Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0026',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=5,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=945,
    end_offset=960,
    text_slice='“你且莫问，日后自然明白的。”',
    hash='sha256:c9ba3c44becfdd068d81bf276d7afaf8ee569ef925b3205dbbd8f6dd41a61738'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0027',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=5,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=960,
    end_offset=988,
    text_slice='说着，便袖了这石，同那道人飘然而去，竟不知投奔何方何舍。',
    hash='sha256:10243a72718b1bb8f2cdfe208c526abd7b8ebc0fdf6024ad00ae0ab23f1066ac'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0028',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=6,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=990,
    end_offset=1046,
    text_slice='后来，不知过了几世几劫，因有个空空道人访道求仙，从这大荒山无稽崖青埂峰下经过，忽见一大块石上字迹分明，编述历历。',
    hash='sha256:1365fe30fbf8fcd6c874a6bb4a8a335a64416939f69932a8e64d59439f9246e6'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0029',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=6,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=1046,
    end_offset=1102,
    text_slice='空空道人乃从头一看，原来就是无材补天，幻形入世，蒙茫茫大士、渺渺真人携入红尘，历尽离合悲欢、炎凉世态的一段故事。',
    hash='sha256:56b8281b3cfe60eea1b122123d301db7ebdf3bcae12f82697b808f7ce1271915'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0030',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=7,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=1113,
    end_offset=1129,
    text_slice='无材可去补苍天，枉入红尘若许年。',
    hash='sha256:0d41bafda74a1d20a3bab6b98c468b01498f112ba4a622ecaec49358dc6f6729'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0031',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=7,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=1129,
    end_offset=1145,
    text_slice='此系身前身后事，倩谁记去作奇传？',
    hash='sha256:34fbd66acc3c81038f68679171b676e809c7f40056301e3c71079af905522b1d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0032',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=8,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=1147,
    end_offset=1175,
    text_slice='诗后便是此石坠落之乡，投胎之处，亲自经历的一段陈迹故事。',
    hash='sha256:15f8935665963de124a6c6e5afc00abe4597769f21c8d1221d9f46df056eec32'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0033',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=8,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=1175,
    end_offset=1219,
    text_slice='其中家庭闺阁琐事，以及闲情诗词倒还全备，或可适趣解闷；然朝代年纪、地舆邦国却反失落无考。',
    hash='sha256:ce4271e50743630ba8475c7856888d0829b72f527720a8b3bc5de2cfc2dda27e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0034',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=9,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=1221,
    end_offset=1232,
    text_slice='空空道人遂向石头说道：',
    hash='sha256:b0dc7709e8edaccdd05f0c920b85df511186403972c5f4bebe9191f05b78a8bc'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0035',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=9,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=1232,
    end_offset=1352,
    text_slice='“石兄，你这一段故事，据你自己说有些趣味，故编写在此，意欲问世传奇。据我看来：第一件，无朝代年纪可考；第二件，并无大贤大忠理朝廷、治风俗的善政，其中只不过几个异样女子，或情或痴，或小才微善，亦无班姑、蔡女之德能。我纵抄去，恐世人不爱看呢！”',
    hash='sha256:41997648d74dcaf128d418085b4f8248650aa8ec62650e469ecad8b5c84659c9'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0036',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=9,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=1352,
    end_offset=1358,
    text_slice='石头笑答道：',
    hash='sha256:4ff14cad87b9b82b75f4ab841489f19fd05d3b2c6b6f7f6e02d4843a94b81ebc'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0037',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=9,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=1358,
    end_offset=1978,
    text_slice='“我师何太痴耶！若云无朝代可考，今我师竟借汉、唐等年纪添缀，又有何难？但我想，历来野史，皆蹈一辙，莫如我这不借此套者，反倒新奇别致。不过只取其事体情理罢了，又何必拘拘于朝代年纪哉！再者，市井俗人喜看理治之书者甚少，爱适趣闲文者特多。历来野史，或讪谤君相，或贬人妻女，奸淫凶恶，不可胜数。更有一种风月笔墨，其淫秽污臭，屠毒笔墨，坏人子弟，又不可胜数。至若佳人才子等书，则又千部共出一套，且其中终不能不涉于淫滥，以致满纸潘安、子建、西子、文君。不过作者要写出自己的那两首情诗艳赋来，故假拟出男女二人名姓，又必旁出一小人其间拨乱，亦如剧中之小丑然。且鬟婢开口即者也之乎，非文即理。故逐一看去，悉皆自相矛盾、大不近情理之话，竟不如我半世亲睹亲闻的这几个女子，虽不敢说强似前代书中所有之人，但事迹原委，亦可以消愁破闷；也有几首歪诗熟话，可以喷饭供酒。至若离合悲欢，兴衰际遇，则又追踪蹑迹，不敢稍加穿凿，徒为供人之目而反失其真传者。今之人，贫者日为衣食所累，富者又怀不足之心；纵然一时稍闲，又有贪淫恋色、好货寻愁之事，哪里有工夫去看那理治之书！所以，我这一段故事，也不愿世人称奇道妙，也不定要世人喜悦检读，只愿他们当那醉淫饱卧之时，或避世去愁之际，把此一玩，岂不省了些寿命筋力？就比那谋虚逐妄，却也省了口舌是非之害、腿脚奔忙之苦。再者，亦令世人换新眼目，不比那些胡牵乱扯，忽离忽遇，满纸才人淑女、子建、文君、红娘、小玉等通共熟套之旧稿。我师意为何如？”',
    hash='sha256:a2ddcdd75d6aeb20ac260b05f0f7d56ad2ed61a2ddc5b059deaee3202e0a1769'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0038',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=10,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=1980,
    end_offset=2076,
    text_slice='空空道人听如此说，思忖半晌，将一这《石头记》再检阅一遍，因见上面虽有些指奸责佞、贬恶诛邪之语，亦非伤时骂世之旨；及至君仁臣良、父慈子孝，凡伦常所关之处，皆是称功颂德，眷眷无穷，实非别书之可比。',
    hash='sha256:060c7c9e8ac2300cb3c7b1fee91214cef05762b4c0796bb9a93e526389e5bdb6'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0039',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=10,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=2076,
    end_offset=2114,
    text_slice='虽其中大旨谈情，亦不过实录其事，又非假拟妄称，一味淫邀艳约，私订偷盟之可比。',
    hash='sha256:3e1d8c5bcff5b5d00af55050868a0831512cb63c0e42b9ba3d72b8cd0f3c99b3'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0040',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=10,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=2114,
    end_offset=2137,
    text_slice='因毫不干涉时世，方从头至尾抄录回来，问世传奇。',
    hash='sha256:5e7d715b24b83091c314f6f181e90c47e966ad45201106291ea5912db6242c9d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0041',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=10,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=2137,
    end_offset=2181,
    text_slice='因空见色，由色生情，传情入色，自色悟空，空空道人遂易名为情僧，改《石头记》为《情僧录》。',
    hash='sha256:f8f26114ce8d0035e7be5e04552f37da08b04bfb402135c65c3ccf23fedc9119'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0042',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=10,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=2181,
    end_offset=2183,
    text_slice='至?',
    hash='sha256:6ba9e4b60666ed8668a2ccf74197f8bf6314e9b78ca5289c813dd5af9c7c5be3'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0043',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=10,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=2183,
    end_offset=2193,
    text_slice='玉峰题曰《红楼梦》。',
    hash='sha256:5ba5f561d735c577d4d13a83d5e51f37f43249423268e6da2a4db22f5cadf088'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0044',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=10,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=2193,
    end_offset=2208,
    text_slice='东鲁孔梅溪则题曰《风月宝鉴》。',
    hash='sha256:efb70e359cf648c4f9c41a5bf66b13a2b660ad03c51d7561a61eaeb8804341b3'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0045',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=11,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=2258,
    end_offset=2270,
    text_slice='满纸荒唐言，一把辛酸泪！',
    hash='sha256:652996fb65c9f680dbfdccb07a5b1376ca53ae35bcf25462a3c05cc800708b02'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0046',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=11,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=2270,
    end_offset=2282,
    text_slice='都云作者痴，谁解其中味？',
    hash='sha256:724071c293d0f559a19fbe8d4fce7eda6b4859cd711dd155d8f96caefcdf1845'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0047',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=12,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=2284,
    end_offset=2303,
    text_slice='至脂砚斋甲戌抄阅再评，仍用《石头记》。',
    hash='sha256:2a426144871b50ff99f344b5ad0429c272ff67ed961e137597faffc3ef5c5ebb'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0048',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=13,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=2305,
    end_offset=2319,
    text_slice='出则既明，且看石上是何故事。',
    hash='sha256:a7e3f84571aeb36b29a3e1d28aff64df9d82c413da5dcfc81ee5f0f527f0a5d3'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0049',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=14,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=2328,
    end_offset=2368,
    text_slice='当日地陷东南，这东南一隅有处曰姑苏，有城曰阊门者，最是红尘中一二等富贵风流之地。',
    hash='sha256:6212dfe3ff4826842d1a54a79530851ebafcab72aa46779c3091a2c55b9d4e56'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0050',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=14,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=2368,
    end_offset=2407,
    text_slice='这阊门外有个十里街，街内有个仁清巷，巷内有个古庙，因地方窄狭，人皆呼作葫芦庙。',
    hash='sha256:8e4e2cf41be24cb5a73cadced1645272c5143ce02f6cd5626028acb114a9845d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0051',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=14,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=2407,
    end_offset=2425,
    text_slice='庙旁住着一家乡宦，姓甄名费，字士隐。',
    hash='sha256:9d776966f6d65af87b4229217a22126a94b38d4248ad5f85a3948860b7f73448'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0052',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=14,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=2425,
    end_offset=2440,
    text_slice='嫡妻封氏，情性贤淑，深明礼义。',
    hash='sha256:3bd9ad1016c8144ceeb55fb240d8120b112abfac39bbb45462883223ada3f434'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0053',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=14,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=2440,
    end_offset=2460,
    text_slice='家中虽不甚富贵，然本地便也推他为望族了。',
    hash='sha256:0372631e3d7e5e5b379303fc6dd53b7a479a093fc716198cdf454536c1becb60'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0054',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=14,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=2460,
    end_offset=2503,
    text_slice='只因这甄士隐禀性恬淡，不以功名为念，每日只以观花修竹、酌酒吟诗为乐，倒是神仙一流人品。',
    hash='sha256:605809ea438dbc243b32243e19b3a138ff2609d67863a575fcc4af43c3f07ade'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0055',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=14,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=2503,
    end_offset=2537,
    text_slice='只是一件不足：如今年已半百，膝下无儿，只有一女，乳名英莲，年方三岁。',
    hash='sha256:f534b3116b23e3e03fcc313e9660c546fb5bd89eddf4c72fdb07ded7c223709e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0056',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=15,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=2539,
    end_offset=2573,
    text_slice='一日，炎夏永昼，士隐于书房闲坐，至手倦拋书，伏几少憩，不觉朦胧睡去。',
    hash='sha256:ec89668d274d60c4ce024afaee84c5ba00000368f6e627408b045ff601e7472c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0057',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=15,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=2573,
    end_offset=2585,
    text_slice='梦至一处，不辨是何地方。',
    hash='sha256:ee0bedb668e13a3efa0660783c4f449747065d8998e92b43fdc88627c4783468'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0058',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=15,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=2585,
    end_offset=2601,
    text_slice='忽见那厢来了一僧一道，且行且谈。',
    hash='sha256:7b69456dfccedc4d309a8a90b99cb1321cf767c0656d859b870536cc0f9d94ff'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0059',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=15,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=2608,
    end_offset=2622,
    text_slice='“你携了这蠢物，意欲何往？”',
    hash='sha256:ab46715618154e8d38ce5cc2b2d6514355d672b1d07465db1e7013b948c5ef9d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0060',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=15,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=2622,
    end_offset=2627,
    text_slice='那僧笑道：',
    hash='sha256:7d1c75caa5ab7ce100a7ffa0488c61194f00a7f497e92354736cf7bbb0e953cb'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0061',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=15,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=2627,
    end_offset=2686,
    text_slice='“你放心，如今现有一段风流公案正该了结。这一干风流冤家，尚未投胎入世。趁此机会，就将此蠢物夹带于中，使他去经历经历。”',
    hash='sha256:1a44748852ee257ee598ff521cb4e0f16e69e952c28296aa8d44be5321b713b9'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0062',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=15,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=2686,
    end_offset=2691,
    text_slice='那道人道：',
    hash='sha256:15ee9ce9ee72e7b382d0e3b719ebd9c3817ce17e1bcc7860a4dea0279e14cd83'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0063',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=15,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=2691,
    end_offset=2721,
    text_slice='“原来近日风流冤孽又将造劫历世去不成？但不知落于何方何处？”',
    hash='sha256:507ef3c780849abd5219bd7697c9f3f835c155b0b0fe3459a87c24c5baa3717f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0064',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=15,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=2721,
    end_offset=2726,
    text_slice='那僧笑道：',
    hash='sha256:7d1c75caa5ab7ce100a7ffa0488c61194f00a7f497e92354736cf7bbb0e953cb'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0065',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=15,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=2726,
    end_offset=3034,
    text_slice='“此事说来好笑，竟是千古未闻的罕事：只因西方灵河岸上三生石畔有绛珠草一株，时有赤瑕宫神瑛侍者，日以甘露灌溉，这绛珠草便得久延岁月。后来既受天地精华，复得雨露滋养，遂得脱却草胎木质，得换人形，仅修成个女体，终日游于离恨天外，饥则食蜜青果为膳，渴则饮灌愁海水为汤。只因尚未酬报灌溉之德，故其五内便郁结着一段缠绵不尽之意。恰近日这神瑛侍者凡心偶炽，乘此昌明太平朝世，意欲下凡造历幻缘，已在警幻仙子案前挂了号。警幻亦曾问及，灌溉之情未偿，趁此倒可了结的。那绛珠仙子道：‘他是甘露之惠，我并无此水可还。他既下世为人，我也去下世为人，但把我一生所有的眼泪还他，也偿还得过他了。’因此一事，就勾出多少风流冤家来陪他们去了结此案。”',
    hash='sha256:f27e7c21bb03b5a796cd24bacc896614ad5ac8d10aa5b1cb0d062f9ed4bb986a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0066',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=15,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=3034,
    end_offset=3039,
    text_slice='那道人道：',
    hash='sha256:15ee9ce9ee72e7b382d0e3b719ebd9c3817ce17e1bcc7860a4dea0279e14cd83'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0067',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=15,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=3039,
    end_offset=3080,
    text_slice='“果是罕闻。实未闻有‘还泪’之说。想来这一段故事，比历来风月事故更加琐碎细腻了。”',
    hash='sha256:f23ff17398e33fb4cd2d32636dee52f0f346d699eddcd4d3e4f0526bd74826cb'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0068',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=15,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=3080,
    end_offset=3084,
    text_slice='那僧道：',
    hash='sha256:2052195cc5034bca0daf4c515f2d060dc8f210151fe8632b357d69c79ca59965'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0069',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=15,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=3084,
    end_offset=3195,
    text_slice='“历来几个风流人物，不过传其大概，以及诗词篇章而已；至家庭闺阁中一饮一食，总未述记。再者，大半风月故事，不过偷香窃玉，暗约私奔而已，并不曾将儿女之真情发泄一二。想这一干人入世，其情痴色鬼、贤愚不肖者，悉与前人传述不同矣！”',
    hash='sha256:edb91bdf11c4c1ba5b3af1453943015743d5456b5fa0d707d562ed8734a3587f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0070',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=15,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=3195,
    end_offset=3200,
    text_slice='那道人道：',
    hash='sha256:15ee9ce9ee72e7b382d0e3b719ebd9c3817ce17e1bcc7860a4dea0279e14cd83'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0071',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=15,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=3200,
    end_offset=3225,
    text_slice='“趁此你我何不也去下世度脱几个，岂不是一场功德？”',
    hash='sha256:504c337c05ddb06f344d9af64e10e3d3ba7ea7acce0ff19afc4edcc48bd75ab6'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0072',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=15,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=3225,
    end_offset=3229,
    text_slice='那僧道：',
    hash='sha256:2052195cc5034bca0daf4c515f2d060dc8f210151fe8632b357d69c79ca59965'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0073',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=15,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=3229,
    end_offset=3290,
    text_slice='“正合吾意。你且同我到警幻仙子宫中，将蠢物交割清楚，待这一干风流孽鬼下世已完，你我再去。如今虽已有一半落尘，然犹未全集。”',
    hash='sha256:aeb92bae8004faec407a5384ed2c303b7d7803b04b875d3c106654909d6063dd'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0074',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=15,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=3290,
    end_offset=3294,
    text_slice='道人道：',
    hash='sha256:f882939df5b0906f87b0c73ea6345128ab17ac1a91377497e3db7bd40979ec5b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0075',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=15,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=3294,
    end_offset=3306,
    text_slice='“既如此，便随你去来。”',
    hash='sha256:2d5cb698d6ad3dd0b74b344b3edb407917d67f9f9afbe7b9bf3157a060bcbfa9'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0076',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=16,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=3308,
    end_offset=3324,
    text_slice='却说甄士隐俱听得明白，但不知所云',
    hash='sha256:5720c553ecb89e737b3c81c5a1ac5298fe2e62c543266b728f780df44a1fa112'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0077',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=16,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=3324,
    end_offset=3328,
    text_slice='“蠢物”',
    hash='sha256:c1f2bc77fb276661d68dee85b42dc3eb32e79adadbab2adf34c3d7184d3a14f1'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0078',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=16,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=3328,
    end_offset=3333,
    text_slice='系何东西。',
    hash='sha256:036645b11f22756148d1be2641257c7876e65e717d83f4ec5f23ba7d33f45bcf'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0079',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=16,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=3345,
    end_offset=3353,
    text_slice='“二仙师请了。”',
    hash='sha256:b786edd39115f8a013d44716677fbfcd1b39bfccc8d32bee2d6fd24b409e15c8'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0080',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=16,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=3353,
    end_offset=3363,
    text_slice='那僧道也忙答礼相问。',
    hash='sha256:afea7699559d64bccb06f618ab22830777c461f1eb9085f7f3ed297f7306faec'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0081',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=16,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=3369,
    end_offset=3433,
    text_slice='“适闻仙师所谈因果，实人世罕闻者。但弟子愚浊，不能洞悉明白，若蒙大开痴顽，备细一闻，弟子则洗耳谛听，稍能警省，亦可免沉伦之苦。”',
    hash='sha256:6dfa2d0858623e03a0a78a386a8b57b07ddcd00465d20f9065b66952ee731ec4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0082',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=16,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=3433,
    end_offset=3438,
    text_slice='二仙笑道：',
    hash='sha256:aabedef9fc3c59b81845485d830427d294179405186a58e165c4ac658ff97b18'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0083',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=16,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=3438,
    end_offset=3471,
    text_slice='“此乃玄机不可预泄者。到那时，只不要忘了我二人，便可跳出火坑矣。”',
    hash='sha256:0eedcbd080ecbdce2bed8808b97917c8ea3be7a6f6df330f5d5727716bc94755'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0084',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=16,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=3471,
    end_offset=3485,
    text_slice='士隐听了，不便再问，因笑道：',
    hash='sha256:4d5ce12261515e4561568b8f98a420d6cdf696e36cc4c45acc1ec93611794bb8'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0085',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=16,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=3485,
    end_offset=3513,
    text_slice='“玄机不可预泄，但适云‘蠢物’，不知为何，或可一见否？”',
    hash='sha256:362b6f0ba233005db00527bebaf2a9c6175b7e4b02f0a42939dc0ec67352a4a2'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0086',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=16,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=3513,
    end_offset=3517,
    text_slice='那僧道：',
    hash='sha256:2052195cc5034bca0daf4c515f2d060dc8f210151fe8632b357d69c79ca59965'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0087',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=16,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=3517,
    end_offset=3531,
    text_slice='“若问此物，倒有一面之缘。”',
    hash='sha256:b337c212967089548c80ee4d158d0c56a39f5da46c9b8ef4e2a6ad7b1f84d56d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0088',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=16,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=3531,
    end_offset=3541,
    text_slice='说着，取出递与士隐。',
    hash='sha256:2923d1e341f3f58f9f0c8b97f5164dab7adfd29443bf2f7df922e375c53cbb5c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0089',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=16,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=3566,
    end_offset=3572,
    text_slice='“通灵宝玉”',
    hash='sha256:8bfbd8ac92df67cd7e52ea2fa452f83b5a99fbcbb5690b1d2324d56cc28f7e41'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0090',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=16,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=3572,
    end_offset=3584,
    text_slice='四字，后面还有几行小字。',
    hash='sha256:277a513eb014ca80b09389542903b9714ded97338176efb3fa1046b349c5ff35'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0091',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=16,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=3595,
    end_offset=3602,
    text_slice='“已到幻境！”',
    hash='sha256:9b575c7a54ef17ed805860814962623d1793ead21ae1e321d1c789c9a87ef840'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0092',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=16,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=3602,
    end_offset=3631,
    text_slice='便强从手中夺了去，与道人竟过一大石牌坊，上书四个大字，乃是',
    hash='sha256:b15589a2e2df7a2acb852d02390f89a16661e708e2031d1cd4eb12fac4e549d5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0093',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=16,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=3631,
    end_offset=3637,
    text_slice='“太虚幻境”',
    hash='sha256:4968652918ac347dc7c53386a48a34878fbc8f3babfd1d402fc2fa815811eb00'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0094',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=16,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=3637,
    end_offset=3650,
    text_slice='。两边又有一幅对联，道是：',
    hash='sha256:b13ae9e550d54737e0ab897618441bd6d7e16d8f882c7343596ae760ba4d415c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0095',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=17,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=3652,
    end_offset=3668,
    text_slice='假作真时真亦假，无为有处有还无。',
    hash='sha256:7293239e34909b3baa9aeac4841ec2e643a112971e48614225834b50fad9c125'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0096',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=18,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=3670,
    end_offset=3699,
    text_slice='士隐意欲也跟了过去，方举步时，忽听一声霹雳，有若山崩地陷。',
    hash='sha256:024b72d718ef4ecbdaef294c752e671d5ad6fcd54fbef7a3acc880c05cbfeb57'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0097',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=18,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=3699,
    end_offset=3734,
    text_slice='士隐大叫一声，定睛一看，只见烈日炎炎，芭蕉冉冉，所梦之事，便忘了大半。',
    hash='sha256:abcbf4d70bfb093915348413b12bbc2952433b3247112faa28141f05e02d6bab'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0098',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=18,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=3734,
    end_offset=3746,
    text_slice='又见奶母正抱了英莲走来。',
    hash='sha256:2c2bd6650a37d64849ab2d66549e62121d0920cde9175c17026ee0450a1365a3'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0099',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=18,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=3746,
    end_offset=3797,
    text_slice='士隐见女儿越发生得粉妆玉琢，乖觉可喜，便伸手接来，抱在怀内，逗他玩耍一回；又带至街前，看那过会的热闹。',
    hash='sha256:9456d853a2c9ba31ade8e9379757d6234d7778412775af7442b37eac6eba4500'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0100',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=18,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=3797,
    end_offset=3815,
    text_slice='方欲进来时，只见从那边来了一僧一道。',
    hash='sha256:6a7af378e4581d210d8b1cdef159e439e1cbf5e3ced8e4c9e61b21c84e74c62d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0101',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=18,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=3815,
    end_offset=3843,
    text_slice='那僧则癞头跣脚，那道则跛足蓬头，疯疯癫癫，挥霍谈笑而至。',
    hash='sha256:6a4961ffd5933a7a807aa06b2158f963c025cdacde9c2fa651817ae2d7d99008'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0102',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=18,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=3874,
    end_offset=3901,
    text_slice='“施主，你把这有命无运、累及爹娘之物，抱在怀内作甚？”',
    hash='sha256:84693b19d505bf613e62fe1517d3573783abb7710fd57dbbe0f7a3876da1feec'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0103',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=18,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=3901,
    end_offset=3917,
    text_slice='士隐听了，知是疯话，也不去睬他。',
    hash='sha256:9f6e167b173ac53343a262ef561d4fde5640e4447938f69b79ddc5503296e65b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0104',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=18,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=3922,
    end_offset=3932,
    text_slice='“舍我罢，舍我罢！”',
    hash='sha256:eb38c534f3616f4e30f2426e1b050dc3a4c2bcc5417fc41e9f4b3af5d821238c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0105',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=18,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=3932,
    end_offset=3968,
    text_slice='士隐不耐烦，便抱女儿撤身进去，那僧乃指着他大笑，口内念了四句言词，道是：',
    hash='sha256:15117e9bf63c85a6a5ae4b53235bfbb492f0ea073e68b061e379c378ef4361c9'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0106',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=19,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=3970,
    end_offset=3986,
    text_slice='惯养娇生笑你痴，菱花空对雪澌澌。',
    hash='sha256:96ffb08c406f99441e396c03443b2b52c3793b7fa2fbf9f46098c9edc669a7ab'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0107',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=19,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=3986,
    end_offset=4002,
    text_slice='好防佳节元宵后，便是烟消火灭时。',
    hash='sha256:e45f47bec0c0071c4df1c67c7b60ef6b543b00f9b5545abbc1563e80f832c547'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0108',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=20,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=4004,
    end_offset=4024,
    text_slice='士隐听得明白，心下犹豫，意欲问他们来历。',
    hash='sha256:311a4f4acf3e6e794dacbf9abba65e126f760ae16f567d07b15f7fc8db339cb8'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0109',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=20,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=4030,
    end_offset=4076,
    text_slice='“你我不必同行，就此分手，各干营生去罢。三劫后，我在北邙山等你，会齐了，同往太虚幻境销号。”',
    hash='sha256:b40ec62e172388d8787ea03e868ee74ea2c83d5f3a9bf1266db3b9333ede05cd'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0110',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=20,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=4076,
    end_offset=4080,
    text_slice='那僧道：',
    hash='sha256:2052195cc5034bca0daf4c515f2d060dc8f210151fe8632b357d69c79ca59965'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0111',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=20,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=4080,
    end_offset=4088,
    text_slice='“妙，妙，妙！”',
    hash='sha256:76aab0cb32ca6d9a11614bebdfcc44fa5441da1d0e6651fa2ed4113b85e26b38'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0112',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=20,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=4088,
    end_offset=4103,
    text_slice='说毕，二人一去再不见个踪影了。',
    hash='sha256:76f4f144d9f3c312f4aba809813905883e961b13f6d2f757b4efc536543825a7'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0113',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=20,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=4103,
    end_offset=4133,
    text_slice='士隐心中此时自忖：这两个人必有来历，该试一问，如今悔却晚也！',
    hash='sha256:5c9dfff95393e8411e1da25fc78b1c0dc678407ac5095acd65e03bceff67de06'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0114',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=21,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=4135,
    end_offset=4178,
    text_slice='这士隐正痴想，忽见隔壁葫芦庙内寄居的一个穷儒-姓贾名化，表字时飞，别号雨村者走了出来。',
    hash='sha256:d9847662facf46f1c0da48fceaaeb22f19d991d417de0d1f25d09355683e7136'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0115',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=21,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=4178,
    end_offset=4247,
    text_slice='这贾雨村原系胡州人氏，也是诗书仕宦之族，因他生于末世，父母祖宗根基已尽，人口衰丧，只剩得他一身一口，在家乡无益，因进京求取功名，再整基业。',
    hash='sha256:5161c6747ec39e404e0db1d99d68918110b96ccecb6269a076a4f1865cfa0ace'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0116',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=21,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=4247,
    end_offset=4284,
    text_slice='自前岁来此，又淹蹇住了，暂寄庙中安身，每日卖字作文为生，故士隐常与他交接。',
    hash='sha256:5d0192e17be17543b0de4d11aa9f2b1d8f8fcd04320601e15d922525fc92e7ba'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0117',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=21,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=4300,
    end_offset=4321,
    text_slice='“老先生倚门伫望，敢是街市上有甚新闻否？”',
    hash='sha256:af57e8e53386c77a9dabcdd58728da03cc90a0209e14d702a38a7da4dcadcb05'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0118',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=21,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=4321,
    end_offset=4326,
    text_slice='士隐笑道：',
    hash='sha256:7aa830ed9e8162c9f7483f2bc61daacaeca7593d934ace0158da70e80412c5ce'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0119',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=21,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=4326,
    end_offset=4374,
    text_slice='“非也。适因小女啼哭，引她出来作耍，正是无聊之甚，兄来得正妙，请入小斋一谈，彼此皆可消此永昼。”',
    hash='sha256:e044c2b081af0ccabae596719243728c6d1911113899a38d1bcfd775d466456d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0120',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=21,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=4374,
    end_offset=4398,
    text_slice='说着，便令人送女儿进去，自与携了雨村来至书房中。',
    hash='sha256:b436ff8975ed9712f0e41e9178eb90722b22d7ae15021b515ef6dc0f0fb576b1'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0121',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=21,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=4398,
    end_offset=4403,
    text_slice='小童献茶。',
    hash='sha256:5377cfb585f982553af19658f097367ee06aeb9069fd1923e6703d8b8c3bbd6e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0122',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=21,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=4417,
    end_offset=4425,
    text_slice='“严老爷来拜。”',
    hash='sha256:4e03ef6a6e1e1edc276186106efd23c3180f84780b41b57202c34c1c200487a8'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0123',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=21,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=4425,
    end_offset=4436,
    text_slice='士隐慌得忙起身谢罪道：',
    hash='sha256:e0324f3fb7e207a947380cf036c4f63e69c23dbc1a032e0f8cef911f7830d082'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0124',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=21,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=4436,
    end_offset=4452,
    text_slice='“恕诳驾之罪！略坐，弟即来陪。”',
    hash='sha256:8d2603f1f77f54733d373c5174b2aebb301a27b64194ed62d21ae7c69ac4afff'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0125',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=21,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=4452,
    end_offset=4461,
    text_slice='雨村忙起身亦让道：',
    hash='sha256:436a92d3fbb3fcf740d609cece328b6f3620218e4f151aeb356937d326e455ec'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0126',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=21,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=4461,
    end_offset=4482,
    text_slice='“老先生请便，晚生乃常造之客，稍候何妨。”',
    hash='sha256:1173329bac8137c15881527fdc927d7566d57bb6d3b8c5e9e016f72476eb800e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0127',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=21,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=4482,
    end_offset=4494,
    text_slice='说着，士隐已出前厅去了。',
    hash='sha256:f2fb2603ec7c8df9abe023d3379b46b4361ebb07234af81dc2b199127202ccf8'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0128',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=22,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=4496,
    end_offset=4508,
    text_slice='这里雨村且翻弄书籍解闷。',
    hash='sha256:6526c8373a1adcbbbbf70db515a5e6d927297bc4dddbde7362e716ff1a852dc6'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0129',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=22,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=4508,
    end_offset=4544,
    text_slice='忽听得窗外有女子嗽声，雨村遂起身往窗外一看，原来是一个丫鬟，在那里撷花。',
    hash='sha256:21f322b85abd54333d41434c51f3ad5ec5f79738e5dac8499ac7c062d3ac0760'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0130',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=22,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=4544,
    end_offset=4570,
    text_slice='生得仪容不俗，眉目清明，虽无十分姿色，却有动人之处。',
    hash='sha256:e7a585eb9a2ec9b98fd6468ba5060ee807a3799a9bda8d742a50191b8d8b5f93'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0131',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=22,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=4570,
    end_offset=4579,
    text_slice='雨村不觉看得呆了。',
    hash='sha256:6b2b9a81494e094f553a5fc773e4796b11e9d86c6f71b570742952426b15924b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0132',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=22,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=4579,
    end_offset=4637,
    text_slice='那甄家丫鬟撷了花，方欲走时，猛抬头见窗内有人，敝巾旧服，虽是贫窘，然生得腰圆背厚，面阔口方；更兼剑眉星眼，直鼻权腮。',
    hash='sha256:c261b507de7dc1fa0c37f3e474619d9e0acefcbda2565ed91aa607dc8a7c3237'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0133',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=22,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=4637,
    end_offset=4701,
    text_slice='这丫鬟忙转身回避，心下乃想：“这人生的这样雄壮，却又这样褴褛，想他定是我家主人常说的什么贾雨村了，每有意帮助周济，只是没甚机会。',
    hash='sha256:b075d3dbc9bb22bfe668fdba5febc408df5a191027baadc1d61b789ca41d6f7f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0134',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=22,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=4701,
    end_offset=4721,
    text_slice='我家并无这样贫穷亲友，想定是此人无疑了。',
    hash='sha256:15a3ec960bbab80f851d5428c5de035cda94e5913d3a4572c25aa664855ff961'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0135',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=22,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=4721,
    end_offset=4733,
    text_slice='怪道又说他必非久困之人。',
    hash='sha256:eca3305a55813bee20ecbc00afa58af81a4429cf4388f5986b6844d183fb5a9f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0136',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=22,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=4733,
    end_offset=4747,
    text_slice='”如此想来，不免又回头两次。',
    hash='sha256:687f37c9a02f4c6e28abf38487bf75aa1649f1bc75051633890a76b433bd36b7'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0137',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=22,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=4747,
    end_offset=4795,
    text_slice='雨村见她回了头，便自谓这女子心中有意于他，便狂喜不尽，自谓此女子必是个巨眼英豪，风尘中之知己也。',
    hash='sha256:2e897f2cd34ac8bed4eb7e7180e737355c1e40d9afa13d685454598128b36065'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0138',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=22,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=4795,
    end_offset=4830,
    text_slice='一时小童进来，雨村打听得前面留饭，不可久待，遂从夹道中自便，出门去了。',
    hash='sha256:3ed9e149a005b2e580142a48e25b921f73054e642130ce6699c1c4b681ebfdd9'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0139',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=22,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=4830,
    end_offset=4849,
    text_slice='士隐待客既散，知雨村自便，也不去再邀。',
    hash='sha256:3a853b271dc8e643b235dff6ac5b1c794c8d531a8269657925796484dbd0dfb1'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0140',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=23,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=4851,
    end_offset=4861,
    text_slice='一日，早又中秋佳节。',
    hash='sha256:62ae313243dea2203ccd878f8b50b3fee833c45ef222f079aac35b8f3aabf0f5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0141',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=23,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=4861,
    end_offset=4891,
    text_slice='士隐家宴已毕，乃又另具一席于书房，却自己步月至庙中来邀雨村。',
    hash='sha256:972065edaee1199a89d09827041aa41d19871f3cb62ca9d2802a1f59e8c1de5b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0142',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=23,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=4891,
    end_offset=4926,
    text_slice='原来雨村自那日见了甄家之婢曾回顾他两次，自谓是个知己，便时刻放在心上。',
    hash='sha256:c523b10757291945634cf17b4b83a8a6838b89a54609854df538dffbe7494436'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0143',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=24,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=4952,
    end_offset=4964,
    text_slice='未卜三生愿，频添一段愁。',
    hash='sha256:aeb44a195bbfcd009997f86fa065e06bcd97c2f0358baac17729d6742955f542'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0144',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=24,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=4964,
    end_offset=4976,
    text_slice='闷来时敛额，行去几回头。',
    hash='sha256:f0751cb1cd050b2f5a2e643605bb6863910ecc1944a50a478edb372dac414063'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0145',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=24,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=4976,
    end_offset=4988,
    text_slice='自顾风前影，谁堪月下俦？',
    hash='sha256:8f9c1a6f45c22ef725e61a8c6913124cc1f9012074d74ca12b7c9b4da1ddf7db'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0146',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=24,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=4988,
    end_offset=5000,
    text_slice='蟾光如有意，先上玉人楼。',
    hash='sha256:41ed285f81b1df5e2b23ab9d1364a25de88962c552bbf0ac6421f4388d575074'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0147',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=25,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=5002,
    end_offset=5036,
    text_slice='雨村吟罢，因又思及平生抱负苦未逢时，乃又搔首对天长叹，复高吟一联云：',
    hash='sha256:02007abd4074aa0b15f1afa7eff608488d4e54440b9aad0924ad5d2037adec7b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0148',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=26,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=5038,
    end_offset=5054,
    text_slice='玉在匮中求善价，钗于奁内待时飞。',
    hash='sha256:bfd629acf62424cfb0cd8f94455702579ac43f10870855151fdc3151c4145f36'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0149',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=27,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=5056,
    end_offset=5068,
    text_slice='恰值士隐走来听见，笑道：',
    hash='sha256:ea5062bf09a08f02893213d7a8e6f4c4159d7892021e3da3e4f6b3b1c481ac7f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0150',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=27,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=5068,
    end_offset=5080,
    text_slice='“雨村兄真抱负不浅也！”',
    hash='sha256:a689d56a172e060df3ea0929428c739da039225d65281c53b97d7bcad6a0096b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0151',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=27,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=5080,
    end_offset=5086,
    text_slice='雨村忙笑道：',
    hash='sha256:7477ddd9e0892b5804d9e49ade1289cfb94de2d7bc0ca30a850fa8b02cb0950e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0152',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=27,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=5086,
    end_offset=5107,
    text_slice='“岂敢！不过偶吟前人之句，何敢狂诞至此！”',
    hash='sha256:13b281f1d3610071d0de8655be9530e9faae144472c2ff972087ede4fe6c9b0b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0153',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=27,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=5107,
    end_offset=5110,
    text_slice='因问：',
    hash='sha256:ccdcf4ca5b0d90eb25386587fe85c6337d5c5a7585863b57f89bca2423599a3a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0154',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=27,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=5110,
    end_offset=5120,
    text_slice='“老先生何兴至此？”',
    hash='sha256:c13d7523713bb3f9541109a41db745e8c72b9370fb3809091ed43dfe1bac6154'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0155',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=27,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=5120,
    end_offset=5125,
    text_slice='士隐笑道：',
    hash='sha256:7aa830ed9e8162c9f7483f2bc61daacaeca7593d934ace0158da70e80412c5ce'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0156',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=27,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=5125,
    end_offset=5178,
    text_slice='“今夜中秋，俗谓‘团圆之节’，想尊兄旅寄僧房，不无寂寞之感，故特具小酌，邀兄到敝斋一饮，不知可纳芹意否？”',
    hash='sha256:8a5f038ce25c8e5012cf4ba644deb23f171df6cbdad38f1abfb7cb9501cb4015'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0157',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=27,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=5178,
    end_offset=5192,
    text_slice='雨村听了，并不推辞，便笑道：',
    hash='sha256:d64aa9336a8562bf32f72dee7555b04a774ee95ea1959a6dd7d5200ca181dd4d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0158',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=27,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=5192,
    end_offset=5206,
    text_slice='“既蒙厚爱，何敢拂此盛情。”',
    hash='sha256:5faee13c0a84bbfe900bf7f4da8489ca9dde5ea7a088f544e52c7666feb5b94a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0159',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=27,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=5206,
    end_offset=5222,
    text_slice='说着，便同士隐复过这边书院中来。',
    hash='sha256:34b7382c310857ce236ca25dbaca879dda6de09ec934376ed200b468236ecaa2'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0160',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=28,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=5224,
    end_offset=5247,
    text_slice='须臾茶毕，早已设下杯盘，那美酒佳肴，自不必说。',
    hash='sha256:e55f80bdbc2736d43f6a3e63899b79222896ff6fb5d6e66576bbf43d06d0217a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0161',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=28,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=5247,
    end_offset=5275,
    text_slice='二人归坐，先是款斟漫饮，次渐谈至兴浓，不觉飞觥限斝起来。',
    hash='sha256:bd13458c1bb716502e3b06eb3b67ec0b32553d791a013d9010dd3dfa4ce0b8fa'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0162',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=28,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=5275,
    end_offset=5290,
    text_slice='当时街坊上家家箫管，户户弦歌。',
    hash='sha256:28b0784d3a65909bceaf2f9442e0fa61d56217d2d8d54effdad5e8917183a88c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0163',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=28,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=5290,
    end_offset=5314,
    text_slice='当头一轮明月，飞彩凝辉，二人愈添豪兴，酒到杯干。',
    hash='sha256:cca2f01bba6aa167be84441fa60e3ec4cf05ec51fbe071421b0aa3c794824ddf'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0164',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=29,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=5345,
    end_offset=5361,
    text_slice='时逢三五便团圆，满把晴光护玉栏。',
    hash='sha256:fadcbb033c405ea59d9534e1c99b03286322f1637075843b600fedd31e103495'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0165',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=29,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=5361,
    end_offset=5377,
    text_slice='天上一轮才捧出，人间万姓仰头看。',
    hash='sha256:4086dd6b7b80ac7e128181ecf7f0a83d4e13a8208d220b6071e7ecd24f692c83'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0166',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=30,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=5379,
    end_offset=5387,
    text_slice='士隐听了，大叫：',
    hash='sha256:2b237995c44f5ba7e0149b04493460b7dc348cba736a7195fd6b0dd578ef5ca3'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0167',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=30,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=5387,
    end_offset=5435,
    text_slice='“妙哉！吾每谓兄必非久居人下者，今所吟之句，飞腾之兆已见，不日可接履于云霓之上矣。可贺！可贺！”',
    hash='sha256:353871501a4c04ac3cb3e54cc5417ef84d5c5ab02c53f50e514419a7fd89fb6e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0168',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=30,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=5435,
    end_offset=5443,
    text_slice='乃亲斟一斗为贺。',
    hash='sha256:731650821412bad62893ad60aff60fde2895a2fe9c24f97509e8d15c1b7455f2'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0169',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=30,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=5452,
    end_offset=5510,
    text_slice='“非晚生酒后狂言，若论时尚之学，晚生也或可去充数沽名，只是目今行囊、路费一概无措，神京路远，非赖卖字撰文即能到者。”',
    hash='sha256:04a6a14896b2ed0ba8cee91e2f45d33862ab7890f97d991da5f0fdd8425c41cc'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0170',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=30,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=5510,
    end_offset=5520,
    text_slice='士隐不待说完，便道：',
    hash='sha256:c3f759e5f54712255869623929d390e4878aef552abb5fe95014e3a65a30401c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0171',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=30,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=5520,
    end_offset=5627,
    text_slice='“兄何不早言。愚久有此心意，但每遇兄时，兄并未谈及，愚故未敢唐突。今既及此，愚虽不才，‘义利’二字却还识得。且喜明岁正当大比，兄宜作速入都，春闱一战，方不负兄之所学也。其盘费余事，弟自代为处置，亦不枉兄之谬识矣！”',
    hash='sha256:552f065452333ecb4e5b07958cdea0a4d3bd1693992178a3aaa6ae883c86c5af'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0172',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=30,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=5627,
    end_offset=5650,
    text_slice='当下即命小童进去，速封五十两白银，并两套冬衣。',
    hash='sha256:ab1f79ead6b5354fc71ef2372a995e998c5e9d4b04e3ddbe7e71e0186ab2ca57'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0173',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=30,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=5653,
    end_offset=5691,
    text_slice='“十九日乃黄道之期，兄可即买舟西上，待雄飞高举，明冬再晤，岂非大快之事耶？”',
    hash='sha256:eaff6483843a59fa6095aa68eedbb7e16aca5ea70188d3d299a5a639331e9731'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0174',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=30,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=5691,
    end_offset=5717,
    text_slice='雨村收了银衣，不过略谢一语，并不介意，仍是吃酒谈笑。',
    hash='sha256:b51ed6f0db5ee96ff8c5eba29e67142b71b204d8e93a6193781660f3d43516eb'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0175',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=30,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=5717,
    end_offset=5729,
    text_slice='那天已交三鼓，二人方散。',
    hash='sha256:4f2b32a2d6f51dbe28b0514be51d4bb30550155db69834e0b8b0d76af8f9d4fd'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0176',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=31,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=5731,
    end_offset=5753,
    text_slice='士隐送雨村去后，回房一觉，直至红日三竿方醒。',
    hash='sha256:aec8fa2da636b15458fc5ef0d771fa85420f30b032880b7fff321fe99d07158d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0177',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=31,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=5753,
    end_offset=5794,
    text_slice='因思昨夜之事，意欲再写两封荐书，与雨村带至神都，使雨村投谒个仕宦之家，为寄足之地。',
    hash='sha256:e6027e2ede8e006309af3c2ac0406b3b7b5877cbb48d0c9b4c6da0269249edf8'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0178',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=31,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=5794,
    end_offset=5866,
    text_slice='因使人过去请时，那家人去了回来说：“和尚说，贾爷今日五鼓已进京去了，也曾留下话与和尚转达老爷，说‘读书人不在黄道黑道，总以事理为要，不及面辞了。',
    hash='sha256:23f2ef3f6e1b368167b2d99838fb58eb867c7d2e089e47b279061d33fd858f6e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0179',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=31,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=5866,
    end_offset=5879,
    text_slice='’”士隐听了，也只得罢了。',
    hash='sha256:af68214a62706364ebf50b7e0c50772bf9841ecf9a5686e5627556d678db1f3a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0180',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=32,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=5881,
    end_offset=5900,
    text_slice='真是闲处光阴易过，倏忽又是元霄佳节矣。',
    hash='sha256:a6a5824d1ddd6229467d82685cc1f46097126cc9954d996988987fb8d274a050'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0181',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=32,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=5900,
    end_offset=5943,
    text_slice='士隐命家人霍启抱了英莲去看社火花灯，半夜中，霍启因要小解，便将英莲放在一家门槛上坐着。',
    hash='sha256:469a87abc5a7d235bd4291731814837786c26c47f1df3a0d2cfb9f0171534b9e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0182',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=32,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=5943,
    end_offset=5962,
    text_slice='待他小解完了，来抱时，哪有英莲的踪影？',
    hash='sha256:353897f9e6192d539d2fdd3bfa5dc8800dd99e27fcfb937658e8100877c5a744'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0183',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=32,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=5962,
    end_offset=5978,
    text_slice='急得霍启直寻了半夜，至天明不见。',
    hash='sha256:a5bc1cda9d5eb6226f7c504b7d710718778147215261714c4d6284d08d077899'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0184',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=32,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=5978,
    end_offset=5999,
    text_slice='那霍启也就不敢回来见主人，便逃往他乡去了。',
    hash='sha256:ae72a4de5221caef4f4f9de09ebf23c8dc938ff285abb84ebdd20e3a4a0f43a0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0185',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=33,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=6001,
    end_offset=6040,
    text_slice='那士隐夫妇，见女儿一夜不归，便知有些不妥，再使几人去寻找，回来皆云连音响皆无。',
    hash='sha256:232254f7b3578d30e01d343793cccbabea08234dd5eea8cc98d240106a9f5031'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0186',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=33,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=6040,
    end_offset=6061,
    text_slice='夫妻二人半世只生此女，一旦失落，岂不思想。',
    hash='sha256:e4fbc8ef5057864f58bfff233844983b6e521dff4da5230e044aed669b399343'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0187',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=33,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=6061,
    end_offset=6075,
    text_slice='因此昼夜啼哭，几乎不曾寻死。',
    hash='sha256:9f5f90eb0b940c3b4b3d5ffc363991d246b2405659c07098c674da6a02358558'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0188',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=33,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=6075,
    end_offset=6089,
    text_slice='看看一月，士隐先就得了一病。',
    hash='sha256:05e6f49895e47b4996766f426eecd787815ab6defb75845c8dad988c5b9ea710'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0189',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=33,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=6089,
    end_offset=6110,
    text_slice='当时，封氏孺人也因思女构疾，日日请医疗治。',
    hash='sha256:705f39c64ef3f9f652b5ab0513f5c7441ea98449b69386510790614379dadde9'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0190',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=34,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=6112,
    end_offset=6150,
    text_slice='不想这日三月十五，葫芦庙中炸供，那些和尚不加小心，致使油锅火逸，便烧着窗纸。',
    hash='sha256:63e54853ce617fd427ce653500d7078be30731339e0c451afa805121b7d0a101'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0191',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=34,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=6150,
    end_offset=6194,
    text_slice='此方人家多用竹篱木壁者，大抵也因劫数，于是接二连三，牵五挂四，将一条街烧得如火焰山一般。',
    hash='sha256:0595fb2c193da3ac94bf155cdeff75d833814f0f1b01f5298f3bf2b400cf3ad0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0192',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=34,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=6194,
    end_offset=6217,
    text_slice='彼时虽有军民来救，那火已成了势，如何救得下去！',
    hash='sha256:8ad35b6e46bfa297b74b48e1ad51d49818b393939ab9db958f620b3b1b5344a1'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0193',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=34,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=6217,
    end_offset=6238,
    text_slice='直烧了一夜，方渐渐熄去，也不知烧了多少家。',
    hash='sha256:f0e39352cf0afe16b71abb4effc30f6869910cd1ad20e60defa67ef1eab1a1de'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0194',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=34,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=6238,
    end_offset=6276,
    text_slice='只可怜甄家在隔壁，早已烧成一片瓦砾场了，只有他夫妇并几个家人的性命不曾伤了。',
    hash='sha256:b9b52445be0c3a7781e146dc541aed6bff55e9d083cc4b05d3d837d3612ff60b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0195',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=34,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=6276,
    end_offset=6288,
    text_slice='急得士隐惟跌足长叹而已。',
    hash='sha256:34b345f5fd6aa01268ce7acd2d84037c68dfecbe01e9b19dcbd89c7ad0efdf3b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0196',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=34,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=6288,
    end_offset=6305,
    text_slice='只得与妻子商议，且到田庄上去安身。',
    hash='sha256:5c80bbd6e314fb80e0370a5262c8d75bd44a93679a0fa3aa42afcc8eb7398af6'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0197',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=34,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=6305,
    end_offset=6348,
    text_slice='偏值近年水旱不收，鼠盗蜂起，无非抢田夺地，鼠窃狗偷，民不安生，因此官兵剿捕，难以安身。',
    hash='sha256:516684c34c2f473677aece5b48b14c8478506f95690fb7310cb630e60bdec422'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0198',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=34,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=6348,
    end_offset=6377,
    text_slice='士隐只得将田庄都折变了，便携了妻子与两个丫鬟投他岳丈家去。',
    hash='sha256:aeb124a72456fa96bfe543dcd7cd17076593f4bc8ff5374764903a57e1ec2fc0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0199',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=35,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=6379,
    end_offset=6407,
    text_slice='他岳丈名唤封肃，本贯大如州人氏，虽是务农，家中都还殷实。',
    hash='sha256:2c5e7229bdcdb0e507ed3502ccad709a618f67421225b5983fb574714c9195d6'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0200',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=35,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=6407,
    end_offset=6426,
    text_slice='今见女婿这等狼狈而来，心中便有些不乐。',
    hash='sha256:0b927cdd0de13538f52c41eb3f276ad750ba5a76baa7d99b5fd6da76452e7cab'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0201',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=35,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=6426,
    end_offset=6469,
    text_slice='幸而士隐还有折变田地的银子未曾用完，拿出来托他随分就价，薄置些须房地，为后日衣食之计。',
    hash='sha256:255d9da82871a65d93907847d87884ac197ec0f7ff064aa9030b6b124748de99'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0202',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=35,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=6469,
    end_offset=6488,
    text_slice='那封肃便半哄半赚，些须与他些薄田朽屋。',
    hash='sha256:34a171af1aec4d05f0d68116fdc4fa2baf86286b8d65ca4a9519078bc2fdc2de'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0203',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=35,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=6488,
    end_offset=6521,
    text_slice='士隐乃读书之人，不惯生理稼穑等事，勉强支持了一二年，越觉穷了下去。',
    hash='sha256:a0d7a44d57d17198f152c014470884ea0e09eced5f22c313df98e91765459dbc'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0204',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=35,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=6521,
    end_offset=6559,
    text_slice='封肃每见面时，便说些现成话，且人前人后又怨他们不善过活，只一味好吃懒做等语。',
    hash='sha256:a8619f645b886a42e6c0cc10a4eb7c828b363deec8d87444a6d603111e8a57f0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0205',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=35,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=6559,
    end_offset=6611,
    text_slice='士隐知投人不着，心中未免悔恨，再兼上年惊唬，急忿怨痛，已伤暮年之人，贫病交攻，竟渐渐露出那下世的光景来。',
    hash='sha256:e1f55f44b1a7c5d784f03b2e2fa763309506704074fd2ae53efcbe0841fa6ef7'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0206',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=36,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=6613,
    end_offset=6666,
    text_slice='可巧这日拄了拐，挣挫到街前散散心时，忽见那边来了一个跛足道人，疯癫落脱，麻屣鹑衣，口内念着几句言词，道是：',
    hash='sha256:2e7ff9db794b8206abe94da808277f8a4b363ef0891762484f9bce150a34ad2f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0207',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=37,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=6668,
    end_offset=6684,
    text_slice='世人都晓神仙好，惟有功名忘不了。',
    hash='sha256:4e120b37fc446ccc06621cc941d69a3e4c475f28bb4e99d5643899b4a1af931a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0208',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=37,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=6684,
    end_offset=6692,
    text_slice='古今将相在何方？',
    hash='sha256:9d5aa6bc60a6d7d8f8d4e26a72e31a67787a52400e14ff968d50cf0c82cf4ecb'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0209',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=37,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=6692,
    end_offset=6700,
    text_slice='荒冢一堆草没了！',
    hash='sha256:6646ac6f488872db488736f07fa6cd732d9f06424fc50e545bcc3b59a8bacd20'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0210',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=37,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=6700,
    end_offset=6716,
    text_slice='世人都晓神仙好，只有金银忘不了。',
    hash='sha256:cde023f5752cf41c1d3baf92286c5655da3ac3906a9bb9bf2ccede2c1710c0b6'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0211',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=37,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=6716,
    end_offset=6732,
    text_slice='终朝只恨聚无多，及到多时眼闭了！',
    hash='sha256:2ef3dfe4a85cf01c3161669db3df57813e73206c312ca8c9460f12be4ab8166f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0212',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=37,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=6732,
    end_offset=6748,
    text_slice='世人都晓神仙好，只有姣妻忘不了。',
    hash='sha256:f6eb660032234139f76c4267f11c12c0533b24ccc6c7dd29983248c339be97c9'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0213',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=37,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=6748,
    end_offset=6764,
    text_slice='君生日日说恩情，君死又随人去了！',
    hash='sha256:31dc489fb2d45591e058a0fa7b7fe1ca64aab10951f2e2136c65f51e89bbae1b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0214',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=37,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=6764,
    end_offset=6780,
    text_slice='世人都晓神仙好，只有儿孙忘不了。',
    hash='sha256:4f7666fe4a06da411f906b2d8e4adebb08776525bd36bb70605ba427ef2abc0e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0215',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=37,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=6780,
    end_offset=6796,
    text_slice='痴心父母古来多，孝顺儿孙谁见了？',
    hash='sha256:5e21f5838a663cdc65db31076f853ecd6ac4025dea57c618c9745e78da086087'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0216',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=38,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=6798,
    end_offset=6808,
    text_slice='士隐听了，迎上来道：',
    hash='sha256:bbadf3e568fed921e7f6abd50bc4858b41f825f1c95cac99f48a70029ea9e094'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0217',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=38,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=6808,
    end_offset=6841,
    text_slice='“你满口说些什么？只听见些‘好’‘了’‘好’‘了’。那道人笑道：”',
    hash='sha256:a8b5be12942cece664e4cf6e2d8e2a5dc33918b181d77a731fd6a569c7b2c959'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0218',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=38,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=6841,
    end_offset=6861,
    text_slice='你若果听见‘好’‘了’二字，还算你明白。',
    hash='sha256:7160d141c1b87618a4af5f9120dfd9638d5ee5f7d40701134f75781003d71aec'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0219',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=38,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=6861,
    end_offset=6878,
    text_slice='可知世上万般，好便是了，了便是好。',
    hash='sha256:6e1a48e163d371eb9c888f5dbda5edba8cb20d3e1d5d884b89d2ae9bd5f85694'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0220',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=38,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=6878,
    end_offset=6894,
    text_slice='若不了，便不好；若要好，须是了。',
    hash='sha256:4f57d6bb79cc1869623daf780c03e45322a67a3bcb46caaaec31cb0593342637'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0221',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=38,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=6894,
    end_offset=6906,
    text_slice='我这歌儿便名《好了歌》。',
    hash='sha256:8fea5fbf13476fe2776e382ecdd43e222a4f683caa81332ad2db10249369b5e2'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0222',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=38,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=6906,
    end_offset=6933,
    text_slice='“士隐本是有宿慧的，一闻此言，心中早已彻悟。因笑道：”',
    hash='sha256:77b5223fe393f52063ee43ba5b920d308438802000d3e357b5bde7e886b5b530'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0223',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=38,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=6933,
    end_offset=6936,
    text_slice='且住！',
    hash='sha256:11e5ca190db1233b4e7144444f04f21e4befffba352da2151f9c8121fe1b50b5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0224',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=38,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=6936,
    end_offset=6953,
    text_slice='待我将你这《好了歌》解注出来何如？',
    hash='sha256:796abeb374677ddbea29d3ae1761dd1bd395abff1db63d5124f50de66e05048f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0225',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=38,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=6953,
    end_offset=6960,
    text_slice='“道人笑道：”',
    hash='sha256:e9323d8f4f5d3daeeccbb30953b671e3d192f22e4970717183d1dac4422835b9'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0226',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=38,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=6960,
    end_offset=6966,
    text_slice='你解，你解。',
    hash='sha256:738a9987b89c67aaacbc6653c4f9528fa54b25242fb03eb049f835ea29402e71'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0227',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=39,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=6975,
    end_offset=6997,
    text_slice='陋室空堂，当年笏满床，衰草枯杨，曾为歌舞场。',
    hash='sha256:889ae7081bf45aadec1aa9ad452da855f2427d600bec21f87b14d7d17cd3daa3'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0228',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=39,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=6997,
    end_offset=7015,
    text_slice='蛛丝儿结满雕梁，绿纱今又糊在蓬窗上。',
    hash='sha256:af10a5b12c65dfafe298efb225ea7f0660584127ea5cf62026d42b090a1d94ae'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0229',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=39,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=7015,
    end_offset=7034,
    text_slice='说什么脂正浓、粉正香，如何两鬓又成霜？',
    hash='sha256:5b7b5999acdde52f39e84315a9c15b30cfc5e4adcf07c8dd0c7214d766400dd0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0230',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=39,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=7034,
    end_offset=7054,
    text_slice='昨日黄土陇头送白骨，今宵红灯帐底卧鸳鸯。',
    hash='sha256:1a9e2d86166f92c110884a8e6729e1a08357cf252aeb2693b05d3a766c0c9ece'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0231',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=39,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=7054,
    end_offset=7070,
    text_slice='金满箱，银满箱，展眼乞丐人皆谤。',
    hash='sha256:c002efed4e2d67399bf819d4b766c8138a6c4659c0135af513808a75f83acd03'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0232',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=39,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=7070,
    end_offset=7086,
    text_slice='正叹他人命不长，那知自己归来丧！',
    hash='sha256:ed53ff4acf183efe9538b2009c8b2c06dba8a3ea9d943906103dac31c0bed129'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0233',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=39,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=7086,
    end_offset=7099,
    text_slice='训有方，保不定日后作强梁。',
    hash='sha256:a0b666e5a3dbe2f936572430aecafd4e1df2f84bc48371c3547da5494c4f4bbb'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0234',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=39,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=7099,
    end_offset=7113,
    text_slice='择膏梁，谁承望流落在烟花巷！',
    hash='sha256:26525f59d706e2ebdb081bf455085fc5c673737671d92000e35707c92860870b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0235',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=39,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=7113,
    end_offset=7125,
    text_slice='因嫌纱帽小，致使锁枷扛。',
    hash='sha256:490b0e10826524ce1e715a9143051fe3f227cdc539ef3bbb49e3065b6585346a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0236',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=39,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=7125,
    end_offset=7137,
    text_slice='昨怜破袄寒，今嫌紫蟒长。',
    hash='sha256:df304982a9453364b53a4d32043306eb50dabb4c099f387e2713675fd0c49c42'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0237',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=39,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=7137,
    end_offset=7156,
    text_slice='乱烘烘你方唱罢我登场，反认他乡是故乡。',
    hash='sha256:7dae57eb4bc76244a0184e14c96aae1b4ce7137317c0fad1eadb8b24f3e5fbcd'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0238',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=39,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=7156,
    end_offset=7173,
    text_slice='甚荒唐，到头来都是为他人作嫁衣裳！',
    hash='sha256:f73a9bb3a80e5e64724eea1f5fe8f4d34b96b9f157db1a8a67fe9587dc9657b5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0239',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=40,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=7175,
    end_offset=7188,
    text_slice='那疯跛道人听了，拍掌笑道：',
    hash='sha256:ed5fbb4c59d22c427a3e68e4f1703a93247691dbeb2b75d7e5b6d4b008619b11'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0240',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=40,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=7188,
    end_offset=7198,
    text_slice='“解得切！解得切！”',
    hash='sha256:ed3106d3dbecfcd7030e00a545678726990976a8df28b1b135ed6e69bdeec9bf'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0241',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=40,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=7198,
    end_offset=7204,
    text_slice='士隐便说一声',
    hash='sha256:93c4dd4fead0fb9b8e0d3b1e8e77de8dd69f90eed930454fd83bf15253c9d61a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0242',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=40,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=7204,
    end_offset=7209,
    text_slice='“走罢！”',
    hash='sha256:4fd77525de1e530e6c68f521c0797b1fb253ba5e9c56d74ecbd38623777e879d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0243',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=40,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=7209,
    end_offset=7238,
    text_slice='将道人肩上褡裢抢了过来背着，竟不回家，同了疯道人飘飘而去。',
    hash='sha256:15bf35571ad60d2dd9735ad52ee4f7cd5da6a75e5cdab4d36d317dfcefe725fb'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0244',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=41,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=7240,
    end_offset=7258,
    text_slice='当下烘动街坊，众人当作一件新闻传说。',
    hash='sha256:81a2a31e269274e70d456e94614e3d58ee890c074df0aa6500bcfcc3c64ad6d8'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0245',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=41,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=7258,
    end_offset=7292,
    text_slice='封氏闻得此信，哭个死去活来，只得与父亲商议，遣人各处访寻，那讨音信？',
    hash='sha256:e90e8afa50b60d09a7e2821aa2f0067a2e4dc8452b8ad0f3f82da76d3d1f8468'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0246',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=41,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=7292,
    end_offset=7308,
    text_slice='无奈何，少不得依靠着她父母度日。',
    hash='sha256:318ab488cc1b89b1048088492d8f4fc0ad6b7332fda82a3816e48ffdbd1fcaaf'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0247',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=41,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=7308,
    end_offset=7345,
    text_slice='幸而身边还有两个旧日的丫鬟伏侍，主仆三人，日夜作些针线发卖，帮着父亲用度。',
    hash='sha256:417d202d7fd4166a77563cbce465fc8c68f6ee507a4f4a279fc87dcd9e837d2a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0248',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=41,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=7345,
    end_offset=7362,
    text_slice='那封肃虽然日日抱怨，也无可奈何了。',
    hash='sha256:bc3f8fd8fe8d107e6af86610b4f005c835a5b28cc8474ebfb80307ad735b471f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0249',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=42,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=7364,
    end_offset=7398,
    text_slice='这日，那甄家大丫鬟在门前买线，忽听街上喝道之声，众人都说新太爷到任。',
    hash='sha256:d51963ba29fd22885c08356f6334bde8b6d073e15ef882885e2ec9587389c833'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0250',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=42,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=7398,
    end_offset=7423,
    text_slice='丫鬟于是隐在门内看时，只见军牢快手一对一对的过去。',
    hash='sha256:8c5b049f666d63c44c0fd5599e7e6ab4840f6b5bbf59bce71aa7500aa6a92777'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0251',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=42,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=7423,
    end_offset=7442,
    text_slice='俄而，大轿抬着一个乌帽猩袍的官府过去。',
    hash='sha256:75eff024c9d690a589258db501f494c3fc4e217609b65f248c3fc1fbfbf303ea'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0252',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=42,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=7453,
    end_offset=7470,
    text_slice='“这官好面善，倒像在那里见过的？”',
    hash='sha256:e318da0441c665e8c7cf90a6b4bbe68e5ebced1317fbe40c2e0e964fada3a2c1'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0253',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=42,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=7470,
    end_offset=7487,
    text_slice='于是进入房中，也就丢过，不在心上。',
    hash='sha256:8e184f8d4778ac7f890be1aca31e5e8ac64cc261389f9c96b631c5f5aa17b5f3'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0254',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=42,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=7515,
    end_offset=7529,
    text_slice='“本府太爷差人来传人问话！”',
    hash='sha256:08afc9a017c829d4f61301694b543cbb8f59345f6ac73dc1493dd2906efe3ca6'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0255',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=42,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=7529,
    end_offset=7548,
    text_slice='封肃听了，唬得目瞪口呆，不知有何祸事。',
    hash='sha256:b35b2f86a95bef361f49722d1d82a19bb36eb23c612ddac9a42b128f6608b430'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0256',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=42,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=7548,
    end_offset=7555,
    text_slice='且听下回分解。',
    hash='sha256:fa4a03a78c390c6b01653600f8fccafe945faf10c30c84130cd04803a156ec49'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0257',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=43,
    segment_type='heading',
    start_offset=7557,
    end_offset=7579,
    text_slice='第二回  贾夫人仙逝扬州城\u3000冷子兴演说荣国府',
    hash='sha256:ffe4de3d2e41ce9bbe138d6e06500ef1e1b94b7e8fd21ebd3940859aebc73aa2'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0258',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=44,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=7581,
    end_offset=7584,
    text_slice='诗云：',
    hash='sha256:1ad843d5cc6b09918ba2030094c836272f9ce51e671cd0a398173347deb81354'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0259',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=45,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=7586,
    end_offset=7602,
    text_slice='一局输赢料不真，香销茶尽尚逡巡。',
    hash='sha256:2596bbb46a80d614dc22a4f79133c4a3f9d9a532f358b3fd8c0b52df8ec98216'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0260',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=45,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=7602,
    end_offset=7618,
    text_slice='欲知目下兴衰兆，须问旁观冷眼人。',
    hash='sha256:e12b3302d2ce96bef09037c7d5e4190566fde38993e4a2b721c5b8738be3f9a5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0261',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=46,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=7620,
    end_offset=7640,
    text_slice='却说封肃因听见公差传唤，忙出来陪笑启问。',
    hash='sha256:391c3e4518305c445e3009e292a0e9d7f6f7a6d6671da207bf08795f990e1a73'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0262',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=46,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=7646,
    end_offset=7655,
    text_slice='“快请出甄爷来！”',
    hash='sha256:da9e5a93ed4690b10b252399ecffb08de96d863f0304de7382a926d7bf403776'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0263',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=46,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=7655,
    end_offset=7662,
    text_slice='封肃忙陪笑道：',
    hash='sha256:ea7dd000d5567c8da0310b5307501a48e1a85a4f34f959b00704bb32aaaa4c2d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0264',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=46,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=7662,
    end_offset=7699,
    text_slice='“小人姓封，并不姓甄。只有当日小婿姓甄，今已出家一二年了，不知可是问他？”',
    hash='sha256:d922f86b0f8b1325e968856ec5db934e21c78f4d815a26e5b2d4356ffc693d40'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0265',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=46,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=7699,
    end_offset=7705,
    text_slice='那些公人道：',
    hash='sha256:3a9972dfa37e8a4162b7495b113ebbb40f664cb36a2478541ab2f5bbc9c79c49'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0266',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=46,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=7705,
    end_offset=7754,
    text_slice='“我们也不知什么‘真’‘假’，因奉太爷之命来问，他既是你女婿，便带了你去亲见太爷面禀，省得乱跑。”',
    hash='sha256:11a0928fbaea0681b5ebc69710151c53fdcafa12a94a62a4cf54185d41b4eacf'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0267',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=46,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=7754,
    end_offset=7772,
    text_slice='说着，不容封肃多言，大家推拥他去了。',
    hash='sha256:6276f75904e337c58babf4083cf827c54c209eda7286d1992ebd90a0c18ce28f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0268',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=46,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=7772,
    end_offset=7785,
    text_slice='封家人个个惊慌，不知何兆。',
    hash='sha256:64c9ff9fb83ed65f7c2fdd2e87d6f4cc340a088f4f43b1b72625f6b45ddb319f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0269',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=47,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=7787,
    end_offset=7816,
    text_slice='那天，约二更时分，只见封肃方回来，欢天喜地，众人忙问端的。',
    hash='sha256:c988fb67115a25170e4a5a8e843fa6f06e2ff36d01c60bdb23c5cf037b83380f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0270',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=47,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=7816,
    end_offset=7852,
    text_slice='他乃说道：“原来本府新升的太爷姓贾名化，本贯胡州人氏，曾与女婿旧日相交。',
    hash='sha256:f56820e3ceb986e983f13a38bb0568dfcdf5ce38183cd206c0b01c410cf6413f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0271',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=47,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=7852,
    end_offset=7883,
    text_slice='方才在咱门前过去，因见娇杏那丫头买线，所以他只当女婿移住于此。',
    hash='sha256:71385676e5fef0b49a9844f2db7f14317a8c4432078975514e7a54f82e0ad5e3'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0272',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=47,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=7883,
    end_offset=7918,
    text_slice='我一一将原故回明，那太爷倒伤感叹息了一回；又问外孙女儿，我说看灯丢了。',
    hash='sha256:a1cde022aa4639900368fdf90f06a53f5dd82d4f27f3a3505bbe46aba3727f59'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0273',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=47,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=7918,
    end_offset=7939,
    text_slice='太爷说：‘不妨，我自使番役，务必探访回来。',
    hash='sha256:ea167a2468b9de9e3d92cb65acf7666a270d73f195bf61ce68a47d422abd0052'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0274',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=47,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=7939,
    end_offset=7957,
    text_slice='’说了一回话，临走倒送了我二两银子。',
    hash='sha256:2477af3b61d170c816cedd82fb45569781dc2ee54e995f23388f5ddbc0f773bc'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0275',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=47,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=7957,
    end_offset=7972,
    text_slice='”甄家娘子听了，不免心中伤感。',
    hash='sha256:f8b3e248be7f89b55927ecc793087c24765c4cf2959e6d1179e2a6f4d7dbb91c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0276',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=47,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=7972,
    end_offset=7977,
    text_slice='一宿无话。',
    hash='sha256:c5443e4ddc0297a845fe17e78db992e89835f4a31422c8dd3a33aae669ed2d1d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0277',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=48,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=7979,
    end_offset=8033,
    text_slice='至次日，早有雨村遣人送两封银子、四匹锦缎，答谢甄家娘子；又寄一封密书与封肃，转托他向甄家娘子要那娇杏作二房。',
    hash='sha256:3657bb8ac77b6e6535745ce7afc752cb3b4dbf1fce3fe98f8f0839710bc2f5fb'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0278',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=48,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=8033,
    end_offset=8061,
    text_slice='封肃喜得屁滚尿流，巴不得去奉承，便在女儿前一力撺掇成了。',
    hash='sha256:b5faad23b517748dbb9caf89e2280ca6eaa62cb49d97b7e8c0d18e30cff50cb5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0279',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=48,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=8061,
    end_offset=8080,
    text_slice='乘夜，只用一乘小轿，便把娇杏送进去了。',
    hash='sha256:495ddbd3a6bcb30510feb5c5edea875f3bb3b2a7b8811334c00fb136e1040c3b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0280',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=48,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=8080,
    end_offset=8126,
    text_slice='雨村欢喜，自不必说，乃封百金赠封肃，外又谢甄家娘子许多物事，令其好生养赡，以待寻访女儿下落。',
    hash='sha256:52ee9707aee0a8c00b809fa383f303c201edd1f347bb804b676ca7087dd82e0b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0281',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=48,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=8126,
    end_offset=8133,
    text_slice='封肃回家无话。',
    hash='sha256:8135cad6328db7d4486861334a142fff756d431214958acd1d1975f44b2a99c6'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0282',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=49,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=8135,
    end_offset=8153,
    text_slice='却说娇杏这丫鬟，便是那年回顾雨村者。',
    hash='sha256:688c4849679f0a65efc6716b21b49f006b81664bb3a40636130a0710b777f962'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0283',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=49,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=8153,
    end_offset=8179,
    text_slice='因偶然一顾，便弄出这段事来，亦是自己意料不到之奇缘。',
    hash='sha256:4bf22aa8d16af7927a14fb8efde5bf697da43b2aa09b95b55ddcabbc7d18f422'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0284',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=49,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=8179,
    end_offset=8235,
    text_slice='谁想他命运两济，不承望自到雨村身边，只一年，便生了一子；又半载，雨村嫡妻忽染疾下世，雨村便将她扶侧作正室夫人了。',
    hash='sha256:aab53257e8448234375dc144a2f1b42afdc12a4e9e64035d1096b21ff1f03a38'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0285',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=50,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=8240,
    end_offset=8252,
    text_slice='偶因一着错，便为人上人。',
    hash='sha256:b6e1c132ec41335ca32165336acefa85e3fc43069e32f7d9f8664da204f567b7'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0286',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=51,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=8254,
    end_offset=8280,
    text_slice='原来，雨村因那年士隐赠银之后，他于十六日便起身入都。',
    hash='sha256:4a56c53df20737eba2053c3f0caabea1f433a4899113d2ed9da2f933228a92e8'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0287',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=51,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=8280,
    end_offset=8314,
    text_slice='至大比之期，不料他十分得意，已会了进士，选入外班，今已升了本府知府。',
    hash='sha256:a7083780cad146d46988e21397f17921e1a3b11953a74d873f105e96083cdb84'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0288',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=51,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=8314,
    end_offset=8346,
    text_slice='虽才干优长，未免有些贪酷之弊；且又恃才侮上，那些官员皆侧目而视。',
    hash='sha256:e24fe701479f9eaa3947c759d529f5487c66fb055c996dd69790a8a476585515'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0289',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=51,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=8346,
    end_offset=8409,
    text_slice='不上一年，便被上司寻了个空隙，作成一本，参他“生性狡猾，擅纂礼仪，且沽清正之名，而暗结虎狼之属，致使地方多事，民命不堪”等语。',
    hash='sha256:d0988ddf2246d38745230693e53e159792473e678fc186b9f6b847c257e1ded7'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0290',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=51,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=8409,
    end_offset=8419,
    text_slice='龙颜大怒，即批革职。',
    hash='sha256:442d3c7f118d95728c0f5dfce454ed0401d899efc6ee7a694af72f3ded9a33ac'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0291',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=51,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=8419,
    end_offset=8435,
    text_slice='该部文书一到，本府官员无不喜悦。',
    hash='sha256:bfc68c79424dc605bed3d37425529417782e1ede27f77f4c7861128d925abb69'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0292',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=51,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=8435,
    end_offset=8463,
    text_slice='那雨村心中虽十分惭恨，却面上全无一点怨色，仍是嘻笑自若。',
    hash='sha256:5702481fc6da7796817382eb8479aacffcaa4bf5f995b239d12e0f6b0497ad29'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0293',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=51,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=8463,
    end_offset=8494,
    text_slice='交代过公事，将历年做官积的些资本并家小人属送至原籍，安插妥协。',
    hash='sha256:9e5db0cbe16d5dac35b04dca12cffb6bc4db7d2c6e3c030bf14c2d23f8f92d25'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0294',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=51,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=8494,
    end_offset=8510,
    text_slice='却又自己担风袖月，游览天下胜迹。',
    hash='sha256:2fe29f758569f52da7d128c8f23ece1534b61a8800a35b951ffe37f8403cafe2'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0295',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=52,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=8512,
    end_offset=8538,
    text_slice='那日，偶又游至维扬地面，因闻得今岁鹾政点的是林如海。',
    hash='sha256:4228b03f647514f7b022ac132761ae01926c839c3d94be0de135e46881abbd8b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0296',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=52,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=8538,
    end_offset=8595,
    text_slice='这林如海姓林名海，表字如海，乃是前科的探花，今已升至兰台寺大夫，本贯姑苏人氏，今钦点出为巡盐御史，到任方一月有余。',
    hash='sha256:a908f8c7f7c81a31e0536ca39b1228e991095b77355dca1cf097cdd0e10a521f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0297',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=52,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=8595,
    end_offset=8620,
    text_slice='原来这林如海之祖，曾袭过列侯，今到如海，业经五世。',
    hash='sha256:f942259386748405e252b960c6de12e7a9fa9d99668bc224e146bc2a69818315'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0298',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=52,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=8620,
    end_offset=8671,
    text_slice='起初时，只封袭三世，因当今隆恩盛德，远迈前代，额外加恩，至如海之父，又袭了一代；至如海，便从科第出身。',
    hash='sha256:ee49a682c7919e53732ad09c614ff3aa531441946543dc98c7534ef666699768'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0299',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=52,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=8671,
    end_offset=8686,
    text_slice='虽系钟鼎之家，却亦是书香之族。',
    hash='sha256:d2571aef3c52af872fc45417a67e54fcb864a9f4c0d23fd853bedea08a16c579'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0300',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=52,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=8686,
    end_offset=8726,
    text_slice='只可惜这林家支庶不盛，子孙有限；虽有几门，却与如海俱是堂族而已，没甚亲支嫡派的。',
    hash='sha256:2a6be76585448166c0f96bd4b1a0b9697377b2b0ba77e1e6fee475fb8d0e8a54'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0301',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=52,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=8726,
    end_offset=8751,
    text_slice='今如海年已四十，只有一个三岁之子，偏又于去岁死了。',
    hash='sha256:538628d244325e64edae59691c30a5aeae8ea8a7c345bc52d2160dc1b0c95a93'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0302',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=52,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=8751,
    end_offset=8773,
    text_slice='虽有几房姬妾，奈他命中无子，亦无可如何之事。',
    hash='sha256:16ef1cff0aa808e33a9575502c1f76325e66b96c666b79df95a315c6b69228c0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0303',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=52,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=8773,
    end_offset=8796,
    text_slice='今只有嫡妻贾氏，生得一女，乳名黛玉，年方五岁。',
    hash='sha256:9da0484585ae7bd9e62164afc9f42caccdc97ecf9eba8c520dd6276a5395d69d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0304',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=52,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=8796,
    end_offset=8847,
    text_slice='夫妻无子，故爱如珍宝；且又见她聪明清秀，便也欲使她读书识得几个字，不过假充养子之意，聊解膝下荒凉之叹。',
    hash='sha256:2192b08ff71e87d3f7639ba906e4f7fa08cbe07444bbf6d59fb7850492a4a97f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0305',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=53,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=8849,
    end_offset=8872,
    text_slice='雨村正值偶感风寒，病在旅店，将一月光景方渐愈。',
    hash='sha256:8191962ebb405e34146b5c6695f6cbdde4cd5e41cfae35a20f7fcf2cb3ee9033'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0306',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=53,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=8872,
    end_offset=8901,
    text_slice='一因身体劳倦，二因盘费不继，也正欲寻个合式之处，暂且歇下。',
    hash='sha256:b074e2a448ab4786b530c19a2706b09e4e252e3a62d29150800d2d89e615afb4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0307',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=53,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=8901,
    end_offset=8946,
    text_slice='幸有两个旧友，亦在此境居住，因闻得鹾政欲聘一西宾，雨村便相托友力，谋了进去，且作安身之计。',
    hash='sha256:68c0aa2d9a111ea80c1310f8ff77edf3e94b4a9e0d531b49bd0648d50a5058f3'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0308',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=53,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=8946,
    end_offset=8991,
    text_slice='妙在只一个女学生，并两个伴读丫鬟，这女学生年又小，身体又极怯弱，功课不限多寡，故十分省力。',
    hash='sha256:010a9ff5debe6121538844af1eb8a204d3d429f220673bc612b64108a8867538'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0309',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=54,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=8993,
    end_offset=9019,
    text_slice='堪堪又是一载的光阴，谁知女学生之母贾氏夫人一疾而终。',
    hash='sha256:ea59303ef51aacab973e9e683715dc5d68cda9761f8011aebb41458dedb9ba2a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0310',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=54,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=9019,
    end_offset=9040,
    text_slice='女学生侍汤奉药，守丧尽哀，遂又将辞馆别图。',
    hash='sha256:9c1e56c3ff4872781c2f91e1c9b1a79b04fbf74fd25a8bd80fc7f9717c0eb884'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0311',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=54,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=9040,
    end_offset=9059,
    text_slice='林如海意欲令女守制读书，故又将他留下。',
    hash='sha256:638b6c0f7bc655305062b009e8d5975f3a1f7d324bf16ac28b3be6d0b41466ba'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0312',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=54,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=9059,
    end_offset=9090,
    text_slice='近因女学生哀痛过伤，本自怯弱多病的，触犯旧症，遂连日不曾上学。',
    hash='sha256:1ee7f8df5bfb4a1900e36f14865b51db946dd1c7796e2416c3f45b0c8f212c19'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0313',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=54,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=9090,
    end_offset=9112,
    text_slice='雨村闲居无聊，每当风日晴和，饭后便出来闲步。',
    hash='sha256:fe7a98fbe74c590399bf9ca0a0507c5cf4a93a86543331e408df5478ee7ff8df'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0314',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=55,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=9114,
    end_offset=9132,
    text_slice='这日，偶至郭外，意欲赏鉴那村野风光。',
    hash='sha256:0570af21603f69c4ae03498d42063cb8ed56e4573728cb07650a5c7853dcc58b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0315',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=55,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=9132,
    end_offset=9167,
    text_slice='忽信步至一山环水旋、茂林深竹之处，隐隐的有座庙宇，门巷倾颓，墙垣朽败。',
    hash='sha256:f33883146d6a72c120c8c8eb5674c785f342ca86b945534752e6f5ba2507e710'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0316',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=56,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=9198,
    end_offset=9214,
    text_slice='身后有余忘缩手，眼前无路想回头。',
    hash='sha256:b6384052f7be26c875911f6b7e86858f1255cf0d616a4eae8f112090e3a69ea7'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0317',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=57,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=9216,
    end_offset=9241,
    text_slice='雨村看了，因想到：“这两句话，文虽浅近，其意则深。',
    hash='sha256:414c9e2ede821b5208c555141784a6a01505e5a42cc05280f6adbaf74c7170b3'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0318',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=57,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=9241,
    end_offset=9285,
    text_slice='我也曾游过些名山大剎，倒不曾见过这话头；其中想必有个翻过筋斗来的也未可知，何不进去试试。',
    hash='sha256:0b9984bb4cf80c176e16e31c22cb7f5503de3fe002b25c1687d7e19da7263a53'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0319',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=57,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=9285,
    end_offset=9308,
    text_slice='”想着，走入看时，只有一个龙钟老僧在那里煮粥。',
    hash='sha256:3e5c6ae42d6194ff09c05bff70a7424347ebddf74cc6600b99e8d4918ebdd84f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0320',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=57,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=9308,
    end_offset=9318,
    text_slice='雨村见了，便不在意。',
    hash='sha256:e9a6363d535797e040ea034fd4fba5de9d9ed73377fbcafe3f61fee84217bfb8'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0321',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=57,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=9318,
    end_offset=9345,
    text_slice='及至问他两句话，那老僧既聋且昏，齿落舌钝，所答非所问。',
    hash='sha256:3e49ff0fabd93fac139ea6aee096df75a48ddda411f62d34871b6c19acf4dd50'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0322',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=58,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=9347,
    end_offset=9382,
    text_slice='雨村不耐烦，便仍出来，意欲到那村肆中沽饮三杯，以助野趣，于是款步行来。',
    hash='sha256:1fec44826956ef05727ecd83d8ab508b9fb510c22379404c21b525a9f5361a2a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0323',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=58,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=9412,
    end_offset=9420,
    text_slice='“奇遇，奇遇！”',
    hash='sha256:9584065c5db41154a77887da6b1936d738b5298334bea5d7db210dedcc3388f3'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0324',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=58,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=9420,
    end_offset=9452,
    text_slice='雨村忙看时，此人是都中在古董行中贸易的号冷子兴者，旧日在都相识。',
    hash='sha256:39df37f65c0cf9467fc6e5fa393a12d46b6b30ed421a169e21a76f63ff0690f0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0325',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=58,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=9452,
    end_offset=9496,
    text_slice='雨村最赞这冷子兴是个有作为大本领的人，这子兴又借雨村斯文之名，故二人说话投机，最相契合。',
    hash='sha256:39900eb826c710ddcbde3f6e270fdfd3b015088bf1a23f0be43ebcecc86ec56b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0326',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=58,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=9502,
    end_offset=9526,
    text_slice='“老兄何日到此？弟竟不知。今日偶遇，真奇缘也！”',
    hash='sha256:7e38847f6fbe45c38e1f7d33e826ac74414937cfe9a47ff8f1fe8863f13b2979'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0327',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=58,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=9526,
    end_offset=9530,
    text_slice='子兴道：',
    hash='sha256:7eb78380be993fca63ecb725b96048ca15b16c38aedda83984d64c5733682c88'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0328',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=58,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=9530,
    end_offset=9620,
    text_slice='“去年岁底到家，今因还要入都，从此顺路找个敝友说一句话，承他之情，留我多住两日。我也无甚紧事，且盘桓两日，待月半时也就起身了。今日敝友有事，我因闲步至此，且歇歇脚，不期这样巧遇！”',
    hash='sha256:2943a5c27652642dca976256148b9c4ed3ab8fae89466dc978ddc320b102a7f0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0329',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=58,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=9620,
    end_offset=9641,
    text_slice='一面说，一面让雨村同席坐了，另整上酒肴来。',
    hash='sha256:a823cea373d394bc3828f9b859f589a88a2d5ed9bc2f207a69a6644847bf6e25'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0330',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=58,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=9641,
    end_offset=9655,
    text_slice='二人闲谈漫饮，叙些别后之事。',
    hash='sha256:771655863120d1817c12a2700513c0acf142e1537096db7a11d06dd367d16ecc'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0331',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=59,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=9657,
    end_offset=9662,
    text_slice='雨村因问：',
    hash='sha256:102b3fa2a303f2947905405410bb42c2e5f3be55be2d80e4bf715a9e868b6728'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0332',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=59,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=9662,
    end_offset=9675,
    text_slice='“近日都中可有新闻没有？”',
    hash='sha256:816d9db28d7aa24c53277b463240c31b86f2d210c4732140dc39af3514d65fc9'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0333',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=59,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=9675,
    end_offset=9679,
    text_slice='子兴道：',
    hash='sha256:7eb78380be993fca63ecb725b96048ca15b16c38aedda83984d64c5733682c88'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0334',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=59,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=9679,
    end_offset=9709,
    text_slice='“倒没有什么新闻，倒是老先生你贵同宗家出了一件小小的异事。”',
    hash='sha256:90d5b67020bd5d387a8dfde970f28228da95708081140cd0c569271d85a7920d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0335',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=59,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=9709,
    end_offset=9714,
    text_slice='雨村笑道：',
    hash='sha256:84ca15199f57adea5d1a601b41a4e01b6ad2a4381bf33df89821ebd9557b3911'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0336',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=59,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=9714,
    end_offset=9729,
    text_slice='“弟族中无人在都，何谈及此？”',
    hash='sha256:bb11d99f64a18a79304c1f2cea03ce5c15dbda3366f7c64a11ead7cc80395f4e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0337',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=59,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=9729,
    end_offset=9734,
    text_slice='子兴笑道：',
    hash='sha256:964eb2d83c25996fba73dd0072a1f6384d29428be535ae2f8fa529ac4e53a019'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0338',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=59,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=9734,
    end_offset=9748,
    text_slice='“你们同姓，岂非同宗一族？”',
    hash='sha256:15ded05cda3597117469f5b0349a329c78ebd935e5bc23ad1f6350d6559e71fa'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0339',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=59,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=9748,
    end_offset=9755,
    text_slice='雨村问是谁家。',
    hash='sha256:815da052313c87ab8648492c14a6e4a670b87780644e534ba84cf02091f3e14c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0340',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=59,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=9759,
    end_offset=9780,
    text_slice='“荣国府贾府中，可也玷辱了先生的门楣了？”',
    hash='sha256:fa513b612a9ccddbc8c528e5f63bbe8f6983d560db47e4dd63b516569a31e739'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0341',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=59,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=9780,
    end_offset=9785,
    text_slice='雨村笑道：',
    hash='sha256:84ca15199f57adea5d1a601b41a4e01b6ad2a4381bf33df89821ebd9557b3911'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0342',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=59,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=9785,
    end_offset=9868,
    text_slice='“原来是他家。若论起来，寒族人丁却不少，自东汉贾复以来，支派繁盛，各省皆有，谁逐细考查！若论荣国一支，却是同谱。但他那等荣耀，我们不便去攀扯，至今故越发生疏难认了。”',
    hash='sha256:4d2eaf3351984a63658bbaa3aaf06d416353cae65f848fc8c8a9d4beaa9374dd'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0343',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=60,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=9870,
    end_offset=9875,
    text_slice='子兴叹道：',
    hash='sha256:3cd4410853606e8b607953135b547d2bdc75f69a988b747bbeaba5567f4b7654'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0344',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=60,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=9875,
    end_offset=9909,
    text_slice='“老先生休如此说！如今的这宁、荣两门，也都萧疏了，不比先时的光景。”',
    hash='sha256:e58a6e099522ad8ad04c9af7309509cc22ecce4e14741fe46907c511896b04a6'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0345',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=60,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=9909,
    end_offset=9913,
    text_slice='雨村道：',
    hash='sha256:a9987f745f066fcafb0033381b00553509b51e3b23b1e13d3aaa9502b2dd926e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0346',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=60,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=9913,
    end_offset=9935,
    text_slice='“当日宁、荣两宅的人口极多，如何就萧疏了？”',
    hash='sha256:272c4a68e022cc0caed87ce9270a813e6719a2b98882533989832d287c968037'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0347',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=60,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=9935,
    end_offset=9940,
    text_slice='冷子兴道：',
    hash='sha256:bd5bfc6372d8819846ce957b255c8a43fb4d1cb4264bbac90521b6ed8898c267'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0348',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=60,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=9940,
    end_offset=9951,
    text_slice='“正是，说来也话长。”',
    hash='sha256:f9841c99915b850e35810b746b5bffbee41f5e1b55f1d9bbe41e2afe2a148e15'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0349',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=60,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=9951,
    end_offset=9955,
    text_slice='雨村道：',
    hash='sha256:a9987f745f066fcafb0033381b00553509b51e3b23b1e13d3aaa9502b2dd926e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0350',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=60,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=9955,
    end_offset=10086,
    text_slice='“去岁我到金陵地界，因欲游览六朝遗迹，那日进了石头城，从他老宅门前经过。街东是宁国府，街西是荣国府，二宅相连，竟将大半条街占了。大门前虽冷落无人，隔着围墙一望，里面厅殿楼阁，也还都峥嵘轩峻；就是后一带花园子里面树木山石，也还都有蓊蔚洇润之气，那里像个衰败之家？”',
    hash='sha256:0c5d1adaec5a638c9d35616b43f453f7860ee94815f606b98349bbd3157c82d6'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0351',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=60,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=10086,
    end_offset=10092,
    text_slice='冷子兴笑道：',
    hash='sha256:94a53050b9c6206b7b230f3af48387715e7d23be01ff5f6ef28984490acad652'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0352',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=60,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=10092,
    end_offset=10270,
    text_slice='“亏你是个进士出身，原来不通！古人有云：‘百足之虫，死而不僵。’如今虽说不及先年那样兴盛，较之平常仕宦之家，到底气象不同。如今生齿日繁，事务日盛，主仆上下，安富尊荣者尽多，运筹谋画者无一；其日用排场费用，又不能将就省俭，如今外面的架子虽未甚倒，内囊却也尽上来了。这还是小事，更有一件大事：谁知这样钟鸣鼎食之家，翰墨诗书之族，如今的儿孙，竟一代不如一代了！”',
    hash='sha256:b1c43dc936edba3bbb81ce60b2576d0e2f6af396519de258fbc5d53122d3dfb2'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0353',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=60,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=10270,
    end_offset=10280,
    text_slice='雨村听说，也纳罕道：',
    hash='sha256:5036789f2c7572cbeb58afc52c70582b03784e9760283d784dfd7e11355b7480'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0354',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=60,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=10280,
    end_offset=10320,
    text_slice='“这样诗礼之家，岂有不善教育之理？别家不知，只说这宁、荣二宅，是最教子有方的。”',
    hash='sha256:42e055ff243a6202da76d13374de9397fa4fe77357301b79844bcb9d47ba7f37'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0355',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=61,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=10322,
    end_offset=10337,
    text_slice='子兴叹道：“正说的是这两门呢。',
    hash='sha256:5bd17c7fcaa644172671e5a5a6f5f90f26f7fece964e8f73d3c562541009cf1c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0356',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=61,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=10337,
    end_offset=10362,
    text_slice='待我告诉你：当日宁国公与荣国公是一母同胞弟兄两个。',
    hash='sha256:638e1b836cc62603e383deaf2408de1dbf3ca26135bc5aff32bf292e3af21f5d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0357',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=61,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=10362,
    end_offset=10374,
    text_slice='宁公居长，生了四个儿子。',
    hash='sha256:ffe30c88f74cd0f4b13f2e785bb7ea2cbc724dbc9202bebe160ff3dcfa97a759'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0358',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=61,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=10374,
    end_offset=10442,
    text_slice='宁公死后，贾代化袭了官，也养了两个儿子：长名贾敷，至八九岁上便死了，只剩了次子贾敬袭了官，如今一味好道，只爱烧丹炼汞，余者一概不在心上。',
    hash='sha256:3890d34cce9f2538da8b6ed98f51ef5b26009136e073ee6c0cdd610c519eedc0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0359',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=61,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=10442,
    end_offset=10475,
    text_slice='幸而早年留下一子，名唤贾珍，因他父亲一心想作神仙，把官倒让他袭了。',
    hash='sha256:425b1541b347a539c45cb05acf5b337b8d51b2b7a5604cc9ca98932f48fef760'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0360',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=61,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=10475,
    end_offset=10499,
    text_slice='他父亲又不肯回原籍来，只在都中城外和道士们胡羼。',
    hash='sha256:e40a58d13a690885bf05f1c239a7df6a5db5a6caa541b1c6232d176351ad0833'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0361',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=61,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=10499,
    end_offset=10524,
    text_slice='这位珍爷也倒生了一个儿子，今年才十六岁，名叫贾蓉。',
    hash='sha256:0a916e7923d5647e7427e0bf248775e25f32eb7c54b5b4021086f5cb42f1f4f7'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0362',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=61,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=10524,
    end_offset=10534,
    text_slice='如今敬老爹一概不管。',
    hash='sha256:db5bb2ea118c28bce35ca72ef8db9efabe8114abecb39d869c61914110a11593'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0363',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=61,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=10534,
    end_offset=10570,
    text_slice='这珍爷那里肯读书，只一味高乐不已，把宁国府竟翻了过来，也没有人敢来管他。',
    hash='sha256:da851403737aa0977e171e733d32fb51189cae28a3bc6a074d7ef8957211b795'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0364',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=61,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=10570,
    end_offset=10589,
    text_slice='再说荣府你听，方才所说异事就出在这里。',
    hash='sha256:acd32ce111c8cfeec12d7ace22b61301c915cc626d967c867d0020d006d22c7f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0365',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=61,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=10589,
    end_offset=10638,
    text_slice='自荣公死后，长子贾代善袭了官，娶的也是金陵世勋史侯家的小姐为妻，生了两个儿子：长子贾赦，次子贾政。',
    hash='sha256:94689ee33575491530533006ec4c47bd597895c79ab6d524dc3f3691b6cd2475'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0366',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=61,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=10638,
    end_offset=10687,
    text_slice='如今代善早已去世，太夫人尚在，长子贾赦袭着官，次子贾政，自幼酷喜读书，祖父最疼，原欲以科甲出身的。',
    hash='sha256:80851e627457ffaf6a5e68195a5d6f443644afb40a05ffe7ccbf8f387359e7da'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0367',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=61,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=10687,
    end_offset=10761,
    text_slice='不料代善临终时，遗本一上，皇上因恤先臣，即时令长子袭官外，问还有几子，立刻引见，遂额外赐了这政老爹一个主事之衔，令其入部习学，如今现已升了员外郎了。',
    hash='sha256:3fabb79e7f08e2702ed17db2830bafc8aa1bc9c9659301e3a93c3617697b57cd'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0368',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=61,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=10761,
    end_offset=10808,
    text_slice='这政老爹的夫人王氏，头胎生的公子，名唤贾珠，十四岁进学，不到二十岁就娶了妻，生了子，一病死了。',
    hash='sha256:95ccdeb8f7f507109fcb2639a1c5a1f83b4f819788abfdd51c250690e8ea8251'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0369',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=61,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=10808,
    end_offset=10884,
    text_slice='第二胎生了一位小姐，生在大年初一，这就奇了，不想后来又生了一位公子，说来更奇，一落胎胞，嘴里便衔下一块五彩晶莹的玉来，上面还有许多字迹，就取名叫作宝玉。',
    hash='sha256:ed7adffb24f11231d26ef94c2843d6439c5add1f8592cd43f5206f6a50b041b1'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0370',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=61,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=10884,
    end_offset=10894,
    text_slice='你道是新奇异事不是？',
    hash='sha256:6cf2172cd4ae521e7b12f5a3ac2b98f1ee1cfe56949da6d0caf907efdb5b4240'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0371',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=62,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=10897,
    end_offset=10902,
    text_slice='雨村笑道：',
    hash='sha256:84ca15199f57adea5d1a601b41a4e01b6ad2a4381bf33df89821ebd9557b3911'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0372',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=62,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=10902,
    end_offset=10918,
    text_slice='“果然奇异。只怕这人来历不小。”',
    hash='sha256:e8d1e0a79ee32bb235219f86c57f57b2e9377853cc4e57b2fdf2f97869168905'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0373',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=62,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=10918,
    end_offset=10924,
    text_slice='子兴冷笑道：',
    hash='sha256:7710ca4e969e81bf65b3449f0d31e30aa8b78c2f0092c9408a39ef6c429275e3'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0374',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=62,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=10924,
    end_offset=11152,
    text_slice='“万人皆如此说，因而乃祖母便先爱如珍宝。那年周岁时，政老爹便要试他将来的志向，便将那世上所有之物摆了无数，与他抓取。谁知他一概不取，伸手只把些脂粉钗环抓来。政老爹便大怒了，说：‘将来酒色之徒耳！’因此便大不喜悦。独那史老太君还是命根一样。说来又奇，如今长了七八岁，虽然淘气异常，但其聪明乖觉处，百个不及他一个。说起孩子话来也奇怪，他说：‘女儿是水作的骨肉，男人是泥作的骨肉。我见了女儿，我便清爽；见了男子，便觉浊臭逼人。’你道好笑不好笑？将来色鬼无疑了！”',
    hash='sha256:5b6895787d2c3457b134b08c4ac23deb873ac5df5527d18515a2cb81b7beb553'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0375',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=62,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=11152,
    end_offset=11163,
    text_slice='雨村罕然厉色，忙止道：',
    hash='sha256:e9bf94fa2a1ee257bb0a2ca25e8d9db670aed97b7283aaf0e59620d0547db1c4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0376',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=62,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=11163,
    end_offset=11226,
    text_slice='“非也！可惜你们不知道这人来历。大约政老前辈也错以淫魔色鬼看待了。若非多读书识事，加以致知格物之功、悟道参玄之力，不能知也。”',
    hash='sha256:92a70a966dced97935df4c18dda8edab30388a4285b975eba23e126348bbce4d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0377',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=63,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=11228,
    end_offset=11245,
    text_slice='子兴见他说得这样重大，忙请教其端。',
    hash='sha256:08341ff5035b5b15e361a42e8ad69cacb77a09c44637dfa94935ab7c7a4dd3e8'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0378',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=63,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=11245,
    end_offset=11270,
    text_slice='雨村道：“天地生人，除大仁大恶两种，余者皆无大异。',
    hash='sha256:713cfb6775c407f943bc7c778d471ef7051915a22b58f1514923bbd51595083b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0379',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=63,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=11270,
    end_offset=11291,
    text_slice='若大仁者，则应运而生；大恶者，则应劫而生。',
    hash='sha256:956fe0ae23c671d3265ddf0b3153f5f59dcc322ec4b69af8d3ccfeb5bc111c83'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0380',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=63,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=11291,
    end_offset=11301,
    text_slice='运生世治，劫生世危。',
    hash='sha256:04a40f97d190df4c1d13639f6eb20218e0714429cfc17101dffcec88d1aad8ab'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0381',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=63,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=11301,
    end_offset=11377,
    text_slice='尧、舜、禹、汤、文、武、周、召、孔、孟、董、韩、周、程、张、朱，皆应运而生者；蚩尤、共工、桀、纣、始皇、王莽、曹操、桓温、安禄山、秦桧等，皆应劫而生者。',
    hash='sha256:55cd81b8d525f812c4c656de0eec107c885bbdb556a87435bd63ecc2a5e17850'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0382',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=63,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=11377,
    end_offset=11395,
    text_slice='大仁者，修治天下；大恶者，扰乱天下。',
    hash='sha256:dda2c514b78353c4bae3a27d102fa4a430979567bd1245264a00bfe0348bc8e8'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0383',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=63,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=11395,
    end_offset=11431,
    text_slice='清明灵秀，天地之正气，仁者之所秉也；残忍乖僻，天地之邪气，恶者之所秉也。',
    hash='sha256:2cfef70b27a2f12a3e85749816dd64fc8d1877a45f54037b44ce542766e04bab'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0384',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=63,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=11431,
    end_offset=11472,
    text_slice='今当运隆祚永之朝，太平无为之世，清明灵秀之气所秉者，上至朝廷，下及草野，比比皆是。',
    hash='sha256:67c24f3600175b077f4eeefb30441f72a90192ff535f1749cf53a8cf5117546b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0385',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=63,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=11472,
    end_offset=11499,
    text_slice='所余之秀气，漫无所归，遂为甘露，为和风，洽然溉及四海。',
    hash='sha256:c1bc403e6447517f1778a6383f813f1e27cef9fcfba79c8aae15b192dfe7ca65'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0386',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=63,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=11499,
    end_offset=11618,
    text_slice='彼残忍乖僻之邪气，不能荡溢于光天化日之中，遂凝结充塞于深沟大壑之内，偶因风荡，或被云摧，略有摇动感发之意，一丝半缕误而泄出者，偶值灵秀之气适过，正不容邪，邪复妒正，两不相下，亦如风水雷电，地中既遇，既不能消，又不能让，必至搏击掀发后始尽。',
    hash='sha256:7725ae64c84e9ab751fd9717cc8118bcc58339294560df0f7ce1c2892d1e7d70'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0387',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=63,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=11618,
    end_offset=11633,
    text_slice='故其气亦必赋人，发泄一尽始散。',
    hash='sha256:bfced645736296b870d6fcdcebe3c42a84e6d17b604e04eb23bb80940dbe31b2'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0388',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=63,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=11633,
    end_offset=11665,
    text_slice='使男女偶秉此气而生者，在上则不能成仁人君子，下亦不能为大凶大恶。',
    hash='sha256:07845e3898682967328b9a36c99ef275b2724111c2e53c3fb7e7dd2a38aecaed'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0389',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=63,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=11665,
    end_offset=11710,
    text_slice='置之于万万人中，其聪俊灵秀之气，则在万万人之上；其乖僻邪谬、不近人情之态，又在万万人之下。',
    hash='sha256:9370eeb4d155314293abc9268169292e094317331c32bfc02e48928c4fa83dc4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0390',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=63,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=11710,
    end_offset=11779,
    text_slice='若生于公侯富贵之家，则为情痴情种；若生于诗书清贫之族，则为逸士高人；纵再偶生于薄祚寒门，断不能为走卒健仆，甘遭庸人驱制驾驭，必为奇优名倡。',
    hash='sha256:8c86dd93f8a30b69830e13a0aed6a3ac6c853720ed3fe8c8625e53829ba0801b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0391',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=63,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=11779,
    end_offset=11900,
    text_slice='如前代之许由、陶潜、阮籍、嵇康、刘伶、王谢二族、顾虎头、陈后主、唐明皇、宋徽宗、刘庭芝、温飞卿、米南宫、石曼卿、柳耆卿、秦少游；近日之倪云林、唐伯虎、祝枝山；再如李龟年、黄幡绰、敬新磨、卓文君、红拂、薛涛、崔莺、朝云之流，此皆易地则同之人也。',
    hash='sha256:c600a7163bbd034298c9e98805239096e7019d30c000878900b62d5337dc1d0b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0392',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=64,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=11903,
    end_offset=11907,
    text_slice='子兴道：',
    hash='sha256:7eb78380be993fca63ecb725b96048ca15b16c38aedda83984d64c5733682c88'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0393',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=64,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=11907,
    end_offset=11924,
    text_slice='“依你说，‘成则王侯败则贼’了？”',
    hash='sha256:4434ab7c565f24c102268b79bf755ec3ad77ca3d139046e0b14ccf07f501652d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0394',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=64,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=11924,
    end_offset=11928,
    text_slice='雨村道：',
    hash='sha256:a9987f745f066fcafb0033381b00553509b51e3b23b1e13d3aaa9502b2dd926e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0395',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=64,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=11928,
    end_offset=12022,
    text_slice='“正是这意。你还不知，我自革职以来，这两年遍游各省，也曾遇见两个异样孩子。所以，方才你一说这宝玉，我就猜着了八九亦是这一派人物。不用远说，只金陵城内，钦差金陵省体仁院总裁甄家，你可知么？”',
    hash='sha256:5e1f280162ba77e824d134f0061e0da3bc71ad17095fc2fe507892120bc9bde9'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0396',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=64,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=12022,
    end_offset=12026,
    text_slice='子兴道：',
    hash='sha256:7eb78380be993fca63ecb725b96048ca15b16c38aedda83984d64c5733682c88'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0397',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=64,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=12026,
    end_offset=12075,
    text_slice='“谁人不知！这甄府和贾府就是老亲，又系世交。两家来往，极其亲热的。便在下也和他家来往非止一日了。”',
    hash='sha256:37f0ac670f067c35295574d64f168110c44e8bbbbe2713ceab6319644b05ece9'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0398',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=65,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=12077,
    end_offset=12102,
    text_slice='雨村笑道：“去年我在金陵，也曾有人荐我到甄府处馆。',
    hash='sha256:8f0ed0c9a21d46f390fe9ebc5ff80fb5eb012456cd658c569c7c11758f636b3f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0399',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=65,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=12102,
    end_offset=12137,
    text_slice='我进去看其光景，谁知他家那等显贵，却是个富而好礼之家，倒是个难得之馆。',
    hash='sha256:de376cde713e72b78c8ef3af002aef2a97189e11eef0fc62d01786042689d74f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0400',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=65,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=12137,
    end_offset=12160,
    text_slice='但这一个学生，虽是启蒙，却比一个举业的还劳神。',
    hash='sha256:db915773e7e17289d1a56e6046630728c53ffcf3444beb448bbadd894303c97f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0401',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=65,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=12160,
    end_offset=12206,
    text_slice='说起来更可笑，他说：‘必得两个女儿伴着我读书，我方能认得字，心里也明白；不然我自己心里胡涂。',
    hash='sha256:29a76b6bae531e2dbddf48a8f71e60e570ba11812a0d3b9b10e235b8a2c5d90a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0402',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=65,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=12206,
    end_offset=12261,
    text_slice='’又常对跟他的小厮们说：‘这女儿两个字，极尊贵、极清净的，比那阿弥陀佛、元始天尊的这两个宝号还更尊荣无对的呢！',
    hash='sha256:d9bf792d3e3aa3332ec091e78796d9d35fd32a7cd7d0de8883573e12dc06919d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0403',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=65,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=12261,
    end_offset=12282,
    text_slice='你们这浊口臭舌，万不可唐突了这两个字要紧！',
    hash='sha256:8227b3b5c13c7ab2091db1279118c72167818567ce16831680c8f3e4ac43036b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0404',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=65,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=12282,
    end_offset=12317,
    text_slice='但凡要说时，必须先用清水香茶漱了口才可；设若失错，便要凿牙穿腮，等事。',
    hash='sha256:67f675768cd227378d86a39339dbe2f1e726a8d7fabb8b432798e29ca0fdeed1'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0405',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=65,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=12317,
    end_offset=12333,
    text_slice='其暴虐浮躁，顽劣憨痴，种种异常。',
    hash='sha256:8599e8dfc06ea99c211187dc5c47cea416d411bddf1ee078e8d99fd8db161761'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0406',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=65,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=12333,
    end_offset=12367,
    text_slice='只一放了学，进去见了那些女儿们，其温厚和平，聪敏文雅，竟又变了一个。',
    hash='sha256:a5f9a791dbc84e0e205ed217416f6447734a10e6d5d195ccdc07f811f8ce5992'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0407',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=65,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=12367,
    end_offset=12390,
    text_slice='因此，他令尊也曾下死笞楚过几次，无奈竟不能改。',
    hash='sha256:38a4bc86cced3f87ad0ed3bd5914d934da1d80ef1700b3a119503c90ed8ce0ed'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0408',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=65,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=12390,
    end_offset=12414,
    text_slice='每打的吃疼不过时，他便’姐姐‘’妹妹‘乱叫起来。',
    hash='sha256:586cb339972669e1f438e4504fd8805c7e56381030e16c431e946ef903a834b1'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0409',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=65,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=12414,
    end_offset=12442,
    text_slice='后来听得里面女儿们拿他取笑：’因何打急了只管叫姊妹作甚？',
    hash='sha256:95ea5c9de038f921bb7db0601efdfbf2ec3fad6f61f95a65fb2b02c76b74fbe6'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0410',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=65,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=12442,
    end_offset=12454,
    text_slice='莫不是求姐妹去说情讨饶？',
    hash='sha256:d4f1326536a5c5b5395e1fb7fb0d129a2da60ec5a7efab3e81a7d88c3d3576c6'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0411',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=65,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=12454,
    end_offset=12460,
    text_slice='你岂不愧些！',
    hash='sha256:87920776063cd47bb0b44bfbd22cfb757a72a7d0fffcf01d89bf21ea4c661b1e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0412',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=65,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=12460,
    end_offset=12469,
    text_slice='‘他回答的得最妙。',
    hash='sha256:c7ca0f75b688d9e6adeddc7655b58b58145fbe4f3680947be28cb76eb91f08dd'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0413',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=65,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=12469,
    end_offset=12534,
    text_slice='他说：’急疼之时，只叫‘姐姐’‘妹妹’字样，或可解疼也未可知，因叫了一声，便果觉不疼了，遂得了秘法：每疼痛之极，便连叫姐妹起来了。',
    hash='sha256:468e4138aa358d26730816fec6303f705c4471d2c4beaa3cef4a62f1947c2752'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0414',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=65,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=12534,
    end_offset=12543,
    text_slice='‘你说可笑不可笑？',
    hash='sha256:f6bc0917139e2488c948bc9ed830525e986bbfbc2cc6731883884fcca0b7bddd'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0415',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=65,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=12543,
    end_offset=12570,
    text_slice='也因祖母溺爱不明，每因孙辱师责子，因此我就辞了馆出来。',
    hash='sha256:daf32170a56a661996fcd264855c9b78b2631cc525d6f0177af60088020a3128'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0416',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=65,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=12570,
    end_offset=12584,
    text_slice='如今在巡盐御史林家做坐馆了。',
    hash='sha256:7b3c35a56a28d809a5d52b3bdc8c88699a14702b3ae4117877347781292d4400'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0417',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=65,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=12584,
    end_offset=12610,
    text_slice='你看，这等子弟，必不能守祖父之根基，从师长之规谏的。',
    hash='sha256:5e519accebdc2fc8b090f7a06cff7d43a2b08ed86d24779cb4cbeb9e48889b05'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0418',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=65,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=12610,
    end_offset=12625,
    text_slice='只可惜他家几个姊妹都是少有的。',
    hash='sha256:db7f6a2ba89bcec0da309d0e55f3b50c68a4ec7acee8958fa3d810360c4e2527'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0419',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=66,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=12628,
    end_offset=12632,
    text_slice='子兴道：',
    hash='sha256:7eb78380be993fca63ecb725b96048ca15b16c38aedda83984d64c5733682c88'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0420',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=66,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=12632,
    end_offset=12753,
    text_slice='“便是贾府中，现有的三个也不错。政老爹的长女，名元春，现因贤孝才德，选入宫作女史去了。二小姐乃赦老爹之妾所出，名迎春；三小姐乃政老爹之庶出，名探春。四小姐乃宁府珍爷之胞妹，名唤惜春。因史老夫人极爱孙女，都跟在祖母这边一处读书，听得个个不错。”',
    hash='sha256:8148a7241f710ebbb43574926cc5ef6bae7d0a9b2ec4595a2c35d38a7196ac4f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0421',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=66,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=12753,
    end_offset=12757,
    text_slice='雨村道：',
    hash='sha256:a9987f745f066fcafb0033381b00553509b51e3b23b1e13d3aaa9502b2dd926e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0422',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=66,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=12757,
    end_offset=12819,
    text_slice='“更妙在甄家的风俗，女儿之名，亦皆从男子之名命字，不似别家另外用这些‘春’‘红’‘香’‘玉’等艳字的。何得贾府亦乐此俗套？”',
    hash='sha256:479a8c41755097573fbb743ffc404d1f66d89baa18784704314b7db8a7a81da5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0423',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=66,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=12819,
    end_offset=12823,
    text_slice='子兴道：',
    hash='sha256:7eb78380be993fca63ecb725b96048ca15b16c38aedda83984d64c5733682c88'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0424',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=66,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=12823,
    end_offset=12924,
    text_slice='“不然。只因现今大小姐是正月初一日所生，故名元春，余者方从了‘春’字。上一辈的，却也是从兄弟而来的。现有对证：目今你贵东家林公之夫人，即荣府中赦、政二公之胞妹，在家时名唤贾敏。不信时，你回去细访可知。”',
    hash='sha256:a31aed377b49292a8dca32cc721a2ff27c34755e7daee9314a3848d1fc5e69fe'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0425',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=66,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=12924,
    end_offset=12931,
    text_slice='雨村拍案笑道：',
    hash='sha256:0dc525e25d0fb5e339e29f5d4f3bd8c7b6bad8b38c2cdbe372ce8c4b780cc9c5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0426',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=66,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=12931,
    end_offset=13062,
    text_slice='“怪道这女学生读至书，凡中有‘敏’字，她皆念作‘密’字，每每如是；写字遇着‘敏’字，又减一二笔，我心中就有些疑惑。今听你说的，是为此无疑矣！怪道我这女学生言语举止另是一样，不与近日女子相同。度其母必不凡，方得其女，今知为荣府之孙，又不足罕矣。可伤上月竟亡故了！”',
    hash='sha256:62cf7276da7e881065c51ea21c4dd4d2773d425e2f38e2f02ab1a3e308b71ed9'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0427',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=66,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=13062,
    end_offset=13067,
    text_slice='子兴叹道：',
    hash='sha256:3cd4410853606e8b607953135b547d2bdc75f69a988b747bbeaba5567f4b7654'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0428',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=66,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=13067,
    end_offset=13117,
    text_slice='“老姊妹四个，这一个是极小的，又没了；长一辈的姊妹，一个也没了！只看这小一辈的，将来之东床如何呢。”',
    hash='sha256:159160930bbcae3dfbf2ca9599442b2dbf210a9fc2a68a934b565c67cf09456c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0429',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=67,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=13119,
    end_offset=13123,
    text_slice='雨村道：',
    hash='sha256:a9987f745f066fcafb0033381b00553509b51e3b23b1e13d3aaa9502b2dd926e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0430',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=67,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=13123,
    end_offset=13166,
    text_slice='“正是。方才说这政公，已有了一个衔玉之儿，又有长子所遗一个弱孙。这赦老竟无一个不成？”',
    hash='sha256:99c984008e7266e3189eabf03dbb199067fb2c81956a932cd063bbc66e3c80cc'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0431',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=67,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=13166,
    end_offset=13170,
    text_slice='子兴道：',
    hash='sha256:7eb78380be993fca63ecb725b96048ca15b16c38aedda83984d64c5733682c88'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0432',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=67,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=13170,
    end_offset=13392,
    text_slice='“政公既有玉儿之后，其妾又生了一个，倒不知其好歹。只眼前现有二子一孙，却不知将来如何。若问那赦公，也有二子：长名贾琏，今已二十来往了，亲上作亲，娶的就是政老爹夫人王氏之内侄女，今已娶了二年。这位琏爷身上，现捐的是个同知，也是不肯读书，于世路上好机变言谈去的。所以如今只在乃叔政老爷家住着，帮着料理些家务。谁知自娶了他令夫人之后，倒上下无一人不称颂他夫人的，琏爷倒退了一射之地。说模样又极标致，言谈又极爽利，心机又极深细，竟是个男人万不及一的。”',
    hash='sha256:89bb3580f4365e40ff65a0d7b76b524d67d655153476011123834b786f39bae1'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0433',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=68,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=13394,
    end_offset=13402,
    text_slice='雨村听了，笑道：',
    hash='sha256:ef5ceb126274e5d8b70333884be325d41738aff4ce281f12adceef4828910d79'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0434',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=68,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=13402,
    end_offset=13445,
    text_slice='“可知我前言不谬。你我方才所说的这几个人，都只怕是那正邪两赋而来一路之人，未可知也。”',
    hash='sha256:b9ee462e5f2d62eb1b6018ec610bc0c96373e365589033b3d3dc3799afe269b9'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0435',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=68,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=13445,
    end_offset=13449,
    text_slice='子兴道：',
    hash='sha256:7eb78380be993fca63ecb725b96048ca15b16c38aedda83984d64c5733682c88'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0436',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=68,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=13449,
    end_offset=13477,
    text_slice='“邪也罢，正也罢，只顾算别人家的帐，你也吃一杯酒才好！”',
    hash='sha256:b542ac159616260f90a617a38fa7bef8df966546f3e1aff81d55403ab355c934'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0437',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=68,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=13477,
    end_offset=13481,
    text_slice='雨村道：',
    hash='sha256:a9987f745f066fcafb0033381b00553509b51e3b23b1e13d3aaa9502b2dd926e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0438',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=68,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=13481,
    end_offset=13498,
    text_slice='“正是，只顾说话，竟多吃了几杯。”',
    hash='sha256:9eb4b5ba210d3173b9280f159f7c5a5f1d93807a9fc8f70d24b46e0a3c106009'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0439',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=68,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=13498,
    end_offset=13503,
    text_slice='子兴笑道：',
    hash='sha256:964eb2d83c25996fba73dd0072a1f6384d29428be535ae2f8fa529ac4e53a019'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0440',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=68,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=13503,
    end_offset=13527,
    text_slice='“说着别人家的闲话，正好下酒，即多吃几杯何妨！”',
    hash='sha256:4bd700dc50e3f1361894724fd146fe675e1c8dfbfcb1e5fb6d3bf363c6adc2d4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0441',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=68,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=13527,
    end_offset=13535,
    text_slice='雨村向窗外看道：',
    hash='sha256:5ae645ba8440ddd78f2885c2fad2a16a4ad4364b00685bf76b20dbe88d79566a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0442',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=68,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=13535,
    end_offset=13562,
    text_slice='“天也晚了，仔细关了城！我们慢慢的进城再谈未为不可。”',
    hash='sha256:abd052b3b7161aad48ab2bfa9da559f944b915062db4ff0a968e5a6b8b865ff2'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0443',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=68,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=13562,
    end_offset=13574,
    text_slice='于是，二人起身算还酒帐。',
    hash='sha256:4184e796b1cc9df6c6ca1f3992edce8cdb770204d2a3d3fb89994333740a4648'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0444',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=68,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=13589,
    end_offset=13607,
    text_slice='“雨村兄，恭喜了！特来报个喜信的。”',
    hash='sha256:ef9b610cca93022b3a58dd347084c8bde239e47f37662b7988d21eb1432b18e2'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0445',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=68,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=13607,
    end_offset=13628,
    text_slice='雨村忙回头看时，要知是何人，且听下回分解。',
    hash='sha256:63be47ae4e59cf03d7366a2b2b10639ee8c22074fcfee183159560b3e80def33'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0446',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=69,
    segment_type='heading',
    start_offset=13630,
    end_offset=13652,
    text_slice='第三回  金陵城起复贾雨村\u3000荣国府收养林黛玉',
    hash='sha256:b465b5e19ce43f7e754dc5f33960360b63fdfa33dfacd0e78d286dcc12f16473'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0447',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=70,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=13654,
    end_offset=13686,
    text_slice='却说雨村忙回头看时，不是别人，乃是当日同僚一案参革的号张如圭者。',
    hash='sha256:32e7766b9225c730a6912c84814d720ceace3835dba7f3b97e8a1e040daf68b3'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0448',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=70,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=13686,
    end_offset=13735,
    text_slice='他本系此地人，革后家居，今打听得都中奏准起复旧员之信，他便四下里寻情找门路，忽遇见雨村，故忙道喜。',
    hash='sha256:6685ceea674fbf9d8e8e90b98e1d45fbf5832d19ed2b86bd1e0a288bad71e2bb'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0449',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=70,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=13735,
    end_offset=13776,
    text_slice='二人见了礼，张如圭便将此信告诉雨村，雨村自是欢喜，忙忙的叙了两句，遂作别各自回家。',
    hash='sha256:142fff3a33e5f0c52b19cd9cc1117abbf4c6a5baa7a6d356cb8cb274cca30360'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0450',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=70,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=13776,
    end_offset=13808,
    text_slice='冷子兴听得此言，便忙献计，令雨村央烦林如海，转向都中去央烦贾政。',
    hash='sha256:a73d06c0f9cdec50ec066f5be65614d4aef95fefdeba1fa2b2b34d0c97b0a1df'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0451',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=70,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=13808,
    end_offset=13830,
    text_slice='雨村领其意，作别回至馆中，忙寻邸报看真确了。',
    hash='sha256:0204b7fdf8ecdd1f63aa62b53d577622f1434db0b742636271e15c7e60d4eedf'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0452',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=71,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=13832,
    end_offset=13841,
    text_slice='次日，面谋之如海。',
    hash='sha256:ade9ecb4351baa9264be493014de32c2ef532e23ca2d2b3d8f834e27042c721d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0453',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=71,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=13845,
    end_offset=14000,
    text_slice='“天缘凑巧，因贱荆去世，都中家岳母念及小女无人依傍教育，前已遣了男女船只来接，因小女未曾大痊，故未及行。此刻正思，向蒙训教之恩，未经酬报，遇此机会，岂有不尽心图报之理！但请放心，弟已预为筹画至此，已修下荐书一封，转托内兄务为周全协佐，方可稍尽弟之鄙诚。即有所费用之例，弟于内兄信中已注明白，亦不劳尊兄多虑矣。”',
    hash='sha256:aa5b395531114692e130a82a7425578cf818b15f92a4efc7361d10e0c6f4c554'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0454',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=71,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=14000,
    end_offset=14017,
    text_slice='雨村一面打恭，谢不释口，一面又问：',
    hash='sha256:3987f0fdedc2a2d8d113d3ddb77c3d6d1e334fd32eefcdff4f37663ee20f6092'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0455',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=71,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=14017,
    end_offset=14046,
    text_slice='“不知令亲大人现居何职？只怕晚生草率，不敢骤然入都干渎。”',
    hash='sha256:aa34b82203b364100f9a222b8d8a138f7b367ee2b4ae9bbef8bcd1b1744ad520'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0456',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=71,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=14046,
    end_offset=14051,
    text_slice='如海笑道：',
    hash='sha256:cca2bcadf78731e17149f78f74561e3ef3a6bc4a54ae2ce804a446784ab4b5e5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0457',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=71,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=14051,
    end_offset=14161,
    text_slice='“若论舍亲，与尊兄犹系同谱，乃荣公之孙。大内兄现袭一等将军，名赦，字恩侯；二内兄名政，字存周，现任工部员外郎，其为人谦恭厚道，大有祖父遗风，非膏粱轻薄仕宦之流，故弟方致书烦托。否则，不但有污尊兄之清操，即弟亦不屑为矣。”',
    hash='sha256:535782f753c0ccc5edc9962a3d0bd19219f133462fd9e38bbb7f929104c777c6'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0458',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=71,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=14161,
    end_offset=14187,
    text_slice='雨村听了，心下方信了昨日子兴之言，于是又谢了林如海。',
    hash='sha256:ffac2ef8d1712fc938875a884f9d68b0d34662079178b41f81b23b1c2a57e0de'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0459',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=71,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=14192,
    end_offset=14221,
    text_slice='“已择了出月初二日，小女入都，尊兄即同路而往，岂不两便？”',
    hash='sha256:31440ad64ae7eacb57fa1d1e73da13666a6740edb0858dcd01988eeac51c1c2e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0460',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=71,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=14221,
    end_offset=14235,
    text_slice='雨村唯唯听命，心中十分得意。',
    hash='sha256:ace68db3e9e3d63f3e378b35d9cef84371787269d555c95538abbc64c3c6c62f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0461',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=71,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=14235,
    end_offset=14255,
    text_slice='如海遂打点礼物并饯行之事，雨村一一领了。',
    hash='sha256:9361441f7e5ddf969231265e47283a04c37743983dcce237acada7df529c332a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0462',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=72,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=14257,
    end_offset=14362,
    text_slice='那女学生黛玉身体方愈，原不忍弃父而往；无奈她外祖母致意务去，且兼如海说：“汝父年将半百，再无续室之意；且汝多病，年又极小，上无亲母教养，下无姊妹兄弟扶持，今依傍外祖母及舅氏姊妹去，正好减我顾盼之忧，何反云不往？',
    hash='sha256:564d2b59e24310df1cc56199829599ce2cdfaeffb92b796883b88000aa4eed7a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0463',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=72,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=14362,
    end_offset=14392,
    text_slice='”黛玉听了，方洒泪拜别，遂同奶娘及荣府中几个老妇人登舟而去。',
    hash='sha256:3a96c8cd2c61ded2f8ad320980dbfc5acea0b397746d516b678c0b6babb274b8'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0464',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=72,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=14392,
    end_offset=14413,
    text_slice='雨村另有一只船，带两个小童，依附黛玉而行。',
    hash='sha256:57b3ef0688e0c8c8ff4c9ccef2438916209e86041eb4a6a62a47d28e4e12fa4b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0465',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=73,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=14415,
    end_offset=14457,
    text_slice='有日，到了都中，进入神京，雨村先整了衣冠，带了小童，拿着宗侄的名帖，至荣府门前投了。',
    hash='sha256:69b86074aca1dee2040ccd94bb15f1cf2117fc0a9c33224e9d6f52b440c61cea'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0466',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=73,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=14457,
    end_offset=14476,
    text_slice='彼时贾政已看了妹丈之书，即忙请入相会。',
    hash='sha256:7538e6e498fb529d15a2daf160a78eca2edff4ba4f5e9cfca0709894ac57b348'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0467',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=73,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=14476,
    end_offset=14543,
    text_slice='见雨村相貌魁伟，言语不俗，且这贾政最喜读书人，礼贤下士，拯弱扶济危，大有祖风；况又系妹丈致意，因此优待雨村，更又不同，便竭力内中协助。',
    hash='sha256:5a729d8ec774a134c6ae70ff6e3b9e4961448e5aa7f3a20bdea1b754a0e0d191'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0468',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=73,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=14543,
    end_offset=14559,
    text_slice='题奏之日，轻轻谋了一个复职候缺。',
    hash='sha256:52e29e31ee9a1b6be35313ccc9eed429766a2aa2a4d5c979139ec6c532a9f8eb'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0469',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=73,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=14559,
    end_offset=14593,
    text_slice='不上两个月，金陵应天府缺出，便谋补了此缺，拜辞了贾政，择日上任去了。',
    hash='sha256:e9cb26b31afc8c4f5aebd85633d19828855d88a652ae6e4e93a22b42f3cd0537'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0470',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=73,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=14593,
    end_offset=14598,
    text_slice='不在话下。',
    hash='sha256:d6924045c03a7abb9192b67f99836b2b60d6a8226f1a7795692af7265875d4c7'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0471',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=74,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=14600,
    end_offset=14634,
    text_slice='且说黛玉自那日弃舟登岸时，便有荣国府打发了轿子并拉行李的车辆久候了。',
    hash='sha256:dbb372e4508326cb57e4459b4f0c379c57e146541b15b2fad69caeea9c397d6a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0472',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=74,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=14634,
    end_offset=14657,
    text_slice='这林黛玉常听得母亲说过，她外祖母家与别家不同。',
    hash='sha256:d8358b7587202bdd59274222348e96bd56ab5859910c5a4521c96eea8c0d9928'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0473',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=74,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=14657,
    end_offset=14684,
    text_slice='她近日所见的这几个三等仆妇，已是不凡了，何况今至其家。',
    hash='sha256:2e4239cfa1c820256d2649aed4759491f57366bd0f8dfdfc62158747a910c0f4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0474',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=74,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=14684,
    end_offset=14722,
    text_slice='因此步步留心，时时在意，不肯轻易多说一句话，多行一步路，生恐被人耻笑了她去。',
    hash='sha256:a1a418a40bcfa216ff3f1add78f71f2721b8afe3ed0d03d0a0f6cb53585b682b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0475',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=74,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=14722,
    end_offset=14761,
    text_slice='自上了轿，进入城中从纱窗向外瞧了一瞧，其街市之繁华，人烟之阜盛，自与别处不同。',
    hash='sha256:a2099531ac638dd414a55d3e309cc2ffd88e7e8f8278d643ddf33e7fb12b1005'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0476',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=74,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=14761,
    end_offset=14802,
    text_slice='又行了半日，忽见街北蹲着两个大石狮子，三间兽头大门，门前列坐着十来个华冠丽服之人。',
    hash='sha256:98d5c37a3e2e0e7c9c563db0c2de05aec48c1a79d2735191e622d01449f25e6b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0477',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=74,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=14802,
    end_offset=14820,
    text_slice='正门却不开，只有东西两角门有人出入。',
    hash='sha256:d8772d060a82981d45e65a42b65371ef7ac9dc91074f8e88da712545627d9686'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0478',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=74,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=14833,
    end_offset=14840,
    text_slice='“敕造宁国府”',
    hash='sha256:09a4e3e6cb17f373bbedb69fd2758a2ad81c9e09463d37e46c1b2e5a1b3c9d12'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0479',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=74,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=14840,
    end_offset=14845,
    text_slice='五个大字。',
    hash='sha256:ee17b84663ecada871599883eaaef0951275c0e69b7c56e6404665228cbb3873'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0480',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=74,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=14845,
    end_offset=14860,
    text_slice='黛玉想道：这是外祖母之长房了。',
    hash='sha256:45898927bf8dfe91b7de8251344195ba4bff153692fa6b60e340ce0dfc133f9e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0481',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=74,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=14860,
    end_offset=14888,
    text_slice='想着，又往西行，不多远，照样也是三间大门，方是荣国府了。',
    hash='sha256:b4e4b7c8bd29b98872ad4f3fcec3f2d7c7d741b61de59b46694fb06c1518bc06'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0482',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=74,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=14888,
    end_offset=14902,
    text_slice='却不进正门，只进了西边角门。',
    hash='sha256:fe22aabe83323bf8a551e7743d5e103877e8528007a06a5b80a0aa83f79a0a49'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0483',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=74,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=14902,
    end_offset=14930,
    text_slice='那轿夫抬进去，走了一射之地，将转弯时，便歇下，退出去了。',
    hash='sha256:6350776f50f5aa8c4ccdbf9bf49bf0844ba50491f5cf0aa01330c64e6e14b48a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0484',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=74,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=14930,
    end_offset=14947,
    text_slice='后面的婆子们已都下了轿，赶上前来。',
    hash='sha256:c707ea047c3fa35ec92969441f636538e1ac2bc22fa4c55b3424dafea9c202e8'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0485',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=74,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=14947,
    end_offset=14990,
    text_slice='另换了三四个衣帽周全十七八岁的小厮上来，复抬起轿子，众婆子步下围随，至一垂花门前落下。',
    hash='sha256:19f6b9f1a83a66ab9b5a0d496f0cc6fbcfff023db2529b982ea40f218b4122eb'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0486',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=74,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=14990,
    end_offset=15012,
    text_slice='众小厮退出，众婆子上来打起轿帘，扶黛玉下轿。',
    hash='sha256:3682e07081e40685bf5ff7d9394526cf6bb6a4b7648626b9b7945f185abc513c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0487',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=74,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=15012,
    end_offset=15060,
    text_slice='林黛玉扶着婆子的手，进了垂花门，两边是抄手游廊，当中是穿堂，当地放着一个紫檀架子大理石的大插屏。',
    hash='sha256:81337b7a09c390e54bdba0418703036e6758111dcb018093b8eb305f321de3b7'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0488',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=74,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=15060,
    end_offset=15083,
    text_slice='转过插屏，小小三间厅，厅后就是后面的正房大院。',
    hash='sha256:10e0e93c4e96f69076f19be84713c04f2ba787723a6bb93df416232345710fb4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0489',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=74,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=15083,
    end_offset=15097,
    text_slice='正面五间上房，皆是雕梁画栋。',
    hash='sha256:3fc6fce063ca109666bdc7dca3b534e7fef3944583325624c35bdbe4d825ef3c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0490',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=74,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=15097,
    end_offset=15119,
    text_slice='两边穿山游廊厢房，挂着各色鹦鹉、画眉等鸟雀。',
    hash='sha256:34a9bb8988cbb65336a5f276937c4fded9312b06c2a01a39e702486fba604490'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0491',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=74,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=15154,
    end_offset=15171,
    text_slice='“刚才老太太还念呢，可巧就来了。”',
    hash='sha256:fde54a7d1af4c1a476711d0955ab5831ba79a179b0ce8122ba8b77861b62b0b5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0492',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=74,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=15171,
    end_offset=15191,
    text_slice='于是三四人争着打起帘笼，一面听得人回话：',
    hash='sha256:e8b9c856103f532c25b0a13651a6e06db475f2ac5b5640bbc982a73ed81ff4d5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0493',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=74,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=15191,
    end_offset=15199,
    text_slice='“林姑娘到了！”',
    hash='sha256:c97f0719065c45ebef7261cc5d229c37ff83a2f201775ffb3605b7bf61e77083'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0494',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=75,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=15201,
    end_offset=15239,
    text_slice='黛玉方进入房时，只见两个人搀着一位鬓发如银的老母迎上来，黛玉便知是她外祖母。',
    hash='sha256:3a098624da0dd7c9b93bf7c8007196b89835b074bc1863908f9393874e52e1e3'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0495',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=75,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=15258,
    end_offset=15264,
    text_slice='“心肝儿肉”',
    hash='sha256:87ff155a500ad243bed23df95d9f6717d3a136b07a6bca6a264a7791067ccc0c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0496',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=75,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=15264,
    end_offset=15271,
    text_slice='叫着大哭起来。',
    hash='sha256:0db0268d3380f51c5587a7a40ba7adb324695e9247f7fae1954a8598e7c36e0f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0497',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=75,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=15271,
    end_offset=15295,
    text_slice='当下地下侍立之人，无不掩面涕泣，黛玉也哭个不住。',
    hash='sha256:359e3e063530dd4c4c259f1bcf2fbcd719ae9ef94236e95f14afc36aa1d0bf9e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0498',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=75,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=15295,
    end_offset=15317,
    text_slice='一时众人慢慢的解劝住了，黛玉方拜见了外祖母。',
    hash='sha256:78bdced48ff2a6ddda15bb32eb9bc9b9d51ab518627fba350422aeac571d2cfd'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0499',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=75,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=15317,
    end_offset=15340,
    text_slice='--此即冷子兴所云之史太君也，贾赦、贾政之母。',
    hash='sha256:caa4f9aa86b3bb558330184de10d703f43d9c8ba5f3ce9b727c31b96d106efd5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0500',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=75,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=15351,
    end_offset=15382,
    text_slice='“这是你大舅母；这是你二舅母；这是你先珠大哥的媳妇珠大嫂子。”',
    hash='sha256:4b8b5223a92eb8aeda666925d606a06b66920cb3d9bf8f63d30c54fc0bfd6c48'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0501',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=75,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=15382,
    end_offset=15390,
    text_slice='黛玉一一拜见过。',
    hash='sha256:5c1645d61351fa4d1437cbdb8e1e86a9e0483091fca198a562d7ff16b3bddaad'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0502',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=75,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=15395,
    end_offset=15419,
    text_slice='“请姑娘们来。今日远客才来，可以不必上学去了。”',
    hash='sha256:0640eb0db982fae81ac330e835aed670c5f51158c75b61b037115724dadf4424'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0503',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=75,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=15419,
    end_offset=15433,
    text_slice='众人答应了一声，便去了两个。',
    hash='sha256:3922d7d9083a76a18de2e779233ead919c6fa5bfe64f8152078d15091ff3a488'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0504',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=76,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=15435,
    end_offset=15463,
    text_slice='不一时，只见三个奶嬷嬷并五六个丫鬟，簇拥着三个姊妹来了。',
    hash='sha256:fe4501e58e99908bb028fccf6931853f0fa7f9312975aabe46efe606703cf59a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0505',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=76,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=15463,
    end_offset=15496,
    text_slice='第一个肌肤微丰，合中身材，腮凝新荔，鼻腻鹅脂，温柔沉默，观之可亲。',
    hash='sha256:9465a1dbd884593c8ea575a0e2aee93da11279cc6ecc1b8814b5ea85639f8963'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0506',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=76,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=15496,
    end_offset=15534,
    text_slice='第二个削肩细腰，长挑身材，鸭蛋脸面，俊眼修眉，顾盼神飞，文彩精华，见之忘俗。',
    hash='sha256:f136f7f3d4a24c1754a8d8ac0f8c13bfef8a9a363321839e14702ff92b9d1206'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0507',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=76,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=15534,
    end_offset=15547,
    text_slice='第三个身量未足，形容尚小。',
    hash='sha256:e2150c973b713860d5a38f15ce1e2eaf08bd80191b3e5f2cac278d058fcce01b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0508',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=76,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=15547,
    end_offset=15563,
    text_slice='其钗环裙袄，三人皆是一样的妆饰。',
    hash='sha256:74e87cb55e1a75bff6b60dbe4ebc743d1d9cb67fbd687426bcb062d6b3ebf94b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0509',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=76,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=15563,
    end_offset=15585,
    text_slice='黛玉忙起身迎上来见礼，互相厮认过，大家归坐。',
    hash='sha256:b5deca733ffbd0f5af06c48b8cae60af72d99adf69a84366d692de1f5c71d480'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0510',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=76,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=15585,
    end_offset=15593,
    text_slice='丫鬟们斟上茶来。',
    hash='sha256:7c3dd24dec0889b48208c4904454b6cf48a4b07de8d0d03855ac2ba677f42a5e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0511',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=76,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=15593,
    end_offset=15620,
    text_slice='不过说些黛玉之母如何得病，如何请医服药，如何送死发丧。',
    hash='sha256:99a05d469b9876e4475ba09a18ef42afa063d55c621bd62347ca510b986422e9'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0512',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=76,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=15620,
    end_offset=15678,
    text_slice='不免贾母又伤感起来，因说：“我这些儿女，所疼者独有你母亲，今日一旦先舍我去了，连面也不能一见，今见了你，我怎不伤心！',
    hash='sha256:f66fa64f4ea846ab607ce55dcc3bd36b7b6d83a1b9c4a9730c215ff1a56c14d9'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0513',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=76,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=15678,
    end_offset=15695,
    text_slice='”说着，搂了黛玉在怀，又呜咽起来。',
    hash='sha256:d9ebb04ef0bd8606fc8548c10179c5032a89640b0971ad143d4ba6fb382d0d8b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0514',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=76,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=15695,
    end_offset=15710,
    text_slice='众人忙都宽慰解释，方略略止住。',
    hash='sha256:af93291139d7097f4f30c1fafc477573fa3e754894ec655529d694b46028c68d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0515',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=77,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=15712,
    end_offset=15761,
    text_slice='众人见黛玉年貌虽小，其举止言谈不俗，身体面庞虽怯弱不胜，却有一段自然的风流态度，便知她有不足之症。',
    hash='sha256:9a1de445bbb8a871373147317069a8875243564cbdf83a946d81a193ab6ee1b0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0516',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=77,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=15764,
    end_offset=15779,
    text_slice='“常服何药，如何不急为疗治？”',
    hash='sha256:1fb9d1511cfdc7553effd437ce52db91fd8bfce7f7d5756dfebdf7af076a7688'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0517',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=77,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=15779,
    end_offset=15783,
    text_slice='黛玉道：',
    hash='sha256:e1608e3669e13bd2ad429b5caf8a6374d9c98e7e77047fb494ca22f634cf5d6f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0518',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=77,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=15783,
    end_offset=15964,
    text_slice='“我自来是如此，从会吃饮食时便吃药，到今日未断；请了多少名医修方配药，皆不见效。那一年我才三岁时，听得说来了一个癞头和尚，说要化我去出家，我父母固是不从。他又说：‘既舍不得她，只怕她的病一生也不能好的。若要好时，除非从此以后总不许见哭声；除父母之外，凡有外姓亲友之人，一概不见，方可平安了此一世。’疯疯癫癫，说了这些不经之谈，也没人理他。如今还是吃人参养荣丸。”',
    hash='sha256:7a2cdde052949f9f60af0114aaa8d7f59502c6225c84cc6d489502c50c1fe377'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0519',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=77,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=15964,
    end_offset=15968,
    text_slice='贾母道：',
    hash='sha256:594e2bd952e224e191cc95f01fe230c15ec56f9f062d20f5865dde07957f71b6'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0520',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=77,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=15968,
    end_offset=15993,
    text_slice='“正好，我这里正配丸药呢。叫他们多配一料就是了。”',
    hash='sha256:c04397477bfc2abafedb778374a2e387a1a5843d41ba69966801fb61af67aa9c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0521',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=78,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=15995,
    end_offset=16011,
    text_slice='一语未了，只听后院中有人笑声说：',
    hash='sha256:87cef5dcf8c1e3cefcd9947cb7701ac41931d3a1cbed58afe2d020469dbef69a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0522',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=78,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=16011,
    end_offset=16025,
    text_slice='“我来迟了，不曾迎接远客！”',
    hash='sha256:47077e462f3669b03e70219cab6d9d1e89cde1944251a525d73aa58d696f9dce'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0523',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=78,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=16025,
    end_offset=16031,
    text_slice='黛玉纳罕道：',
    hash='sha256:ba0c3623223a1e250aa42256f54378ffe900c9a20790789b664a20a991dcff72'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0524',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=78,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=16031,
    end_offset=16064,
    text_slice='“这些人个个皆敛声屏气，恭肃严整如此，这来者系谁，这样放诞无礼？”',
    hash='sha256:76ce621a6807d12b59e27d589e57dd651865d39181aefa4b6f63ae1fc9d749c2'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0525',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=78,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=16064,
    end_offset=16092,
    text_slice='心下想时，只见一群媳妇、丫鬟围拥着一个人，从后房门进来。',
    hash='sha256:81fbf6dad7ecbcfda48b7c187eec7cfc8faad4dc2e9d9df35a9a3858f9f61a5b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0526',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=78,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=16092,
    end_offset=16207,
    text_slice='这个人打扮与众姊妹不同，彩绣辉煌，恍若神妃仙子：头上戴着金丝八宝攒珠髻，绾着朝阳五凤挂珠钗；项上戴着赤金盘螭璎珞圈；裙边系着豆绿宫条、双衡比目玫瑰佩；身上穿著缕金百蝶穿花大红洋缎窄褙袄，外罩五彩刻丝石青银鼠褂；下着翡翠撒花洋绉裙。',
    hash='sha256:402800145759a262454a4c288a09154f07568ae770ac870adca4d8362663634a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0527',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=78,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=16207,
    end_offset=16249,
    text_slice='一双丹凤三角眼，两弯柳叶吊梢眉；身量苗条，体格风骚；粉面含春威不露，丹唇未启笑先闻。',
    hash='sha256:eecacaddb1d4798151c379daf2c8d56ac79f7e13f6e80f268357c4c73b708cf3'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0528',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=78,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=16249,
    end_offset=16258,
    text_slice='黛玉连忙起身接见。',
    hash='sha256:f86f44f643810e67ae2f46196d29c331f2f4f46b2e937adecab663c278f73086'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0529',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=78,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=16263,
    end_offset=16312,
    text_slice='“你不认得她，她是我们这里有名的一个泼皮破落户儿，南省俗谓作‘辣子’，你只叫他她‘凤辣子’就是。”',
    hash='sha256:df0c5d9fd7d40e262e0f689b7fb6abdbb0e18e02079abfaffff76dbcd89108c2'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0530',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=78,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=16312,
    end_offset=16334,
    text_slice='黛玉正不知以何称呼，只见众姊妹都忙告诉她道：',
    hash='sha256:717dc1ad6a0d8d69b89a576f84eda9375fa971d58faefe05035f10697f5a2ebd'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0531',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=78,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=16334,
    end_offset=16342,
    text_slice='“这是琏嫂子。”',
    hash='sha256:4f610327c541227a2261c5124d1032762bb1331e0791bbb372909fc37cc48c90'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0532',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=78,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=16342,
    end_offset=16397,
    text_slice='黛玉虽不识，也曾听见母亲说过，大舅贾赦之子贾琏，娶的就是二舅母王氏之内侄女，自幼假充男儿教养的，学名叫王熙凤。',
    hash='sha256:132118d39565ee0b85a6c6e683506e77e0e1f611a17daa46d4d3177819f70178'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0533',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=78,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=16406,
    end_offset=16409,
    text_slice='“嫂”',
    hash='sha256:56e6294560eda0b263722c919f13ed2c04d5d03bcf6674be11311782d495d9a2'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0534',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=78,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=16409,
    end_offset=16412,
    text_slice='呼之。',
    hash='sha256:9b81cd25864f7d1c64a819b33a0c57915e03d346ec55ef34ab271c947e204e41'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0535',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=78,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=16447,
    end_offset=16538,
    text_slice='“天下真有这样标致人物，我今儿才算见了！况且这通身的气派，竟不象老祖宗的外孙女儿，竟是个嫡亲的孙女，怨不得老祖宗天天口头心头，一时不忘。只可怜我这妹妹这样命苦，怎么姑妈偏就去世了！”',
    hash='sha256:3f00f72a4371832a19261f4d16edce5bdf2b207aa326e7b270c9893d2c723133'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0536',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=78,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=16538,
    end_offset=16547,
    text_slice='说着，便用帕拭泪。',
    hash='sha256:858e45335ae180c4343edb37b5aeb76c377c1f81c022ac5d728dbe1bcecc4d51'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0537',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=78,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=16552,
    end_offset=16591,
    text_slice='“我才好了，你倒来招我！你妹妹远路才来，身子又弱，也才劝住了，快再休提前话！”',
    hash='sha256:affc553d06f5661e50733254cc0b59a4fe632eded115bc82da19ddd69f721377'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0538',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=78,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=16591,
    end_offset=16604,
    text_slice='这熙凤听了，忙转悲为喜道：',
    hash='sha256:96ebf756809d3750ca6b95a54bd37fac832c44ec6bd8ef18f17f3bc526a67def'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0539',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=78,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=16604,
    end_offset=16650,
    text_slice='“正是呢！我一见了妹妹，一心都在他身上了，又是喜欢，又是伤心，竟忘记了老祖宗。该打，该打！”',
    hash='sha256:fbcf7e87c699cb0a0537a71d93cf3c88a36c5d60bb2ee1fe6195fa5690a7897b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0540',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=78,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=16650,
    end_offset=16660,
    text_slice='又忙携黛玉之手，问：',
    hash='sha256:9ec40609b749174d9042de5fb01860a19916cfc92c073d9ed063a0c5793d2360'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0541',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=78,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=16660,
    end_offset=16722,
    text_slice='“妹妹几岁了？可也上过学？现吃什么药？在这里不要想家，想要什么吃的，什么玩的，只管告诉我；丫头老婆们不好了，也只管告诉我。”',
    hash='sha256:77c7761c5636c6096a159fe65b1f4e165a425172e25bd97dd7e882a739e1c469'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0542',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=78,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=16722,
    end_offset=16730,
    text_slice='一面又问婆子们：',
    hash='sha256:129534e34cf9b1deaf4bc226073cca191067dc6a59db468d96dcb7d5353cef29'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0543',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=78,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=16730,
    end_offset=16771,
    text_slice='“林姑娘的行李东西可搬进来了？带了几个人来？你们赶早打扫两间下房，让她们去歇歇。”',
    hash='sha256:d57e444120550490c39b229d6014407d02b9da0e7cc7926186511bfa5427bff7'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0544',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=79,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=16773,
    end_offset=16785,
    text_slice='说话时，已摆了茶果上来。',
    hash='sha256:c74d39202d480fbdf10f9c5004f19bd6eab4f75e1ca4368d815090887454ad42'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0545',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=79,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=16785,
    end_offset=16794,
    text_slice='熙凤亲为捧茶捧果。',
    hash='sha256:efe6741a8c22858e1f18077f3b1ff9e3dbb0d2411730d27a49aa5f43af5709c8'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0546',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=79,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=16802,
    end_offset=16812,
    text_slice='“月钱放完了不曾？”',
    hash='sha256:da27d019ec7953d1073f8394c944aae868f7db8817d37cc14f030534c52c43a3'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0547',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=79,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=16812,
    end_offset=16816,
    text_slice='熙凤道：',
    hash='sha256:63b5a185590be99b0824aa3af8eca43394932ce23c3ec0cac2956b0406e0f70d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0548',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=79,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=16816,
    end_offset=16867,
    text_slice='“月钱已放完了。刚才带着人到后楼上找缎子，找了这半日，也并没有见昨日太太说的那样的，想是太太记错了？”',
    hash='sha256:ec2d50652ae9ffdbef4675cb512519252eb116ffec9de59d4da70599a8d5c22b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0549',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=79,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=16867,
    end_offset=16872,
    text_slice='王夫人道：',
    hash='sha256:1766c1bd9af9766fe93dc7cb49104279844445c6b1a45c4facc18ec8c32aa79a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0550',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=79,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=16872,
    end_offset=16883,
    text_slice='“有没有，什么要紧。”',
    hash='sha256:befd06af8eb2ffcf1db13a50dcd416bfb66f631c82fdf37fe1f0c832cb5f3b2b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0551',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=79,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=16883,
    end_offset=16888,
    text_slice='因又说道：',
    hash='sha256:8fe4adbb880970702f65e713c5d7ea13c3e86d118ba6b7dd7076d527b6ef3f3a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0552',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=79,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=16888,
    end_offset=16927,
    text_slice='“该随手拿出两个来，给你这妹妹去裁衣裳的，等晚上想着叫人再去拿罢，可别忘了！”',
    hash='sha256:3d0c34252156da7b421fe3ba40c7a3f88da3f04e299af4286cc1f0ddea0ccb2b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0553',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=79,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=16927,
    end_offset=16931,
    text_slice='熙凤道：',
    hash='sha256:63b5a185590be99b0824aa3af8eca43394932ce23c3ec0cac2956b0406e0f70d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0554',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=79,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=16931,
    end_offset=16973,
    text_slice='“这倒是我先料着了，知道妹妹不过这两日到的，我已预备下了，等太太回去过了目好送来。”',
    hash='sha256:05b11fb13b30c11e62c5b6d9e5458e4fe3f939c09ecdbd549fbba5ae19421888'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0555',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=79,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=16973,
    end_offset=16984,
    text_slice='王夫人一笑，点头不语。',
    hash='sha256:585185ce72acb76a1c69627cbcaea332760faf698374a9c1bfd8b4eab14f6d42'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0556',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=80,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=16986,
    end_offset=17012,
    text_slice='当下茶果已撤，贾母命两个老嬷嬷带了黛玉去见两个母舅。',
    hash='sha256:8c7efe01d6d5c38163f96ff767a978a9c718fb822d2af55e4d489a5043cab97d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0557',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=80,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=17029,
    end_offset=17045,
    text_slice='“我带了外甥女过去，倒也便宜。”',
    hash='sha256:0dd938d2e14ac294302c1042f8314db3d2305fc98df6ddf6b1dfc71f1c14e5e5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0558',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=80,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=17045,
    end_offset=17050,
    text_slice='贾母笑道：',
    hash='sha256:b2e3b8dcd63b5176d618845f4088f0bcc7794c37c226715453d5e21c5fb07f5c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0559',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=80,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=17050,
    end_offset=17067,
    text_slice='“正是呢，你也去罢！不必过来了。”',
    hash='sha256:48045689d14f88fd9fb31049262155dbd483f6108bdd87dbd481db57b156a210'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0560',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=80,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=17067,
    end_offset=17075,
    text_slice='邢夫人答应了一个',
    hash='sha256:a98aa2b3acafaa5e2b2665e94629559e120add19073310c6e04b141e564547da'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0561',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=80,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=17075,
    end_offset=17078,
    text_slice='“是”',
    hash='sha256:090f2ef0ebb5d24d8be084e110276dd49b63d06614f8a3a608a389ef81728909'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0562',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=80,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=17078,
    end_offset=17100,
    text_slice='字，遂带了黛玉与王夫人作辞，大家送至穿堂前。',
    hash='sha256:57443984b2e8ffb508881492357b349799b94d5a29ff0378f3fae4751a901c9f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0563',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=80,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=17100,
    end_offset=17122,
    text_slice='出了垂花门，早有众小厮们拉过一辆翠幄青紬车。',
    hash='sha256:aefc3bf4267b7d18e1f7a1dee3b5787ca8c43661b80e7553a26d14711ab44568'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0564',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=80,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=17122,
    end_offset=17193,
    text_slice='邢夫人携了黛玉坐上，众婆子们放下车帘，方命小厮们抬起，拉至宽处，方驾上驯骡，亦出了西角门，往东过荣府正门，便入一黑油大门中，至仪门前，方下来。',
    hash='sha256:1859f297a56a0a6be1957d5de644438504c6e16c567cef604f75f732da52ce62'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0565',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=80,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=17193,
    end_offset=17220,
    text_slice='众小厮退出，方打起车帘，邢夫人搀了黛玉的手，进入院中。',
    hash='sha256:578174221a1d860292f155fa4f7f94c096cccd8cb825c1fdc6fbf7af57a265e2'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0566',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=80,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=17220,
    end_offset=17242,
    text_slice='黛玉度其房屋院宇，必是荣府中花园隔断过来的。',
    hash='sha256:7a278284f2ac3710ecfd756c5e7944eea68b2bd0b56c8adaf630daa9bc71ffa4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0567',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=80,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=17242,
    end_offset=17289,
    text_slice='进入三层仪门，果见正房厢庑游廊，悉皆小巧别致，不似方才那边轩峻壮丽；且院中随处之树木山石皆有。',
    hash='sha256:ce9cea963e802dab63014673cc421271a07b940812148ecdb167b11ae4c37dc9'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0568',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=80,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=17289,
    end_offset=17312,
    text_slice='一时进入正室，早有许多盛妆丽服之姬妾丫鬟迎着。',
    hash='sha256:3e1e2277eeff33e66c4b6039a042d8bff6e56ff090a0b9fb1b12572dd4ca2707'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0569',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=80,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=17312,
    end_offset=17335,
    text_slice='邢夫人让黛玉坐了，一面命人到外面书房中请贾赦。',
    hash='sha256:14cfe1e3df3898824e64c1b29fd3288618c18fdf111e4e1e445e390811672fd3'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0570',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=80,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=17343,
    end_offset=17442,
    text_slice='“老爷说了：‘连日身上不好，见了姑娘彼此倒伤心，暂且不忍相见。劝姑娘不要伤心想家，跟着老太太和舅母，即同家里一样。姊妹们虽拙，大家一处伴着，亦可以解些烦闷。或有委屈之处，只管说得，不要外道才是。’”',
    hash='sha256:bfc7f5ba27734b8b839895b5c2ff6861bd6b32f8da61793ad28f5f65cf397eb2'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0571',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=80,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=17442,
    end_offset=17454,
    text_slice='黛玉忙站起来，一一听了。',
    hash='sha256:e2e2d19b0e44913ab1933f50c1b5d97afefeaa473ae829fc58e5eb79d191cbee'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0572',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=80,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=17454,
    end_offset=17463,
    text_slice='再坐一刻，便告辞。',
    hash='sha256:391dd0b8bf330b1b134d0cade1b5f7c44da7be727fb05b2a3a0fdd5b5a4c2fb3'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0573',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=80,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=17463,
    end_offset=17474,
    text_slice='邢夫人苦留吃过晚饭去。',
    hash='sha256:d13297d681e1014241c166cd5ea5deaf84bef9c82dac10e6baa5b40c2235d382'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0574',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=80,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=17480,
    end_offset=17530,
    text_slice='“舅母爱惜赐饭，原不应辞，只是还要过去拜见二舅舅，恐领了赐去不恭，异日再领，未为不可。望舅母容谅！”',
    hash='sha256:fff98673ed1e694471afbf9c6f57c657d5af8576a596eaeab6bce81fd50d08b5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0575',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=80,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=17530,
    end_offset=17539,
    text_slice='邢夫人听说，笑道：',
    hash='sha256:262007c4a7b06d24fb3eb78abfde073fef66a3377b79feb9f55dea53f7d2c4a3'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0576',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=80,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=17539,
    end_offset=17546,
    text_slice='“这倒是了。”',
    hash='sha256:6a4ccee7e2fba0971c39c095cec539d7cbcebe77f50355575c748422e14894e5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0577',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=80,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=17546,
    end_offset=17565,
    text_slice='遂令两三个嬷嬷用方才的车好生送了过去。',
    hash='sha256:c37f368c777b4836706274496dc62763fdccda6227f3e874b16589e645ebe9ed'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0578',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=80,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=17565,
    end_offset=17572,
    text_slice='于是黛玉告辞。',
    hash='sha256:4f154ba9681b7533e8a6a5e25de26a2632b07f1fdc38d955743f70c6806c2c50'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0579',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=80,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=17572,
    end_offset=17601,
    text_slice='邢夫人送至仪门前，又嘱咐了众人几句，眼看着车去了，方回来。',
    hash='sha256:df53e9114fbafd5dfcd2a0ac49ef6e3144ab3844f8ad87d290508883bd089e65'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0580',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=81,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=17603,
    end_offset=17616,
    text_slice='一时黛玉进了荣府，下了车。',
    hash='sha256:afecde15cb2a67c14b6546d4b92a358efa43fa207b416f5b30202ba81b3797ea'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0581',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=81,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=17616,
    end_offset=17688,
    text_slice='众嬷嬷引着，便往东转弯，穿过一个东西的穿堂，向南大厅之后，仪门内大院落，上面五间大正房，两边厢房鹿顶耳房钻山，四通八达，轩昂壮丽，比贾母处不同。',
    hash='sha256:17aac66147d04271ef3063648104a00a99435bc5663216f15c5b2ff83c686af5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0582',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=81,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=17688,
    end_offset=17714,
    text_slice='黛玉便知这方是正经正内室，一条大甬路，直接出大门的。',
    hash='sha256:86ed1c8e707f5ec9e156267618fa2c99f427f11bcffd1faf1855da8ef6ba8151'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0583',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=81,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=17751,
    end_offset=17756,
    text_slice='“荣禧堂”',
    hash='sha256:3df16bc58c851a0023a089ac3ec595b5ed3d8350cf4aeb9cf2b7f8bfad5249cd'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0584',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=81,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=17756,
    end_offset=17764,
    text_slice='，后有一行小字：',
    hash='sha256:0f4680aa2b07ba1b6bca3435f1c9f8d0c384ab5f46becb44e7f67f4e9fdad959'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0585',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=81,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=17764,
    end_offset=17777,
    text_slice='“某年月日书赐荣国公贾源”',
    hash='sha256:ecd83c2cf685d1fe8d2eea7c98e0dac1bb46efd13f19666c6f90c122a027c3f0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0586',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=81,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=17777,
    end_offset=17780,
    text_slice='，又有',
    hash='sha256:e647b730e753d84acd98f0491b6817c297b67de1d8a1edcd5c09fc2660bd8a16'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0587',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=81,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=17780,
    end_offset=17788,
    text_slice='“万几宸翰之宝”',
    hash='sha256:6bce9db4de2bc9c15d1fe0351a9fb5e2d12c338b1afb54ae3d5ae1ad177e1e03'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0588',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=81,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=17789,
    end_offset=17834,
    text_slice='大紫檀雕螭案上，设着三尺来高青绿古铜鼎，悬着待漏随朝墨龙大画，一边是金蜼彝，一边是玻璃盒。',
    hash='sha256:876d62d756d53b9abb87638dd2ff60c3b21fa1156d50e0260cb0e83754e5c09f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0589',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=81,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=17834,
    end_offset=17846,
    text_slice='地下两溜十六张楠木交椅。',
    hash='sha256:730af4ef83b6c424a0ed53eaa5fa2a18636c87553074782e12542bcde0b1b2fd'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0590',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=82,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=17873,
    end_offset=17889,
    text_slice='座上珠玑昭日月，堂前黼黻焕烟霞。',
    hash='sha256:9e2bc05937d33930fe91f8255dd50ba4934d3878dd7036ee3cbe1aee45c96734'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0591',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=83,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=17891,
    end_offset=17920,
    text_slice='下面一行小字，道是：“同乡世教弟勋袭东安郡王穆莳拜手书”。',
    hash='sha256:c5a33224a33b138c061f06361f4aae961ded4086a3a9769ed26eafb198ffe451'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0592',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=84,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=17922,
    end_offset=17955,
    text_slice='原来王夫人时常居坐宴息，亦不在这正室，只在这正室东边的三间耳房内。',
    hash='sha256:3ccaa3becd35460ab4136cd5878131725ca8a468c28401b0a64a8a2568249085'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0593',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=84,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=17955,
    end_offset=17969,
    text_slice='于是老嬷嬷引黛玉进东房门来。',
    hash='sha256:c67273bf1aaf659ef57a61eecfa4062f952b3c424db1df7cc10ceb0f00a2018b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0594',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=84,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=17969,
    end_offset=18009,
    text_slice='临窗大炕上猩红洋罽，正面设着大红金钱蟒靠背，石青金钱蟒引枕，秋香色金钱蟒大条褥。',
    hash='sha256:f7664cb69c2b0f7e07457cc9a981a1447bd01c0ad8c3b7f7844c1b9fb7b3037f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0595',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=84,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=18009,
    end_offset=18022,
    text_slice='两边设一对梅花式洋漆小几。',
    hash='sha256:4f28de3090526780f3bc64412eeca69682ea7e48ffaa7d4ef05f884314bb8801'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0596',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=84,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=18022,
    end_offset=18064,
    text_slice='左边几上文王鼎、匙箸、香盒；右边几上汝窑美人觚-觚内插着时鲜花卉，并茗碗、痰盒等物。',
    hash='sha256:01d9bd80f23ae5276f0730f063fe540d3e7181c88b6dc7e87f8bf231799d4936'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0597',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=84,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=18064,
    end_offset=18092,
    text_slice='地下面西一溜四张椅上，都搭着银红撒花椅搭，底下四副脚踏。',
    hash='sha256:b8d64f592a04a78dcac6cdb2fdc142942833920fe20ec1582205b2219f0b4527'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0598',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=84,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=18092,
    end_offset=18113,
    text_slice='椅之两边，也有一对高几，几上茗碗瓶花俱备。',
    hash='sha256:7a4b21549c8cd77a423ef8131e2843384ffa8835d8d810488ce2cc9a4a74031a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0599',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=84,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=18113,
    end_offset=18124,
    text_slice='其余陈设，自不必细说。',
    hash='sha256:c74f5de87679ed3f49f3eacaa94ab770c6d33ed211ebf9107236e4405a9ff82d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0600',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=84,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=18124,
    end_offset=18148,
    text_slice='老嬷嬷们让黛玉炕上坐，炕沿上却也有两个锦褥对设。',
    hash='sha256:ca796a0aab54366ee6095c174f229e37b9b2fc6946c1399358e0f265871f3488'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0601',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=84,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=18148,
    end_offset=18170,
    text_slice='黛玉度其位次，便不上炕，只向东边椅子上坐了。',
    hash='sha256:2c9a44b0e6ecf1e98d465371e0fbe763a28cdbe4244a8bfc47df7780b11d4905'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0602',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=84,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=18170,
    end_offset=18182,
    text_slice='本房内的丫鬟忙捧上茶来。',
    hash='sha256:b5dce12a78ead81a180db3d3b0dce38d8364db2ccf0689400ab2b8f712ce014d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0603',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=84,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=18182,
    end_offset=18217,
    text_slice='黛玉一面吃茶，一面打谅这些丫鬟们，妆饰衣裙，举止行动，果亦与别家不同。',
    hash='sha256:8d428e0d23b13f1e6896d299d0dd543784b4b3092531592918e3558fcb3a533e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0604',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=85,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=18219,
    end_offset=18249,
    text_slice='茶未吃了，只见穿红绫袄、青缎掐牙背心的一个丫鬟走来笑，说道：',
    hash='sha256:fb3a8a94439de0e2e7f5d182e96d6ef734ff203eb827287313e477581c225392'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0605',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=85,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=18249,
    end_offset=18264,
    text_slice='“太太说，请姑娘到那边坐罢！”',
    hash='sha256:3929042ce3b18e742c9a14a5453804147705eae95c00ef1dee5f84a4ff803f7a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0606',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=85,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=18264,
    end_offset=18290,
    text_slice='老嬷嬷听了，于是又引黛玉出来，到了东廊三间小正房内。',
    hash='sha256:c0792c2239fea93e7979bac39fdce75869409c7ca3d602dce7d0d863a4287a2e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0607',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=85,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=18290,
    end_offset=18328,
    text_slice='正面炕上横设一张炕桌，桌上磊着书籍茶具，靠东壁面西，设着半旧得青缎靠背引枕。',
    hash='sha256:94693488e8ba0dacba4e1a1c0da55e70019e5f46ed29dfdebdf2fa020e80d0b3'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0608',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=85,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=18328,
    end_offset=18351,
    text_slice='王夫人却坐在西边下首，亦是半旧的青缎靠背坐褥。',
    hash='sha256:51a4e7e2f1616cd939aad8c7a1169c5795885281ce8277e20116b131e792672a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0609',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=85,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=18351,
    end_offset=18362,
    text_slice='见黛玉来了，便往东让。',
    hash='sha256:01e7a812ab905f02849e1ae5bef665061b3cb3da64da1eea76d3bc66fb85fbda'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0610',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=85,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=18362,
    end_offset=18375,
    text_slice='黛玉心中料定这是贾政之位。',
    hash='sha256:546755adc514d7ddfc22cd9b9738d1da35b24c21632da9c182eb3e55bffc6063'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0611',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=85,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=18375,
    end_offset=18407,
    text_slice='因见挨炕一溜三张椅子上，也搭着半旧的弹墨椅袱，黛玉便向椅上坐了。',
    hash='sha256:a74198bbc19971ab5fcc744b5d3c7a7dfdc4aefb6323d8ca4e49e8f3135cbe3c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0612',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=85,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=18407,
    end_offset=18426,
    text_slice='王夫人再四携她上炕，她方挨王夫人坐了。',
    hash='sha256:f998c0f59ed833f4491928dbfc3292c50229747f31506e28509c338fc1d52b9a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0613',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=85,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=18432,
    end_offset=18570,
    text_slice='“你舅舅今日斋戒去了，再见罢。只是有一句话嘱咐你：你三个姊妹倒都极好，以后一处念书认字、学针线，或是偶一玩笑，都有尽让的。但我不放心的最是一件：我有一个孽根祸胎，是家里的‘混世魔王’，今日因庙里还愿去了，尚未回来，晚间你看见便知。你只以后不用睬他，你这些姊妹都不敢沾惹他的。”',
    hash='sha256:ab0623a89e60774848135c886342b64e3a47a838b3444a280a61fc4a0677e086'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0614',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=86,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=18572,
    end_offset=18630,
    text_slice='黛玉亦常听得母亲说过，二舅母生的有个表兄，乃衔玉而诞，顽劣异常，极恶读书，最喜在内帏厮混；外祖母又极溺爱，无人敢管。',
    hash='sha256:8a7da7aac007b9c85769f01bbdea555ec4474270e607ae10b5d0a4ef6f15a607'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0615',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=86,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=18630,
    end_offset=18649,
    text_slice='今见王夫人如此说，便知说的是这表兄了。',
    hash='sha256:5b0a458e40de8775e14d7e65e7da0e5276a0df12064d47fe89ea49a0d7b89df4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0616',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=86,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=18654,
    end_offset=18750,
    text_slice='“舅母说的，可是衔玉所生的这位哥哥？在家时亦曾听见母亲常说，这位哥哥比我大一岁，小名就唤宝玉，虽极憨顽，说在姊妹情中极好的。况我来了，自然只和姊妹同处，兄弟们自是别院另室的，岂得去沾惹之理！”',
    hash='sha256:5f63143dc9adcb2715d41a96a86e5b2cb6a4b1ddca46ab7ad8253ee97ebff95c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0617',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=86,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=18750,
    end_offset=18756,
    text_slice='王夫人笑道：',
    hash='sha256:d2a34a029ec825755997b3326e5527a8361a1129b0512caaba4ee6efc09c5462'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0618',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=86,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=18756,
    end_offset=18916,
    text_slice='“你不知原故：他与别人不同，自幼因老太太疼爱，原系同姊妹们一处娇养惯了的。若姊妹们有日不理他，他倒还安静些，纵然他没趣，不过出了二门，背地里拿着他的两个小幺儿出气，咕唧一会子就完了。若这一日姊妹们和他多说一句话，他心里一乐，便生出多少事来！所以嘱咐你别睬他。他嘴里一时甜言蜜语，一时有天无日，一时又疯疯傻傻，只休信他！”',
    hash='sha256:71e56c04893530fff45f595250303d12132a09ca36f59a2d78b39353d4e2e1eb'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0619',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=87,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=18918,
    end_offset=18928,
    text_slice='黛玉一一的都答应着。',
    hash='sha256:37b4a8e1f418dfe7f15438fe2bfe1bb22005b7787cded07a7f536b7fe77eb2af'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0620',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=87,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=18937,
    end_offset=18949,
    text_slice='“老太太那里传晚饭了！”',
    hash='sha256:be43d20260c5088f4cd0245ee66edbd0867da474fa2987059e5cbc0b3fb86daf'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0621',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=87,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=18949,
    end_offset=18980,
    text_slice='王夫人忙携黛玉从后房门由后廊往西，出了角门，是一条南北宽夹道。',
    hash='sha256:52f0b13ef358920f299e00f4222ff824e0512b9789cbba047954a028dd866187'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0622',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=87,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=18980,
    end_offset=19019,
    text_slice='南边是倒座三间小小抱厦厅，北边立着一个粉油大影壁，后有一半大门，小小一所房室。',
    hash='sha256:a5b2ebc57fd4755d6e3462e50ee4368b7ace0d3c4ebf481938a87bbfcc9a693e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0623',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=87,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=19029,
    end_offset=19068,
    text_slice='“这是你凤姐姐的屋子，回来你好往这里找她来，少什么东西，你只管和她说就是了。”',
    hash='sha256:6329f9afcdf52a63f036eb44eececeff81070d896fcf68a437c0c51788cd1b55'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0624',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=87,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=19068,
    end_offset=19090,
    text_slice='这院门上也有四五个才总角的小厮，都垂手侍立。',
    hash='sha256:25ff83e6bc67d6dc4a95ac23fd664003dfd5d3d4ab04d33fa0ab6f757ad1d4df'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0625',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=87,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=19090,
    end_offset=19115,
    text_slice='王夫人遂携黛玉穿过一个东西穿堂，便是贾母的后院了。',
    hash='sha256:284247ac908045b315fe245feb3fb255e8bbcf409b6678ae7bc7b71021011c82'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0626',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=87,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=19115,
    end_offset=19146,
    text_slice='于是，进入后房门，已有多人在此伺候，见王夫人来了，方安设桌椅。',
    hash='sha256:dc4b407ba6e7112a4c0b42279e062e5dc941cb36c131d23707ac69ef47a7338c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0627',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=87,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=19146,
    end_offset=19166,
    text_slice='贾珠之妻李氏捧饭，熙凤安箸，王夫人进羹。',
    hash='sha256:7ce5f30a7235886b06c95c79c576c67c96de14b7845c32d588cd82c097161d97'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0628',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=87,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=19166,
    end_offset=19200,
    text_slice='贾母正面榻上独坐，两边四张空椅，熙凤忙拉了黛玉在左边第一张椅上坐了。',
    hash='sha256:7bdc355d2e0bb150942bb209d689382c74a9b1764599b3d1e8b94e3bba150458'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0629',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=87,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=19200,
    end_offset=19207,
    text_slice='黛玉十分推让。',
    hash='sha256:f806e0573cb06d4f34f9d204b32d9c6709f2147aa4347bcba909452024efb033'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0630',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=87,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=19212,
    end_offset=19239,
    text_slice='“你舅母和嫂子们不在这里吃饭。你是客，原应如此坐的。”',
    hash='sha256:cf9c93e6584c2eb89069890efe6993a8562f9b773f0b14be330a00f5fda05694'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0631',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=87,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=19239,
    end_offset=19249,
    text_slice='黛玉方告了座，坐了。',
    hash='sha256:52b4b6bae6631e95af5146b94433caf07797554be4acd1f0f54f727ada0d4be2'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0632',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=87,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=19249,
    end_offset=19258,
    text_slice='贾母命王夫人坐了。',
    hash='sha256:17456255afd8704355e0a929a22b21c8ab41721dd099653c7fa35518460befb8'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0633',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=87,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=19258,
    end_offset=19272,
    text_slice='迎春姊妹三个告了座，方上来。',
    hash='sha256:5ecffcd1fa8df6fa7c5a29e6e880c7d68df3753dd98dbfded40942afdb1c1245'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0634',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=87,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=19272,
    end_offset=19293,
    text_slice='迎春便坐右手第一，探春左第二，惜春右第二。',
    hash='sha256:e0cc0c4801f23ffc54e346e552b61fc5d909872e7a8e479ccf570b90faa1c4ba'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0635',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=87,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=19293,
    end_offset=19308,
    text_slice='旁边丫鬟执着拂尘、漱盂、巾帕。',
    hash='sha256:0fa97791d4f0481df58a284b1989495de586cb48d74ddc5e7eee70985d82954f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0636',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=87,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=19308,
    end_offset=19320,
    text_slice='李、凤二人立于案旁布让。',
    hash='sha256:19bb91058ecae0bbea53383da17a11260dfd80c46837641779248cc455803194'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0637',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=87,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=19320,
    end_offset=19341,
    text_slice='外间伺候之媳妇丫鬟虽多，却连一声咳嗽不闻。',
    hash='sha256:79bce485ccd619dfcd94d19f801cb8430a952fb17773faae7a86266ce00e3060'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0638',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=87,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=19341,
    end_offset=19359,
    text_slice='寂然饭毕，各有丫鬟用小茶盘捧上茶来。',
    hash='sha256:2baddd0d372bee216237277d711d21bb7954210095fcd8643b9ff509358b3deb'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0639',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=87,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=19359,
    end_offset=19395,
    text_slice='当日林如海教女以惜福养身，云饭后务待饭粒咽尽，过一时再吃茶，方不伤脾胃。',
    hash='sha256:3f4878725a4290974d586eacd30016f3ec4f4b5d0deff5cde181d75bce10c8d5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0640',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=87,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=19395,
    end_offset=19435,
    text_slice='今黛玉见了这里许多事情不合家中之式，不得不随的，少不得一一的改过来，因而接了茶。',
    hash='sha256:c214010adbf1265dee468e5fda2d96d57dabe98d7fc776e560d860124016f0c9'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0641',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=87,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=19435,
    end_offset=19454,
    text_slice='早有人又捧过漱盂来，黛玉也照样漱了口。',
    hash='sha256:6484e5ca99611bb739cae396b5f707b5e3b9c088311d9b627338e3fcde18ca03'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0642',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=87,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=19454,
    end_offset=19472,
    text_slice='然后盥手毕，又捧上茶来，方是吃的茶。',
    hash='sha256:f006d09f1adaf4d134d179e78db0903b4ad1c5b7dfb09cae3dfadd7cbbae0668'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0643',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=87,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=19477,
    end_offset=19493,
    text_slice='“你们去罢，让我们自在说话儿。”',
    hash='sha256:66eda0bb622bfae2c5d4afc62dc54a17de5e33beaf6924becb5a912b2857914f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0644',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=87,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=19493,
    end_offset=19521,
    text_slice='王夫人听了，忙起身，又说了两句闲话，方引李、凤二人去了。',
    hash='sha256:0e487699e4c55f90ae45fd1d91be170157478d188a8ab09bb3e7426c82d7928f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0645',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=87,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=19521,
    end_offset=19531,
    text_slice='贾母因问黛玉念何书。',
    hash='sha256:4f57c2a0d6b89a8d642e1c6a3601a72e2767eb5d12ff02080cb5cba4fd9ba870'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0646',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=87,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=19535,
    end_offset=19546,
    text_slice='“只刚念了《四书》。”',
    hash='sha256:e0f3d249b05a2431e1a679421c6f26ccfab67e88dbf22ad9e4d386968fa64d9d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0647',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=87,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=19546,
    end_offset=19557,
    text_slice='黛玉又问姊妹们读何书。',
    hash='sha256:dcd120f0a23351565701ea99e5c28f4b860c6977a65d01d5ea1059152a8c678a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0648',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=87,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=19561,
    end_offset=19589,
    text_slice='“读的是什么书，不过是认得两个字，不是睁眼的瞎子罢了！”',
    hash='sha256:f4a4cb2238bc5ad0506c3904042235cb1cb256ccd94f584f67cf1512bd9069b9'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0649',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=88,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=19591,
    end_offset=19613,
    text_slice='一语未了，只听外面一阵脚步响，丫鬟进来笑道：',
    hash='sha256:fa31a4c4fb2f62d2aa8d70e3545b52a8e37f79be85d4c82f4e4c7790ef242bdf'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0650',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=88,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=19613,
    end_offset=19620,
    text_slice='“宝玉来了！”',
    hash='sha256:e7ae6e65babe7680c967be4b30b714e896f8b2a13994dd1af406b4be3453d860'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0651',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=88,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=19620,
    end_offset=19629,
    text_slice='黛玉心中正疑惑着：',
    hash='sha256:af711a835db8154181d0144a21e38eb03e6a64680050bd5734f72b5b1b7b86a4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0652',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=88,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=19629,
    end_offset=19654,
    text_slice='“这个宝玉，不知是怎生个惫懒人物、懵懂顽劣之童？”',
    hash='sha256:541902c213e2452fcc4c372ab78991ce2fe95aa527b4d4eb0b0c171e2c1de352'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0653',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=88,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=19654,
    end_offset=19664,
    text_slice='倒不见那蠢物也罢了！',
    hash='sha256:261e633ba32e494c0a08958fbfd540a42dda2a6bd9b293ea358a87fbb1de9275'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0654',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=88,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=19664,
    end_offset=19765,
    text_slice='心中想着，忽见丫鬟话未报完，已进来了一个年轻公子：头上戴着束发嵌宝紫金冠，齐眉勒着二龙抢珠金抹额；穿一件二色金百蝶穿花大红箭袖，束着五彩丝攒花结长穗宫条；外罩石青起花八团倭缎排穗褂；登着青缎粉底小朝靴。',
    hash='sha256:c458b8ac51abadaa0d259322bcbc2de7d8c1859cb4a4a31c70d65f906402f7f4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0655',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=88,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=19765,
    end_offset=19799,
    text_slice='面若中秋之月，色如春晓之花，鬓若刀裁，眉如墨画，面如桃瓣，眼若秋波。',
    hash='sha256:1eadd012bb7750dbc9aa8e4fbc625fe561f1422311562fe2a0e22a47cece6f76'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0656',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=88,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=19799,
    end_offset=19813,
    text_slice='虽怒时而若笑，即瞋视而有情。',
    hash='sha256:f0092a0416e0ada8af1455fa33540cc4faab39407f88a6be058b9050cd97674e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0657',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=88,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=19813,
    end_offset=19836,
    text_slice='项上金螭璎珞，又有一根五色丝条，系着一块美玉。',
    hash='sha256:97588dca2e38596b6a560ffc509e4ae47ca150cb90d5042ef23d434a5ad973c0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0658',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=88,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=19852,
    end_offset=19878,
    text_slice='“好生奇怪！倒像在那里见过的一般，何等眼熟到如此！”',
    hash='sha256:cb157b9b4f69b966e5428959960a91bbb33f4a311823d2914b3acf8477853eea'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0659',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=88,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=19878,
    end_offset=19890,
    text_slice='只见这宝玉向贾母请了安。',
    hash='sha256:d990f6964ba484943eed540914f985771220dbbf1f03b69cb5abf7644f733a6e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0660',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=88,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=19895,
    end_offset=19903,
    text_slice='“去见你娘来！”',
    hash='sha256:af6115e3123735573f5ea04d54b0ee090d87323987ea154cb030111b99d28138'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0661',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=88,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=19903,
    end_offset=19911,
    text_slice='宝玉即转身去了。',
    hash='sha256:e0d10929bbfe46313d95508aad413f7623ea4819297c4b01cc67c2379eb5a568'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0662',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=88,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=19911,
    end_offset=20043,
    text_slice='一时回来，再看，已换了冠带：头上周围一转的短发，都结成小辫，红丝结束，共攒至顶中胎发，总编一根大辫，黑亮如漆，从顶至梢，一串四颗大珠，用金八宝坠角；身上穿著银红撒花半旧大袄，仍旧带着项圈、宝玉、寄名锁、护身符等物；下面半露松花撒花绿绫裤腿，锦边弹墨袜，厚底大红鞋。',
    hash='sha256:2a3775ab637e8d21f131cb54de06de399e66c351f47944552abcd719d29a3abe'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0663',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=88,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=20043,
    end_offset=20066,
    text_slice='越显得面如敷粉，唇若施脂；转盼多情，语言常笑。',
    hash='sha256:8048866e2a6ed1caf618395a48ed2a66213746f4a97575353f78c0223dd26916'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0664',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=88,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=20066,
    end_offset=20090,
    text_slice='天然一段风骚，全在眉梢；平生万种情思，悉堆眼角。',
    hash='sha256:f9335008c975300a3a89d372f5132dcfcc4c129f0aac309296aad6b75eba2af2'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0665',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=88,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=20090,
    end_offset=20107,
    text_slice='看其外貌，最是极好，却难知其底细。',
    hash='sha256:5d5f1e7141ab5d5d8a39f8fdf1d0bb1a7ac6e16fc21d8c9586bff2f913cbb6ca'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0666',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=89,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=20131,
    end_offset=20145,
    text_slice='无故寻愁觅恨，有时似傻如狂。',
    hash='sha256:e49a512c8e1559d4485da802faa84660872e485ac7d4c67dba0ac2d3801827d3'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0667',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=89,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=20145,
    end_offset=20160,
    text_slice='纵然生得好皮囊，腹内原来草莽。',
    hash='sha256:1e771da341a614cb6678fd449a40b28a641b71dc2f348e1aa6460d3dd3f8ca67'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0668',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=89,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=20160,
    end_offset=20174,
    text_slice='潦倒不通世务，愚顽怕读文章。',
    hash='sha256:f998bc083c61147c08ee461dc0219ed027967917f3bfc162d23fb9aca7241eae'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0669',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=89,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=20174,
    end_offset=20189,
    text_slice='行为偏僻性乖张，那管世人诽谤！',
    hash='sha256:25af23d6afdbabfd468d18fd5f7b40b15236af739ef63c0ed3c7e0318f5a4b33'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0670',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=89,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=20189,
    end_offset=20203,
    text_slice='富贵不知乐业，贫穷难耐凄凉。',
    hash='sha256:7b56d33979dc7bc9d07a64d1445d0e3271c951e6a3f3700f0eaafa3cab912ec4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0671',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=89,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=20203,
    end_offset=20218,
    text_slice='可怜辜负好韶光，于国于家无望。',
    hash='sha256:61dae442f306d37589f898563dd92cd4b6eed22e36c53f494e27289179b9be3a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0672',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=89,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=20218,
    end_offset=20232,
    text_slice='天下无能第一，古今不肖无双。',
    hash='sha256:7e5cada6ea79de8bf7cd40f63f97d71193fc535e48d81462aa1858418b117fa6'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0673',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=89,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=20232,
    end_offset=20247,
    text_slice='寄言纨绔与膏粱：莫效此儿形状！',
    hash='sha256:d93e3e339dd725acc8e0862c5ee8e8e4595821f1b8e07c96db3cd73de197d250'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0674',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=90,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=20249,
    end_offset=20255,
    text_slice='贾母因笑道：',
    hash='sha256:b503d38790878aea783342c2b7663660bc92fdfee791319b19b0af96545279f4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0675',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=90,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=20255,
    end_offset=20276,
    text_slice='“外客未见，就脱了衣裳，还不去见你妹妹！”',
    hash='sha256:9be2ed93aab63bf3466582aac5656121d5bebaea396736fde52878882314c230'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0676',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=90,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=20276,
    end_offset=20304,
    text_slice='宝玉早已看见多了一个姊妹，便料定是林姑妈之女，忙来作揖。',
    hash='sha256:739b73607fccce811292d830aef5430555325c4c7b8605a9acf708e58c894dd9'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0677',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=90,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=20304,
    end_offset=20341,
    text_slice='厮见毕，归坐，细看形容，与众各别：两弯似蹙非蹙罥烟眉，一双似喜非喜含露目。',
    hash='sha256:94e210899c58e7031a34b08df94fc2ebacaee5751939a6e87625f44bb9210e14'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0678',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=90,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=20341,
    end_offset=20355,
    text_slice='态生两靥之愁，娇袭一身之病。',
    hash='sha256:1a6e247d08d8f216b82aa775b9088329949fe8c13e1ecc326584670598d0cc4f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0679',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=90,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=20355,
    end_offset=20365,
    text_slice='泪光点点，娇喘微微。',
    hash='sha256:535a1c8c5e0093a1177bc8fd998b0288df38ab2eec4770845fcd0e298a1d5c37'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0680',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=90,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=20365,
    end_offset=20385,
    text_slice='闲静时，如姣花照水；行动处，似弱柳扶风。',
    hash='sha256:c0b12998f03ffcc35aa3d1e01ee79adf64e08ecce747dd538b59968d310611b7'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0681',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=90,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=20385,
    end_offset=20401,
    text_slice='心较比干多一窍，病如西子胜三分。',
    hash='sha256:6d914df032f4f9137aaf486b6f2e1eda4ae3254fc896cf3261868bb3fbf8309c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0682',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=90,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=20410,
    end_offset=20422,
    text_slice='“这个妹妹我曾见过的。”',
    hash='sha256:d006671ea8b5b8ee4859959be4e21614a96216e863bbc7503f76cc1916c19d8d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0683',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=90,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=20422,
    end_offset=20427,
    text_slice='贾母笑道：',
    hash='sha256:b2e3b8dcd63b5176d618845f4088f0bcc7794c37c226715453d5e21c5fb07f5c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0684',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=90,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=20427,
    end_offset=20443,
    text_slice='“可又是胡说！你又何曾见过他？”',
    hash='sha256:e7bca78a0f9589d2c593307340dadb5cc4dbd806ba2cc2eb9acb142494af2d8f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0685',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=90,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=20443,
    end_offset=20448,
    text_slice='宝玉笑道：',
    hash='sha256:4010737831077115327a930fc031b5caa442f6aca950d1b4be97c2a32a759b5c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0686',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=90,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=20448,
    end_offset=20488,
    text_slice='“虽然未曾见过她，然我看着面善，心里就算是旧相识，今日只作远别重逢，未为不可。”',
    hash='sha256:0fe36641673af263e3e7f46185dccca60f2b3603f741d36c7a7d58f8dae91e1b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0687',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=90,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=20488,
    end_offset=20493,
    text_slice='贾母笑道：',
    hash='sha256:b2e3b8dcd63b5176d618845f4088f0bcc7794c37c226715453d5e21c5fb07f5c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0688',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=90,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=20493,
    end_offset=20511,
    text_slice='“更好，更好，若如此，更相和睦了！”',
    hash='sha256:86eaf062e3c1836d1d55626d7ac432c32d7b7168dc5fba179bc812fada1b330c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0689',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=90,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=20511,
    end_offset=20534,
    text_slice='宝玉便走近黛玉身边坐下，又细细打量一番，因问：',
    hash='sha256:bd67a8599d80469123ee79afaf1f2be5cceea4f8a2625448d7bcfbc978d8a0c0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0690',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=90,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=20534,
    end_offset=20543,
    text_slice='“妹妹可曾读书？”',
    hash='sha256:a8b5d3d7738990c1a7e5adf592e7c26aa3d8dacf2ea694e2983b042a52706806'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0691',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=90,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=20543,
    end_offset=20547,
    text_slice='黛玉道：',
    hash='sha256:e1608e3669e13bd2ad429b5caf8a6374d9c98e7e77047fb494ca22f634cf5d6f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0692',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=90,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=20547,
    end_offset=20569,
    text_slice='“不曾读书，只上了一年学，些须认得几个字。”',
    hash='sha256:bbe272b8b01933c17166f6d7d8a2a302460bb5910a12b4b81bdde24c4185e00d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0693',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=90,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=20569,
    end_offset=20574,
    text_slice='宝玉又道：',
    hash='sha256:0cc8ccdc4ade9fa936f8b35451853f091bbe3f21e1f329631ef9b09c581b368e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0694',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=90,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=20574,
    end_offset=20586,
    text_slice='“妹妹尊名是那两个字？”',
    hash='sha256:db6647f891243dbd5e38b45d01d337705b2ceb39fbf41ecb1acf5f39f07cf443'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0695',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=90,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=20586,
    end_offset=20594,
    text_slice='黛玉便说了名字。',
    hash='sha256:ddf964fc97c435de9c1a0bf307010bbea628b6fe3edae7537989ab0660ee9c5d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0696',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=90,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=20594,
    end_offset=20601,
    text_slice='宝玉又问表字。',
    hash='sha256:21779286a9fe290252d4ccbd387c0a4610f3357948d005cb05f524beb382e6b7'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0697',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=90,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=20605,
    end_offset=20610,
    text_slice='“无字。”',
    hash='sha256:e341d79a8519b49b62d3809cd80246a41b557edf12351aa6f86d18826de59617'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0698',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=90,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=20610,
    end_offset=20615,
    text_slice='宝玉笑道：',
    hash='sha256:4010737831077115327a930fc031b5caa442f6aca950d1b4be97c2a32a759b5c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0699',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=90,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=20615,
    end_offset=20636,
    text_slice='“我送妹妹一妙字，莫若‘颦颦’二字极好！”',
    hash='sha256:437ccbe275f3af957b22a2e0774cbfe5de9fdc41248b7d9b7a2b66756fbae6a0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0700',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=90,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=20636,
    end_offset=20641,
    text_slice='探春便问：',
    hash='sha256:6ffea81a104e28189fc6f17d96f9d3bb31ba89488b00d43f3145f0ca3db13940'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0701',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=90,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=20641,
    end_offset=20646,
    text_slice='“何出？”',
    hash='sha256:83a7834d96fba93c3da1bc78b8529afedaf04ebe0398df50521cf938b580d799'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0702',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=90,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=20646,
    end_offset=20650,
    text_slice='宝玉道：',
    hash='sha256:10c9e1a43f0e2e5bf2e54f50fb3dbede512eb436326aec72d14625e62153e9b0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0703',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=90,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=20650,
    end_offset=20701,
    text_slice='“《古今人物通考》上说：‘西方有石名黛，可代画眉之墨。’况这林妹妹眉尖若蹙，用取这两个字，岂不两妙！”',
    hash='sha256:6533c35e1abb032bd2483dcf2dac82a878bb062f9f80d4d7caa04ab070aea458'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0704',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=90,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=20701,
    end_offset=20706,
    text_slice='探春笑道：',
    hash='sha256:892cb1c1c4a2d52554142b7707f768b17f518828156e960e0478d50d685ff278'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0705',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=90,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=20706,
    end_offset=20717,
    text_slice='“只恐又是你的杜撰。”',
    hash='sha256:48f764314ed0310e4963e369ad65324238b5dd1fd3dbc842d44758cd8c70b13d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0706',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=90,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=20717,
    end_offset=20722,
    text_slice='宝玉笑道：',
    hash='sha256:4010737831077115327a930fc031b5caa442f6aca950d1b4be97c2a32a759b5c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0707',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=90,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=20722,
    end_offset=20746,
    text_slice='“除《四书》外，杜撰的太多，偏只我是杜撰不成？”',
    hash='sha256:8d8279b2eda37de67705d515fba6f1b1d728a083d9395363c4fe06a57ec9b8a5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0708',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=90,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=20746,
    end_offset=20751,
    text_slice='又问黛玉：',
    hash='sha256:4e4e9e0fc6480f39bd532d91236aac5c705b35d99ff18f3870d9691720866e4e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0709',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=90,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=20751,
    end_offset=20760,
    text_slice='“可也有玉没有？”',
    hash='sha256:14aa11c03c5c39903e6e0bfd04e1be66bd302673fe8d57bc466764e5abbf8635'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0710',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=90,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=20760,
    end_offset=20767,
    text_slice='众人不解其语。',
    hash='sha256:bc17a8a26d7e5afcd1d6d6eed2e07023257dbc8542fea710b079d970d0b3f027'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0711',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=90,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=20767,
    end_offset=20786,
    text_slice='黛玉便忖度着，因他有玉，故问我有也无。',
    hash='sha256:5010d67d14c315405f7718f44ed54c1093aa275e02a913700c3f62e39fdbee4a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0712',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=90,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=20790,
    end_offset=20816,
    text_slice='“我没有那个。想来那玉亦是一件罕物，岂能人人有的！”',
    hash='sha256:feb78568968a84b66cc87ba6ab8ac1db5e066df0e8ada15bf79f7807ba491dcb'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0713',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=90,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=20816,
    end_offset=20845,
    text_slice='宝玉听了，登时发作起痴狂病来，摘下那玉，就狠命摔去，骂道：',
    hash='sha256:07a9979247e75ebb23a639aed9653b9da721e976df280b9085d683e36f9e2120'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0714',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=90,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=20845,
    end_offset=20883,
    text_slice='“什么罕物，连人之高低不择，还说‘通灵’不‘通灵’呢！我也不要这劳什子了！”',
    hash='sha256:d352780b7b2c855be19ee6276d83d7eadd0e6e35eb512aea1a81c23054924794'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0715',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=90,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=20883,
    end_offset=20894,
    text_slice='吓的众人一拥争去拾玉。',
    hash='sha256:b94a1fbc0fc7d6c02044caf9af9b6209001341a435bcc2832af68af58533bad9'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0716',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=90,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=20904,
    end_offset=20928,
    text_slice='“孽障！你生气，要打骂人容易，何苦摔那命根子！”',
    hash='sha256:4a84c7cbe922c5c3dfea8203d37cab5c00c06f49cf61eb8f74c8a6e538d216c7'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0717',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=90,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=20928,
    end_offset=20937,
    text_slice='宝玉满面泪痕泣道：',
    hash='sha256:888566ccc1f48b5dc0e5f26007e593c31c49146e0cce977a9090f1cd51e6a7e8'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0718',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=90,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=20937,
    end_offset=20986,
    text_slice='“家里姐姐妹妹都没有，单我有，我就没趣，如今来了这么一个神仙似的妹妹也没有，可知这不是个好东西！”',
    hash='sha256:f61442c71ea86f621b6c13136ed58c43f4dc4ff80680e660a5fecb231cd97615'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0719',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=90,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=20986,
    end_offset=20993,
    text_slice='贾母忙哄他道：',
    hash='sha256:2f1dab06cda738f0798ecf919b6e3b3936b5e1e25b4090bfe240837d3088b20f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0720',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=90,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=20993,
    end_offset=21115,
    text_slice='“你这妹妹原有这个来的，因你姑妈去世时，舍不得你妹妹，无法可处，遂将她的玉带了去了：一则全殉葬之礼，尽你妹妹之孝心；二则你姑妈之灵，亦可权作见了女儿之意。因此她只说没有这个，不便自己夸张之意。你如今怎比得他？还不好生慎重带上，仔细你娘知道了！”',
    hash='sha256:8d0177834d73cc2cb38182fcc95c3133d46951a8b3da26cab8157500d35980e6'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0721',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=90,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=21115,
    end_offset=21133,
    text_slice='说着，便向丫鬟手中接来，亲与他带上。',
    hash='sha256:47c05b46afaa29a6c2446884c68fd41a55fc94e56f2fe6c28d9df3abc39b05b6'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0722',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=90,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=21133,
    end_offset=21158,
    text_slice='宝玉听如此说，想一想，竟大有情理，也就不生别论了。',
    hash='sha256:42106105b46ee9596466aca3fb4e97ae7335ffb07fe2efb153b232ec6d09db7e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0723',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=91,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=21160,
    end_offset=21174,
    text_slice='当下，奶娘来请问黛玉之房舍。',
    hash='sha256:523328a7d64d33b878ccead47228711ac44ca961817305b4706f2e0fbddc09ab'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0724',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=91,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=21179,
    end_offset=21238,
    text_slice='“今将宝玉挪出来，同我在套间暖阁儿里面，把你林姑娘暂安置碧纱橱里。等过了残冬，春天再与他们收拾房屋，另作一番安置罢。”',
    hash='sha256:3701da7abe70b5c2330033d0cabf6ed11e22fb45c5dbf5a1b7a411d249e37519'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0725',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=91,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=21238,
    end_offset=21242,
    text_slice='宝玉道：',
    hash='sha256:10c9e1a43f0e2e5bf2e54f50fb3dbede512eb436326aec72d14625e62153e9b0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0726',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=91,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=21242,
    end_offset=21277,
    text_slice='“好祖宗，我就在碧纱橱外的床上很妥当，何必又出来闹的老祖宗不得安静。”',
    hash='sha256:042899ec1a06d3b5baf67c14bf9cd506fd7e0eb8fc942a54f2abf9be016a15c7'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0727',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=91,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=21277,
    end_offset=21285,
    text_slice='贾母想了一想说：',
    hash='sha256:9d7f1418a577fb568fc35e81bdfb198731b11a39b198f3907d9a073ef9b887c0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0728',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=91,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=21285,
    end_offset=21291,
    text_slice='“也罢了！”',
    hash='sha256:85524d554836cdba3fa6fca8c9bdd436e0d26add439ac9f15c787d50e88514d9'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0729',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=91,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=21291,
    end_offset=21315,
    text_slice='每人一个奶娘并一个丫头照管，余者在外间上夜听唤。',
    hash='sha256:6e0a75948ad35582d3097d8e9dac911385e49d32ae4d932e97516eab3977f4c0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0730',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=91,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=21315,
    end_offset=21343,
    text_slice='一面早有熙凤命人送了一顶藕合色花帐，并几件锦被缎褥之类。',
    hash='sha256:00f85609c9b17b95c7feb33004e1f8c0b83cd38763da9d8c0cb3cd5f90f57b58'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0731',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=92,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=21345,
    end_offset=21389,
    text_slice='黛玉只带了两个人来：一个是自幼奶娘王嬷嬷，一个是十岁的小丫头，亦是自幼随身的，名唤雪雁。',
    hash='sha256:63924319ca31936d8fd92a5f52d8a08c1fbc231bcb530aad1b0df9dba706a049'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0732',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=92,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=21389,
    end_offset=21444,
    text_slice='贾母见雪雁甚小，一团孩气，王嬷嬷又极老，料黛玉皆不遂心省力的，便将自己身边的一个二等丫头，名唤鹦哥者与了黛玉。',
    hash='sha256:0709fdd547fa7f067cfbf80782bd24f1cfda6a1e7b6008031ea2def50fb961a2'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0733',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=92,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=21444,
    end_offset=21503,
    text_slice='外亦如迎春等例，每人除自幼乳母外，另有四个教引嬷嬷，除贴身掌管钗钏盥沐两个丫鬟外，另有五六个洒扫房屋来往使役的小丫头。',
    hash='sha256:eb334d22f64fa71bea6fcb3077fdf9e44df76e2a144bc63870e5f60a21fd9294'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0734',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=92,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=21503,
    end_offset=21522,
    text_slice='当下，王嬷嬷与鹦哥陪侍黛玉在碧纱橱内。',
    hash='sha256:d4a7879c185c3ec3913208c17dd2f771e05bc41726eb3c9b4f763409f67dac51'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0735',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=92,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=21522,
    end_offset=21550,
    text_slice='宝玉之乳母李嬷嬷，并大丫鬟名唤袭人者，陪侍在外面大床上。',
    hash='sha256:18cea8c949b27494d78adcc4190405295547f9dba88e725b211067a7a4e19c67'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0736',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=93,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=21552,
    end_offset=21569,
    text_slice='原来这袭人亦是贾母之婢，本名珍珠。',
    hash='sha256:3e3849fa486ea5bae92ec08943c621b9c518a6678b5f2bdf51bc1e64a3e0e979'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0737',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=93,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=21569,
    end_offset=21611,
    text_slice='贾母因溺爱宝玉，生恐宝玉之婢无竭力尽忠之人，素喜袭人心地纯良，克尽职任，遂与了宝玉。',
    hash='sha256:05b7fddd17711713350e6eb7640b1a8083cbabd7635641c5da4f50a3dc7dd624'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0738',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=93,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=21611,
    end_offset=21649,
    text_slice='宝玉因知她本姓花，又曾见旧人诗句上有“花气袭人”之句，遂回明贾母，更名袭人。',
    hash='sha256:6181495fd96d3d901f4bfe76edb8e61d299bff1d351cd99586289e46c113cbc1'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0739',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=93,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=21649,
    end_offset=21693,
    text_slice='这袭人亦有些痴处；伏侍贾母时，心中眼中只有一个贾母；如今与了宝玉，心中眼中又只有个宝玉。',
    hash='sha256:95ad9e2ba3951759ea7a292c86bc4c0dea7724c83967d94ec9e0c605af8ca9e9'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0740',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=93,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=21693,
    end_offset=21719,
    text_slice='只因宝玉性情乖僻，每每规谏，宝玉不听，心中着实忧郁。',
    hash='sha256:66cf24a525ece8eb61aeff5b8793d7565c43520959486ab6561b2feadf2c8466'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0741',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=94,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=21721,
    end_offset=21734,
    text_slice='是晚，宝玉、李嬷嬷已睡了。',
    hash='sha256:e877a525ca29c26f5b820dc6983a769bfd13c68f31a5ddbffab005448d4e8d72'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0742',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=94,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=21762,
    end_offset=21773,
    text_slice='“姑娘怎么还不安歇？”',
    hash='sha256:f3c70952650e689dab0be1b6d44f851dfa4a3b8f60aecc87dd8764a601d68bc3'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0743',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=94,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=21773,
    end_offset=21778,
    text_slice='黛玉忙让：',
    hash='sha256:8db4df8f27ec6e02a6374f84222ef059186f8e57c94f860468b9f467a890b2ff'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0744',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=94,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=21778,
    end_offset=21785,
    text_slice='“姊姊请坐。”',
    hash='sha256:f7ea2e58e3ee21f44d082f51595d8905ee3db928ff2b2bda748b8ebf1d524b9c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0745',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=94,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=21785,
    end_offset=21794,
    text_slice='袭人在床沿上坐了。',
    hash='sha256:922307f0e7947d22a4413d82d0f709719c4cec03c277a6215d657fd064255fd2'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0746',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=94,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=21799,
    end_offset=21869,
    text_slice='“林姑娘正在这里伤心呢，自己淌眼抹泪的说：‘今儿才来，就惹出你家哥儿的狂病，倘或摔坏了那玉，岂不是因我之过！’因此便伤心，我好容易劝好了。”',
    hash='sha256:162384daa27fdf01c5d244279f7142be633b7b72ad2dd6c24f9ffeb699c8a9b3'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0747',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=94,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=21869,
    end_offset=21873,
    text_slice='袭人道：',
    hash='sha256:20b9ce849764d73657fada1a3bcedf010a5d2e8297c59e5915d5b191856e2fa1'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0748',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=94,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=21873,
    end_offset=21928,
    text_slice='“姑娘快休如此，将来只怕比这个更奇怪的笑话儿还有呢！若为他这种行止，你多心伤感，只怕你伤感不了呢。快别多心！”',
    hash='sha256:1dfa96183e23ca224ecf876aedee9a77823fb24390f679802bb4d19e5891eb7c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0749',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=94,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=21928,
    end_offset=21932,
    text_slice='黛玉道：',
    hash='sha256:e1608e3669e13bd2ad429b5caf8a6374d9c98e7e77047fb494ca22f634cf5d6f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0750',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=94,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=21932,
    end_offset=21967,
    text_slice='“姐姐们说的，我记着就是了。究竟那玉不知是怎么个来历，上面还有字迹？”',
    hash='sha256:3eaeb6ccdb1bf5d81f833300b2738cc749cc612493d18c74f3e08a7f96bd4441'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0751',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=94,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=21967,
    end_offset=21971,
    text_slice='袭人道：',
    hash='sha256:20b9ce849764d73657fada1a3bcedf010a5d2e8297c59e5915d5b191856e2fa1'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0752',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=94,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=21971,
    end_offset=22017,
    text_slice='“连一家子也不知来历，听得说，落草时从他口里掏出来的，上头有现成的穿眼。等我拿来你看便知。”',
    hash='sha256:627f234ef90782de88db1d1bdf04de68d6ec9cdcc5e61e3eb707a740794b38fa'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0753',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=94,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=22017,
    end_offset=22023,
    text_slice='黛玉忙止道：',
    hash='sha256:6faed1d4d049eb542e13859b0dce2e3a27b0e111ff4272ff102b0fa4878d6460'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0754',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=94,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=22023,
    end_offset=22040,
    text_slice='“罢了！此刻夜深，明日再看不迟。”',
    hash='sha256:20898c246afa27b2d48a67be5d7ca8bc2014777191fa520849316deb385e4d54'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0755',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=94,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=22040,
    end_offset=22053,
    text_slice='大家又叙了一回，方才安歇。',
    hash='sha256:81e19b1a654d7e2c1cddff3c2c3d7e074bcc861d9b8c3b25e84455509e95d7b9'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0756',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=95,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=22055,
    end_offset=22113,
    text_slice='次日起来，省过贾母，因往王夫人处来，正值王夫人与熙凤在一处拆金陵来的书信看，又有王夫人之兄嫂处遣了两个媳妇来说话的。',
    hash='sha256:4709a7e55b8daa5ebe240e3e079d0e1e986813885fa6d2c9ebfbb2759f3973ab'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0757',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=95,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=22113,
    end_offset=22171,
    text_slice='黛玉虽不知原委，探春等却都晓得是议论金陵城中所居的薛家姨母之子、姨表兄薛蟠，倚财仗势，打死人命，现在应天府案下审理。',
    hash='sha256:9818e7d687b0eba39b82b6b1f1fd2a53a24300bdfa86b178af7a918795dc98b4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0758',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=95,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=22171,
    end_offset=22201,
    text_slice='如今母舅王子腾得了信息，故遣人来告诉这边，意欲唤取进京之意。',
    hash='sha256:2670cac8edf3d3ccc295a6d75d39de439d545890e21c2cd37aae76fc4773121d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0759',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=95,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=22201,
    end_offset=22213,
    text_slice='要知端详，且听下回分解。',
    hash='sha256:89fcce203b6d8173d82fb8dc0e514cdb3cc4cf9f18931adbf1ba04cfbb631b85'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0760',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=96,
    segment_type='heading',
    start_offset=22215,
    end_offset=22237,
    text_slice='第四回  薄命女偏逢薄命郎\u3000葫芦僧乱判葫芦案',
    hash='sha256:694d3c60072c06ec15c8b6e792dedfdcbbb4cf98bdfb55df4d692f49c4a4ca3c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0761',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=97,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=22239,
    end_offset=22242,
    text_slice='题曰：',
    hash='sha256:929d387722922017064f1ab92b7c279dac886989c2329f581607682d0468cf5e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0762',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=98,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=22244,
    end_offset=22256,
    text_slice='捐身报国恩，未报身犹在。',
    hash='sha256:0f130bb4f8c2125c4fbd31f251941f7c0e611acc125d4ee985c0ee2ecbae3256'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0763',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=98,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=22256,
    end_offset=22268,
    text_slice='眼底物多情，君恩或可待。',
    hash='sha256:0c19a88cba524c59b80f69303264c6e72a1504a25524737ad5263d1e5418dcb3'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0764',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=99,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=22270,
    end_offset=22313,
    text_slice='却说黛玉同姊妹们至王夫人处，见王夫人与兄嫂处的来使计议家务，又说姨母家遭人命官司等语。',
    hash='sha256:3f8a9baf9df1e1bad7af0e4c45966c657bf34a6949bbd300a93c296dc13e25de'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0765',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=99,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=22313,
    end_offset=22340,
    text_slice='因见王夫人事情冗杂，姊妹们遂出来，至寡嫂李氏房中来了。',
    hash='sha256:b3a10e0427112c7c593024ffbec979f8c0a6c1abf023da091ade1ce4adac3bdd'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0766',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=100,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=22342,
    end_offset=22379,
    text_slice='原来这李氏即贾珠之妻，珠虽夭亡，幸存一子，取名贾兰，今方五岁，已入学攻书。',
    hash='sha256:f6077cdc207fd8f567efdaf5319dadab2dbdf3502393fe72d28a6570eac4bbc5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0767',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=100,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=22379,
    end_offset=22418,
    text_slice='这李氏亦系金陵名宦之女，父名李守中，曾为国子监祭酒，族中男女无有不诵诗读书者。',
    hash='sha256:34173d03adf14ebee7669a57f543a6bbefa73443765de7026b4fb7d3429ec228'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0768',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=100,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=22418,
    end_offset=22524,
    text_slice='至李守中继承以来，便说“女子无才便有德”，故生李氏时，便不十分令其读书，只不过将些《女四书》、《列女传》、《贤媛集》等三四种书，使他认得几个字，记得前朝这几个贤女便罢了；却只以纺绩井臼为要，因取名为李纨，字宫裁。',
    hash='sha256:813a80ee5bdf0a7ea45fa8c00253c7243cb215df6cca0ba5c9f9f9d9aed3d156'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0769',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=100,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=22524,
    end_offset=22583,
    text_slice='因此，这李纨虽青春丧偶，居家处膏粱锦绣之中，竟如槁木死灰一般，一概无见无闻，惟知侍亲养子，外则陪侍小姑等针黹诵读而已。',
    hash='sha256:9e1c1dc68de0e400627b339436796f6a9fda23a93aa20214e2cfff73a8894587'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0770',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=100,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=22583,
    end_offset=22616,
    text_slice='今黛玉虽客寄于斯，日有这般姐妹相伴，除老父外，余者也都无庸虑及了。',
    hash='sha256:50bcb29e5cb414c438ff7b3ac3e9ad9223a02357d7b04a1aa0dbd2c0caaefc91'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0771',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=101,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=22618,
    end_offset=22672,
    text_slice='如今且说贾雨村，因补授了应天府，一下马，就有一件人命官司详至案下，乃是两家争买一婢，各不相让，以至殴死人命。',
    hash='sha256:4ceb1406e8fac437e319cfd123c2fdfa9a6d2d574ba1da1552ae6253695192d3'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0772',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=101,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=22672,
    end_offset=22682,
    text_slice='彼时，雨村即问原告。',
    hash='sha256:ea00467574bc9ee50c2bc8b0ce316e8d7257eecc0e805974e2bd8a99d082cfa8'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0773',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=101,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=22682,
    end_offset=22700,
    text_slice='那原告道：“被殴死者，乃小人之主人。',
    hash='sha256:2db528d128851945c4d5a634343ebfb87a18efcd281c6a81f1dfba87c4961ba3'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0774',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=101,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=22700,
    end_offset=22720,
    text_slice='因那日买了一个丫头，不想是拐子拐来卖的。',
    hash='sha256:8cf4a25404209f88627a29ea6ef1fe3c4c533ae4c5f1c08124845ad3d6534a42'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0775',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=101,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=22720,
    end_offset=22752,
    text_slice='这拐子先已得了我家银子，我家小爷原说第三日方是好日子，再接入门。',
    hash='sha256:6d255805fe22011eddbd47697b0701bbde748f84120e287b92af65ecc03c38b1'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0776',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=101,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=22752,
    end_offset=22784,
    text_slice='这拐子便又悄悄的卖与了薛家，被我们知道了，去找那卖主，夺取丫头。',
    hash='sha256:8c03167b6fd495576dc29ecc4e3799d1c87eb2f8688e75cb9ff88a52e68eb128'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0777',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=101,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=22784,
    end_offset=22812,
    text_slice='无奈薛家原系金陵一霸，倚财仗势，众豪奴将我主人竟打死了。',
    hash='sha256:052a2d353d2da5549264ac1ad2d789a0a15ac3ff41cee83de8a9c0cf0aea2288'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0778',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=101,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=22812,
    end_offset=22836,
    text_slice='凶身主仆已皆逃走，无影无踪，只剩了几个局外之人。',
    hash='sha256:ff1a0da706addb2a411175ab0c82ca8421cfb9c1b341cf0bdd97ce2f38763839'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0779',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=101,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=22836,
    end_offset=22851,
    text_slice='小人告了一年的状，竟无人作主。',
    hash='sha256:27d74a77899637996b24446f7b8a01eea70c73be84b8d05c9dabbd56bf57e0f5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0780',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=101,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=22851,
    end_offset=22879,
    text_slice='望大老爷拘拿凶犯，剪恶除凶，以救孤寡，死者感戴天恩不尽！',
    hash='sha256:d99b3284a0dba474133e684ef7876ec76b877e8f71663ba102e49d7e4fc0def5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0781',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=102,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=22882,
    end_offset=22891,
    text_slice='雨村听了，大怒道：',
    hash='sha256:f069854dcefb3e36e5c2b016691c63b4676cb065be4d22ef3d33314dd3fa1836'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0782',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=102,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=22891,
    end_offset=22920,
    text_slice='“岂有这样放屁的事！打死人命，就白白的走了，再拿不来的？”',
    hash='sha256:fa56d3b166c71167894322d323d1aa176852131bfe74e7f4f73329ab6f2de115'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0783',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=102,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=22920,
    end_offset=22958,
    text_slice='因发签差公人立刻将凶犯族中人拿来拷问，令他们实供藏在何处；一面再动海捕文书。',
    hash='sha256:71bb7d112b75fb06110b7b8ec8e2bd488d79605e103d93384d12d73487e2a9c4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0784',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=102,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=22958,
    end_offset=22989,
    text_slice='正要发签时，只见案边立的一个门子使眼色儿，--不令他发签之意。',
    hash='sha256:bd65007f3349ff770c09605da1eec02889ca2070099b53f8e21bd87cda599e40'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0785',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=102,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=22989,
    end_offset=23004,
    text_slice='雨村心中甚是疑怪，只得停了手。',
    hash='sha256:567defd286148dfd952baec6b7b4742acc232665af0e588047a8d361a1231790'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0786',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=102,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=23004,
    end_offset=23028,
    text_slice='实时退堂，至密室，便从皆退去，只留门子一人服侍。',
    hash='sha256:0d922445f5ce6644ac8607ab1b2b3b7bca06dc1228debfe787bb9848c8064c39'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0787',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=102,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=23040,
    end_offset=23061,
    text_slice='“老爷一向加官进禄，八九年来就忘了我了？”',
    hash='sha256:2afa382c832d76dda79557fac0cb4c9a0e6ec2898e4861a0d655fad0ccde1337'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0788',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=102,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=23061,
    end_offset=23065,
    text_slice='雨村道：',
    hash='sha256:a9987f745f066fcafb0033381b00553509b51e3b23b1e13d3aaa9502b2dd926e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0789',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=102,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=23065,
    end_offset=23084,
    text_slice='“却十分面善得紧，只是一时想不起来。”',
    hash='sha256:d473e10939fb9f6e22008a7c3ea5047e207ae6ce181cc111611b857bf455a531'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0790',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=102,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=23084,
    end_offset=23090,
    text_slice='那门子笑道：',
    hash='sha256:bd77f57c04f6f2e05a22ae34db9dc260dfff7241445fbe524f72add02ea8e58d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0791',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=102,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=23090,
    end_offset=23123,
    text_slice='“老爷真是贵人多忘事，把出身之地竟忘了，不记当年葫芦庙里之事了？”',
    hash='sha256:1caef44b7f0e337df7c6301602c3e7f6a49ba5d639638ff6e7a572d63f8d9595'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0792',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=102,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=23123,
    end_offset=23140,
    text_slice='雨村听了，如雷震一惊，方想起往事。',
    hash='sha256:c501779fc810571b5c476eb9c4974ff26d4f4b6fcd15cee7cdc9c504a5532182'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0793',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=102,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=23140,
    end_offset=23211,
    text_slice='原来这门子本是葫芦庙内一个小沙弥，因被火之后，无处安身，欲投别庙去修行，又耐不得清凉景况，因想这件生意倒还轻省热闹，遂趁年纪蓄了发，充了门子。',
    hash='sha256:5d8769207f2b04cd0cd320af6036a70b5a2a8367dc02a2f771272cf52c9e7144'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0794',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=102,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=23227,
    end_offset=23235,
    text_slice='“原来是故人。”',
    hash='sha256:c2c6b702ecadabb6fab32fba0d9fc08dfce1491b6ffa7a240c09f9bceaf4a21a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0795',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=102,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=23235,
    end_offset=23249,
    text_slice='又让了好坐谈，这门子不敢坐。',
    hash='sha256:c5b2a762ba04d515c452b6a49cf0833daaf64b0814088d9d5fd2f17f5eefad8b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0796',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=102,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=23254,
    end_offset=23289,
    text_slice='“贫贱之交不可忘。你我故人也；二则此系私室，既欲长谈，岂有不坐之理？”',
    hash='sha256:0de4a7fa7860baadb744d832e9a4374e8af2d27051864264d45bbfa0f498f67a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0797',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=102,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=23289,
    end_offset=23306,
    text_slice='这门子听说，方告了座，斜签着坐了。',
    hash='sha256:69eb2e34a61f04f88dbfe5ec00168960bc5767e622f53d600a722ce3c4737aae'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0798',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=103,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=23308,
    end_offset=23322,
    text_slice='雨村因问方才何故有不令发签。',
    hash='sha256:8cf4f386fc5ecf16438832a5f62efcb574c6aff3d77c0e836d15a28d09c3e5f4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0799',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=103,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=23327,
    end_offset=23357,
    text_slice='“老爷既荣任到这一省，难道就没抄一张本省‘护官符’来不成？”',
    hash='sha256:2c8037058e45de0319033b774bbb474f1adbb35663143fa581fa6694dcfda073'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0800',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=103,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=23357,
    end_offset=23362,
    text_slice='雨村忙问：',
    hash='sha256:cfb7fb77d4644896ae62d0a5edcc7ffbd9c9f291722a2b86c3429c7f1aeb2a08'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0801',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=103,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=23362,
    end_offset=23377,
    text_slice='“何为‘护官符’？我竟不知。”',
    hash='sha256:1676c1e9205241f80ce5b25ed27d75789553fe374e9226283f6e36524fcf4913'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0802',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=103,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=23377,
    end_offset=23381,
    text_slice='门子道：',
    hash='sha256:4cbb298275f3ffb4d10180d36239ae754b590cbb084921f5c677bfb370bc0d5c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0803',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=103,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=23381,
    end_offset=23534,
    text_slice='“这还了得！连这个不知，怎能作得长远！如今凡作地方官者，皆有一个私单，上面写的是本省最有权有势、极富极贵的大乡绅名姓，各省皆然；倘若不知，一时触犯了这样的人家，不但官爵，只怕连性命还保不成呢！所以绰号叫作‘护官符’。方才所说的这薛家，老爷如何惹得他！他这件官司并无难断之处，皆因都碍着情分脸面，所以如此。”',
    hash='sha256:d83a8dc7cb090b73ceb8967146d37a4ea47c95c25cec64e03557426d2aa04ef7'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0804',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=103,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=23534,
    end_offset=23584,
    text_slice='一面说，一面从顺袋中取出一张抄写的‘护官符’来，递与雨村，看时，上面皆是本地大族名宦之家的谚俗口碑。',
    hash='sha256:3594d0e9daec8ba2821c8757c8a28ed0894d02547a5e59ff389e8d26cba17eff'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0805',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=103,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=23584,
    end_offset=23607,
    text_slice='其口碑排写得明白，下面所皆注着始祖官爵并房次。',
    hash='sha256:c0ebd9eec58aa731e8227d3664a042d23b7fd6e75b8182921098e3c465c00eb3'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0806',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=104,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=23629,
    end_offset=23641,
    text_slice='贾不假，白玉为堂金作马。',
    hash='sha256:9c8d305886b4d06a301b0a0a85b0b07ee4ff20c53a773f7831b5e183ce6ccead'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0807',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=104,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=23641,
    end_offset=23679,
    text_slice='（宁国、荣国二公之后，共二十房分，除宁、荣亲派八房在都外，现原籍住者十二房。',
    hash='sha256:bd92e18ebea766989c97c4e7885e70bcd2c573cfc0e6082645be9304e5c709a8'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0808',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=105,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=23682,
    end_offset=23699,
    text_slice='阿房宫，三百里，住不下金陵一个史。',
    hash='sha256:9c1e509f6cd4505c86ea6a719c2e27f44c65460a6d54b60d31f2045c9c95493e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0809',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=105,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=23699,
    end_offset=23732,
    text_slice='（保龄侯尚书令史公之后，房分共十八，都中现住者十房，原籍现居八房。',
    hash='sha256:b5f3ff8c8c84ce158b424f31963b43add91a762756d6de454bf84956a1906af6'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0810',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=106,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=23735,
    end_offset=23751,
    text_slice='东海缺少白玉床，龙王来请金陵王。',
    hash='sha256:25b01c34a1e2b53131d515a0e901bdbb366708c1111e2715aabe9cc3b8d49f03'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0811',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=106,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=23751,
    end_offset=23778,
    text_slice='（都太尉统制县伯王公之后，共十二房，都中二房，余在籍。',
    hash='sha256:70a35f31b46286991812ae071521ca49df8eaf36f6103e33dd4eda9e7d6f6588'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0812',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=107,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=23781,
    end_offset=23795,
    text_slice='丰年好大雪，珍珠如土金如铁。',
    hash='sha256:a5266a9f32970ca080fa68c0ec1b7591b74f96e0ee80f5c63bbb47094d632c6b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0813',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=107,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=23795,
    end_offset=23819,
    text_slice='（紫薇舍人薛公之后，现领内府帑银行商，共八房分。',
    hash='sha256:0ecccd0947931518bb8fb61b8b73acfbe2328b74be318f2c77e2f98202220f86'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0814',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=108,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=23822,
    end_offset=23836,
    text_slice='雨村犹未看完，忽闻传点人报：',
    hash='sha256:5901bb78d99675320128d81655839c7d2b70220aeb2172e07742fa97af45a610'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0815',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=108,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=23836,
    end_offset=23844,
    text_slice='“王老爷来拜。”',
    hash='sha256:b758587e57e57cc751a337968cb95d8b4dba9d121e4d1ae1684175fda82c1caf'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0816',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=108,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=23844,
    end_offset=23858,
    text_slice='雨村听说，忙具衣冠出去迎接。',
    hash='sha256:7aa5f51fb33804d65541854be5d10be8ea84a36a0fa481554de9360b6fec19c3'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0817',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=108,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=23858,
    end_offset=23870,
    text_slice='有顿饭工夫，方回来细问。',
    hash='sha256:51d4667adffdd69f67e045c1bbef9c18972526660bf690aa0bd532ecf2b3b8e7'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0818',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=108,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=23875,
    end_offset=23960,
    text_slice='“这四家皆连络有亲，一损皆损，一荣皆荣，扶持遮饰，俱有照应的。今告打死人之薛，就系‘丰年大雪’之薛也。也不单靠这三家，他的世交亲友在都在外者，本亦不少。老爷如今拿谁去？”',
    hash='sha256:a1394d15a696ece29a5ac8d131d036d082b7a26ab846322eaad5b29a6034b024'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0819',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=108,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=23960,
    end_offset=23974,
    text_slice='雨村听如此说，便笑问门子道：',
    hash='sha256:c28b9aa3e4f02b1dcf85685712daa97163796d329652a609e91f840fe55be0e6'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0820',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=108,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=23974,
    end_offset=24006,
    text_slice='“如你这样说来，却怎么了结此案？你大约也深知这凶犯躲的方向了？”',
    hash='sha256:2fced08de30d507b16f82d64613ac74c5644e49dd6f17d31ce938115060b9b03'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0821',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=109,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=24008,
    end_offset=24013,
    text_slice='门子笑道：',
    hash='sha256:815747d686248bc45ade9b98324d58cc616847adc13d3a527c6e2e2269e7e6a7'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0822',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=109,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=24013,
    end_offset=24426,
    text_slice='“不瞒老爷说，不但这凶犯躲的方向我知道，一并这拐卖之人我也知道，死鬼买主也深知道。待我细说与老爷听：这个被打之死鬼，乃是本地一个小乡宦之子，名唤冯渊，自幼父母早亡，又无兄弟，只他一个人守着些薄产过日子。长到十八九岁上，酷爱男风，最厌女子。这也是前生冤孽，可巧遇见这拐子卖丫头，他便一眼看上了这丫头，立意买来作妾，立誓再不交结接男子，也不再娶第二个了，所以三日后方过门。谁晓这拐子又偷卖与了薛家，他意欲卷了两家银子，再逃往他省；谁知又不曾走脱，两家拿住，打了个臭死，都不肯收银，只要领人。那薛家公子岂是让人的，便喝着手下人一打，将冯公子打了个稀烂，抬回家去，三日死了。这薛公子原是早已择定日子上京去的，头起身两日前，就偶然遇见了这丫头，意欲买了就进京的，谁知闹出这事来。既打了冯公子，夺了丫头，他便没事人一般，只管带了家眷走他的路。他这里自有兄弟奴仆在此料理，并不为此些些小事值得他一逃走的。这且别说，老爷你当被卖的丫头是谁？”',
    hash='sha256:c6190abe4c85367ddb461c3efc10e8f9e2ac25c6089fd2a5f7e38f6d8c270f16'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0823',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=109,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=24426,
    end_offset=24431,
    text_slice='雨村笑道：',
    hash='sha256:84ca15199f57adea5d1a601b41a4e01b6ad2a4381bf33df89821ebd9557b3911'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0824',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=109,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=24431,
    end_offset=24439,
    text_slice='“我如何得知。”',
    hash='sha256:1d248f1a266ca92f55e516153c39559410537844bebe6d43cb70440bf0bcf674'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0825',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=109,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=24439,
    end_offset=24445,
    text_slice='门子冷笑道：',
    hash='sha256:f6d9633c190c2a7325b3b77b1f200bb9722b3a14440686a0af6c5f896c04b8e8'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0826',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=109,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=24445,
    end_offset=24483,
    text_slice='“这人算来还是老爷的大恩人呢！她就是葫芦庙旁住的甄老爷的小姐，名唤英莲的。”',
    hash='sha256:84398eba409b9573c9332afdbf6d92d22285a41253c2b6940db99fc66e19a6f6'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0827',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=109,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=24483,
    end_offset=24489,
    text_slice='雨村罕然道：',
    hash='sha256:ede0e09e1cc218e4d2f13c9619cbf7e9b493728ea4ab2a03205439450f0f68b6'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0828',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=109,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=24489,
    end_offset=24516,
    text_slice='“原来就是她！闻得养至五岁被人拐去，却如今才来卖呢？”',
    hash='sha256:8ba1c9c67b6277df56548d01479f71acd8727d7d27194f708c1b146a070f44bf'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0829',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=110,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=24518,
    end_offset=24566,
    text_slice='门子道：“这一种拐子单管偷拐五六岁的儿女，养在一个僻静之处，到十一二岁，度其容貌，带至他乡转卖。',
    hash='sha256:0ffa68852f697fa3074852a080b6004e025309d65172a042d7b285ff01bdbd97'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0830',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=110,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=24566,
    end_offset=24627,
    text_slice='当日，这英莲我们天天哄她玩耍；虽隔了七八年，如今十二三岁的光景，其模样虽然出脱得齐整好些，然大概相貌，自是不改，熟人易认。',
    hash='sha256:1936eb409ae57891176ec3829b102069e9d382660c11627322fb0dc6e1fb4b5b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0831',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=110,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=24627,
    end_offset=24660,
    text_slice='况且他眉心中原有米粒大小的一点胭脂痣，从胎里带来的，所以我却认得。',
    hash='sha256:8367b44fb3ed0a4f26a63507d26436b3a6f1fea608f09c26c348c58cf67ae56c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0832',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=110,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=24660,
    end_offset=24675,
    text_slice='偏生这拐子又租了我的房舍居住。',
    hash='sha256:47b9096efe2b6f67deae2cf8b40df203b1c716803e1f4b82fd9a2e32101d22fb'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0833',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=110,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=24675,
    end_offset=24690,
    text_slice='那日，拐子不在家，我也曾问她。',
    hash='sha256:a201fdc90039a648d000bca765722e688fa6aeb5adbbef015e6c65507a6c939f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0834',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=110,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=24690,
    end_offset=24724,
    text_slice='她是被拐子打怕了的，万不敢说，只说拐子系她亲爹，因无钱偿债，故卖她。',
    hash='sha256:842c89b5aa5f7f73895f5a5cc0cd3d2913803e0d4b353088226005f137866b3c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0835',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=110,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=24724,
    end_offset=24750,
    text_slice='我又哄之再四，她又哭了，只说：‘我原不记得小时之事。',
    hash='sha256:fd2121fabccee96e2a385a4382f1c347d8ef89f279484812aa3d9642411da28c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0836',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=110,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=24750,
    end_offset=24757,
    text_slice='’这可无疑了！',
    hash='sha256:2f5984be8f999a1d3adffd9b16b9a24bbe0b87a738ed66968cace710c8cb889d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0837',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=110,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=24757,
    end_offset=24791,
    text_slice='那日冯公子相看了，兑了银子，拐子醉了，她自叹道：‘我今日罪孽可满了！',
    hash='sha256:2bef43c659188ab4860211fcd123fb4db21e66016d3495f0156787622faee9d5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0838',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=110,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=24791,
    end_offset=24818,
    text_slice='’后又听得冯公子令三日之后才娶过门，她又转有忧愁之态。',
    hash='sha256:714ab92a070ab3583e4c4e55f9ac9e0a885aeaa529aaedae4a7a7cfb72999bfd'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0839',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=110,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=24818,
    end_offset=24864,
    text_slice='我又不忍其形景，等拐子出去，又命内人去解释她：‘这冯公子必待好日期来接，可知必不以丫鬟相看。',
    hash='sha256:653700c3baf139c43d7890a2edc4f82ed72604d5150ee4dda6c1ab4aed48fc35'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0840',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=110,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=24864,
    end_offset=24903,
    text_slice='况他是个绝风流人品，家里颇过得，素习又最厌恶堂客，今竟破价买你，后事不言可知。',
    hash='sha256:3dd336f263eaf9b30d8266bbd245768c9aa773113f90cee6800f3c01a51cab9c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0841',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=110,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=24903,
    end_offset=24915,
    text_slice='只耐得三两日，何必忧闷！',
    hash='sha256:c1c00ca6222e58ef6a4599988304716e11d3ff2308ee4e2a845b04f093a1b511'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0842',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=110,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=24915,
    end_offset=24936,
    text_slice='’她听如此说，方才略解忧闷，自为从此得所。',
    hash='sha256:b671cf983f171b360e150fa7476257167fde1a8e3f05e0090783ce0c3fc0f7e1'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0843',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=110,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=24936,
    end_offset=24962,
    text_slice='谁料天下竟有这等不如意事，第二日，她偏又卖与了薛家。',
    hash='sha256:ac20ee5a8f77bf8e63cbe602d5a684da1ff5164b96061e1bd8c512976342c970'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0844',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=110,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=24962,
    end_offset=25037,
    text_slice='若卖与第二个人还好，这薛公子的混名人称‘呆霸王’，最是天下第一个弄性尚气的人，而且使钱如土，遂打了个落花流水，生拖死拽，把个英莲拖去，如今也不知死活。',
    hash='sha256:34879d1f783addfe3851151cb15b7ae02fc19270a7c7379d48c5e2712e94998c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0845',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=110,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=25037,
    end_offset=25065,
    text_slice='这冯公子空喜一场，一念未遂，反花了钱，送了命，岂不可叹！',
    hash='sha256:c9ee342c8d2c2da4cfd4bad97ecc6ccc7171bcc50c23e339c9d14e421a6dff38'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0846',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=111,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=25068,
    end_offset=25077,
    text_slice='雨村听了，亦叹道：',
    hash='sha256:ffd3bf56cba988eaa13a9107f2107040ce441ce62e4d6469ee2c9888213f6c0b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0847',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=111,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=25077,
    end_offset=25235,
    text_slice='“这也是他们的孽障遭遇，亦非偶然。这冯渊如何偏只看准了这英莲？这英莲受了拐子这几年折磨，才得了个头路，且又是个多情的，若能聚合了，倒是件美事，偏又生出这段事来。这薛家纵比冯家富贵，想其为人，自然姬妾众多，淫佚无度，未必及冯渊定情于一人者。这正是梦幻情缘，恰遇一对薄命儿女。且不要议论他，只目今这官司，如何剖断才好？”',
    hash='sha256:8d55a650177c049c0c3fc50b1d004dcdc60913de5e6eaecd8ee6272fef2d7a44'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0848',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=111,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=25235,
    end_offset=25240,
    text_slice='门子笑道：',
    hash='sha256:815747d686248bc45ade9b98324d58cc616847adc13d3a527c6e2e2269e7e6a7'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0849',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=111,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=25240,
    end_offset=25329,
    text_slice='“老爷当年何等明决，今日何反成个没主意的人了！小的闻得老爷补升此任，亦系贾府、王府之力；此薛蟠即贾府之亲，老爷何不顺水行舟，作个整人情，将此案了结，日后也好去见贾、王二公的面。”',
    hash='sha256:d47005158ce858f668d8c8ea8df8075851a2181d2d1481c03bba5ee13973f2c7'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0850',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=111,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=25329,
    end_offset=25333,
    text_slice='雨村道：',
    hash='sha256:a9987f745f066fcafb0033381b00553509b51e3b23b1e13d3aaa9502b2dd926e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0851',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=111,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=25333,
    end_offset=25395,
    text_slice='“你说的何尝不是。但事关人命，蒙皇上隆恩，起复委用，实是重生再造，正当殚心竭力图报之时，岂可因私而废法！是我实不能忍为者。”',
    hash='sha256:dc5093f57a10f072ed75a397cadd8fed70abfc6b3c350534d9e5aae9e1dbbfa8'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0852',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=111,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=25395,
    end_offset=25404,
    text_slice='门子听了，冷笑道：',
    hash='sha256:660dd98e4898aa6d5906a28c4e0bcf0bdce76c0ab36f264d79aa350ceacf0103'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0853',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=111,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=25404,
    end_offset=25492,
    text_slice='“老爷说的何尝不是大道理，但只是如今世上是行不去的。岂不闻古人有云：‘大丈夫相时而动’，又曰‘趋吉避凶者为君子’。依老爷这一说，不但不能报效朝廷，亦且自身不保，还要三思为妥。”',
    hash='sha256:9a62bac248156f48301b5188778937a35b6d2822dfff47781a89ebbf151466f9'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0854',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=112,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=25494,
    end_offset=25506,
    text_slice='雨村低了半日头，方说道：',
    hash='sha256:71e3e49438e233d4fccfe91e0143dfb1104af12c59855414fd3dc9000cb143d0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0855',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=112,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=25506,
    end_offset=25514,
    text_slice='“依你怎么样？”',
    hash='sha256:90bb19b4f0645196bf98f0e0a35e9b31dc704060eab5b73956d54dd26099b859'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0856',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=112,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=25514,
    end_offset=25518,
    text_slice='门子道：',
    hash='sha256:4cbb298275f3ffb4d10180d36239ae754b590cbb084921f5c677bfb370bc0d5c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0857',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=112,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=25518,
    end_offset=25853,
    text_slice='“小人已想了个极好的主意在此：老爷明日坐堂，只管虚张声势，动文书，发签拿人。原凶自然是拿不来的，原告固是定要，自然将薛家族中及奴仆人等拿几个来拷问。小的在暗中调停，令他们报个暴病身亡，令族中及地方上共递一张保呈。老爷只说善能扶鸾请仙，堂上设下乩坛，令军民人等只管来看。老爷就说：‘乩仙批了，死者冯渊与薛蟠原因夙孽相逢，今狭路既遇，原应了结。薛蟠今已得了无名之病，被冯魂追索已死。其祸皆因拐子某人而起，拐之人原系某乡某姓人氏，按法处治，余不略及’等语。小人暗中嘱托拐子，令其实招。众人见乩仙批语与拐子相符，余者自然也都不虚了。薛家有的是钱，老爷断一千也可，五百也可，与冯家作烧埋之费。那冯家也无甚要紧的人，不过为的是钱，见有了这个银子，想来也就无话了。老爷细想此计如何？”',
    hash='sha256:5ae7964cbd0c172cd642b205bed5c9d0399810a9c171c38d1eb49aa581f35191'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0858',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=112,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=25853,
    end_offset=25858,
    text_slice='雨村笑道：',
    hash='sha256:84ca15199f57adea5d1a601b41a4e01b6ad2a4381bf33df89821ebd9557b3911'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0859',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=112,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=25858,
    end_offset=25881,
    text_slice='“不妥，不妥。等我再斟酌斟酌，或可压服口声。”',
    hash='sha256:569bd2759fdc6c01d8201054086723374ea466b44d3c4144462648e8e4bdcb10'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0860',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=112,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=25881,
    end_offset=25896,
    text_slice='二人计议，天色已晚，别无话说。',
    hash='sha256:679ee8439ef907e345ffba742daf6739fd9a6f2641f1d142ba2c6d88a4801902'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0861',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=113,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=25898,
    end_offset=25921,
    text_slice='至次日，坐堂，勾取一应有名人犯，雨村详加审问。',
    hash='sha256:8cf2f642a760aadf5f421863ae6c8c649691453e5a20c518d2e2e9289b871bc0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0862',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=113,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=25921,
    end_offset=25943,
    text_slice='果见冯家人口稀疏，不过赖此欲多得些烧埋之费。',
    hash='sha256:cdbe92d330829761d6e1ecc3831d074cab3fc1e4d404285c24d1b9cbac19d0b8'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0863',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=113,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=25943,
    end_offset=25962,
    text_slice='薛家仗势倚情，偏不相让，故致颠倒未决。',
    hash='sha256:b063e0c257e5275b5279515994d9e2043f3cfeace816bd5be5e10549395e7d69'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0864',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=113,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=25962,
    end_offset=25978,
    text_slice='雨村便徇情枉法，胡乱判断了此案。',
    hash='sha256:6e37f072e2ce067bc06202dbf9c4a4267672ab0ef57ff7ad049e76d5d0c60989'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0865',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=113,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=25978,
    end_offset=25997,
    text_slice='冯家得了许多烧埋银子，也就无甚话说了。',
    hash='sha256:27acb89cbe800fc9ae99ded5d921430d80b68cb9561b20bc73b29c345490ed8b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0866',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=113,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=25997,
    end_offset=26044,
    text_slice='雨村断了此案，急忙作书信二封，与贾政并京营节度使王子腾，不过说“令甥之事已完，不必过虑”等语。',
    hash='sha256:79af6ce2c3cde135610e992a8be38e82a504be2f4eee063cba4f73ae5c47fb8a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0867',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=113,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=26044,
    end_offset=26108,
    text_slice='此事皆由葫芦庙内之沙弥新门子所出，雨村又恐他对人说出当日贫贱时的事来，因此心中大不乐业，后来到底寻了个不是，远远的充发了他才罢。',
    hash='sha256:faa96bab8784c5aa721e8b647b30e4b2d1b693ba916f0ae42579086627433a3a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0868',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=114,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=26110,
    end_offset=26118,
    text_slice='当下言不着雨村。',
    hash='sha256:2f2bc83177d8e17f41f6b3bbc6e78df6b2dc461e931b9e8748924ba418d860c8'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0869',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=114,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=26118,
    end_offset=26151,
    text_slice='且说那买了英莲、打死冯渊的薛公子，亦系金陵人氏，本是书香继世之家。',
    hash='sha256:31e77cced169c21139414e26190280074449a3facbefd28ec8e6a6d2a0223d8c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0870',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=114,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=26151,
    end_offset=26213,
    text_slice='只是如今这薛公子幼年丧父，寡母又怜他是个独根孤种，未免溺爱纵容些，遂至老大无成；且家中有百万之富，现领着内帑钱粮，采办杂料。',
    hash='sha256:589b54f4cd9079ad6ed7bb87bb46dfed661dd07f824193c82a585449cf4a7b17'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0871',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=114,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=26213,
    end_offset=26244,
    text_slice='这薛公子学名薛蟠，表字文龙，今方十有五岁上性情奢侈，言语傲慢。',
    hash='sha256:bf0f45401a88889543022e668acdeca79b15e23b29809bfb34520746ebd6d241'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0872',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=114,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=26244,
    end_offset=26273,
    text_slice='虽也上过学，不过略识几字，终日惟有斗鸡走马，游山玩景而已。',
    hash='sha256:0f5d9aed5c9d8d01d50d9e8f32e3fe0cbea465bfd99356390df4f83605d2bcf2'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0873',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=114,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=26273,
    end_offset=26328,
    text_slice='虽是皇商，一应经济世事，全然不知，不过赖祖父旧日的情分，户部挂虚名，支领钱粮，其余事体，自有伙计老家人等措办。',
    hash='sha256:c31f071cf7cace23e38e7e293d6928855b2e8f75b404bd348a1b0586d0021644'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0874',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=114,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=26328,
    end_offset=26368,
    text_slice='寡母王氏，乃现任京营节度使王子腾之妹，与荣国府贾政的夫人王氏，是一母所生的姊妹。',
    hash='sha256:f2a38bf48e5668d74429b391a2c18f9ee07c083ee630cdcfbf2ac9189da0fd6e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0875',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=114,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=26368,
    end_offset=26414,
    text_slice='今年方四十上下年纪，只有薛蟠一子；还有一女，比薛蟠小两岁，乳名宝钗，生得肌骨莹润，举止娴雅。',
    hash='sha256:b2c5b035ad3987a5b7199a05602dec091ea517cfaf28b283bf0fd4d677ec94aa'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0876',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=114,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=26414,
    end_offset=26445,
    text_slice='当日有她父亲在日，酷爱此女，令其读书识字，较之乃兄竟高过十倍。',
    hash='sha256:b1a5eb8a4440d04bbe339100aaea96a3c2c77baba23b3537aad0d18057d32512'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0877',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=114,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=26445,
    end_offset=26490,
    text_slice='自父亲死后，见哥哥不能依体贴母怀，她便不以书字为事，只留心针黹家计等事，好为母亲分忧解劳。',
    hash='sha256:9bf05068f4ab27acc88d02bc07d3855d8c84160d5386a89da76e20c12d0d219f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0878',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=114,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=26490,
    end_offset=26557,
    text_slice='近因今上崇诗尚礼，征采才能，降不世出之隆恩，除聘选妃嫔外，凡世宦名家之女，皆亲名达部，以备选为公主、郡主入学陪侍，充为才人、赞善之职。',
    hash='sha256:111eb60e624dbbb58f3aed1ded7e8b2adb86181b1554547ae972a2824b20eb1c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0879',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=114,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=26557,
    end_offset=26618,
    text_slice='二则自薛蟠父亲死后，各省中所有的买卖承局、总管、伙计人等，见薛蟠年轻，不谙世事，便趁时拐骗起来，京都中几处生意，渐亦消耗。',
    hash='sha256:358ca10a4916f14b710472c50cadc7ed90a0651e1b9b95a2a1c19900286b4946'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0880',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=114,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=26618,
    end_offset=26686,
    text_slice='薛蟠素闻得都中乃第一繁华之地，正思一游，便趁此机会，一为送妹待选，二为望亲，三因亲自入部销算旧帐，再计新支，其实，则为游览上国风光之意。',
    hash='sha256:dbabe0744a33450df0f74cf4806ba9c5cea3088525ae8b8ef3a14b9ba6945175'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0881',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=114,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=26686,
    end_offset=26733,
    text_slice='因此，早已打点下行装细软，以及馈送亲友各色土物人情等类，正择日已定，不想偏遇见了拐子重卖英莲。',
    hash='sha256:b16e077ab555f6080253b55b9c1db0c467ccc4194579e28a383616cba651845f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0882',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=114,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=26733,
    end_offset=26771,
    text_slice='薛蟠见英莲生得不俗，立意买了，又遇冯家来夺人，因恃强喝令手下豪奴将冯渊打死。',
    hash='sha256:b6fc9f85f4846cb45b2bdee7ddf320f8eefdc4ca3a08dcdf9c0112a846272f15'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0883',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=114,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=26771,
    end_offset=26806,
    text_slice='他便将家中事务嘱了族中人并几个老家人，他便同了母妹等竟自起身长行去了。',
    hash='sha256:8da2fb11ed14ec40be1ace732a320ed49b138da4f8ebfdf404440c0b0e9fb906'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0884',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=114,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=26806,
    end_offset=26835,
    text_slice='人命官司一事，他却视为儿戏，自为花上几个臭钱，没有不了的。',
    hash='sha256:04f336a8cae5856b70ce874c14cbafd0fc4143480cf1a3fcd0740310f8df9141'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0885',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=115,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=26837,
    end_offset=26844,
    text_slice='在路不记其日。',
    hash='sha256:39a303e4185a8875e5972474031f0f18b962614009c9e11e14aa3f300803ab99'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0886',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=115,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=26844,
    end_offset=26876,
    text_slice='那日，已将入都时，却又闻得母舅王子腾升了九省统制，奉旨出都查边。',
    hash='sha256:cd0431e544ed2b7f2013633e21c1f0bf38d9e3cc379756611c46b8f4cca67aa6'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0887',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=115,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=26884,
    end_offset=26928,
    text_slice='“我正愁进京去有个嫡亲的母舅管辖着，不能任意挥霍挥霍，偏如今又升出去了，可知天从人愿。”',
    hash='sha256:756ece983ec79ff5aa19386b1a60e950270629780352431effbeb79457035b7b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0888',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=115,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=26928,
    end_offset=26936,
    text_slice='因和母亲商议道：',
    hash='sha256:0d848845c67d85efa56f4cfd70cc5c5fc69a1fb3a9e8a9bec3608c8d5cf6a5bc'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0889',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=115,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=26936,
    end_offset=26991,
    text_slice='“咱们京中虽有几处房舍，只是这十来年没人进京居住，那看守的人未免偷着租赁与人，须得先着几个人去打扫收拾才好。”',
    hash='sha256:5abd9d39615ce6b7c1279308293e0c15468162082a21eafa1429c3c3ba847dbd'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0890',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=115,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=26991,
    end_offset=26996,
    text_slice='他母亲道：',
    hash='sha256:1dc05f2a47f3509a25f3c6ba698e4c55f902ca40e5f95eeafbf1f29af350eb3c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0891',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=115,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=26996,
    end_offset=27071,
    text_slice='“何必如此招摇！咱们这一进京，原是先拜望亲友，或是在你舅舅家，或是你姨爹家。他两家的房舍极是方便的，咱们先能着住下，再慢慢的着人去收拾，岂不消停些！”',
    hash='sha256:1f58f9673afc293994ddebefb799b23ef86295e455c33eebe6984070f4c1aa06'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0892',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=115,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=27071,
    end_offset=27075,
    text_slice='薛蟠道：',
    hash='sha256:f1f41f2fafb04647cb672eb408b6a9d42bcf0b06dcb780c67b1b07084441eba0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0893',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=115,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=27075,
    end_offset=27119,
    text_slice='“如今舅舅正升了外省去，家里自然忙乱起身，咱们这工夫反一窝一拖的奔了去，岂不没眼色些？”',
    hash='sha256:484b41cfc0a1fb928c3c711590e9143440a9ebe349c2e0b462f8176b74dd44dc'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0894',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=115,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=27119,
    end_offset=27124,
    text_slice='他母亲道：',
    hash='sha256:1dc05f2a47f3509a25f3c6ba698e4c55f902ca40e5f95eeafbf1f29af350eb3c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0895',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=115,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=27124,
    end_offset=27310,
    text_slice='“你舅舅家虽升了去，还有你姨爹家。况这几年来，你舅舅、姨娘两处，每每带信捎书，接咱们来，如今既来了，你舅舅虽忙着起身，你贾家姨娘未必不苦留我们。咱们且忙忙收拾房屋，岂不使人见怪？你的意思我却知道：守着舅舅、姨爹住着，未免拘紧了你，不如你各自住着，好任意施为的。你既如此，你自去挑所宅子去住，我和你姨娘姊妹们别了这几年，却要厮守几日，我带了你妹子投你姨娘家去，你道好不好？”',
    hash='sha256:b30822607e8ceb889cb1d2d35f32a13ed584f99dbb85fb330289b903c5ddefd3'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0896',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=115,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=27310,
    end_offset=27340,
    text_slice='薛蟠见母亲如此说，情知扭不过的，只得吩咐人夫一路奔荣国府来。',
    hash='sha256:aa5cdfabffb8cd0a196813d02a16fb05c3355db7489d090a54bd6c406926bfd8'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0897',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=116,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=27342,
    end_offset=27373,
    text_slice='那时，王夫人已知薛蟠官司一事，亏贾雨村就中维持了结，才放了心。',
    hash='sha256:330ccc549a2d808d3c17811b6f0d101beaab99676e91ee9c3fd902ee41ba3cc6'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0898',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=116,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=27373,
    end_offset=27400,
    text_slice='又见哥哥升了边缺，正愁又少了娘家的亲戚来往，更加寂寞。',
    hash='sha256:195ac3c529b7eb3e8d2c8896220c934da1fa0349df20372d4db2f0abe5d31dd3'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0899',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=116,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=27400,
    end_offset=27434,
    text_slice='过了几日，忽家人传报：“姨太太带了哥儿姐儿，合家进京，正在门外下车。',
    hash='sha256:a0bbda9c802e8590bbf6ff0db3a57f6b60bef67b96b790619b2ed28d25ad82cc'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0900',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=116,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=27434,
    end_offset=27464,
    text_slice='”喜得王夫人忙带了媳妇、女儿等接出大厅，将薛姨妈等接了进来。',
    hash='sha256:9e94d7a0ef8cd69502a5c677784d851fa5b7398c845f9611ad476f9782db94f4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0901',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=116,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=27464,
    end_offset=27482,
    text_slice='姊妹们暮年相会，自不必说，悲喜交集。',
    hash='sha256:e447d7247b8e665a11d0145705600d88be282e638df69619c27919467e5fab08'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0902',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=116,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=27482,
    end_offset=27509,
    text_slice='泣笑叙阔一番，忙又引了拜见贾母，将人情土物各种酬献了。',
    hash='sha256:489c813c023def8cf61eb904979d7df12a0e54a69229ca186b7c277d6c00ab16'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0903',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=116,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=27509,
    end_offset=27523,
    text_slice='合家俱厮见过，忙又治席接风。',
    hash='sha256:85de272a39eddc2e0e55b70fa19c292ff50ec69b23379aed6a15c27e209bee78'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0904',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=117,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=27525,
    end_offset=27549,
    text_slice='薛蟠已拜见过贾政，贾琏又引着拜见了贾赦、贾珍等。',
    hash='sha256:19880ef83adce27ed1dc9c8bde3173e3a63c0c02c148f8a81c806d65c2d3c2be'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0905',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=117,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=27562,
    end_offset=27634,
    text_slice='“姨太太已有了春秋，外甥年轻不知世路，在外住着，恐有人生事。咱们东北角上梨香院一所十来间房，白空闲着，赶着打扫了，请姨太太和哥儿姐儿住了甚好。”',
    hash='sha256:1964edddde7bca26d7d45df8aff65e154d29681290aa457b9acb4268db50e42f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0906',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=117,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=27634,
    end_offset=27650,
    text_slice='王夫人未及留，贾母也就遣人来说：',
    hash='sha256:b1391a83898c883e19299a0fa4f2ad8fafb69f2915d9055fcc82e942e65947b7'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0907',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=117,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=27650,
    end_offset=27668,
    text_slice='“请姨太太就在这里住下，大家亲密些”',
    hash='sha256:0db3038344b06d46066ae960cf04bf54f3834a82e7feb134f414c73c665a69be'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0908',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=117,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=27668,
    end_offset=27671,
    text_slice='等语。',
    hash='sha256:ff844b1dd96842e1626f4d58932f22a117191c59fa71959d33caeda92b7df9ec'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0909',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=117,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=27671,
    end_offset=27709,
    text_slice='薛姨妈正要同居一处，方可拘紧些儿，若另住在外，又恐他纵性惹祸，遂忙道谢应允。',
    hash='sha256:7fbc483415012005b5187a8d67374800554538c775a5e577bae056e9a1f5452c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0910',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=117,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=27718,
    end_offset=27739,
    text_slice='“一应日费供给，一概免却，方是处常之法。”',
    hash='sha256:b5638ae98a28847cb457f92bb68ec3ebc56d87b4903bf311d3047d0d1ec4af09'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0911',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=117,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=27739,
    end_offset=27756,
    text_slice='王夫人知她家不难于此，遂亦从其愿。',
    hash='sha256:360f6ec230e41d75aa1654dc28b7bc660f48ee574cacf6d6e5d3182bb37142d4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0912',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=117,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=27756,
    end_offset=27772,
    text_slice='从此后，薛家母子就在梨香院住了。',
    hash='sha256:d2143f2f1e60904f51db222e5d89e39a2c51cb8944ee645fc143c254ee973d40'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0913',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=118,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=27774,
    end_offset=27813,
    text_slice='原来这梨香院即乃当日荣公暮年养静之所，小小巧巧，约有十余间房屋，前厅后舍俱全。',
    hash='sha256:49dae17210c94ececa4099d15ac17b32848a79b8faf343f868efad7db29ad405'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0914',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=118,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=27813,
    end_offset=27831,
    text_slice='另有一门通街，薛蟠家人就走此门出入。',
    hash='sha256:6e7f49cdd4bfd65600a21b043df992f522faea263cb99d0e3101a38054db90ab'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0915',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=118,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=27831,
    end_offset=27860,
    text_slice='西南有一角门，通一夹道，出了夹道，便是王夫人正房的东院了。',
    hash='sha256:374a4ee2d8a34a890f426955683c7c64bc801620f3c4f5a7333b7177e2494f68'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0916',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=118,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=27860,
    end_offset=27892,
    text_slice='每日或饭后，或晚间，薛姨妈便过来，或与贾母闲谈，或与王夫人相叙。',
    hash='sha256:8886a46caa327cafa110c7b81959d9970c894f84b055684f15eb5c8e53284fd3'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0917',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=118,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=27892,
    end_offset=27925,
    text_slice='宝钗日与黛玉、迎春姊妹等一处，或看书下棋，或作针黹，倒也十分乐业。',
    hash='sha256:a1d7b642dfe70c98df6f5807fe98b02ff3b5d225ce6ce163d8d8c17033e4fc7f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0918',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=118,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=27925,
    end_offset=28008,
    text_slice='只是薛蟠起初之心，原不欲在贾宅居住者，生恐姨父管约拘禁，料必不自在的；无奈母亲执意在此，且要宅中又十分殷勤苦留，只得暂且住下；一面使人打扫出自己的房屋，再移居过去的。',
    hash='sha256:5be1b02d91a39b30e0bd7949eec4d5954d74a1bde17d0e303942da8b9c97412a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0919',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=118,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=28008,
    end_offset=28059,
    text_slice='谁知自在此间住了不上一月的光景，贾宅族中凡有的子侄，俱已认熟了一半，凡是那些纨气习者，莫不喜与他来往。',
    hash='sha256:823a8c07f84559920cd6b98dd667ae0450d96bbe6468cc24b5b3f0bcece2468e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0920',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=118,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=28059,
    end_offset=28097,
    text_slice='今日会酒，明日观花，甚至聚赌嫖娼，渐渐无所不至，引诱得薛蟠比当日更坏了十倍。',
    hash='sha256:f55c7c51a77b7166f370483e61760739ec2496ab520a3985301a50ce55c65b4f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0921',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=118,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=28097,
    end_offset=28201,
    text_slice='虽然贾政训子有方，治家有法，一则族大人多，照管不到这些；二则现任族长乃是贾珍，彼乃宁府长孙，又现袭职，凡族中事，自有他掌管；三则公私冗杂，且素性潇洒，不以俗务为要，每公暇之时，不过看书着棋而已，余事多不介意。',
    hash='sha256:28d0cef0a68ceef99d817443de68633db5f403c7918db14e2f2cc6ea7618eeef'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0922',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=118,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=28201,
    end_offset=28245,
    text_slice='况且这梨香院相隔两层房舍，又有街门另开，任意可以出入，所以这些子弟们竟可以放意畅怀的闹。',
    hash='sha256:77f3377ee9a0ea7a9037b621fee0f25d958c62f8529f5df40fbeca88fab97a69'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0923',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=118,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=28245,
    end_offset=28260,
    text_slice='因此，遂将移居之念渐渐打灭了。',
    hash='sha256:463b30ce45a30d2bb583e2f79f5a8077de55265c1861f50e860911db4e0e92ef'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0924',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=118,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=28260,
    end_offset=28272,
    text_slice='要知端的，且听下回分解。',
    hash='sha256:5abd5dab26755e7093185410c7174251c7834b09157c4de42f50724a986829ad'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0925',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=119,
    segment_type='heading',
    start_offset=28274,
    end_offset=28297,
    text_slice='第五回  游幻境指迷十二钗  饮仙醪曲演红楼梦',
    hash='sha256:59cebef9529a11b8bb2bd1254ae8dc7d9880a7fa2ef764ab3e622960cbf1f713'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0926',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=120,
    segment_type='heading',
    start_offset=28299,
    end_offset=28330,
    text_slice='第四回中既将薛家母子在荣府内寄居等事略已表明，此回则暂不能写矣',
    hash='sha256:8026d94f1f9e509141c8315f875ad1c3ea930e644c44887696d42a23adf4ecef'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0927',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=121,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=28332,
    end_offset=28381,
    text_slice='如今且说林黛玉自在荣府以来，贾母万般怜爱，寝食起居，一如宝玉、迎春、探春、惜春三个亲孙女倒且靠后。',
    hash='sha256:83c3697a254d1a4ff71148fefd9e7624a62a78619a97a86d4a52fd92b4be1113'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0928',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=121,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=28381,
    end_offset=28430,
    text_slice='便是宝玉和黛玉二人之亲密友爱，亦自较别个不同，日则同行同坐，夜则同息同止，真是言和意顺，略无参商。',
    hash='sha256:25664fc2326bb0fefa27e08731f7f70b0519231a64432b063eb6a92c0bf4a270'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0929',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=121,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=28430,
    end_offset=28471,
    text_slice='不想如今忽然来了一个薛宝钗，年岁虽大不多，然品格端方，容貌丰美，人多谓黛玉所不及。',
    hash='sha256:804a0f83ce59ecdf727660117f59befbb5ec12bb3e43ec85e645e41a988550a2'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0930',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=121,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=28471,
    end_offset=28510,
    text_slice='而且宝钗行为豁达，随分从时，不比黛玉孤高自许，目无下尘，故比黛玉大得下人之心。',
    hash='sha256:a0902f8191ac92503862c528c074e2cbaea8feb0a8aac26b7c45e7917286f5e7'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0931',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=121,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=28510,
    end_offset=28530,
    text_slice='便是那些小丫头子们，亦多喜与宝钗去玩笑。',
    hash='sha256:7888fa186c3d228009e8558401ac2b283f6d2d5ce6e347b9848e1fcf2c445c21'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0932',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=121,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=28530,
    end_offset=28554,
    text_slice='因此黛玉心中便有些悒郁不忿之意，宝钗却浑然不觉。',
    hash='sha256:8cbca52d04131d5fea8870f602aa29db8b063673108f9709c9aa2ec482adc0c3'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0933',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=121,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=28554,
    end_offset=28598,
    text_slice='那宝玉亦在孩提之间，况自天性所禀来的一片愚拙偏僻，视姊妹弟兄皆出一体，并无亲疏远近之别。',
    hash='sha256:19029124dd3a19103d982609cebe2709ed5cb96e1a17612ef22dcf5f59ec9ce7'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0934',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=121,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=28598,
    end_offset=28624,
    text_slice='其中因与黛玉同随贾母一处坐卧，故略比别个姊妹熟惯些。',
    hash='sha256:0b28fc92ee5f7a576c143cdaa21ce053f1bdc720e86595a80d076e7a14af7e6f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0935',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=121,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=28624,
    end_offset=28654,
    text_slice='既熟惯，则更觉亲密；既亲密，则不免一时有求全之毁，不虞之隙。',
    hash='sha256:5673a5096da328932916672b6be2e9719a97216de94d6188020347eda637bfd0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0936',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=121,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=28654,
    end_offset=28711,
    text_slice='这日不知为何，他二人言语有些不合起来，黛玉又气的独在房中垂泪，宝玉又自悔言语冒撞，前去俯就，那黛玉方渐渐的回转来。',
    hash='sha256:3e066ae70efba196363ecd2ddec7de926af8ff80dfa6986c74d67a0c298b4b26'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0937',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=122,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=28713,
    end_offset=28752,
    text_slice='因东边宁府中花园内梅花盛开，贾珍之妻尤氏乃治酒，请贾母、邢夫人、王夫人等赏花。',
    hash='sha256:b7d7d2556280a23ee8f74308bcf7d5743a5557484ddc0f093390b31da81d2de8'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0938',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=122,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=28752,
    end_offset=28768,
    text_slice='是日，先携了贾蓉之妻二人来面请。',
    hash='sha256:47d65bfcb9491b9befc7579745c90c356b341360ce01ff68444fd157baf86fe5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0939',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=122,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=28768,
    end_offset=28818,
    text_slice='贾母等于早饭后过来，就在会芳园游玩，先茶后酒，不过皆是宁、荣二府女眷家宴小集，并无别样新文趣事可记。',
    hash='sha256:f9437422064c62703ffcd6536215a8f8b285c79700d393a10e239a4b16f99a9c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0940',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=123,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=28820,
    end_offset=28832,
    text_slice='一时宝玉倦怠，欲睡中觉。',
    hash='sha256:995c720dcc29b056329a38a9104ed5b0452b16a193c323b737a05b9acc831e81'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0941',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=123,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=28832,
    end_offset=28848,
    text_slice='贾母命人好生哄着，歇息一回再来。',
    hash='sha256:4b29e7117aa5f8b9fdb8e62eeb1496096055f57920c6b9154c5fb05473db6d2a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0942',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=123,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=28860,
    end_offset=28892,
    text_slice='“我们这里有给宝叔收拾下的屋子，老祖宗放心，只管交与我就是了。”',
    hash='sha256:c75ea3abc7a5ee266f86816683692115e4bc23928d2433387e8336a9650db9e5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0943',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=123,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=28892,
    end_offset=28905,
    text_slice='又向宝玉的奶娘、丫鬟等道：',
    hash='sha256:e717b5e7991e7adaa1405cfb041123e41eadc15789a5d4ad2ecf5d0d016937e1'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0944',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=123,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=28905,
    end_offset=28923,
    text_slice='“嬷嬷、姐姐们，请宝叔随我这里来！”',
    hash='sha256:326cf93fd36fd7a6dd7130b3c1627e9d3a111b0c9ce492bcac74d6bee521d8dd'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0945',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=123,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=28923,
    end_offset=28979,
    text_slice='贾母素知秦氏是个极妥当的人，生的袅娜纤巧，行事又温柔和平，乃重孙媳中第一个得意之人，见她去安置宝玉，自是安稳的。',
    hash='sha256:355095364aea8084e456629012697440f4c7927d762423c5ae187bfafc9cde49'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0946',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=124,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=28981,
    end_offset=28997,
    text_slice='当下秦氏引了一簇人来至上房内间。',
    hash='sha256:28398041766b1848b77eef86003b419b854ed59e7769a0e1a2970dde0d2fdd18'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0947',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=124,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=28997,
    end_offset=29046,
    text_slice='宝玉抬头看见一幅画贴在上面，画的人物固好，其故事乃是《燃藜图》，也不看系何人所画，心中便有些不快。',
    hash='sha256:56d8ad2e9cde3a77376cb87899c41a42d6fd27d8feb0807d466a0e3aba3aea48'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0948',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=125,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=29059,
    end_offset=29075,
    text_slice='世事洞明皆学问，人情练达即文章。',
    hash='sha256:dc37b38ec4c3704fb1359949317c526dc5dbaef1830a1b10e796fa5ec69c3f74'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0949',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=126,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=29077,
    end_offset=29106,
    text_slice='及看了这两句，纵然室宇精美，铺陈华丽，亦断断不肯在这里了。',
    hash='sha256:1bd02a75bafd492bee8c0b3b3a9d505a0351f39a4f514bd92f995bf8e2d874d4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0950',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=126,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=29109,
    end_offset=29119,
    text_slice='“快出去！快出去！”',
    hash='sha256:f2571059d631bc65d4cd91afd789a684cdb572c6713679f87cda4e6639b6b0cd'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0951',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=126,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=29119,
    end_offset=29126,
    text_slice='秦氏听了笑道：',
    hash='sha256:2df47ae85eed4666ca705d101cf8a23469055cf1e9a85769d44a965789fb2293'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0952',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=126,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=29126,
    end_offset=29151,
    text_slice='“这里还不好，可往那里去呢？不然，往我屋里去吧。”',
    hash='sha256:ccd11f440cbd6fd3b1a438894b73f278afaaf12f92f21602ad504d81614cf0d6'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0953',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=126,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=29151,
    end_offset=29158,
    text_slice='宝玉点头微笑。',
    hash='sha256:553730812c06830fc9762c38c1505674ca5ecc56b1fcd5a2390ce442d3d12565'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0954',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=126,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=29166,
    end_offset=29184,
    text_slice='“那里有个叔叔往侄儿房里睡觉的礼？”',
    hash='sha256:59a038c386c7a4157c77994c491d2d2a54a737a643b9c60074463181915f7337'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0955',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=126,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=29184,
    end_offset=29189,
    text_slice='秦氏笑道：',
    hash='sha256:a70e23eff568480f76a659e827bae8fd43220e1cb104bc33ac90efc58e622335'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0956',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=126,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=29189,
    end_offset=29253,
    text_slice='“嗳哟哟！不怕他恼。他能多大了，就忌讳这些个？上月你没看见我那个兄弟来了，虽然与宝叔同年，两个人若站在一处，只怕那个还高些呢。”',
    hash='sha256:bc785853885ee733fb946af8fc002562d72c6c8ea1c71e3649fbbf5ddd57c3a5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0957',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=126,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=29253,
    end_offset=29257,
    text_slice='宝玉道：',
    hash='sha256:10c9e1a43f0e2e5bf2e54f50fb3dbede512eb436326aec72d14625e62153e9b0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0958',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=126,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=29257,
    end_offset=29274,
    text_slice='“我怎么没见过？你带他来我瞧瞧。”',
    hash='sha256:971e2b9b38faf819f7697183d7a2bed138c19566565320990ba83e21c52672d4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0959',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=126,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=29274,
    end_offset=29279,
    text_slice='众人笑道：',
    hash='sha256:fec7ea0793d55abb41c663a1be418ec6593044408f49f0e8af795fbf821ce100'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0960',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=126,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=29279,
    end_offset=29300,
    text_slice='“隔着二三十里，哪里带去？见的日子有呢。”',
    hash='sha256:f5c8794561b8cf8376b419d7a86e3be9209a0b910d4886ad660a4657901ba968'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0961',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=126,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=29300,
    end_offset=29312,
    text_slice='说着，大家来至秦氏房中。',
    hash='sha256:fcc00c17be1c27b9a56b3b3a039995ed411bb1a55e237347b13861118f60baf2'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0962',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=126,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=29312,
    end_offset=29331,
    text_slice='刚至房门，便有一股细细的甜香袭了人来。',
    hash='sha256:2ace12045ca89befdfafa476d44e7f612e364c259d6b8f051f1d7e5533fea85f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0963',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=126,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=29344,
    end_offset=29349,
    text_slice='“好香！”',
    hash='sha256:a752c13f2a979c92506fd17cb8c989c74587a54420fca3d7034b9d5441aa3a20'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0964',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=126,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=29349,
    end_offset=29391,
    text_slice='入房向壁上看时，有唐伯虎画的《海棠春睡图》，两边有宋学士秦太虚写的一副对联，其联云：',
    hash='sha256:cbf1566b7cb56bb4de502f4fa665c2dd58c873c54bd2d62f296ee4587430d1df'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0965',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=127,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=29393,
    end_offset=29409,
    text_slice='嫩寒锁梦因春冷，芳气笼人是酒香。',
    hash='sha256:e10297551015904017ea759fae8f0a1acfdf432ca6f188f9b1dfc2295e37d8b6'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0966',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=128,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=29411,
    end_offset=29461,
    text_slice='案上设着武则天当日镜室中设的宝镜，一边摆着飞燕立着舞过的金盘，盘内盛着安禄山掷过，伤了太真乳的木瓜。',
    hash='sha256:857f1fd100807323afe2233739411730dc0c98943144bb08de0978eda757da57'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0967',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=128,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=29461,
    end_offset=29491,
    text_slice='上面设着寿昌公主于含章殿下卧的榻，悬的是同昌公主制的涟珠帐。',
    hash='sha256:585446b89aa5f20ea491d3bff170808ef94ebb065192bbab7d0e17a89feb932a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0968',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=128,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=29498,
    end_offset=29504,
    text_slice='“这里好！”',
    hash='sha256:4bff11c5d01f29a21338cfcd12d55a1e23ac03063d254edf2bb7cf61d798dbe5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0969',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=128,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=29504,
    end_offset=29509,
    text_slice='秦氏笑道：',
    hash='sha256:a70e23eff568480f76a659e827bae8fd43220e1cb104bc33ac90efc58e622335'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0970',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=128,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=29509,
    end_offset=29527,
    text_slice='“我这屋子，大约神仙也可以住得了。”',
    hash='sha256:b509c2291f234ed69e820353a221a0314acb12d714aa30b9898d7778f7d62906'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0971',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=128,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=29527,
    end_offset=29552,
    text_slice='说着亲自展开了西子浣过的纱衾，移了红娘抱过的鸳枕。',
    hash='sha256:da6fd770f46b6960f3793453ca11bb963a1b66e0e8bd2da9df412c31063eb7fe'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0972',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=128,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=29552,
    end_offset=29590,
    text_slice='于是，众奶母伏侍宝玉卧好，款款散了，只留袭人、媚人、晴雯、麝月四个丫鬟为伴。',
    hash='sha256:e305f04e1b54b68d44bd0386a2726494561813b47667bcb379413a216b21f12b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0973',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=128,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=29590,
    end_offset=29615,
    text_slice='秦氏便吩咐小丫鬟们，好生在廊檐下看着猫儿狗儿打架。',
    hash='sha256:ad7e1cf306224c936ef948df745de98b0611ce523daf88e769954cf6095d3ea9'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0974',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=129,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=29617,
    end_offset=29654,
    text_slice='那宝玉刚合上眼，便惚惚的睡去，犹似秦氏在前，遂悠悠荡荡，随了秦氏至一所在。',
    hash='sha256:f4364a27219c7832a7512809ff994a131b658ff0b906740744d609ce567a483b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0975',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=129,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=29654,
    end_offset=29678,
    text_slice='但见朱栏白石，绿树清溪，真是人迹稀逢，飞尘不到。',
    hash='sha256:a6ae4035a8f2a3311f6323e50099cecb98b7903464b01fddc9789e31414b3533'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0976',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=129,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=29678,
    end_offset=29697,
    text_slice='宝玉在梦中欢喜，想道：“这个去处有趣！',
    hash='sha256:217b0de023fa5f351ab2d70a3cfd6c645040b82ab7753b0dfb4969ee542ffb9e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0977',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=129,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=29697,
    end_offset=29728,
    text_slice='我就在这里过一生，纵然失了家也愿意，强如天天被父母、师傅打呢！',
    hash='sha256:141c09c2cd3749c6a441b3a56d3ca1540a41c1c0f88ab1bfe88770fa83c265a9'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0978',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=130,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=29747,
    end_offset=29771,
    text_slice='春梦随云散，飞花逐水流；寄言众儿女，何必觅闲愁！',
    hash='sha256:d0dd6b11ec79508291eb7426f82fcb8da7d33ad68d655e812b442eba03fa4bc2'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0979',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=131,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=29773,
    end_offset=29785,
    text_slice='宝玉听了，是女子的声音。',
    hash='sha256:2a7e2023b95e997c363d622e31d10b165f491b0c6e54cb7508e797e8ac9a8333'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0980',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=131,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=29785,
    end_offset=29813,
    text_slice='歌音未息，早见那边走出一个人来，蹁跹袅娜，端的与人不同。',
    hash='sha256:676a8fc5c6de2d3c07a45af397bb01a4987e510ae83065fac32af7d0646212b3'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0981',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=132,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=29820,
    end_offset=29830,
    text_slice='方离柳坞，乍出花房。',
    hash='sha256:5cf15838223a3fc258e74f7b308bde19b7f3c3d67fa4be80f8180e037e71bb36'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0982',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=132,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=29830,
    end_offset=29848,
    text_slice='但行处，鸟惊庭树；将到时，影度回廊。',
    hash='sha256:ca6e34d40844f79de964e6ee3516d5e38b61969b21bc5b44005c0c2d2f89bf5d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0983',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=132,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=29848,
    end_offset=29874,
    text_slice='仙袂乍飘兮，闻麝兰之馥郁；荷衣欲动兮，听环佩之铿锵。',
    hash='sha256:f473ff6fa15e0deda5ebe02c0b13c6eace94fa4e2d4e58bcde86630443e58a12'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0984',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=132,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=29874,
    end_offset=29896,
    text_slice='靥笑春桃兮，云堆翠髻；唇绽樱颗兮，榴齿含香。',
    hash='sha256:4482124bc1aca99b5d05081bdc9bfffbc285fbcad84359053a54ce8c1cc087d0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0985',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=132,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=29896,
    end_offset=29920,
    text_slice='纤腰之楚楚兮，回风舞雪；珠翠之辉辉兮，满额鹅黄。',
    hash='sha256:ae9a21a1f02e713b1faeee4f9193784ccb0c596d9fb8776a62298765dbf4cbb1'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0986',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=132,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=29920,
    end_offset=29942,
    text_slice='出没花间兮，宜嗔宜喜；徘徊池上兮，若飞若扬。',
    hash='sha256:b3dae8200c7148eba4f703cf53cc58ea2b3830e19bd69614dda550d114b4f59e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0987',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=132,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=29942,
    end_offset=29966,
    text_slice='蛾眉颦笑兮，将言而未语；莲步乍移兮，待止而欲行。',
    hash='sha256:108511d2755d909c30693fbd07330ff43c16d9724ce33073ef04c21b641d6ae9'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0988',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=132,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=29966,
    end_offset=29990,
    text_slice='羡彼之良质兮，冰清玉润；羡彼之华服兮，闪灼文章。',
    hash='sha256:1d144263c3992353c132fae17bbeb3306fc81281e85e7cb672625f3e70e05aef'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0989',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=132,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=29990,
    end_offset=30014,
    text_slice='爱彼之貌容兮，香培玉琢；美彼之态度兮，凤翥龙翔。',
    hash='sha256:684dba823a5ed9ce9d3a934ea2a8e1a833a8c3249c9bd93efa5e259636bd9a24'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0990',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=132,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=30014,
    end_offset=30019,
    text_slice='其素若何？',
    hash='sha256:a01a50489bb71c272acfb35508e797f59f27f308057eec821cfafbb2c85ef47c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0991',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=132,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=30019,
    end_offset=30024,
    text_slice='春梅绽雪。',
    hash='sha256:d35391cbca33cdcab5b723b4b54dff8a8b9a4e0ab25c5321678b5c4b5d0a5c61'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0992',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=132,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=30024,
    end_offset=30029,
    text_slice='其洁若何？',
    hash='sha256:04976a4db8d5d86cae38bca4e734cdc6924367509b576035c23ffbc2d30cb173'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0993',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=132,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=30029,
    end_offset=30034,
    text_slice='秋菊被霜。',
    hash='sha256:903184852fe0c396da203b9ba648fb582d4e5cdd52c6f9a282df49baba64bc02'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0994',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=132,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=30034,
    end_offset=30039,
    text_slice='其静若何？',
    hash='sha256:9aa163c413eda4dbca4896a3cbcb9cabcc7bc6c8e21b6a0df1d656c124e7d0bd'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0995',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=132,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=30039,
    end_offset=30044,
    text_slice='松生空谷。',
    hash='sha256:6594d180a36b21800121618572e8ca5f2a468af8f2a8eb6f360386fddae367cc'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0996',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=132,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=30044,
    end_offset=30049,
    text_slice='其艳若何？',
    hash='sha256:c625310b5a052486acf077ed0815265207c099f638e8444d238114f799d1d33a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0997',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=132,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=30049,
    end_offset=30054,
    text_slice='霞映澄塘。',
    hash='sha256:fe7a780c9ba728f1d60b40dbe8380029610afca311490746882d97018b40991e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0998',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=132,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=30054,
    end_offset=30059,
    text_slice='其文若何？',
    hash='sha256:0bdf643fadf17ab21fbdc92db85e9f3392f93e9cc9ec8f5917651443898b659f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_0999',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=132,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=30059,
    end_offset=30064,
    text_slice='龙游曲沼。',
    hash='sha256:ad6a199cfde09c5fee93d235b24d226833c00b4379d98d38fb0ac88ee6c36b2f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1000',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=132,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=30064,
    end_offset=30069,
    text_slice='其神若何？',
    hash='sha256:b159cd6b20ae182b68f841a689777adaeaa0f423549917b2e87917ac5102691c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1001',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=132,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=30069,
    end_offset=30074,
    text_slice='月射寒江。',
    hash='sha256:5cda3830cbed3e763e86d78261b3689c549006468580b8f4087ffb7934d47304'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1002',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=132,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=30074,
    end_offset=30084,
    text_slice='应惭西子，实愧王嫱。',
    hash='sha256:e2a3d4ceb966787627108fa3a3042950661dde2e8b997c64a497307484183f2a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1003',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=132,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=30084,
    end_offset=30088,
    text_slice='奇矣哉！',
    hash='sha256:472e04ea2a52ab6e07d7b9641f4fae9d28ad5076e7318b508ad0197196897610'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1004',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=132,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=30088,
    end_offset=30098,
    text_slice='生于孰地，来自何方？',
    hash='sha256:60e478b041cad510aab573c5e9f82bedd06b402dd438fbad741d3408e4b3f174'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1005',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=132,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=30098,
    end_offset=30102,
    text_slice='信矣乎！',
    hash='sha256:8e40132f12fa0ac4cf8272b8d25969b2b1f1c8545add5109d3792cadd0914110'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1006',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=132,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=30102,
    end_offset=30112,
    text_slice='瑶池不二，紫府无双。',
    hash='sha256:8c84837d8dd98c9ebf6745b60bce08507bf004cfada05f808768ade4af95b854'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1007',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=132,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=30112,
    end_offset=30117,
    text_slice='果何人哉？',
    hash='sha256:92494f4b9929b2a7362c37d44b08c04b3610ace7c7cccdb799995761003b8bfc'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1008',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=132,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=30117,
    end_offset=30123,
    text_slice='如斯之美也！',
    hash='sha256:d3dd5e7eed9ca2973ffa0627acbcc769750e9bf64931b8ccbf163571e03cc79c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1009',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=133,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=30125,
    end_offset=30146,
    text_slice='宝玉见是一个仙姑，喜得忙上来作揖，笑问道：',
    hash='sha256:8daf6842de1dfc28fe74a507d6c6e0fc1c7fda2a6fb5f33fa020b4a88ac87f3f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1010',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=133,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=30146,
    end_offset=30184,
    text_slice='“神仙姐姐不知从那里来，如今要往那里去？也我不知这里是何处，望乞携带携带！”',
    hash='sha256:bfce554aacaf5f2779f0cdb9ae004aa5f455483bc617581a8010f87d9bfe1626'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1011',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=133,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=30184,
    end_offset=30190,
    text_slice='那仙姑笑道：',
    hash='sha256:0922116cdf1f78a7836a96ed35f928e2dd027705f6c0d8e641c0231c312eccbf'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1012',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=133,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=30190,
    end_offset=30339,
    text_slice='“吾居离恨天之上，灌愁海之中，乃放春山遣香洞太虚幻境警幻仙姑是也：司人间之风情月债，掌尘世之女怨男痴。因近来风流冤孽，缠绵于此处，是以前来访察机会，布散相思。今忽与你相逢，亦非偶然。此离吾境不远，别无他物，仅有自采仙茗一盏，亲酿美酒一瓮，素练魔舞歌姬数人，新填《红楼梦》仙曲十二支，试随吾一游否？”',
    hash='sha256:6342d031777af8ae8beaa44025f0510d6a45b87b1fc6cd3454b915f6afdfaa89'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1013',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=133,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=30339,
    end_offset=30368,
    text_slice='宝玉听了喜跃非常，便忘了秦氏在何处，竟随了仙姑，至一所在。',
    hash='sha256:b1e795b79becf23e0e5a3b1f32ee54b6742485bf6e8a8bc8954835f8af35a953'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1014',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=133,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=30376,
    end_offset=30382,
    text_slice='“太虚幻境”',
    hash='sha256:4968652918ac347dc7c53386a48a34878fbc8f3babfd1d402fc2fa815811eb00'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1015',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=133,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=30382,
    end_offset=30397,
    text_slice='四个大字，两边一副对联，乃是：',
    hash='sha256:0c74cacbe15f2f09640df5098fb2b74380990d2ec8fabfff59a542c0a3f2245a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1016',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=134,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=30399,
    end_offset=30415,
    text_slice='假作真时真亦假，无为有处有还无。',
    hash='sha256:7293239e34909b3baa9aeac4841ec2e643a112971e48614225834b50fad9c125'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1017',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=135,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=30417,
    end_offset=30448,
    text_slice='转过牌坊，便是一座宫门，上面横书四个大字，道是：“孽海情天”。',
    hash='sha256:6b68303f059009736f616d0293ce8f9a8c87e4d4b005663d4701a40921ed70e5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1018',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=136,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=30461,
    end_offset=30487,
    text_slice='厚地高天，堪叹古今情不尽；痴男怨女，可怜风月债难偿。',
    hash='sha256:3420236791495b653c7db99329721ce0bd27c3224cbe8f817adb5cd2bd042908'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1019',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=137,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=30489,
    end_offset=30500,
    text_slice='宝玉看了，心下自思道：',
    hash='sha256:076c68660294aa2a5ffae7b4dfca82dfd469631f315945f69b2345e6aab0e8c3'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1020',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=137,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=30500,
    end_offset=30538,
    text_slice='“原来如此！但不知何为‘古今之情’，又何为‘风月之债’？从今倒要领略领略。”',
    hash='sha256:c9a940c5c096c92a41f9e578fb3134f45a8a26f589672afa96009d65475baca9'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1021',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=137,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=30538,
    end_offset=30560,
    text_slice='宝玉只顾如此一想，不料早把些邪魔招入膏肓了。',
    hash='sha256:8190f51bdeb4cda29309303cbdc16245398b1b4807d4f59b6664e11563fb0819'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1022',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=137,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=30603,
    end_offset=30608,
    text_slice='“痴情司”',
    hash='sha256:eb83be045ea2b7adaba9287b802f2d070f2730b2a2fe4636130e556a0a197f56'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1023',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=137,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=30608,
    end_offset=30609,
    text_slice='、',
    hash='sha256:c4a40ea8fe35627476f7f8cb9e1fc7f8898f428c6d1ff18b0bc5479d5db39c5f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1024',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=137,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=30609,
    end_offset=30614,
    text_slice='“结怨司”',
    hash='sha256:4299e15895734fa5558904ddc8359f531a46ab537607582eb862506855d80342'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1025',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=137,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=30614,
    end_offset=30615,
    text_slice='、',
    hash='sha256:c4a40ea8fe35627476f7f8cb9e1fc7f8898f428c6d1ff18b0bc5479d5db39c5f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1026',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=137,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=30615,
    end_offset=30620,
    text_slice='“朝啼司”',
    hash='sha256:add70c339238bd19f5a7f5b574cf0c7ec1481c4d3191eaf38b2a91703e9da74c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1027',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=137,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=30620,
    end_offset=30621,
    text_slice='、',
    hash='sha256:c4a40ea8fe35627476f7f8cb9e1fc7f8898f428c6d1ff18b0bc5479d5db39c5f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1028',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=137,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=30621,
    end_offset=30626,
    text_slice='“夜哭司”',
    hash='sha256:64bc6f41bd1b3d6c50daa76f1d7543228fc23469af5235d385fafe94cf256e36'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1029',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=137,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=30626,
    end_offset=30627,
    text_slice='、',
    hash='sha256:c4a40ea8fe35627476f7f8cb9e1fc7f8898f428c6d1ff18b0bc5479d5db39c5f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1030',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=137,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=30627,
    end_offset=30632,
    text_slice='“春感司”',
    hash='sha256:f967ebf946d345b5dbdd14efa7594ea67b0f2585df0dbe4a90a965c47384715d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1031',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=137,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=30632,
    end_offset=30633,
    text_slice='、',
    hash='sha256:c4a40ea8fe35627476f7f8cb9e1fc7f8898f428c6d1ff18b0bc5479d5db39c5f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1032',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=137,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=30633,
    end_offset=30638,
    text_slice='“秋悲司”',
    hash='sha256:aaf4e37a8b28db79780e506202b5482cc52a6e527dbf8ce43f95d636114104e1'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1033',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=137,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=30638,
    end_offset=30648,
    text_slice='。看了，因向仙姑道：',
    hash='sha256:e6a84b810aafe0db6c34b224280f66d9fae2a006e01a9ff380891ff5b90dde4f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1034',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=137,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=30648,
    end_offset=30672,
    text_slice='“敢烦仙姑引我到那各司中游玩游玩，不知可使得？”',
    hash='sha256:80fc8974aebf75cb5a4c63228582504783c75f0727a5a621509f0bd4b4193bc2'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1035',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=137,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=30672,
    end_offset=30676,
    text_slice='仙姑道：',
    hash='sha256:9b316ae29c3c127f284d1d8e8372f5217e23e09434c6c5013f95811866c5b444'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1036',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=137,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=30676,
    end_offset=30715,
    text_slice='“此各司中皆贮的是普天之下所有的女子过去未来的簿册，你凡眼尘躯，未便先知的。”',
    hash='sha256:38df144e72378373f775433d30b78bfd51f4b8f5250d9bb714e1e2f0fcc34c94'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1037',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=137,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=30715,
    end_offset=30731,
    text_slice='宝玉听了，那里肯依，复央之再四。',
    hash='sha256:8fd801e85332da0c4875801c36e8904bbb94bbb515c644ca88785fca9f23c4c6'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1038',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=137,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=30738,
    end_offset=30756,
    text_slice='“也罢！就在此司内略随喜随喜罢了！”',
    hash='sha256:5f2d836c2900338cb46eb82551cc71fb0bcd7b811fd7fa09d0cf287056c7cd76'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1039',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=137,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=30756,
    end_offset=30774,
    text_slice='宝玉喜不自胜，抬头看这司的匾上，乃是',
    hash='sha256:62d34692490e634c54018b09e0367c54b23e1c26f8d888e42c574a48387b823a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1040',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=137,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=30774,
    end_offset=30779,
    text_slice='“薄命司”',
    hash='sha256:bd7f93eedbd8254828510fecf794fab17e2493a8df1b40902852a98fae1c9028'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1041',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=137,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=30779,
    end_offset=30790,
    text_slice='三字，两边对联写的是：',
    hash='sha256:47e942c7da43f2aa7199e55bb6bcc51a8fa466cbbd4391aac368c48640d82b66'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1042',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=138,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=30792,
    end_offset=30808,
    text_slice='春恨秋悲皆自惹，花容月貌为谁妍？',
    hash='sha256:34ab0b0c08c856509951f55934ea02246ee711e8c841e71ddae3df0932fbede7'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1043',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=139,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=30810,
    end_offset=30820,
    text_slice='宝玉看了，便知感叹。',
    hash='sha256:cc29f0dff39b3bdb2a0b5d4e8a62c772c721d36c81dc02bdee728a5330b9d71f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1044',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=139,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=30820,
    end_offset=30841,
    text_slice='进入门来，只见有十数个大橱，皆用封条封着。',
    hash='sha256:17318f3c63c502746fd79d5ea503dd713ae6b7fd79cf55ecdeda2a8b8808010a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1045',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=139,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=30841,
    end_offset=30855,
    text_slice='看那封条上，皆是各省的地名。',
    hash='sha256:e4bc37a50e8d3acdfd14faa31f28e4bf0aba39d84507afca48353e45a5963aad'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1046',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=139,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=30855,
    end_offset=30879,
    text_slice='宝玉一心只拣自己的家乡封条看，遂无心看别省的了。',
    hash='sha256:920711aa6c179f1893f741771b77d5b7ec2d7abe6fd4cf16aa4e246ba95aa011'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1047',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=139,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=30894,
    end_offset=30903,
    text_slice='“金陵十二钗正册”',
    hash='sha256:11735b17d32827e5398ef29be048691f617940503a05cec71ef76cdaba19d679'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1048',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=139,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=30903,
    end_offset=30909,
    text_slice='。宝玉问道：',
    hash='sha256:316904d95b4d629a643fc23012511cb8f9a16e05a3218a7276f7b6855dd583f7'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1049',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=139,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=30909,
    end_offset=30923,
    text_slice='“何为‘金陵十二钗正册’？”',
    hash='sha256:a6af34b636785066a15a6f3f826a51b2a8bc2ee9af867b51445c133a729be53a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1050',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=139,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=30923,
    end_offset=30927,
    text_slice='警幻道：',
    hash='sha256:4a7a118d0dc4ab83a933c8225ac307345ab46873ebc7ef3f8a7b640ab3723ddf'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1051',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=139,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=30927,
    end_offset=30949,
    text_slice='“即贵省中十二冠首女子之册，故为‘正册’。”',
    hash='sha256:b39ceed0b6d6273228f16ae97101167449b5bffc477396f7cf7c0748b9815583'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1052',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=139,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=30949,
    end_offset=30953,
    text_slice='宝玉道：',
    hash='sha256:10c9e1a43f0e2e5bf2e54f50fb3dbede512eb436326aec72d14625e62153e9b0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1053',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=139,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=30953,
    end_offset=30995,
    text_slice='“常听人说，金陵极大，怎么只十二个女子？如今单我家里，上上下下，就有几百女孩子呢。”',
    hash='sha256:f47df571038b5dc751d945f50d99684509d12603b44171e6ae304ba4b51c48a6'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1054',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=139,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=30995,
    end_offset=31001,
    text_slice='警幻冷笑道：',
    hash='sha256:7383e70f99b82b8b6050d890098eaff3094bff09cfcbe1d426fd84eb0b8957b4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1055',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=139,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=31001,
    end_offset=31043,
    text_slice='“贵省女子固多，不过择其紧要者录之。下边二橱则又次之。余者庸常之辈，则无册可录矣。”',
    hash='sha256:e4b1a1ac51604854f280a506e4472b50e06d93eb637c6af02a0f5742fe12878e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1056',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=139,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=31043,
    end_offset=31062,
    text_slice='宝玉听说，再看下首二橱上，果然写一个着',
    hash='sha256:5d07088e07fd74f926d7f76f0884d461099cd62bd50e7b9be5844249278d0fb5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1057',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=139,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=31062,
    end_offset=31071,
    text_slice='“金陵十二钗副册”',
    hash='sha256:32e83edcfd0a22f010a69451191f76b9645febb7a3363fd772a5b46b884e627a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1058',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=139,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=31071,
    end_offset=31077,
    text_slice='，又一个写着',
    hash='sha256:d2af2e73ad0907648d8b1d5cdbbfbeb7b711ab0622c2525c52290d170adeed8e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1059',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=139,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=31077,
    end_offset=31087,
    text_slice='“金陵十二钗又副册”',
    hash='sha256:fe9229714e6ed87691a4f592306926b38cd93a68ecf9c2b35fed9811ac58dd3c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1060',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=139,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=31087,
    end_offset=31095,
    text_slice='。宝玉便伸手先将',
    hash='sha256:e2bde5f8ee04bb0a784649d20d3de6147af6d6805517ae68d03a9dbaa7a271f7'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1061',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=139,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=31095,
    end_offset=31100,
    text_slice='“又副册”',
    hash='sha256:3d0741910247c149979418012f5b884c0cf1f4d1db491337465812e94da6ee0f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1062',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=139,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=31100,
    end_offset=31156,
    text_slice='橱门开了，拿出一本册来，揭开一看，只见这首页上画着一幅画，又非人物，也无山水，不过是水墨滃染的满纸乌云浊雾而已。',
    hash='sha256:07fa6b068c24faed2245fc82b81269d978e9d3b7f5792dc33f416c2be67481cc'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1063',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=140,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=31169,
    end_offset=31179,
    text_slice='霁月难逢，彩云易散。',
    hash='sha256:48181ed41d00bc1f17fd014c46a7c795cd203bc2199710bc8cc0029f0eb3eef5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1064',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=140,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=31179,
    end_offset=31189,
    text_slice='心比天高，身为下贱。',
    hash='sha256:c5dc9dc48db137c7a611ff96e5bee85271d63e71951cfc4a8b15cc15407c0bea'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1065',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=140,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=31189,
    end_offset=31197,
    text_slice='风流灵巧招人怨。',
    hash='sha256:26c6f025ad5ea9c1f8fc83041a5849ff75f4be8ada0ff845acbb5a5bcbbd78a5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1066',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=140,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=31197,
    end_offset=31213,
    text_slice='寿夭多因毁谤生，多情公子空牵念。',
    hash='sha256:e737e2934aeaa935027dc98cf38918a06cb6b615ca38b3236f77b6838999896e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1067',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=141,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=31215,
    end_offset=31247,
    text_slice='宝玉看了，又见后面画着一簇鲜花，一床破席，也有几句言词，写道是：',
    hash='sha256:935dd47220d4940c942be880017a0ac7290775d570cfb7b154184b2843ef1457'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1068',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=142,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=31249,
    end_offset=31263,
    text_slice='枉自温柔和顺，空云似桂如兰。',
    hash='sha256:0a80dad7e3f1f3ead1dd877444bb3887e134c499b75231c3651f7e290c862155'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1069',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=142,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=31263,
    end_offset=31277,
    text_slice='堪羡优伶有福，谁知公子无缘！',
    hash='sha256:403339de8e58f23d72e3cf694edf7d387b2cd240c34031367df5f6820bd27494'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1070',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=143,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=31279,
    end_offset=31286,
    text_slice='宝玉看了不解。',
    hash='sha256:124de08bfb911daffd3067fbb39fee567035a826260da5a6fdf338b075e134e5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1071',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=144,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=31348,
    end_offset=31364,
    text_slice='根并荷花一茎香，平生遭际实堪伤。',
    hash='sha256:8022a3e939cf2f5f528cf3c3daaa00bb330011b8eca6440f6105c9726114633a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1072',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=144,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=31364,
    end_offset=31380,
    text_slice='自从两地生孤木，致使香魂返故乡。',
    hash='sha256:c3680e8bf16bcc895e2caf0e101fb528531e471a733edd887929fee5ad5f62b4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1073',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=145,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=31382,
    end_offset=31390,
    text_slice='宝玉看了仍不解。',
    hash='sha256:66e6f3f743d575706dd3f1634d0d3abcfe6191447eb8e02a08b043cef81635a2'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1074',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=145,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=31390,
    end_offset=31440,
    text_slice='便又掷了，再去取“正册”看，只见头一页上便画着两株枯木，木上悬着一围玉带；又有一堆雪，雪下一股金簪。',
    hash='sha256:f13ad7b4c0e889eef1488ec7af400a57978a1d255b81f0f2166cbe64b4c8aa99'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1075',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=146,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=31452,
    end_offset=31464,
    text_slice='可叹停机德，堪怜咏絮才。',
    hash='sha256:5208c0b6ebd21ba52f5df654818fd9dfe27ef9186ce3a040e00bb6aab3325442'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1076',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=146,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=31464,
    end_offset=31476,
    text_slice='玉带林中挂，金簪雪里埋。',
    hash='sha256:7b209170bfa34ea1fa9bba50688bd1313a4527446bcbc1111330dc851a8b660a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1077',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=147,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=31478,
    end_offset=31486,
    text_slice='宝玉看了仍不解。',
    hash='sha256:66e6f3f743d575706dd3f1634d0d3abcfe6191447eb8e02a08b043cef81635a2'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1078',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=147,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=31486,
    end_offset=31509,
    text_slice='待要问时，情知她必不肯泄漏；待要丢下，又不舍。',
    hash='sha256:f1db1094821006aae21edc4c502db732d6517a1fed8488a1bc1932f366c5b3aa'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1079',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=147,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=31509,
    end_offset=31531,
    text_slice='遂又往后看时，只见画着一张弓，弓上挂着香橼。',
    hash='sha256:9dca4a68a5509ef79144e6b8d3c5b71eb22af4c228104c1e92b9d9c3a8bcacda'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1080',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=148,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=31541,
    end_offset=31557,
    text_slice='二十年来辨是非，榴花开处照宫闱。',
    hash='sha256:c8c8db8a66f06789a86b7bf40007032ed132b41c346523754692da01ddd84e08'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1081',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=148,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=31557,
    end_offset=31565,
    text_slice='三春争及初春景？',
    hash='sha256:4b78c63cb1e587f6004ee776b5dbf64bb311bd820904985f87f4af2ece2bdd6c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1082',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=148,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=31565,
    end_offset=31573,
    text_slice='虎兔相逢大梦归。',
    hash='sha256:4b2088992bb4cb41de22fb390d9fdb10528d8ff7e64a022e90b5263053f57a0e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1083',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=149,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=31575,
    end_offset=31609,
    text_slice='后面又画着两人放风筝，一片大海，一只大船，船中有一女子掩面泣涕之状。',
    hash='sha256:bc723797b46a87d3874184e24bd64eecfa4a208199451c5f28457f6125b09b42'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1084',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=150,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=31618,
    end_offset=31634,
    text_slice='才自精明志自高，生于末世运偏消。',
    hash='sha256:9963e7596db91dd61a9407f50614f442499e7d346e15084122ec65c2937d105c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1085',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=150,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=31634,
    end_offset=31650,
    text_slice='清明涕送江边望，千里东风一梦遥。',
    hash='sha256:2b37c5a074d34b514bed20a5893b71b5f0c38a537c85cdb1564e4f601c077d74'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1086',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=151,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=31652,
    end_offset=31666,
    text_slice='后面又画几缕飞云，一湾逝水。',
    hash='sha256:9694606ea9b63fabf43226e19005a80556c6318af03e7fdf4a80c0b6a45c2858'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1087',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=152,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=31672,
    end_offset=31686,
    text_slice='富贵又何为，襁褓之间父母违。',
    hash='sha256:f727ef6efcea665c75c2e09ce64e282a5f272714f5192ff0cc3aa7283e0e89a7'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1088',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=152,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=31686,
    end_offset=31700,
    text_slice='展眼吊斜晖，湘江水逝楚云飞。',
    hash='sha256:6d382f9af5fa3e34cd472b1f4f87325d8141911d0cbd026d028600bed343f812'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1089',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=153,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=31702,
    end_offset=31719,
    text_slice='后面又画着一块美玉，落在泥垢之中。',
    hash='sha256:9187048b560378bb0a350d705559d997c6031a2131a51d8bf41cf82b0845116f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1090',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=154,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=31726,
    end_offset=31738,
    text_slice='欲洁何曾洁，云空未必空。',
    hash='sha256:a091dd12c720e8a6c27498f0302f7ea79fdfefd1ec0f418f8637b97c8d3b17ac'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1091',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=154,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=31738,
    end_offset=31750,
    text_slice='可怜金玉质，终陷淖泥中。',
    hash='sha256:0f6c19381bf6c2ca5abd55a9d5978a5408879bce2c2e57e877c5e969e562b403'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1092',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=155,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=31752,
    end_offset=31773,
    text_slice='后面忽见画着个恶狼，追扑一美女，欲啖之意。',
    hash='sha256:6eca411baf9fd360b3eae393245ca12c5675bdebef07ed5d27cdc3de2508b502'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1093',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=156,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=31779,
    end_offset=31791,
    text_slice='子系中山狼，得志便猖狂。',
    hash='sha256:df06d725e83eea7060f7f3c76794f1a88c44359d066fa6aa340e47cc72ec6b98'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1094',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=156,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=31791,
    end_offset=31803,
    text_slice='金闺花柳质，一载赴黄粱。',
    hash='sha256:ef3c28cc377f948d030016cb01b4758c87cf53dfb360efebad0e14fc271e5730'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1095',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=157,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=31805,
    end_offset=31827,
    text_slice='后面便是一所古庙，里面有一美人在内看经独坐。',
    hash='sha256:cd0cc5bca3390a23a4c23e58d1f158cda9ff9e1b2f3c7cd2db24c10c5b95f3b9'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1096',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=158,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=31833,
    end_offset=31849,
    text_slice='勘破三春景不长，缁衣顿改昔年妆。',
    hash='sha256:d81a63e6fdd5e1e9845053ecb817316d04b95dea12fa9c6a5b58972d18178216'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1097',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=158,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=31849,
    end_offset=31865,
    text_slice='可怜绣户侯门女，独卧青灯古佛旁。',
    hash='sha256:d1a1f19df1b4ef74c33973edfab5036a5a43a543ee2b12413d0e1ac0496bad0f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1098',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=159,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=31867,
    end_offset=31884,
    text_slice='后面便是一片冰山，上面有一只雌凤。',
    hash='sha256:7f0afc03fc185fc19ebfe16179bff7125910983c806c5469a6431fd7ee3d3322'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1099',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=160,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=31890,
    end_offset=31906,
    text_slice='凡鸟偏从末世来，都知爱慕此生才。',
    hash='sha256:e86a8608c44b3786c896d18ecff1a31fbb47d01a23a89b646b6322b5ed79373a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1100',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=160,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=31906,
    end_offset=31922,
    text_slice='一从二令三人木，哭向金陵事更哀。',
    hash='sha256:f0f53c31c0074b878cb08b1fbbcd7dcc9dfab5d5c22530db56b3f4e8abcccec1'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1101',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=161,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=31924,
    end_offset=31945,
    text_slice='后面又是一座荒村野店，有一美人在那里纺绩。',
    hash='sha256:8ca521c4d2e0f01de609a2e0f75d7f481d3905a702292a0da3362741ce195a8c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1102',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=162,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=31951,
    end_offset=31963,
    text_slice='势败休云贵，家亡莫论亲。',
    hash='sha256:c94737b0e4f380345edff21dc250da76c36e74272d191ef5ecf9cf90ddc2133f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1103',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=162,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=31963,
    end_offset=31975,
    text_slice='偶因济刘氏，巧得遇恩人。',
    hash='sha256:bf36aca48e95b78f191fa16b4356c5f19103541d388506735e230f389eea031f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1104',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=163,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=31977,
    end_offset=31999,
    text_slice='后面又画着一盆茂兰，旁有一位凤冠霞帔的美人。',
    hash='sha256:f8d16219a9addab6a7f3475e9f7f330f4a40ca4500e6f37d9ef600d79dd12076'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1105',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=164,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=32006,
    end_offset=32022,
    text_slice='桃李春风结子完，到头谁似一盆兰。',
    hash='sha256:2a4d4b126bf05216612cb849110f375ec1271229c8b2afa7ba6b14a1530d6175'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1106',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=164,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=32022,
    end_offset=32038,
    text_slice='如冰水好空相妒，枉与他人作笑谈。',
    hash='sha256:67082d69233b1a291d90a19fe1118af5034ad416edbf508c1487f8e1b6bf0f67'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1107',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=165,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=32040,
    end_offset=32059,
    text_slice='后面又画着高楼大厦，有一美人悬梁自缢。',
    hash='sha256:fa39fa6c1c8b7674d86c8ca218a41079cafb65c06762f1197efec074eab941c1'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1108',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=166,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=32065,
    end_offset=32081,
    text_slice='情天情海幻情身，情既相逢必主淫。',
    hash='sha256:cd8d65d9f7f05862b72ac87f0b3fa712a9d5ca17657788854906cb30aa4823cd'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1109',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=166,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=32081,
    end_offset=32097,
    text_slice='漫言不肖皆荣出，造衅开端实在宁。',
    hash='sha256:26201c5e18dc2f03e9fb39fa595a0646da19368ff0d25b524a140fef01f019e8'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1110',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=167,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=32099,
    end_offset=32160,
    text_slice='宝玉还欲看时，那仙姑知他天分高明，性情颖慧，恐把仙机泄漏，遂掩了卷册，笑向宝玉道：“且随我去游玩奇景，何必在此打这闷葫芦！',
    hash='sha256:97278fea6a0f394d7c252e1b47b0601fbd9dd92cafc4dfbb7870b97672049583'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1111',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=168,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=32163,
    end_offset=32187,
    text_slice='宝玉恍恍惚惚，不觉弃了卷册，又随了警幻来至后面。',
    hash='sha256:1afae1a9b2f10d31e7789ea902231ad384bbfb56bcc1dba34ead15e91722a7fe'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1112',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=168,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=32187,
    end_offset=32219,
    text_slice='但见珠帘绣幕，画栋雕檐，说不尽那光摇朱户金铺地，雪照琼窗玉作宫。',
    hash='sha256:8d8f17520b562da49778846c59f84f15f2f723fc0f638aa86be107caad3670b0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1113',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=168,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=32219,
    end_offset=32237,
    text_slice='更见仙花馥郁，异草芬芳，真好个所在。',
    hash='sha256:20434f860c73beb0bcc00f47d309cd987871bf76cf1560f18024975d2efc260c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1114',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=168,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=32244,
    end_offset=32256,
    text_slice='“你们快出来迎接贵客！”',
    hash='sha256:e3fd01a921ff24ce27b6035c19d4cbc4bb70d76dd34223a36b95e6d2217bf63a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1115',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=168,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=32256,
    end_offset=32296,
    text_slice='一语未了，只见房中又走出几个仙子来，皆是荷袂蹁跹，羽衣飘舞，娇若春花，媚如秋月。',
    hash='sha256:f13f5e2f2300d55de4eafb5af18b068aaac74bf660ce4d23f2815bad07dde28a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1116',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=168,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=32309,
    end_offset=32372,
    text_slice='“我们不知系何贵客，忙的接了出来姐姐曾说今日今时必有绛珠妹子的生魂前来游玩，故我等久待。何故反引这浊物来污染这清净女儿之境？”',
    hash='sha256:cef6c0a4da4d990f66f181d3baf07aa5e219118b0ea5c57fcea6113da041271f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1117',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=169,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=32374,
    end_offset=32399,
    text_slice='宝玉听如此说，便唬得欲退不能退，果觉自形污秽不堪。',
    hash='sha256:140480122fdc2c8a663a9228d8992dff11d50a967f69904e9bd751c29b774b18'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1118',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=169,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=32399,
    end_offset=32493,
    text_slice='警幻忙携住宝玉的手，向众姊妹道：“你等不知原委：今日原欲往荣府去接绛珠，适从宁府所过，偶遇宁、荣二公之灵，嘱吾云：‘吾家自国朝定鼎以来，功名奕世，富贵传流，虽历百年，奈运终数尽，不可挽回。',
    hash='sha256:0694df485469e5bca956eae24861c6a36fb494009357052ddf6972b23cb37567'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1119',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=169,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=32493,
    end_offset=32509,
    text_slice='故遗之子孙虽多，竟无一可以继业。',
    hash='sha256:a911252956426c0d0c758150db70b7c2cbd04cbbbda454f02128df551bb0c6d9'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1120',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=169,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=32509,
    end_offset=32557,
    text_slice='其中惟嫡孙宝玉一人，禀性乖张，生情怪谲，虽聪明灵慧，略可望成，无奈吾家运数合终，恐无人规引入正。',
    hash='sha256:6a01419cdd7de8814e61003124549287ac7cba025807fa7444950ca4947e0432'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1121',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=169,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=32557,
    end_offset=32604,
    text_slice='幸仙姑偶来，万望先以情欲声色等事警其痴顽，或能使彼跳出迷人圈子，然后入于正路，亦吾兄弟之幸矣。',
    hash='sha256:2e466090cbdb66596f3368e9100f4c1a758fb9446d106445e7d9ad13f1beeb73'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1122',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=169,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=32604,
    end_offset=32649,
    text_slice='’如此嘱吾，故发慈心，引彼至此，先以彼家上、中、下三等女子之终身册籍，令彼熟玩，尚未觉悟。',
    hash='sha256:e1540d4be06cabe9ba15101565b45d466b63c92c61e7d90e939c4c249ff10ff4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1123',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=169,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=32649,
    end_offset=32681,
    text_slice='故引彼再至此处，令其再历饮馔声色之幻，或冀将来一悟，亦未可知也。',
    hash='sha256:a89bcd1fe8e465a7016f93be77d281e964dfd1bb88cf9b942b39e1decb2f4821'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1124',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=170,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=32684,
    end_offset=32694,
    text_slice='说毕，携了宝玉入室。',
    hash='sha256:e1f379c6e4b46a43055bcf37b3cfe81d17fa21e934b45f5eabfee4731d4182c2'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1125',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=170,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=32694,
    end_offset=32710,
    text_slice='但闻一缕幽香，竟不知其所焚何物。',
    hash='sha256:811075c2abac74fb5932d089ceb03cb08981fc691ab24a8580704397aafbf331'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1126',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=170,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=32710,
    end_offset=32718,
    text_slice='宝玉遂不禁相问。',
    hash='sha256:9629c544df0a2e871654e4da84ffcb2e516bd7f4611d9f168f6ee5c4bf50766a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1127',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=170,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=32724,
    end_offset=32775,
    text_slice='“此香尘世中既无，尔何能知！此香乃系诸名山胜境内初生异卉之精，合各种宝林珠树之油所制，名‘群芳髓’。”',
    hash='sha256:5d12461af5c3c21d750e0208743a029cfbecd35e5008aa98105e2cb3afa96754'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1128',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=170,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=32775,
    end_offset=32785,
    text_slice='宝玉听了，自是羡慕。',
    hash='sha256:8cecc323f160e304f2ffcc237269465357859f3f66b166e12bca2c298c968a7b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1129',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=170,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=32785,
    end_offset=32800,
    text_slice='而已，大家入座，小鬟捧上茶来。',
    hash='sha256:ec96abf186a7448f1db67fecdee2b0f40bf2235e02604943a45d1c1acb581bed'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1130',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=170,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=32800,
    end_offset=32820,
    text_slice='宝玉自觉清香味异，纯美非常，因又问何名。',
    hash='sha256:9d01bf838edaadda8a9d1cc84f618161d3b39bc5ce28c24c4bcc5ab5d07f6969'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1131',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=170,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=32824,
    end_offset=32863,
    text_slice='“此茶出在放春山遣香洞，又以仙花灵叶上所带之宿露而烹，此茶名曰‘千红一窟’。”',
    hash='sha256:fdc6cb0c0c060e4732d8c402fb07552bcc7f8d3b9e62106f0abca6387d868c59'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1132',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=170,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=32863,
    end_offset=32873,
    text_slice='宝玉听了，点头称赏。',
    hash='sha256:3f33b13136d50a4b290ba8cd71934ecfd8cbcdf62b9b30fea7a9299a74aefe94'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1133',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=170,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=32873,
    end_offset=32911,
    text_slice='因看房内，瑶琴、宝鼎、古画、新诗，无所不有；更喜窗下亦有唾绒，奁间时渍粉污。',
    hash='sha256:35f95530a7e3ab5a5fe29a36b453ffbcf50a562e6335775fad65d1dff98db03c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1134',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=170,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=32911,
    end_offset=32937,
    text_slice='壁上也见悬着一副对联，书云：幽微灵秀地，无可奈何天。',
    hash='sha256:1356054e9c31329f94114229a434e513a509653c6b54090d2cbc70c6be077b9d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1135',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=171,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=32939,
    end_offset=32949,
    text_slice='宝玉看毕，无不羡慕。',
    hash='sha256:bc90efeaa9baaa82106278514df3899545bfa13445c423e5e34890306a10f8ff'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1136',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=171,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=32949,
    end_offset=32994,
    text_slice='因又请问众仙姑姓名：一名痴梦仙姑，一名钟情大士，一名引愁金女，一名度恨菩提，各各道号不一。',
    hash='sha256:c56c086961bd70d04a261e1ff34130d60c9522669c0edbc67080593ab8221d95'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1137',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=171,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=32994,
    end_offset=33030,
    text_slice='少刻，有小鬟来调桌安椅，设摆酒馔，真是：琼浆满泛玻璃盏，玉液浓斟琥珀杯。',
    hash='sha256:9af24a0bed8874829aaf7250d5a422f64c387064a4e5888913a966411b185718'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1138',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=171,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=33030,
    end_offset=33041,
    text_slice='更不用再说那肴馔之盛。',
    hash='sha256:d27a5416ca75f2eee1b7051729183f2041f89697883dc4f59859208ef1a7f897'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1139',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=171,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=33041,
    end_offset=33064,
    text_slice='宝玉因闻得此酒清香甘冽，异乎寻常，又不禁相问。',
    hash='sha256:561da923aa0b32b83c512ba784d71b36cfe660caf39d90ef0adc0dffd5625b67'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1140',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=171,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=33064,
    end_offset=33106,
    text_slice='警幻道：“此酒乃以百花之蕊、万木之汁，加以麟髓之醅、凤乳之酿成，因名为‘万艳同杯’。',
    hash='sha256:1097f34523739c62e2b1a24783b00a6edd8a455fff233effe98b3168c0eefe4c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1141',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=171,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=33106,
    end_offset=33114,
    text_slice='”宝玉称赏不迭。',
    hash='sha256:dfe3f7fb82eecd1f8189624ea0bf4072de8d56b6fb2fce70c3dc40ff0dc7564e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1142',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=172,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=33116,
    end_offset=33137,
    text_slice='饮酒间，又有十二个舞女上来，请问演何词曲。',
    hash='sha256:2b31f09296d79cb1503075e4cae9610dd1bedb1e89bba750079b012d60983c31'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1143',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=172,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=33137,
    end_offset=33158,
    text_slice='警幻道：“就将新制《红楼梦》十二支演上来。',
    hash='sha256:a5c7725208a4ff5cd987e0269525e988aadca1e41dfbd615dd2e3e140a39f0cf'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1144',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=173,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=33185,
    end_offset=33195,
    text_slice='开辟鸿蒙......',
    hash='sha256:b61d890ab9c8fa505177e6fcc324b493cc83b82172022f7771d641595b64b757'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1145',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=174,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=33197,
    end_offset=33245,
    text_slice='方歌了一句，警幻便说道：“此曲不比尘世中所填传奇之曲，必有生、旦、净、末之别，又有南北九宫之限。',
    hash='sha256:f1418503c096c7ac95860f50954e7e94e80bda6f223111f617c70dbf5d0c2e18'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1146',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=174,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=33245,
    end_offset=33270,
    text_slice='此或咏叹一人，或感怀一事，偶成一曲，即可谱入管弦。',
    hash='sha256:e69a94c338ecc3ba292983abcb8dc5ad6343a1fcf971350ca1dc0220e77a6c01'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1147',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=174,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=33270,
    end_offset=33293,
    text_slice='若非个中人，不知其中之妙，料尔亦未必深明此调。',
    hash='sha256:2464e1f00f2468e751dff0691a21a2649c7d2946dcc3e962c6c45d6698da5ed1'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1148',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=174,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=33293,
    end_offset=33311,
    text_slice='若不先阅其稿，后听其歌，反成嚼蜡矣！',
    hash='sha256:1e59a911398bf27f7f135dcd8a5c45fcda6de698cce09ddd32cdc63d6d025bbf'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1149',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=174,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=33311,
    end_offset=33337,
    text_slice='”说毕，回头命小丫鬟取了《红楼梦》原稿来，递与宝玉。',
    hash='sha256:4ebe4be0ee521439aba0d3da931065cd02ce789c44cab390c6a0c1534b5acbc5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1150',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=175,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=33360,
    end_offset=33378,
    text_slice='〔红楼梦，引子〕开辟鸿蒙，谁为情种？',
    hash='sha256:77979c03400b9f133be4fdb24f3f6c618c88a5c7bded051915933002d601840c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1151',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=175,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=33378,
    end_offset=33386,
    text_slice='都只为风月情浓。',
    hash='sha256:d79b7edc8ec0b5c850071a1f7e448d9cd0ae6c4371354b442a18a42136166228'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1152',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=175,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=33386,
    end_offset=33406,
    text_slice='趁着这奈何天、伤怀日、寂寥时，试遣愚衷。',
    hash='sha256:e48b5a4613a490a2e0ba43efc6746e9a2bf621296210dbb9c45dd454b695784d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1153',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=175,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=33406,
    end_offset=33424,
    text_slice='因此上、演出这怀金悼玉的《红楼梦》。',
    hash='sha256:c473c11bc569f0ebc2208c945a85b0f645067801e1f07dbfc56dfa4377640487'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1154',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=176,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=33426,
    end_offset=33447,
    text_slice='〔终身误〕都道是金玉良姻，俺只念木石前盟。',
    hash='sha256:ad850078783558a5d65db853d2d820579a79f1c2bffe9fa1b439163dca148e8a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1155',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=176,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=33447,
    end_offset=33471,
    text_slice='空对着、山中高士晶莹雪；终不忘、世外仙姝寂寞林。',
    hash='sha256:01906ab1c413abac5071f4f96da296aa7b53021cef65691aa40b8e7eebbf0a89'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1156',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=176,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=33471,
    end_offset=33483,
    text_slice='叹人间、美中不足今方信。',
    hash='sha256:6978d111a33740fd0c74c9b22f7d9dd31f180b108f739e23eb6cee5e67df820b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1157',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=176,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=33483,
    end_offset=33497,
    text_slice='纵然是齐眉举案，到底意难平！',
    hash='sha256:30bc9ed67600a71342db1814a5de0997855e2a3b2c580e699260ca3e09493d83'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1158',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=177,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=33499,
    end_offset=33520,
    text_slice='〔枉凝眉〕一个是阆苑仙葩，一个是美玉无瑕。',
    hash='sha256:c74f548f100c83ee8bec67a57b99379794ac871e5193ece482d630c5409da273'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1159',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=177,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=33520,
    end_offset=33548,
    text_slice='若说没奇缘，今生偏又遇着他；若说有奇缘，如何心事终虚化？',
    hash='sha256:42e70ec3f9509fb666d9462d1213552bc619ab4d4fc73c09d940391c5e232832'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1160',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=177,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=33548,
    end_offset=33562,
    text_slice='一个枉自嗟呀，一个空劳牵挂。',
    hash='sha256:5687d51d0b50baecaa6d050fa77fc9c2b448aab7b5aad352d8b7c626a481a638'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1161',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=177,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=33562,
    end_offset=33576,
    text_slice='一个是水中月，一个是镜中花。',
    hash='sha256:da01b9cfe390081c013992ee7b7e680406297cec21073934a49c0b7d5514742d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1162',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=177,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=33576,
    end_offset=33601,
    text_slice='想眼中能有多少泪珠儿，怎禁得秋流到冬尽、春流到夏！',
    hash='sha256:d9ea20672c0502527c4d6907e15f38debb81a90c4ec096475926925263eee388'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1163',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=178,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=33603,
    end_offset=33635,
    text_slice='宝玉听了此曲，散漫无稽，不见得好处；但其声韵凄惋，竟能销魂醉魄。',
    hash='sha256:f00184787952d0c219acbcacdf6559a84d8f3807a08c305a41d1e6a527c7ff01'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1164',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=178,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=33635,
    end_offset=33658,
    text_slice='因此也不察其原委，问其来历，就暂以此释闷而已。',
    hash='sha256:a5a5da706e2f44334acb11b99eae2cf5d0fee1f2bd148a0df06665212db07258'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1165',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=179,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=33666,
    end_offset=33683,
    text_slice='〔恨无常〕喜荣华正好，恨无常又到。',
    hash='sha256:5a693ca70676e5a0c7f3bb15a79ee2abbcdcd03a94fad6b1741078fb61cb68a7'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1166',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=179,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=33683,
    end_offset=33693,
    text_slice='眼睁睁、把万事全拋。',
    hash='sha256:f83289227fbab9485bd1206e166734f69937a68c8e05206cbe603921c68543dd'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1167',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=179,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=33693,
    end_offset=33703,
    text_slice='荡悠悠、把芳魂消耗。',
    hash='sha256:18c64f39a7fc050998c078b7438b0a13ff7069c383443be8df89f8ec189f9d8a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1168',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=179,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=33703,
    end_offset=33712,
    text_slice='望家乡，路远山高。',
    hash='sha256:33371e91af05ef1e8ef0946aa6a16067146deadbaa856f5dfa807e3b51ec9e7b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1169',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=179,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=33712,
    end_offset=33741,
    text_slice='故向爹娘梦里相寻告：儿命已入黄泉，天伦呵，须要退步抽身早！',
    hash='sha256:414dcf8104be28b96155135092084669fcae1affc01426b2de188dd81d161671'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1170',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=180,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=33743,
    end_offset=33766,
    text_slice='〔分骨肉〕一帆风雨路三千，把骨肉家园齐来拋闪。',
    hash='sha256:13b1abb4f5803ce9967848e0ae8209a0bcd073dce8eabf73e92a099c7c7040e4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1171',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=180,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=33766,
    end_offset=33782,
    text_slice='恐哭损残年，告爹娘，休把儿悬念。',
    hash='sha256:f2a91c07e93f0942c8bc3d4c2e4592e7242fbeda70ab6f0755331c3c2cc3f069'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1172',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=180,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=33782,
    end_offset=33796,
    text_slice='自古穷通皆有定，离合岂无缘？',
    hash='sha256:3df71062a191f2bfa8efac35e4e9bab1b2300b9e9f8cefe67c00f4a8296f9060'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1173',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=180,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=33796,
    end_offset=33808,
    text_slice='从今分两地，各自保平安。',
    hash='sha256:c8c2b4dc87fb8bb066f60e9a976155148797e6ae624aadf5531835b8c6485476'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1174',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=180,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=33808,
    end_offset=33816,
    text_slice='奴去也，莫牵连！',
    hash='sha256:4462d1762df3937f1dc004006d9dc4d78e765c8ea5ea58d2d51eca89fdecccef'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1175',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=181,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=33818,
    end_offset=33832,
    text_slice='〔乐中悲〕襁褓中父母叹双亡。',
    hash='sha256:5029d80d4d7a8d047e51633027199cdfaf0b328f312627ff0fbf5ea1eccfed13'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1176',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=181,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=33832,
    end_offset=33844,
    text_slice='纵居那绮罗丛，谁知娇养？',
    hash='sha256:025c40f0dd6585a553ed6d413fba40677186645bc25428c11a301ef685972b6a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1177',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=181,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=33844,
    end_offset=33867,
    text_slice='幸生来英豪阔大宽宏量，从未将儿女私情略萦心上。',
    hash='sha256:0d98dad6d4e3630080f976076ea9a2ba2589cee9df80afd17c10490ff5de78a8'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1178',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=181,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=33867,
    end_offset=33879,
    text_slice='好一似、霁月光风耀玉堂。',
    hash='sha256:391caec119da9d82ab4cfbbdb1538cac9bfc15bf7cda9742b6c5b6817f6b7466'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1179',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=181,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=33879,
    end_offset=33906,
    text_slice='厮配得才貌仙郎，博得个地久天长，准折得幼年时坎坷形状。',
    hash='sha256:2f86dfb68cecb95890b2a7b4590ac554a9fde2ada5d5cca16390f1fe87ddca62'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1180',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=181,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=33906,
    end_offset=33919,
    text_slice='终久是云散高唐，水涸湘江。',
    hash='sha256:3d30a760b61c25e414fa8eb966db39ec394c3176bd502fc50b4124acd10229bb'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1181',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=181,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=33919,
    end_offset=33936,
    text_slice='这是尘寰中消长数应当，何必枉悲伤！',
    hash='sha256:dee08ecbc9db99bbc3624588225ac5c674956274760932ea9f3fafec2274872c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1182',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=182,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=33938,
    end_offset=33955,
    text_slice='〔世难容〕气质美如兰，才华阜比仙。',
    hash='sha256:25e124c4f99e6c15fc0025587aa26e8e5b5894059be9571b26e391d485e6fa63'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1183',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=182,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=33955,
    end_offset=33964,
    text_slice='天生成孤癖人皆罕。',
    hash='sha256:0b07f51afe11be3c7faef9520dc6424f87bce4b95c70efdff0adf19019b7f2bc'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1184',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=182,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=33964,
    end_offset=33980,
    text_slice='你道是、啖肉食腥膻，视绮罗俗厌。',
    hash='sha256:23eaa0578b59cafe52221b99156da45a1f1429213fed96fee1c31a713afa76d7'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1185',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=182,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=33980,
    end_offset=33996,
    text_slice='却不知、太高人愈妒，过洁世同嫌。',
    hash='sha256:31f6c82b8ec822fd9e1be14eca29d89d8722bc4fa712bf60784df8f7269bc8ff'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1186',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=182,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=33996,
    end_offset=34020,
    text_slice='可叹这、青灯古殿人将老；辜负了、红粉朱楼春色阑。',
    hash='sha256:1243f4d493b3a0668ec0edae9a62a815339d39c91e94fe40d0cf4831ef04f624'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1187',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=182,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=34020,
    end_offset=34035,
    text_slice='到头来、依旧是风尘骯脏违心愿。',
    hash='sha256:c9c7d11cec18411a2aefe0274ad9389f634c72df7ff1b88e597f6eda2622e9fd'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1188',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=182,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=34035,
    end_offset=34059,
    text_slice='好一似、无瑕白玉遭泥陷；又何须，王孙公子叹无缘！',
    hash='sha256:82830daa43a93a79b5023afeb6c38d9b3c260a8e40e770882f6c1cbcaa6d9caa'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1189',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=183,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=34061,
    end_offset=34082,
    text_slice='〔喜冤家〕中山狼，无情兽，全不念当日根由。',
    hash='sha256:c014f48379b47d39aa300f859b82381f32de80afb6e80c75bbb5290e8e178662'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1190',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=183,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=34082,
    end_offset=34093,
    text_slice='一味的骄奢淫荡贪欢媾。',
    hash='sha256:d21b939860760113c9860d44c860a0c93a3ed436ad980c65ac9f220ac480c9eb'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1191',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=183,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=34093,
    end_offset=34117,
    text_slice='觑着那，侯门艳质同蒲柳；作践得，公府千金似下流。',
    hash='sha256:c11d693540554a1ef82e652fc6698f17a920e470557fc040dad2e3e3c592eaa8'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1192',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=183,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=34117,
    end_offset=34129,
    text_slice='叹芳魂艳魄，一载荡悠悠！',
    hash='sha256:ccc4df387f20e0065fa8cd55bae80382d62675147a3bc4347c9a2bf7d31f29b2'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1193',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=184,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=34131,
    end_offset=34151,
    text_slice='〔虚花悟〕将那三春看破，桃红柳绿待如何？',
    hash='sha256:3006e63569f9d9c110a8dbc8655aa910fe73663552a560b41e5898bd78137018'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1194',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=184,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=34151,
    end_offset=34165,
    text_slice='把这韶华打灭，觅那清淡天和。',
    hash='sha256:bf3ab9f341b23194cd7860806e2bd8f1990dfbb876bb93f1248296377145286f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1195',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=184,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=34165,
    end_offset=34181,
    text_slice='说什么，天上夭桃盛，云中杏蕊多。',
    hash='sha256:ecd312b6edc12e7a96678519e95f72082b617459e2b34a81941220d6fd290426'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1196',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=184,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=34181,
    end_offset=34191,
    text_slice='到头来，谁把秋捱过？',
    hash='sha256:c50c52918a76b6b3655fe79d599292ea8367e729f05ab7aacbebda54692537d2'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1197',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=184,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=34191,
    end_offset=34211,
    text_slice='则看那，白杨村里人呜咽，青枫林下鬼吟哦。',
    hash='sha256:914bbcf917cb4691c1ea0846ed06aacf7e7c64d704fe420cca2d7b21c1acc88d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1198',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=184,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=34211,
    end_offset=34223,
    text_slice='更兼着，连天衰草遮坟墓。',
    hash='sha256:d329d7b34ad1e7191c3d3a9a375dfdb1be5e0e4dc88b3da21e9bfa8bbac9a362'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1199',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=184,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=34223,
    end_offset=34243,
    text_slice='这的是，昨贫今富人劳碌，春荣秋谢花折磨。',
    hash='sha256:4e7aefa3243cc20c079964efceabad2a6421eef174cb7921367c635b46ed92f9'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1200',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=184,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=34243,
    end_offset=34255,
    text_slice='似这般，生关死劫谁能躲？',
    hash='sha256:d480ebe94e7cb69edaab4064d7c9e0331c8bdeaba7d42495924300080c7dc43d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1201',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=184,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=34255,
    end_offset=34274,
    text_slice='闻说道，西方宝树唤婆娑，上结着长生果。',
    hash='sha256:c0dc97e536680badaef6ee74efb6ff88b3a64d779953e07c714fb1347ba6df32'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1202',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=185,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=34276,
    end_offset=34297,
    text_slice='〔聪明累〕机关算尽太聪明，反算了卿卿性命。',
    hash='sha256:eaed57502bc09451b14f67e1d9c1268f5a538e82378217dfc08ff92c2faaf4aa'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1203',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=185,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=34297,
    end_offset=34309,
    text_slice='生前心已碎，死后性空灵。',
    hash='sha256:afb672a305bf98fb3f04d8d7f892394255c3bcfe3d666c3beea57a7b7164c8f3'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1204',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=185,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=34309,
    end_offset=34325,
    text_slice='家富人宁，终有个家亡人散各奔腾。',
    hash='sha256:64cb3e8ed1d392887f61739842b0c778ae5916ac70ce15715372a959d9b1df4f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1205',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=185,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=34325,
    end_offset=34347,
    text_slice='枉费了、意悬悬半世心，好一似、荡悠悠三更梦。',
    hash='sha256:d1947422415c144eefa1a67a142e5f5841a239d164e0e44c53f7c738c7baac0b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1206',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=185,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=34347,
    end_offset=34363,
    text_slice='忽喇喇似大厦倾，昏惨惨似灯将尽。',
    hash='sha256:d09329708c193d37f734f55fe8bb51ae66fa62a8a011e33d5b0a14fd0a1bd510'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1207',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=185,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=34363,
    end_offset=34365,
    text_slice='呀！',
    hash='sha256:971e447a960a0ee0a628076c22f27d5ee86ce266d1598843dbba7f284c5cf7ba'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1208',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=185,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=34365,
    end_offset=34373,
    text_slice='一场欢喜忽悲辛。',
    hash='sha256:f1f343a8f146be09d9239268f6e817eba006c8e792716c3f93b2d8c6bcf5bac8'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1209',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=185,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=34373,
    end_offset=34381,
    text_slice='叹人世，终难定！',
    hash='sha256:be7df9e048d8d8d797bd2589458d8fc5a1c92ae5699534bd226a2ccd00339de1'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1210',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=186,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=34383,
    end_offset=34414,
    text_slice='〔留余庆〕留余庆，留余庆，忽遇恩人；幸娘亲，幸娘亲，积得阴功。',
    hash='sha256:d2a69d9f69f2364f8a7614f530abe3da8673eca6955a204dc350e45c17f7a2d1'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1211',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=186,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=34414,
    end_offset=34440,
    text_slice='劝人生，济困扶穷，休似俺那爱银钱、忘骨肉的狠舅奸兄！',
    hash='sha256:58cf0ddc5779c535b6bdc678499e598efa411a710eeaa70723bb61593798e6a4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1212',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=186,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=34440,
    end_offset=34452,
    text_slice='正是乘除加减，上有苍穹！',
    hash='sha256:1fb870bc70389a1f986b01c45c6f74f904e483efce8bee9652d9531ebee0483e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1213',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=187,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=34454,
    end_offset=34472,
    text_slice='〔晚韶华〕镜里恩情，更那堪梦里功名！',
    hash='sha256:f1e62c9e7516cca1b6666ecb4a455010e761e996fdc6d6fee52a388526d0360e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1214',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=187,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=34472,
    end_offset=34481,
    text_slice='那美韶华去之何迅！',
    hash='sha256:3f215f976116cd1a59c6e8611444e17572e6dbb9f0490e0e635182588cba33a7'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1215',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=187,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=34481,
    end_offset=34489,
    text_slice='再休提绣帐鸳衾。',
    hash='sha256:f9865ea67629525b27b253273899035358811f4482348bae83e762cdbae31394'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1216',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=187,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=34489,
    end_offset=34508,
    text_slice='只这带珠冠，披凤袄，也抵不了无常性命。',
    hash='sha256:ddd1cf6696991c779208c9917d48c71e0a0cb66b9c4ee9355164e5489f22fed8'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1217',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=187,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=34508,
    end_offset=34529,
    text_slice='虽说是、人生莫受老来贫，也须要阴骘积儿孙。',
    hash='sha256:a290953c7872f8f93d4cf04546d238d282bc25f2cc870790bc0d396f3c1eb332'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1218',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=187,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=34529,
    end_offset=34577,
    text_slice='气昂昂头戴簪缨，气昂昂头戴簪缨，光灿灿胸悬金印；威赫赫爵禄高登，威赫赫爵禄高登，昏惨惨黄泉路近。',
    hash='sha256:7bf30a8b249d3de0ded89c2b7ef4739ee13e196ddfd69c0557ff82390a02e0a5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1219',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=187,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=34577,
    end_offset=34586,
    text_slice='问古来将相可还存？',
    hash='sha256:2e66a1e0f00481a4bac1cb3c4608bc1b5b791180a9d26c9732b4e83d2754ac19'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1220',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=187,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=34586,
    end_offset=34599,
    text_slice='也只是，虚名儿与后人钦敬。',
    hash='sha256:9420c29651b19a98e2c3f8d33308b7d9790bd95f87eb301114c7c83919aaba95'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1221',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=188,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=34601,
    end_offset=34614,
    text_slice='〔好事终〕画梁春尽落香尘。',
    hash='sha256:e054ca5a84a579f9e6075f919fe579979ee7c79fd28db1995681310f4a0adeef'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1222',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=188,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=34614,
    end_offset=34630,
    text_slice='擅风情，秉月貌，便是败家的根本。',
    hash='sha256:650073fa67cf6fa08cf2169385b8dc7c14549f6d04503449edf767ee7433cba5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1223',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=188,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=34630,
    end_offset=34646,
    text_slice='箕裘颓堕皆从敬，家事消亡首罪宁。',
    hash='sha256:8ad4fc32a186b1312857f1b104493c4483cbbd373d37242e9362845d0caeac63'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1224',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=188,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=34646,
    end_offset=34652,
    text_slice='宿孽总因情。',
    hash='sha256:15f0e5d5372c184a9e562baf44764efeead48ade783e4f54ffbebc0a0bd34764'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1225',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=189,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=34654,
    end_offset=34658,
    text_slice='〔收尾?',
    hash='sha256:0ef796aa18c9936ee3b32fa3ea504fb0408f57e888cb98a5ba13ffe862a02334'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1226',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=189,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=34658,
    end_offset=34716,
    text_slice='飞鸟各投林〕为官的，家业凋零；富贵的，金银散尽；有恩的，死里逃生；无情的，分明报应；欠命的，命已还；欠泪的，泪已尽。',
    hash='sha256:0c0cd782d442a5d960e3ef8db0cac6372d40851e085c71d7db5b2d5dbd813101'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1227',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=189,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=34716,
    end_offset=34732,
    text_slice='冤冤相报实非轻，分离聚合皆前定。',
    hash='sha256:fe94f85d19b84c6168f41fa8eef3d8db3f212a3ee388aed16d40ebbce3d405b2'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1228',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=189,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=34732,
    end_offset=34749,
    text_slice='欲知命短问前生，老来富贵也真侥幸。',
    hash='sha256:2ae657116e6dccb9d25b9244d6db73df5ef07609c2a37e7753d6bd4ebffd7789'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1229',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=189,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=34749,
    end_offset=34768,
    text_slice='看破的，遁入空门；痴迷的，枉送了性命。',
    hash='sha256:4a716bd98a3b85991081f6d8b1a5c9ad79dbbeab38e678b3c813f8cf3be4efbb'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1230',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=189,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=34768,
    end_offset=34789,
    text_slice='好一似食尽鸟投林，落了片白茫茫大地真干净！',
    hash='sha256:d8127c055ecc4abd4b80e5d42f2190aababb32fb9d67a09cd2c99e349e2a2fe3'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1231',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=190,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=34791,
    end_offset=34800,
    text_slice='歌毕，还要歌副曲。',
    hash='sha256:2af4f48789ad60bfa10f613a58e01689c82518eda2de01b7fc89b47960877e27'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1232',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=190,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=34813,
    end_offset=34823,
    text_slice='“痴儿！竟尚未悟！”',
    hash='sha256:ae7121b67f31a887a93029f1541160336074eba93a3399b988ddf6b4516924d6'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1233',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=190,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=34823,
    end_offset=34847,
    text_slice='那宝玉忙止歌姬不必再唱，自觉朦胧恍惚，告醉求卧。',
    hash='sha256:3b4d8248a7a0fa76e0aa8baeaaa12cc0e1000f62f76bb7ea8f9a526f71ad4321'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1234',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=190,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=34847,
    end_offset=34883,
    text_slice='警幻便命撤去残席，送宝玉至一香闺绣阁之中，其间铺陈之盛，乃素所未见之物。',
    hash='sha256:da8af6026ed7fab50c3c0dd196f5b0a2df19ec9be24d1f0de585f46d56c41418'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1235',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=190,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=34883,
    end_offset=34920,
    text_slice='更可骇者，早有一位女子在内，其鲜艳妩媚，有似乎宝钗，风流袅娜，则又如黛玉。',
    hash='sha256:64fa09465edf85fe4f6a534f14cfcc7c15a7177e6f0aa8a3389d4003bf62cfd4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1236',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=190,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=34931,
    end_offset=35073,
    text_slice='“尘世中多少富贵之家，那些绿窗风月，绣阁烟霞，皆被淫污纨与那些流荡女子悉皆玷辱。更可恨者，自古来多少轻薄浪子，皆以‘好色不淫’为饰，又以‘情而不淫’作案，此皆饰非掩丑之语也。好色即淫，知情更淫。是以巫山之会，云雨之欢，皆由既悦其色，复恋其情所致也。吾所爱汝者，乃天下古今第一淫人也！”',
    hash='sha256:901bf4b0981af8273b42bbb7694ec3826c7151b7283127070656912b34a52908'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1237',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=191,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=35075,
    end_offset=35086,
    text_slice='宝玉听了，唬得忙答道：',
    hash='sha256:137dab2bf411bcb57ce94e8fe10bda41ae4d390793bc762ae3a8169e62eaa7ce'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1238',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=191,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=35086,
    end_offset=35135,
    text_slice='“仙姑错了！我因懒于读书，家父母尚每垂训饬，岂敢再冒‘淫’字？况且年纪尚小，不知‘淫’字为何物。”',
    hash='sha256:1ce2e47944f95a2c8601f65a0990dab040453bcb70fcd1639990e2351e8de9bb'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1239',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=191,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=35135,
    end_offset=35139,
    text_slice='警幻道：',
    hash='sha256:4a7a118d0dc4ab83a933c8225ac307345ab46873ebc7ef3f8a7b640ab3723ddf'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1240',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=191,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=35139,
    end_offset=35445,
    text_slice='“非也！淫虽一理，意则有别。如世之好淫者，不过悦容貌，喜歌舞，调笑无厌，云雨无时，恨不能尽天下之美女，供我片时之趣兴，此皆皮肤淫滥之蠢物耳！如尔则天分中生成一段痴情，吾辈推之为‘意淫’。‘意淫’二字，惟心会而不可口传，可神通而不可语达。汝今独得此二字，在闺阁中，固可为良友，然于世道中，未免迂阔怪诡，百口嘲谤，万目睚眦。今既遇令祖宁、荣二公剖腹深嘱，吾不忍君独为我闺阁增光，见弃于世道。是以特引前来，醉以灵酒，沁以仙茗，警以妙曲，再将吾妹一人，乳名兼美字、可卿者，许配于汝。今夕良时，即可成姻。不过令汝领略此仙闺幻境之风光尚然如此，何况尘境之情景哉！而今后万万解释，改悟前情，将谨勤有用的工夫，置身于经济之道。”',
    hash='sha256:bb7fb6a97130adbd0f881cdf32fb18a0e72cf0682044ca0770e373a2966fa030'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1241',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=191,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=35445,
    end_offset=35470,
    text_slice='说毕，便秘授以云雨之事，推宝玉入帐，将门掩上自去。',
    hash='sha256:62e8d316efa1d3b707d710f443eab8d28f12b6a97d4fbf260557da9fe256a11a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1242',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=192,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=35472,
    end_offset=35499,
    text_slice='那宝玉恍恍惚惚，依警幻所嘱之言，未免有阳台、巫峡之事。',
    hash='sha256:96a19055f0742d5b865ad5365adeede03b760d4c6a2b695c86ca8c9a7d5469e1'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1243',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=192,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=35499,
    end_offset=35521,
    text_slice='数日来，柔情缱绻，软语温存，与可卿难解难分。',
    hash='sha256:89b9bf6dc53663b4e35afc9ba8c7421e01df917024295625bf71c7559eda6c82'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1244',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=193,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=35523,
    end_offset=35554,
    text_slice='那日，警幻携宝玉，可卿闲游至一个所在，但见荆榛遍地，狼虎同群。',
    hash='sha256:262b0b177bd29ceb3de0c2a1063a0e5f38dcaf924ad7e3efccb9f51f252181d3'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1245',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=193,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=35554,
    end_offset=35574,
    text_slice='忽而，大河阻路，黑水淌洋，又无桥梁可通。',
    hash='sha256:e7eebc6c9a62e6c56268961eebff51f2ff7409e21942cf4b2240636d1e5a6241'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1246',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=193,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=35587,
    end_offset=35602,
    text_slice='“宝玉休前进，作速回头要紧！”',
    hash='sha256:8411af3d5aee88fa6d3f4ae4dc6b4c9ba8dc1ef99a92ac130000a269b335f413'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1247',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=193,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=35602,
    end_offset=35610,
    text_slice='宝玉忙止步问道：',
    hash='sha256:034c4b79daac786491e0c28793372e8b4a23d932a43352c39e106cb86dbc6512'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1248',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=193,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=35610,
    end_offset=35617,
    text_slice='“此系何处？”',
    hash='sha256:294f11e39c17ace94c236140cf33bd5f7bd4d2e41676338212961f9b20e1a9c7'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1249',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=193,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=35617,
    end_offset=35621,
    text_slice='警幻道：',
    hash='sha256:4a7a118d0dc4ab83a933c8225ac307345ab46873ebc7ef3f8a7b640ab3723ddf'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1250',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=193,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=35621,
    end_offset=35715,
    text_slice='“此即迷津也。深有万丈，遥亘千里，中无舟楫可通，只有一个木筏，乃木居士掌舵，灰侍者撑篙，不受金银之谢，但遇有缘者渡之。尔今偶游至此，如堕落其中，则深负我从前一番以情悟道、守理衷情之言矣！”',
    hash='sha256:b4abee6b91493b4b616068aa8bcdba6dca72ab924ec6cb5dfd55fc913b494cd9'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1251',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=193,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=35715,
    end_offset=35748,
    text_slice='宝玉方欲回言，只听迷津内水响如雷，竟有一夜叉般怪物窜出，直扑而来。',
    hash='sha256:b3378da286c163d37bbb516ba4246eb6ac2a089e06d918d63663f4415933af7f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1252',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=193,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=35764,
    end_offset=35776,
    text_slice='“可卿救我！可卿救我！”',
    hash='sha256:bd23e9b4682ef672554b6b66e47f4da2c192fcf3276bd9708dbf61ad1c9d5473'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1253',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=193,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=35776,
    end_offset=35793,
    text_slice='慌得袭人、媚人等上来扶起，拉手说：',
    hash='sha256:52b3e2298c58baee8aaa90e4a5b047d1c9fb6695f58100c6a768177e24c64a18'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1254',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=193,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=35793,
    end_offset=35806,
    text_slice='“宝玉别怕，我们在这里!”',
    hash='sha256:e14368910ab74bd86333f1584c77e4be8650997bbd4f433388d4dd85401306d4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1255',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=194,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=35808,
    end_offset=35824,
    text_slice='秦氏在外听见，连忙进来，一面说：',
    hash='sha256:05e2c5c1651781ab1d07e13e76fe99e5cf9473b30a2ae048fbb5da52509c778a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1256',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=194,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=35824,
    end_offset=35843,
    text_slice='“ㄚ鬟们，好生看着猫儿狗儿打架打架！”',
    hash='sha256:2534bd0a7de3b5ee71d50bab0576f0b1097945fee94daa5d8e82321c650f879b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1257',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=194,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=35843,
    end_offset=35852,
    text_slice='又闻宝玉口中连叫：',
    hash='sha256:09fe227507c02c660d6af408c61240b6338a11cbaac33d654522de7b7314a0bf'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1258',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=194,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=35852,
    end_offset=35858,
    text_slice='“可卿救我”',
    hash='sha256:ce779a53bfb57ef044b123313070fc33c85a7299d073e799fb9bacd27f30ab3d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1259',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=194,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=35858,
    end_offset=35864,
    text_slice='，因纳闷道：',
    hash='sha256:d36267aa7dbaeb3017c150fe52a65e532980e0f0e5ef19ef401cfd7cd596fbea'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1260',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=194,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=35864,
    end_offset=35887,
    text_slice='“我的小名这里没人知道，他如何从梦里叫出来？”',
    hash='sha256:b62f549076ab0be76c471657431b7a096bef999fb423e582c733fcdab0091f0a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1261',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=194,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=35887,
    end_offset=35890,
    text_slice='正是：',
    hash='sha256:a41aa5ab8bf6a1f15fc07b37c586871dcd3dd9b690e58e081052393d29747ef4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1262',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=195,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=35892,
    end_offset=35908,
    text_slice='一场幽梦同谁近，千古情人独我痴。',
    hash='sha256:7d16b8e5f7bf4ffa93ac4ae0cbdf8495151350c719f694df9d694e1f09c34d1a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1263',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=196,
    segment_type='heading',
    start_offset=35910,
    end_offset=35932,
    text_slice='第六回  贾宝玉初试云雨情\u3000刘姥姥一进荣国府',
    hash='sha256:8bd7e44af359a02c571f02369a15f69ce303e7574dd500a098165604e8a60e90'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1264',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=197,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=35934,
    end_offset=35937,
    text_slice='题曰：',
    hash='sha256:929d387722922017064f1ab92b7c279dac886989c2329f581607682d0468cf5e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1265',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=198,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=35939,
    end_offset=35951,
    text_slice='朝叩富儿门，富儿犹未足。',
    hash='sha256:bddee40f4c5f14b3896df52ea1495f0a8eaf60660e32fbf5741119e883dd4e7b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1266',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=198,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=35951,
    end_offset=35963,
    text_slice='虽无千金酬，嗟彼胜骨肉！',
    hash='sha256:1ca0b805a3aacfda2b57328e795e01a43a089fae777810d492260c6d01acb7cc'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1267',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=199,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=35965,
    end_offset=35996,
    text_slice='却说秦氏因听见宝玉从梦中唤她的乳名，心中自是纳闷，又不好细问。',
    hash='sha256:416c980edab1f93dbc65e5cf2023ee387bf04299895cd6450f1f8b3ed0907765'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1268',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=199,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=35996,
    end_offset=36010,
    text_slice='彼时宝玉迷迷惑惑，若有所失。',
    hash='sha256:4d3b04df867da6c2eb42165265bc56d344e3ed3d07ba996b46651433b10c20cd'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1269',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=199,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=36010,
    end_offset=36031,
    text_slice='众人忙端上桂圆汤来，呷了两口，遂起身整衣。',
    hash='sha256:93d4e31cacf4bd91b91be45ca31adbf061a9e668bfe05ad967fc9ec591bb58a2'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1270',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=199,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=36031,
    end_offset=36074,
    text_slice='袭人伸手与他系裤带时，不觉伸手至大腿处，只觉冰凉一片沾湿，唬得忙退出手来，问是怎么了。',
    hash='sha256:a1ff0a2a99a4935823b0e67077c67ab9abc489f785566506644c1f45bf2cab4f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1271',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=199,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=36074,
    end_offset=36088,
    text_slice='宝玉红涨了脸，把她的手一捻。',
    hash='sha256:a21add286001144af9f98b617e92a7b0fb6506596bba1b3dbed712a062eda3da'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1272',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=199,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=36088,
    end_offset=36151,
    text_slice='袭人本是个聪明女子，年纪本又比宝玉大两岁，近来也渐通人事，今见宝玉如此光景，心中便觉察了一半，不觉也羞得红涨了脸面，不敢再问。',
    hash='sha256:4db473cc3130c557a8686c29b6ea5925906cb1804e132508cfbb30722600fa9b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1273',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=199,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=36151,
    end_offset=36178,
    text_slice='仍旧理好衣裳，遂至贾母处来，胡乱吃毕了晚饭，过这边来。',
    hash='sha256:04bafaefdc7ad21c1218cd7c6d7f05ff0e0784ebda7b7fb48210453856a30a2d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1274',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=200,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=36180,
    end_offset=36208,
    text_slice='袭人忙趁众奶娘丫鬟不在旁时，另取出一件中衣来与宝玉换上。',
    hash='sha256:6e7c0da8a245100cf3e75d2f05a3fd7b1aab17bd146231d2fca74a664fd55d50'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1275',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=200,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=36216,
    end_offset=36232,
    text_slice='“好姐姐，千万别告诉别人要紧！”',
    hash='sha256:2827dcd01024cc32797be281efeb95cf9648a809adaad4b6bd55890cf75053a6'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1276',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=200,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=36232,
    end_offset=36241,
    text_slice='袭人亦含羞笑问道：',
    hash='sha256:5ae538a68a7f0a8302072f2296b88da7623900c85028fb1754a8ea91cf8eb351'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1277',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=200,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=36241,
    end_offset=36265,
    text_slice='“你梦见什么故事了？是那里流出来的那些脏东西？”',
    hash='sha256:374a5024a206ade971e7bed4b8e08dfced44879897197d43bb31f2a5b4482981'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1278',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=200,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=36265,
    end_offset=36269,
    text_slice='宝玉道：',
    hash='sha256:10c9e1a43f0e2e5bf2e54f50fb3dbede512eb436326aec72d14625e62153e9b0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1279',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=200,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=36269,
    end_offset=36276,
    text_slice='“一言难尽。”',
    hash='sha256:b0fb7a10b9b0cf1d8b138aa1d761adf6e2dc233ae2e2d02fbc88064d8637a02b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1280',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=200,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=36276,
    end_offset=36293,
    text_slice='说着，便把梦中之事细说与袭人听了。',
    hash='sha256:3b08b17a730daeb249ae2882cdb6d8b7eb9bc6e0a8164c53d10005bbc02b7bc9'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1281',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=200,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=36293,
    end_offset=36317,
    text_slice='然后说至警幻所授云雨之情，羞的袭人掩面伏身而笑。',
    hash='sha256:9d10ba47466ade4b1d5929e49a7e6f16d8ebc59d33cefdfbb10803a9b9b79cc4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1282',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=200,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=36317,
    end_offset=36344,
    text_slice='宝玉亦素喜袭人柔媚娇俏，遂强袭人同领警幻所训云雨之事。',
    hash='sha256:9fceab9a1c20065ba0864f8cd315578d2cdbd38c43571beafbe09e0af3e6dbb9'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1283',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=200,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=36344,
    end_offset=36387,
    text_slice='袭人素知贾母已将自己与了宝玉的，今便如此，亦不为越礼，遂和宝玉偷试一番，幸得无人撞见。',
    hash='sha256:2430d9f36eda0d5507f3de17b0f14e21d7b796f1270cc8fd230c17e0712c0959'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1284',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=200,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=36387,
    end_offset=36413,
    text_slice='自此，宝玉视袭人更与别个不同，袭人待宝玉更为尽心职。',
    hash='sha256:0558dd82c5a1168b00a7f5e854909e4b17b8649a83540a91c0dd956eb6db0373'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1285',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=200,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=36413,
    end_offset=36420,
    text_slice='暂且别无话说。',
    hash='sha256:836402898e4a5c9b03e49362a4fc68bb88dbf6d452d3514c94a6b3cdb04fd7fd'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1286',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=201,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=36422,
    end_offset=36482,
    text_slice='按荣府中一宅人合算起来，人口虽不多，从上至下也有三四百丁；事虽不多，一天也有一二十件，竟如乱麻一般，并无个头绪可作纲领。',
    hash='sha256:1c48603da571e166d43f60163d5e44e1e3332597165ae55a6f266dbbc99fc7b4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1287',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=201,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=36482,
    end_offset=36556,
    text_slice='正寻思从那一件事自那一个人写起方妙，恰好忽从千里之外，芥荳之微，小小一个人家，因与荣府略有些瓜葛，这日正往荣府中来，因此便就此一家说来，倒还是头绪。',
    hash='sha256:a38b059689f68b9f5373dc98e32d9af80b52da7ec4f72a3d5d9d05bd58a11aa2'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1288',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=201,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=36556,
    end_offset=36575,
    text_slice='你道这一家姓甚名谁，又与荣府有甚瓜葛。',
    hash='sha256:5ae6afcaae02438147986ad6b967fb1f0d611ebb68ccdbf2af254022af9735a7'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1289',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=201,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=36575,
    end_offset=36617,
    text_slice='――诸公若嫌琐碎粗呢，则快掷下此书，另觅好书去醒目；若谓聊可破闷时，待蠢物逐细言来。',
    hash='sha256:2d5f32c00a773d9db2976bd4ad1055992b5fefdf1466a07894d0766366392457'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1290',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=202,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=36619,
    end_offset=36666,
    text_slice='方才所说这小小之家，姓王，乃本地人氏，祖上曾作过小小的一个京官，昔年与凤姐之祖王夫人之父认识。',
    hash='sha256:043231f745ae850b6cc1dfbdc32a7bebd9088b308dcbe95415440453b8cb7040'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1291',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=202,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=36666,
    end_offset=36684,
    text_slice='因贪王家的势利，便连了宗，认作侄儿。',
    hash='sha256:15d1b1d4a0775a022a727c49c234d34accb346d576434bd03b8d7221798495f0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1292',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=202,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=36684,
    end_offset=36726,
    text_slice='那时，只有王夫人之大兄凤姐之父与王夫人随在京中的，知有此一门连宗之族，余者皆不认识。',
    hash='sha256:a1ce80d42f1696f60355ca9012643ea1d183adced1f0a49171981a818d713057'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1293',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=202,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=36726,
    end_offset=36763,
    text_slice='目今其祖已故，只有一个儿子，名唤王成，因家业萧条，仍搬出城外原乡中住去了。',
    hash='sha256:55d2a9f7c6e9863e3f291b3b3ebc92d0c221308833842e8ac046dca3425eed21'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1294',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=202,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=36763,
    end_offset=36782,
    text_slice='王成新近亦因病故，只有其子，小名狗儿。',
    hash='sha256:3e1b2ab2d7f3e167324c01211283178412d69abbb03b166e372e128daa2e04f2'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1295',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=202,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=36782,
    end_offset=36809,
    text_slice='狗儿亦生一子，小名板儿；嫡妻刘氏，又生一女，名唤青儿。',
    hash='sha256:1d48d79df48dd15b3e307276427076e8cbb9b24bb2174fbb5a9341a5c350d56e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1296',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=202,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=36809,
    end_offset=36821,
    text_slice='一家四口，仍以务农为业。',
    hash='sha256:967ab7aa75cc5087b49842f186b5857a0a0a9179d803755904cb504d5ce0dcad'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1297',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=202,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=36821,
    end_offset=36853,
    text_slice='因狗儿白日间又作些生计，刘氏又操井臼等事，青板姊弟两个无人看管。',
    hash='sha256:3758eb3884077fc8d46ae48aca813dd63db015af564aa7b1fb4aabb7e6a81e92'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1298',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=202,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=36853,
    end_offset=36869,
    text_slice='狗儿遂将岳母刘姥姥接来一处过活。',
    hash='sha256:21e89971a9cff9a721eda0608e88e0e191d4016856dddc0b0ae93539731a2605'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1299',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=202,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=36869,
    end_offset=36901,
    text_slice='这刘姥姥乃是个久经世代的老寡妇，膝下又无儿女，只靠两亩薄田度日。',
    hash='sha256:a55280833880c64eeeb7b2229f79ddce998d3277a9e6fe2c066a71419e7b7c8c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1300',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=202,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=36901,
    end_offset=36933,
    text_slice='如今女婿接来养活，岂不愿意，遂一心一计，帮趁着女儿女婿过活起来。',
    hash='sha256:5e9e1dc98bf1ef4ede852fefa2fdc3b4d34f34b54558d210e2e377f39665d33c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1301',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=203,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=36935,
    end_offset=36988,
    text_slice='因这年秋尽冬初，天气冷将上来，家中冬事未办，狗儿未免心中烦虑，吃了几杯闷酒，在家闲寻气恼，刘氏也不敢顶撞。',
    hash='sha256:fa7953ac285e46d727f7197e35d02e4b7dc6e66323372ad353007562cafa6778'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1302',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=203,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=37001,
    end_offset=37155,
    text_slice='“姑爷，你别嗔着我多嘴。咱们村庄人，那一个不是老老诚诚的，守着多大碗儿吃多大的饭。你皆因年小的时，托着你那老家的福，吃喝惯了，如今所以把持不住。有了钱就顾头不顾尾，没了钱就瞎生气，成个什么男子汉大丈夫了！如今咱们虽离城住着，终是天子脚下。这长安城中，遍地都是钱，只可惜没人会去拿去罢了。在家跳蹋也不中用的。”',
    hash='sha256:ce5b21fda31f151b566660461397e391c6000db20f0977a8a945c1e71d44191f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1303',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=203,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=37155,
    end_offset=37164,
    text_slice='狗儿听说，便急道：',
    hash='sha256:fdee329b9bedc267ff8698e7a2a6dece17e4d4e2ce89ceda99671bdc06f5b7b2'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1304',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=203,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=37164,
    end_offset=37188,
    text_slice='“你老只会炕头儿上混说，难道叫我打劫偷去不成？”',
    hash='sha256:f67db8fb007adbe54dd9652132e430eaa45d41b19d9e221109c98c1daf76d4bf'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1305',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=203,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=37188,
    end_offset=37193,
    text_slice='刘姥姥道：',
    hash='sha256:d5b36905fd0f84600160cd0100f419b526eba8e12d366add2a27385ca2bf84e4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1306',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=203,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=37193,
    end_offset=37230,
    text_slice='“谁叫你偷去呢！也到底大家想法儿裁度，不然，那银子钱自己跑到咱家来不成？”',
    hash='sha256:c3b6fcb28afb8f451829a78122b89fc553c757e67e1399c9fb807c13d0fb7b5d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1307',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=203,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=37230,
    end_offset=37236,
    text_slice='狗儿冷笑道：',
    hash='sha256:eabc71831fbedf9fcc84c871f29eeb7f869e126089bc73b48632cf8d90fdbdc2'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1308',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=203,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=37236,
    end_offset=37290,
    text_slice='“有法儿还等到这会子呢？我又没有收税的亲戚，作官的朋友，有什么法子可想的？便有，也只怕他们未必来理我们呢！”',
    hash='sha256:2eb9827e4357cd003be0ee765251ba4b142689ac16ddfc9c4d574a5008a2250a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1309',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=204,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=37292,
    end_offset=37297,
    text_slice='刘姥姥道：',
    hash='sha256:d5b36905fd0f84600160cd0100f419b526eba8e12d366add2a27385ca2bf84e4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1310',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=204,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=37297,
    end_offset=37559,
    text_slice='“这倒不然。谋事在人，成事在天。咱们谋到了，靠菩萨的保佑，有些机会，也未可知。我倒替你们想出一个机会来。当日，你们原是和金陵王家连过宗的，二十年前，他们看承你们还好；如今自然是你们拉硬屎的，不肯去俯就他，故疏远起来。想当初，我和女儿还去过一遭。他家的二小姐着实响快，会待人的，倒不拿大。如今现是荣国府贾二老爷的夫人。听得说，如今上了年纪，越发怜贫恤老，最爱斋僧敬道、舍米舍钱的。如今王府虽升了边任，只怕这二姑太太还认得咱们。你何不去走动走动，或者她念旧，有些好处，也未可知。要是他发一点好心，拔一根寒毛，比咱们的腰还粗呢！”',
    hash='sha256:e046b0dfa204d56c7860cb5f66deac1f8428776fbc86feb53dcfcef6aae195f9'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1311',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=204,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=37559,
    end_offset=37567,
    text_slice='刘氏一旁接口道：',
    hash='sha256:6b1e9d98c1fa3681e0b4e962746b9a18287552acda09ac1bde0d71f3c9c6d8bc'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1312',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=204,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=37567,
    end_offset=37623,
    text_slice='“你老虽说的是，但只你我这样个嘴脸，怎么好到她门上去的？先不先，他们那些门上人也未必肯去通报。没的去打嘴现世！”',
    hash='sha256:623b7efd00016e6ac4c6374c19d52db93701dac7019d57a2150a4d20c4ca7808'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1313',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=205,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=37625,
    end_offset=37651,
    text_slice='谁知狗儿利名心甚重，听如此一说，心下便有些活动起来。',
    hash='sha256:030e440f0f77812b15c7b5eb13e08409bdbb803d4e3987411051ed3b36898ce0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1314',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=205,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=37665,
    end_offset=37710,
    text_slice='“姥姥既如此说，况且当年你又见过这姑太太一次，何不你老人家明日就走一趟，先试试风头再说。”',
    hash='sha256:a131b03d87a51ef395bd2bca918ca5943ad0c037607afe486701089ded30bffc'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1315',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=205,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=37710,
    end_offset=37715,
    text_slice='刘姥姥道：',
    hash='sha256:d5b36905fd0f84600160cd0100f419b526eba8e12d366add2a27385ca2bf84e4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1316',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=205,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=37715,
    end_offset=37759,
    text_slice='“嗳哟哟！可是说的，‘侯门似海’，我是个什么东西，她家人又不认得我，我去了也是白去的。”',
    hash='sha256:301081aaa9211daa90b66d2d0ad7736804418b31827567aa2d32193c50de648c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1317',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=205,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=37759,
    end_offset=37764,
    text_slice='狗儿笑道：',
    hash='sha256:c5bf45c4937e4ef66eb4d277876c8bfcc1a2dc1dd585b5d8b6272ec8a1c605c2'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1318',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=205,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=37764,
    end_offset=37831,
    text_slice='“不妨，我教你老一个法子：你竟带了外孙子小板儿，先去找陪房周瑞，若见了他，就有些意思了。这周瑞先时曾和我父亲交过一桩事，我们极好的。”',
    hash='sha256:98bccd5b5db10ca727b31e23207bae3717bdd0de0c1420120019d934d2bbb645'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1319',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=205,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=37831,
    end_offset=37836,
    text_slice='刘姥姥道：',
    hash='sha256:d5b36905fd0f84600160cd0100f419b526eba8e12d366add2a27385ca2bf84e4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1320',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=205,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=37836,
    end_offset=37964,
    text_slice='“我也知道他的。只是许多时不走动，知道他如今是怎样？这也说不得了，你又是个男人，又这样个嘴脸，自然去不得。我们姑娘年轻媳妇子，也难卖头卖脚的，倒还是舍着我这付老脸去碰一碰。果然有些好处，大家都有益；便是没银子来，我也到那公府侯门见一见世面，也不枉我一生。”',
    hash='sha256:e67211bd0a1dd0b5046a198399e5a16fd723239c5e6e651482bed5727faaae96'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1321',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=205,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=37964,
    end_offset=37982,
    text_slice='说毕，大家笑了一回，当晚，计议已定。',
    hash='sha256:4232f199eeed6f7b62b560b40eca2652373fe9a892f25025fa4aaf2bb5a7bddd'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1322',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=206,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=37984,
    end_offset=38010,
    text_slice='次日天未明，刘姥姥便起来梳洗了，又将板儿教训了几句。',
    hash='sha256:9dffe3ccff34a4a901b25f73cdab9a1df617c99fd61cc02a9b58d99209fc333c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1323',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=206,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=38010,
    end_offset=38043,
    text_slice='那板儿才五六岁的孩子，一无所知，听见带他进城逛去，便喜得无不应承。',
    hash='sha256:4d868f9c3038a347fd5ff01159df55b93899eadb0695701d29dbdf1639718594'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1324',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=206,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=38043,
    end_offset=38060,
    text_slice='于是，刘姥姥带他进城，找至宁荣街。',
    hash='sha256:54c01aca4d5f21793f6c638965ffa41c6d213af9109a3a4123e3bfb13a237348'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1325',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=206,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=38060,
    end_offset=38139,
    text_slice='来至荣府大门石狮子前，只见簇簇的轿马，刘姥姥便不敢过去，且掸了掸衣服，又教了板儿几句话，然后蹭到角门前，只见几个挺胸叠肚指手画脚的人，坐在大凳上，说东谈西呢。',
    hash='sha256:31015c494f5c1b3577833a2a9b23fa3ea602f3652e033a570cafce7bc2d720a6'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1326',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=206,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=38149,
    end_offset=38157,
    text_slice='“太爷们纳福！”',
    hash='sha256:5b6f5d79efd0167dba0c212af6791d7f76e67f3990b1ca8c5d7d3c8015ec94ea'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1327',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=206,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=38157,
    end_offset=38174,
    text_slice='众人打量了她一会，便问是那里来的。',
    hash='sha256:deda9db3f0374fbf773586e7b4d9eb46a24e6ee918e84e15d8937f1ab0c9d196'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1328',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=206,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=38181,
    end_offset=38208,
    text_slice='“我找太太的陪房周大爷的，烦哪位太爷替我请他老出来。”',
    hash='sha256:6497ad26f65625f389306e95247bbcb79bf0bbeb5a7dbeb4389eae0b7fd4ae86'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1329',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=206,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=38208,
    end_offset=38225,
    text_slice='那些人听了，都不瞅睬，半日方说道：',
    hash='sha256:10ae6a664b7e3a8aea2a7f407b8b287227c58b24cf2840fa4b59ea0812bcfd32'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1330',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=206,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=38225,
    end_offset=38252,
    text_slice='“你远远的在那墙角下等着，一会子他们家有人就出来的。”',
    hash='sha256:5f1f5cb71a2d9993c6fc537a10faec1760640b8c6d7ba042b690141e35e40d91'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1331',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=206,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=38252,
    end_offset=38262,
    text_slice='内中有一老人年说道：',
    hash='sha256:d65eae39409ad449406836136ba3cab9cf00f1821a485a38f5932808d0deb488'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1332',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=206,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=38262,
    end_offset=38276,
    text_slice='“不要误她的事，何苦耍她。”',
    hash='sha256:9c073d30214a5f2aa073767e0102ede14d741806a8c62e45a696682b0b80259d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1333',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=206,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=38276,
    end_offset=38283,
    text_slice='因向刘姥姥道：',
    hash='sha256:460c123b87403bd0e5e05bdc5b81021d474414a1860846625273b6368b98ee1e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1334',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=206,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=38283,
    end_offset=38334,
    text_slice='“那周大爷已往南边去了。他在后一带住着，他娘子却在家。你要找时，从这边绕到后街，上后门上去问就是了。”',
    hash='sha256:3eb6e2f8e10d29fc8b1935330f3a590c82357608bce2721487e829dd60fddc24'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1335',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=207,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=38336,
    end_offset=38356,
    text_slice='刘姥姥听了谢过，遂携了板儿，绕到后门上。',
    hash='sha256:0f6ad55c32f3059ff43ed8349da0654e6651245ee80c37e474fbd2594d2ca909'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1336',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=207,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=38356,
    end_offset=38399,
    text_slice='只见门前歇着些生意担子，也有卖吃的，也有卖玩耍对象的，闹哄哄三二十个小孩子在那里厮闹。',
    hash='sha256:c0198a9b387886bda8ca08c791f206116d0a5b3bd082becabad54c1b40ba567c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1337',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=207,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=38409,
    end_offset=38428,
    text_slice='“我问哥儿一声，有个周大娘可在家么？”',
    hash='sha256:c3694aea471f5c4dfb6e9303d1fc70e7324cdd66025007a382d92d477f2da1d0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1338',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=207,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=38428,
    end_offset=38432,
    text_slice='孩子道：',
    hash='sha256:9655cb426936a6e697ceda654ac7a7858319e24d6554cf6948b862a6a1b486b8'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1339',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=207,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=38432,
    end_offset=38471,
    text_slice='“那个周大娘？我们这里周大娘有三个呢，还有两个周奶奶，不知是哪一个行当上的？”',
    hash='sha256:ae377bdb6bb9506960ab272139e5e201d7b269cfe687d00c8f77abc31b39b66a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1340',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=207,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=38471,
    end_offset=38476,
    text_slice='刘姥姥道：',
    hash='sha256:d5b36905fd0f84600160cd0100f419b526eba8e12d366add2a27385ca2bf84e4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1341',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=207,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=38476,
    end_offset=38487,
    text_slice='“是太太的陪房周瑞。”',
    hash='sha256:afdfb3d434e961e8c3ded642f418480f4771496fbf7a766a2ab394c6e5c685eb'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1342',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=207,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=38487,
    end_offset=38491,
    text_slice='孩子道：',
    hash='sha256:9655cb426936a6e697ceda654ac7a7858319e24d6554cf6948b862a6a1b486b8'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1343',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=207,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=38491,
    end_offset=38503,
    text_slice='“这个容易，你跟我来。”',
    hash='sha256:72b26295c3b7a54cb833151470f5003c8eaa4ee8f36a407a911957f5b3d81d5b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1344',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=207,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=38503,
    end_offset=38533,
    text_slice='说着，跳蹿蹿的引着刘姥姥进了后门，至一院墙边，指与刘姥姥道：',
    hash='sha256:8bbde46c68abb6626f246734319244641f297ad0a7182a72c35888f2dd1be49a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1345',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=207,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=38533,
    end_offset=38541,
    text_slice='“这就是他家。”',
    hash='sha256:3d0542036fd5a87190afa5c91dba5423193f7a7743145356275e76e4288d2aed'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1346',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=207,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=38541,
    end_offset=38545,
    text_slice='又叫道：',
    hash='sha256:900156d18838db6974906ef980244aef61df47356e376564f970edeece1c0c3c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1347',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=207,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=38545,
    end_offset=38567,
    text_slice='“周大妈，有个老奶奶来找你呢，我带了来了。”',
    hash='sha256:3ec8ecf3f756d8a240f634a2dae5c14c67c69fd48bd8302208e714cb375f9664'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1348',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=208,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=38569,
    end_offset=38589,
    text_slice='周瑞家的在内听说，忙迎了出来，问是那位。',
    hash='sha256:3c10b5596ed808f212cf7cce3e66e3470d88e3ac2fd34fad207eaba4049eba2c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1349',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=208,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=38599,
    end_offset=38608,
    text_slice='“好呀，周嫂子！”',
    hash='sha256:f6be74e40d629ea78d463f5b6c3300734dccc6268b37c1472bed4730becb6b29'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1350',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=208,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=38608,
    end_offset=38621,
    text_slice='周瑞家的认了半日，方笑道：',
    hash='sha256:632aa760ae91470d8306eeb8c6bfd3623490495d68ee1d1ce9a55a2cc884e0b1'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1351',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=208,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=38621,
    end_offset=38651,
    text_slice='“刘姥姥，你好呀！你说说，能几年，我就忘了。请家里来坐罢。”',
    hash='sha256:7161f8473991580701a62026950b79d6c0c8eac291323891c8eaf0d642b724c7'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1352',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=208,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=38651,
    end_offset=38665,
    text_slice='刘姥姥一壁走，一壁笑，说道：',
    hash='sha256:025bbc43892462aec2de6ed28b72cd6cfac06256aa081d602ade3a7b98c9d614'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1353',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=208,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=38665,
    end_offset=38685,
    text_slice='“你老是贵人多忘事，哪里还记得我们呢。”',
    hash='sha256:4ecd1809b17759110c2baf800b2ec1c424c6913ff13b710d2ff30742bac7dd4f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1354',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=208,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=38685,
    end_offset=38693,
    text_slice='说着，来至房中。',
    hash='sha256:f2716b6b137d9c4274ea4ef0a752a48f29d23d97f1922e488a78de18e4e19039'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1355',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=208,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=38693,
    end_offset=38711,
    text_slice='周瑞家的命雇的小丫头倒上茶来，吃着。',
    hash='sha256:be34ecfaf25aee21f724abef27270ac9a76ea87cd0f807fd82a9bef952137454'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1356',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=208,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=38741,
    end_offset=38756,
    text_slice='“今日还是路过，还是特来的？”',
    hash='sha256:752e515de765f1de868493b06d5f375415a7f00bb905eb67bbdeb7d63c194333'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1357',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=208,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=38756,
    end_offset=38762,
    text_slice='刘姥姥便说：',
    hash='sha256:957251b3c5870e51a884ec805a1459654b7f5526d2be8a6e3d23a58d82ddf370'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1358',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=208,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=38762,
    end_offset=38811,
    text_slice='“原是特来瞧瞧嫂子你，二则也请请姑太太的安。若可以领我见一见更好，若不能，便借重嫂子转致意罢了。”',
    hash='sha256:7fd6ef6551db1502a803613864b63d70a959061593078c0c676f58a500953f0d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1359',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=209,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=38813,
    end_offset=38829,
    text_slice='周瑞家的听了，便已猜着几分来意。',
    hash='sha256:51493a3237f59fd9565fe470b40df0d357bbe1823d81b3b21f8cfd2d5e5648d4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1360',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=209,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=38829,
    end_offset=38882,
    text_slice='只因昔年她丈夫周瑞争买田地一事，其中多得狗儿之力，今见刘姥姥如此而来，心中难却其意；二则也要显弄自己体面。',
    hash='sha256:4969102ef404575dae154ef84035196d68fffe9df29a20758ecb09e8dfcd03c1'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1361',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=209,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=38891,
    end_offset=39112,
    text_slice='“姥姥你放心！大远的诚心诚意来了，岂有个不教你见个真佛去的？论理，人来客至回话，却不与我相干。我们这里都是各占一枝儿：我们男的只管春秋两季地租子，闲时只带着小爷们出门子就完了；我只管跟太太、奶奶们出门的事。皆因你原是太太的亲戚，又拿我当个人，投奔了我来，我竟破个例，给你通个信去。但只一件，姥姥有所不知，我们这里又比不得五年前了。如今太太竟不大管事了，都是琏二奶奶管家。你道这琏二奶奶是谁？就是太太的内侄女，当日大舅老爷的女儿，小名凤哥的。”',
    hash='sha256:2f19fead5abe356970d0485d4703094d1794d9f6c189475250b2ca0ba0a3f98b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1362',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=209,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=39112,
    end_offset=39122,
    text_slice='刘姥姥听了，罕问道：',
    hash='sha256:1a2a8d9e72369706250b85122109531824b3ad157ce3820f4e045024c08df9ae'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1363',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=209,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=39122,
    end_offset=39157,
    text_slice='“原来是她！怪道呢，我当日就说她不错呢。这等说来，我今儿还得见她了。”',
    hash='sha256:a39da11d16ed7f483a90cc8e10f64df8140b1ca799d5a2debc7687b5d1bbdf4a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1364',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=209,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=39157,
    end_offset=39163,
    text_slice='周瑞家的道：',
    hash='sha256:cd1e213cc7d30d3ef228792c5125537b9f72af073869f2e38a6ea013c0736e8f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1365',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=209,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=39163,
    end_offset=39234,
    text_slice='“这个自然的。如今太太事多心烦，有客来了，略可推得去的，也就推过去了，都是凤姑娘周旋迎待。今儿宁可不见太太，倒要见她一面，才不枉这里来一遭。”',
    hash='sha256:1041c351a375e98e7de212425be74dc163e793dc0ba35dd06afaa739e8703bfc'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1366',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=209,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=39234,
    end_offset=39239,
    text_slice='刘姥姥道：',
    hash='sha256:d5b36905fd0f84600160cd0100f419b526eba8e12d366add2a27385ca2bf84e4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1367',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=209,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=39239,
    end_offset=39254,
    text_slice='“阿弥陀佛！全仗嫂子方便了。”',
    hash='sha256:7a6511161e98b07c282200be2b34a2b6898939f6363bdf6c63543e465dd52774'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1368',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=209,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=39254,
    end_offset=39260,
    text_slice='周瑞家的道：',
    hash='sha256:cd1e213cc7d30d3ef228792c5125537b9f72af073869f2e38a6ea013c0736e8f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1369',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=209,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=39260,
    end_offset=39301,
    text_slice='“说那里话！俗语说的：‘与人方便，自己方便。’不过用我说一句话罢了，害着我什么！”',
    hash='sha256:ef4c051f43cbea32841d1a415b9e847fb5915928ffd2bb9fb8f2dbf6caa62990'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1370',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=209,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=39301,
    end_offset=39333,
    text_slice='说着，便叫小丫头到倒厅上悄悄的打听打听，老太太屋里摆了饭了没有。',
    hash='sha256:a73b6c349d05b9b567d640b5eec25b971c2fd6591ee1d6e185466cf7d48e94ed'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1371',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=209,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=39333,
    end_offset=39339,
    text_slice='小丫头去了。',
    hash='sha256:f16d5c2758ce1b6aa0d3646939e5729f871a650ab2fb85943af60a7f46e51cfc'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1372',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=209,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=39339,
    end_offset=39349,
    text_slice='这里二人又说些闲话。',
    hash='sha256:4e238ac3f7accb4b8fa8d1cb353d7589dbb7f7a0e38a1fbd31f0c937148ec62e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1373',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=210,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=39351,
    end_offset=39357,
    text_slice='刘姥姥因说：',
    hash='sha256:38dfbb2f5d1e78170e53938f1a3b2366f9423af5a5ea6119ac0755d5da41bb1a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1374',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=210,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=39357,
    end_offset=39394,
    text_slice='“这凤姑娘今年大还不过二十岁罢了，就这等有本事，当这样的家，可是难得的。”',
    hash='sha256:4c29e226fb2fffdf17b1821bfa636c294ce40254bdc1e1431f2364b853b8b5a9'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1375',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=210,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=39394,
    end_offset=39402,
    text_slice='周瑞家的听了道：',
    hash='sha256:cd7140312f92d33766936e6dc9e27c79366a1643bcbdc9ac1da06019b7d2c42c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1376',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=210,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=39402,
    end_offset=39507,
    text_slice='“嗐！我的姥姥，告诉不得你呢。这位凤姑娘年纪虽小，行事却比世人都大呢。如今出挑得美人一样的模样儿，少说些有一万个心眼子。再要赌口齿，十个会说话的男人也说她不过。回来你见了就信了。就只一件，待下人未免太严些了。”',
    hash='sha256:6bd1d55f7b69e4edf40e55475ac09181fa20ca1c62cab2fc9a59741f3b5bec13'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1377',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=210,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=39507,
    end_offset=39519,
    text_slice='说着，只见小丫头回来说：',
    hash='sha256:db5838b19233ab779e9f4fd12d6ec3e3a80693e3aaf34d56c5147a2888209854'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1378',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=210,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=39519,
    end_offset=39542,
    text_slice='“老太太屋里已摆完了饭，二奶奶在太太屋里呢。”',
    hash='sha256:537432418cb2015b6be4652e8b3b2fa5fe842a5ce073ba66cc466472072e60fd'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1379',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=210,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=39542,
    end_offset=39561,
    text_slice='周瑞家的听了，连忙起身，催着刘姥姥说：',
    hash='sha256:22308806da2e5f2640929ffbf3a6bb450c3523e86748df8dedf15d0c9cab718f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1380',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=210,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=39561,
    end_offset=39620,
    text_slice='“快走，快走！这一下来她吃饭是一个空子，咱们先等着去。若迟一步，回事的人也多了，难说话；再歇了中觉，越发没了时候了。”',
    hash='sha256:4f9bc5e5164f2d38311ae1609128dad0766d78e1b61ed774bb4024b2cc05dd66'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1381',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=210,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=39620,
    end_offset=39662,
    text_slice='说着，一齐下了炕，打扫打扫衣服，又教了板儿几句话，随着周瑞家的，逶迤往贾琏的住处来。',
    hash='sha256:ce6e11879e1fde162b8efa3d5426bf2877bef4a578386b1d9bc75c37c6034b60'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1382',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=211,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=39664,
    end_offset=39688,
    text_slice='先到了倒厅，周瑞家的将刘姥姥安插在那里略等一等。',
    hash='sha256:8f74432a8bd251c07be9ba33c5274173185354d6912d3f957691db224f947411'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1383',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=211,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=39688,
    end_offset=39730,
    text_slice='自己先过了影壁，进了院门，知凤姐未下来，先找着了凤姐的一个心腹通房大丫头名唤平儿的。',
    hash='sha256:4a0bf9c155180e2db49fb2c5e89f71f08d1a5dc4af60ad3ae886c31be9529caa'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1384',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=211,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=39749,
    end_offset=39811,
    text_slice='“今日大远的特来请安。当日太太是常会的，今儿不可不见，所以我带了她进来了。等奶奶下来，我细细回明，奶奶想也不责备我莽撞的。”',
    hash='sha256:e998dedec830760a8fa35ce861a69c37326008b28b302526a9c1c142a8e83a91'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1385',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=211,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=39811,
    end_offset=39822,
    text_slice='平儿听了，便作了主意：',
    hash='sha256:25e020785d2bc9c5cb5c411cef5251486350468c052a2debd8f5594bd2c4c75b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1386',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=211,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=39822,
    end_offset=39840,
    text_slice='“叫他们进来，先在这里坐着就是了。”',
    hash='sha256:d46f363c2aa3a731cfb9c8497eb3a120b75d2c30982da0e01c696bf968789ff5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1387',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=211,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=39840,
    end_offset=39859,
    text_slice='周瑞家的听了，忙出去引他两个进入院来。',
    hash='sha256:7ad3720ca63830b9f99f9f047fb5c4af198c25798ff988a9f5cd95654be2ff13'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1388',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=211,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=39859,
    end_offset=39876,
    text_slice='上了正房台矶，小丫头打起猩红毡帘。',
    hash='sha256:554d8a41a4e4c65f27fa17a87888d8a48d535c07d9da2a0c752541917d080447'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1389',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=211,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=39876,
    end_offset=39909,
    text_slice='才入堂屋，只闻一阵香扑了脸来，竟不辨是何气味，身子如在云端里一般。',
    hash='sha256:7c9c7495674a9ebdfcf3126929c6cfcca2f9652d65e892619fe140f54aadc6b9'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1390',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=211,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=39909,
    end_offset=39929,
    text_slice='满屋中之物都是耀眼争光的，使人头悬目眩。',
    hash='sha256:f09cf9561ade1c7778cf57b31df23e73fbb5dce2e7ae70d363941d4967e96b4c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1391',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=211,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=39929,
    end_offset=39944,
    text_slice='刘姥姥此时惟点头咂嘴念佛而已。',
    hash='sha256:cb21b2d09706e3cb54e84a2dbc0fbd98e26796c9e3aaa338acf0f9348af23843'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1392',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=211,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=39944,
    end_offset=39970,
    text_slice='于是来至东边这间屋内，乃是贾琏的女儿大姐儿睡觉之所。',
    hash='sha256:be300f7c565ce3695129e447a6af87e88151257204ff1426331424ee97eb9cd6'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1393',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=211,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=39970,
    end_offset=39996,
    text_slice='平儿站在炕沿边，打量了刘姥姥两眼，只得问个好，让坐。',
    hash='sha256:65ed771102d97bd6d8e89ff98f699ff10e34a221bd4c51904c300686891d5aa8'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1394',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=211,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=39996,
    end_offset=40026,
    text_slice='刘姥姥见平儿遍身绫罗，插金带银，花容玉貌的，便当是凤姐儿了。',
    hash='sha256:459761aa5a59d2d37e42a9e37556b522708138dbdff1d1a0a280c4ea54199c9d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1395',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=211,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=40026,
    end_offset=40075,
    text_slice='才要称姑奶奶，忽听周瑞家的称她是平姑娘，又见平儿赶着周瑞家的称周大娘，方知不过是个有些体面的丫头。',
    hash='sha256:e6d0388119ab4059a7b1740d8472d51a407d2c2caa4cd1a28e4869301fc75322'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1396',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=211,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=40075,
    end_offset=40088,
    text_slice='于是让刘姥姥和板儿上了炕。',
    hash='sha256:97167d57d76464230f648ceefd2b0706303b6f1b12f2ca53649d9a6bd51e1de6'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1397',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=211,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=40088,
    end_offset=40114,
    text_slice='平儿和周瑞家的对面坐在炕沿上，小丫头子斟上茶来吃茶。',
    hash='sha256:9f9603402bacd4eb180ed33c5f2995cc4d5aa1920f35bf7247b9865322264ca5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1398',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=212,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=40116,
    end_offset=40151,
    text_slice='刘姥姥只听见咯当咯当的响声，大有似乎打箩柜筛面的一般，不免东瞧西望的。',
    hash='sha256:685b1f7b36d8eb002a277768242d4635f8c9a423a22624dcb17dbf33eee275a1'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1399',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=212,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=40151,
    end_offset=40187,
    text_slice='忽见堂屋中柱子上挂着一个匣子，底下又坠着一个秤砣般的一物，却不住的乱幌。',
    hash='sha256:87f0076018c49e25d9a169dc960d994c4f2dcb5207a95302566ea26d6101c445'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1400',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=212,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=40195,
    end_offset=40210,
    text_slice='“这是什么爱物儿？有啥用呢？”',
    hash='sha256:33069a700d6bfd223b358284b9981e6f829ae4ed17d64adb8d985f3b64581dd9'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1401',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=212,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=40210,
    end_offset=40241,
    text_slice='正呆时，陡听得当的一声，又若金钟铜磬一般，不防倒唬的得一展眼。',
    hash='sha256:1b33433c6fb00eef19a7a4a77392eaffd265824b73b66ed1047439cf2fd4b208'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1402',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=212,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=40241,
    end_offset=40251,
    text_slice='接着又是一连八九下。',
    hash='sha256:233e1037b225722c0778504b079df7d7583f9a17a0aab72038ec7d4e4ca79fd1'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1403',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=212,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=40269,
    end_offset=40277,
    text_slice='“奶奶下来了。”',
    hash='sha256:df7a0355b8278d654e0807e0143b2ea8f8a5d055e2e01282298688c6c0e8e7d0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1404',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=212,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=40277,
    end_offset=40292,
    text_slice='平儿与周瑞家的忙起身，命刘姥姥',
    hash='sha256:dec6affccb43201a10034653239d11874e18fe87ba735f837cdd54ac42e59a5c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1405',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=212,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=40292,
    end_offset=40311,
    text_slice='“只管坐着等，是时候，我们来请你呢。”',
    hash='sha256:68ad5e6d6e9a28a16364225d65f2d980e7f75b02e7b56ebbf9284736b2539aca'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1406',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=212,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=40311,
    end_offset=40320,
    text_slice='说着，都迎出去了。',
    hash='sha256:2797801a1c96a4daee6822450ab42451277e27f783414b7ef69cfb20fed6825d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1407',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=213,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=40322,
    end_offset=40332,
    text_slice='刘姥姥屏声侧耳默候。',
    hash='sha256:bbaccb05c72d4dfde3fa750a9a007ec70691744b4d1b5e8b772e16bb25a1c161'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1408',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=213,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=40332,
    end_offset=40367,
    text_slice='只听远远有人笑声，约有一二十妇人，衣裙窸窣，渐入堂屋，往那边屋内去了。',
    hash='sha256:b63e781dcc19966d5b85f46cc3b97f240945d0797578f7f78dc9780a6983d3fb'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1409',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=213,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=40367,
    end_offset=40390,
    text_slice='又见两三个妇人，都捧着大漆捧盒，进这边来等候。',
    hash='sha256:cc39fc6336e944f84c1abd71ccb60108a7db64ae99ef464c72f106567d572290'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1410',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=213,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=40390,
    end_offset=40421,
    text_slice='听得那边说了声“摆饭”，渐渐的人才散出，只有伺候端菜的几个人。',
    hash='sha256:8c74e411dce4c1c4e3939817534cc4332df7fb6e11b8515ca5b659e17dc3cab2'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1411',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=213,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=40421,
    end_offset=40475,
    text_slice='半日鸦雀不闻之后，忽见二个人抬了一张炕桌来，放在这边炕上，桌上碗盘森列，仍是满满的鱼肉在内，不过略动了几样。',
    hash='sha256:8207a7a37da97faf978675e108da4ca1d7fe9b69f14444e21a996fba89b65ab8'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1412',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=213,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=40475,
    end_offset=40488,
    text_slice='板儿一见了，便吵着要肉吃。',
    hash='sha256:62d8b3728853fe93f335db5dc2e49a2f58068fae777b11755e7790fa4dc27023'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1413',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=213,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=40488,
    end_offset=40499,
    text_slice='刘姥姥一巴掌打了他去。',
    hash='sha256:b3e794c8cb63505e43c0ae79d9e540570d0e13d69a839b0c235500eb6af98b85'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1414',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=213,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=40499,
    end_offset=40518,
    text_slice='忽见周瑞家的笑嘻嘻走过来，招手儿叫她。',
    hash='sha256:d2228251636349d33d132b9d1ddb9cd493297255070434b9d8a916c73d17ea6d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1415',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=213,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=40518,
    end_offset=40561,
    text_slice='刘姥姥会意，于是带了板儿下炕，至堂屋中，周瑞家的又和他唧咕了一会，方过蹭到这边屋里来。',
    hash='sha256:4dfe5209af45433ea13086feda73ef02aeee5383d75d2ed1fec3221002a6f0cc'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1416',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=214,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=40563,
    end_offset=40632,
    text_slice='只见门外錾铜钩上悬着大红撒花软帘，南窗下是炕，炕上大红毡条，靠东边板壁立着一个锁子锦靠背与一个引枕，铺着金心绿闪缎大坐褥，旁边有银唾沫盒。',
    hash='sha256:50e03098de5e62d46052b93b466628776a4c75465e1b3b54fd89148a34f7b013'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1417',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=214,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=40632,
    end_offset=40709,
    text_slice='那凤姐儿家常带着紫貂昭君套，围着攒珠勒子，穿著桃红撒花袄，石青刻丝灰鼠披风，大红洋绉银鼠皮裙，粉光脂艳，端端正正坐在那里，手内拿着小铜火箸儿拨手炉内的灰。',
    hash='sha256:096a89aa978344ffc857faf5d879593a1bd5a2c7f5e6594b6aa4f5558c7e28b5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1418',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=214,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=40709,
    end_offset=40737,
    text_slice='平儿站在炕沿边，捧着小小的一个填漆茶盘，盘内一个小盖钟。',
    hash='sha256:7b706569844abf5dc4fb4d00323838f33ab5d3c29a9d57c502d4b813a20f1762'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1419',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=214,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=40764,
    end_offset=40774,
    text_slice='“怎么还不请进来？”',
    hash='sha256:0f8084b09b094e9f150e496d81b1e9fbd2ff818ea5ea0d314007cdcecd9a59a0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1420',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=214,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=40774,
    end_offset=40805,
    text_slice='一面说，一面抬身要茶时，只见周瑞家的已带了两个人在地下站着了。',
    hash='sha256:636903c962821dc8b95a70351286ce8e808a148294a9879f7553cba171aa5ed5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1421',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=214,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=40805,
    end_offset=40837,
    text_slice='这才忙欲起身，犹未起身，满面春风的问好，又嗔周瑞家的怎么不早说。',
    hash='sha256:348487ab310a3dd42773880b3a49714150a467183dd47f6bf06c6caf0260097e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1422',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=214,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=40837,
    end_offset=40856,
    text_slice='刘姥姥在地下已是拜了数拜，问姑奶奶安。',
    hash='sha256:172d6d5a29cc68f8a3343c79ac3135ac91280de39a5533e7ee6d4e647a6e0e25'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1423',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=214,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=40861,
    end_offset=40901,
    text_slice='“周姐姐，快搀住别拜罢，请坐。我年轻，不大认得，可也不知是什么辈数，不敢称呼。”',
    hash='sha256:c21fe3730e377480ed2dad2cac8291f2642633a45cf1051c43fb485cd32d17b7'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1424',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=214,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=40901,
    end_offset=40909,
    text_slice='周瑞家的忙回道：',
    hash='sha256:4beb6c3d7a18401aaa1d2bc3d8c26df9eb34990317036ee1325b87056691f87d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1425',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=214,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=40909,
    end_offset=40923,
    text_slice='“这就是我才回的那姥姥了。”',
    hash='sha256:4f9a7de9ec32ffefaa0a1590e06115919207bb7dbc56981127564cec42390bc2'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1426',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=214,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=40923,
    end_offset=40928,
    text_slice='凤姐点头。',
    hash='sha256:7fbddbb055f55ae75c40d18d92c7a32b28339624e0eaa524a9e5e67631c11ee4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1427',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=214,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=40928,
    end_offset=40939,
    text_slice='刘姥姥已在炕沿上坐下。',
    hash='sha256:5fc9a3a85127a93ba0022c8d4be511a6349d7994c8c1fd2b146fded4cfe445a2'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1428',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=214,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=40939,
    end_offset=40963,
    text_slice='板儿便躲在背后，百般的哄他出来作揖，他死也不肯。',
    hash='sha256:51c50f2f511b339d8c066a72c01a56da9c1d5f009db7da96c90f2feafbe5b975'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1429',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=215,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=40965,
    end_offset=40971,
    text_slice='凤姐儿笑道：',
    hash='sha256:b0ca30783a1130bd50e00c9499f7d86fc8c4b51163a4d1ad4faaa5de7be9a002'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1430',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=215,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=40971,
    end_offset=41025,
    text_slice='“亲戚们不大走动，都疏远了。知道的呢，说你们弃厌我们，不肯常来；不知道的那起小人，还只当我们眼里没人似的。”',
    hash='sha256:684e0a697ea68803055e108d3c5aa31d699e89ad2f1c8588fcd153dc324e34e7'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1431',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=215,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=41025,
    end_offset=41033,
    text_slice='刘姥姥忙念佛道：',
    hash='sha256:12d68db4ba4c65447c3a676e745cd0eb21c3ea7ccfbdeb090ba9fe9e46b14e43'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1432',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=215,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=41033,
    end_offset=41072,
    text_slice='“我们家道艰难，走不起，来了这里，没的给姑奶奶打嘴，就是管家爷们看着也不像。”',
    hash='sha256:93a00d766de4b802879fdd2af3e99539131c744fb9e1883fd130ecbe531c3d18'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1433',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=215,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=41072,
    end_offset=41078,
    text_slice='凤姐儿笑道：',
    hash='sha256:b0ca30783a1130bd50e00c9499f7d86fc8c4b51163a4d1ad4faaa5de7be9a002'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1434',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=215,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=41078,
    end_offset=41146,
    text_slice='“这话没的叫人恶心。不过借赖着祖父虚名，作个穷官儿罢了，谁家有什么，不过是个旧日的空架子。俗语说，‘朝廷还有三门子穷亲’呢，何况你我。”',
    hash='sha256:09a7c7e34eeffb4de2c3c9f85b1c654075b056ceef56182c99747d14a21ca33b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1435',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=215,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=41146,
    end_offset=41163,
    text_slice='说着，又问周瑞家的回了太太了没有。',
    hash='sha256:b650793b89cde795c7bdc002bb249529d4280de08ea8f302f61eb3f826a5009b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1436',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=215,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=41169,
    end_offset=41180,
    text_slice='“如今等奶奶的示下。”',
    hash='sha256:0c7387b43f7809b863e76c9141bde17046ec76a571079a05f371664ad14727d2'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1437',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=215,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=41180,
    end_offset=41184,
    text_slice='凤姐道：',
    hash='sha256:493b74ef604832e715c69f5c0a24d8d4a251e38e82e9ee38006f3f407dd315a5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1438',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=215,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=41184,
    end_offset=41212,
    text_slice='“你去瞧瞧，要是有人有事就罢，得闲儿呢就回，看怎么说。”',
    hash='sha256:349227e556a9d5acd1547d67ef64af5875ce09fdb5d7ac3526af6410e12fe0c6'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1439',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=215,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=41212,
    end_offset=41222,
    text_slice='周瑞家的答应着去了。',
    hash='sha256:d0b9416d28cb7b1ab5a008ee4fc25ab37d4c203a668d3a2f4dfeae684f6e2883'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1440',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=216,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=41224,
    end_offset=41261,
    text_slice='这里凤姐叫人抓些果子与板儿吃，刚问些闲话时，就有家下许多媳妇管事的来回话。',
    hash='sha256:48be4e1c15968dc1f4256906c84bccee0401cca7ebc1c0c0be8147dc8dbe403b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1441',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=216,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=41270,
    end_offset=41300,
    text_slice='“我这里陪客呢，晚上再来回。若有很要紧的，你就带进来现办。”',
    hash='sha256:aaca07edec31f7358f7ddb26830623d7896f658ba3b5499d29f03c8f08a7ed59'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1442',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=216,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=41300,
    end_offset=41311,
    text_slice='平儿出去，一会进来说：',
    hash='sha256:9c49accc4010cdc445d68838e36490b94db3599161bcda224df066ec77f22cd1'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1443',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=216,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=41311,
    end_offset=41332,
    text_slice='“我都问了，没什么紧事，我就叫她们散了。”',
    hash='sha256:ac1e3e11d70703f127d55795a4c0468558f5fa7e1dfceac567021d02e06437ee'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1444',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=216,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=41332,
    end_offset=41337,
    text_slice='凤姐点头。',
    hash='sha256:7fbddbb055f55ae75c40d18d92c7a32b28339624e0eaa524a9e5e67631c11ee4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1445',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=216,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=41351,
    end_offset=41408,
    text_slice='“太太说了，今日不得闲，二奶奶陪着便是一样。多谢费心想着；白来逛逛呢便罢，若有甚说的，只管告诉二奶奶，都是一样。”',
    hash='sha256:f7424cf37bdc9bcead6266ac36ed9abe703267be041c228aff207f76b5d388e8'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1446',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=216,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=41408,
    end_offset=41413,
    text_slice='刘姥姥道：',
    hash='sha256:d5b36905fd0f84600160cd0100f419b526eba8e12d366add2a27385ca2bf84e4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1447',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=216,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=41413,
    end_offset=41444,
    text_slice='“也没甚说的，不过是来瞧瞧姑太太、姑奶奶，也是亲戚们的情分。”',
    hash='sha256:fdc8e3e1b8bf44a1f02a24c8c1e4ff53110badfc8371bc41fbb942060cbb057d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1448',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=216,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=41444,
    end_offset=41450,
    text_slice='周瑞家的道：',
    hash='sha256:cd1e213cc7d30d3ef228792c5125537b9f72af073869f2e38a6ea013c0736e8f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1449',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=216,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=41450,
    end_offset=41478,
    text_slice='“没甚说的便罢，若有话，只管回二奶奶，是和太太一样的。”',
    hash='sha256:1061fd551c5717d95833678321451482a25c4c3d0224a90723a1652ee75f53bd'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1450',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=216,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=41478,
    end_offset=41492,
    text_slice='一面说，一面递眼色与刘姥姥。',
    hash='sha256:01543313d6105cf6a46c6862d0f3e29a87d6e93cddb6d02d2a2131dff127b977'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1451',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=216,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=41492,
    end_offset=41506,
    text_slice='刘姥姥会意，未语先飞红了脸。',
    hash='sha256:b1b723f7d2de9c246523f25804d89ead220bc25a57b4f7971d6cdb9a813d9bf5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1452',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=216,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=41506,
    end_offset=41519,
    text_slice='欲待不说，今日又所为何来？',
    hash='sha256:0a96c74794ce8fed3acfeb6459a8cc47f4936a2c4fd64cfff2745ed7a9b7102b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1453',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=216,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=41526,
    end_offset=41567,
    text_slice='“论理今儿初次见姑奶奶，却不该说的，只是大远的奔了你老这里来，也少不的说了..。”',
    hash='sha256:f62a15023bc19dcb3d1c932128b0beb14b0784bbcb4adcc8678a9fecc8c74ec6'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1454',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=216,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=41567,
    end_offset=41585,
    text_slice='刚说到这里，只听得二门上小厮们回说：',
    hash='sha256:d8d6d7c8b8dcdc806645e0f42df5257627d846e648c591b182344e55a03a00e3'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1455',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=216,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=41585,
    end_offset=41597,
    text_slice='“东府里小大爷进来了。”',
    hash='sha256:7d74a0c1ddcffde2741ad5f24b1faba595cde4a75b234ac450faa328371c99c1'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1456',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=216,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=41597,
    end_offset=41609,
    text_slice='凤姐忙止刘姥姥不必说了。',
    hash='sha256:b85edf421457f7788312eb4cb6ee4d83a9d9e96423c5891eec33861145c9d51e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1457',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=216,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=41614,
    end_offset=41625,
    text_slice='“你蓉大爷在哪里呢？”',
    hash='sha256:307776d86ab7f0205d5e8d3416a195598d8d3877f4678ba6e04b8a42b9f71b16'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1458',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=216,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=41625,
    end_offset=41667,
    text_slice='只听一路靴子脚响，进来了一个十七八岁的少年，面目清秀，身材妖娇，轻裘宝带，美服华冠。',
    hash='sha256:bdfb6c9b63af9197beb7d94d2a6e512afb8d5428422e0b85261d09e106824177'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1459',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=216,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=41667,
    end_offset=41685,
    text_slice='刘姥姥此时坐不是，立不是，藏没处藏。',
    hash='sha256:676eea1a5bf4fa65a4d7f6715dc4fca56cb59a52060da296c1a191e14a9a3522'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1460',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=216,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=41690,
    end_offset=41704,
    text_slice='“你只管坐着，这是我侄儿。”',
    hash='sha256:47ce52803e41c5cfc6a458074a671ba639a41438eb3ea61e0018b9b672c6fa1d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1461',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=216,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=41704,
    end_offset=41719,
    text_slice='刘姥姥方扭扭捏捏在炕沿上坐了。',
    hash='sha256:3157884525e04d53ce4437e1545c0f7904c9103807c8c4a5f99c42fa9dc2d426'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1462',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=217,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=41721,
    end_offset=41726,
    text_slice='贾蓉笑道：',
    hash='sha256:14bf034c9a1cafba734b07d4c8b73adb78cfc2cb216ae91081232d4a80d17978'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1463',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=217,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=41726,
    end_offset=41779,
    text_slice='“我父亲打发我来求婶子，说上回老舅太太给婶子的那架玻璃炕屏，明日请一个要紧的客，借了略摆一摆就送过来的。”',
    hash='sha256:7662a83b737de2fa05f9b7c93c741eba6a2e9e5b723be1c851fd9191a20933ca'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1464',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=217,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=41779,
    end_offset=41783,
    text_slice='凤姐道：',
    hash='sha256:493b74ef604832e715c69f5c0a24d8d4a251e38e82e9ee38006f3f407dd315a5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1465',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=217,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=41783,
    end_offset=41800,
    text_slice='“说迟了一日，昨儿已经给了人了。”',
    hash='sha256:d959702e91901201654040b07e0ca3cbab5d610d9b45acd394dd7da854a0ad8c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1466',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=217,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=41800,
    end_offset=41819,
    text_slice='贾蓉听说，嘻嘻的笑着，在炕沿上半跪道：',
    hash='sha256:a66df7cbe546073622e1143026e284f4f4f9f845bca3997abbc2797f8d5b43fd'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1467',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=217,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=41819,
    end_offset=41854,
    text_slice='“婶子若不借，又说我不会说话了，又挨一顿好打呢。婶子只当可怜侄儿罢！”',
    hash='sha256:7ee968847bd670a5a29f1499b0381edb824500b7bd09229adfd84d5587d02668'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1468',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=217,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=41854,
    end_offset=41859,
    text_slice='凤姐笑道：',
    hash='sha256:fa673815883516a89495f0598428fc17e5f85586cc72e1283fe4d69da7b1c484'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1469',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=217,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=41859,
    end_offset=41902,
    text_slice='“也没见你们，王家的东西都是好的不成？一般你们那里放着那些东西，只是看不见我的才罢！”',
    hash='sha256:3ed8f21d2a4698fc476f1efb47d7796ce4e3f68bf724b29735485793bb2face8'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1470',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=217,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=41902,
    end_offset=41907,
    text_slice='贾蓉笑道：',
    hash='sha256:14bf034c9a1cafba734b07d4c8b73adb78cfc2cb216ae91081232d4a80d17978'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1471',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=217,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=41907,
    end_offset=41923,
    text_slice='“那里如这个好呢！只求开恩罢。”',
    hash='sha256:223fb4eb027628be482e9d882d2b20557c590fd5fb7875fdb86b83d01e9fb36f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1472',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=217,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=41923,
    end_offset=41927,
    text_slice='凤姐道：',
    hash='sha256:493b74ef604832e715c69f5c0a24d8d4a251e38e82e9ee38006f3f407dd315a5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1473',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=217,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=41927,
    end_offset=41942,
    text_slice='“碰一点儿，你可仔细你的皮！”',
    hash='sha256:95f9437509905b7b46800c67abdab3f2c2ccb4ef756f0370becccc44664c6408'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1474',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=217,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=41942,
    end_offset=41964,
    text_slice='因命平儿拿了楼房门钥匙，传几个妥当人来抬去。',
    hash='sha256:f447544a3e26903fb3724719d75d4f4de1f4c42226d7aa0c4f0ca8fc91695774'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1475',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=217,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=41976,
    end_offset=41994,
    text_slice='“我亲自带了人拿去，别由他们乱碰。”',
    hash='sha256:8fd6ea66f1ffc4a5088755b7c5b504b8bb40b50cb79aab02ce158a80c9625a00'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1476',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=217,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=41994,
    end_offset=42004,
    text_slice='说着，便起身出去了。',
    hash='sha256:c4a30ffc5b47b9382cec1ea3b1e404c9a6aebd1b088d0f0e46f42df6d44afc18'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1477',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=218,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=42006,
    end_offset=42024,
    text_slice='这里凤姐忽又想起一事来，便向窗外叫：',
    hash='sha256:81f6d170da3b7b631ce778df689460f2792abe6cb15139a0e8a42a4b3c6ad6f0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1478',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=218,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=42024,
    end_offset=42031,
    text_slice='“蓉儿回来！”',
    hash='sha256:c73c8d30ebc3badcc51d411be42c2a3f10d4b36f82773b49d72d5b4ba0c9880c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1479',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=218,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=42031,
    end_offset=42040,
    text_slice='外面几个人接声说：',
    hash='sha256:7762c66cfcc0ea7527dfbce9923b1e738d20124fcd0eb48c16534a8978ea8f2c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1480',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=218,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=42040,
    end_offset=42049,
    text_slice='“蓉大爷快回来！”',
    hash='sha256:7108f17bc663aa6fa602c05df698177e357aaf5843537241ca241bcadf503f3f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1481',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=218,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=42049,
    end_offset=42067,
    text_slice='贾蓉忙复身转来，垂手侍立，听何指示。',
    hash='sha256:b8fbc0b2c38b5c26b9aa6bd3be1d10349c4ff143f5cc924f5e2cdd536680d04d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1482',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=218,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=42088,
    end_offset=42120,
    text_slice='“罢了！你且去罢。晚饭后你来再说罢。这会子有人，我也没精神了。”',
    hash='sha256:32476eb317e299e67b101e146df3156d177035199acfdf111356ac44cf8b9222'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1483',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=218,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=42120,
    end_offset=42132,
    text_slice='贾蓉应了，方慢慢的退去。',
    hash='sha256:4fb24507e3979e6669749b3a19f6cee47105331f9db28e010ab2515ab5b74c6c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1484',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=219,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=42134,
    end_offset=42149,
    text_slice='这里刘姥姥心神方安，才又说道：',
    hash='sha256:f6163979836f6792253adc66fa91b01e2d74e3a9da9a5f87b5b269049bb21a55'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1485',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=219,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=42149,
    end_offset=42213,
    text_slice='“今日我带了你侄儿来，也不为别的，只因他老子娘在家里，连吃的都没有。如今天又冷了，越想越没个派头儿，只得带了你侄儿奔了你老来。”',
    hash='sha256:133d24b509717af6a80cc26c2514e4d5975e1f3e181696793b6c05f473273c37'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1486',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=219,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=42213,
    end_offset=42221,
    text_slice='说着又推板儿道：',
    hash='sha256:f78d7663fa7b1b138e16f29c2ff9b8654b456ffaab0461f197140787286ee09b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1487',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=219,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=42221,
    end_offset=42250,
    text_slice='“你那爹在家怎么教你来？打发咱们作啥事来？只顾吃果子咧！”',
    hash='sha256:761944090dbb9bc589e4db1b671a649d0e773b1187e0ea0b9be528dedfbdcbb2'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1488',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=219,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=42250,
    end_offset=42270,
    text_slice='凤姐早已明白了，听她不会说话，因笑止道：',
    hash='sha256:b420893c9ee680021db3ab09e3d28c81a188d5ed94c193de0876346fc3883177'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1489',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=219,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=42270,
    end_offset=42282,
    text_slice='“不必说了，我知道了。”',
    hash='sha256:2cd1114cf56a84ab13238a275aee9c449afc7e21e0c99bd5cc9929f78428ec48'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1490',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=219,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=42282,
    end_offset=42290,
    text_slice='因问周瑞家的道：',
    hash='sha256:c9b87053fb46c54257b7cb275ae0de45cc604fd96f7fbb21b883d2663fc34cc6'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1491',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=219,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=42290,
    end_offset=42307,
    text_slice='“这姥姥不知可用了过早饭没有呢？”',
    hash='sha256:e5d0f4ad65263665d20e0c632b22b08ae915932606c893f72f873e2e016422ab'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1492',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=219,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=42307,
    end_offset=42313,
    text_slice='刘姥姥忙道：',
    hash='sha256:34333cd5cc41aa53279dd9f30697ae1d35e9a5614657981da8ed036d7ed042d8'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1493',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=219,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=42313,
    end_offset=42335,
    text_slice='“一早就往这里赶咧，那里还有吃饭的工夫咧！”',
    hash='sha256:bb6ef77541c9c5ca8c83700e5852e0f092e3fa21022678fcf78491d45fec9c33'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1494',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=219,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=42335,
    end_offset=42347,
    text_slice='凤姐听说，忙命快传饭来。',
    hash='sha256:e08539833b2f82540c57f238b3fe45a18646181eec518d619d07b20eb3732d23'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1495',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=219,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=42347,
    end_offset=42383,
    text_slice='一时周瑞家的传了一桌客馔来，摆在东边屋内，过来带了刘姥姥和板儿过去吃饭。',
    hash='sha256:fb0d7f7dbabed15fc15cb9c98e3733a118c578f8445afaca4bcb1ae3a79943ad'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1496',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=219,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=42388,
    end_offset=42407,
    text_slice='“周姐姐，好生让着些儿，我不能陪了。”',
    hash='sha256:dde04ed0067db891d35acf9aedeab7629eed380cfb2003a24f25923d0f3d514f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1497',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=219,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=42407,
    end_offset=42416,
    text_slice='于是过东边房里来。',
    hash='sha256:5157e24542016502315a2faa21aa4337f80b3d34480a62c7783f83c45fa92fcb'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1498',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=220,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=42418,
    end_offset=42432,
    text_slice='凤姐又叫过周瑞家的去，问她：',
    hash='sha256:5d605f58c1e12e3acfab4b4d52e598197c6cd7fa6d57ff902c38b60dd8b69a35'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1499',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=220,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=42432,
    end_offset=42447,
    text_slice='“方才回了太太，说了些什么？”',
    hash='sha256:df32fce2ed79c37a8b1ce83b8a803f7e57767b2aa606282a6642d9848985acf6'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1500',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=220,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=42447,
    end_offset=42453,
    text_slice='周瑞家的道：',
    hash='sha256:cd1e213cc7d30d3ef228792c5125537b9f72af073869f2e38a6ea013c0736e8f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1501',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=220,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=42453,
    end_offset=42567,
    text_slice='“太太说，他们家原不是一家子，不过因出一姓，当年又与太老爷在一处作官，偶然连了宗的。这几年来也不大走动。当时他们来一遭，却也没空了他们。今儿既来了，瞧瞧我们，是她的好意思，也不可简慢了她。便是有什么说的，叫二奶奶裁度着就是了。”',
    hash='sha256:0f5fd7eb9b94e5a5c5c5032a73ea0fd708f5f61d371a6d75ac75c997113b419c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1502',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=220,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=42567,
    end_offset=42574,
    text_slice='凤姐听了说道：',
    hash='sha256:8938add4ba391a8a446199049edb38cc6b6ed57020861d48bbf1ea35c820abf1'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1503',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=220,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=42574,
    end_offset=42597,
    text_slice='“我说呢，既是一家子，我如何连影儿也不知道。”',
    hash='sha256:3ff068f71e488705a1eb292dc41a4acc4b5a0d228ff96e1aaa7f8643dbdebde9'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1504',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=221,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=42599,
    end_offset=42627,
    text_slice='说话时，刘姥姥已吃毕了饭，拉了板儿过来，抹舌咂嘴的道谢。',
    hash='sha256:d3e51b70463ed46c36ce9440a462ec5e3770b12545c09e0ee2704ad08447fa21'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1505',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=221,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=42627,
    end_offset=42647,
    text_slice='凤姐笑道：“且请坐下，听我告诉你老人家。',
    hash='sha256:611fcb376c7d56c3a798879b22e4dc303cd065ffc7b60f232936a13841150666'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1506',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=221,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=42647,
    end_offset=42659,
    text_slice='方才的意思，我已知道了。',
    hash='sha256:7c25b25bea1a34dbdce2cda6f766c5f506a33e8af4793acbba3705b1439dbb9c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1507',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=221,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=42659,
    end_offset=42681,
    text_slice='若论亲戚之间，原该不等上门来就该有照应才是。',
    hash='sha256:0a11cc71ae4ab779e257410ba18237121f9757eaab66f8b4823ad2a0f8e4aca4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1508',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=221,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=42681,
    end_offset=42709,
    text_slice='但如今家内杂事太烦，太太渐上了年纪，一时想不到也是有的。',
    hash='sha256:bdbc7beb1552ffcf5b038509319405360d82c6ef1c034bdf4f9693ec8e127fd2'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1509',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=221,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=42709,
    end_offset=42732,
    text_slice='况是我近来接着管些事，都不大知道这些个亲戚们。',
    hash='sha256:350d7d89148820d97d1cf7c257566f047e0ffe3b2568cbe686051a38fc8a355b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1510',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=221,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=42732,
    end_offset=42768,
    text_slice='二则外头看着这里烈烈轰轰的，殊不知大有大的艰难去处，说与人也未必信罢了。',
    hash='sha256:5383e2a12502794e35a2fd3176a278fde796f92407c01475c6f1f95b5631bc38'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1511',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=221,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=42768,
    end_offset=42797,
    text_slice='今儿你既老远的来了，又是头一次见我张口，怎好叫你空回去呢。',
    hash='sha256:f3c3a45fb8508354f1a26340c179d6651af190ad732585fd0a661619c78a57b3'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1512',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=221,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=42797,
    end_offset=42840,
    text_slice='可巧昨儿太太给我的丫头们做衣裳的二十两银子，我还没动呢，你若不嫌少，就暂且先拿了去罢。',
    hash='sha256:2fe224806d10ea7247be0e9af6befcd69b566e8e7b9a8e5d2441a8a5493d4584'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1513',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=222,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=42843,
    end_offset=42890,
    text_slice='那刘姥姥先听见告艰难，只当是没有，心里便突突的；后来听见给她二十两，喜的又浑身发痒起来，说道：',
    hash='sha256:8f5861a84bb963a29440782f98d71551673e485679cea8c43c53adb847ee3abe'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1514',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=222,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=42890,
    end_offset=42941,
    text_slice='“嗳！我也是知道艰难的。但俗语说：‘瘦死的骆驼比马还大’，凭他怎样，你老拔根寒毛，比我们的腰还粗呢！”',
    hash='sha256:6b92df30e8bf60c13d6125e7cd67c1035c123f3b7fa6c8b30f1ef2fd31e2e919'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1515',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=222,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=42941,
    end_offset=42960,
    text_slice='周瑞家的听她说得粗鄙，只管使眼色止她。',
    hash='sha256:9601ad4f9db2dc4831b2e6c95aca92f601da49a814e415bbb5f0a395cdfab4f1'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1516',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=222,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=42960,
    end_offset=43001,
    text_slice='凤姐听了，笑而不睬，只命平儿把昨儿那包银子拿来，再拿一吊串钱来，都送到刘姥姥跟前。',
    hash='sha256:c67a5f60e1e08586ac47a5d8b7512fe4e0dfcd22e35409210a09451a8a50e6f7'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1517',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=222,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=43006,
    end_offset=43096,
    text_slice='“这是二十两银子，暂且给这孩子做件冬衣罢。若不拿着，可真是怪我了。这串钱雇了车子坐罢。改日无事，只管来逛逛，方是亲戚们的意思。天也晚了，也不虚留你们了，到家里该问好的问个好儿罢。”',
    hash='sha256:530787dd63f7915f531f58fe4988adf2ff3a79a6389f5f4e99b9dee53231096f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1518',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=222,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=43096,
    end_offset=43108,
    text_slice='一面说，一面就站起来了。',
    hash='sha256:6af3890af527d44739c5c60452b544f34b7bfe584f5ff6ea5f18f702a71ba26e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1519',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=223,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=43110,
    end_offset=43137,
    text_slice='刘姥姥只管千恩万谢，拿了银钱，随周瑞家的来至外面厢房。',
    hash='sha256:ebc430572b2466282517a4cf2c7d18f78b82efc02b0f33fc12de3b86f0b7309d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1520',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=223,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=43144,
    end_offset=43223,
    text_slice='“我的娘！你见了她怎么倒不会说了？开口就是‘你侄儿’。我说句不怕你恼的话，便是亲侄儿，也要说和柔些，那蓉大爷才是她的正经侄儿呢，她怎么又跑出这么个侄儿来了？”',
    hash='sha256:2524a4e458d9f1cb3aa4cf60eeb282f83d7b2d4cf11cb2c86b89d3898665e953'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1521',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=223,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=43223,
    end_offset=43229,
    text_slice='刘姥姥笑道：',
    hash='sha256:94d8252bdadbcf32e562a3be212c7422b978c8b89bdda9a071997100f5c87fe4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1522',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=223,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=43229,
    end_offset=43262,
    text_slice='“我的嫂子，我见了她，心眼儿里爱还爱不过来，那里还说得上话来呢！”',
    hash='sha256:db018e67d7f9a4dceb72d91c452cfca1b8ab332198b08fa3dd24436fb7e21113'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1523',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=223,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=43262,
    end_offset=43277,
    text_slice='二人说着，又到周瑞家坐了片时。',
    hash='sha256:11b5a0daf2bfabb37e48c4119180766e12dd3033b23d804cd8635d40b2c8df18'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1524',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=223,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=43277,
    end_offset=43317,
    text_slice='刘姥姥便要留下一块银子，与周瑞家的儿女买果子吃，周瑞家的如何放在眼里，执意不肯。',
    hash='sha256:f41eba0c1c53868aad83eba68b539faeb82c7d931061e571ba03e79159e7d077'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1525',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=223,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=43317,
    end_offset=43332,
    text_slice='刘姥姥感谢不尽，仍从后门去了。',
    hash='sha256:00504cd875122855193453bf512cd7d17d4eb3fcb0f7860e4e7ddcecbe9a1259'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1526',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=224,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=43337,
    end_offset=43353,
    text_slice='得意浓时易接济，受恩深处胜亲朋。',
    hash='sha256:53d5313d9504061e80986230d911f437deb943d93c1509a6ed8a3f779c833b25'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1527',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=225,
    segment_type='heading',
    start_offset=43355,
    end_offset=43377,
    text_slice='第七回  送宫花周瑞叹英莲\u3000谈肆业秦钟结宝玉',
    hash='sha256:4ed7ce488368d71068e55370f079ce948cb07732f0b8414338f8ccdc935e31f0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1528',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=226,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=43379,
    end_offset=43398,
    text_slice='题曰：十二花容色最新，不知谁是惜花人。',
    hash='sha256:f14c9b6dacacd4bab7d293089db407344648d2cd53378651fa90d6f875e957db'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1529',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=226,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=43398,
    end_offset=43414,
    text_slice='相逢若问何姓氏，家住江南姓本秦。',
    hash='sha256:86e779619d8c49f8cae54d8ad9fa9c7e7245910f6df575c81dfea18cd7e97bc0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1530',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=227,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=43416,
    end_offset=43439,
    text_slice='话说周瑞家的送了刘姥姥去后，便上来回王夫人话。',
    hash='sha256:fdb58967eec541cfaaaed212b1467f5bb44e5138a5175cb427b2b412233a8aa6'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1531',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=227,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=43439,
    end_offset=43468,
    text_slice='谁知王夫人不在上房，问丫鬟们时，方知往薛姨妈那边闲话去了。',
    hash='sha256:0fcb7dfc2e069c1dbbae9bbf0adf52fe89916329a3aae3c742881455105bda03'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1532',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=227,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=43468,
    end_offset=43491,
    text_slice='周瑞家的听说，便转东角门出至东院，往梨香院来。',
    hash='sha256:966d76b4869f2836816ae1f4942c40fe792fa115b3baf35faa91ef01bdc2aed7'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1533',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=227,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=43491,
    end_offset=43530,
    text_slice='刚至院门前，只见王夫人的丫鬟名金钏儿者，和一个才留了头的小女孩儿站在台矶上玩。',
    hash='sha256:2e2325dca3daa0d905003c8df21bd08111a255c7c07235c75aea602c341d5bdd'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1534',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=227,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=43530,
    end_offset=43551,
    text_slice='见周瑞家的来了，便知有话回，因向内努嘴儿。',
    hash='sha256:342a14b1ba350f921902dfaa4c835421aaf6815b2f37f6f7f0b6454f7b794454'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1535',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=228,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=43553,
    end_offset=43587,
    text_slice='周瑞家的轻轻掀帘进去，只见王夫人和薛姨妈长篇大套的说些家务人情等语。',
    hash='sha256:af18add05e6dbb060581e638afe46db65fa21e89d962f40e21e72488f7f435d6'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1536',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=228,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=43587,
    end_offset=43656,
    text_slice='周瑞家的不敢惊动，遂进里间来，只见薛宝钗穿著家常衣服，头上只散挽着簪(原字为上髟下赞)儿，坐在炕里边，伏在小炕儿上同丫鬟莺儿正描花样子呢。',
    hash='sha256:cb5df9dd8988d43645d91f5b6d64def51b5f52ccdbf1b4bbde51cad15a449df7'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1537',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=228,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=43679,
    end_offset=43686,
    text_slice='“周姐姐坐。”',
    hash='sha256:9d9fe15c4cf7baedce68849978fcdefe5a681c141cb43f84d79cb954d3226f01'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1538',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=228,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=43686,
    end_offset=43696,
    text_slice='周瑞家的也忙陪笑问：',
    hash='sha256:a8ac6e8fb41c1662b56cdcadc2b8d5d25ad38ff98f4fa36c38414a752798bc42'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1539',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=228,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=43696,
    end_offset=43701,
    text_slice='“姑娘好”',
    hash='sha256:1203b47939fe02e7b0a66644ca895c011ac0af5f2a35568f3a67a1195fa6c878'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1540',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=228,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=43701,
    end_offset=43712,
    text_slice='一面炕沿上坐了，因说：',
    hash='sha256:1b5578934c91335eda7abb049c7eaf0a810037325227a8c60653b10dfd31864c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1541',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=228,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=43712,
    end_offset=43745,
    text_slice='“这有两三天也没见姑娘到那边逛逛去，只怕是你宝兄弟冲撞了你不成？”',
    hash='sha256:7a66e0f683eda7b2ba36d44d4dca8d2cb27a1d095cb5b854b0f2c49cf6054b52'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1542',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=228,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=43745,
    end_offset=43750,
    text_slice='宝钗笑道：',
    hash='sha256:e9823d24e989c8a2053f21ebbe7a66997af9188b1a00acfb93665bf7c308c576'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1543',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=228,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=43750,
    end_offset=43776,
    text_slice='“那里的话！只因我那种病又发了两天，所以静养两日。”',
    hash='sha256:82011cd0de9cc746826705204b9e5c5c8608b23cd9e632b929038ca9bed336f0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1544',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=228,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=43776,
    end_offset=43782,
    text_slice='周瑞家的道：',
    hash='sha256:cd1e213cc7d30d3ef228792c5125537b9f72af073869f2e38a6ea013c0736e8f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1545',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=228,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=43782,
    end_offset=43850,
    text_slice='“正是呢，姑娘到底有什么病根儿，也该趁早儿请了大夫来，好生开个方子，认真吃几剂药，一势儿除了根才好。小小的年纪倒作下个病根也不是玩的。”',
    hash='sha256:7133b7a58c605b3345ba98768dced1269d3a12ca2007120e20a3dd399ebee110'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1546',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=228,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=43850,
    end_offset=43859,
    text_slice='宝钗听说，便笑道：',
    hash='sha256:65e06e51aef7cc60b0632382c0d37476dac9df96a235be93ef6a94aa4f560a17'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1547',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=228,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=43859,
    end_offset=44032,
    text_slice='“再不要提吃药。为这病请大夫、吃药，也不知白花了多少银子钱呢。凭你什么名医仙药，从不见一点儿效。后来还亏了一个秃头和尚，说专治无名之症，因请他看了。他说我这是从胎里带来的一股热毒，幸而我先天壮，还不相干；若吃寻常药，是不中用的。他就说了一个海上方，又给了一包末药作引，异香异气的，不知是那里弄了来的。他说发了时吃一丸就好。倒也奇怪，这倒效验些。”',
    hash='sha256:df23707d4f7c1dabfba3f0f9ab767104b99e22ecedbc6b9f849628876b5fab30'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1548',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=229,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=44034,
    end_offset=44042,
    text_slice='周瑞家的因问道：',
    hash='sha256:e12966427071cc2551d24770810b249b6a8efc1bd57b5e747d448839311c1804'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1549',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=229,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=44042,
    end_offset=44087,
    text_slice='“不知是个什么海上方儿？姑娘说了，我们也记着，说与人知道，倘遇见这样的病，也是行好的事。”',
    hash='sha256:fb87ac9f6917321195d144e4f726575be2562a16a380633b54885191b10433a3'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1550',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=229,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=44087,
    end_offset=44096,
    text_slice='宝钗见问，乃笑道：',
    hash='sha256:07a92947379f27c34494a57da3f6c2a02bce68a743217cd4a9109efa8731c640'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1551',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=229,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=44096,
    end_offset=44244,
    text_slice='“不用这方儿还好，若用起这方儿，真真把人琐碎死了。东西药料一概都有，现易得的，只难得‘可巧’二字。要春天开的白牡丹花蕊十二两，夏天开的白荷花蕊十二两，秋天的白芙蓉花蕊十二两，冬天开的白梅花蕊十二两。将这四样花蕊，于次年春分这日晒干，和在末药一处，一齐研好。又要雨水这日的雨水十二钱，......”',
    hash='sha256:75b6141ad4527bde11ec784b2c4d340c50e7a27a7598bf108a2485442e11d8fa'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1552',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=229,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=44244,
    end_offset=44251,
    text_slice='周瑞家的忙道：',
    hash='sha256:5ecef9e019142f644faa50215e0eb52bb3cba5efd177c3ac271e12e69d140a99'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1553',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=229,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=44251,
    end_offset=44288,
    text_slice='“嗳哟！这样说来，这就得一二年的工夫。倘或这日雨水竟不下雨水，又怎处呢？”',
    hash='sha256:85e6585dabe507ff676628c1be6ea86cff30c80030d21de7a859b50118f3c0ce'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1554',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=229,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=44288,
    end_offset=44293,
    text_slice='宝钗笑道：',
    hash='sha256:e9823d24e989c8a2053f21ebbe7a66997af9188b1a00acfb93665bf7c308c576'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1555',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=229,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=44293,
    end_offset=44424,
    text_slice='“所以了，那里有这样可巧的雨，便没雨也只好再等罢了。白露这日的露水十二钱，霜降这日的霜十二钱，小雪这日的雪十二钱。把这四样水调匀，和了药，再加蜂蜜十二钱，白糖十二钱，丸了龙眼大的丸子，盛在旧磁罐内，埋在花根底下。若发了病时，拿出来吃一丸，用十二分黄柏煎汤送下。”',
    hash='sha256:4ac7a1460dbbfc63d70a416b030aa2098ee34ed96a3bf75913758c1730699de3'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1556',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=230,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=44426,
    end_offset=44435,
    text_slice='周瑞家的听了笑道：',
    hash='sha256:086173c0390dbf60c1b3958dbb310703f83dd6d34fc2a31f557231687789fa02'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1557',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=230,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=44435,
    end_offset=44459,
    text_slice='“阿弥陀佛，真坑死了人！等十年未必都这样巧呢。”',
    hash='sha256:7f2df29bc759d28be7edf1507cc7580a94e03d5d9937bb95cd36de0958b2ac2b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1558',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=230,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=44459,
    end_offset=44463,
    text_slice='宝钗道：',
    hash='sha256:87f70241fca15c6e0d2d9d5113e2d33a81b798ae7d0090db564b501fa57e8bc4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1559',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=230,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=44463,
    end_offset=44511,
    text_slice='“竟好，自他说了去后，一二年间可巧都得了，好容易配成一料。如今从南带至北，现在就埋在梨花树下。”',
    hash='sha256:1d9e88140c0a8529608011c904f81ed37642dbf249842f896ab0918c9ac2102c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1560',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=230,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=44511,
    end_offset=44519,
    text_slice='周瑞家的又问道：',
    hash='sha256:f2559c010330411e39407c45bbd14e54d7d2eb06cd9a4ca425edbc7f4bb2ca46'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1561',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=230,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=44519,
    end_offset=44531,
    text_slice='“这药可有名字没有呢？”',
    hash='sha256:d76a58d3d9238907eb72f9a8a1beed90e557531bb1a44982dc019313373010a9'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1562',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=230,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=44531,
    end_offset=44535,
    text_slice='宝钗道：',
    hash='sha256:87f70241fca15c6e0d2d9d5113e2d33a81b798ae7d0090db564b501fa57e8bc4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1563',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=230,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=44535,
    end_offset=44559,
    text_slice='“有。这也是那癞头和尚说下的，叫作‘冷香丸’。”',
    hash='sha256:9251a7b5490062eb9fb64a875f65f667ffa0f63c72a8beb4a618f5c1453f6249'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1564',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=230,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=44559,
    end_offset=44573,
    text_slice='周瑞家的听了点头儿，因又说：',
    hash='sha256:1275c532291b4605916a927c6b49194541e893648cf7778239b5f7185d9fbc85'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1565',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=230,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=44573,
    end_offset=44586,
    text_slice='“这病发了时到底觉怎样？”',
    hash='sha256:7d59cf49a05661eda88e463000bdeb15817a6e8814a9c1a8bfc6e3032f73b7ea'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1566',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=230,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=44586,
    end_offset=44590,
    text_slice='宝钗道：',
    hash='sha256:87f70241fca15c6e0d2d9d5113e2d33a81b798ae7d0090db564b501fa57e8bc4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1567',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=230,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=44590,
    end_offset=44614,
    text_slice='“也不觉甚什么，只不过喘嗽些，吃一丸也就罢了。”',
    hash='sha256:bfcf5489c43eb85082de75e6175ef9175ed51c78496e2254c1c7aad474938d1e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1568',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=231,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=44616,
    end_offset=44633,
    text_slice='周瑞家的还欲说话时，忽听王夫人问：',
    hash='sha256:03b9ca31df8570d51ed1f7cbca2639eeaa7304aabe70e67b3c4a6050f43aa942'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1569',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=231,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=44633,
    end_offset=44640,
    text_slice='“谁在里头？”',
    hash='sha256:b9eb7049027782f28d7d5f33fcd6954885dae118b30658b7f2978c7cba79d9b6'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1570',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=231,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=44640,
    end_offset=44661,
    text_slice='周瑞家的忙出去答应了，趁便回了刘姥姥之事。',
    hash='sha256:a5495dc7e7c3edb65cfd9c5b610c11a3aea403e07874b4136fa2fdd3cf50d858'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1571',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=231,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=44686,
    end_offset=44706,
    text_slice='“你且站住，我有一宗东西，你带了去罢。”',
    hash='sha256:8620384eecfacb3365ef24ea87de7914d5ba96c14872b427bfdbc8927919d3f6'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1572',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=231,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=44706,
    end_offset=44713,
    text_slice='说着便叫香菱。',
    hash='sha256:74d9edbdeb4d387dd6f9936fca1144d64d5752600430b997c5896be3c5513e6e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1573',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=231,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=44737,
    end_offset=44747,
    text_slice='“奶奶叫我作什么？”',
    hash='sha256:874d1c558582ddb7bd7e37761b987302d8fdc720a8956fbf760938bc62994b34'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1574',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=231,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=44747,
    end_offset=44753,
    text_slice='薛姨妈乃道：',
    hash='sha256:ac3ae0a21616760cf59113ac08dbbb7254e704941192a0f463926c5daff639b2'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1575',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=231,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=44753,
    end_offset=44765,
    text_slice='“把匣子里的花儿拿来。”',
    hash='sha256:d92b8e35ffbad9957065f3f30553e460210839101cdb1db78821505608fe3bac'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1576',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=231,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=44765,
    end_offset=44782,
    text_slice='香菱答应了，向那边捧了个小锦匣来。',
    hash='sha256:69a1e5b2e3541b7edf4df495aff2d3792f6c594974324435e82c91d7119a2b5b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1577',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=231,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=44787,
    end_offset=44894,
    text_slice='“这是宫里头作的新鲜样法，堆纱花儿十二支。昨儿我想起来，白放着可惜旧了的，何不给他们姊妹们戴去。昨儿要送去，偏又忘了。你今儿来得巧，就带了去罢。你家的三位姑娘，每人两枝，下剩六枝，送林姑娘两枝，那四枝给了凤哥罢。”',
    hash='sha256:ea892176b7e2903069a97149906083bcc2692f8691c4f039900db42ffc8f2dc1'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1578',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=231,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=44894,
    end_offset=44899,
    text_slice='王夫人道：',
    hash='sha256:1766c1bd9af9766fe93dc7cb49104279844445c6b1a45c4facc18ec8c32aa79a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1579',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=231,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=44899,
    end_offset=44917,
    text_slice='“留着给宝丫头戴罢了，又想着她们！”',
    hash='sha256:fa04c1d7f611cc77ebec2fc3085de60e5745c7a2b348a73736ae32f6fdb7b16c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1580',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=231,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=44917,
    end_offset=44922,
    text_slice='薛姨妈道：',
    hash='sha256:1e34a5a016872005262442da3f56e3cfae7859188058d7a45050b9ea6e3c1a5a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1581',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=231,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=44922,
    end_offset=44951,
    text_slice='“姨娘不知道，宝丫头古怪着呢，她从来不爱这些花儿粉儿的。”',
    hash='sha256:9e1edb5cbbabee319b14130b0f18d6ae0a40560074523067dfcb09673b402280'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1582',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=232,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=44953,
    end_offset=44982,
    text_slice='说着，周瑞家的拿了匣子，走出房门，见金钏仍在那里晒日阳儿。',
    hash='sha256:3876f1630777998a08b30064ee552e78e23290f018b815350568eff7f256dc20'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1583',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=232,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=44991,
    end_offset=45028,
    text_slice='“那香菱小丫头子，可就是常说临上京时买的、为她打人命官司的那个小丫头子？”',
    hash='sha256:1aefb967b1d54d0a23e769072b6d0c6256ec00d0a7b250b16a68b39a7b2c7c08'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1584',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=232,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=45028,
    end_offset=45032,
    text_slice='金钏道：',
    hash='sha256:fa07a631836ca1905377c8577619566003bfe4a4fb79e98ab4887dd959221e26'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1585',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=232,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=45032,
    end_offset=45040,
    text_slice='“可不就是她。”',
    hash='sha256:eadf4f4d7c672397132441ae305c493228bced1a5fa4ba8bd02d45be68d797fd'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1586',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=232,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=45040,
    end_offset=45055,
    text_slice='正说着，只见香菱笑嘻嘻的走来。',
    hash='sha256:6d224039e27ab84d13753f3d7d67007da79865d76d67ae5d46d64a1eaf92956f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1587',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=232,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=45081,
    end_offset=45107,
    text_slice='“倒好个模样儿！竟有些像咱们东府里蓉大奶奶的品格。”',
    hash='sha256:0ab0e6a1f74317dee2452b4d2764c93d1b2bf01d22552a283d5c00167c7369e1'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1588',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=232,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=45107,
    end_offset=45113,
    text_slice='金钏儿笑道：',
    hash='sha256:0dd0b0955a2d73d6d56f753433badfd15746be691f0c199d8f304015f16e838b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1589',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=232,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=45113,
    end_offset=45123,
    text_slice='“我也是这么说呢。”',
    hash='sha256:733a1d9e2ba627603a53600eade23d0c52a71ac66937913727831d27d4fca567'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1590',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=232,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=45123,
    end_offset=45132,
    text_slice='周瑞家的又问香菱：',
    hash='sha256:7781d9ca1beb4397642f1081a35ad756c32678a6c923597d0032d027227bc055'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1591',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=232,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=45132,
    end_offset=45143,
    text_slice='“你几岁投身到这里？”',
    hash='sha256:77faebf7bdac903ac432f02c656ec7edcac35d6b7c5be4549150ac4f631c7137'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1592',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=232,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=45143,
    end_offset=45146,
    text_slice='又问：',
    hash='sha256:cf579c61b69454b7ea425ac715d9fe6337a29daa1b2195fe27a0eb61b2a57c68'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1593',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=232,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=45146,
    end_offset=45170,
    text_slice='“你父母今在何处？今年十几岁了？本处是哪里人？”',
    hash='sha256:3644c1a00dabce27d1f680b14ffa8735a6034fb49c74c006b3bc738c9c1bae95'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1594',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=232,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=45170,
    end_offset=45180,
    text_slice='香菱听问，都摇头说：',
    hash='sha256:a63333f1218fa48d542c8e25d7f2deff38398eef24d0a6741dd94a5f6cced2fe'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1595',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=232,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=45180,
    end_offset=45187,
    text_slice='“不记得了。”',
    hash='sha256:80e587088783ace7a262879b58d45d1f5682e36c2859c2f8d0e8992f118b481b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1596',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=232,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=45187,
    end_offset=45209,
    text_slice='周瑞家的和金钏儿听了，倒反为她叹息伤感一回。',
    hash='sha256:8c1251ff16414d7788deda2b7a2f7657b2cde3e136da557a669ce49785d3223d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1597',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=233,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=45211,
    end_offset=45229,
    text_slice='一时，周瑞家的携花至王夫人正房后来。',
    hash='sha256:ae5759d2763def1fd345724320bef31c09fa63266f504c6e4c0dd8890246221f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1598',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=233,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=45229,
    end_offset=45302,
    text_slice='原来近日贾母说孙女们太多了，一处挤着倒不方便，只留宝玉、黛玉二人在这边解闷，却将迎、探、惜三人移到王夫人这边房后三间小抱厦内居住，令李纨陪伴照管。',
    hash='sha256:0593c5f47511c1ca7aa720c07387bf2c002c131c596c0acc7e6f0c29b3d5a8d8'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1599',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=233,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=45302,
    end_offset=45336,
    text_slice='如今周瑞家的故顺路先往这里来，只见几个小丫头子都在抱厦内听呼唤默坐。',
    hash='sha256:cb153af594b17a85d51cdea91533983a39fbe51ab4ce7cec572641fa71630c96'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1600',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=233,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=45336,
    end_offset=45408,
    text_slice='迎春的丫鬟司棋与探春的丫鬟待书二人正掀帘子出来，手里都捧着茶钟茶盘，周瑞家的便知她姊妹在一处坐着，遂进入内房，只见迎春、探春二人正在窗下下围棋。',
    hash='sha256:9c89d774502f1ff54e745aa870459387f4057271b750555710f2dc59ce10b11b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1601',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=233,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=45408,
    end_offset=45422,
    text_slice='周瑞家的将花送上，说明原故。',
    hash='sha256:62430bd57370f6867824345455cad7298495a55faa84b3e52de00bd34a047d0d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1602',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=233,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=45422,
    end_offset=45442,
    text_slice='二人忙住了棋，都欠身道谢，命丫鬟们收了。',
    hash='sha256:5011e86032773467bdb6b77b7316efa95408e63f8ecc4e2600b5c6ed62a3c2b5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1603',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=234,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=45444,
    end_offset=45455,
    text_slice='周瑞家的答应了，因说：',
    hash='sha256:702476b1fc102cb7a1f30581902d3cad210290d850368ae9749648541b6294b4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1604',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=234,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=45455,
    end_offset=45475,
    text_slice='“四姑娘不在房里？只怕在老太太那边呢。”',
    hash='sha256:4dd38f7d8fde22041c7854890ed2368a33f1c2da8bd834c5e534c067b302aef6'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1605',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=234,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=45475,
    end_offset=45480,
    text_slice='丫鬟们道：',
    hash='sha256:48ecd73adf7416f9298df5a953436a6d0ecdb0788743d31508df0b23e7652469'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1606',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=234,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=45480,
    end_offset=45488,
    text_slice='“那屋里不是？”',
    hash='sha256:1ff8ba640e68491da96a950b9e6ad2bb513f28f3996e60133c2c8d8d0c7ca974'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1607',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=234,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=45488,
    end_offset=45503,
    text_slice='周瑞家的听了，便往这边屋里来。',
    hash='sha256:7a9e58b0000347cc14a60e89837165c5c93643e5a0d378a7112816a1973867ab'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1608',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=234,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=45503,
    end_offset=45526,
    text_slice='只见惜春正同水月庵的小姑子智能儿两个一处玩耍。',
    hash='sha256:cb6d1abd2d51ecf2e448dd9a6a7cac06065711e2e3f0b274108fa7755ed4ccf2'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1609',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=234,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=45526,
    end_offset=45542,
    text_slice='见周瑞家的进来，惜春便问她何事。',
    hash='sha256:3d359b44f060b1a1bf817a4870474cbc11dcde750a35815cffd7bc09f96caa92'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1610',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=234,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=45542,
    end_offset=45558,
    text_slice='周瑞家的便将花匣打开，说明原故。',
    hash='sha256:33583dd82e09be7c7310dc1f4b77dcf4572c77484b81abb3218e0bc778c5c678'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1611',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=234,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=45563,
    end_offset=45616,
    text_slice='“我这里正和智能儿说，我明儿也剃了头，同她作姑子去呢，可巧又送了花儿来；若剃了头，可把这花儿戴在哪里呢？”',
    hash='sha256:73e4c033e799431f6d9728b39f3f7a513619e982b3b8a994497db61f4432c13b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1612',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=234,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=45616,
    end_offset=45637,
    text_slice='说着，大家取笑一回，惜春命丫鬟入画来收了。',
    hash='sha256:4166b124a97c67d895f36b4a4843a5284072071e2e84589475424de9c8825e6c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1613',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=235,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=45639,
    end_offset=45649,
    text_slice='周瑞家的因问智能儿：',
    hash='sha256:ed9a2c9ebce8d1551963a43465cef97bdfa658227bd3e2c6ea422279424ffdd0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1614',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=235,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=45649,
    end_offset=45673,
    text_slice='“你是什么时候来的？你师父那秃歪剌往那里去了？”',
    hash='sha256:a6a612c81a22a556eda0148ddb47d57a642d44cc93af94520280f586ca8545c1'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1615',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=235,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=45673,
    end_offset=45678,
    text_slice='智能儿道：',
    hash='sha256:212c7ba698afe6b7c6629d3a57dbe7e2a3dc316a514dfa04264b0a0eac7d2f5a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1616',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=235,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=45678,
    end_offset=45714,
    text_slice='“我们一早就来了，我师父见过太太，就往于老爷府里去了，叫我这里等她呢。”',
    hash='sha256:16224c50474665180b565547ea155b3e48076318633f64d712729e163ef375dd'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1617',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=235,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=45714,
    end_offset=45721,
    text_slice='周瑞家的又道：',
    hash='sha256:c6c922e9aa079c2dd245ca00c0613befee08f3d6030d132e6717338d88a61bce'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1618',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=235,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=45721,
    end_offset=45738,
    text_slice='“十五的月例香供银子可得了没有？”',
    hash='sha256:ed2efb9e93a3cc5a4105076a9355fc88c86fa7ab19da74bb19e137be152d3f3b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1619',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=235,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=45738,
    end_offset=45745,
    text_slice='智能儿摇头说：',
    hash='sha256:84adb5fb5aa9e4a7163b6a8b32e98d165b8b4718e9ff0c3fb84aea8f532c1bbb'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1620',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=235,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=45745,
    end_offset=45751,
    text_slice='“不知道。”',
    hash='sha256:e2e4af22828891715c56d9d8afa4b8d9612538fa2c3472b52d30b2bc318e1bc1'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1621',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=235,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=45751,
    end_offset=45763,
    text_slice='惜春听了，便问周瑞家的：',
    hash='sha256:94bfdb21be653796e2402941e17ecf30d5d5e53a900c50aac3dfc0c1663fd76b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1622',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=235,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=45763,
    end_offset=45778,
    text_slice='“如今各庙月例银子是谁管着？”',
    hash='sha256:62b7eccc5323ec8e0a3ffc4ee065a3c2b32014c425b8d330acacd767ba0e9823'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1623',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=235,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=45778,
    end_offset=45784,
    text_slice='周瑞家的道：',
    hash='sha256:cd1e213cc7d30d3ef228792c5125537b9f72af073869f2e38a6ea013c0736e8f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1624',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=235,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=45784,
    end_offset=45792,
    text_slice='“是余信管着。”',
    hash='sha256:93d62eeeecc75ac697b0b8baf8176796251d9cf41ee221fad16ad8c27d7d98c1'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1625',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=235,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=45792,
    end_offset=45800,
    text_slice='惜春听了，笑道：',
    hash='sha256:438ff2392f00a404f79718584e688ed183f463f55a17ddf0699535a1e3e0ecd2'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1626',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=235,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=45800,
    end_offset=45840,
    text_slice='“这就是了！她师父一来，余信家的就赶上来，和她师父咕唧了半日，想是就为这事了。”',
    hash='sha256:078b1850bea8502fb8f231c644ccee728a8bbb2bc260d91d8f3cfe55a8a334c9'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1627',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=236,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=45842,
    end_offset=45866,
    text_slice='那周瑞家的又和智能儿唠叨了一会，便往凤姐儿处来。',
    hash='sha256:55476812c34d312bc90282f774edf8568dd3fd546adc1c1e879978ac9a28d37a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1628',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=236,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=45866,
    end_offset=45894,
    text_slice='穿夹道，从李纨后窗下过，越西花墙，出西角门进入凤姐院中。',
    hash='sha256:e61e1bf37f8704bb70880ab1e98e6a7e0ebab697971f37a80d2c361ea926750f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1629',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=236,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=45894,
    end_offset=45935,
    text_slice='走至堂屋，只见小丫头丰儿坐在凤姐房门槛上，见周瑞家的来了，连忙摆手儿叫她往屋里去。',
    hash='sha256:6119cf3bfb192794c5ecf668edd61a08a85acd64ce0ba8c5243e0f1c663ce4b0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1630',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=236,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=45935,
    end_offset=45970,
    text_slice='周瑞家的会意，慌得蹑手蹑足的往东边房里来，只见奶子正拍着大姐儿睡觉呢。',
    hash='sha256:5a3b208a1164537ba443a912db038810b875e1289911d46adff61e4cdcfa1895'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1631',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=236,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=45980,
    end_offset=45995,
    text_slice='“奶奶睡中觉呢？也该清醒了！”',
    hash='sha256:3100c4b078fe1d026c31b840a29ccb295f64774fec108706f52b18043b88af93'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1632',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=236,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=45995,
    end_offset=46001,
    text_slice='奶子摇头儿。',
    hash='sha256:86f7eb1c765ef8cae980691ee515a691d1ed2123d88b502e638f75e7af67a279'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1633',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=236,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=46001,
    end_offset=46022,
    text_slice='正问着，只听那边一阵笑声，却有贾琏的声音。',
    hash='sha256:5b632e0a8fd3a6b381c2ff37fb9f77c41b632227649e41cc8a4c55b9173fdbd6'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1634',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=236,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=46022,
    end_offset=46048,
    text_slice='接着，房门响处，平儿拿着大铜盆出来，叫丰儿舀水进去。',
    hash='sha256:a53ea37aa119ada87d92e9346df10fd07dc39655ab918509dbb7329e9583590d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1635',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=236,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=46066,
    end_offset=46080,
    text_slice='“你老人家又跑了来作什么？”',
    hash='sha256:4b0a33e0e399b4fc63474cc1f066acfaf4ce968f80e6fd98da29c5fef338e055'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1636',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=236,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=46080,
    end_offset=46101,
    text_slice='周瑞家的忙起身，拿匣子与她，说送花儿一事。',
    hash='sha256:c0dd0ebf30405b157dbeeab57ecac986bae29b98359a60d5a0ada908af62a465'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1637',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=236,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=46101,
    end_offset=46122,
    text_slice='平儿听了，便打开匣子，拿出四枝，转身去了。',
    hash='sha256:2ef3d87f214fa60b71497ce3a37453a8fa22ea859af1af1d2f917f97fd70712d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1638',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=236,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=46122,
    end_offset=46172,
    text_slice='半刻工夫，手里拿出两枝来，先叫彩明来，吩咐她送到那边府里给小蓉大奶奶戴去，次后方命周瑞家的回去道谢。',
    hash='sha256:739a38a4b9446e5b1ca4588a8c4f21c8b2c74fd88066084906ae03b0279371b1'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1639',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=237,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=46174,
    end_offset=46187,
    text_slice='周瑞家的这才往贾母这边来。',
    hash='sha256:e66005cdb222e50626bdebb29d0d261d8421265a3c683619fd5e273b8d7a0ecd'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1640',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=237,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=46187,
    end_offset=46210,
    text_slice='穿过了穿堂，顶头忽见她女儿打扮着才从她婆家来。',
    hash='sha256:2c5bf13ed32e6d390ba016548f805fb0c611579e8d0a48afc3f92933932cb9bd'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1641',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=237,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=46217,
    end_offset=46229,
    text_slice='“你这会子跑来作什么？”',
    hash='sha256:d1d44f6606f48d9bd806e5f0cb62b852aa14a152fd1b179442eeaba8fdde7a52'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1642',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=237,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=46229,
    end_offset=46235,
    text_slice='她女儿笑道：',
    hash='sha256:266b3dddd9f1e3926d7982dabd14d7a13ebcf292f65b7fbecfd23d5649a99a68'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1643',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=237,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=46235,
    end_offset=46319,
    text_slice='“妈一向身上好？我在家里等了这半日，妈竟不出去，什么事情这样忙得不回家？我等烦了，自己先到老太太跟前请了安了，这会子请太太安去。妈还有什么不了的差事？手里是什么东西？”',
    hash='sha256:81f91b33516f22ffa965b846e1eca39d41ac715b7687c915afe9e7301cf1cd64'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1644',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=237,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=46319,
    end_offset=46326,
    text_slice='周瑞家的笑道：',
    hash='sha256:007c21a51831c2e8ee758bdca7ba4d62dbd032bf98ab812c639e743964b58f9f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1645',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=237,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=46326,
    end_offset=46406,
    text_slice='“嗳！今儿偏偏的来了个刘姥姥，我自己多事，为她跑了半日；这会子又被姨太太看见了，送这几枝花儿与姑娘奶奶们。这会子还没送清白呢。你这会子跑来，一定有什么事情的。”',
    hash='sha256:5b2376b44f2a2e1292b57c8ce3dfb0507f525940ac41898e5caacc5de6228800'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1646',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=237,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=46406,
    end_offset=46412,
    text_slice='她女儿笑道：',
    hash='sha256:266b3dddd9f1e3926d7982dabd14d7a13ebcf292f65b7fbecfd23d5649a99a68'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1647',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=237,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=46412,
    end_offset=46509,
    text_slice='“你老人家倒会猜。实对你老人家说，你女婿前儿因多吃了两杯酒，和人分争起来，不知怎的被人放了一把邪火，说他来历不明，告到衙门里，要递解还乡。所以我来和你老人家商议商议，这个情分，求那一个可了事？”',
    hash='sha256:9737a78d5e569afb785a43f46582628b8acfca67a00eff7473459b5e82686355'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1648',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=237,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=46509,
    end_offset=46518,
    text_slice='周瑞家的听了，道：',
    hash='sha256:2b4c8e90b655fd2aad5eb328c8d2675c397c720a5992f4b16e1a4ef9dec20374'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1649',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=237,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=46518,
    end_offset=46579,
    text_slice='“我就知道呢。这有什么大不了的！你且家去等我，我送林姑娘的花儿去了就回来。此时，太太、二奶奶都不得闲儿，便回去了，还说：”',
    hash='sha256:f2058ef6f99a65d9cd506f5cfddf7d6328f5ef936b328ce7fab8895673759b8d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1650',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=237,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=46579,
    end_offset=46587,
    text_slice='妈，你好歹快来！',
    hash='sha256:9b6ace3a7623318216326afcf754889e2c8782ff8be1ad181953e2bb6c75f0eb'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1651',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=237,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=46587,
    end_offset=46595,
    text_slice='“周瑞家的道：”',
    hash='sha256:cf7abff267d7b51acb791445c17c795f447fb11438362084c2e9f8241f2661ae'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1652',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=237,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=46595,
    end_offset=46617,
    text_slice='是了，小人家没经过什么事情，就急得你这样子。',
    hash='sha256:ee8d8540472638a2a858ac0908ee0cc53f806970e42de42ef11a367ff91d5f5a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1653',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=237,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=46617,
    end_offset=46630,
    text_slice='“说着，便到黛玉房中去了。',
    hash='sha256:eddd88205aaa152830a97645010793cd690662879a3d3c766b516e11526ddf7f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1654',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=238,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=46632,
    end_offset=46661,
    text_slice='谁知此时黛玉不在自己房中，却在宝玉房中，大家解九连环作战。',
    hash='sha256:0ff3547df178af73d423d44fb9935c3040fff0635559f7d387883f924a8653e4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1655',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=238,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=46670,
    end_offset=46690,
    text_slice='“林姑娘，姨太太着我送花儿来与姑娘戴。”',
    hash='sha256:d69ae473961606d2fdaa337bcd65e211d98494db64cbcc0db7efc69726b3fbe0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1656',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=238,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=46690,
    end_offset=46699,
    text_slice='宝玉听说，先便问：',
    hash='sha256:46a3a8a2f3c3bc04ff9e2183768e1efeae89fed467ad722faed634f21e41f670'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1657',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=238,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=46699,
    end_offset=46711,
    text_slice='“什么花儿？拿来给我！”',
    hash='sha256:26df4a2fe9c95c46ce3f9849f5125d21dd300846d7db227e094a86c899384f45'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1658',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=238,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=46711,
    end_offset=46721,
    text_slice='一面早伸手接过来了。',
    hash='sha256:c6ca7a1d3c3f46e64bccfe28220531ea670c4453161e0470fefa696ca29cad73'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1659',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=238,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=46721,
    end_offset=46741,
    text_slice='开匣看时，原来是两枝宫制堆纱新巧的假花。',
    hash='sha256:289a9ef5751d7ba0cf2d848b4a45b905673fcf559e4a251512277738958bd6ec'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1660',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=238,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=46758,
    end_offset=46780,
    text_slice='“还是单送我一人的，还是别的姑娘们都有呢？”',
    hash='sha256:38bfe149ad87feee53f52feca6a33883c86ea2f6c5457e9b6cfbd68ab1431a4f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1661',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=238,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=46780,
    end_offset=46786,
    text_slice='周瑞家的道：',
    hash='sha256:cd1e213cc7d30d3ef228792c5125537b9f72af073869f2e38a6ea013c0736e8f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1662',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=238,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=46786,
    end_offset=46803,
    text_slice='“各位都有了，这两枝是姑娘的了。”',
    hash='sha256:caaacd0c2d30ceab0c1472b692285049b6ccce8ba76e1546c7ad10d2e86327fb'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1663',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=238,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=46803,
    end_offset=46815,
    text_slice='黛玉再看了一看，冷笑道：',
    hash='sha256:b23de1ab038da016836064849424282bd0f7c5f711b336fe7303ff5f8045dab2'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1664',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=238,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=46815,
    end_offset=46841,
    text_slice='“我就知道，别人不挑剩下的，也不给我。替我道谢罢！”',
    hash='sha256:f6516f4ddb8c39f879876946c5c386a8fb76286187dca73dc71d306ad02f0001'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1665',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=238,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=46841,
    end_offset=46855,
    text_slice='周瑞家的听了，一声儿不言语。',
    hash='sha256:9de8fdc1ef354f356a8309643c83c6dbfd256368df1ef15b8e10203a5785cd7e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1666',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=238,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=46861,
    end_offset=46877,
    text_slice='“周姊姊，你作什么到那边去了？”',
    hash='sha256:6630fb0a75b301dbddd09adc48e8ad8023cd4139150b84dd4dd04cb797ddc830'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1667',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=238,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=46877,
    end_offset=46884,
    text_slice='周瑞家的因说：',
    hash='sha256:ad4d1ed42c66898097d3080b86a95366d3a9ffcd1c66ea99b974f6b8bf4c37b5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1668',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=238,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=46884,
    end_offset=46910,
    text_slice='“太太在那里，因回话去了，姨太太就顺便叫我带来了。”',
    hash='sha256:71089428a41b64bf6a28925ed865b4034a690d292c12e81b734aa5e43d40292a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1669',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=238,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=46910,
    end_offset=46914,
    text_slice='宝玉道：',
    hash='sha256:10c9e1a43f0e2e5bf2e54f50fb3dbede512eb436326aec72d14625e62153e9b0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1670',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=238,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=46914,
    end_offset=46936,
    text_slice='“宝姐姐在家作什么呢？怎么这几日也不过来？”',
    hash='sha256:0fdc5f370d8a3999ea093f9a26a3613e59f1fa36cf6a410a2e86aa089069ffe6'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1671',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=238,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=46936,
    end_offset=46942,
    text_slice='周瑞家的道：',
    hash='sha256:cd1e213cc7d30d3ef228792c5125537b9f72af073869f2e38a6ea013c0736e8f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1672',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=238,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=46942,
    end_offset=46951,
    text_slice='“身上不大好呢。”',
    hash='sha256:1dcf2726f4c6d2863e54f65b1e9b521283d327159c949b45c3475b70bfb5336e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1673',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=238,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=46951,
    end_offset=46963,
    text_slice='宝玉听了，便和丫头们说：',
    hash='sha256:b78a7674ab386b023ca5b7863be85558dcdb971d6fe34a2b3d05ecf676260f74'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1674',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=238,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=46963,
    end_offset=47031,
    text_slice='“谁去瞧瞧？就说我和林姑娘打发来问姨娘、姐姐安，问姐姐是什么病，吃什么药。论理我该亲自来的，就说才从学里来，也着了些凉，异日再亲自来。”',
    hash='sha256:ec52a78ff26eda14a08946e2a23ecd6a56587f9ba073ed7112c23215a4732e0c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1675',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=238,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=47031,
    end_offset=47042,
    text_slice='说着，茜雪便答应去了。',
    hash='sha256:44890e7502f83ff9dc4486d64ad62374beb85be7d8dbc77037de29e8c52a1884'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1676',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=238,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=47042,
    end_offset=47052,
    text_slice='周瑞家的自去，无话。',
    hash='sha256:6bd327e39427cfc9e225ffa63c21a1f835c9a516332d0f13691451948c83f41c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1677',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=239,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=47054,
    end_offset=47094,
    text_slice='原来这周瑞的女婿，便是雨村的好友冷子兴，近因卖古董和人打官司，故遣女人来讨情分。',
    hash='sha256:71b8530d5070852c8a5a81097770cd031601e6e63c737fcf467dd79279c8ede5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1678',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=239,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=47094,
    end_offset=47129,
    text_slice='周瑞家的仗着主子的势利，把这些事也不放在心上，晚间只求求凤姐儿便完了。',
    hash='sha256:5998c22242f7a59960d370eadde4df69e7a56a2f1fe9e345608d488afa600d00'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1679',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=240,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=47131,
    end_offset=47152,
    text_slice='至掌灯时分，凤姐已卸了妆，来见王夫人回话：',
    hash='sha256:d860be57a64e8d77168274a05ad6d1f263278e3daed9d75ae5f27e527faff8d7'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1680',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=240,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=47152,
    end_offset=47200,
    text_slice='“今儿甄家送了来的东西，我已收了。咱们送他的，趁着他家有年下进鲜的船去，一并都交给他们带去了。”',
    hash='sha256:f18010ca19334743598995afbf53272f97a66ac465c6c0a9039d89547861cac7'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1681',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=240,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=47200,
    end_offset=47206,
    text_slice='王夫人点头。',
    hash='sha256:d89a3a3fa7a879fb55317439e1d95e0d34b04d482858f0496bdf39650328b0fa'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1682',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=240,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=47211,
    end_offset=47236,
    text_slice='“临安伯老太太千秋的礼已经打点了，太太派谁送去？”',
    hash='sha256:7d917ab7d73c9d1855cfb4bb27c30951ef30d1e58255d8c8a6115232a4a1bd6f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1683',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=240,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=47236,
    end_offset=47241,
    text_slice='王夫人道：',
    hash='sha256:1766c1bd9af9766fe93dc7cb49104279844445c6b1a45c4facc18ec8c32aa79a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1684',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=240,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=47241,
    end_offset=47273,
    text_slice='“你瞧谁闲着，不管打发两个女人去就完了，又来当什么正经事问我。”',
    hash='sha256:5839dcb5ec162ca4a7c1c0dd34805444fa0a72a2af835a789e91fbb83172e654'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1685',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=240,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=47273,
    end_offset=47279,
    text_slice='凤姐又笑道：',
    hash='sha256:b16d03b9a1ba77fdad9c48c1c738534d3d84deb2f19e6d022f2c71879e11f72a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1686',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=240,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=47279,
    end_offset=47307,
    text_slice='“今儿珍大嫂子来，请我明儿过去逛逛，明儿倒没有什么事。”',
    hash='sha256:e57e56638285431207fa70038cd358702a27276054dc27e48be9a1f9f3da51da'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1687',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=240,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=47307,
    end_offset=47312,
    text_slice='王夫人道：',
    hash='sha256:1766c1bd9af9766fe93dc7cb49104279844445c6b1a45c4facc18ec8c32aa79a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1688',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=240,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=47312,
    end_offset=47386,
    text_slice='“有事没事都害不着什么。每常她来请，有我们，你自然不便意；她既不请我们，单请你，可知是她诚心叫你散淡散淡，别辜负了她的心，便是有事，也该过去才是。”',
    hash='sha256:6b310b1ced768993e38fbb862330bd3fda2bceeb6ab0d1de69d1ec36201f5604'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1689',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=240,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=47386,
    end_offset=47392,
    text_slice='凤姐答应了。',
    hash='sha256:44ae2bd5feefea5294e780bc7107aa3b4e6edecf3ef7dfaf6bc2814c7861a9e6'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1690',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=240,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=47392,
    end_offset=47419,
    text_slice='当下，李纨、迎、探等姊妹们亦来定省毕，各自归房，无话。',
    hash='sha256:641ab717b4f16b30e0d0cb7a48bbb6eb653eee6e716b823e3956c180f4ad4f96'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1691',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=241,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=47421,
    end_offset=47443,
    text_slice='次日，凤姐梳洗了，先回王夫人毕，方来辞贾母。',
    hash='sha256:32edb14f67c45e691d4e60c65e915689a68790e2e76dfa3c2519b5867b8e00ef'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1692',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=241,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=47443,
    end_offset=47453,
    text_slice='宝玉听了，也要逛去。',
    hash='sha256:6f12febc545570d66de729e6f5feb4e72067c99478f475c57b4ffcea65dccb78'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1693',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=241,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=47453,
    end_offset=47483,
    text_slice='凤姐只得答应着，立等换了衣服，姐儿两个坐了车，一时进入宁府。',
    hash='sha256:bfbde86b9374398c712ab3ce5bddc94ab2d105ce823346b3d30d397263835a2c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1694',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=241,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=47483,
    end_offset=47521,
    text_slice='早有贾珍之妻尤氏与贾蓉之妻秦氏，婆媳两个引了多少姬妾、丫鬟、媳妇等接出仪门。',
    hash='sha256:d77e269570238df93f2c5c3408fc48e0b67d3dafff8d84b976cd5872d4457b20'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1695',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=241,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=47521,
    end_offset=47550,
    text_slice='那尤氏一见了凤姐，必先笑嘲一阵，一手携了宝玉入上房来归坐。',
    hash='sha256:94631e8e6c7b3d070f172a6ad06043ca74ab8579d51ea3763edd8fce92cc7652'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1696',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=241,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=47561,
    end_offset=47592,
    text_slice='“你们请我来作什么？有什么东西来孝敬，就献上来，我还有事呢。”',
    hash='sha256:67cf847e45e59ad52b6896e7432df82cd749ff1bae9388cf66b5b4ff611b2b0c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1697',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=241,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=47592,
    end_offset=47613,
    text_slice='尤氏、秦氏未及答话，地下几个姬妾先就笑说：',
    hash='sha256:45af3cf1f4acdb8805c7382abb63130dc97d7e34dc0091c1a04c5bab7d8fd2ff'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1698',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=241,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=47613,
    end_offset=47638,
    text_slice='“二奶奶今儿不来就罢，既来了，就依不得二奶奶了。”',
    hash='sha256:40c05a4c4f62a01aba48728d80f0f154d9ae6b014f87373d8968fc0053cd29ca'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1699',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=241,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=47638,
    end_offset=47651,
    text_slice='正说着，只见贾蓉进来请安。',
    hash='sha256:19dbd274527c859b16fe0ddb07ebb2daf6405650b148e8c98fd509cbb25c0d13'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1700',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=241,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=47656,
    end_offset=47667,
    text_slice='“大哥哥今日不在家？”',
    hash='sha256:ac4460e258b0ae7991d1de3a03382ca4f37fc7360f0d980ec7b12434f98c10ca'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1701',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=241,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=47667,
    end_offset=47671,
    text_slice='尤氏道：',
    hash='sha256:a770cb189e69039a617afc79b3f86391dc741bed11673a456877bf606c7c1dd3'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1702',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=241,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=47671,
    end_offset=47682,
    text_slice='“出城请老爷安去了。”',
    hash='sha256:f1cc55b0dfe231019468af20c98aa818360b51c95cb75ec1d26aad444ed57e60'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1703',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=241,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=47682,
    end_offset=47685,
    text_slice='又道：',
    hash='sha256:5491b83a3188000d53513c419a2db2a41f48c64eb411b7b7150cf57bc71ebb48'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1704',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=241,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=47685,
    end_offset=47708,
    text_slice='“可是你怪闷的，坐在这里作什么？何不去逛逛？”',
    hash='sha256:95f19587e1cd30b23ef6821c0eff66ebb77d2e47bec1209d6dad874dd88964ef'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1705',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=242,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=47710,
    end_offset=47715,
    text_slice='秦氏笑道：',
    hash='sha256:a70e23eff568480f76a659e827bae8fd43220e1cb104bc33ac90efc58e622335'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1706',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=242,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=47715,
    end_offset=47756,
    text_slice='“今儿巧，上回宝叔立刻要见我兄弟，他今儿也在这里，想在书房里，宝叔何不去瞧一瞧？”',
    hash='sha256:cd9face80f42c36a9bcf105c006f609bf229945317bc7033f9284977e503f08f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1707',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=242,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=47756,
    end_offset=47768,
    text_slice='宝玉听了，即便下炕要走。',
    hash='sha256:8f511092e0ffa807fc204d69759b491415b1813aa465494dda22a795c3b6e31c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1708',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=242,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=47777,
    end_offset=47787,
    text_slice='“好生着，忙什么！”',
    hash='sha256:d027085d46756fcd4e3194cfdd063bd21230d1e3241a103a9ead4f9d3647c929'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1709',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=242,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=47787,
    end_offset=47794,
    text_slice='一面便吩咐人：',
    hash='sha256:cb19b7e0ed8d77dff61b2f47d762c4e07afbc3e90afdb95ea5a596f00de4a130'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1710',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=242,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=47794,
    end_offset=47824,
    text_slice='“好生小心跟着，别委曲着他，倒比不得跟了老太太过来就罢了。”',
    hash='sha256:61b0df30b2308103c4bac192536d74587a070e3adbaf2216e6879b2edf18f6d7'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1711',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=242,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=47824,
    end_offset=47829,
    text_slice='凤姐儿道：',
    hash='sha256:93bab9ff591c039f189f615d0e6ec70c46f0b6be387ab4b78d2ab495d263a94e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1712',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=242,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=47829,
    end_offset=47861,
    text_slice='“既这么着，何不请进这秦小爷来，我也瞧瞧。难道我见不得他不成？”',
    hash='sha256:0b0bd72537a343f0cae0108a5f3a46397696beab4630778825d02dcf39a2d169'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1713',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=242,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=47861,
    end_offset=47866,
    text_slice='尤氏笑道：',
    hash='sha256:1b73774d874d1c046179e52ec7c7a1a45f2e895f617c8e2a83918ecf5b762c77'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1714',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=242,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=47866,
    end_offset=47932,
    text_slice='“罢，罢！可以不必见他，比不得咱们家的孩子们，胡打海摔的惯了。人家的孩子，都是斯斯文文惯了的，乍见了你这破落户，还被人笑话死了呢！”',
    hash='sha256:8a8c0e1dfe34f7c970cbe7b5e6e6590d1dd35382fe3cdc1a320ffc9ef61135dd'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1715',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=242,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=47932,
    end_offset=47937,
    text_slice='凤姐笑道：',
    hash='sha256:fa673815883516a89495f0598428fc17e5f85586cc72e1283fe4d69da7b1c484'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1716',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=242,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=47937,
    end_offset=47965,
    text_slice='“普天下的人，我不笑话就罢了，竟叫这小孩子笑话我不成？”',
    hash='sha256:3cc481bbc8d9469cf7a1e5ddaaad54f1d6224551f49b70d3557815016a19de59'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1717',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=242,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=47965,
    end_offset=47970,
    text_slice='贾蓉笑道：',
    hash='sha256:14bf034c9a1cafba734b07d4c8b73adb78cfc2cb216ae91081232d4a80d17978'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1718',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=242,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=47970,
    end_offset=48001,
    text_slice='“不是这话，他生得腼腆，没见过大阵仗儿，婶子见了，没的生气。”',
    hash='sha256:809ed584982b7c430b3e01a15050a2de3143b4ae60cae220b776de29b481df8a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1719',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=242,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=48001,
    end_offset=48006,
    text_slice='凤姐啐道：',
    hash='sha256:85707e56b348d568fbce12773f2b572a9a1c620e9b7df18202d3b68669e5c15b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1720',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=242,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=48006,
    end_offset=48042,
    text_slice='“他是哪咤，我也要见一见，别放你娘的屁了！再不带去看给你一顿好嘴巴子！”',
    hash='sha256:6f939db219c041c33eedf6911175c6d8c2bde71c759bd877e59df9d914534729'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1721',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=242,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=48042,
    end_offset=48050,
    text_slice='贾蓉笑嘻嘻的说：',
    hash='sha256:46ed336b11bd2f634c294cdc0d87f630855255ac239b3e2a08e26d2548852de2'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1722',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=242,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=48050,
    end_offset=48062,
    text_slice='“我不敢强，就带他来。”',
    hash='sha256:40f57af4a9afa9657ea9563b5be73fd2f827c359958f751983980929df61514a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1723',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=243,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=48064,
    end_offset=48128,
    text_slice='说着，果然出去带进一个小后生来，较宝玉略瘦巧些，清眉秀目，粉面朱唇，身材俊俏，举止风流，似在宝玉之上，只是怯怯羞羞，有女儿之态。',
    hash='sha256:261615868d4f8a2aeeac93833bee0e1ef70c89bf94b2272573439fddf2b49e56'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1724',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=243,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=48128,
    end_offset=48141,
    text_slice='腼腆含糊的向凤姐作揖问好。',
    hash='sha256:510a9a66284d7850219b365b2877b35341c58475f9fc7fd69a1cd6c5ce4a33e3'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1725',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=243,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=48153,
    end_offset=48160,
    text_slice='“比下去了！”',
    hash='sha256:3acefecd4330e5f287e1b4d24f41faf84f7627ca72c9394c8028f90b37d22a21'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1726',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=243,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=48160,
    end_offset=48181,
    text_slice='便探身一把携了这孩子的手，就命他身旁坐下。',
    hash='sha256:6930f61e79c4922d36a46f2910af37644de0047acaf8883ebe68e9039f3308bd'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1727',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=243,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=48181,
    end_offset=48204,
    text_slice='慢慢的问他：年纪、读书等事，方知他学名唤秦钟。',
    hash='sha256:cfa7e1b7561ab56826003d2506844c1cbfe50ebaed3ff5d7ea6c9039fbe32726'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1728',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=243,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=48204,
    end_offset=48241,
    text_slice='早有凤姐的丫鬟媳妇们见凤姐初会秦钟，并未备得表礼来，遂忙过那边去告诉平儿。',
    hash='sha256:dd04a32ab1a92abeaffa11747ecfecfa01044ea0fe6619896197250fc22d734d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1729',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=243,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=48282,
    end_offset=48288,
    text_slice='“状元及第”',
    hash='sha256:46764cad29a8ed347c016f22a2c9184f764a301c276c46856b04a725c0ee0e66'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1730',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=243,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=48288,
    end_offset=48303,
    text_slice='的小金锞子，交付与来人送过去。',
    hash='sha256:fced41e3a43f18e6d3ccb045a139cacb1b57305633f9e6ce366b5b22b07b7f65'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1731',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=243,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=48303,
    end_offset=48314,
    text_slice='凤姐犹笑说太简薄等语。',
    hash='sha256:8eff6190f965559cf9f655c8c2fc87a5b8ba69865f2f5a0412a252e316d66fb4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1732',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=243,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=48314,
    end_offset=48320,
    text_slice='秦氏等谢毕。',
    hash='sha256:c3a9f415b7e5e532d1a5c7e8757a2270e1deab72e66a00eb3ad25fac95d020d8'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1733',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=243,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=48320,
    end_offset=48344,
    text_slice='一时吃过饭，尤氏、凤姐、秦氏等抹骨牌，不在话下。',
    hash='sha256:268cdc47684e28c752a2b9932070bc3c596616b08e38dd109da84aa8bc36ba04'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1734',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=243,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=48344,
    end_offset=48358,
    text_slice='宝玉、秦钟二人随便起坐说话。',
    hash='sha256:5353caa0f6b2b735700e5276528a2485d1de51dc082af28661689a02ff6b0dcc'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1735',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=243,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=48358,
    end_offset=48376,
    text_slice='那宝玉自见了秦钟人品，心中便有所失。',
    hash='sha256:dc9b69abebcbc40f9a9f2913e0c53fdf04be9f81274b9a8b52530d1127b310cb'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1736',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=243,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=48396,
    end_offset=48524,
    text_slice='“天下竟有这等人物！如今看来，我竟成了泥猪癞狗了。可恨我为什么生在这侯门公府之家，若也生在寒门薄宦之家，早得与他交结，也不枉生了一世。我虽如此比他尊贵，可知绫锦纱罗，也不过裹了我这根死木头；美酒羊羔，也不过填了我这粪窟泥沟。‘富贵’二字，不料遭我荼毒了！”',
    hash='sha256:34df6472f2a4ea0d28ff80cf788472045dfe570f2d6a1dbd614ca0c6106fd83c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1737',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=243,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=48524,
    end_offset=48562,
    text_slice='秦钟自见了宝玉形容出众，举止不凡，更兼金冠绣服，骄婢侈童，秦钟心中亦自思道：',
    hash='sha256:cd2846c35f12623f38a06d83f6f640398852f853374392c01888dd5cd9859b02'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1738',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=243,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=48562,
    end_offset=48618,
    text_slice='“果然这宝玉怨不得人人溺爱他。可恨我偏生于清寒之家，不能与他耳鬓交接，可知‘贫窭’二字限人，亦世间之大不快事。”',
    hash='sha256:5e82b5dba2f2cdc59cc6f32837e7f9b0b4f021239d4198e3bf45310f615bc668'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1739',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=243,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=48618,
    end_offset=48628,
    text_slice='二人一样的胡思乱想。',
    hash='sha256:55d250387faf3b7182dbee4cd46d462fc1d751366ab5759a63e63e8ae8676412'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1740',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=243,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=48628,
    end_offset=48651,
    text_slice='忽又有宝玉问他读什么书；秦钟见问，便因实而答。',
    hash='sha256:58c0ba81bc91111c6dea1efbd53ec45ad22bdf3786cd97a349e1a58a0e990a2f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1741',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=243,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=48651,
    end_offset=48670,
    text_slice='二人你言我语，十来句后，越觉亲密起来。',
    hash='sha256:10e6319da26052a5a19a5ab4811fad431725544eb1587942a3db6f4ffb9fcb93'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1742',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=244,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=48672,
    end_offset=48686,
    text_slice='一时摆上茶果吃茶，宝玉便说：',
    hash='sha256:4d46fe8cac77405589702e6cbd92538ced3aa5d6b4aa7f55f0c2661fb3470072'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1743',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=244,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=48686,
    end_offset=48720,
    text_slice='“我两个又不吃酒，把果子摆在里间小炕上，我们那里坐去，省得闹你们。”',
    hash='sha256:fa29e20011c6a9be5d4bda3686db3261436172f40660c0d1a7917c20aee1ab96'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1744',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=244,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=48720,
    end_offset=48731,
    text_slice='于是二人进里间来吃茶。',
    hash='sha256:30f6608eb3153f6cb3ac78391f91ead921e798fc40b921663716cd209eb36475'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1745',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=244,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=48754,
    end_offset=48805,
    text_slice='“宝叔，你侄儿年小，倘或言语不防头，你千万看着我，不要理他。他虽腆腼，却性子左强，不大随和此是有的。”',
    hash='sha256:e8f5e1b18e72c763d2415e71755afdedb43e1c0bcb14f7a145bef346591a0df1'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1746',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=244,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=48805,
    end_offset=48810,
    text_slice='宝玉笑道：',
    hash='sha256:4010737831077115327a930fc031b5caa442f6aca950d1b4be97c2a32a759b5c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1747',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=244,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=48810,
    end_offset=48821,
    text_slice='“你去罢，我知道了。”',
    hash='sha256:403ff09e320136b27876a9df776b31c9916dff5ad9d7648c4f75af02e66e0c5e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1748',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=244,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=48821,
    end_offset=48838,
    text_slice='秦氏又嘱了她兄弟一回，方去陪凤姐。',
    hash='sha256:d2d2b59b7ebc60beb9fa340171ff143c68f917cdceb4d0244f0a0c930a1e0af1'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1749',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=245,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=48840,
    end_offset=48856,
    text_slice='一时凤姐、尤氏又打发人来问宝玉：',
    hash='sha256:5cbc69f937a448ec31b5f455a7d1baec671f1ff8f6f8fd67d520373c4e182c53'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1750',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=245,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=48856,
    end_offset=48872,
    text_slice='“要吃什么，外面有，只管要去。”',
    hash='sha256:0b8e3789d6ae44733fbc0637a86c93dbaaaa5b956d214bf2180c9b25cca6f27a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1751',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=245,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=48872,
    end_offset=48898,
    text_slice='宝玉只答应着，也无心在饮食上，只问秦钟近日家务等事。',
    hash='sha256:53248beed5730923fb47f8e279faf148ddf6284edfcbcfe5d2243c1551210fdc'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1752',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=245,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=48903,
    end_offset=48984,
    text_slice='“业师于去年病故，家父又年纪老迈，残疾在身，公务繁冗，因此尚未议及再延师一事，目下不过在家温习旧课而已。再读书一事，必须有一二知己为伴，时常大家讨论，才能进益。”',
    hash='sha256:ee5a95c8eb0ea85199464523c5bf303cdeae9cc59d9fceb4feb4745b4d08ab73'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1753',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=245,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=48984,
    end_offset=48995,
    text_slice='宝玉不待说完，便答道：',
    hash='sha256:07572bf03bf14477a1dbdd3b1bd6b0bf19707bde53fc5ecc53da21d97e738185'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1754',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=245,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=48995,
    end_offset=49189,
    text_slice='“正是呢，我们却有个家塾，合族中有不能延师的，便可入塾读书。子弟们中亦有亲戚在内，可以附读。我因上年业师回家去了，也现荒废着呢。家父之意，亦欲暂送我去，温习旧书，待明年业师上来，再各自在家亦可。家祖母因说：一则家学里子弟太多，生恐大家淘气，反不好；二则也因我病了几天，遂暂且耽搁着。如此说来，尊翁如今也为此事悬心。今日回去，何不禀明，就往我们这敝塾中来，我亦相伴，彼此有益，岂不是好事？”',
    hash='sha256:94c83ab78d968f6017e448146d89e66d8fbcd1e44d10e9c025299b60c5e2ae93'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1755',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=245,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=49189,
    end_offset=49194,
    text_slice='秦钟笑道：',
    hash='sha256:3f51106d2128c5dc9fd201d5d6660025d9fe565a0c9f8e0b6ef85a00f4b50291'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1756',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=245,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=49194,
    end_offset=49315,
    text_slice='“家父前日在家提起延师一事，也曾提起这里的义学倒好，原要来和这里的亲翁商议引荐。因这里事忙，不便为这点小事来聒絮的。宝叔果然度小侄或可磨墨涤砚，何不速速的作成，又彼此不致荒废，又可以常相谈聚，又可以慰父母之心，又可以得朋友之乐，岂不是美事？”',
    hash='sha256:bad31c27aa2f61d2f0852187b58218b46996839da2ac751f810558f77bdfba75'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1757',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=245,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=49315,
    end_offset=49320,
    text_slice='宝玉笑道：',
    hash='sha256:4010737831077115327a930fc031b5caa442f6aca950d1b4be97c2a32a759b5c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1758',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=245,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=49320,
    end_offset=49376,
    text_slice='“放心，放心！咱们回来先告诉你姐夫、姊姊和琏二嫂子。你今日回家就禀明令尊；我回去再禀明家祖母，再无不速成之理。”',
    hash='sha256:dbd35f095596c2a1dc3d2961db50960e729f55ba2edddc37469887220914023d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1759',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=245,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=49376,
    end_offset=49383,
    text_slice='二人计议一定。',
    hash='sha256:030fc860645ba3ddc7b7f3210343a78a8b202ddadc75a69aa8e9b1a564a5226d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1760',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=245,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=49383,
    end_offset=49405,
    text_slice='那天气已是掌灯时候，出来又看他们玩了一回牌。',
    hash='sha256:6d2539c9b3858471c11203c862837e255182279508ab2e53fc1bfa54e1f78187'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1761',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=245,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=49405,
    end_offset=49436,
    text_slice='算帐时，却又是秦氏、尤氏二人输了戏酒的东道，言定后日吃这东道。',
    hash='sha256:c2009da21c4ff92f471a1f143134bdfef54ec76bfdc7bd067bbbc495aab8b215'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1762',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=245,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=49436,
    end_offset=49444,
    text_slice='一面又说回了话。',
    hash='sha256:6a88b6835e1bd654958767a29a6f7c9a8fc95290fdc9d177832571825172ad17'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1763',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=246,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=49446,
    end_offset=49460,
    text_slice='晚饭毕，因天黑了，尤氏因说：',
    hash='sha256:22d92c1cc605e4101dae3d9784737a4030b98e54e1e2db77646027bef6757f4d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1764',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=246,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=49460,
    end_offset=49476,
    text_slice='“先派两个小子送了这秦相公去。”',
    hash='sha256:ef3a6d9fcad5c35a145ccec920f5223f3ba17eae242e2002948b9cd363fbfd4a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1765',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=246,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=49476,
    end_offset=49493,
    text_slice='媳妇们传出去，半日，秦钟告辞起身。',
    hash='sha256:22ec5b4f8da2f533a5c450a07a83c2444f4aba21ea590a07f3e5ab33173dcbd4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1766',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=246,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=49497,
    end_offset=49505,
    text_slice='“派了谁送去？”',
    hash='sha256:76b9f3bb151eb90b78284058df9e8c70d830f795382d2a7c99470d80e710dc1d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1767',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=246,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=49505,
    end_offset=49511,
    text_slice='媳妇们回说：',
    hash='sha256:9afbccd22dd3eecbfa498671488d1a89f19543f727bd6882655efce430132608'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1768',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=246,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=49511,
    end_offset=49531,
    text_slice='“外头派了焦大，谁知焦大醉了，又骂呢。”',
    hash='sha256:c7a35ae1b7740bb84d65afce31cf1413aefb58760d12e9da2774162f496fd638'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1769',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=246,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=49531,
    end_offset=49540,
    text_slice='尤氏、秦氏都说道：',
    hash='sha256:f4fd8801cf90a27f40eab37eafcfed3cef66b2bacb1162d8f1df702dc31b11d0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1770',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=246,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=49540,
    end_offset=49571,
    text_slice='“偏又派他作什么！放着这些小子们，那一个派不得？偏要惹他去！”',
    hash='sha256:be067db9183aff815a65d4972b1d5679f26f8beec182dbf6fc3ecdfd2774a2cc'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1771',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=246,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=49571,
    end_offset=49575,
    text_slice='凤姐道：',
    hash='sha256:493b74ef604832e715c69f5c0a24d8d4a251e38e82e9ee38006f3f407dd315a5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1772',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=246,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=49575,
    end_offset=49601,
    text_slice='“我成日家说你太软弱了，纵的家里人这样，还了得呢！”',
    hash='sha256:57c9a1b634fa36110d1d331652034afb7dd5bc7c3c659bd09c4f178c5be24602'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1773',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=246,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=49601,
    end_offset=49606,
    text_slice='尤氏叹道：',
    hash='sha256:b744d3329a6bbef8da78269820b6a87698653b04c872bc5a1cd48cdbfe241c1f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1774',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=246,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=49606,
    end_offset=49804,
    text_slice='“你难道不知这焦大的？连老爷都不理他的，你珍大哥哥也不理他。只因他从小儿跟着太爷们出过三四回兵，从死人堆里把太爷背了出来，得了命；自己挨着饿，却偷了东西来给主子吃；两日没得水，得了半碗水，给主子喝，他自己喝马溺。不过仗着这些功劳情分，有祖宗时都另眼相待，如今谁肯难为他去！他自己又老了，又不顾体面，一味的吃酒，一吃醉了，无人不骂。我常说给管事的，不要派他差事，全当一个死的就完了。今儿又派了他！”',
    hash='sha256:2827e73fa7d7545e7712245837c4c4690bdf3d2ec8d97bd592f581dd4a3b0bdc'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1775',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=246,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=49804,
    end_offset=49808,
    text_slice='凤姐道：',
    hash='sha256:493b74ef604832e715c69f5c0a24d8d4a251e38e82e9ee38006f3f407dd315a5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1776',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=246,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=49808,
    end_offset=49847,
    text_slice='“我何曾不知这焦大。倒是你们没主意，有这样，何不打发他远远的庄子上去就完了。”',
    hash='sha256:0356cefcf0a2eb09dac86aa48c457d7136bee611f0f81f6b6a790470f13f1442'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1777',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=246,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=49847,
    end_offset=49853,
    text_slice='说着，因问：',
    hash='sha256:a965ffaf450b6203d8957e70cea9e109af4b22b5d40878013d45f0111108544b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1778',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=246,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=49853,
    end_offset=49864,
    text_slice='“我们的车可齐备了？”',
    hash='sha256:cc0362a8578fafdd90b8fd39f91c5a5dee0a29e8d8b369c18f395e5f4c423d18'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1779',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=246,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=49864,
    end_offset=49871,
    text_slice='地下众人都应：',
    hash='sha256:b08422a739ea48d368165d787046105db29a8f9024a93ffbf1437eddbff6db68'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1780',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=246,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=49871,
    end_offset=49878,
    text_slice='“伺候齐了。”',
    hash='sha256:c3bd0e535ba8596fe5d24579b2932a83eecdee74edd2dc053eed697fce8d7da3'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1781',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=247,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=49880,
    end_offset=49896,
    text_slice='凤姐亦起身告辞，和宝玉携手同行。',
    hash='sha256:d023123f4f93676d3ae23e75e8968f344a639666228183ff1644da124f7d6a95'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1782',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=247,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=49896,
    end_offset=49921,
    text_slice='尤氏等送至大厅，只见灯烛辉煌，众小厮都在丹墀侍立。',
    hash='sha256:7166439c479db196ae0d8e431b8bda65acbef81bb812d2374a354f55baddd09c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1783',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=247,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=49921,
    end_offset=49952,
    text_slice='那焦大又恃贾珍不在家，即在家亦不好怎样，更可以恣意的洒落洒落。',
    hash='sha256:05f92c577cc4ece823d381f842dada25305c456fb6de9e78ff91497e3a79b706'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1784',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=247,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=49952,
    end_offset=50004,
    text_slice='因趁着酒兴，先骂大总管赖二，说他不公道，欺软怕硬，“有了好差事就派别人，像这样黑更半夜送人的事，就派我。',
    hash='sha256:4b6b3a97dc46f9c4f68ba93ea3db9a0459582937d8114e25a95e99fdf733cdf5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1785',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=247,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=50004,
    end_offset=50013,
    text_slice='没良心的王八羔子！',
    hash='sha256:1413178b93052a723b8f6fd4ec4c363a2d2990bc2bbe79c10ffa1e852aca8369'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1786',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=247,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=50013,
    end_offset=50018,
    text_slice='瞎充管家！',
    hash='sha256:cb6482475704a72f946f8ffcbc4216bf1d4f0e8be87ca27ceb18dbb5f441d2c2'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1787',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=247,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=50018,
    end_offset=50042,
    text_slice='你也不想想，焦大太爷跷起一只脚，比你的头还高呢。',
    hash='sha256:8cddbed3b568352a125124e8dc8d0e0ebabef2a3ef0044d8d7b4b81bcf783a6b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1788',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=247,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=50042,
    end_offset=50058,
    text_slice='二十年头里的焦大太爷，眼里有谁？',
    hash='sha256:248c25e9c338799a8f9133109e4c6da98fe6ac74600c5f938e9d1953024f1ae1'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1789',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=247,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=50058,
    end_offset=50074,
    text_slice='别说你们这一把子杂种王八羔子们！',
    hash='sha256:029f5750cea15be310f5754aafb7643febf7a7ef360854238d3f4a63839e0fbe'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1790',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=248,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=50077,
    end_offset=50114,
    text_slice='正骂的兴头上，贾蓉送凤姐的车出去，众人喝他不听，贾蓉忍不得，便骂了他两句：',
    hash='sha256:bcf0d7f51779ca72dd896464c999819c37b2380b2039b7e223807fab4e7d0818'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1791',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=248,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=50114,
    end_offset=50139,
    text_slice='“使人捆起来！等明日醒了酒，问他还寻死不寻死了！”',
    hash='sha256:f2c7a37de8deba2a75a83642154405a44394009a8137574ec517cd025eed77fd'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1792',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=248,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=50139,
    end_offset=50164,
    text_slice='那焦大那里把贾蓉放在眼里，反大叫起来，赶着贾蓉叫：',
    hash='sha256:0aa00b87279d2628199d5ffba53b1e36acca4985693f6ee290661e94700cda3d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1793',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=248,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=50164,
    end_offset=50294,
    text_slice='“蓉哥儿，你别在焦大跟前使主子性儿。别说你这样儿的，就是你爹、你爷爷，也不敢和焦大挺腰子呢！不是焦大一个人，你们做官儿，享荣华，受富贵？你祖宗九死一生挣下这家业，到如今不报我的恩，反和我充起主子来了。不和我说别的还可，若再说别的，咱们白刀子进去，红刀子出来！”',
    hash='sha256:9ccf7d2602a32e967425b78d387261daaa68f89d74c310060706861e6acd5ab3'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1794',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=248,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=50294,
    end_offset=50305,
    text_slice='凤姐在车上说与贾蓉道：',
    hash='sha256:e8f72c8721bf6279e63052df4d0db352fe7f9cc230066a82dbe3372c051291c9'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1795',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=248,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=50305,
    end_offset=50364,
    text_slice='“以后还不早打发了这个没王法的东西！留在这里岂不是祸害？倘或亲友知道了，岂不笑话咱们这样的人家，连个王法规矩都没有？”',
    hash='sha256:73cbaec2cc17442904bbdc871b886a7754b0fba619600c39068ff3a7fae44a1c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1796',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=248,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=50364,
    end_offset=50368,
    text_slice='贾蓉答应',
    hash='sha256:450cced0f9a2f99434ca101b018e5d440e5367292b98f98a04d05b252132c5ea'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1797',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=248,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=50368,
    end_offset=50371,
    text_slice='“是”',
    hash='sha256:090f2ef0ebb5d24d8be084e110276dd49b63d06614f8a3a608a389ef81728909'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1798',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=248,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=50371,
    end_offset=50372,
    text_slice='。',
    hash='sha256:eb0d5884569b398e475b89e77a068c6c575a0064ff6a72fafc173102c4cfcd57'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1799',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=249,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=50374,
    end_offset=50406,
    text_slice='众小厮见他太撒野了不堪了，只得上来几个，揪翻捆倒，拖往马圈里去。',
    hash='sha256:5629299cf633e4f7cba787b54c548576f9d3ac789c59aea4ea5cb2459a885203'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1800',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=249,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=50406,
    end_offset=50451,
    text_slice='焦大越发连贾珍都说出来，乱嚷乱叫说：“我要往祠堂里哭太爷去，那里承望到如今生下这些畜牲来！',
    hash='sha256:a8231d1951fdbe2fc80d736261087c3034dac3ac6aebaa1acbf60e9c61e128df'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1801',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=249,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=50451,
    end_offset=50482,
    text_slice='每日家偷狗戏鸡，爬灰的爬灰，养小叔子的养小叔子，我什么不知道？',
    hash='sha256:56a4eb952295b0f94da5520da950b36221f1cfdfaa10d6b0a57e182a9c0cf948'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1802',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=249,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=50482,
    end_offset=50496,
    text_slice='咱们‘胳膊折了往袖子里藏’！',
    hash='sha256:b6d69f3319db141a579fede0d18c192b680cc584ded5a24f38be5225996b5a36'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1803',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=249,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=50496,
    end_offset=50548,
    text_slice='”众小厮听他说出这些没天日的话来，唬得魂飞魄散，也不顾别的了，便把他捆起来，用土和马粪满满的填了他一嘴。',
    hash='sha256:98fc044cba0a3d11fcfe14d58c5d793d83684b95e20fe1739e927aee74a6b082'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1804',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=250,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=50550,
    end_offset=50571,
    text_slice='凤姐和贾蓉等也遥遥的闻得，便都装作没听见。',
    hash='sha256:d0a7ebea2daaba2ee1fbd0d263033d176534af8e21c7941318698c364f64c6d4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1805',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=250,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=50571,
    end_offset=50587,
    text_slice='宝玉在车上见这般醉闹，倒也有趣。',
    hash='sha256:29eab06ffaf056efb2bdf1df15e20043347e3c735492530a55e2984622d64649'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1806',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=250,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=50593,
    end_offset=50618,
    text_slice='“姐姐，你听他说‘爬灰的爬灰’，什么是‘爬灰’？”',
    hash='sha256:d267be12e436e8a4888f679188d40b7eaca334e6946e965340cece99f80e6ca7'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1807',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=250,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=50618,
    end_offset=50633,
    text_slice='凤姐听了，连忙立眉嗔目断喝道：',
    hash='sha256:144a9a58452f5c8607a3c37d0bf9847968c9df40c8662c86dd9f530530583820'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1808',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=250,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=50633,
    end_offset=50684,
    text_slice='“少胡说！那是醉汉嘴里混厮，你是什么样的人！不说没听见，还倒细问！等我回去回了太太，仔细捶你不捶你！”',
    hash='sha256:2a092aa29c9bbee4140af6f7726c18a56ef6058f662c101028a52152d8a28d62'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1809',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=250,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=50684,
    end_offset=50693,
    text_slice='唬的宝玉忙央告道：',
    hash='sha256:3a7816b7e9dbf7f046aa11ff9353aec3d0cf76a040fe96cf6d67a16b9a8d6f9b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1810',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=250,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=50693,
    end_offset=50708,
    text_slice='“好姐姐，我再不敢说这话了！”',
    hash='sha256:b1d06f096d9f3cc8886cfeb08d732cdec740d95062ea1141fa3be879db2ae5cc'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1811',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=250,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=50708,
    end_offset=50717,
    text_slice='凤姐亦忙回色哄道：',
    hash='sha256:b9f796a4bdcaa12d3c43f5aedebf5eacb35a93b5e86fd9005abfcba1b655e534'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1812',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=250,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=50717,
    end_offset=50760,
    text_slice='“好兄弟这才是呢。等回去咱们回了老太太，打发人往家里说明白了，请了秦钟家念书去要紧。”',
    hash='sha256:292076f88cd30e6c132d5952f2b01aa532259118af1f062a818c566f901ed4f6'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1813',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=250,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=50760,
    end_offset=50772,
    text_slice='说着，却自回往荣府而来。',
    hash='sha256:a355074613f47f897bb5d625761ff3a569831a495013389c3ac498305efac2ed'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1814',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=251,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=50777,
    end_offset=50793,
    text_slice='不因俊俏难为友，正为风流始读书。',
    hash='sha256:57fe1252cfa971ce9ea988964a92c357dffba08db6b6d4c1c0d3768d936e5c83'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1815',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=252,
    segment_type='heading',
    start_offset=50795,
    end_offset=50817,
    text_slice='第八回  薛宝钗小恙梨香院\u3000贾宝玉大醉绛芸轩',
    hash='sha256:d72410dc5aa31752830386687d32b2adc296003093ce5184fc468bb8f0b60043'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1816',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=253,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=50819,
    end_offset=50838,
    text_slice='题曰：古鼎新烹风髓香，那堪翠斝贮琼浆。',
    hash='sha256:c6f53bbef8f5b7f8448c23472ab6a4b7d12d666e332234f5b56a8162a83761b9'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1817',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=253,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=50838,
    end_offset=50845,
    text_slice='莫言绮縠无风?',
    hash='sha256:64be276dc352e3a5dedd69c3a54f7d3482432ac0800997169ebb98d4bc860f1d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1818',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=253,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=50845,
    end_offset=50854,
    text_slice='，试看金娃对玉郎。',
    hash='sha256:7abe0cfeff927ca2b4bc6b861acce88b5a296988c6e710deea74929e9b7a7b27'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1819',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=254,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=50856,
    end_offset=50871,
    text_slice='话说凤姐和宝玉回家，见过众人。',
    hash='sha256:c4c7c8654b347c488eb39c53c516e768ea619f680fa827b8a4fa44d186a8da4b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1820',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=254,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=50871,
    end_offset=50925,
    text_slice='宝玉先便回明贾母秦钟要上家塾之事，自己也有了个伴读的朋友，正好发奋；又着实的称赞秦钟的人品行事，最使人怜爱。',
    hash='sha256:5fa834d66b7f27e95b6699bfbe2d54e0ef98757ca848edb472f21e2a8848ed37'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1821',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=254,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=50925,
    end_offset=50957,
    text_slice='凤姐又在一旁帮着说“过日他还来拜老祖宗”等语，说得贾母喜悦起来。',
    hash='sha256:528de6779b37a1bf630cae9dfe7534b20e0e84526172a8968b13e7a12454293d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1822',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=254,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=50957,
    end_offset=50972,
    text_slice='凤姐又趁势请贾母后日过去看戏。',
    hash='sha256:c06a46ca370cdc82a9e4d8c05503e100ad3e04f21ab8f57c2652f691b52952c3'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1823',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=254,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=50972,
    end_offset=50984,
    text_slice='贾母虽年意，却极有兴头。',
    hash='sha256:9108c26581497966ca2be0ffb2778bae5df6eb20f4f07e209b8b57ae81862bba'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1824',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=254,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=50984,
    end_offset=51014,
    text_slice='至后日，又有尤氏来请，遂携了王夫人、林黛玉、宝玉等过去看戏。',
    hash='sha256:c1c19c3d336d1be88fbc60de4d25361bdd8e68312a13893dd1df7d656fbedffe'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1825',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=254,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=51014,
    end_offset=51027,
    text_slice='至晌午，贾母便回来歇息了。',
    hash='sha256:b57004137cbf51827376a925cd3612c2844802f21713f771e28f6c21f64802e8'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1826',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=254,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=51027,
    end_offset=51049,
    text_slice='王夫人本是好清净的，见贾母回来，也就回来了。',
    hash='sha256:682cbb56bfbb422d2f6fccffeb2e09c8ae5aa4766f47433adb82c91aeb62c9e4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1827',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=254,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=51049,
    end_offset=51065,
    text_slice='然后凤姐坐了首席，尽欢至晚无话。',
    hash='sha256:32acd218a62a1263715a5792877e383f40140545daeef0db306bfac04b678510'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1828',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=255,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=51067,
    end_offset=51132,
    text_slice='却说宝玉因送贾母回来，待贾母歇了中觉，意欲还去看戏取乐，又恐扰得秦氏等人不便，因想起近日薛宝钗在家养病，未去亲候，意欲去望她一望。',
    hash='sha256:cd9c867424f083807ad88f8f39d86ea58b1040f2b3bb88c8d6218bb6b01067d0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1829',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=255,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=51132,
    end_offset=51174,
    text_slice='若从上房后角门过去，又恐遇见别事缠绕，再或可巧遇见他父亲，更为不妥，宁可绕远路罢了。',
    hash='sha256:fe502d2b6aa768f28205427490216c46a0b418c7b44a8e3744172849bfd35a09'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1830',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=255,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=51174,
    end_offset=51224,
    text_slice='当下众嬷嬷丫鬟伺候他换衣服，见他不换，仍出二门去了，众嬷嬷、丫鬟只得跟随出来，还只当他去那府中看戏。',
    hash='sha256:79141fba5b3f7bfdc047302bbee498af111b1d8738aac9044714e10de18cbfcf'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1831',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=255,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=51224,
    end_offset=51242,
    text_slice='谁知到了穿堂，便向东向北绕厅后而去。',
    hash='sha256:43c9406471b71b76a9e5613c578688a7bc652decd23da80eb28141006be28309'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1832',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=255,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=51242,
    end_offset=51265,
    text_slice='偏顶头遇见了门下清客相公詹光、单聘仁二人走来。',
    hash='sha256:85705e237a55b32afb44b56d975e08c9b0226aca8d9208a165fc66ed3a5751d0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1833',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=255,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=51294,
    end_offset=51320,
    text_slice='“我的菩萨哥儿！我说作了好梦呢，好容易得遇见了你。”',
    hash='sha256:27bb01700cf13842532d25b9eae279108b1f7f8fa7a6db097a007aee384987b6'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1834',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=255,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=51320,
    end_offset=51341,
    text_slice='说着，请了安，又问好，唠叨半日，方才走开。',
    hash='sha256:5bbdffa5de476f84c2a8c5a6daedb9378ccbbac817c19b4a6b507d2005f12347'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1835',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=255,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=51350,
    end_offset=51367,
    text_slice='“你二位爷是从老爷跟前来的不是？”',
    hash='sha256:cd28859e2c224f2941eb81120f8abd85d93164b352d6fae2d547205b1f7b5250'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1836',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=255,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=51367,
    end_offset=51374,
    text_slice='他二人点头道：',
    hash='sha256:8fba677b5c30dbdb1a7bf0c070ce9befc25c1520aa0d78efeddab3b4f1696ac8'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1837',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=255,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=51374,
    end_offset=51396,
    text_slice='“老爷在梦坡斋小书房里歇中觉呢，不妨事的。”',
    hash='sha256:3aedd33b3a8995165075a47b5a70d5c934727857d7f00dd742d0502ba1ed4d79'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1838',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=255,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=51396,
    end_offset=51405,
    text_slice='一面说，一面走了。',
    hash='sha256:daf9d828b3427140a030b5525644e6854c760baa0614f45d86369501819860dc'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1839',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=255,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=51405,
    end_offset=51413,
    text_slice='说得宝玉也笑了。',
    hash='sha256:d8dce21fb8cfd5003f3bbb1153ce1b70b599e10fb73c598a0891c42d505b036e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1840',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=255,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=51413,
    end_offset=51425,
    text_slice='于是转弯向北奔梨香院来。',
    hash='sha256:2c3a9aaece0baf45de8b8ee1d80ea5f9aeaf561f60563d2fcdf4931142373925'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1841',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=255,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=51425,
    end_offset=51487,
    text_slice='可巧银库房的总领名唤吴新登与仓上的头目名戴良，还有几个管事的头目，共有七个人，从帐房里出来，一见了宝玉，赶来都一齐垂手站住。',
    hash='sha256:fa2ae734cf9617eb375b2773a5ab487ca86be85435415ca686d9ed552732be10'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1842',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=255,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=51487,
    end_offset=51517,
    text_slice='独有一个买办名唤钱华的，因他多日未见宝玉，忙上来打千儿请安。',
    hash='sha256:59f674ed5f47e161d7a246264a910207d8ced3c4f1e8a3410be2e82a654753c5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1843',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=255,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=51517,
    end_offset=51527,
    text_slice='宝玉忙含笑携他起来。',
    hash='sha256:bac0a54e4438b56124b8cb83b1832974bd5c995c02e5ab659f2339c729a16456'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1844',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=255,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=51533,
    end_offset=51568,
    text_slice='“前儿在一处看见二爷写的斗方，字法越发好了，多早晚儿赏我们几张贴贴？”',
    hash='sha256:4ab4f7a6c55fdba7e1ee4f57184f5f61444ad35db1ff0d3bc03b48d7be53c6d0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1845',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=255,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=51568,
    end_offset=51573,
    text_slice='宝玉笑道：',
    hash='sha256:4010737831077115327a930fc031b5caa442f6aca950d1b4be97c2a32a759b5c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1846',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=255,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=51573,
    end_offset=51582,
    text_slice='“在那里看见了？”',
    hash='sha256:a1965a6e4c96fbcc1d0afcd66e8f92fd822900d9af5b0fb052750935cc044cd5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1847',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=255,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=51582,
    end_offset=51586,
    text_slice='众人道：',
    hash='sha256:9b7cfd35ec4e9995a55f0eb346ea28e5b8f08093983501e273ddcf11c98f91e8'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1848',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=255,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=51586,
    end_offset=51609,
    text_slice='“好几处都有，都称赞得了不得，还和我们寻呢。”',
    hash='sha256:911e4663b074726505ff2620486cf405373fac9314391f9b84fc686c4558fab2'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1849',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=255,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=51609,
    end_offset=51614,
    text_slice='宝玉笑道：',
    hash='sha256:4010737831077115327a930fc031b5caa442f6aca950d1b4be97c2a32a759b5c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1850',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=255,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=51614,
    end_offset=51635,
    text_slice='“不值什么，你们说与我的小幺儿们就是了。”',
    hash='sha256:2490c99a7f529c48d4a3fc95ee20ed2bfd93012fce87517638221e1e7f36198d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1851',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=255,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=51635,
    end_offset=51658,
    text_slice='一面说，一面前走，众人待他过去，方都各自散了。',
    hash='sha256:af2761b95144aa9c3f609e0c1131736153fb0754426a6e5a12e90ad63afc6cd0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1852',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=256,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=51660,
    end_offset=51700,
    text_slice='闲言少述，且说宝玉来至梨香院中，先入薛姨妈室中来，正见薛姨妈打点针黹与丫鬟们呢。',
    hash='sha256:254022f501e754d9b2552329f66fbeffd393fe60ba9db6cd81df2e434a897fbd'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1853',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=256,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=51725,
    end_offset=51751,
    text_slice='“这么冷天，我的儿，难为你想着我，快上炕来坐着罢！”',
    hash='sha256:791de1ccec986676068e2916066f3f5bed9c0c7383ad61b04f262d9f4396a74f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1854',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=256,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=51751,
    end_offset=51760,
    text_slice='命人倒滚滚的茶来。',
    hash='sha256:0c2f3a9c96b9922d7c6643b237926c0e016051d4559d13f9811d1a50ecdd216d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1855',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=256,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=51765,
    end_offset=51773,
    text_slice='“哥哥不在家？”',
    hash='sha256:9cbad088a66b9fc1a9817cb860338f42ba3ac1d004797267c873206a6c419ec1'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1856',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=256,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=51773,
    end_offset=51779,
    text_slice='薛姨妈叹道：',
    hash='sha256:7aef53ca53c8d71850c4c4c6f7dd1f5b74daf24e93576edaf71f2422825ab912'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1857',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=256,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=51779,
    end_offset=51803,
    text_slice='“他是没笼头的马，天天逛不了，那里肯在家一日！”',
    hash='sha256:cf5660cc28c65aa3d08116da705a246fa558b10ba8642441d4e773b2bc5d0179'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1858',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=256,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=51803,
    end_offset=51807,
    text_slice='宝玉道：',
    hash='sha256:10c9e1a43f0e2e5bf2e54f50fb3dbede512eb436326aec72d14625e62153e9b0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1859',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=256,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=51807,
    end_offset=51816,
    text_slice='“姊姊可大安了？”',
    hash='sha256:6843b35fdc9fdd5c06f5f8d357c7ce86839ec0b6fc50e75a8f8b906d24e8ff5c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1860',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=256,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=51816,
    end_offset=51821,
    text_slice='薛姨妈道：',
    hash='sha256:1e34a5a016872005262442da3f56e3cfae7859188058d7a45050b9ea6e3c1a5a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1861',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=256,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=51821,
    end_offset=51879,
    text_slice='“可是呢，你前儿又想着打发人来瞧她。她在里间不是，你去瞧她！里间比这里暖和，那里坐着，我收拾收拾就进去和你说话儿。”',
    hash='sha256:0f5bf826463b2a1729cca2726bc07745267b1f78a8b60113d0a9807aeb969e5b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1862',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=256,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=51879,
    end_offset=51908,
    text_slice='宝玉听说，忙下了炕，来至里间门前，只见吊着半旧的红紬软帘。',
    hash='sha256:65cf97b5410912188d675bf2b412f89f90873e607a37cb04076bc7264fc3d3dc'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1863',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=256,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=51908,
    end_offset=51992,
    text_slice='宝玉掀帘一迈步进去，先就看见薛宝钗坐在炕上做针线，头上挽着漆黑油光的簪(原字为上髟下赞)儿，蜜合色棉袄，玫瑰紫二色金银鼠比肩褂，葱黄绫棉裙，一色半新不旧，看去不觉奢华。',
    hash='sha256:daa53f6f8a8e22bc52a233087acd1c7be5cd2b3b97adbd40818529449b4a9e89'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1864',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=256,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=51992,
    end_offset=52014,
    text_slice='唇不点而红，眉不画而翠；脸若银盆，眼如水杏。',
    hash='sha256:aa18a4fefdd8207fa98a39e37b27e8bf3e1fb6621ae5e8e30a1c528bc9c2c8af'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1865',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=256,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=52014,
    end_offset=52034,
    text_slice='罕言寡语，人谓藏愚；安分随时，自云守拙。',
    hash='sha256:650e8408f411c1cdd215a8377a4d147b4bb122f53a80333eccfa028f19d213a6'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1866',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=256,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=52045,
    end_offset=52054,
    text_slice='“姐姐可大愈了？”',
    hash='sha256:e55326fd48a1a70268faceaeb7758d539413dc1dbd7fad6620f31178cb1f2a1d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1867',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=256,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=52054,
    end_offset=52075,
    text_slice='宝钗抬头，只见宝玉进来，连忙起身含笑答说：',
    hash='sha256:aabb2011eb5ccdded03da5eed28deaf03d4e578fb29ce3e2ea4501538073256f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1868',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=256,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=52075,
    end_offset=52090,
    text_slice='“已经大好了，倒多谢记挂着！”',
    hash='sha256:d4053ac0ce9f633aaf823df405bea971386b426dee4a55fd713c8dee41178ce4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1869',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=256,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=52090,
    end_offset=52110,
    text_slice='说着，让他在炕沿上坐了，即命莺儿斟茶来。',
    hash='sha256:33f29ecced67b94ed1f65e872f30fb6641a6759e1324797e669c50baf7ecd60e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1870',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=256,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=52110,
    end_offset=52210,
    text_slice='一面又问老太太、姨娘安，别的姊妹们都好；一面看宝玉头上戴着累丝嵌宝紫金冠，额上勒着二龙抢珠金抹额，身上穿著秋香色立蟒白狐腋箭袖，系着五色蝴蝶鸾绦，项上挂着长命锁、记名符，另外有一块落草时衔下来的宝玉。',
    hash='sha256:c1261570298be8d26cbf54eb3f0cef2095369d75168ca769808e97684a11025f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1871',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=256,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=52217,
    end_offset=52246,
    text_slice='“成日家说你的这玉，究竟未曾细细的赏鉴，我今儿倒要瞧瞧。”',
    hash='sha256:bc839d6e7d12cf29863342c3be5928dec699079462f8600f60a797a9929110bb'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1872',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=256,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=52246,
    end_offset=52254,
    text_slice='说着便挪近前来。',
    hash='sha256:59d25bc320ccf2d7661b2d51c37257a3c2d4fda9abc050f785b834f5351d61b8'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1873',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=256,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=52254,
    end_offset=52277,
    text_slice='宝玉亦凑了上去，从项上摘了下来，递在宝钗手内。',
    hash='sha256:8431df08eb99b0a717796e2733249f119cfe33b03504be29626a7709d1cc8a90'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1874',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=256,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=52277,
    end_offset=52308,
    text_slice='宝钗托于掌上，只见大如雀卵，灿若明霞，莹润如酥，五色花纹缠护。',
    hash='sha256:e43813b7ac88bc32dc3f0da7a775653e85ac9e17328e056e0b47aa85329a487d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1875',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=256,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=52308,
    end_offset=52328,
    text_slice='这就是大荒山中青埂峰下的那块顽石的幻相。',
    hash='sha256:9879cd128dc87d1dccbe364dae8f4a09aa3e4c09428c79d01f4d44f951ef6fe1'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1876',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=257,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=52338,
    end_offset=52354,
    text_slice='女娲炼石已荒唐，又向荒唐演大荒。',
    hash='sha256:2a722fbc81f3f8c30fcbbcbd3344bc06c8aeebae58876e673ba8df181128749d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1877',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=257,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=52354,
    end_offset=52370,
    text_slice='失去幽灵真境界，幻来亲就臭皮囊。',
    hash='sha256:bb573f0780741ee9b875d30c2e13cffbe714f7865060ec94f0422f9953a44324'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1878',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=257,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=52370,
    end_offset=52386,
    text_slice='好知运败金无彩，堪叹时乖玉不光。',
    hash='sha256:a5daf563970c5578e0c79c978407b703906546017fa6d9af0531d01096bbd833'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1879',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=257,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=52386,
    end_offset=52402,
    text_slice='白骨如山忘姓氏，无非公子与红妆。',
    hash='sha256:29ea96650cf1f98e80887d6808b29e6ff2cdb337a71bfe70916e21e5af5fd8dd'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1880',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=258,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=52404,
    end_offset=52432,
    text_slice='那顽石亦曾记下他这幻相并癞僧所镌的篆文，今亦按图画于后。',
    hash='sha256:12be733dbd7463fb210d4650b05471d2cd06c2d892444c8d69e2f64fd1f4267a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1881',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=258,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=52432,
    end_offset=52451,
    text_slice='但其真体最小，方能从胎中小儿口内衔下。',
    hash='sha256:e22d639555dc96ca1c5f193fc2c358c8a28855b12fc345c6316ba84be624fab6'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1882',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=258,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=52451,
    end_offset=52479,
    text_slice='今若按其体画，恐字迹过于微细，使观者大费眼光，亦非畅事。',
    hash='sha256:c551fdff0579f156f039c7846c4e2b247a27cb8b099ea21dfd5102e5c1729545'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1883',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=258,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=52479,
    end_offset=52508,
    text_slice='故今只按其形式，无非略放展些规矩，使观者便于灯下醉中可阅。',
    hash='sha256:9358d88b831b66a626d8e94a23f3cd1acba832447937878b6a7f9ea5e6e9cf90'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1884',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=258,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=52508,
    end_offset=52540,
    text_slice='今注明此故，方无胎中之儿口有多大，怎得衔此狼犺蠢大之物等语之谤。',
    hash='sha256:9ac8b36cde4bd15e301ee14e95896de06dc020d67b00f214afb5ab3e7be00a04'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1885',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=259,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=52542,
    end_offset=52565,
    text_slice='通灵宝玉正面图式通\u3000灵\u3000宝\u3000玉莫失莫忘仙寿恒昌',
    hash='sha256:ebb1f2084bece39305473c90083a243d1d8bfd0af3a5424ea3c88dbbea1233d1'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1886',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=260,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=52567,
    end_offset=52587,
    text_slice='通灵宝玉反面图式一除邪祟二疗冤疾三知祸福',
    hash='sha256:46f1acf4a151a6d5c63691b78760b65cad0a19ac10646ed6746ad0387e6e280f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1887',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=261,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=52589,
    end_offset=52610,
    text_slice='宝钗看毕，又从新翻过正面来细看，口内念道：',
    hash='sha256:4cee2a4a422be244fed2321d5b87150d48c9983375d9a265a86f51df7d0475ce'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1888',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=261,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=52610,
    end_offset=52622,
    text_slice='“莫失莫忘，仙寿恒昌。”',
    hash='sha256:9de2d3783d89a25f95ced2f76af6574f17753520b4bc478b1ff3855ed5b40183'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1889',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=261,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=52622,
    end_offset=52636,
    text_slice='念了两遍，乃回头向莺儿笑道：',
    hash='sha256:292a4753f079fc8dbeb97fa9bc31f9f5d0cbad629a4d2dc1b0b8962bc1e1cb91'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1890',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=261,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=52636,
    end_offset=52654,
    text_slice='“你不去倒茶，也在这里发呆作什么？”',
    hash='sha256:299b3a2a9a24834869b1bd218ac16d838526ee129bd31e14e5422f55de252a7d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1891',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=261,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=52654,
    end_offset=52661,
    text_slice='莺儿嘻嘻笑道：',
    hash='sha256:e7b022fa91165de3cef4989468707901b80fb83fe089a427a7a0972fa765ad20'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1892',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=261,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=52661,
    end_offset=52688,
    text_slice='“我听这两句话，倒像和姑娘的项圈上的两句话是一对儿。”',
    hash='sha256:a5a6422688c68c21128edcb87c27ecd4ba3d398f8fe74669fd69c07f2dbe5e9e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1893',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=261,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=52688,
    end_offset=52698,
    text_slice='宝玉听了，忙笑说道：',
    hash='sha256:68317bf27b942d1f803b1cb303d001d511e9b51d8493b3ef0d29530d0166d662'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1894',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=261,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=52698,
    end_offset=52721,
    text_slice='“原来姊姐那项圈上也有八个字，我也赏鉴赏鉴。”',
    hash='sha256:3bc58c91cf2563cff5313d2a9b164c9c56966c35d6bbecf79ad1bf08b756f95a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1895',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=261,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=52721,
    end_offset=52725,
    text_slice='宝钗道：',
    hash='sha256:87f70241fca15c6e0d2d9d5113e2d33a81b798ae7d0090db564b501fa57e8bc4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1896',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=261,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=52725,
    end_offset=52740,
    text_slice='“你别听他的话，没有什么字。”',
    hash='sha256:a23abf5a474f96d5faa03165c419fb5eeba2203c01ae3359f55fe9851dec15a4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1897',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=261,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=52740,
    end_offset=52745,
    text_slice='宝玉笑央：',
    hash='sha256:a7a16b9136d0bc4e46996da453077c6872640424e00ff2748a6207f5ba752fb2'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1898',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=261,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=52745,
    end_offset=52760,
    text_slice='“好姐姐，你怎么瞧我的了呢！”',
    hash='sha256:bba2eb6103b080e4b2aa87a235d5e88c822e4a303aae31da3f9bb92b26c3d781'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1899',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=261,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=52760,
    end_offset=52772,
    text_slice='宝钗被他缠不过，因说道：',
    hash='sha256:943aaf94d8f38db3a12e34cbcabe80af7de7d699ef04bdbaa5103e34f2021231'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1900',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=261,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=52772,
    end_offset=52812,
    text_slice='“也是个人给了两句吉利话儿，所以錾上了，叫天天带着；不然，沉甸甸的有什么趣儿！”',
    hash='sha256:fcc1d5856fe152e9e257fbd4a7abb352d913bd7d46cbcd1705dab5e0b9106719'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1901',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=261,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=52812,
    end_offset=52849,
    text_slice='一面说，一面解了排扣，从里面大红袄上将那珠宝晶莹、黄金灿烂的璎珞掏将出来。',
    hash='sha256:364bc8046d3d90dee1e5db419ba34952c0a33c64781971106b7775bb7088aea9'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1902',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=261,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=52849,
    end_offset=52880,
    text_slice='宝玉忙托了锁看时，果然一面有四个篆字，两面八字，共成两句吉谶。',
    hash='sha256:11baaa65886f4d7ce4c9680b72114f4dad2d45bdf17288c2060e648bf943c117'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1903',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=262,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=52891,
    end_offset=52899,
    text_slice='不离不弃芳龄永继',
    hash='sha256:dbd5c70afae8783646e6bfd55ff97e986a58bade87b89196fa4a4ab6d6943c99'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1904',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=263,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=52901,
    end_offset=52924,
    text_slice='宝玉看了，也念了两遍，又念自己的两遍，因笑问：',
    hash='sha256:1a2967e64a47e80878353d07a742448ce2965dae5fd2a968fc02d0a9a994b298'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1905',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=263,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=52924,
    end_offset=52942,
    text_slice='“姐姐，这八个字倒真与我的是一对。”',
    hash='sha256:44c5fefaa43748a83053b21d8959871473f02a66687ce24d4a4981babef5a827'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1906',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=263,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=52942,
    end_offset=52947,
    text_slice='莺儿笑道：',
    hash='sha256:aceb95f1328ee119b6228178adcc544cbda91151ff7293b7d81e6f529fe87f79'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1907',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=263,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=52947,
    end_offset=52973,
    text_slice='“是个癞头和尚送的，他说必须錾在金器上......”',
    hash='sha256:82f4b3174c8f92416820ee7649c7b8659e1b95954f4aa8fc974c1706e7257ba6'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1908',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=263,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=52973,
    end_offset=52999,
    text_slice='宝钗不待说完，便嗔她不去倒茶，一面又问宝玉从那里来。',
    hash='sha256:80b21eb7211d78716579a548cc17aa1d4245cb678b7e8430d4e545970dc0f9d3'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1909',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=264,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=53001,
    end_offset=53038,
    text_slice='宝玉此时与宝钗就近，只闻一阵阵凉森森、甜丝丝的幽香，竟不知系何香气，遂问：',
    hash='sha256:1fdf3ab18ea702c2b4b499803ab1fff1b7b4319875445a87f4df9202d5c1b00a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1910',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=264,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=53038,
    end_offset=53060,
    text_slice='“姐姐熏的是什么香？我竟从未闻见过这味儿。”',
    hash='sha256:9a0875d15a9171968087c91b30d990c86c64f384422dc01dadfafb15ffaf5ad5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1911',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=264,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=53060,
    end_offset=53065,
    text_slice='宝钗笑道：',
    hash='sha256:e9823d24e989c8a2053f21ebbe7a66997af9188b1a00acfb93665bf7c308c576'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1912',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=264,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=53065,
    end_offset=53087,
    text_slice='“我最怕熏香，好好的衣服，熏得烟燎火气的！”',
    hash='sha256:92d0da8ea5d243bfea6a69eca882ba5677c8a030a584cece2f08e51ce9e70ba2'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1913',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=264,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=53087,
    end_offset=53091,
    text_slice='宝玉道：',
    hash='sha256:10c9e1a43f0e2e5bf2e54f50fb3dbede512eb436326aec72d14625e62153e9b0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1914',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=264,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=53091,
    end_offset=53103,
    text_slice='“既如此，这是什么香？”',
    hash='sha256:cdbdc09d3c028a80ac8f8b7d2542208c3318d3691f4bd00df23c9c39e2f46e92'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1915',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=264,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=53103,
    end_offset=53113,
    text_slice='宝钗想了一想，笑道：',
    hash='sha256:117309013b49511270bd459d24f93d499c6431dcdff7de5ab118c9c1e40ae555'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1916',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=264,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=53113,
    end_offset=53130,
    text_slice='“是了，是我早起吃了丸药的香气。”',
    hash='sha256:fdbb30c7c6f8090c3a1a22963798c9b7d4376ac234719e9005bb886c04025244'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1917',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=264,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=53130,
    end_offset=53135,
    text_slice='宝玉笑道：',
    hash='sha256:4010737831077115327a930fc031b5caa442f6aca950d1b4be97c2a32a759b5c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1918',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=264,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=53135,
    end_offset=53157,
    text_slice='“什么丸药这么好闻？好姐姐，给我一丸尝尝！”',
    hash='sha256:392e14fa453a88e8d9954687d1eebdaee6b3b9dce3c8c6c34a80ad9c84c3bf7a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1919',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=264,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=53157,
    end_offset=53162,
    text_slice='宝钗笑道：',
    hash='sha256:e9823d24e989c8a2053f21ebbe7a66997af9188b1a00acfb93665bf7c308c576'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1920',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=264,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=53162,
    end_offset=53178,
    text_slice='“又混闹了，一个药也是混吃的？”',
    hash='sha256:80088789beafffd2d9f846adc59c8861a8c6919a339d4fa90067e573857ae00d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1921',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=265,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=53180,
    end_offset=53192,
    text_slice='一语未了，忽听外面人说：',
    hash='sha256:4123d264e060d81c0817f6983767ce60f7f373d553927cbc368e4dbcfc9aa6b2'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1922',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=265,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=53192,
    end_offset=53200,
    text_slice='“林姑娘来了。”',
    hash='sha256:9a6a6e58eac7b84b6e1094463bcce23ea01864e22153a27bf83e65b3616369d0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1923',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=265,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=53200,
    end_offset=53217,
    text_slice='话犹未了，林黛玉已摇摇的走了进来。',
    hash='sha256:74ad2f792a750aef6b0eeacce681cc675c3c02964526193c279cda4bd7c1ef02'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1924',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=265,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=53227,
    end_offset=53239,
    text_slice='“嗳哟，我来的不巧了！”',
    hash='sha256:59ca4642eaa5cf661b9a060d87bf7d552dec7b9c2e5cb72dc5fd14b1fe08b047'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1925',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=265,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=53239,
    end_offset=53249,
    text_slice='宝玉等忙起身笑让坐。',
    hash='sha256:67c481fc80a6341ac901652b6fc23d5d26c2680c2b7f0fc63887d8918b60376d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1926',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=265,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=53255,
    end_offset=53263,
    text_slice='“这话怎么说？”',
    hash='sha256:a062e808c52db1b65b69b8c2cc1ff44579716269aa2c9f368aa451cb4b0679e1'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1927',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=265,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=53263,
    end_offset=53268,
    text_slice='黛玉笑道：',
    hash='sha256:262b8d2fa54e1920c87a964440cd3c9ca8fc3cbe0d1b21b7af07946e9ef0fbfc'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1928',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=265,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=53268,
    end_offset=53281,
    text_slice='“早知他来，我就不来了。”',
    hash='sha256:97853047c0658d4c4295209a70e5a92b71778bcef2cecd46ef2ccaf062878d21'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1929',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=265,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=53281,
    end_offset=53285,
    text_slice='宝钗道：',
    hash='sha256:87f70241fca15c6e0d2d9d5113e2d33a81b798ae7d0090db564b501fa57e8bc4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1930',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=265,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=53285,
    end_offset=53294,
    text_slice='“我更不解这意。”',
    hash='sha256:97da59078c094831c75e3c2c28865a27b3580e9561933477b8613421b044fdb5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1931',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=265,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=53294,
    end_offset=53299,
    text_slice='黛玉笑道：',
    hash='sha256:262b8d2fa54e1920c87a964440cd3c9ca8fc3cbe0d1b21b7af07946e9ef0fbfc'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1932',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=265,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=53299,
    end_offset=53376,
    text_slice='“要来时一群都来，要不来一个也不来；今儿他来了，明儿我再来，如此间错开了来着，岂不天天有人来了？也不至于太冷落，也不至于太热闹了。姐姐如何反不解这意思？”',
    hash='sha256:1fe0ec3b17d8f7eef997a8372baba0219ba358c8056572e68823e07eb76d924f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1933',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=266,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=53378,
    end_offset=53399,
    text_slice='宝玉因见她外面罩着大红羽缎对衿褂子，因问：',
    hash='sha256:3867d1f5bce21cd71959c5045cb2253fc5e1d9193931daa5225ad193e4dd5a3c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1934',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=266,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=53399,
    end_offset=53406,
    text_slice='“下雪了么？”',
    hash='sha256:8c3fad5adc89114b9ef2c7b96b337c1ad321155e5b4137245dd54c7e54a7f0f2'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1935',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=266,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=53406,
    end_offset=53413,
    text_slice='地下婆娘们道：',
    hash='sha256:4fa9830573ca4e7e559f24f45ac080125438819711e16ede89048f0b14df9c9e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1936',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=266,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=53413,
    end_offset=53425,
    text_slice='“下了这半日雪珠儿了。”',
    hash='sha256:26b94a28bc41f9bff86b87d718568418cc9dee0fd021873f61cfd5d807f06d32'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1937',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=266,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=53425,
    end_offset=53429,
    text_slice='宝玉道：',
    hash='sha256:10c9e1a43f0e2e5bf2e54f50fb3dbede512eb436326aec72d14625e62153e9b0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1938',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=266,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=53429,
    end_offset=53441,
    text_slice='“取了我的斗篷来不曾？”',
    hash='sha256:9858c1ab23d80e8661e146e693b8b4fdaadbb92d09abf5b0a779d4632118ba7e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1939',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=266,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=53441,
    end_offset=53446,
    text_slice='黛玉便道：',
    hash='sha256:0236de751be4e5a0b38d35c15426ae6054774268de6b77fd4214ea58d0d26e11'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1940',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=266,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=53446,
    end_offset=53462,
    text_slice='“是不是？我来了，她就该去了？”',
    hash='sha256:0c35f9ee84a259fda08654c4fc3319183fa4264462fb814a1e9931d81b9ba103'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1941',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=266,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=53462,
    end_offset=53467,
    text_slice='宝玉笑道：',
    hash='sha256:4010737831077115327a930fc031b5caa442f6aca950d1b4be97c2a32a759b5c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1942',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=266,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=53467,
    end_offset=53487,
    text_slice='“我多早晚说要去了？不过是拿来预备着。”',
    hash='sha256:18090c85f6a47252a43800ebb090e141eede76412a3108ba0d786e0b1a0e8d6b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1943',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=266,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=53487,
    end_offset=53499,
    text_slice='宝玉的奶母李嬷嬷因说道：',
    hash='sha256:c2ba926e671f579a0f811b99d31da85a3dc2e83a9c50a2b8491f49fac4ce003d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1944',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=266,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=53499,
    end_offset=53559,
    text_slice='“天又下雪，也好早晚的了，就在这里同姐姐妹妹一处玩玩罢。姨妈那里摆茶果子呢。我叫丫头去取了斗篷来，说给小幺儿们散了罢。”',
    hash='sha256:57a230132aa7dacc3049f383cb61010af55d5f4c324416da4aee204d2d7f7414'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1945',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=266,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=53559,
    end_offset=53564,
    text_slice='宝玉应允。',
    hash='sha256:d9f4be4901e694d99af6ff1fe8db1d3601f4383e5ea159686fe67d0d75889450'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1946',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=266,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=53564,
    end_offset=53581,
    text_slice='李嬷嬷出去，命小厮们都各散去不提。',
    hash='sha256:a6ab9012e9f06980b442b4a18933ed9e9d507ccb64117296e2419a1a3c394ea6'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1947',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=267,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=53583,
    end_offset=53604,
    text_slice='这里薛姨妈已摆了几样细巧茶果，留他们吃茶。',
    hash='sha256:d588f0909e5aef0d929108351c2e0dfe20794aaf7c08a78d25480c88913aafe6'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1948',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=267,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=53604,
    end_offset=53626,
    text_slice='宝玉因夸前日在那府里珍大嫂子的好鹅掌、鸭信。',
    hash='sha256:3b8f54c4ab2f6bed6db8f38e0e3907d26a91ea6bfbd517fb276f8628c1a00841'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1949',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=267,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=53626,
    end_offset=53647,
    text_slice='薛姨妈听了，忙也把自己糟的取了些来与他尝。',
    hash='sha256:e650724c695fd1e0c0d2e29ec9c4216b22fed358afe61363af1b05850af459c7'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1950',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=267,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=53652,
    end_offset=53663,
    text_slice='“这个须得就酒才好。”',
    hash='sha256:07455c50dab2a564608ba686c315b67c672b94d7b67a01143940594233bf981c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1951',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=267,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=53663,
    end_offset=53679,
    text_slice='薛姨妈便命人去灌了些上等的酒来。',
    hash='sha256:9161e14274efc11954ce1fb197afbd49f6cdfa806907bb14d1e9c6b8ba64bd74'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1952',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=267,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=53687,
    end_offset=53698,
    text_slice='“姨太太，酒倒罢了。”',
    hash='sha256:b82055a65db80b8ca9ab2187d9612a45c8c33f2b924cb9134e36369963c2c7ac'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1953',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=267,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=53698,
    end_offset=53704,
    text_slice='宝玉笑央道：',
    hash='sha256:fd50499ea4b258bf6dacf3c356af38e83ede9f49ab8e103207eb79a7785d5011'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1954',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=267,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=53704,
    end_offset=53716,
    text_slice='“好妈妈，我只喝一钟。”',
    hash='sha256:eb1a7fc5c0fc442204dd6a8717a63b5f4cdaa4dcddb1aec554cf1ad39970686f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1955',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=267,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=53716,
    end_offset=53721,
    text_slice='李嬷嬷道：',
    hash='sha256:3328eb3d3bf293188d40bcc58915ac56543602911b5eb0632a02ff7c62006e3f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1956',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=267,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=53721,
    end_offset=53854,
    text_slice='“不中用！当着老太太、太太，哪怕你吃一坛呢！想那日我眼错不见一会，不知是那一个没调教的，只图讨你的好儿，不管别人死活，给了你一口酒吃，葬送得我挨了两日骂。姨太太不知道他性子又可恶，吃了酒更弄性。有一日老太太高兴了，又尽着他吃，什么日子又不许他吃，何苦我白赔在里面！”',
    hash='sha256:60489a4fa3be111a1f67def0f6d842650affb987c80b82055922fe0b62cea3ac'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1957',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=267,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=53854,
    end_offset=53860,
    text_slice='薛姨妈笑道：',
    hash='sha256:f284f6f4c264d84ce775b69e1c10bc8662d0a40d9171d4d29429bcc28828576f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1958',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=267,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=53860,
    end_offset=53894,
    text_slice='“老货，你只放心吃你的去。我也不许他吃多了。便是老太太问，有我呢。”',
    hash='sha256:5a70fb170a8f76fc816a1d1686d53de6e1bfe958b807a7bba7977ccaef19a9e7'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1959',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=267,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=53894,
    end_offset=53901,
    text_slice='一面命小丫鬟：',
    hash='sha256:2362433d4d131b43bd6b7e47145c8bfc1bdebe7c480651866df8132755dd7092'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1960',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=267,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=53901,
    end_offset=53920,
    text_slice='“来！让你奶奶们去，也吃杯搪搪雪气。”',
    hash='sha256:b258fc2b4004d14f39da5395a6f5e408fc8cf9e1d49c436ebbfbe6c14cf27bd8'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1961',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=267,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=53920,
    end_offset=53941,
    text_slice='那李嬷嬷听如此说，只得和众人且去吃些酒水。',
    hash='sha256:7c796d302fe245e6008cd64217b5409f3d812ab21480d9d5fab6bdb1425de369'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1962',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=267,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=53948,
    end_offset=53969,
    text_slice='“不必烫热了，我只爱吃冷的。薛姨妈忙道：”',
    hash='sha256:78fc102f90fe10834c20930bc6a954f3165f35b00bf9377e86738b283082b9f5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1963',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=267,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=53969,
    end_offset=53987,
    text_slice='这可使不得，吃了冷酒，写字手打飐儿。',
    hash='sha256:5e6ffa3ef730f6713af920ad66ddbb50bd9f65a3ec8b7b18a9021f8a335b35ae'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1964',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=267,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=53987,
    end_offset=53994,
    text_slice='“宝钗笑道：”',
    hash='sha256:b09d43009662d0d7aef24f1b610048755068739d9d656bfeb1fe8d4f68f082a3'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1965',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=267,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=53994,
    end_offset=54056,
    text_slice='宝兄弟，亏你每日家杂学旁收的，难道就不知道酒性最热，若热吃下去，发散得就快；若冷吃下去，便凝结在内，以五脏去暖他，岂不受害？',
    hash='sha256:f1e1cb5b73e1b666771317cc3c784dfb8188b5e977fdc91b4c3283a11bd6796d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1966',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=267,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=54056,
    end_offset=54069,
    text_slice='从此还不快不要吃那冷的呢！',
    hash='sha256:d8fbb9edebcc34c838dd42a483871c7294f69c32b6554556b07620ae7887ac3d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1967',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=267,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=54069,
    end_offset=54092,
    text_slice='“宝玉听这话有情理，便放下冷的，命人暖来方饮。',
    hash='sha256:253898bb0e542cf4109ef75e0eb1381674c266e76ef7f51d720218caaf7f893e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1968',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=268,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=54094,
    end_offset=54108,
    text_slice='黛玉磕着瓜子儿，只抿着嘴笑。',
    hash='sha256:0a23a71da75082122b5cdf2892c963c08d135e90b2b00b11e5975269fe0bdb77'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1969',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=268,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=54138,
    end_offset=54161,
    text_slice='“谁叫你送来的？难为她费心，那里就冷死了我！”',
    hash='sha256:f0869bc41bb144f6bdfe118423902b27e4d67142622669b2d42ff45d16bd5d42'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1970',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=268,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=54161,
    end_offset=54165,
    text_slice='雪雁道：',
    hash='sha256:50eff3baff40a5d3e62a7d283a882e9fcf7237ac60f15d1a661068dabd802283'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1971',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=268,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=54165,
    end_offset=54182,
    text_slice='“紫鹃姐姐怕姑娘冷，使我送来的。”',
    hash='sha256:049219814edf475f8c8ba44eb7451325ed54f949efd542b79152ae257709031b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1972',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=268,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=54182,
    end_offset=54197,
    text_slice='黛玉一面接了，抱在怀中，笑道：',
    hash='sha256:22b11ef9c47da0a1fcdb1068c5cbad53c73cbc83ffcf72179d8d8a682d1fef8d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1973',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=268,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=54197,
    end_offset=54238,
    text_slice='“也亏你倒听她的话。我平日和你说的，全当耳旁风；怎么他说了你就依，比圣旨还快呢？”',
    hash='sha256:bd58ade46e1e2c1a55ec50261ec9eabc55ad5f1cad46bd53c81d5e0e4ca1376c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1974',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=268,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=54238,
    end_offset=54272,
    text_slice='宝玉听这话，知是黛玉借此奚落他，也无回复之词，只嘻嘻的笑了两阵罢了。',
    hash='sha256:f2879d5951a52f4038728bd92911359b7fcd91f65d5d62976abc96bf7c0e2377'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1975',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=268,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=54272,
    end_offset=54291,
    text_slice='宝钗素知黛玉是如此惯了的，也不去睬她。',
    hash='sha256:a5f39e082e52f6cb9e61d684bd782caf66602e781b96119cafdaa625361ab5eb'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1976',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=268,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=54297,
    end_offset=54322,
    text_slice='“你素日身子弱，禁不得冷的，她们记挂着你倒不好？”',
    hash='sha256:5c7823d4895946dd396382e4d51383e9b76727bc8d2d49d461ecbce8c45e79e7'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1977',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=268,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=54322,
    end_offset=54327,
    text_slice='黛玉笑道：',
    hash='sha256:262b8d2fa54e1920c87a964440cd3c9ca8fc3cbe0d1b21b7af07946e9ef0fbfc'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1978',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=268,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=54327,
    end_offset=54407,
    text_slice='“姨妈不知道。幸亏是姨妈这里，倘或在别人家，人家岂不恼？好说就看得人家连个手炉也没有，巴巴的从家里送个来。不说丫头们太小心过余，还只当我素日是这等轻狂惯了呢。”',
    hash='sha256:488d661009039aca89f0d2037bbf78398fb7a1aae3b3e83de3f81f27c824442e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1979',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=268,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=54407,
    end_offset=54412,
    text_slice='薛姨妈道：',
    hash='sha256:1e34a5a016872005262442da3f56e3cfae7859188058d7a45050b9ea6e3c1a5a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1980',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=268,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=54412,
    end_offset=54433,
    text_slice='“你这个多心的，有这样想。我就没这样心。”',
    hash='sha256:7e41028c8b47fb83a4b5764aaf8a4dae7cde060c39ab34c4c0d2f4f8a2d3d582'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1981',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=269,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=54435,
    end_offset=54448,
    text_slice='说话时，宝玉已是三杯过去。',
    hash='sha256:a81938365c12f28b5a9bc49b0083a5e255adf37ddaafadabb001c40fc154bc21'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1982',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=269,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=54448,
    end_offset=54457,
    text_slice='李嬷嬷又上来拦阻。',
    hash='sha256:5fa36d84c4109bf848da734ee0db13e9b1b9505f7cae89d8f3a3b239a8977f85'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1983',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=269,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=54457,
    end_offset=54485,
    text_slice='宝玉正在心甜意洽之时，和宝、黛姊妹说说笑笑的，那肯不吃。',
    hash='sha256:4c1e2eb9f514c3600278a168932bb34026e7c75419ac0aa4258df773abd0db30'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1984',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=269,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=54494,
    end_offset=54510,
    text_slice='“好妈妈，我再吃两钟就不吃了！”',
    hash='sha256:245509c18d7c1f732c14b074f2ba59cb0f67d843b8470a924c55f638cb9aba89'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1985',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=269,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=54510,
    end_offset=54515,
    text_slice='李嬷嬷道：',
    hash='sha256:3328eb3d3bf293188d40bcc58915ac56543602911b5eb0632a02ff7c62006e3f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1986',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=269,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=54515,
    end_offset=54535,
    text_slice='“你可仔细老爷今儿在家，提防问你的书！”',
    hash='sha256:be0dea7bd024816186666a2941f92743478bfd7c2b80e4a237756c8815c436ec'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1987',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=269,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=54535,
    end_offset=54561,
    text_slice='宝玉听了这话，便心中大不自在，慢慢的放下酒，垂了头。',
    hash='sha256:4335291b04bd8b7216903f8c6cba7d3e27f4fbdb796bd487feb7d655980b04b5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1988',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=269,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=54568,
    end_offset=54610,
    text_slice='“别扫大家的兴！舅舅若叫你，只说姨妈留着呢。这个妈妈，她吃了酒，又拿我们来醒脾了！”',
    hash='sha256:aa833dbc823dcccd77583caf51aedc5e8fc74c979a977372e3fb3db997c02031'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1989',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=269,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=54610,
    end_offset=54631,
    text_slice='一面悄推宝玉，使他赌气；一面悄悄的咕哝说：',
    hash='sha256:f74938e8a4fb239946cd970c1ec4e5e5bbfc318c3169508b5ef501ddca04d10d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1990',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=269,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=54631,
    end_offset=54648,
    text_slice='“别理那老货！咱们只管乐咱们的。”',
    hash='sha256:300f498fd3926599c2bee0de64ce5816da177f3593674c0dbd81da26c90c6c57'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1991',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=269,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=54648,
    end_offset=54663,
    text_slice='那李嬷嬷也素知黛玉的，因说道：',
    hash='sha256:cec2c94612f77ad97303c595ef4bb6532644eaf05e67f76fc764450c4e548f56'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1992',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=269,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=54663,
    end_offset=54690,
    text_slice='“林姐儿，你不要助着他了。你倒劝劝他，只怕他还听些。”',
    hash='sha256:48826c1c65a7494c6ebc7581e54dcb1991ed5a91d33a87658684e95107fedf65'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1993',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=269,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=54690,
    end_offset=54697,
    text_slice='林黛玉冷笑道：',
    hash='sha256:e620680fafdef0025e3289f2403ecf9e0be038d335e3ae94a60cc0920989de84'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1994',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=269,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=54697,
    end_offset=54774,
    text_slice='“我为什么助着他？我也不犯着劝他。你这妈妈太小心了，往常老太太又给他酒吃，如今在姨妈这里多吃一杯，料也不妨事。必定姨妈这里是外人，不当在这里的也未可知。”',
    hash='sha256:86f0fb82b8c957a4d21201dd9d0407736b7c5e900e081243cb8a02c84df5c3e7'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1995',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=269,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=54774,
    end_offset=54791,
    text_slice='李嬷嬷听了，又是急，又是笑，说道：',
    hash='sha256:b14c4d07ca7e4c32b2c46270d74fecf67aa3abebccbc536ad759e3e6d028bb18'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1996',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=269,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=54791,
    end_offset=54821,
    text_slice='“真真这林姑娘，说出一句话来，比刀子还尖。你这算了什么呢！”',
    hash='sha256:15cc9660e843ecc70b99c294219f22f3949afc37745980dd5cc4aa305cb4a86b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1997',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=269,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=54821,
    end_offset=54841,
    text_slice='宝钗也忍不住笑着，把黛玉腮上一拧，说道：',
    hash='sha256:04d0c9c629e205a19b6011ae28c19604428c11d5317604a3cfb25583680a2886'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1998',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=269,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=54841,
    end_offset=54868,
    text_slice='“真真这个颦丫头的一张嘴，叫人恨又不是，喜欢又不是！”',
    hash='sha256:0623a25bac71aa73739804255d819a00ba392e1c185784df3a3c2fafa33e723c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_1999',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=269,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=54868,
    end_offset=54876,
    text_slice='薛姨妈一面又说：',
    hash='sha256:7d1a464a2b15a5295964eb2d77a9db618936cad68f7b64a469858c37c9280c4e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2000',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=269,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=54876,
    end_offset=54949,
    text_slice='“别怕，别怕，我的儿！来了这里，没好的你吃，别把这点子东西吓得存在心里，倒叫我不安。只管放心吃，都有我呢！越发吃了晚饭去，便醉了，就跟着我睡罢。”',
    hash='sha256:594d31e165d100076c20bba5e393a80cbae6f15df1ecc8da9aefaadd0f2544f8'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2001',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=269,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=54949,
    end_offset=54952,
    text_slice='因命：',
    hash='sha256:c549d0a60d8d185efa2a06fcdbb7783b30824f19a91d9eecbef008be66f302dd'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2002',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=269,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=54952,
    end_offset=54974,
    text_slice='“再烫热酒来！姨妈陪你吃两杯，可就吃饭罢。”',
    hash='sha256:d5f3be35eada4f36c62d74d1d0979de245a5694b88a3e942f5e22c3c9b5d76fa'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2003',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=269,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=54974,
    end_offset=54986,
    text_slice='宝玉听了，方又鼓起兴来。',
    hash='sha256:ed80013753f716bd78b0ed3d9a2f53ad1d9adb6a2212168f11219e8b4f3f2760'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2004',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=270,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=54988,
    end_offset=55000,
    text_slice='李嬷嬷因吩咐小丫头子们：',
    hash='sha256:7fac9960bcc2531a5f39590d980c7f19463c1808804b2f34766dd4423363f056'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2005',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=270,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=55000,
    end_offset=55041,
    text_slice='“你们在这里小心着，我家里去换了衣服就来，悄悄的回姨太太，别任他的性，多给他吃。”',
    hash='sha256:773d00e68f0fe5e7a6adec8f75f9cce298e343c3ab891f23f466a96a5095ff39'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2006',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=270,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=55041,
    end_offset=55048,
    text_slice='说着便家去了。',
    hash='sha256:abf5b18ae445d1a114ad156b69381d954ea0d557315582ade5c52f4526872864'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2007',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=270,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=55048,
    end_offset=55086,
    text_slice='这里虽还有三四个婆子，都是不关痛痒的，见李嬷嬷走了，也都悄悄的自寻方便去了。',
    hash='sha256:f17732f20fc8495eca9ab89b2e85161e292adc03a219879d86ee31156ee4c9e8'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2008',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=270,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=55086,
    end_offset=55105,
    text_slice='只剩了两个小丫头子，乐得讨宝玉的欢喜。',
    hash='sha256:76e196aa5b4fb60c16610f491a45d2c0a44ea476ff371b5b3a67cb8d04629655'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2009',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=270,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=55105,
    end_offset=55130,
    text_slice='幸而薛姨妈千哄万哄的，只容他吃了几杯，就忙收过了。',
    hash='sha256:15b975fa84014b2fb6bcd51d6efd74057fd0f4fe42b1807486bff67ec39a055b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2010',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=270,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=55130,
    end_offset=55156,
    text_slice='做了酸笋鸡皮汤，宝玉痛喝了两碗，吃了半碗饭、碧粳粥。',
    hash='sha256:a4931d4d7e84082e84fe1bb05133e02fa3a68ef68aa4794dcc33391ca24fc354'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2011',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=270,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=55156,
    end_offset=55183,
    text_slice='一时薛、林二人也吃完了饭，又酽酽的沏上茶来，大家吃了。',
    hash='sha256:9cf789dede35073c6f5e244676abd271ac70f5c7396047dd8ec88b8959fe7e3f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2012',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=270,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=55183,
    end_offset=55191,
    text_slice='薛姨妈方放了心。',
    hash='sha256:c85ab6043e3df416972fdf1622aafdd15e70fa86301dc3880af66a63e6eb6591'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2013',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=270,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=55191,
    end_offset=55209,
    text_slice='雪雁等三四个丫头已吃了饭，进来伺候。',
    hash='sha256:65f988c754bebb618791e9b94446fd5ce4381afde9d73d0e87cbab287a621afe'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2014',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=270,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=55217,
    end_offset=55224,
    text_slice='“你走不走？”',
    hash='sha256:9525038aaca4beb027dae545f427894088db79014bb66a180802942b43cbc96b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2015',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=270,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=55224,
    end_offset=55232,
    text_slice='宝玉乜斜倦眼道：',
    hash='sha256:213bef4b3aeeda4edd559b87ea60ed7edf3e3de3c984bd41b7d95c6b5ce7549d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2016',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=270,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=55232,
    end_offset=55245,
    text_slice='“你要走，我和你一同走。”',
    hash='sha256:a71cb9b69ab2b1c0484d281bb36c33a54e408731ddb1ba90be1fe8a5d49b0ced'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2017',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=270,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=55245,
    end_offset=55255,
    text_slice='黛玉听说，遂起身道：',
    hash='sha256:98976d32c207b6383d44f814d82b66b25602597d57004bbcdd4ccbdb4cc389d4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2018',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=270,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=55255,
    end_offset=55283,
    text_slice='“咱们来了这一日，也该回去了。还不知那边怎么找咱们呢。”',
    hash='sha256:63e99b46ff2d98efcf6d910440865fc4b3018738e09bc344a4c8fb4f7ed874e2'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2019',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=270,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=55283,
    end_offset=55292,
    text_slice='说着，二人便告辞。',
    hash='sha256:f9eaa866a907b465aef4431e72fe4f6170c8aea6b0e52c0421e7c9364e13396e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2020',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=271,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=55294,
    end_offset=55319,
    text_slice='小丫头忙捧过斗笠来，宝玉便把头略低一低，命她戴上。',
    hash='sha256:412feabd14ac4e227bcd81b758c7241a89c9141d2579f0d0ebf78bb37bf107e4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2021',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=271,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=55348,
    end_offset=55383,
    text_slice='“罢，罢！好蠢东西，你也轻些儿！难道没见过别人戴过的？让我自己戴罢！”',
    hash='sha256:53dcfb2c7977cf2af1b74d1845db94a56e3be429b5ae42332129d924c8fe12af'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2022',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=271,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=55383,
    end_offset=55392,
    text_slice='黛玉站在炕沿上道：',
    hash='sha256:0d27c6e6dbddfeebac20edbee03c48891f84f0dbdca919e13501a1da1498c25c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2023',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=271,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=55392,
    end_offset=55407,
    text_slice='“啰苏什么，过来，我瞧瞧罢！”',
    hash='sha256:20047b8c4c34a576e0a5ab26aa3d6f5e39a4460bf7ebd4f2c3dfadad018d40cb'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2024',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=271,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=55407,
    end_offset=55415,
    text_slice='宝玉忙就近前来。',
    hash='sha256:f64086c9d81ee0e4e6c286c4aa1eb1a2e208ba54772c375e918fac382ca1718e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2025',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=271,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=55415,
    end_offset=55463,
    text_slice='黛玉用手整理，轻轻笼住束发冠，将笠沿掖在抹额之上，将那一颗核桃大的绛绒簪缨扶起，颤巍巍露于笠外。',
    hash='sha256:86d71b02f2b5aff4fd196fec65722d26b2ab568e471c2f33e5cc8c59678c4c78'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2026',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=271,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=55477,
    end_offset=55488,
    text_slice='“好了，披上斗篷罢！”',
    hash='sha256:5d822801a1a14e45ecbcdcab31294c7a6e980c4e3f842e0ecd95afaa1cbefdda'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2027',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=271,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=55488,
    end_offset=55501,
    text_slice='宝玉听了，方接了斗篷披上。',
    hash='sha256:37ede83f1f4feb9d9c940eb91f918a5034781ae628a9b8d2975c9b73aeb07222'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2028',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=271,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=55507,
    end_offset=55528,
    text_slice='“跟你们的妈妈都还没来呢，且略等等不迟。”',
    hash='sha256:8a8cb3c98fe8da9f81fc38c9e49e7249e9060a3ac6a2b4222f6362ed6751a55c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2029',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=271,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=55528,
    end_offset=55532,
    text_slice='宝玉道：',
    hash='sha256:10c9e1a43f0e2e5bf2e54f50fb3dbede512eb436326aec72d14625e62153e9b0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2030',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=271,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=55532,
    end_offset=55552,
    text_slice='“我们倒去等她们？有丫头们跟着也够了。”',
    hash='sha256:69944d68cc33b63dfd39e5db32b58fcb18e173870ca1bbc81437d5bf962f0889'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2031',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=271,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=55552,
    end_offset=55574,
    text_slice='薛姨妈不放心，到底命两个妇女跟随他兄妹方罢。',
    hash='sha256:8d9dd0abbfb2b1ccbdd8e7b6cce0a6c31eea95b935928adf609d08e2e29e90bd'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2032',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=271,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=55574,
    end_offset=55590,
    text_slice='他二人道了扰，一径回至贾母房中。',
    hash='sha256:944d801467fd47a4b0530dfab37b39f22b7308666d2a2052f36ace6aeb2f856a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2033',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=272,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=55592,
    end_offset=55613,
    text_slice='贾母尚未用晚饭，知是薛姨妈处来，更加喜欢。',
    hash='sha256:f62c3391d19ea079a7dad8431dca3e9efe3d9745ab581daffe06ee5b5b66dbc3'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2034',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=272,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=55613,
    end_offset=55638,
    text_slice='因见宝玉吃了酒，遂命他自回房去歇着，不许再出来了。',
    hash='sha256:2d1d59875faad595e97b4f70bc35257dbe165feb3a3bafc6ff5db406c4d80ef1'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2035',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=272,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=55638,
    end_offset=55647,
    text_slice='因命人好生看侍着。',
    hash='sha256:54763e5c5cf6603772cd7b8ff0c99eee3aa9a803f10b60c5a4e00df57a0f0cd5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2036',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=272,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=55662,
    end_offset=55672,
    text_slice='“李奶子怎么不见？”',
    hash='sha256:3bf92a8f570941e3d65baeaf74fd8bb639da071c00736f822609fcaf1f132b46'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2037',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=272,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=55672,
    end_offset=55685,
    text_slice='众人不敢直说家去了，只说：',
    hash='sha256:eaa4fbd34049e4e363837efe6cf6812cf5ad6f2a461945f7859ea32fa2fb686b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2038',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=272,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=55685,
    end_offset=55699,
    text_slice='“才进来的，想有事才去了。”',
    hash='sha256:19debe523fdddc48a76aaaf6cdb5165a39787db71fc57e1eb4c1202c6b0eab7b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2039',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=272,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=55699,
    end_offset=55707,
    text_slice='宝玉踉跄回头道：',
    hash='sha256:c2f42decedb7d05b22b08250715427c4977512fe40442a5916ff1e1902b6b455'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2040',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=272,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=55707,
    end_offset=55737,
    text_slice='“她比老太太还受用呢，问她作什么！没有她只怕我还多活两日。”',
    hash='sha256:d8f0643ada5f403b6282800e2348f513ed8b295c3de85c04dcdf61eb50957f91'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2041',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=272,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=55737,
    end_offset=55751,
    text_slice='一面说，一面来至自己的卧室。',
    hash='sha256:3323fef2739784ff8b56e8f3d4fe9d31a2da026b5c88409122a1f6b479a52eff'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2042',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=272,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=55769,
    end_offset=55823,
    text_slice='“好，好！要我研了那些墨，早起高兴，只写了三个字，丢下笔就走了，哄得我们等了一日。快来与我写完这些墨才罢！”',
    hash='sha256:b58af012caf0f86925fbd1e1ee9a1e25601fbf852f9df34a1b1f551776f2cd95'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2043',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=272,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=55823,
    end_offset=55839,
    text_slice='宝玉忽然想起早起的事来，因笑道：',
    hash='sha256:2ccad207b7d4d492d00db6f3059536ca890a188d105b38edab267db7cd9883ab'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2044',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=272,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=55839,
    end_offset=55853,
    text_slice='“我写的那三个字在那里呢？”',
    hash='sha256:fd338812a12b0239c2725833bd5bb6b85ecd3dbe8fb1a7a444775cb51d89d2f3'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2045',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=272,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=55853,
    end_offset=55858,
    text_slice='晴雯笑道：',
    hash='sha256:1d8f0a4143d239dc3b67f3d6f44651ab96cbd54ac6fd3a747772c82330b0633f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2046',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=272,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=55858,
    end_offset=55927,
    text_slice='“这个人可醉了！你头里过那府里去，嘱咐我贴在这门斗上的，这会子又这么问。我生怕别人贴坏了，我亲自爬高上梯的贴上，这会子还冻的手僵冷的呢。”',
    hash='sha256:43aee828c1ab76d17e22941f298fa68e843b387485d6425c52a60d4fe0181736'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2047',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=272,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=55927,
    end_offset=55935,
    text_slice='宝玉听了，笑道：',
    hash='sha256:3968351bf10089b53e11b8ed6adfb1419fb742452de36c0a153370f31feee8e8'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2048',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=272,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=55935,
    end_offset=55952,
    text_slice='“我忘了。你的手冷，我替你渥着。”',
    hash='sha256:24a264e5a479adc696117e2e2abc1261e9261e4a03a4f5b73440e0aaef12a834'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2049',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=272,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=55952,
    end_offset=55978,
    text_slice='说着便伸手携了晴雯的手，同仰首看门斗上新书的三个字。',
    hash='sha256:b108981068e1a372ca9fd08954a84aedfc899b67bb4fb64e4dd97f07d8bb2eb5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2050',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=273,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=55980,
    end_offset=55993,
    text_slice='一时黛玉来了，宝玉便笑道：',
    hash='sha256:b7218aa1355ee06b192e9afea78c2f09177aa37c8d81307400b9b517fd465546'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2051',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=273,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=55993,
    end_offset=56016,
    text_slice='“好妹妹，你别撒谎，你看这三个字那一个字好？”',
    hash='sha256:eb31ae74da6bf87e70c93711653404fb46831879b8f9638a145fb30917381c0f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2052',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=273,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=56016,
    end_offset=56036,
    text_slice='黛玉仰头看里间门斗上，新贴了三个字，写着',
    hash='sha256:2a47ac6590a9a564327c63a2b4f7e1a73a927238435a0bac334123eacc65580c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2053',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=273,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=56036,
    end_offset=56041,
    text_slice='“绛芸轩”',
    hash='sha256:cc4c74edc62fedd214a760e47192bd15819fa920d32671ee66918a1ff4c51407'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2054',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=273,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=56041,
    end_offset=56047,
    text_slice='。黛玉笑道：',
    hash='sha256:a2a4d3b15d395b4e72f69fd45ebdd38fad7405d258bdfaafa32a3fa16a054de5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2055',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=273,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=56047,
    end_offset=56073,
    text_slice='“个个都好。怎么写得这么好了？明儿也与我写一个匾。”',
    hash='sha256:eaacf316c4a3be38bac9160699df3482b0dcaeba33c83336f8e6216c117f877d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2056',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=273,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=56073,
    end_offset=56081,
    text_slice='宝玉嘻嘻的笑道：',
    hash='sha256:c28b4c10563c0bd251728797990248ab50ec320736e259ef8694dea427dd670e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2057',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=273,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=56081,
    end_offset=56088,
    text_slice='“又哄我呢。”',
    hash='sha256:2aee56ef0277721281c28a466c76ddbff360c03ebf9865f077470cabcf61311e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2058',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=273,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=56088,
    end_offset=56093,
    text_slice='说着又问：',
    hash='sha256:c76aab3cf8eddfe79319a43083b402b7641f5df092503e0c6aa4e80ae5ece833'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2059',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=273,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=56093,
    end_offset=56101,
    text_slice='“袭人姐姐呢？”',
    hash='sha256:91ad098f19c7bbf30554aaf1276918d0a9d521a4bd79520920f75b8531e7dbbe'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2060',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=273,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=56101,
    end_offset=56111,
    text_slice='晴雯向里间炕上努嘴。',
    hash='sha256:9cf4b676f1f78a1ae283199fd1da68226bab6db36c07f7105d5e0186d9eea58d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2061',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=273,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=56111,
    end_offset=56128,
    text_slice='宝玉一看，只见袭人和衣睡着在那里。',
    hash='sha256:9d98c465dd7de9bd8e5089a9b6772b7958e53379de29b503628e231ba23d8cc1'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2062',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=273,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=56133,
    end_offset=56143,
    text_slice='“好！太渥早了些。”',
    hash='sha256:8f69e05e025373c30313eb3362211192ee3355a15ddad9061b0c7b0154586681'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2063',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=273,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=56143,
    end_offset=56150,
    text_slice='因又问晴雯道：',
    hash='sha256:d82485d1d756f46a432d076e5bcde3663c43722e32c9889994f6c61c35c854d2'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2064',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=273,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=56150,
    end_offset=56210,
    text_slice='“今儿我在那府里吃早饭，有一碟子豆腐皮的包子，我想着你爱吃，和珍大奶奶说了，只说我留着晚上吃，叫人送过来的，你可吃了？”',
    hash='sha256:c71907b1dcc065d27f6ae93bf5e07fa19887605476fa72b9ba840788a8ec7d41'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2065',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=273,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=56210,
    end_offset=56214,
    text_slice='晴雯道：',
    hash='sha256:cff77ce24049e6facc73191a3eae3357a3c496dbf26ee3136e750c9d1ed50220'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2066',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=273,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=56214,
    end_offset=56286,
    text_slice='“快别提！一送了来，我知道是我的，偏我才吃了饭，就搁在那里。后来李奶奶来了看见，说：‘宝玉未必吃了，拿来给我孙子吃去罢。’他就叫人拿了家去了。”',
    hash='sha256:7ae68693f9c257be0a7cf086b610437e25fab2611c03045621f7af17ef9941ac'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2067',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=273,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=56286,
    end_offset=56296,
    text_slice='接着，茜雪捧上茶来。',
    hash='sha256:e0699fb52c423cba9fff56d9dd525844e3a23449c8a0825bc7df3e16b8bf9fd4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2068',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=273,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=56296,
    end_offset=56306,
    text_slice='宝玉因让林妹妹吃茶。',
    hash='sha256:fe6914e47b4726c6ca3eccfdc9eadcef6648da61a9e6d06d6d16ebf50ba2e541'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2069',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=273,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=56311,
    end_offset=56324,
    text_slice='“林妹妹早走了，还让呢！”',
    hash='sha256:3f76a856f31eabb3bd6b537eb1988fb8d7e4bf1009bad5296f5c23cca35d4a92'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2070',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=274,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=56326,
    end_offset=56350,
    text_slice='宝玉吃了半碗茶，忽又想起早起的茶来，因问茜雪道：',
    hash='sha256:4b08ecb02b529ec89913d932fbd1f9345b1eafc518c3ca21c3b8cb151b1f1536'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2071',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=274,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=56350,
    end_offset=56390,
    text_slice='“早起沏了一碗枫露茶，我说过，那茶是三四次后才出色的，这会子怎么又沏了这个来？”',
    hash='sha256:3e091c9d0641d06e4b98ee7268be90f202a88afa2f82b50413caaa5d6780d26c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2072',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=274,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=56390,
    end_offset=56394,
    text_slice='茜雪道：',
    hash='sha256:67fb8da3066d061e77047cbf75bfee0921ff79f8b8d62641b8dcde340a01bbd4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2073',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=274,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=56394,
    end_offset=56423,
    text_slice='“我原是留着的，那会子李奶奶来了，她要尝尝，就给她吃了。”',
    hash='sha256:a98d61da1a5ddcea8bc592db5ad8639cdcae310f1515076c20fd4f2f8b286288'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2074',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=274,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=56423,
    end_offset=56443,
    text_slice='宝玉听了，将手中的茶杯只顺手往地下一掷，',
    hash='sha256:2458d2bd55048e3ce3b5dee848a8305f2782878421181858abed9009111b6e85'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2075',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=274,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=56443,
    end_offset=56447,
    text_slice='"豁啷"',
    hash='sha256:796b1d746fd61d41a43565800950d6df096f01cff6692d7d366411374db03f45'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2076',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=274,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=56447,
    end_offset=56465,
    text_slice='一声，打个齑粉，泼了茜雪一裙子的茶。',
    hash='sha256:f50c9452166d51f7cd6607d1703c81abd0ae2ce9f2790a685cb8acb4dbf369fa'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2077',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=274,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=56475,
    end_offset=56557,
    text_slice='“她是你那一门子的奶奶，你们这么孝敬她？不过是仗着我小时候吃过她几日奶罢了。如今逞得她比祖宗还大了！如今我又吃不着奶了，白白的养着祖宗作什么！撵了出去，大家干净！”',
    hash='sha256:165e62fbc7779d9a365c3b6d3e08bbc7fe976b6a9c44bf82e08c5365bd6706e6'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2078',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=274,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=56557,
    end_offset=56574,
    text_slice='说着，立刻便要去回贾母，撵他乳母。',
    hash='sha256:3ceab5cb112a5d89894c72e68cada38b79dcb1d27ff09a41f0834b8e1479166d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2079',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=275,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=56576,
    end_offset=56601,
    text_slice='原来袭人实未睡着，不过故意装睡，引宝玉来怄他顽耍。',
    hash='sha256:b14e3fe0ab2d999931381bfd29f5fad37034e144e62225c049d280c15ca10d30'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2080',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=275,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=56601,
    end_offset=56642,
    text_slice='先闻得说字、问包子等事，也还可不必起来；后来摔了茶钟，动了气，遂连忙起来解释劝阻。',
    hash='sha256:f5b62221593582718b76ea1826c4a9578d9b0096a13f4732b836a4dda42fb1e6'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2081',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=275,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=56651,
    end_offset=56658,
    text_slice='“是怎么了？”',
    hash='sha256:c5ac86c0ec43bcb911fdb4a1fc1ae46b5551522f6ccc4b652f199bad4deee2a3'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2082',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=275,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=56658,
    end_offset=56663,
    text_slice='袭人忙道：',
    hash='sha256:6655852253a3be2c2eea8f606e636d3ccd1727534369c016b52460a6f24e1a3c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2083',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=275,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=56663,
    end_offset=56684,
    text_slice='“我才倒茶来，被雪滑倒了，失手砸了钟子。”',
    hash='sha256:5f45ecf8e10b0666a097f10fbf81f03580091f3fd170f0d40b1c99cb1a3c3981'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2084',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=275,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=56684,
    end_offset=56693,
    text_slice='一面又安慰宝玉道：',
    hash='sha256:fc873446f22c32483a13f149caf5e1ca69668972ca80e2765ea544d05e66c42c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2085',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=275,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=56693,
    end_offset=56743,
    text_slice='“你立意要撵她也好，我们也都愿意出去，不如趁势连我们一齐撵了，我们也好，你也不愁再有好的来服侍你。”',
    hash='sha256:e0e567ebeca48ef79c218427826e15e70c65847884d90f2db1d83ca30fedbae1'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2086',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=275,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=56743,
    end_offset=56771,
    text_slice='宝玉听了这话，方无了言语，被袭人等扶至炕上，脱换了衣服。',
    hash='sha256:b4a93086a59c228f094ca8dc2753568a95166404238a5c92f854727fc23d53b2'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2087',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=275,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=56771,
    end_offset=56804,
    text_slice='不知宝玉口内还说些什么，只觉口齿绵缠，眼眉愈加饧涩，忙伏侍他睡下。',
    hash='sha256:8c562f499a21f12219bd1761c2efe66f7851de94335d7df483d2c435b3b0ef28'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2088',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=275,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=56804,
    end_offset=56846,
    text_slice='袭人伸手从他项上摘下那通灵玉来，用自己的手帕包好，塞在褥下，次日带时，便冰不着脖子。',
    hash='sha256:dba4e584d6e2e69b91d38233cef9d1580ec6d93397903375d7cfccb260344c45'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2089',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=275,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=56846,
    end_offset=56856,
    text_slice='那宝玉就枕便睡着了。',
    hash='sha256:9567ff61daf42c17b37d1489d281b474dac035aef49260b8ad31de0f5805fd62'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2090',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=275,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=56856,
    end_offset=56896,
    text_slice='彼时李嬷嬷等已进来了，听见醉了，不敢前来再加触犯，只悄悄的打听睡了，方放心散去。',
    hash='sha256:85afd92b3b78c44b0d35ccecb8e46f1eca4cefafc6ba673a153241c1046dd58d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2091',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=276,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=56898,
    end_offset=56908,
    text_slice='次日醒来，就有人回：',
    hash='sha256:59edb69951027a8a4e4b2e9bebe4d336770f55efa3135ae86a6b0fb6c30e2faa'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2092',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=276,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=56908,
    end_offset=56924,
    text_slice='“那边小蓉大爷带了秦相公来拜。”',
    hash='sha256:eed917b2cd93df9390c706ae559598560038110594a00879e28022bca4fbc76f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2093',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=276,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=56924,
    end_offset=56939,
    text_slice='宝玉忙接了出去，领了拜见贾母。',
    hash='sha256:54f2e74a5f85162ef70cf7715d7d2188f7af9d484329eb752581b6c584801846'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2094',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=276,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=56939,
    end_offset=56985,
    text_slice='贾母见秦钟形容标致，举止温柔，堪陪宝玉读书，心中十分欢喜，便留茶留饭，又命人带去见王夫人等。',
    hash='sha256:c08ea2a5e03a0fd9ed7890ab1a00f325b2419f54be3355f66b3d30602ab9235f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2095',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=276,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=56985,
    end_offset=57017,
    text_slice='众人因素爱秦氏，今见了秦钟是这般人品，也都欢喜，临去时都有表礼。',
    hash='sha256:ff3be8bc4b3b3d4e29000d8ee50bab08a795d6838e59693f70badb17e0f7e9c0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2096',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=276,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=57034,
    end_offset=57040,
    text_slice='“文星和合”',
    hash='sha256:06f45a2dc2ac0a0bd070b8951587ab9e968e109f8827af65bf705ce02f9c17dd'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2097',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=276,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=57040,
    end_offset=57043,
    text_slice='之意。',
    hash='sha256:49c071ba13e3a2ec1f2c8ecc46954cc489cde4982c8b889d8870a34a0ec21cc5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2098',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=276,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=57049,
    end_offset=57104,
    text_slice='“你家住得远，或一时寒热饥饱不便，只管住在我这里，不必限定了。只和你宝叔在一处，别跟着那起不长进的东西们学。”',
    hash='sha256:b1887bb750b0fd838c98a3ab88d3319299bc168f71d90cc094d3e4dc2e898fc8'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2099',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=276,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=57104,
    end_offset=57117,
    text_slice='秦钟一一的答应，回去禀知。',
    hash='sha256:292898843261f44701b31137ee047b18b6bbd31517f826c8f92a6e13358b36d3'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2100',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=277,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=57119,
    end_offset=57141,
    text_slice='他父亲秦业，现任营缮郎，年近七十，夫人早亡。',
    hash='sha256:8f81392c00d14a49abd814fbd5e804a8203be2fcfb7820a0c0a0ea47b082d916'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2101',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=277,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=57141,
    end_offset=57165,
    text_slice='因当年无儿女，便向养生堂抱了一个儿子并一个女儿。',
    hash='sha256:05e8a9ee8d99676c0df73cf318df4ee52b774322c327956abd2236219566efeb'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2102',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=277,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=57165,
    end_offset=57200,
    text_slice='谁知儿子又死了，只剩女儿，小名唤可儿，长大时，生得形容袅娜，性格风流。',
    hash='sha256:5c414f9a70499d6d193c6495373180bd6506fa320850546a9205ff989478a911'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2103',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=277,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=57200,
    end_offset=57222,
    text_slice='因素与贾家有些瓜葛，故结了亲，许与贾蓉为妻。',
    hash='sha256:64d257fc652020aaad0ee735d0be80062262289449892ce2efb5bd977ba9200b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2104',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=277,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=57222,
    end_offset=57236,
    text_slice='那秦业至五旬之上方得了秦钟。',
    hash='sha256:75d723bd6890f05fe6d74601a79fde28aa3a315b794c41a65a5e3c4c90d448d8'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2105',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=277,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=57236,
    end_offset=57264,
    text_slice='因去岁业师亡故，未暇延请高明之士，只得暂时在家温习旧课。',
    hash='sha256:d3fbbb88ddb6e80cd1ec63819da78b640cd51777575cdd59bb9181d18efd1849'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2106',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=277,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=57264,
    end_offset=57301,
    text_slice='正思要和亲家去商议，送往他家塾中去，暂且不致荒废，可巧遇见了宝玉这个机会。',
    hash='sha256:dc701106767bbe2af52cf10873d349cad71d20f787188af7f426cc838e82531c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2107',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=277,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=57301,
    end_offset=57348,
    text_slice='又知贾家塾中现今司塾的是贾代儒，乃当今之老儒，秦钟此去，学业料必进益，成名可望，因此十分欢喜。',
    hash='sha256:d40a188a6c2babc471a8bf59adcb445b547e91e7cfb9aa3114bbdfeb23449066'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2108',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=277,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=57348,
    end_offset=57428,
    text_slice='只是宦囊羞涩，那贾家上上下下都是一双富贵眼睛，容易拿不出来；又恐误了为儿子的终身大事，说不得东拼西凑的恭恭敬敬封了二十四两贽见礼，亲自带了秦钟，来代儒家拜见了。',
    hash='sha256:4d10f6d9271f8e83db4b476dc22445b5bf3b45e020727f1be0746760846f2c3f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2109',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=277,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=57428,
    end_offset=57444,
    text_slice='然后听宝玉上学之日，好一同入塾。',
    hash='sha256:9cba3a0a75bdc4de704345ae25154e1f94b294a34e13cff7465b8612121c40b5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2110',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=278,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=57449,
    end_offset=57465,
    text_slice='早知日后闲争气，岂肯今朝错读书！',
    hash='sha256:e3c8bc89e90ff9186a5a1076e58a6996f177d8d6dac8f98e3c37ca28fc6f6439'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2111',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=279,
    segment_type='heading',
    start_offset=57467,
    end_offset=57489,
    text_slice='第九回  恋风流情友入家塾\u3000起嫌疑顽童闹学堂',
    hash='sha256:cceb6c8828814d84b6c8c5d2284b9550240f4d196cc08152debeec3f11603334'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2112',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=280,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=57491,
    end_offset=57512,
    text_slice='话说秦业父子专候贾家的人来送上学择日之信。',
    hash='sha256:986a5b5cc9b4af4f4a9cfed7e8b65e4fe8dd9262e9552b57e88e0589fbd35516'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2113',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=280,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=57512,
    end_offset=57540,
    text_slice='原来宝玉急于要和秦钟相遇，却顾不得别的，遂择了后日上学。',
    hash='sha256:6f1a04197866598f4cddf52286a72c889e385aae437dbab05c5413b1dfcce573'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2114',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=280,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=57540,
    end_offset=57563,
    text_slice='“后日一早请秦相公到我这里，会齐了，一同前去。',
    hash='sha256:fee7d20181050b53b8f2ada77f48fa26bdb512f3e6e4524220764e1fd3fb9a30'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2115',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=280,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=57563,
    end_offset=57572,
    text_slice='”打发人送了去信。',
    hash='sha256:de498480cc42bc2c2561fea647e8add5130fa13a05d872f78044eb8cbea7006d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2116',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=281,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=57574,
    end_offset=57612,
    text_slice='至是日一早，宝玉未起来时，袭人早已把书笔文物包好，收拾停妥，坐在床沿上发闷。',
    hash='sha256:9082acaac447b1944fcc770793a3f3b819c10a28e90e871efb16a8c63303036c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2117',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=281,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=57612,
    end_offset=57626,
    text_slice='见宝玉醒来，只得服侍他梳洗。',
    hash='sha256:10826e1bbee416a6f64d6ca5fc461f1b7a5400484f75262c53c73008c4de8a47'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2118',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=281,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=57639,
    end_offset=57671,
    text_slice='“好姐姐，你怎么又不自在了？难道怪我上学去丢得你们冷清了不成？”',
    hash='sha256:f4734e555d42b2dc8eddef0e16dd9fec2c04f3bf62a36ee6a5395509f4da0cf9'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2119',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=281,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=57671,
    end_offset=57676,
    text_slice='袭人笑道：',
    hash='sha256:e1ef0136e156f2e8f63d7e723b950b832a0705e21926a3e739ffb859c3a59d8e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2120',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=281,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=57676,
    end_offset=57800,
    text_slice='“这是那里话？读书是极好的事，不然，就潦倒一辈子，终究怎么样呢？但只一件：读书之时只想著书，不读书的时节想着家里些。别和他们一处玩闹，碰见老爷不是玩的。虽说是奋志要强，那工课宁可少些，一则贪多嚼不烂，二则身子也要保重。这就是我的意思，你可要体谅。”',
    hash='sha256:1e12dcb626b929868510b35ba26f68466bdc9e802a156e4157163f49befa9352'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2121',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=281,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=57800,
    end_offset=57812,
    text_slice='袭人说一句，宝玉应一句。',
    hash='sha256:f789f83f6c801b2f8ab51031983d7def3ebb7efc953b35bfadd1522f6ad4db31'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2122',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=281,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=57817,
    end_offset=57901,
    text_slice='“大毛衣服我也包好了，交出给小子们去了。学里冷，好歹想着添换，比不得家里有人照看。脚炉手炉的炭也交出去了，你可着他们添。那一起懒贼，你不说，他们乐得不动，白冻坏了你。”',
    hash='sha256:c5de1be4b21746e2ac307b77983f923be2b6ea588428e491f604c96515a81c56'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2123',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=281,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=57901,
    end_offset=57905,
    text_slice='宝玉道：',
    hash='sha256:10c9e1a43f0e2e5bf2e54f50fb3dbede512eb436326aec72d14625e62153e9b0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2124',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=281,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=57905,
    end_offset=57946,
    text_slice='“你放心，出外头我自己都会调停的。你们也别闷死在屋里，长和林妹妹一处去玩笑才好。”',
    hash='sha256:54a2662bf533b2134dc5f2d9a9be1e63c307596d4875d842ce63f1dcf52bd84b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2125',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=281,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=57946,
    end_offset=57973,
    text_slice='说着，俱已穿戴齐备，袭人催他去见贾母、贾政、王夫人等。',
    hash='sha256:3db3920376c3730de55bd3e3090b20f4653904572b515c017223e7040ce8aa39'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2126',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=281,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=57973,
    end_offset=57996,
    text_slice='宝玉又去嘱咐了晴雯、麝月等几句，方出来见贾母。',
    hash='sha256:0bc5d2095ebcc11d0aedf2743b91f0bd03a3666c345d9c13ed94978b45aeed14'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2127',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=281,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=57996,
    end_offset=58010,
    text_slice='贾母未免也有几句嘱咐他的话。',
    hash='sha256:89aaccd1baf65d076832c195672efe0bc65fb2aa270a749fafde03b9916d9d3b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2128',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=281,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=58010,
    end_offset=58028,
    text_slice='然后去见王夫人，又出来书房中见贾政。',
    hash='sha256:f85aee5c5e002af98e930aab32c3e88876145f6c29643e7792471e4cc856b99a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2129',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=282,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=58030,
    end_offset=58055,
    text_slice='偏生这日贾政回家得早，正在书房中与相公清客们闲话。',
    hash='sha256:05d864995585c315d97297877a64993246976481d74c39fd3a28a89cd2feeb1b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2130',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=282,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=58077,
    end_offset=58129,
    text_slice='“你如果再提‘上学’两字，连我也羞死了。依我的话，你竟玩你的去是正理。仔细站脏了我这地，靠脏了我这门！”',
    hash='sha256:923791940a5bad91607d8f384912aaccc7a0d1fbb1adf06789c1c1e8048d550d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2131',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=282,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=58129,
    end_offset=58141,
    text_slice='众清客相公们都起身笑道：',
    hash='sha256:079dc88ba920479434bec7fba8245171779c58d4cbd2ef54ac79332866a1c777'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2132',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=282,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=58141,
    end_offset=58196,
    text_slice='“老世翁何必如此！今日世兄一去，三二年就可显身成名的了，断不似往年仍作小儿之态的。天也将饭时，世兄竟快请罢！”',
    hash='sha256:55025b8c2b4720755781f28dcb18b2d7f0560a75c09a8498f9f9ec78572dcf30'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2133',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=282,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=58196,
    end_offset=58216,
    text_slice='说着便有两个年老的携了宝玉的手走出去了。',
    hash='sha256:4ebef164520f252dd12c597b9c48b750c2fa2744bba24bb24b91d0117d641bf6'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2134',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=283,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=58218,
    end_offset=58223,
    text_slice='贾政因问：',
    hash='sha256:b6be33cd16109b88bb4a9f16d01e7173c0a4557abd69f756bc9e8c306da51ee9'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2135',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=283,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=58223,
    end_offset=58232,
    text_slice='“跟宝玉的是谁？”',
    hash='sha256:d06676a22a9b1cfe1eb99480439400076ab6c276806168407d00b3fd1d8b2d87'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2136',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=283,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=58232,
    end_offset=58257,
    text_slice='只听外面答应了两声，早进来三四个大汉，打千儿请安。',
    hash='sha256:162d8ae7bf5fb9ff112b90654b79ad152a4f353bd5be5b230630b5ee1bebaf7a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2137',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=283,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=58257,
    end_offset=58279,
    text_slice='贾政看时，认得是宝玉的奶母之子，名唤李贵的。',
    hash='sha256:dd03fba14516311904b0c33c88c2fc721c7635199863762bbe26611f54eb6d35'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2138',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=283,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=58285,
    end_offset=58351,
    text_slice='“你们成日家跟他上学，他到底念了些什么书！倒念了些胡言混语在肚子里，学了些精致的淘气。等我闲一，先揭了你的皮，再和那不长进的算帐！”',
    hash='sha256:12a1a1b97704b2c653d8f8beb0d08f1ceded53898329f22d5e35ed2d85fe6300'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2139',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=283,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=58351,
    end_offset=58375,
    text_slice='吓得李贵忙双膝跪下，摘了帽子，碰头有声，连连答应',
    hash='sha256:fe1a52abdb2302f12120a6613f55a777883aa882e9f776d5101cd14f9f79c444'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2140',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=283,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=58375,
    end_offset=58378,
    text_slice='“是”',
    hash='sha256:090f2ef0ebb5d24d8be084e110276dd49b63d06614f8a3a608a389ef81728909'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2141',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=283,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=58378,
    end_offset=58383,
    text_slice='，又回说：',
    hash='sha256:cca3d44474ce10a02d69066151afa05eafc18a92faaa2be2d83cf5a35f89b086'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2142',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=283,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=58383,
    end_offset=58419,
    text_slice='“哥儿已念到第三本《诗经》，什么‘呦呦鹿鸣，荷叶浮萍’，小的不敢撒谎。”',
    hash='sha256:543185a68a056fdf1dbebb469dacdc832553ab6e7845a2dbc1470ba6ec4fb4cb'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2143',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=283,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=58419,
    end_offset=58430,
    text_slice='说的满座哄然大笑起来。',
    hash='sha256:71fd33be633e50158e693babefa8204795d26005577a47dba6d29204b63bb91c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2144',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=283,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=58430,
    end_offset=58439,
    text_slice='贾政也撑不住笑了。',
    hash='sha256:aa30ba1e8d2097867229f2e0a4952fc6549f733c2b01e4d5418064149c5c5418'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2145',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=283,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=58443,
    end_offset=58526,
    text_slice='“那怕再念三十本《诗经》，也都是掩耳偷铃，哄人而已。你去请学里师老爷安，就说我说的：什么《诗经》、古文，一概不用虚应故事，只是先把《四书》一齐讲明背熟，是最要紧的。”',
    hash='sha256:563d7b2e03ab948606ce2d9667325e859e0cf107aba792c271b8e028f018351f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2146',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=283,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=58526,
    end_offset=58531,
    text_slice='李贵忙答应',
    hash='sha256:55db6fff7b7c166339199891b56dfa1f80e2c614fa974ad843f8aefcfbaa3ea2'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2147',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=283,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=58531,
    end_offset=58534,
    text_slice='“是”',
    hash='sha256:090f2ef0ebb5d24d8be084e110276dd49b63d06614f8a3a608a389ef81728909'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2148',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=283,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=58534,
    end_offset=58547,
    text_slice='，见贾政无话，方退了出去。',
    hash='sha256:9ce089202f5f1838a03588a02235229ba5182cf8122e510e129a3944628b6167'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2149',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=284,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=58549,
    end_offset=58572,
    text_slice='此时，宝玉独站在院外，避猫鼠儿似的，屏声静候。',
    hash='sha256:8953f77d66824a436342878fb42a5164465eb1d0bfe6ee4c165e2a2fd6c85d9d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2150',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=284,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=58572,
    end_offset=58585,
    text_slice='待他们出来，便忙忙的走了。',
    hash='sha256:636e4a17d7e8c55427eb291a9c258e02e66e6944d7dbb48d13fc7c9170d0e71b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2151',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=284,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=58599,
    end_offset=58659,
    text_slice='“可听见了不曾？先要揭我们的皮呢！人家的奴才，跟主子赚些好体面，我们这等奴才，白陪着挨打受骂的。从此后也可怜见些才好。”',
    hash='sha256:6d3b5175aad46d574fe9016d266d5ad0de8dcbc8a1e9d3385c4a88979e160d0d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2152',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=284,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=58659,
    end_offset=58664,
    text_slice='宝玉笑道：',
    hash='sha256:4010737831077115327a930fc031b5caa442f6aca950d1b4be97c2a32a759b5c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2153',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=284,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=58664,
    end_offset=58681,
    text_slice='“好哥哥，你别委曲，我明儿请你。”',
    hash='sha256:4331c8aaa1610a4b147637ee153232ccea9570d0f029c68b2308437a15951de9'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2154',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=284,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=58681,
    end_offset=58685,
    text_slice='李贵道：',
    hash='sha256:fc98fd5bbd4507998e2a656e4ff410d21c54849ddbde2d6879dfd93e8f6467e5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2155',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=284,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=58685,
    end_offset=58709,
    text_slice='“小祖宗，谁敢望你请！只求你听一两句话就有了。”',
    hash='sha256:a157f6eb8b45ca9bef5c9c619e5fea8c0c91043c9accb1ec17dbb2b70088f961'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2156',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=284,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=58709,
    end_offset=58737,
    text_slice='说着，又至贾母这边，秦钟早已来候了，贾母正和他说话儿呢。',
    hash='sha256:d6da26810498b4736b32144b7405659dc9a0400329284a8b9374e26286704c7b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2157',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=284,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=58737,
    end_offset=58749,
    text_slice='于是二人见过，辞了贾母。',
    hash='sha256:be42d230b660fc873d98563f12570b6fbf922e76f27a0b6e73ca2234d6ffb258'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2158',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=284,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=58749,
    end_offset=58771,
    text_slice='宝玉忽想起未辞黛玉，因又忙至黛玉房中来作辞。',
    hash='sha256:c9cc62e48f7408cafa0e47b6dfc657695ca31cc4aafc70f1bcf3936e170e1081'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2159',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=284,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=58797,
    end_offset=58825,
    text_slice='“好，这一去，可定是要‘蟾宫折桂’去了。我不能送你了。”',
    hash='sha256:1702af59a56083b0dd4a760fef074c45c4459136482737b10c78fe5c03b33894'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2160',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=284,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=58825,
    end_offset=58829,
    text_slice='宝玉道：',
    hash='sha256:10c9e1a43f0e2e5bf2e54f50fb3dbede512eb436326aec72d14625e62153e9b0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2161',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=284,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=58829,
    end_offset=58858,
    text_slice='“好妹妹，等我下了学再吃晚饭。那胭脂膏子，也等我来再制。”',
    hash='sha256:05c03ec20adcc90bdbecedd14559008643daa307be31bb7b6ae24e480da2b6e4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2162',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=284,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=58858,
    end_offset=58870,
    text_slice='唠叨了半日，方撤身去了。',
    hash='sha256:971d12216c3ac2bdc85477c468b0968370ed85b733d57e015837e892b1cf4499'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2163',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=284,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=58880,
    end_offset=58895,
    text_slice='“你怎么不去辞辞你宝姐姐呢？”',
    hash='sha256:98cc3dcabcfba433e529575f1d72f30fab454334dadc1376f60cd6cd0001e77f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2164',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=284,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=58895,
    end_offset=58912,
    text_slice='宝玉笑而不答，一径同秦钟上学去了。',
    hash='sha256:e6a21e1e546724ef825d0fd8b865825ac6f7603464eaead1be9517bdb9ff71b4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2165',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=285,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=58914,
    end_offset=58935,
    text_slice='原来这贾家之义学，离此不远，不过一里之遥。',
    hash='sha256:45345a67c861f0ee4c7087142fd7460dfb582f5aaa4a5a0d24bd74b3ae498ea0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2166',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=285,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=58935,
    end_offset=58963,
    text_slice='原系始祖所立，恐族中子弟有贫穷不能请师者，即入此中肄业。',
    hash='sha256:0d4c0f7ddf3fa00cfefb2b2dfced2ff0f67d77e3bf7c6a4718b2e557c6469bde'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2167',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=285,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=58963,
    end_offset=58993,
    text_slice='凡族中有官爵之人，皆有供给银两，按俸之多寡帮助，为学中之费。',
    hash='sha256:f2df885558168f31909fda45a51bb495f24b230d7887a61c201229c47c0d4877'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2168',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=285,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=58993,
    end_offset=59013,
    text_slice='特共举年高有德之人为塾掌，专为训课子弟。',
    hash='sha256:b6afba7815593796ec97c0d45bc7c5c166913471c2e2a4da77adeec18628e010'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2169',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=285,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=59013,
    end_offset=59038,
    text_slice='如今宝、秦二人来了，一一的都互相拜见过，读起书来。',
    hash='sha256:3c6639e1b187e76193b2e40a6f735bb700b48e2c5367d5bfe99f7b459328aa94'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2170',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=285,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=59038,
    end_offset=59059,
    text_slice='自此后，二人同来同往，同坐同起，愈加亲密。',
    hash='sha256:6aefd0e917b60cbecbcc9c2e99166e3b72cbd2a05efa892a461b7ccec3e63345'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2171',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=285,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=59059,
    end_offset=59092,
    text_slice='又兼贾母爱惜，也时常留下秦钟，住上三天五夜，与自己的重孙一般疼爱。',
    hash='sha256:efb07ea97f852adba123644104e1de80bcf94cd88cf523b5f8d269f4fabb0fb9'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2172',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=285,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=59092,
    end_offset=59110,
    text_slice='因见秦钟不甚宽裕，又助他些衣履等物。',
    hash='sha256:25ee14278a6133aa50f3c9e10ec0c4ea9008317d07470fa47d5f3a7a9e12a38e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2173',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=285,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=59110,
    end_offset=59127,
    text_slice='不上一月之工，秦钟在荣府便熟惯了。',
    hash='sha256:78b271a26621b6a0ae345152ef5a68be7c35ea41ef27266abc5e8c4a8a1cb0bf'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2174',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=285,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=59163,
    end_offset=59197,
    text_slice='“咱俩人一样的年纪，况又同窗，以后不必论叔侄，只论弟兄朋友就是了。”',
    hash='sha256:a0ec495a5b2d45b1c1b6c8383ebc711355038bf0af79c9884130ad45b30d3fbd'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2175',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=285,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=59197,
    end_offset=59215,
    text_slice='先是秦钟不肯，当不得宝玉不依，只叫他',
    hash='sha256:28dfca40ee0d3b071d2266612d3ce5d694720c260dc2e171473ac4205056a2c5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2176',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=285,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=59215,
    end_offset=59219,
    text_slice='“兄弟”',
    hash='sha256:3bed91eca2a980609eab975a7394e700c47c3a07f3df3081863d75175d7e76c3'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2177',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=285,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=59219,
    end_offset=59226,
    text_slice='，或叫他的表字',
    hash='sha256:7af79dd6af9627f2869090b04e3be54231d18aa6b6b9f8d12c47795ba48c81f9'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2178',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=285,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=59226,
    end_offset=59230,
    text_slice='“鲸卿”',
    hash='sha256:96182502c187579ed29ec3fac5b5f06d8fe45f5d2d8df4f992dc6112bf8df8e0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2179',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=285,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=59230,
    end_offset=59243,
    text_slice='，秦钟也只得混着乱叫起来。',
    hash='sha256:edc1be547ccd703e05cb19dd9a9a03810b7763d1e75e4a5c7e29f9ed3e1d3779'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2180',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=286,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=59245,
    end_offset=59283,
    text_slice='原来这学中虽都是本族人丁与些亲戚的子弟，俗语说得好：“一龙生九种，种种各别。',
    hash='sha256:246531c5f13eefc1fe495c1a29072c9f39db6926e45461520b88ebe2850bea82'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2181',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=286,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=59283,
    end_offset=59304,
    text_slice='”未免人多了，就有龙蛇混杂，下流人物在内。',
    hash='sha256:905ca5557c34f01f890e0a442c02f2ca0bba9b3739fbd7e50e0711c808d399d0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2182',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=286,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=59304,
    end_offset=59378,
    text_slice='自宝、秦二人来了，都生得花朵一般模样，又见秦钟腼腆温柔，未语面先红，怯怯羞羞，有女儿之风；宝玉又是天生成惯能作小服低，赔身下气，性情体贴，话语绵缠。',
    hash='sha256:4b2d7aea16e089102980f13340376b97c89479ce5e8661616c048e598848447a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2183',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=286,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=59378,
    end_offset=59420,
    text_slice='因此二人更加亲厚，也怨不得那起同窗人起了疑，背地里你言我语，诟谇谣诼，布满书房内外。',
    hash='sha256:9e687c43db14a08cb212c349e1ba9473191d3909af035f7ff49685b52fb1c170'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2184',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=287,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=59422,
    end_offset=59461,
    text_slice='原来薛蟠自来王夫人处住后，便知有一家学，学中广有青年子弟，不免偶动了龙阳之兴。',
    hash='sha256:66524d85adf81b2ca8be4b572001b654a979313cd97847efb4654d85f3d20f0f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2185',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=287,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=59461,
    end_offset=59515,
    text_slice='因此，也假说来上学读书，不过是三日打鱼，两日晒网，白送些束修礼物与贾代儒，却不曾有一些进益，只图结交些契弟。',
    hash='sha256:cb4edb52c561708a31c1599cd113cf354066a9620ebd38669951cdc92eda3e9a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2186',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=287,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=59515,
    end_offset=59552,
    text_slice='谁想这学内就有好几个小学生，图了薛蟠的银钱吃穿，被他哄上手的，也不消多记。',
    hash='sha256:1720fd41428629578d087d30062eb8a1be7e9b31a7775b848bcd099b297ab52b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2187',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=287,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=59605,
    end_offset=59609,
    text_slice='“香怜”',
    hash='sha256:6a1e15b95bb04f2cecb7de195ea9cf954d6e5fb3283d1fbc1775573ad857e229'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2188',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=287,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=59609,
    end_offset=59612,
    text_slice='，一号',
    hash='sha256:ec0ba45071d6f6d1d1696e60591cfa8a2a2b480ef3f2228c7a96ffa8628b6334'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2189',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=287,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=59612,
    end_offset=59616,
    text_slice='“玉爱”',
    hash='sha256:10d6859637a76092f8810fc9bb762a3671caca6d7cffbef45bc42d1c325f54b6'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2190',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=287,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=59617,
    end_offset=59650,
    text_slice='虽都有窃慕之意、将不利于孺子之心，只是都惧薛蟠的威势，不敢来沾惹。',
    hash='sha256:bc27d8c7fbffeb62e5fdec0e14a3b8dbc0f5d2d4e0c9011eb73018b68bb9aebd'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2191',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=287,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=59650,
    end_offset=59691,
    text_slice='如今宝、秦二人一来，见了他两个，也不免绻缱羡慕，亦因知系薛蟠相知，故未敢轻举妄动。',
    hash='sha256:df73dad595e67c51f5805cdaad9be43708bd1c337ee92df8d0b8a07cd5ed4634'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2192',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=287,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=59691,
    end_offset=59710,
    text_slice='香、玉二人心中，也一般的留情与宝、秦。',
    hash='sha256:6400eeddc2b95bc9fab0ff963194598e7e7da99abcd6ab70c1f2e706d03eaed7'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2193',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=287,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=59710,
    end_offset=59727,
    text_slice='因此，四人心中虽有情意，只未发迹。',
    hash='sha256:fbe2e5be64565bc86b260c2e6d33b5b6158742c316dbe796199d1dda6f5aeec4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2194',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=287,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=59727,
    end_offset=59772,
    text_slice='每日一入学中，四处各坐，却八目勾留，或设言托意，或咏桑寓柳，遥以心照，却外面自为避人眼目。',
    hash='sha256:adcf806a8610947c78b6916525e427d1006db6bf2b1aa5df6b874bc02b9bd1ea'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2195',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=287,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=59772,
    end_offset=59809,
    text_slice='不意偏又有几个滑贼，看出形景来，都背后挤眉弄眼，或咳嗽扬声，这也非止一日。',
    hash='sha256:6e24fa1a84fdbb53c23d1cdf6b7b9ec5b2941c2d61b372a02e83657f58391e89'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2196',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=288,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=59811,
    end_offset=59850,
    text_slice='可巧这日代儒有事，早已回家去了，只留下一句七言对联，命学生对了，明日再来上书。',
    hash='sha256:b3895774bf6ea19915730bbe431b01ab2d72ffe2139ea38f97159274315bb26f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2197',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=288,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=59850,
    end_offset=59867,
    text_slice='将学中之事，又命长孙贾瑞暂且管理。',
    hash='sha256:d6d7c12a30a5ac250de6d13cdc4b2aee73a0377bcc58ac694a39a8993cb7cd05'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2198',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=288,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=59867,
    end_offset=59914,
    text_slice='妙在薛蟠如今不大来学中应卯了，因此秦钟趁此和香怜挤眉使暗号，二人假装出小恭，走至后院说梯己话。',
    hash='sha256:b7ccf9fdd773078415bcb8b8a58273d9c554b4615476d12d99eb12d8d4873752'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2199',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=288,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=59920,
    end_offset=59936,
    text_slice='“家里的大人可管你交朋友不管？”',
    hash='sha256:3c75e6ef129ce35d074f34ff98e45b2ad1db5bb019845dde929e03a43677105f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2200',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=288,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=59936,
    end_offset=59951,
    text_slice='一语未了，只听背后咳嗽了一声。',
    hash='sha256:7f2049240a15a45076c6e8d96ebb353b91493003117b3a8d21376d7faf060b84'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2201',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=288,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=59951,
    end_offset=59971,
    text_slice='二人吓得忙回头看时，原来是窗友名金荣者。',
    hash='sha256:5555ef76821b37f587440412dad3d0d1bb47d0828c4967dd44042b29e1b233e4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2202',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=288,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=59989,
    end_offset=60008,
    text_slice='“你咳嗽什么？难道不许我们说话不成？”',
    hash='sha256:d4ab7c867c933cc44c09fdc1355bac67c4fd916f5481cca2b77681115c4fe8c5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2203',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=288,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=60008,
    end_offset=60013,
    text_slice='金荣笑道：',
    hash='sha256:d373d7a856b8488a626096fdf436e684ce7cb4df8dbeb642e229bae4f817951e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2204',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=288,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=60013,
    end_offset=60099,
    text_slice='“许你们说话，难道不许我咳嗽不成？我只问你们：有话不明说，谁许你们这样鬼鬼祟祟的干什么故事？我可也拿住了，还赖什么！先得让我抽个头儿，咱们一声儿不言语，不然大家就奋起来。”',
    hash='sha256:75aff9302be46ba3fd34760809d2679c54e1a28abf727a8ae30bc0d623a88580'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2205',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=288,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=60099,
    end_offset=60115,
    text_slice='秦、香二人急得飞红了脸，便问道：',
    hash='sha256:518ac5ae757e911d25278047d0922f0793bdba7cfdd0660586ee2d2fe55b424a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2206',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=288,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=60115,
    end_offset=60124,
    text_slice='“你拿住什么了？”',
    hash='sha256:20efb0682035f075e8cd9a72e1634d6e894955b29071707b2d136a66607e7a82'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2207',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=288,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=60124,
    end_offset=60129,
    text_slice='金荣笑道：',
    hash='sha256:d373d7a856b8488a626096fdf436e684ce7cb4df8dbeb642e229bae4f817951e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2208',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=288,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=60129,
    end_offset=60140,
    text_slice='“我现拿住了是真的。”',
    hash='sha256:f072ca709e6240259790422578d184decd33cf5fd980417433a34bb483dec960'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2209',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=288,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=60140,
    end_offset=60151,
    text_slice='说着，又拍着手笑嚷道：',
    hash='sha256:cf8164b076f0c4aa76528241f633b375082d0c68b6e13f384033081a36fb50e0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2210',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=288,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=60151,
    end_offset=60169,
    text_slice='“贴的好烧饼！你们都不买一个吃去？”',
    hash='sha256:2be267adffd103d73b3f1c7beacb76a654d2629c2f776a144c8adad387e311d8'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2211',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=288,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=60169,
    end_offset=60200,
    text_slice='秦钟、香怜二人又气又急，忙进来向贾瑞前告金荣，无故欺负他两个。',
    hash='sha256:4f2d057f58c22ed3e77b618ebcf2908d453693a72cd0b1a96cfc5c8ac58324a1'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2212',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=289,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=60202,
    end_offset=60277,
    text_slice='原来这贾瑞最是个图便宜，没行止的人，每在学中以公报私，勒索子弟们请他；后又附助着薛蟠图些银钱酒肉，一任薛蟠横行霸道，他不但不去管约，反助纣为虐讨好儿。',
    hash='sha256:43d427cad49640fa376cfc3c33fb670880b982b5ef550fab9afe2c879cbcb729'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2213',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=289,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=60277,
    end_offset=60318,
    text_slice='偏那薛蟠本是浮萍心性，今日爱东，明日爱西，近来又有了新朋友，把香、玉二人丢开一边。',
    hash='sha256:9b6c706cc586e97c8857d299765b083ccfc709105d6a5aa079a10cd864202a59'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2214',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=289,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=60318,
    end_offset=60346,
    text_slice='就连金荣亦是当日的好朋友，自有了香、玉二人，便弃了金荣。',
    hash='sha256:5b77be7dd29326ff711b244fd24d6c95597ebb877c42ff862c28f55567fa001f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2215',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=289,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=60346,
    end_offset=60357,
    text_slice='近日连香、玉亦已见弃。',
    hash='sha256:252228cfb5ba02a8c6cd9425ad4cd2472681ebccc561c1c989e1ba46ee30ffe5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2216',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=289,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=60357,
    end_offset=60370,
    text_slice='故贾瑞便无了提携帮衬之人。',
    hash='sha256:faff377b9776d3af9b09bfbf30e1b9f4aa0eb1e42f7fffa7ce929ce615a1020a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2217',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=289,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=60370,
    end_offset=60418,
    text_slice='他不说薛蟠得新弃旧，只怨香、玉二人不在薛蟠前提携帮补他，因此贾瑞、金荣等一干人，正在醋妒他两个。',
    hash='sha256:1da845a51116dd1d3f193f76e11afb773f1b6dda2551d8bf29865217100387c8'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2218',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=289,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=60418,
    end_offset=60471,
    text_slice='今见秦、香二人来告金荣，贾瑞心中便不自在起来，虽不好呵叱秦钟，却拿着香怜作法，反说他多事，着实抢白了几句。',
    hash='sha256:4d30a0bd109f6d6ce75f1c3ace1d48519d77159d70c8274640fa528589e1cc7b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2219',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=289,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=60471,
    end_offset=60493,
    text_slice='香怜反讨了没趣，连秦钟也讪讪的各归坐位去了。',
    hash='sha256:8e77e2c66ba71cbc7c50b4cf6246ba5fe0e36e7af0557b795ac918e895e71da0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2220',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=289,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=60493,
    end_offset=60540,
    text_slice='金荣越发得了意，摇头咂嘴的，口内还说许多闲话，玉爱偏又听了不忿，两个人隔座咕咕唧唧的角起口来。',
    hash='sha256:fc43c066a81809580ef0605a7103c57dc1f9ba6f641e91ef3ec2de302e6414f8'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2221',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=289,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=60540,
    end_offset=60596,
    text_slice='金荣只一口咬定说：“方才明明的撞见他两个在后院里亲嘴摸屁股，两个商议定了，一对一肏，撅草根儿抽长短，谁长谁先干。',
    hash='sha256:1064bd37b6b4946d499593f5c26f6a1f2f0b92e46b7c58cc16d13ae91f889f6d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2222',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=289,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=60596,
    end_offset=60614,
    text_slice='”金荣只顾得意乱说，却不防还有别人。',
    hash='sha256:0023a20d120e30dd1d55284666f0947459a770de2076ddbdbb2381d24aa4935e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2223',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=289,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=60614,
    end_offset=60624,
    text_slice='谁知早又触怒了一个。',
    hash='sha256:2203befe5eb379fa1a3f1f0cf4d8a8c2d7d98bb2321d5ef0b00937ef83adf9a1'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2224',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=289,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=60624,
    end_offset=60631,
    text_slice='你道这个是谁？',
    hash='sha256:465bd8aa9108c4b2580572839cf9ab0411c1e5876d2820a6ecdae69529cf91ed'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2225',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=290,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=60633,
    end_offset=60688,
    text_slice='原来这一个名唤贾蔷，亦系宁府中之正派玄孙，父母早亡，从小儿跟着贾珍过活，如今长了十六岁，比贾蓉生的还风流俊俏。',
    hash='sha256:a4b1cc30ab44975700c46d8fe44be4a9614b9f9bf73c746864bb61599791a636'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2226',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=290,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=60688,
    end_offset=60703,
    text_slice='他弟兄二人最相亲厚，常相共处。',
    hash='sha256:f96071f8b9759f134a5549f6fe31eab70356b5933ffc9fbc1f1994d3a5939934'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2227',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=290,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=60703,
    end_offset=60748,
    text_slice='宁府人多口杂，那些不得志的奴仆们，专能造言诽谤主人，因此，不知又有了什么小人诟谇谣诼之词。',
    hash='sha256:038241cefe25399b6933d89a46c0d3b077e127a8c299f1302874ec80d980710a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2228',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=290,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=60748,
    end_offset=60797,
    text_slice='贾珍想亦风闻得些口声不大好，自己也要避些嫌疑，如今竟分与房舍，命贾蔷搬出宁府，自去立门户过活去了。',
    hash='sha256:316310829e54cb8feeeb23dded152090a20e5fdee322e42eefc142164b8aefe5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2229',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=290,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=60797,
    end_offset=60829,
    text_slice='这贾蔷外相既美，内性又聪明，虽然应名来上学，亦不过虚掩眼目而已。',
    hash='sha256:37a981add54e9d0cac4774a52bc84d7208a1f544f2796b15b0e369ac09e9daf4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2230',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=290,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=60829,
    end_offset=60841,
    text_slice='仍是斗鸡走狗，赏花玩柳。',
    hash='sha256:2bfd97029b5850120e95c7e5d4c1c5df1423fe5c62955b09132c72440491a64d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2231',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=290,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=60841,
    end_offset=60869,
    text_slice='总恃上有贾珍溺爱，下有贾蓉匡助，因此族人谁敢来触逆于他。',
    hash='sha256:2c9a7ea28f2fe3cebcb0aa376ccc7878ff8c2c730babe98fb962b93097d056ed'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2232',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=290,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=60869,
    end_offset=60891,
    text_slice='他既和贾蓉最好，今见有人欺负秦钟，如何肯依？',
    hash='sha256:e07e9f684c2a66094dc208b8c4df8bc8e30181d713b17735f90d6935f3c4c290'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2233',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=290,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=60891,
    end_offset=60966,
    text_slice='自己要挺身出来抱不平，心中且又忖度一番，：“金荣、贾瑞一干人，都是薛大叔的相知，向日我又与薛大叔相好，倘或我一出头，他们告诉了老薛，我们岂不伤了和气？',
    hash='sha256:83b18bc2a7f1a50bf86c801be9fd3cedba2f1b72cca891a14f39e71bf5902651'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2234',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=290,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=60966,
    end_offset=60983,
    text_slice='待要不管，如此谣言，说得大家没趣。',
    hash='sha256:dc417c44c689fba304f12d0d1937d44702c8de3e9e2337591d5a6d32059dc498'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2235',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=290,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=60983,
    end_offset=61004,
    text_slice='如今何不用计制伏，又止息口声，又不伤脸面？',
    hash='sha256:bd663b9ce2d66058f01a2b192edde5bf5032d1afe881cebb19b98d5e71e61913'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2236',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=290,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=61004,
    end_offset=61050,
    text_slice='”想毕，也装作出小恭，走至外面，悄悄把跟宝玉的书童名唤茗烟者唤到身边，如此这般，调拨他几句。',
    hash='sha256:bcd88c865b3263d7e2abbf53e218f01f0fbca2567eb5b6fd93154409bf5c0d0b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2237',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=291,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=61052,
    end_offset=61119,
    text_slice='这茗烟乃是宝玉第一个得用的，且又年轻不谙世事，如今听贾蔷说金荣如此欺负秦钟，连他的爷宝玉都干连在内，不给他个利害，下次越发狂纵难制了。',
    hash='sha256:d518d01d9438ec01768efe46283c15ac1ab89322f53c6e32b47a5793bf0cf253'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2238',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=291,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=61119,
    end_offset=61154,
    text_slice='这茗烟无故就要欺压人的，如今听了这话，又有贾蔷助着，便一头进来找金荣。',
    hash='sha256:18b191e8a0c98fe96dc3c6c611c777f8c5704137a2d8d458791212a95ed72470'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2239',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=291,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=61164,
    end_offset=61177,
    text_slice='“姓金的，你是什么东西！”',
    hash='sha256:d43ddd5521894ba17d21785ff984d77e9d3f6c069d6fc4e65e7cc16ee159c845'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2240',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=291,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=61177,
    end_offset=61200,
    text_slice='贾蔷遂跺一跺靴子，故意整整衣服，看看日影儿说：',
    hash='sha256:86cf5481a8363900c8367b43a6bf2687220d85db0c6ce301a7d6680541c656fe'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2241',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=291,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=61200,
    end_offset=61207,
    text_slice='“是时候了。”',
    hash='sha256:54ba715f180059110e6268431709ff36d1041df472e86edf0f953927ff54bebd'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2242',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=291,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=61207,
    end_offset=61221,
    text_slice='遂先向贾瑞说有事要早走一步。',
    hash='sha256:f2fce88177c6a45066204b4092a5510c263030d33dc965fc5d8d9622dc3e396e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2243',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=291,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=61221,
    end_offset=61235,
    text_slice='贾瑞不敢强他，只得随他去了。',
    hash='sha256:ad62b03ce783761a31c67d897ed7be12061f98b811e5527617ef731186b6c1c3'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2244',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=291,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=61249,
    end_offset=61310,
    text_slice='“我们肏屁股不肏，管你鸡（原字为左毛右几）巴（原字为左毛右巴）相干！横竖没肏你爹去就罢了你是好小子，出来动一动你茗大爷！”',
    hash='sha256:f8f77994f8ea8ece72344c0268a6d5b3aef6f1ee2b39de67b026ae436a57a11c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2245',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=291,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=61310,
    end_offset=61324,
    text_slice='吓得满屋中子弟都怔怔的痴望。',
    hash='sha256:12d4ba1fff3fe0aa9be89649ab87f39c9f08cb3d6f79c383fb212be104660b25'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2246',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=291,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=61330,
    end_offset=61339,
    text_slice='“茗烟不得撒野！”',
    hash='sha256:e9455a7d41025ae29cbaff44c85c324fa84905b22f1bcce09645d4c1ac5b2cfe'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2247',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=291,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=61339,
    end_offset=61348,
    text_slice='金荣气黄了脸，说：',
    hash='sha256:cca854d694dd273951a94a29413c421b056815be0ac01bbe3d91500915bb4b38'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2248',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=291,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=61348,
    end_offset=61373,
    text_slice='“反了，反了！奴才小子都敢如此，我只和你主子说。”',
    hash='sha256:486924a738550b9d58c3302920d2a63e6e4035fa955714fb376ac808db3e5d91'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2249',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=291,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=61373,
    end_offset=61386,
    text_slice='便夺手要去抓打宝玉、秦钟。',
    hash='sha256:decb0f2758cf64314435bbdbf2111afe27c9a8a5e4ccb0ffc16c6fef0a0ae18c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2250',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=291,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=61386,
    end_offset=61444,
    text_slice='尚未去时，从脑后飕的一声，早见一方砚瓦飞来，并不知系何人打来的，幸未打着，却又打在旁人的座上，这座上乃是贾兰、贾菌。',
    hash='sha256:60d210dc67542b68cbead8c97ba95442a2b53d80efc761604a30c6217fd17755'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2251',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=292,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=61446,
    end_offset=61472,
    text_slice='这贾菌亦系荣国府近派的重孙，其母亦少寡，独守着贾菌。',
    hash='sha256:d51b9c514a5f3eb3ca3af4af6e219aa075f5e2c2c9febf60ca5b2ffdd69de68e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2252',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=292,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=61472,
    end_offset=61490,
    text_slice='这贾菌与贾兰最好，所以二人同桌而坐。',
    hash='sha256:add6ef9ba3335f6926b9be162eb383e765dbe08e286a39f1b409cb8e4444462a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2253',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=292,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=61490,
    end_offset=61514,
    text_slice='谁知贾菌年纪虽小，志气最大，极是个淘气不怕人的。',
    hash='sha256:36c045c424fd5c83025378a8eec35c76d93b78f0933d2db1ebd39d164d5cd00a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2254',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=292,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=61514,
    end_offset=61579,
    text_slice='他在座上冷眼看见金荣的朋友暗助金荣，飞砚来打茗烟，偏没打着茗烟，便落在他桌上，正打在面前，将一个磁砚水壶打了个粉碎，溅了一书黑水。',
    hash='sha256:a644a59b6b17c124e77b7cc0bc69b923968f979ea07e56f963715bf0ad36a51a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2255',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=292,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=61589,
    end_offset=61606,
    text_slice='“好囚攮的们，这不都动了手了么！”',
    hash='sha256:a02148a58698ab737d44a4c87df38d5900457bcfbac0bfbb05eaac4979ca611f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2256',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=292,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=61606,
    end_offset=61621,
    text_slice='骂着，也便抓起砚砖来要打回去。',
    hash='sha256:83f16aec03f1dfd68d7d7f3f21d94e65fcecfcc0fc34ba79ad27bb591dc83abf'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2257',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=292,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=61639,
    end_offset=61652,
    text_slice='“好兄弟，不与咱们相干。”',
    hash='sha256:17f6ff29efbc565e17d1a5ebbce4aaf3e8b462cad3fa172b3bba70927bd77524'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2258',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=292,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=61652,
    end_offset=61677,
    text_slice='贾菌如何忍得住，便两手抱起书匣子来，照那边抡了去。',
    hash='sha256:9f77765a61485396de11986a42633ff1d828d1c9d3db902a68adb5419ecc5629'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2259',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=292,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=61677,
    end_offset=61705,
    text_slice='终是身小力薄，却抡到半道，至宝玉、秦钟桌案上就落了下来。',
    hash='sha256:a9d73f16fc3126b7f129e6c5206028f893963e20c366cac327d6e46b2cad828b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2260',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=292,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=61707,
    end_offset=61712,
    text_slice='"豁啷啷"',
    hash='sha256:1f3e3ab0a93815774907eaa6f2b877f7facb3b3d3e7c7387dbe0785c6ca8509d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2261',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=292,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=61712,
    end_offset=61752,
    text_slice='一声响，砸在桌上，书本、纸片、笔砚等物撒了一桌，又把宝玉的一碗茶也砸得碗碎茶流。',
    hash='sha256:739cd9c4d1416c7b1044f3c05251b42cdf49403986a31ff1f99bf35b8ad2fc4b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2262',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=292,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=61752,
    end_offset=61769,
    text_slice='贾菌便跳出来，要揪打那一个飞砚的。',
    hash='sha256:2aad85d6d72190e0798423f9074c94030d7eaf12f0ca227e61abcf377ab4715a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2263',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=292,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=61769,
    end_offset=61800,
    text_slice='金荣此时随手抓了一根毛竹大板在手，地狭人多，那里经得舞动长板。',
    hash='sha256:36ef0d844547440384908f87cc0504f43e16d3d998d2fa77fff1ff6ed30aec4b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2264',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=292,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=61812,
    end_offset=61822,
    text_slice='“你们还不来动手？”',
    hash='sha256:20da560a65c6c0ca9b56f3eab35943a28b5e1249720b1af6d535d02ee38b87b4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2265',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=292,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=61822,
    end_offset=61846,
    text_slice='宝玉还有三个小厮：一名锄药，一名扫红，一名墨雨。',
    hash='sha256:3c8003d505dc9f08ab5891597c4087fb244d87d0791a3ae1ce700b1691cb7ec9'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2266',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=292,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=61861,
    end_offset=61874,
    text_slice='“小妇养的！动了兵器了！”',
    hash='sha256:e9a149c779e9e180f67ebbb733b12961f6e6fd6cc2a8bddb3549b01f53850b3e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2267',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=292,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=61874,
    end_offset=61902,
    text_slice='墨雨遂掇起一根门闩，扫红、锄药手中都是马鞭子，蜂拥而上。',
    hash='sha256:d9257c6dd6061942af45251382e3eb2792fde963a270f5e60551501aca72a742'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2268',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=292,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=61902,
    end_offset=61929,
    text_slice='贾瑞急得拦一回这个，劝一回那个，谁听他的话，肆行大闹。',
    hash='sha256:e69f1527851a1daff5792058073e074055870d84ab21625a57d289601f73548c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2269',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=292,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=61929,
    end_offset=61978,
    text_slice='众顽童也有趁势帮着打太平拳助乐的，也有胆小藏过一边的，也有直立在桌上拍着手儿乱笑，喝着声儿叫打的。',
    hash='sha256:012d4fc88fabdd6b9d60871cc9c4ee8e1a04ab510bad81a1efbfacdcb59db0e2'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2270',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=292,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=61978,
    end_offset=61986,
    text_slice='登登间鼎沸起来。',
    hash='sha256:44fbb17e8080a577acb706951b4cca5291e333b3ab7f712b466a0de14596ba14'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2271',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=293,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=61988,
    end_offset=62017,
    text_slice='外边李贵等几个大仆人听见里边作起反来，忙都进来，一齐喝住。',
    hash='sha256:68c29a210ca5e45805a5278cd378171cb3c55b70713fb8f28f1a85c3037488d5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2272',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=293,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=62017,
    end_offset=62043,
    text_slice='问是何原故，众声不一，这一个如此说，那一个又如彼说。',
    hash='sha256:413d0ae6d6562cf9927c9b40ca74f36835097666cc2c5d6762dd15c03d349ee8'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2273',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=293,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=62043,
    end_offset=62062,
    text_slice='李贵且喝骂了茗烟等四个一顿，撵了出去。',
    hash='sha256:8fd3bf1be5e6b47f001d00276896236ca9ca02ddf430b8ef5c3ef6ba86625be9'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2274',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=293,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=62107,
    end_offset=62241,
    text_slice='“收书！拉马来，我去回太爷去！我们被人欺负了，不敢说别的，守礼来告诉瑞大爷，瑞大爷反倒派我们的不是，听着人家骂我们，还调唆他们打我们。茗烟见人欺负我，他岂有不为我的？他们反打伙儿打了茗烟，连秦钟的头也打破了，这还在这里念什么书！茗烟他也是为有人欺侮我的。不如散了罢。”',
    hash='sha256:1f01bb1d690a89efbfb7e3141e339a0a18654826dbfe797a95ec7c4fb7564f83'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2275',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=293,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=62241,
    end_offset=62246,
    text_slice='李贵劝道：',
    hash='sha256:26058b9210e682f00c8e09fc5c93c2858e8cb891c3556175dac4f410f3b51214'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2276',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=293,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=62246,
    end_offset=62383,
    text_slice='“哥儿不要性急。太爷既有事回家去了，这会子为这点子事去聒噪他老人家，倒显得咱们没理似的。依我的主意，那里的事情那里了结，何必惊动老人家。这都是瑞大爷的不是，太爷不在这里，你老人家就是这学里的头脑了，众人看你行事。众人有了不是，该打的打，该罚的罚，如何等闹到这步田地还不管？”',
    hash='sha256:eadd8ff3a522132df678460f08096969003093a8b0e919c061857d8eff73fbe5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2277',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=293,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=62383,
    end_offset=62387,
    text_slice='贾瑞道：',
    hash='sha256:83fe90dd541fa90fb903ac71eee5c92dcb1a75ae02bbc6092706747967eadac9'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2278',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=293,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=62387,
    end_offset=62397,
    text_slice='“我吆喝着都不听。”',
    hash='sha256:9733ef954ae3eb6594f766747f56ad7ed85556270a08705f70a6126b67a4491b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2279',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=293,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=62397,
    end_offset=62402,
    text_slice='李贵笑道：',
    hash='sha256:2a25be88d7498a7d9de2944337de2cf058ca4c1b367230f32d9b244e0bdd6f3b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2280',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=293,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=62402,
    end_offset=62469,
    text_slice='“不怕你老人家恼我，素日你老人家到底有些不正经，所以这些兄弟才不听。就闹到太爷跟前去，连你老人家也脱不过的。还不快作主意撕罗开了罢！”',
    hash='sha256:7189f5b191f9ad3bc2de7539fd4b18fe7b423e51d716784d0ca32047bfccd98d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2281',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=293,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=62469,
    end_offset=62473,
    text_slice='宝玉道：',
    hash='sha256:10c9e1a43f0e2e5bf2e54f50fb3dbede512eb436326aec72d14625e62153e9b0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2282',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=293,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=62473,
    end_offset=62487,
    text_slice='“撕罗什么？我必是回去的！”',
    hash='sha256:2dca8100ec47edf1989e8e0186fc2861e2d23b4376185d78607bfb484f9fe487'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2283',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=293,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=62487,
    end_offset=62492,
    text_slice='秦钟哭道：',
    hash='sha256:144a268a7fc9d91442a4d3f3ca442a96d9bcbb2434a932e642c37191d50cc44c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2284',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=293,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=62492,
    end_offset=62508,
    text_slice='“有金荣，我是不在这里念书的。”',
    hash='sha256:40e9d0572f3c1cc85964cbc40158646a520c403d38be4e46309a2fa20a630b61'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2285',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=293,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=62508,
    end_offset=62512,
    text_slice='宝玉道：',
    hash='sha256:10c9e1a43f0e2e5bf2e54f50fb3dbede512eb436326aec72d14625e62153e9b0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2286',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=293,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=62512,
    end_offset=62549,
    text_slice='“这是为什么？难道有人家来得，咱们倒来不得？我必回明白众人，撵了金荣去。”',
    hash='sha256:444dc197361a180e1f3607fee96fb270860d961d6cccdcac222f04cc88442804'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2287',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=293,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=62549,
    end_offset=62554,
    text_slice='又问李贵：',
    hash='sha256:f3d9b97e74245a371ec7f563110be80ee8fcbaf01fee2e4011be8c65d80eb20f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2288',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=293,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=62554,
    end_offset=62566,
    text_slice='“金荣是那一房的亲戚？”',
    hash='sha256:a847a9c212520af9f5c5f720047380bdc4b024a9d2819c94615e8e5afddcbe82'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2289',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=293,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=62566,
    end_offset=62573,
    text_slice='李贵想一想道：',
    hash='sha256:4c172699d65719f0e1e8b12c471ff494e3c125061b782b35d5e30665a8316455'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2290',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=293,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=62573,
    end_offset=62601,
    text_slice='“也不用问了。若说起哪一房的亲戚，更伤了兄弟们的和气。”',
    hash='sha256:078165246c8418ae5dd7bf654052b9da2fd50df6b3d080219e2d93968ac4fe51'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2291',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=294,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=62603,
    end_offset=62610,
    text_slice='茗烟在窗外道：',
    hash='sha256:ca2c624e1604f9b02be2b035bd293a85011f598e32dc28f89a60dc9022826a33'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2292',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=294,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=62610,
    end_offset=62693,
    text_slice='“他是东胡同子里璜大奶奶的侄儿。哪是什么硬正仗腰子的，也来唬我们！璜大奶奶是他姑娘。你那姑妈只会打旋磨子，给我们琏二奶奶跪着借当头。我眼里就看不起他那样的主子奶奶！”',
    hash='sha256:aafd981abf2e9a3220bfd8acb26f6557fb1e945deca90ecb53a0af7a87bc22c0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2293',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=294,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=62693,
    end_offset=62703,
    text_slice='李贵忙断喝不止，说：',
    hash='sha256:21e03db45080b07d877fdd73baaef173a322d2169c194edadd18980d03e90cb6'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2294',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=294,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=62703,
    end_offset=62721,
    text_slice='“偏你这小狗肏的知道，有这些蛆嚼！”',
    hash='sha256:76252f327e7f0bf21ef3197cbfd3222233a52b34fee6bd9b54b0ae63d7e44b09'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2295',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=294,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=62721,
    end_offset=62727,
    text_slice='宝玉冷笑道：',
    hash='sha256:530d4f338ddbdfa69cdde493020fa4a7d4509f5670b14faa54226a40d77785c1'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2296',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=294,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=62727,
    end_offset=62756,
    text_slice='“我只当是谁的亲戚，原来是璜嫂子的侄儿，我就去问问她来！”',
    hash='sha256:3a038edaed67e689f129e9c10d95a4c03cef47b923544d039aaaeacef1c73136'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2297',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=294,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=62756,
    end_offset=62762,
    text_slice='说着便要走。',
    hash='sha256:7b488721e0ef3ce90d4bc64375b4079162b195e4fd01ab24b6e4fb546e4874a5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2298',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=294,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=62762,
    end_offset=62770,
    text_slice='叫茗烟进来包书。',
    hash='sha256:e3078bea31994f277b4f435533d5739177ab690ecd5f32c52c30619533f22458'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2299',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=294,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=62781,
    end_offset=62833,
    text_slice='“爷也不用自己去见，等我去她家，就说老太太有说的话问她呢，雇上一辆车拉进去，当着老太太问她，岂不省事？”',
    hash='sha256:cd10ba1f2e8ea2a2af44d63828455426d11aee2297e3000a781094f67c306771'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2300',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=294,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=62833,
    end_offset=62839,
    text_slice='李贵忙喝道：',
    hash='sha256:9b346d13246d8cba26445bb296eab3a459241187d1ae46a101ee65da3a341f9a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2301',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=294,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=62839,
    end_offset=62925,
    text_slice='“你要死！仔细回去我好不好先捶了你，然后再回老爷、太太，就说宝玉全是你调唆的。我这里好容易劝哄好了一半，你又来生个新法子。你闹了学堂，不说变法儿压息了才是，倒要往大里闹！”',
    hash='sha256:84cf74c9b365f9781e894f8c66bfa3ba30e7f40fc4bf8ea45f23d6f917791513'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2302',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=294,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=62925,
    end_offset=62935,
    text_slice='茗烟方不敢作声儿了。',
    hash='sha256:014b53fda491c472875d7a35d34545788007117747dd9815cd700fc7078b932c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2303',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=295,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=62937,
    end_offset=62973,
    text_slice='此时，贾瑞也生恐闹大了，自己也不干净，只得委曲着来央告秦钟，又央告宝玉。',
    hash='sha256:a814bc67c84fbae14dd542f86072dcebb2cfa113149d31b27c260a91e4fcd18d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2304',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=295,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=62973,
    end_offset=62981,
    text_slice='先是他二人不肯。',
    hash='sha256:f404b0095cfded4f35ceb6230f962e7a1e10a23f2922b5c52c9c1531fc10f0ad'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2305',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=295,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=62987,
    end_offset=63006,
    text_slice='“不回去也罢了，只叫金荣赔不是便罢。”',
    hash='sha256:52f37f835e35eceac290b5147e4fae606fdd4a4b5a05781196dac71af4096d64'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2306',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=295,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=63006,
    end_offset=63041,
    text_slice='金荣先是不肯，后来禁不得贾瑞也来逼他去赔不是，李贵等只得好劝金荣，说：',
    hash='sha256:54ed254efe9fcb8ca33b4ce2630fa8f0edba09e4f7214f34a861ea718c3e83b2'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2307',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=295,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=63041,
    end_offset=63060,
    text_slice='“原是你起的端，你不这样，怎得了局？”',
    hash='sha256:3df59db7899838cf7d41deadc5be3c3d352b716151ea860ce01ea59ad61a2291'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2308',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=295,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=63060,
    end_offset=63075,
    text_slice='金荣强不过，只得与秦钟作了揖。',
    hash='sha256:5c8c15d9ea45b32898dfbe4ec7fb9803c1a9d526b7a8801d76d309015a80094e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2309',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=295,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=63075,
    end_offset=63087,
    text_slice='宝玉还不依，偏定要磕头。',
    hash='sha256:cc806fe1410923f1855611b82a605345d20ee0ea423428bb2830a057b5bfb007'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2310',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=295,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=63105,
    end_offset=63146,
    text_slice='“俗语说得好：‘杀人不过头点地。’你既惹出事来，少不得下点气儿，磕个头就完事了。”',
    hash='sha256:7769d19f91a50ef46faa49b9807993aba6d137504abd2be834b8e827c1aacd64'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2311',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=295,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=63146,
    end_offset=63162,
    text_slice='金荣无奈，只得进前来与秦钟磕头。',
    hash='sha256:ca548a54353f22add9fac2a786d47f6c7204ee3e8e838499c68ccaf63e93d292'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2312',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=295,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=63162,
    end_offset=63169,
    text_slice='且听下回分解。',
    hash='sha256:fa4a03a78c390c6b01653600f8fccafe945faf10c30c84130cd04803a156ec49'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2313',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=296,
    segment_type='heading',
    start_offset=63171,
    end_offset=63193,
    text_slice='第十回  金寡妇贪利权受辱\u3000张太医论病细穷源',
    hash='sha256:518bdeadbfd018fc30604689a2e3b17b03fe33502757a40d9ea845a20b110887'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2314',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=297,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=63195,
    end_offset=63233,
    text_slice='话说金荣因人多势众，又兼贾瑞勒令，赔了不是，给秦钟磕了头，宝玉方才不吵闹了。',
    hash='sha256:f7da51e50c4907ee8c8f1347f3ce6d6ce22ba2985750461185413a22908ac8e1'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2315',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=297,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=63233,
    end_offset=63288,
    text_slice='大家散了学，金荣回到家中，越想越气，说：“秦钟不过是贾蓉的小舅子，又不是贾家的子孙，附学读书，也不过和我一样。',
    hash='sha256:7542441aee65e1358f9a0e4b7daeb9453082e5731afb5cc5357c02bfbbc381a7'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2316',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=297,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=63288,
    end_offset=63305,
    text_slice='他因仗着宝玉和他好，他就目中无人。',
    hash='sha256:7ed6970108aca3c8df8c549214b424cf5ceb908b573d85906897d02a272c667b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2317',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=297,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=63305,
    end_offset=63325,
    text_slice='他既是这样，就该行些正经事，人也没的说。',
    hash='sha256:436087dd698b8da1dac1408406eeb99fc2201fc0bc459fe7c3e32b2ee20f75a6'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2318',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=297,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=63325,
    end_offset=63350,
    text_slice='他素日又和宝玉鬼鬼祟祟的，只当人都是瞎子，看不见。',
    hash='sha256:c74de8970649ecc9a9ad06b731b3fe02aefc45ca2a3fcd7f350dc1de80f30978'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2319',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=297,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=63350,
    end_offset=63369,
    text_slice='今日他又去勾搭人，偏偏的撞在我眼睛里。',
    hash='sha256:a9bf03133de8d95a7a6e284df178092ed8576ec14aec2343e0e65812ec0f5a16'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2320',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=297,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=63369,
    end_offset=63384,
    text_slice='就是闹出事来，我还怕什么不成？',
    hash='sha256:09480e0ec67fb9af37e7dc3af818ebe66172875fe5f533b6c0e5760e876fc84f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2321',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=298,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=63387,
    end_offset=63416,
    text_slice='他母亲胡氏听见他咕咕嘟嘟的说，因问道：“你又要争什么闲气？',
    hash='sha256:27d6bae188ada452178f94713827d7f0964dea231bba263c226f70cd2e704573'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2322',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=298,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=63416,
    end_offset=63464,
    text_slice='好容易我望你姑妈说了，你姑妈又千方百计的问他们西府里的琏二奶奶跟前说了，你才得了这个念书的地方。',
    hash='sha256:49079de719ac6d78a9a82923e3da50d2aa8414e64bfeaf3c316cdae4e27e7d55'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2323',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=298,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=63464,
    end_offset=63486,
    text_slice='若不是仗着人家，咱们家里还有力量请得起先生？',
    hash='sha256:a5cd414fe84673b8d9a4ac95091662d35409186a27899108cba0ecdb33dcd6ac'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2324',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=298,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=63486,
    end_offset=63507,
    text_slice='况且人家学里，茶也是现成的，饭也是现成的。',
    hash='sha256:ebabaf58e15053ce92651d01bed600b74b736213d9579158c2b9f1ddd0cce811'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2325',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=298,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=63507,
    end_offset=63528,
    text_slice='你这二年在那里念书，家里也省好大的嚼用呢。',
    hash='sha256:1b5b22946189f033e6ed2dbab79e367926bae4f308763feb284e885a43abc28f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2326',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=298,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=63528,
    end_offset=63543,
    text_slice='省出来的，你又爱穿件鲜明衣服。',
    hash='sha256:627384af3d91e57434de0ab640ad9f2036b74435a98d1261d63545c4304b98f5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2327',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=298,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=63543,
    end_offset=63567,
    text_slice='再者，不是因你在那里念书，你就认得什么薛大爷了？',
    hash='sha256:57aff9c5d229697262817a52e9d24f8a5b657528034793afc3485a2b8ec2a1b1'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2328',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=298,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=63567,
    end_offset=63594,
    text_slice='那薛大爷一年不给不给，这二年也帮了咱们有七八十两银子。',
    hash='sha256:9bc56107907177a332f67da64abc6180edad46f3612372c0fb56dc35f74c24df'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2329',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=298,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=63594,
    end_offset=63629,
    text_slice='你如今要闹出了这个学房，再要找这么个地方，我告诉你说罢，比登天还难呢！',
    hash='sha256:db3711cfbfc73d67d698c57e8cbbe5489c643c4f9ea073db00843d784f1ad67c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2330',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=298,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=63629,
    end_offset=63653,
    text_slice='你给我老老实实的，玩一会子睡你的觉去，好多着呢。',
    hash='sha256:52d2a719782d35af45db0e93538655567b1010012de3171224036013bf3504e3'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2331',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=298,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=63653,
    end_offset=63674,
    text_slice='”于是金荣忍气吞声，不多一时，他自去睡了。',
    hash='sha256:e91689f2f493265edf93a078dafcf7e212ea8cbe40b6d05d60a37335b979841b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2332',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=298,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=63674,
    end_offset=63683,
    text_slice='次日仍旧上学去了。',
    hash='sha256:b54baf877782f0261d01efaf1adb5d98b2f0e7388b6d789dcf08e350ab952076'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2333',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=298,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=63683,
    end_offset=63688,
    text_slice='不在话下。',
    hash='sha256:d6924045c03a7abb9192b67f99836b2b60d6a8226f1a7795692af7265875d4c7'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2334',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=299,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=63690,
    end_offset=63717,
    text_slice='且说他姑娘，原聘给的是贾家‘玉’字辈的嫡派，名唤贾璜。',
    hash='sha256:768e423d768db4c5fe81318837c865ec877e1a7f87dcbc06e004c16904cb764c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2335',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=299,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=63717,
    end_offset=63741,
    text_slice='但其族人那里皆能像宁、荣二府的富势，原不用细说。',
    hash='sha256:94fd047602eeda50f20810c5a3729043428a7726381db262d9af5cc675408958'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2336',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=299,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=63741,
    end_offset=63804,
    text_slice='这贾璜夫妻，守着些小的产业，又时常到宁、荣二府里去请请安，又会奉承凤姐儿并尤氏，所以凤姐、尤氏也时常资助资助他，方能如此度日。',
    hash='sha256:61c67c4b15cefcda4755cd7bb0f4eb640d125f78299fbdf44eb3db639b3d3d70'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2337',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=300,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=63806,
    end_offset=63856,
    text_slice='却说这日贾璜之妻金氏因遇天气晴明，又值家中无事，遂带了一个婆子，坐上车，来家里走走，瞧瞧寡嫂并侄儿。',
    hash='sha256:61ebbac4a91b6ec4430ec62430fad084ec6dfbad2da290355263b10d37b3973f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2338',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=300,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=63856,
    end_offset=63898,
    text_slice='闲话之间，金荣的母亲偏提起昨日贾家学房里的那事，从头至尾，一五一十都向他小姑子说了。',
    hash='sha256:6525791c9b0210419d6f236bb48087ad9d36bef45d1ea5f85d4f79fa50bfa8bd'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2339',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=300,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=63922,
    end_offset=64021,
    text_slice='“这秦钟小崽子是贾门的亲戚，难道荣儿不是贾门的亲戚？人都别忒势利了，况且都做的是什么有脸的好事！就是宝玉，也犯不上向着他到这个地。等我去到东府瞧瞧我们珍大奶奶，再向秦钟他姐姐说说，叫她评评这个理。”',
    hash='sha256:01390ecb6f9036b6c7079cc5b39723fda9cf76f6fa4ede3fed8e812e5256d550'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2340',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=300,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=64021,
    end_offset=64042,
    text_slice='这金荣的母亲听了这话，急得了不得，忙说道：',
    hash='sha256:d349b26f7ea2d9ea157e3f3b2ca6caceae310205e7e82561de76ba3f615a79ff'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2341',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=300,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=64042,
    end_offset=64124,
    text_slice='“这都是我的嘴快，告诉了姑奶奶，求姑奶奶快别说去去，别管他们谁是谁非。倘或闹起来，怎么在那里站得住？若是站不住，家里不但不能请先生，反倒在他身上添出许多嚼用来呢。”',
    hash='sha256:2f46914d7558617d59359173971545133ed08cbdc1759657d26521f189a8d24a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2342',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=300,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=64124,
    end_offset=64134,
    text_slice='璜大奶奶听了，说道：',
    hash='sha256:33d8a1254085d5892041e7874df1ea2f400b05bed9ab7560ef974e0051d3628a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2343',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=300,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=64134,
    end_offset=64155,
    text_slice='“那里管得许多！你等我说了，看是怎么样。”',
    hash='sha256:6e7c357a2a9d003104d4de9086a85c650d7e763b00fbaa9aa63034fc94ad8240'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2344',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=300,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=64155,
    end_offset=64182,
    text_slice='也不容她嫂子劝，一面叫老婆子瞧了车，就坐上往宁府里来。',
    hash='sha256:4990729bee9468458e575dd729c0b18562f99463a0a1519804fa8a23a8170e95'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2345',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=301,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=64184,
    end_offset=64217,
    text_slice='到了宁府，进了车门，到了东边小角门前下了车，进去见了贾珍之妻尤氏。',
    hash='sha256:3ceba19833b171216270d889f200c7f9ec187b897f29c5b73d109265a46ad758'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2346',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=301,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=64242,
    end_offset=64255,
    text_slice='“今日怎么没见蓉大奶奶？”',
    hash='sha256:ec94d4915fa97253c166d01402cf225fb7eff299d98aa47c3e44a69a7cdeb7cc'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2347',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=301,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=64255,
    end_offset=64260,
    text_slice='尤氏说道：',
    hash='sha256:948c68618582760ae88e0622ea5a6cd996a015227f98f0f2d43c60967b173e69'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2348',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=301,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=64260,
    end_offset=64957,
    text_slice='“她这些日子不知怎么着，经期有两个多月没来。叫大夫瞧了，又说并不是喜。那两日，到了下半天就懒待动，话也懒待说，眼神也发眩。我说她：‘你且不必拘礼，早晚不必照例上来，你竟好生养养罢。就是有亲戚一家儿来，有我呢。就有长辈们怪你，等我替你告诉。’连蓉哥我都嘱咐了，我说：‘你不许累掯她，不许招她生气，叫她静静的养养就好了。她要想什么吃，只管到我这里取来。倘或我这里没有，只管望你琏二婶子那里要去。倘或她有个好歹，你再要娶这么一个媳妇，这么个模样儿，这么个性情的人儿，打着灯笼也没地方找去。’她这为人行事，哪个亲戚、哪个一家的长辈不喜欢她？所以我这两日好不烦心，焦得我了不得。偏偏今儿早晨她兄弟来瞧他，谁知那小孩子家不知好歹，看见他姐姐身上不大爽快，就有事也不当告诉她，别说是这么一点子小事，就是你受了一万分的委曲，也不该向她说才是。谁知他们昨儿学房里打架，不知是那里附学来的一个人欺侮了他了。里头还有些不干不净的话，都告诉了他姐姐。婶子，你是知道那媳妇的，虽则见了人有说有笑，会行事儿，她可心细，心又重，不拘听见个什么话儿，都要度量个三日五夜才罢。这病就是打这个秉性上头思虑出来的。今儿听见有人欺负了她兄弟，又是恼，又是气。恼的是那群混帐狐朋狗友的扯是搬非、调三惑四的那些个；气的是她兄弟不学好，不上心读书，以致如此学里吵闹。她听了这事，今日索性连早饭也没吃。我听见了，我方到她那边安慰了她一会子，又劝解了她兄弟一会子。我叫她兄弟到那边府里找宝玉去了。我才看着她吃了半盏燕窝汤，我才过来了。婶子，你说我心焦不心焦？况且如今又没个好大夫，我想到他这病上，我心里倒像针扎似的。你们知道有什么好大夫没有？”',
    hash='sha256:1fb5e4d666f52c374d8e7eacf44a2ef6da75e3863bf554798e8bde54cb9b05ce'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2349',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=302,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=64959,
    end_offset=65002,
    text_slice='金氏听了这半日话，把方才在她嫂子家的那一团要向秦氏论理的盛气，早吓得都丢在爪洼国去了。',
    hash='sha256:e5f1812f114e2c28fb39c9cf9bda323c62bd1e67f2ceaa5e2b836deaa8cee6e4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2350',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=302,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=65022,
    end_offset=65087,
    text_slice='“我们这么听着，实在也没听见人说有个好大夫。如今听起大奶奶这个来，定不得还是喜呢。嫂子倒别教人混治。倘或认错了，这可是了不得的！”',
    hash='sha256:ca300d8a3f7bdf7ec23e4556932d2e74d58313417d2f206294675f8fec3af988'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2351',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=302,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=65087,
    end_offset=65091,
    text_slice='尤氏道：',
    hash='sha256:a770cb189e69039a617afc79b3f86391dc741bed11673a456877bf606c7c1dd3'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2352',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=302,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=65091,
    end_offset=65098,
    text_slice='“可不是呢。”',
    hash='sha256:49522f70ca910a1c104be9a03524e1068d7ec1c8c465e01d8f3027e79661f7ba'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2353',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=302,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=65098,
    end_offset=65123,
    text_slice='正说话之间，贾珍从外进来，见了金氏，便向尤氏问道：',
    hash='sha256:6af6218631b78ef8c464d5e8b525e2adaa0579eafe57b8bc38c22bccd36fdf18'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2354',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=302,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=65123,
    end_offset=65134,
    text_slice='“这不是璜大奶奶么？”',
    hash='sha256:7a913b688c605bd3b774591736378caa1f0798cb33bff1f7a618ea11732ac0d6'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2355',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=302,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=65134,
    end_offset=65145,
    text_slice='金氏向前给贾珍请了安。',
    hash='sha256:18ea4589e86ac1f128c5b901e5ab3f88123abae64cea9fd36255baeb46127f9c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2356',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=302,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=65153,
    end_offset=65165,
    text_slice='“让这大妹妹吃了饭去。”',
    hash='sha256:52eee91be567618474dae4ca089e6cac331c4d92ddf459868906e83a75bfe16e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2357',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=302,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=65165,
    end_offset=65178,
    text_slice='贾珍说着话，就过那屋里了。',
    hash='sha256:675cc191a2dfffb51e51bed5b477aea2c2339d54a4c852458e09fa5c01797ba2'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2358',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=302,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=65178,
    end_offset=65221,
    text_slice='金氏此来，原要向秦氏说说秦钟欺负了她侄儿的事，听见秦氏有病，不但不能说，亦且不敢提了。',
    hash='sha256:c2af25ed4797154345c3ef6cfd8cfc59a542375fa8835a6d15cdc2c4ef903e8c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2359',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=302,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=65221,
    end_offset=65255,
    text_slice='况且贾珍、尤氏又待得很好，反转怒为喜的，又说了一会子话儿，方家去了。',
    hash='sha256:00e2c78e7282baeb1f0b8795af28c6eafa470a4423e413413dca47570c56ab31'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2360',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=303,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=65257,
    end_offset=65275,
    text_slice='金氏去后，贾珍方过来坐下，问尤氏道：',
    hash='sha256:9a44e75ff5ff8a1594efb2303ceca312b28f9edd6500b6d9c867a394c24121f4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2361',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=303,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=65275,
    end_offset=65291,
    text_slice='“今日她来，有什么说的事情么？”',
    hash='sha256:af492ed95fdf1b148f309eef383ff6092a289638a9c70ea61f083c5714ba86ad'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2362',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=303,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=65291,
    end_offset=65296,
    text_slice='尤氏答道：',
    hash='sha256:84c0770173cd6bd5e9d087dd8413f0a41183f3bab1a0106126f5d7c33ae6c876'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2363',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=303,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=65296,
    end_offset=65550,
    text_slice='“倒没说什么。一进来的时候，脸上倒像有些着了恼的气色似的，及说了半天话，又提起媳妇这病，她倒渐渐的气色平定了。你又叫让她吃饭，她听见媳妇这么病，也不好意思只管坐着，又说了几句闲话儿就去了，倒没有求什么事。如今且说媳妇这病，你到哪里寻个好大夫来给她瞧瞧要紧，可别耽误了！现今咱们家走的这群大夫，那里要得，一个个都是听着人的口气儿，人怎么说，他也添几句文话儿说一遍。可倒殷勤得很，三四个人一日轮流着，倒有四五遍来看脉。他们大家商量着立个方子，吃了也不见效，倒弄得一日换四五遍衣裳，坐起来见大夫，其实于病人无益。”',
    hash='sha256:e0e769c1a03742890a0787d79703f39003b39838256003bd15a283e6b41cccf6'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2364',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=303,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=65550,
    end_offset=65555,
    text_slice='贾珍说道：',
    hash='sha256:23a345d19efbb6393c6cb411d091b1002fe72377b8854373a2016389d0955967'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2365',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=303,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=65555,
    end_offset=65890,
    text_slice='“可是。这孩子也胡涂，何必脱脱换换的，倘或了凉，更添一层病，那还了得！衣裳任凭是什么好的，可又值什么！孩子的身子要紧，就是一天穿一套新的，也不值什么。我正进来要告诉你：方才冯紫英来看我，他见我有些抑郁之色，问我是怎么了。我才告诉他说，媳妇忽然身子有好大的不爽快，因为不得个好太医，断不透是喜是病，又不知有妨碍无妨碍，所以我这两日心里着实着急。冯紫英因说起他有一个幼时从学的先生，姓张名友士，学问最渊博的，更兼医理极深，且能断人的生死。今年是上京给他儿子来捐官，现在他家住着呢。这么看来，竟是合该媳妇的病在他手里除灾，亦未可知。我即刻差人拿我的名帖请去了。今日倘或天晚了不能来，明日想必一定来。况且冯紫英又即刻回家，亲自去求他，务必叫他来瞧瞧。等这个张先生来瞧了再说罢。”',
    hash='sha256:859d627f4790c0d5fe5410c6514d3c21f6684f267c44a720edcb23b0a0c39f6e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2366',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=304,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=65892,
    end_offset=65906,
    text_slice='尤氏听了，心中甚喜，因说道：',
    hash='sha256:45aff7cbb0373edfeb89cf51284f61f20e20bfc6193599d7d78870bf8afb55a0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2367',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=304,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=65906,
    end_offset=65923,
    text_slice='“后日是太爷的寿日，到底怎么办？”',
    hash='sha256:d6e3cd46655f772a0792134dbb1df7e11d6da2da397dc9a95fe3da390cf0d2a5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2368',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=304,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=65923,
    end_offset=65928,
    text_slice='贾珍说道：',
    hash='sha256:23a345d19efbb6393c6cb411d091b1002fe72377b8854373a2016389d0955967'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2369',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=304,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=65928,
    end_offset=66184,
    text_slice='“我方才到了太爷那里去请安，兼请太爷来家来受一受一家子的礼。太爷因说道：‘我是清净惯了的，我不愿意往你们那样是非场中去闹去。你们必定说是我的生日，要叫我去受众人些头，莫过你把我从前注的《阴骘文》给我叫人好好的写出来刻了，比叫我无故受众人的头还强百倍呢。倘或后日这两日一家子要来，你就在家里好好的款待他们就是了。也不必给我送什么东西来，连你后日也不必来，你要心中不安，你今日就给我磕了头去。倘或后日你要来，又跟随多少人来闹我，我必和你不依。’如此说了又说，后日我是再不敢去的了。且叫来升来，吩咐他预备两日的筵席。”',
    hash='sha256:575e3d31ce1ce5a022ef7e9ad52288b5aa7e5686083855a371d4ee34bd17ab77'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2370',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=304,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=66184,
    end_offset=66195,
    text_slice='尤氏因叫人叫了贾蓉来：',
    hash='sha256:d6a8d0abb35224ec9bc61363420a8860be28e723055e9bc8d1fb913247ea453e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2371',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=304,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=66195,
    end_offset=66298,
    text_slice='“吩咐来升照旧例预备两日的筵席，要丰丰富富的。你再亲自到西府里去请老太太，大太太，二太太和你琏二婶子来逛逛。你父亲今日又听见一个好大夫，业已打发人请去了，想必明日必来。你可将他这些日子的病症细细的告诉他。”',
    hash='sha256:5dd060f940eb64c75c05828377d4c6e89e7933b25e166c3061db4b4966501534'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2372',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=304,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=66298,
    end_offset=66309,
    text_slice='贾蓉一一的答应出去了。',
    hash='sha256:44e010d798f190faab4ec5040ab158cdc1dc5835030252912e9bde8428ad248a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2373',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=305,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=66311,
    end_offset=66361,
    text_slice='正遇着方才去冯紫英家请那先生的小子回来了，因回道：“奴才方才到了冯大爷家，拿了老爷的名帖请那先生去。',
    hash='sha256:ac7715b777cb5a7b147988c915413709565f78ae29699cafe2d33d7dda0ca372'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2374',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=305,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=66361,
    end_offset=66380,
    text_slice='那先生说道：‘方才这里大爷也向我说了。',
    hash='sha256:e9bf6c5ca1dd593886d4b188e878fe3b11dcff277e426ac1586718a24b296f3b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2375',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=305,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=66380,
    end_offset=66420,
    text_slice='但是今日拜了一天的客，才回到家，此时精神实在不能支持，就是去到府上，也不能看脉。',
    hash='sha256:c694fa4fc85a5b795a2fa8743a3e5869b2418f46be31a7e5422781ad96ca72ff'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2376',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=305,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=66420,
    end_offset=66436,
    text_slice='’他说等调息一夜，明日务必到府。',
    hash='sha256:2a30d68c57462763b188d38c354fd41c08ead107f9199d832a5171cc4598d088'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2377',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=305,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=66436,
    end_offset=66492,
    text_slice='他又说，他‘医学浅薄，本不敢当此重荐，因我们冯大爷和府上的大人既已如此说了，又不得不去，你先代我回明大人就是了。',
    hash='sha256:31bd1446b2198f3b9d914e602df12fb91eec381459f1597f6a11bdfd2eac9f50'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2378',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=305,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=66492,
    end_offset=66502,
    text_slice='大人的名帖实不敢当。',
    hash='sha256:52933e92332f363b6988629e19c2eeec487b12a26edb00800116e6031c51f69c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2379',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=305,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=66502,
    end_offset=66512,
    text_slice='’仍叫奴才拿回来了。',
    hash='sha256:a641a6364ffda72040b8e7d68524cf3543e9ad4c4722dbfcb7249a0c85ddcd14'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2380',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=305,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=66512,
    end_offset=66523,
    text_slice='哥儿替奴才回一声儿罢。',
    hash='sha256:7ffaa95fa5844f9513f214f5cb9a0085111244159ed04649749810769eef6129'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2381',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=305,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=66523,
    end_offset=66564,
    text_slice='”贾蓉复转身进去，回了贾珍、尤氏的话，方出来叫了来升来，吩咐他预备两日的筵席的话。',
    hash='sha256:a2f37298a3939b4f3bdd71b1d7b34f0417dd53700c1ec2c187ff1a238df3f097'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2382',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=305,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=66564,
    end_offset=66576,
    text_slice='来升听毕，自去照例料理。',
    hash='sha256:77966a7205d73a0def088c620ed5bdbff16d209ec8ff811611e9025eeae30b42'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2383',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=305,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=66576,
    end_offset=66581,
    text_slice='不在话下。',
    hash='sha256:d6924045c03a7abb9192b67f99836b2b60d6a8226f1a7795692af7265875d4c7'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2384',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=306,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=66583,
    end_offset=66594,
    text_slice='且说次日午间，人回道：',
    hash='sha256:4d2f5dca8f5371f8f7e32f29f01eba80b55b84c0e3b0ec2df11e0a7e28250b38'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2385',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=306,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=66594,
    end_offset=66605,
    text_slice='“请的那张先生来了。”',
    hash='sha256:0ccfa3285a360a5722a69000d9df67b3bc5b73944b49df59e803b47e4d50b040'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2386',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=306,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=66605,
    end_offset=66615,
    text_slice='贾珍遂延入大厅坐下。',
    hash='sha256:d902514d84dc7386c82a0a386955a1e9615e820c7f93a406566a6f1a6043d088'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2387',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=306,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=66623,
    end_offset=66656,
    text_slice='“昨承冯大爷示知老先生人品学问，又兼深通医学之至，小弟不胜钦仰！”',
    hash='sha256:5458f6f9f503d668d8f2c4729219f6a2975bd0ddc2c83c7a8e3ea87e78d15431'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2388',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=306,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=66656,
    end_offset=66661,
    text_slice='张先生道：',
    hash='sha256:2c12be820d0152cca057ab37228bf3b34b42551c6c0033627d5eaa191b6fa779'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2389',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=306,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=66661,
    end_offset=66714,
    text_slice='“晚生粗鄙下士，本知见浅陋。昨因冯大爷示知，大人家第谦恭下士，又承呼唤，敢不奉命。但毫无实学，倍增颜汗。”',
    hash='sha256:0115118839ef749d9adee3e0855449db399624bb2b608a07578e630ba68a01ea'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2390',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=306,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=66714,
    end_offset=66718,
    text_slice='贾珍道：',
    hash='sha256:f8a8aedd2ce9740ac4855922a831abf328af70a340beca97664f0fbd7e28f010'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2391',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=306,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=66718,
    end_offset=66748,
    text_slice='“先生何必过谦。就请先生进去看看儿妇，仰仗高明，以释下怀。”',
    hash='sha256:ea7f5c226e71039d5bd89a45f89584a1857dc06f3b0651f271ed3de2923b6491'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2392',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=307,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=66750,
    end_offset=66760,
    text_slice='于是，贾蓉同了进去。',
    hash='sha256:b7a0a2f1b07e477bff318cffc80317b52527fc6cd5b7652c33fabe1b5e5ba55b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2393',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=307,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=66778,
    end_offset=66788,
    text_slice='“这就是尊夫人了？”',
    hash='sha256:a81ff5c7059f2d1073a935bd418e0756e3e7bb4905400b875b3cd29cc015c6ac'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2394',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=307,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=66788,
    end_offset=66792,
    text_slice='贾蓉道：',
    hash='sha256:9d929f43885abe4aff1a05b3791ed0df40e139d8351539fc7a58d2639d3f2a17'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2395',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=307,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=66792,
    end_offset=66819,
    text_slice='“正是。请先生坐下，让我把贱内的病说一说再看脉如何？”',
    hash='sha256:30713c76e8f3f4d3ac1ce733b7b6e7e1e0a6bae94e3273a80d6f8487d3182806'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2396',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=307,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=66819,
    end_offset=66824,
    text_slice='那先生道：',
    hash='sha256:2b20f35c9b0714ae400d19a7ed9f707c0ea186c6066662537cd8ac6cafbba378'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2397',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=307,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=66824,
    end_offset=66939,
    text_slice='“依小弟的意思，竟先看过脉，再说的为是。我是初造尊府的，本也不晓得什么，但是我们冯大爷务必叫小弟过来看看，小弟所以不得不来。如今看了脉息，看小弟说得是不是，再将这些日子的病势讲一讲，大家斟酌一个方儿，可用不可用，那时大爷再定夺。”',
    hash='sha256:4e0956be8fb458c2dbad2fe5d798ced2b39c8a611fefc265e7ae1c52c134dd49'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2398',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=307,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=66939,
    end_offset=66943,
    text_slice='贾蓉道：',
    hash='sha256:9d929f43885abe4aff1a05b3791ed0df40e139d8351539fc7a58d2639d3f2a17'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2399',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=307,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=66943,
    end_offset=66985,
    text_slice='“先生实在高明，如今恨相见之晚。就请先生看一看脉息，可治不可治，以便使家父母放心。”',
    hash='sha256:18d1efda1affcc367b16e4941ba168cea43ae3ab2c760b8cb71ed1a981bb4b86'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2400',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=307,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=66985,
    end_offset=67020,
    text_slice='于是家下媳妇们捧过大迎枕来，一面给秦氏靠着，一面拉着袖口，露出手腕来。',
    hash='sha256:8205c6195bd93e1d8ea28e07d8f54b4dd95d7b989cb81f9c75f168051649c181'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2401',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=307,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=67020,
    end_offset=67060,
    text_slice='先生方伸手按在右手脉上，调息了至数，宁神细诊了半刻的工夫；方换过左手，亦复如是。',
    hash='sha256:3e9cdd9a3378e57b3dcf39fa3164569c434150c9d2da11b637aa6e44141ece9c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2402',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=307,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=67068,
    end_offset=67077,
    text_slice='“我们外边坐罢。”',
    hash='sha256:d2c413c433433db28ff11fee440b9ab3b53cd4db3a252765afb4e10df42cb3da'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2403',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=308,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=67079,
    end_offset=67105,
    text_slice='贾蓉于是同先生到外边屋里炕上坐了，一个婆子端了茶来。',
    hash='sha256:188da091df28f96274940beefd336d4110cf14f76a5652b2664c665fd7dde9b7'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2404',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=308,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=67109,
    end_offset=67116,
    text_slice='“先生请茶。”',
    hash='sha256:c73127d299cf5adf5b8140fbc5d79cd27181a612d3adb92413c2c3240f819db6'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2405',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=308,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=67116,
    end_offset=67129,
    text_slice='于是陪先生吃了茶，遂问道：',
    hash='sha256:dd18dcf190647369efddf767e3bedb9b2a2659e3e67090846247e74e67483aea'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2406',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=308,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=67129,
    end_offset=67145,
    text_slice='“先生看这脉息，还治得治不得？”',
    hash='sha256:e43149b31df02aa0e29d127fcfdd502874ee6e20d120c9e8c956c71c32e1c381'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2407',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=308,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=67145,
    end_offset=67149,
    text_slice='先生道：',
    hash='sha256:e87de64b9f5922de4d71b4744048de96c47215642619c8399764dc6aa3e7606a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2408',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=308,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=67149,
    end_offset=67380,
    text_slice='“看得尊夫人这脉息：左寸沉数，左关沉伏；右寸细而无力，右关需而无神。其左寸沉数者，乃心气虚而生火；左关沉伏者，乃肝家气滞血亏。右寸细而无力者，乃肺经气分太虚；右关需而无神者，乃脾土被肝木克制。心气虚而生火者，应现经期不调，夜间不寐。肝家血亏气滞者，必然肋下疼胀，月信过期，心中发热。肺经气分太虚者，头目不时眩晕，寅卯间必然自汗，如坐舟中。脾土被肝木克制者，必然不思饮食，精神倦怠，四肢酸软。据我看，这脉息应当有这些症候才对。或以这个脉为喜脉，则小弟不敢闻命矣。”',
    hash='sha256:601db612c1242f7afb718405789babbb0e0c2bab74ebee864bb799bd2eb12255'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2409',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=308,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=67380,
    end_offset=67393,
    text_slice='旁边一个贴身伏侍的婆子道：',
    hash='sha256:0193778117f4ab1075f8056ac27e7a7256deacc180bf74dee2b53781ee38a532'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2410',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=308,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=67393,
    end_offset=67497,
    text_slice='“何尝不是这样呢。真正先生说的如神，倒不用我们告诉了。如今我们家里现有好几位太医老爷瞧着呢，都不能说得这么当真切。有一位说是喜，有一位说是病；这位说不相干，那位说怕冬至，总没有个准话儿。求老爷明白指示指示。”',
    hash='sha256:2acfe55a0b6fc6a71e1a1741bc45171003ee93a74fef0d1806beff16884df7d5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2411',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=309,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=67499,
    end_offset=67505,
    text_slice='那先生笑道：',
    hash='sha256:15c3916e68a8fcaff9a7199d9f4e45222a351d199d23c3940ef81b6879096dfd'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2412',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=309,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=67505,
    end_offset=67726,
    text_slice='“大奶奶这个症候，可是那几位耽搁了。要在初次行经的时后就用药治起来，不但断无今日之患，而且此时已全愈了。如今既是把病耽误到这个地位，也是应有此灾。依我看来，这病尚有三分治得。吃了我这药看，若是夜间睡得着觉，那时又添了二分拿手了。据我看这脉息：大奶奶是个心性高强，聪明不过的人；但聪明太过，则不如意事常有；不如意事常有，则思虑太过。此病是忧虑伤脾，肝木忒旺，经血所以不能按时而至。大奶奶从前的行经的日子问一问，断不是常缩，必是常长的。是不是？”',
    hash='sha256:8d4ed589b2ad2be0cb73f9b380bc3f51c742d159039dc749f1cc91b6008e036b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2413',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=309,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=67726,
    end_offset=67732,
    text_slice='这婆子答道：',
    hash='sha256:4a9ef4d6c433f03e3ba5194f7eb3bcbd44b5f42837cbb3c71a3fa427fc2be082'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2414',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=309,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=67732,
    end_offset=67760,
    text_slice='“可不是，从没有缩过，或是长两日三日，以至十日都长过。”',
    hash='sha256:2c12a2cb04be3b848124ece87272a2489558c402fcac589f91b857461fa870a9'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2415',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=309,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=67760,
    end_offset=67766,
    text_slice='先生听了道：',
    hash='sha256:6f7fa725c9d1a20dea089825ac35588fe4827fb540e8911cd7edce617e85603c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2416',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=309,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=67766,
    end_offset=67821,
    text_slice='“妙啊！这就是病源了。从前若能够以养心调经之药服之，何至于此！这如今明显出一个水亏木旺的症候来。待用药看看。”',
    hash='sha256:29e9bf06cc405165c02492a425b211c03ccd8b73b5ac145e7f6372dfb4cc0d1b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2417',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=309,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=67821,
    end_offset=67838,
    text_slice='于是写了方子，递与贾蓉，上写的是：',
    hash='sha256:3e9f21c7b296f451e90e27753563236f12a88e28e0fa7b862b9f503a2205054c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2418',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=310,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=67840,
    end_offset=67849,
    text_slice='益气养荣补脾和肝汤',
    hash='sha256:5ea829f012e1a48143d91902d1fa5aaa07afed93415f27db55d56593c8514c60'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2419',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=311,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=67851,
    end_offset=67856,
    text_slice='人参二钱。',
    hash='sha256:b06aedb150c47a3cfd528dcea239f85a7851e6cae6f91f4789d865e1e6c27874'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2420',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=311,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=67856,
    end_offset=67864,
    text_slice='白朮二钱，土炒。',
    hash='sha256:857e71fb708833fbb841bf783285e43f996695de01035f843efa5e03b8ee1293'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2421',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=311,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=67864,
    end_offset=67869,
    text_slice='云苓三钱。',
    hash='sha256:afb1bff3029f818b5e684c64714537cfde7e60afb6bf41eded59a9fabb9f9e83'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2422',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=311,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=67869,
    end_offset=67874,
    text_slice='熟地四钱。',
    hash='sha256:26346f158ce30547831f1510320cbda2b29b9c98f924d8a17d5b27da9b15f26c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2423',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=311,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=67874,
    end_offset=67882,
    text_slice='归身二钱，酒洗。',
    hash='sha256:33a8822a78d80f1162f945249931b16d3486c938a47340e62daa82bb49841507'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2424',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=311,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=67882,
    end_offset=67889,
    text_slice='白芍二钱，炒。',
    hash='sha256:a87df0a100eb422cb68d68b7947ddcb966fbed25a10c759aa8936f8a21a9b8a5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2425',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=311,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=67889,
    end_offset=67894,
    text_slice='川芎钱半。',
    hash='sha256:0ca499ddcbe3ebc27d0e30e000eebdea26dc5d8a8198b9bed66bb5338bd50fbc'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2426',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=311,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=67894,
    end_offset=67896,
    text_slice='黄?',
    hash='sha256:bc67128ebad91b97aaadbab807b4d02b8129d880bc06ee35e3a03bec186a3070'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2427',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=311,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=67896,
    end_offset=67899,
    text_slice='三钱。',
    hash='sha256:c45899b2882dc2eb76f3f51da978a6637016f59796284bbf5a66cc4c8acba792'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2428',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=311,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=67899,
    end_offset=67912,
    text_slice='香附米二钱，制醋柴胡八分。',
    hash='sha256:8f143f3d1750887a5e2765999388758741778efa5556957e247df98d40423854'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2429',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=311,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=67912,
    end_offset=67920,
    text_slice='怀山药二钱，炒。',
    hash='sha256:85a1709bda0396d58bfc57ce61a1ac497fe1b7f6fe7d1a1e109c63f8d2c2606a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2430',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=311,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=67920,
    end_offset=67930,
    text_slice='真阿胶二钱，蛤粉炒。',
    hash='sha256:9186f5b6d40b77fe415b5eb4d9a17b611d30b9359f0c07bfe991c0064772c772'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2431',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=311,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=67930,
    end_offset=67939,
    text_slice='延胡索钱半，酒炒。',
    hash='sha256:825d8cf3a646c8c6e95383f98c15214da86affb5cc8998daa80cceeccd69410e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2432',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=311,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=67939,
    end_offset=67945,
    text_slice='炙甘草八分。',
    hash='sha256:0ebb05c92f936cbeffc949916d7968825294efe784b2602e6e6d526e0da04e8a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2433',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=311,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=67945,
    end_offset=67956,
    text_slice='引用建莲子七粒，去心。',
    hash='sha256:ec862e435fbe9d1ad5f04773eae154eae719000317f7b59a352d2c159ff37bbe'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2434',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=311,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=67956,
    end_offset=67961,
    text_slice='红枣二枚。',
    hash='sha256:7c03bdbd6949484532530066b424276c0a1e0b89f05cb7d227b4b8b6ec3f3799'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2435',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=312,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=67963,
    end_offset=67970,
    text_slice='贾蓉看了，说：',
    hash='sha256:3f3b2bf6408aeca08ca6cb216f283b8f7e8e65341a3a0fc465908d90848d245b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2436',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=312,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=67970,
    end_offset=67996,
    text_slice='“高明得很。还要请教先生，这病与性命终久有妨无妨？”',
    hash='sha256:a06a99caf4a63ec652f4fcac09fdf95dcf4427d4224a2ff595c41b5ca9ee364e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2437',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=312,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=67996,
    end_offset=68001,
    text_slice='先生笑道：',
    hash='sha256:7a9a3d0a3aba065ee468f66e567411cd17b78299fb8321db7ca775a1f1c0690f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2438',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=312,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=68001,
    end_offset=68071,
    text_slice='“大爷是最高明的人。人病到这个地位，非一朝一夕的症候，吃了这药，也要看医缘了。依小弟看来，今年一冬是不相干的。总是过了春分，就可望全愈了。”',
    hash='sha256:2c8eb7b7cc418100dbfd23c45a69d205ffc188c753bd6b5d297f7a86d860bc44'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2439',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=312,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=68071,
    end_offset=68088,
    text_slice='贾蓉也是个聪明人，也不往下细问了。',
    hash='sha256:2dacdf65bedc3be06248a5716710778e74170d4af962d7b631e0d7c72051d367'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2440',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=313,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=68090,
    end_offset=68131,
    text_slice='于是贾蓉送了先生去了，方将这药方子并脉案都给贾珍看了，说的话也都回了贾珍并尤氏了。',
    hash='sha256:03457b0cb4d8eb42b86da7a17567c9d4a01d97d1830e04d3bca99c2bf9463115'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2441',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=313,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=68139,
    end_offset=68163,
    text_slice='“从来大夫不像他说的这么痛快，想必用药也不错。”',
    hash='sha256:d10d126b958d1aaa87ed3c2a33b8b163e4ec46fa4e1356327d3a9075b3d04522'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2442',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=313,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=68163,
    end_offset=68167,
    text_slice='贾珍道：',
    hash='sha256:f8a8aedd2ce9740ac4855922a831abf328af70a340beca97664f0fbd7e28f010'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2443',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=313,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=68167,
    end_offset=68245,
    text_slice='“人家原不是混饭吃的久惯行医的人。因为冯紫英与我们相好，他好容易求了他来的。既有这个人，媳妇的病或者就能好了。他那方子上有人参，就用前日买的那一斤好的罢。”',
    hash='sha256:61af17d10492014eee94c0eb5f6377826849d81bb8623048817ce9422de56af4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2444',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=313,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=68245,
    end_offset=68265,
    text_slice='贾蓉听毕话，方出来叫人打药去煎给秦氏吃。',
    hash='sha256:67b9d183ede8cf7d0f40a4c552bc35d5766cdcaf0b0927459fb11dd6e4875d0f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2445',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=313,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=68265,
    end_offset=68285,
    text_slice='不知秦氏服了此药病势如何，且听下回分解。',
    hash='sha256:98340420f0bebbcb6917e44a1f839537242023910ee647ebce6b9631aca60abf'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2446',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=314,
    segment_type='heading',
    start_offset=68287,
    end_offset=68310,
    text_slice='第十一回  庆寿辰宁府排家宴\u3000见熙凤贾瑞起淫心',
    hash='sha256:f5f89c42251a1df7c87053389b62fe96565cab8aede73de3cc2c5b26c9ec7206'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2447',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=315,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=68312,
    end_offset=68390,
    text_slice='话说是日贾敬的寿辰，贾珍先将上等可吃的东西、稀奇些的果品，装了十六大捧盒，着贾蓉带领家下人等与贾敬送去，向贾蓉说道：“你留神看太爷喜欢不喜欢，你就行了礼来。',
    hash='sha256:330d2f68710faeee76f06f4398d644ad2276fca498ee3b1a1e700a54d2de254d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2448',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=315,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=68390,
    end_offset=68421,
    text_slice='你说：‘我父亲遵太爷的话未敢来，在家里率领合家都朝上行了礼了。',
    hash='sha256:bf9e19291760c337ad15982117d07d81bbe9e876b16d0770c7b2ac6b4469e9fb'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2449',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=315,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=68421,
    end_offset=68436,
    text_slice='’”贾蓉听罢，即率领家人去了。',
    hash='sha256:ff2d23e53f3879c47ff9e486264b35e8811eca5ec8d9d5ddfe20a9c112aa131f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2450',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=316,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=68438,
    end_offset=68449,
    text_slice='这里渐渐的就有人来了。',
    hash='sha256:662aaf2e2d283d1299ccbdada8c2fcbc4373f4dc150f072157177fd35846836b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2451',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=316,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=68471,
    end_offset=68482,
    text_slice='“有什么玩意儿没有？”',
    hash='sha256:b17624b2769f2f1d92c20c91017275a6c9ffdc8fb04836359bcde2cdbdece864'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2452',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=316,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=68482,
    end_offset=68487,
    text_slice='家人答道：',
    hash='sha256:896b71c5595e5f8aca25f9985da0f80199fb3027c0cb81b1dcc2aa91ea1b87f3'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2453',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=316,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=68487,
    end_offset=68560,
    text_slice='“我们爷原算计请太爷今日来家，所以并未敢预备顽意儿。前日，听见太爷又不来了，现叫奴才们找了一班小戏儿并一档子打十番的，都在园子里戏台上预备着呢。”',
    hash='sha256:d2da2e4f1bd26befb63094bbffd56db8dd4e65729aaef3a35e48421bb27b095d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2454',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=316,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=68560,
    end_offset=68590,
    text_slice='次后邢夫人、王夫人、凤姐儿、宝玉都来了，贾珍并尤氏接了进去。',
    hash='sha256:13e5fe0f4c23c6b26d641bfac4e427eeb4c2ab1dd6916ea61bd449aff50375b9'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2455',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=316,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=68590,
    end_offset=68602,
    text_slice='尤氏的母亲已先在这里呢。',
    hash='sha256:b8deff9bfdc2d1bea81ef3358434612fdf2d64c80deb92439832be21f9ff848d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2456',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=316,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=68602,
    end_offset=68614,
    text_slice='大家见过了，彼此让了坐。',
    hash='sha256:9f682351af0a46e0f07c7ae44183517bc3aee7ae078e324b2d8b842465201a5a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2457',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=316,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=68632,
    end_offset=68724,
    text_slice='“老太太原是老祖宗，我父亲又是侄儿，这样日子，原不敢请她老人家；但是这个时候，天气正凉爽，满园的菊花又盛开，请老祖宗过来散散闷，看着众儿孙热闹热闹，是这个意思。谁知老祖宗又不肯赏脸。”',
    hash='sha256:b75dac45ec6133d023f40a47f6ad6aa305abdab8bc84d1e4f632b8ef7900a28f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2458',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=316,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=68724,
    end_offset=68739,
    text_slice='凤姐儿未等王夫人开口，先说道：',
    hash='sha256:a1119511590e99f9d5958888d10dd4b81356e53c89d1dc879a6381ba86f34f7e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2459',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=316,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=68739,
    end_offset=68840,
    text_slice='“老太太昨日还说要来着呢，因为晚上看着宝兄弟他们吃桃儿，老人家又嘴馋了，吃了有大半个，五更天的时候，就一连起来了两次，今日早晨略觉身子倦些。因叫我回大爷，今日断不能来了，说有好吃的要几样，还要很烂的。”',
    hash='sha256:acc132e227027285a7e2b61ce064eb173508b7d4dd7b1044e0817b940433f636'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2460',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=316,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=68840,
    end_offset=68847,
    text_slice='贾珍听了笑道：',
    hash='sha256:0af367bfcab1c1b53c4da38f6f291e73a74a71caf7e841a4f7d2b2b5bc00c3ee'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2461',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=316,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=68847,
    end_offset=68881,
    text_slice='“我说老祖宗是爱热闹的，今日不来，必定有个原故，若是这么着就是了。”',
    hash='sha256:d38000cfdc306dbe8c22fc685195cb569c64bc3cfe645ea95f02c15000466fc2'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2462',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=316,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=68881,
    end_offset=68886,
    text_slice='王夫人道：',
    hash='sha256:1766c1bd9af9766fe93dc7cb49104279844445c6b1a45c4facc18ec8c32aa79a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2463',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=316,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=68886,
    end_offset=68919,
    text_slice='“前日听见你大妹妹说，蓉哥儿媳妇儿身上有些不大好，到底是怎么样？”',
    hash='sha256:d59ea5a31ceadb97f9c94dd0d92d8ef3906e284ade2776dec350024c137de3d7'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2464',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=316,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=68919,
    end_offset=68923,
    text_slice='尤氏道：',
    hash='sha256:a770cb189e69039a617afc79b3f86391dc741bed11673a456877bf606c7c1dd3'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2465',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=316,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=68923,
    end_offset=69001,
    text_slice='“她这个病病得也奇，上月中秋还跟着老太太、太太们玩了半夜，回家来好好的。到了二十后，一日比一日觉懒，也懒待吃东西，这将近有半个多月了。经期又有两个月没来。”',
    hash='sha256:118eb4bd4bbcd079d5bb0141f462df34b6c0e4013076df92ff596fbf264f3c4b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2466',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=316,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=69001,
    end_offset=69009,
    text_slice='邢夫人接着说道：',
    hash='sha256:eeb092244ddbdc1c4e38e3837ab82f693a1b23265d1e1c9a33dcb380395cf10a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2467',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=316,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=69009,
    end_offset=69016,
    text_slice='“别是喜罢？”',
    hash='sha256:2f22eed8864fbc4210fcbb2e5f6cc996971bc3da097fd71cee5e3828098dc448'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2468',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=317,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=69018,
    end_offset=69028,
    text_slice='正说着，外头人回道：',
    hash='sha256:aa59dfaa540e1f88f0fbbf90116883f1cafa167dea9c550c712e7aa65fbcb4e3'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2469',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=317,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=69028,
    end_offset=69053,
    text_slice='“大老爷、二老爷并一家子的爷们都来了，在厅上呢。”',
    hash='sha256:135673dac997bf19c340f290d9782e60c1028674e1518bc7175818da3edbeb68'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2470',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=317,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=69053,
    end_offset=69061,
    text_slice='贾珍连忙出去了。',
    hash='sha256:1124870b809999ceeff3ed519ee52a5ef076f6bb4884700e15be8bf0ac6b9969'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2471',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=317,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=69069,
    end_offset=69155,
    text_slice='“从前大夫也有说是喜的。昨日冯紫英荐了他从学过的一个先生，医道很好，瞧了说不是喜，竟是很大的一个症候。昨日开了方子，吃了一剂药，今日头眩得略好些，别的仍不见怎么样大见效。”',
    hash='sha256:44c0aa4333439efc75040f0ecaa094273077c105d508c7b6ff399fff81960211'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2472',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=317,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=69155,
    end_offset=69160,
    text_slice='凤姐儿道：',
    hash='sha256:93bab9ff591c039f189f615d0e6ec70c46f0b6be387ab4b78d2ab495d263a94e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2473',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=317,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=69160,
    end_offset=69193,
    text_slice='“我说她不是十分支持不住，今日这样的日子，再也不肯不扎挣着上来。”',
    hash='sha256:cab195f551766aaed05d05d5e04aadd322546a8bab2fd4d2206ff1634660d865'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2474',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=317,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=69193,
    end_offset=69197,
    text_slice='尤氏道：',
    hash='sha256:a770cb189e69039a617afc79b3f86391dc741bed11673a456877bf606c7c1dd3'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2475',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=317,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=69197,
    end_offset=69244,
    text_slice='“你是初三日在这里见她的，她还强扎挣了半天，也是因你们娘儿两个好的上头，她才恋恋的舍不得去。”',
    hash='sha256:a3e9d0ca1404ad5608737572e8c07fc55255bf7b2a4c257a386e4b1ea0f98221'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2476',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=317,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=69244,
    end_offset=69264,
    text_slice='凤姐儿听了，眼圈儿红了半天，半日方说道：',
    hash='sha256:4070f7a61b5602b27f3cf57bbf471ab3987707817ae73be7887d067269a17fbc'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2477',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=317,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=69264,
    end_offset=69312,
    text_slice='“真是‘天有不测风云，人有旦夕祸福’。这个年纪，倘或就因这个病上怎么样了，人还活着有甚么趣儿！”',
    hash='sha256:5b6a0da02d4537dafe2d5bca976919aeb211d9462423d40259ff777dcfcf43d8'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2478',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=318,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=69314,
    end_offset=69348,
    text_slice='正说话间，贾蓉进来，给邢夫人、王夫人、凤姐儿前都请了安，方回尤氏道：',
    hash='sha256:eb8d0f0dff282d7856b21504fec99f7799958601ba70333715283c1b4345ee5c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2479',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=318,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=69348,
    end_offset=69505,
    text_slice='“方才我去给太爷送吃食去，并回说我父亲在家中伺候老爷们，款待一家子的爷们，遵太爷的话并未敢来。太爷听了甚喜欢，说：‘这才是’。叫告诉父亲、母亲好生伺候太爷、太太们，叫我好生伺候叔叔、婶子们并哥哥们。还说那《阴骘文》，叫急急的刻出来，印一万张散人。我将此话都回了我父亲了。我这会子得快出去打发太爷们并合家爷们吃饭。”',
    hash='sha256:10dba1dcb0cb721c4550bea9a6fac5d9f069c15cceaa7af7f953f154c1b2735a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2480',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=318,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=69505,
    end_offset=69510,
    text_slice='凤姐儿说：',
    hash='sha256:6be8da6f79b674c1ae28fdbb0b1abbaac7115638af330bf5f7a84ea3f3dabf93'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2481',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=318,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=69510,
    end_offset=69533,
    text_slice='“蓉哥儿，你且站住。你媳妇今日到底是怎么着？”',
    hash='sha256:3574712dd2e623b1274fc45eafc9299d9cac3935e7ef4e2e9b8c946bd57220f6'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2482',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=318,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=69533,
    end_offset=69542,
    text_slice='贾蓉皱皱眉，说道：',
    hash='sha256:c08bb243ab31bda1bc1b5fe1652edb439474a62aefad81e773a853156989f048'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2483',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=318,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=69542,
    end_offset=69560,
    text_slice='“不好么！婶子回来瞧瞧去就知道了。”',
    hash='sha256:9abde6cbbf67b33bb4e5f3d86500e6b50d80a5fe8cc256be278eb6ad698de890'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2484',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=318,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=69560,
    end_offset=69568,
    text_slice='于是贾蓉出去了。',
    hash='sha256:1412ffe08acbc0b51163f2a1dc89640bbcb3d7c09e78de2211f539a1b2821c23'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2485',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=319,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=69570,
    end_offset=69584,
    text_slice='这里尤氏向邢夫人、王夫人道：',
    hash='sha256:fe1289d7223603372e0c20ba80a09b15d0d68a50e52fff88a09394c824b9da59'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2486',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=319,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=69584,
    end_offset=69618,
    text_slice='“太太们在这里吃饭啊，还是在园子里吃去好？小戏儿现预备在园子里呢。”',
    hash='sha256:078740e43b39fa651a5f4b8f65fd869d1495dcf83273271be0029a866c96857a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2487',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=319,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=69618,
    end_offset=69627,
    text_slice='王夫人向邢夫人道：',
    hash='sha256:57c55037ec8024781ad428a2e630a25fd704d0e6038efcbbc19c557dbc96e919'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2488',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=319,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=69627,
    end_offset=69647,
    text_slice='“我们索性吃了饭再过去罢，也省好些事。”',
    hash='sha256:02cf7a4ef6e8ec50a74d83aad1a9e33eb6fb960aa9f6415b1dd6120339e2f8da'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2489',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=319,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=69647,
    end_offset=69652,
    text_slice='邢夫人道：',
    hash='sha256:f856d17f84a5050e90fe318c89d8cc6f7d9b35142ea36836f1124c31b299ed78'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2490',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=319,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=69652,
    end_offset=69657,
    text_slice='“很好。”',
    hash='sha256:cb3ec69b492fc94318fa9172bf402c75a8794b7abc4252bd690edb955a7a3800'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2491',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=319,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=69657,
    end_offset=69670,
    text_slice='于是尤氏就吩咐媳妇婆子们：',
    hash='sha256:d34ada7eb209dd5a7ed6fcc715bf2b5b070e9ee55c74ff8198ab959e58822303'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2492',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=319,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=69670,
    end_offset=69677,
    text_slice='“快送饭来！”',
    hash='sha256:4d1f81466277fbb237e92e1faa4a3a467da9cd06ec0c694670a3c2c9108391b9'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2493',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=319,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=69677,
    end_offset=69697,
    text_slice='门外一齐答应了一声，都各人端各人的去了。',
    hash='sha256:3a4ed7bd6e1db15aacc1751163945f9cdcfbc8cb7779628b89967a11e0e29382'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2494',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=319,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=69697,
    end_offset=69707,
    text_slice='不多一时，摆上了饭。',
    hash='sha256:2aafe50a8e92053e3a658b5e31275230f3f24d482ce17eb9c9d98da2c007bf54'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2495',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=319,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=69707,
    end_offset=69739,
    text_slice='尤氏让邢夫人、王夫人并她母亲都上了坐，她与凤姐儿、宝玉侧席坐了。',
    hash='sha256:8d21a6622d3a4150cb624d538dfe9c30bb736f940964b1b6b7f179719f44e1d0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2496',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=319,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=69748,
    end_offset=69776,
    text_slice='“我们来原为给大老爷拜寿，这不竟是我们来过生日来了么？”',
    hash='sha256:c572295a305af81ccdcc1dcfda22196ac6167b85b7b1de02fa270f398192139f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2497',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=319,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=69776,
    end_offset=69782,
    text_slice='凤姐儿说道：',
    hash='sha256:695ea6929411db80fc6b85b12a7933436e6ee76440400a303b1bee1c6190b1c1'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2498',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=319,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=69782,
    end_offset=69829,
    text_slice='“大老爷原是好养静的，已经修炼成了，也算得是神仙了。太太们这么一说，这就叫作‘心到神知’了。”',
    hash='sha256:caa1cda2d73e60fddc1496221f516835204fefd12aee34b9e3ac055989d5cced'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2499',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=319,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=69829,
    end_offset=69845,
    text_slice='一句话说得满屋里的人都笑起来了。',
    hash='sha256:eac65759c2210f2bf5fff34fba46cb300943852b74bf46c4791aacc9023c0109'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2500',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=320,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=69847,
    end_offset=69889,
    text_slice='于是，尤氏的母亲并邢夫人、王夫人、凤姐儿都吃毕饭，漱了口，净了手，才说要往园子里去。',
    hash='sha256:c6a227b3651853def79e9d98825fc4083e8c8552f1be1abbdaed6d971e62374c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2501',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=320,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=69899,
    end_offset=70119,
    text_slice='“老爷们并众位叔叔、哥哥、兄弟们也都吃了饭了。大老爷说家里有事，二老爷是不爱听戏又怕人闹得慌，都才去了。别的一家子爷们都被琏二叔并蔷兄弟让过去听戏去了。方才南安郡王、东平郡王、西宁郡王、北静郡王四家王爷，并镇国公牛府等六家，忠靖侯史府等八家，都差人持了名帖送寿礼来，俱回了我父亲，先收在帐房里了，礼单都上了档子了。老爷的领谢的名帖都交给各来人了，各来人也都照旧例赏了，众来人都让吃了饭才去。母亲该请二位太太、老娘、婶子都过园子里坐着去罢。”',
    hash='sha256:9acfc6594d0f3bd774caa52beb83dac0cebf8600660749d4296ebb13170e8bc0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2502',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=320,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=70119,
    end_offset=70123,
    text_slice='尤氏道：',
    hash='sha256:a770cb189e69039a617afc79b3f86391dc741bed11673a456877bf606c7c1dd3'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2503',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=320,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=70123,
    end_offset=70139,
    text_slice='“也是才吃完了饭，就要过去了。”',
    hash='sha256:e9019d86e5b7a85f346f0d7b70ccad7fac28233c8f9e8ad1bb6ccb3490b8b0c9'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2504',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=321,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=70141,
    end_offset=70146,
    text_slice='凤姐儿说：',
    hash='sha256:6be8da6f79b674c1ae28fdbb0b1abbaac7115638af330bf5f7a84ea3f3dabf93'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2505',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=321,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=70146,
    end_offset=70168,
    text_slice='“我回太太，我先瞧瞧蓉哥儿媳妇，我再过去。”',
    hash='sha256:edba3a73baa0268ad2ea19598143b12a9be18db4c7ec63afca40de6fb367fa59'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2506',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=321,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=70168,
    end_offset=70173,
    text_slice='王夫人道：',
    hash='sha256:1766c1bd9af9766fe93dc7cb49104279844445c6b1a45c4facc18ec8c32aa79a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2507',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=321,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=70173,
    end_offset=70203,
    text_slice='“很是。我们都要去瞧瞧她，倒怕她嫌闹得慌，说我们问她好罢。”',
    hash='sha256:e4e0eb62d6d573f2a75a4c7d42c8fb4af43226fb1928448a523c347e688ac428'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2508',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=321,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=70203,
    end_offset=70207,
    text_slice='尤氏道：',
    hash='sha256:a770cb189e69039a617afc79b3f86391dc741bed11673a456877bf606c7c1dd3'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2509',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=321,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=70207,
    end_offset=70243,
    text_slice='“好妹妹，媳妇听你的话，你去开导开导她，我也放心。你就快些过园子里来。”',
    hash='sha256:598d5401f6e42585a2ed1a03c28ea3017123a9f16310ae93b91923a8498deb2d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2510',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=321,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=70243,
    end_offset=70263,
    text_slice='宝玉也要跟了凤姐儿去瞧秦氏去，王夫人道：',
    hash='sha256:3bb9aed7260855defafc359f5be8c4cdef356b9c0b3e5bcc0a18622541d2eba0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2511',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=321,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=70263,
    end_offset=70280,
    text_slice='“你看看就过去罢，那是侄儿媳妇。”',
    hash='sha256:6bc1f10dbc687ac61249ba0a26362255e5f6c9b6ee769cb83e927b7101d53aa5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2512',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=321,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=70280,
    end_offset=70305,
    text_slice='于是尤氏请了邢夫人、王夫人并她母亲都过会芳园去了。',
    hash='sha256:92c2413b59dfa34e41f9ce776601af15783a4860891658c283b4a6482e31cd73'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2513',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=322,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=70307,
    end_offset=70325,
    text_slice='凤姐儿、宝玉方和贾蓉到秦氏这边来了。',
    hash='sha256:869a40c52490a34efdfba6a4624f2280ee92bcd631e3c4b0029b734ee0ea863b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2514',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=322,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=70357,
    end_offset=70371,
    text_slice='“快别起来，看起猛了头晕。”',
    hash='sha256:7587a9bd7fb86d2b8c9f6e16701bbe4dac94a9ba4aee72c7f1031822b1aab533'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2515',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=322,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=70371,
    end_offset=70393,
    text_slice='于是凤姐儿就紧走了两步，拉住秦氏的手，说道：',
    hash='sha256:fb56312ce577464346da07248033d0f222d83baf7ce8d67695c2908e48948d9a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2516',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=322,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=70393,
    end_offset=70415,
    text_slice='“我的奶奶！怎么几日不见，就瘦得这么着了！”',
    hash='sha256:5f49c3e7b8e9057484501c7fe5cd49cfe6fd38015cdb19840bd039155de0f530'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2517',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=322,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=70415,
    end_offset=70428,
    text_slice='于是就坐在秦氏坐的褥子上。',
    hash='sha256:810c8a7772b7c6970a7607b052ab94cd0fe7b777b06d94193473973701fa4c38'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2518',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=322,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=70428,
    end_offset=70443,
    text_slice='宝玉也问了好，坐在对面椅子上。',
    hash='sha256:f1f76cbb0065517682e6dfddd35ecd04e60014dea360104b93564e8fd0b6c3e0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2519',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=322,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=70447,
    end_offset=70468,
    text_slice='“快倒茶来！婶子和二叔在上房还未喝茶呢。”',
    hash='sha256:c141769457d394f77b71cf1153542824de67658a99cbba587d0d1ae551201779'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2520',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=323,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=70470,
    end_offset=70492,
    text_slice='秦氏拉着凤姐儿的手，强笑道：“这都是我没福。',
    hash='sha256:2f3225f2aea72786a10d77d0e4723e50ccc6a094a7067b40813221c142d2cd29'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2521',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=323,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=70492,
    end_offset=70513,
    text_slice='这样人家，公公、婆婆当自己的女孩儿似的待。',
    hash='sha256:547d0c00ba7c23e95ffa5f2bd3e08da9a3ab2341579100cc0a97b3280e78952e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2522',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=323,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=70513,
    end_offset=70543,
    text_slice='婶娘的侄儿虽说年轻，却也是他敬我，我敬他，从来没有红过脸儿。',
    hash='sha256:50829a741df34ab4d03005c545e2b7ffc6da8cc4fa835945e613447aef6a9093'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2523',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=323,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=70543,
    end_offset=70585,
    text_slice='就是一家子的长辈、同辈之中，除了婶子倒不用说了，别人也从无不疼我的，也无不和我好的。',
    hash='sha256:e7b2ad3efb3111ba79c0956e220a569442affaeaef3f05fee9060fe558bf9192'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2524',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=323,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=70585,
    end_offset=70608,
    text_slice='这如今得了这个病，把我那要强的心一分也没有了。',
    hash='sha256:067a9ad0b2477554419bb964a8d4b350a89a7fc47501080228e8cceeb0edd006'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2525',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=323,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=70608,
    end_offset=70646,
    text_slice='公婆跟前未得孝顺一天，就是婶娘这样疼我，我就有十分孝顺的心，如今也不能够了。',
    hash='sha256:589be05fb598dc14ee57f034a8319be55fb88136e06b7c9d73bd0301ddf11a81'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2526',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=323,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=70646,
    end_offset=70660,
    text_slice='我自想着，未必熬的过年去呢。',
    hash='sha256:1d2ec7dc1f45c82fc14c58c176fe7badd6ad661deeb9f84e659b2a294ab21820'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2527',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=324,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=70663,
    end_offset=70684,
    text_slice='宝玉正眼瞅着那《海棠春睡图》并那秦太虚写的',
    hash='sha256:88e111052c45a3b0ada409450679b668921ef1b797e31d2d1cc2e7b0fbed165f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2528',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=324,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=70684,
    end_offset=70701,
    text_slice='“嫩寒锁梦因春冷，芳气笼人是酒香”',
    hash='sha256:f4b61047ed22ef9c41bfe40aa12cc7376d3f69776ce7a85ac8bc93727eb8f4fe'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2529',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=324,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=70701,
    end_offset=70718,
    text_slice='的对联，不觉想起在这里睡晌觉，梦到',
    hash='sha256:9ee48595c4bb6435205a102b97e8710b1cd19b05a2d52d468456ec7fb203b05f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2530',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=324,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=70718,
    end_offset=70724,
    text_slice='“太虚幻境”',
    hash='sha256:4968652918ac347dc7c53386a48a34878fbc8f3babfd1d402fc2fa815811eb00'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2531',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=324,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=70724,
    end_offset=70728,
    text_slice='的事来。',
    hash='sha256:00e781743100d433cd086269d1c520181b451064f694139ae9ab4312463005f0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2532',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=324,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=70728,
    end_offset=70762,
    text_slice='正自出神，听得秦氏说了这些话，如万箭攒心，那眼泪不知不觉就流下来了。',
    hash='sha256:4401c990b5d4856551842768693b3796e8006dbe319e51b84ecdfdaf87177f53'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2533',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=324,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=70762,
    end_offset=70805,
    text_slice='凤姐儿心中虽十分难过，但恐怕病人见了众人这个样儿，反添心酸，倒不是来开导劝解的意思了。',
    hash='sha256:4fa0e125ada978a7fa461fa9ae22ae377f59a863280a6b1f05809f382af1623d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2534',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=324,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=70817,
    end_offset=70892,
    text_slice='“宝兄弟，你忒婆婆妈妈的了。她病人不过是这么说，哪里就到得这个田地了？况且能多大年纪的人，略病一病儿，就这么想那么想的，这不是自己倒给自己添病了么？”',
    hash='sha256:45153a0f26d2e13ec960d1f1b4c7be39d7b908e49849db2aa2ba37447d6b1f5b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2535',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=324,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=70892,
    end_offset=70896,
    text_slice='贾蓉道：',
    hash='sha256:9d929f43885abe4aff1a05b3791ed0df40e139d8351539fc7a58d2639d3f2a17'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2536',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=324,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=70896,
    end_offset=70919,
    text_slice='“她这病也不用别的，只是吃得些饮食就不怕了。”',
    hash='sha256:2e7b28fd797dfa44733737240798f0531aa625d91ee3bf61cb0e96cdcf0c4f65'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2537',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=324,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=70919,
    end_offset=70924,
    text_slice='凤姐儿道：',
    hash='sha256:93bab9ff591c039f189f615d0e6ec70c46f0b6be387ab4b78d2ab495d263a94e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2538',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=324,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=70924,
    end_offset=70970,
    text_slice='“宝兄弟，太太叫你快过去呢。你别在这里只管这么着，倒招得媳妇也心里不好。太太那里又惦着你。”',
    hash='sha256:91a56fec261a6a06bc45810f932aaa75de259a05a29d5aff54c9f98340768ecc'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2539',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=324,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=70970,
    end_offset=70977,
    text_slice='因向贾蓉说道：',
    hash='sha256:2e51fe32442a136f7009ba7e077c90f9949be87ef20d998a672949a79529ebc1'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2540',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=324,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=70977,
    end_offset=70998,
    text_slice='“你先同你宝叔叔过去罢，我还略坐一坐儿。”',
    hash='sha256:8a796193ce428fe5a2349df1400d0e2d831e4bc7570dd6a7ab49b7a882fae02c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2541',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=324,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=70998,
    end_offset=71014,
    text_slice='贾蓉听说，即同宝玉过会芳园来了。',
    hash='sha256:6b554ee0cf616a388d99f43f949cec5e8dcef461ee505e3de9ab9b274f89f7b5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2542',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=325,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=71016,
    end_offset=71043,
    text_slice='这里凤姐儿又劝解了秦氏一番，又低低的说了许多衷肠话儿。',
    hash='sha256:b161da68985a9a231f84d9936e1bd834bbe258500b60ca12974f66c46431a2ea'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2543',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=325,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=71064,
    end_offset=71111,
    text_slice='“你好生养着罢，我再来看你。合该你这病要好，所以前日就有人荐了这个好大夫来，再也是不怕的了。”',
    hash='sha256:7493c49e28bb2efead91eb52016c820d9bcfc04ddd47a59d84d6de0c23461d0d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2544',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=325,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=71111,
    end_offset=71116,
    text_slice='秦氏笑道：',
    hash='sha256:a70e23eff568480f76a659e827bae8fd43220e1cb104bc33ac90efc58e622335'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2545',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=325,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=71116,
    end_offset=71149,
    text_slice='“任凭神仙也罢，治得病治不得命。婶子，我知道我这病不过是挨日子。”',
    hash='sha256:14514dd8903a6c2563d138d385e84ca95974d85e34654f1e74ec684c1ec87867'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2546',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=325,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=71149,
    end_offset=71155,
    text_slice='凤姐儿说道：',
    hash='sha256:695ea6929411db80fc6b85b12a7933436e6ee76440400a303b1bee1c6190b1c1'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2547',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=325,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=71155,
    end_offset=71293,
    text_slice='“你只管这么想着，病那里能好呢？总要想开了才是。况且听得大夫说，若是不治，怕的是春天不好。如今才九月半，还有四五个月的工夫，什么病治不好呢？咱们若是不能吃人参的人家，这也难说了；你公公、婆婆听见治得好你，别说一日二钱人参，就是二斤，也能够吃得起。好生养着罢，我过园子里去了。”',
    hash='sha256:99490e353ab4490b1b346dc693f892a600094e5b1e073b80db4785f35a9cc7f6'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2548',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=325,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=71293,
    end_offset=71298,
    text_slice='秦氏又道：',
    hash='sha256:a4162e7fc5400461a1db8b8ce6e0de6d3de27b3c1089f86ef603c0101cc94666'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2549',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=325,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=71298,
    end_offset=71342,
    text_slice='“婶子，恕我不能跟过去了。闲了时候还求婶子常过来瞧瞧我，咱们娘儿们坐坐，多说几遭话儿。”',
    hash='sha256:e4f0902bdbf5608c6ae307e68aa89455299de7fbf39bb96a5b0e80d7e827b987'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2550',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=325,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=71342,
    end_offset=71362,
    text_slice='凤姐儿听了，不觉得又眼圈儿一红，遂说道：',
    hash='sha256:9bd6a009d4688b480fd0f2cb2767a99b7fa9d5658ed64d4509c6ad0cfefeed8f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2551',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=325,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=71362,
    end_offset=71376,
    text_slice='“我得了闲儿，必常来看你。”',
    hash='sha256:c85ffb7e60b781970f0ff79786c7bf12c0084cca636cae1075ae23fdcb9ddd94'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2552',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=326,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=71378,
    end_offset=71416,
    text_slice='于是凤姐儿带领跟来的婆子、丫头并宁府的媳妇、婆子们，从里头绕进园子的便门来。',
    hash='sha256:a6adbc472108c5af3384fb50795d605fe83955077e16e16bfce714608584de1a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2553',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=327,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=71422,
    end_offset=71432,
    text_slice='黄花满地，白柳横坡。',
    hash='sha256:3e5a8af21d51f0d7fabd2aa6187d69bb8a18b9cbc43aaee77eb1cdff699ac7e7'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2554',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=327,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=71432,
    end_offset=71448,
    text_slice='小桥通若耶之溪，曲径接天台之路。',
    hash='sha256:a8e64c445dd23adcd053c5bf4bf9868492ecc88d83817d49ed6bb9d5dbfa100b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2555',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=327,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=71448,
    end_offset=71472,
    text_slice='石中清流激湍，篱落飘香；树头红叶翩翻，疏林如画。',
    hash='sha256:95eef772d330f800c3c3599561eab02dd92276f3dd726c074b58904203dc2b8b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2556',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=327,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=71472,
    end_offset=71492,
    text_slice='西风乍紧，初罢莺啼；暖日当暄，又添蛩语。',
    hash='sha256:c72b46982f273350c0f2bb7805342370cfb6be993c1608aa981008cab3508f21'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2557',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=327,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=71492,
    end_offset=71518,
    text_slice='遥望东南，建几处依山之榭；纵观西北，结三间临水之轩。',
    hash='sha256:a1fa9122a8abd63a7f1a2435260e6571101899371a9dcba4256851fd0520bf90'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2558',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=327,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=71518,
    end_offset=71523,
    text_slice='笙簧盈耳。',
    hash='sha256:8823a8859e655026313b3ebfe526253ebb70aed8fbdf4f6debc01c4333ac8eac'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2559',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=327,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=71523,
    end_offset=71538,
    text_slice='别有幽情；罗绮穿林，倍添韵致。',
    hash='sha256:0084c994f84fa7570b4754106a79d821ba7908a80f6f36a114d476304b0ea42e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2560',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=328,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=71540,
    end_offset=71560,
    text_slice='凤姐儿正自看园中的景致，一步步行来赞赏。',
    hash='sha256:0625953ef3bce746d1caeeb7fc6c99ad2793568602623c37e8b370428c97ed8d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2561',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=328,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=71583,
    end_offset=71590,
    text_slice='“请嫂子安。”',
    hash='sha256:390a06582598fe6b9392e28aac1e303ced96cf22be1f8fd02d3cce3fd75e8e86'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2562',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=328,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=71590,
    end_offset=71609,
    text_slice='凤姐儿猛然见了，将身子望后一退，说道：',
    hash='sha256:4926476af2c1a4e38f49ab2f97bd6fd281c0b6abd800d07d3ed0fc3a49d4f966'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2563',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=328,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=71609,
    end_offset=71619,
    text_slice='“这是瑞大爷不是？”',
    hash='sha256:5e91c8629da36e527dc2c3c14439fa314a1bd9f245458c5904f0cb40df21cb1f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2564',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=328,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=71619,
    end_offset=71624,
    text_slice='贾瑞说道：',
    hash='sha256:93d601621db2a60d25d912ac46de04d07815452498e04c4df8d118964277a830'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2565',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=328,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=71624,
    end_offset=71642,
    text_slice='“嫂子连我也不认得了？不是我是谁？”',
    hash='sha256:1fdeb9a635c482e0e307ca15e9dc783373ba81c6dbf9291a1de86888aef22ff2'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2566',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=328,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=71642,
    end_offset=71647,
    text_slice='凤姐儿道：',
    hash='sha256:93bab9ff591c039f189f615d0e6ec70c46f0b6be387ab4b78d2ab495d263a94e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2567',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=328,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=71647,
    end_offset=71671,
    text_slice='“不是不认得，猛然一见，不想到是大爷到这里来。”',
    hash='sha256:4a1495c43404863f942ee893d1f5fc980464fcb95519b6b5afd8cf8bb4f44a2a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2568',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=328,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=71671,
    end_offset=71675,
    text_slice='贾瑞道：',
    hash='sha256:83fe90dd541fa90fb903ac71eee5c92dcb1a75ae02bbc6092706747967eadac9'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2569',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=328,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=71675,
    end_offset=71728,
    text_slice='“也是合该我与嫂子有缘。我方才偷出了席，在这个清净地方略散一散，不想就遇见嫂子也从这里来。这不是有缘么？”',
    hash='sha256:32716abffe1e34ea30b86c31f6f2784a67cef59d1ac90bfecb65f33d4ff7cdec'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2570',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=328,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=71728,
    end_offset=71747,
    text_slice='一面说着，一面拿眼睛不住的觑着凤姐儿。',
    hash='sha256:a95fe226d173fb69d75763d00570dee148a4e100f23fd17e2a73ca32e714bba4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2571',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=329,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=71749,
    end_offset=71775,
    text_slice='凤姐儿是个聪明人，见他这个光景，如何不猜透八九分呢。',
    hash='sha256:d14f94e5c818740ad509e4b2c9818b602f79d88c933d670ce30050612a8f164a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2572',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=329,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=71785,
    end_offset=71863,
    text_slice='“怨不得你哥哥时常提你，说你很好。今日见了，听你说这几句话儿，就知道你是个聪明和气的人了。这会子我要到太太们那里去，不得和你说话儿，等闲了咱们再说话儿罢。”',
    hash='sha256:23a1a07815b5923a001d6359fa48685ba7827f4c5292cd611a70c99f9735b109'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2573',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=329,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=71863,
    end_offset=71867,
    text_slice='贾瑞道：',
    hash='sha256:83fe90dd541fa90fb903ac71eee5c92dcb1a75ae02bbc6092706747967eadac9'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2574',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=329,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=71867,
    end_offset=71895,
    text_slice='“我要到嫂子家里去请安，又恐怕嫂子年轻，不肯轻易见人。”',
    hash='sha256:5e8b57b2c65d484fe65653732cf46d104f5e2b1014efa11c7bbeb5a08e44c68d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2575',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=329,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=71895,
    end_offset=71903,
    text_slice='凤姐儿假意笑道：',
    hash='sha256:97f12b163d6c1a87a81bcad6ceff8b5efc6deb4d38f1110f386114eee8635ee0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2576',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=329,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=71903,
    end_offset=71922,
    text_slice='“一家子骨肉，说什么年轻不年轻的话！”',
    hash='sha256:db562e3a65c50e93629783738f7b4ef067b339d4ce1d4e948680856d1580bfc1'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2577',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=329,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=71922,
    end_offset=71954,
    text_slice='贾瑞听了这话，再不想到今日得这个奇遇，那神情光景，越发不堪难看。',
    hash='sha256:4b463c196ba90bfa3fecce70a85d3a1467236623bad2f0f62e36878f613c7efc'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2578',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=329,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=71960,
    end_offset=71980,
    text_slice='“你快去入席去罢，仔细他们拿住罚你酒！”',
    hash='sha256:0fa2ec14bf3c30b70c93f4b9906ab0e21aa9db10e7c059636781763c1ac81ab9'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2579',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=329,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=71980,
    end_offset=72009,
    text_slice='贾瑞听了，身上已木了半边，慢慢的一面走着，一面回过头来看。',
    hash='sha256:33f0fc6aac287c850a12400d421d9ae5e5b4235a9f8a0045c24572145dd00dbe'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2580',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=329,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=72036,
    end_offset=72089,
    text_slice='“这才是‘知人知面不知心’呢，哪里有这样禽兽的人呢！他如果如此，几时叫他死在我的手里，他才知道我的手段！”',
    hash='sha256:c06308417bb04e459b54343813612f68b11b25606a231f65fc389e37b7352518'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2581',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=330,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=72091,
    end_offset=72103,
    text_slice='于是，凤姐儿方移步前来。',
    hash='sha256:aba013a271a3404c494edcee32641bcf057ee384eaff2e04a405707328434bc5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2582',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=330,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=72136,
    end_offset=72169,
    text_slice='“我们奶奶见二奶奶只是不来，急得了不得，叫奴才们又来请奶奶来了。”',
    hash='sha256:4fc25960ee1486a8bc2bf0273c537b54d8bec319c01f67e8e45363dfc8617a9a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2583',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=330,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=72169,
    end_offset=72175,
    text_slice='凤姐儿说道：',
    hash='sha256:695ea6929411db80fc6b85b12a7933436e6ee76440400a303b1bee1c6190b1c1'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2584',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=330,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=72175,
    end_offset=72191,
    text_slice='“你们奶奶就是这么急脚鬼似的。”',
    hash='sha256:da5f9ce380edcdb6dde5d5f804992200eb1aad871a71c6e9b98147cc8d969d30'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2585',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=330,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=72191,
    end_offset=72202,
    text_slice='凤姐儿慢慢的走着，问：',
    hash='sha256:d71fb79d755ba457c933d7918ec22419af8913599ebf05c9ba3add4248de8d59'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2586',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=330,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=72202,
    end_offset=72211,
    text_slice='“戏唱了几出了？”',
    hash='sha256:7ab3c29063ce12ce4102f29e14f2aba1c529a700189f5d737fa724491187d3a8'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2587',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=330,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=72211,
    end_offset=72217,
    text_slice='那婆子回道：',
    hash='sha256:37770ee726e23ea097908f1e06311eda4bdf43b31b169aaeb640961a7db28e9c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2588',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=330,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=72217,
    end_offset=72225,
    text_slice='“有八九出了。”',
    hash='sha256:0e75733add82e5e8d006f8d8690b90d7bc49a355751ef5f490f7a33c536580f4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2589',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=330,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=72225,
    end_offset=72256,
    text_slice='说话之间，已来到了天香楼的后门，见宝玉和一群丫头们在那里玩呢。',
    hash='sha256:d9464864b2e7fcc9ae2b529e6e2d60d995d2cf6919cba2618efedbdcfa4dbee1'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2590',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=330,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=72262,
    end_offset=72274,
    text_slice='“宝兄弟，别忒淘气了！”',
    hash='sha256:93a3bd1c65a2ab673d6fd22c59d2d65d39a26c964e7e6e0d8508514b27e58f16'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2591',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=330,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=72274,
    end_offset=72282,
    text_slice='有一个丫头说道：',
    hash='sha256:b8f99586a856a94afdca304669630140e51c19e26f54891c988913e56a69f57e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2592',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=330,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=72282,
    end_offset=72306,
    text_slice='“太太们都在楼上坐着呢，请奶奶就从这边上去罢。”',
    hash='sha256:e2c061871c7ccdb452cd606df9c033654e85c8965a42febf3805df91d5d46331'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2593',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=331,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=72308,
    end_offset=72334,
    text_slice='凤姐儿听了，款步提衣上了楼，见尤氏已在楼梯口等着呢。',
    hash='sha256:1fd8a68189e788fce97043a9189379911079e556be982f2b82df43efea920b1b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2594',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=331,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=72340,
    end_offset=72384,
    text_slice='“你们娘儿两个忒好了，见了面总舍不得来了。你明日搬来和她住着罢。你坐下，我先敬你一钟。”',
    hash='sha256:d0d73cd63bb5def57a2e090bb204d7ee394a68d33573f5b49a7101f7a7cddd83'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2595',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=331,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=72384,
    end_offset=72429,
    text_slice='于是凤姐儿在邢、王二夫人前告了坐，又在尤氏的母亲前周旋了一遍，仍同尤氏坐在一桌上吃酒听戏。',
    hash='sha256:1e3a47b5fab1781aa13198f6554cca5c73a443ba97aa538a3bc1714ebe3e783d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2596',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=331,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=72429,
    end_offset=72444,
    text_slice='尤氏叫拿戏单来，让凤姐儿点戏。',
    hash='sha256:801307d2337b2d67f4a21a524303476bacab9c04237a0838510c94a1f6ee1394'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2597',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=331,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=72450,
    end_offset=72470,
    text_slice='“亲家太太和太太们在这里，我如何敢点！”',
    hash='sha256:b3f86a75a9078d32351a96d2e4d52dc9a6205e3a33ac30b3982ae29dd3d21ecc'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2598',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=331,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=72470,
    end_offset=72480,
    text_slice='邢夫人、王夫人说道：',
    hash='sha256:e1ec07eb4e8e08cb6de50761d69cac74183f9153ae53097962d20f2b6293fc4c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2599',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=331,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=72480,
    end_offset=72507,
    text_slice='“我们同亲家太太都点了好几出了，你点两出好的我们听。”',
    hash='sha256:f502fa667c159d69b76f9f2b71a7813fae75dd15339e89a7ca74a982790cc139'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2600',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=331,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=72507,
    end_offset=72555,
    text_slice='凤姐儿立起身来，答应了一声，方接了戏单，从头一看，点了一出《还魂》，一出《弹词》，递过戏单去说：',
    hash='sha256:e2ca5122ab4e4a34eda86fa0f6f8dea1bcbeb43d41f309bf389e7bc896aa4eb4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2601',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=331,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=72555,
    end_offset=72585,
    text_slice='“现在唱的这《双官诰》，唱完了，再唱这两出，也就是时候了。”',
    hash='sha256:4672405a0349eb854cef8412111daddecb31c56168a0828e65a193a5c4c40f8e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2602',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=331,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=72585,
    end_offset=72590,
    text_slice='王夫人道：',
    hash='sha256:1766c1bd9af9766fe93dc7cb49104279844445c6b1a45c4facc18ec8c32aa79a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2603',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=331,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=72590,
    end_offset=72619,
    text_slice='“可不是呢，也该趁早叫你哥哥、嫂子歇歇，他们又心里不静。”',
    hash='sha256:6319945e637f3533052cf071caafb727f54ef1c9d5405643297e4fe5c031ef4d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2604',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=331,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=72619,
    end_offset=72624,
    text_slice='尤氏说道：',
    hash='sha256:948c68618582760ae88e0622ea5a6cd996a015227f98f0f2d43c60967b173e69'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2605',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=331,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=72624,
    end_offset=72655,
    text_slice='“太太们又不常过来，娘儿们多坐一会子去，才有趣儿，天还早呢。”',
    hash='sha256:ee80502ed72f3f3d1d47f3508cc2c7f783a089c8fcfc4d9c65a4dddb21cb178c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2606',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=331,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=72655,
    end_offset=72671,
    text_slice='凤姐儿立起身来，望楼下一看，说：',
    hash='sha256:a666fadaa4f10c488dac2eb60de95659d9ac38f694d5503431c3ef1ccd091bb9'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2607',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=331,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=72671,
    end_offset=72682,
    text_slice='“爷们都往哪里去了？”',
    hash='sha256:06219f35fcc5b78c1b1148ee9d6a2328381ddf75d68241c85b2465207d2b593e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2608',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=331,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=72682,
    end_offset=72690,
    text_slice='旁边一个婆子道：',
    hash='sha256:970c8fcadfb7193409fe10c45708751b33a37ef2d487d33fe7f17c0e22f5af2e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2609',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=331,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=72690,
    end_offset=72713,
    text_slice='“爷们才到凝曦轩，带了打十番的那里吃酒去了。”',
    hash='sha256:4de4f030f4c41286e204b297cba93f3864b4fc70e88d70e874c6ba8800702ab9'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2610',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=331,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=72713,
    end_offset=72719,
    text_slice='凤姐儿说道：',
    hash='sha256:695ea6929411db80fc6b85b12a7933436e6ee76440400a303b1bee1c6190b1c1'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2611',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=331,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=72719,
    end_offset=72740,
    text_slice='“在这里不便易？背地里又不知干什么去了！”',
    hash='sha256:3f8c2503a9b78717515c87af7edd5018511522cda3b3bae4556478411f8a81b5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2612',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=331,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=72740,
    end_offset=72745,
    text_slice='尤氏笑道：',
    hash='sha256:1b73774d874d1c046179e52ec7c7a1a45f2e895f617c8e2a83918ecf5b762c77'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2613',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=331,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=72745,
    end_offset=72759,
    text_slice='“哪里都像你这么正经人呢。”',
    hash='sha256:213b8fdb091990fa21594b1f382c530be69883c5b2b69cf5bacbc17060dd79d7'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2614',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=332,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=72761,
    end_offset=72788,
    text_slice='于是说说笑笑，点的戏都唱完了，方才撤下酒席，摆上饭来。',
    hash='sha256:0ac04b4244c67cfd674df2f6c3ae3e8fb5f50ee27a2365610a0eb190f32068c3'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2615',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=332,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=72788,
    end_offset=72826,
    text_slice='吃毕，大家才出园子来，到上房坐下，吃了茶，方才叫预备车，向尤氏的母亲告了辞。',
    hash='sha256:e1a2cd93b2aa206e4dc163ffc4e638fc093669d16eee11427e63b0e6e3979f18'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2616',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=332,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=72876,
    end_offset=72890,
    text_slice='“二位婶子明日还过来逛逛。”',
    hash='sha256:426816e2b25f23373e816aeb8944708582de68bc1dd8ad43cc0ddca691f6375a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2617',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=332,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=72890,
    end_offset=72895,
    text_slice='王夫人道：',
    hash='sha256:1766c1bd9af9766fe93dc7cb49104279844445c6b1a45c4facc18ec8c32aa79a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2618',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=332,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=72895,
    end_offset=72920,
    text_slice='“罢了，我们今日整坐了一日，也乏了，明日歇歇罢。”',
    hash='sha256:124bea811ca7ba23cc5d893e7a4d6b62e41f30ec15a2045b1940522a096fc3f7'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2619',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=332,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=72920,
    end_offset=72928,
    text_slice='于是都上车去了。',
    hash='sha256:3ae4e3fd456612901c93d922572a66ac57a3b425b14497ce5e0c2a77982944a7'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2620',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=332,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=72928,
    end_offset=72942,
    text_slice='贾瑞犹不时拿眼睛觑着凤姐儿。',
    hash='sha256:2cbbb1c68de7ee3dc67a09d237f703dbcf74c29abb1232b0b41773864ab0cb1f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2621',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=332,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=72942,
    end_offset=72957,
    text_slice='贾珍等进去后，李贵才拉过马来。',
    hash='sha256:e7263138cc911b75507e1d367fe553894479db8c5a0a8dfcdd77b998a8a95df0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2622',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=332,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=72957,
    end_offset=72970,
    text_slice='宝玉骑上，随了王夫人去了。',
    hash='sha256:23b588407096e83424a7a28e822253895769e354b8122c1d3514735deb870912'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2623',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=332,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=72970,
    end_offset=72996,
    text_slice='这里贾珍同一家子的弟兄、子侄吃过了晚饭，方大家散了。',
    hash='sha256:48c9f4599b1822243315abf03692f2964b8e6b4bbe1a7cd5aed7ec479e682cd6'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2624',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=333,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=72998,
    end_offset=73017,
    text_slice='次日，仍是众族人等闹了一日，不必细说。',
    hash='sha256:3ea75b1fb6877a547d0993ec36aa9ca55059ddb45b0811b2a3204d7eea96026f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2625',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=333,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=73017,
    end_offset=73031,
    text_slice='此后凤姐儿不时亲自来看秦氏。',
    hash='sha256:f980a2c4d2be2c35fde44661859b0d9eec58d4a059f6403ccdc2337d64c3dffd'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2626',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=333,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=73031,
    end_offset=73049,
    text_slice='秦氏也有几日好些，也有几日仍是那样。',
    hash='sha256:4be4fe1d590c643f24a3c4b3dfa7df607466a02ebebd385d34f2698b7a10b0ff'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2627',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=333,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=73049,
    end_offset=73062,
    text_slice='贾珍、尤氏、贾蓉好不焦心。',
    hash='sha256:b63d4879934a3c96ccf8df2b3daa1e11c933153947bb6864d3c76769e1f32f67'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2628',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=334,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=73064,
    end_offset=73091,
    text_slice='且说贾瑞到荣府来了几次，偏都遇见凤姐儿往宁府那边去了。',
    hash='sha256:c4ce8392f3f25c2f5136c9c372ee197deb4f89c933a484c03ecec62023317815'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2629',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=334,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=73091,
    end_offset=73104,
    text_slice='这年正是十一月三十日冬至。',
    hash='sha256:e2bf518f966845e5e080685d605bb38babb24365b660535938fccf84f5f242e6'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2630',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=334,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=73138,
    end_offset=73155,
    text_slice='“这几日也未见添病，也不见甚好。”',
    hash='sha256:9aca3405830de9261ff2989a53cec68128c4897b96652770b6db08e9d52499f1'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2631',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=334,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=73155,
    end_offset=73163,
    text_slice='王夫人向贾母说：',
    hash='sha256:9f1cccd944386e6af16ee1541a2c63befbe7ef5a0ce79343dd8f69f3ce1ff8af'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2632',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=334,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=73163,
    end_offset=73189,
    text_slice='“这个症候，遇着这样大节不添病，就有好大的指望了。”',
    hash='sha256:dca7057fc9b616bd71cdbacc5ae3edcc7d7af9cafd5a0ba195eb996b92f93e9e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2633',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=334,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=73189,
    end_offset=73193,
    text_slice='贾母说：',
    hash='sha256:eaec02cb6bfa3bd4ed0addd0ac96ca34fa275c868a09a7350b2b89bd843c5267'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2634',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=334,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=73193,
    end_offset=73218,
    text_slice='“可是呢，好个孩子，要是有些原故，可不叫人疼死！”',
    hash='sha256:b16567b3575af2db52b998927b51e8f3f998705205d4f50e62b8181d229e57b6'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2635',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=334,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=73218,
    end_offset=73233,
    text_slice='说着，一阵心酸，叫凤姐儿说道：',
    hash='sha256:6b7e2d23709ddd6650571d70198720621a6cb00a36f4f3938a2f053adc6125b3'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2636',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=334,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=73233,
    end_offset=73321,
    text_slice='“你们娘儿两个也好了一场，明日大初一，过了明日，你后日去看一看她去。你细细的瞧瞧她那光景，倘或好些儿，你回来告诉我，我也喜欢喜欢。那孩子素日爱吃的，你也常叫人做些给她送过去。”',
    hash='sha256:71f718228011bc5e68070813d2e6da215f1bc5ea38523a70366f39e0eda0f34b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2637',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=334,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=73321,
    end_offset=73331,
    text_slice='凤姐儿一一的答应了。',
    hash='sha256:4561878b72c52fc1a3bb2e9ac8dda12d7b99dc7594b32900fbb718a0246c96c2'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2638',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=335,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=73333,
    end_offset=73377,
    text_slice='到了初二日，吃了早饭，来到宁府，看见秦氏的光景，虽未甚添病，但是那脸上身上的肉全瘦干了。',
    hash='sha256:461c681020c74124574d02148a0782960fbaa1d8dd7edd81de47240754b78ae4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2639',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=335,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=73377,
    end_offset=73408,
    text_slice='于是和秦氏坐了半日，说了些闲话儿，又将这病无妨的话开导了一遍。',
    hash='sha256:2804bbb6c434500f1354f469a0c193c39407cc8c5df378d1c4e9d34771f9775a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2640',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=335,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=73413,
    end_offset=73495,
    text_slice='“好不好，春天就知道了。如今现过了冬至，又没怎么样，或者好得了也未可知。婶子回老太太、太太放心罢。昨日老太太赏的那枣泥馅的山药糕，我倒吃了两块，倒像克化得动似的。”',
    hash='sha256:c18d76002df184a2b7050176eeaabf97cbece05c942bdcba6847c9f0d701b971'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2641',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=335,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=73495,
    end_offset=73501,
    text_slice='凤姐儿说道：',
    hash='sha256:695ea6929411db80fc6b85b12a7933436e6ee76440400a303b1bee1c6190b1c1'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2642',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=335,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=73501,
    end_offset=73535,
    text_slice='“明日再给你送来。我到你婆婆那里瞧瞧，就要赶着回去回老太太的话去。”',
    hash='sha256:c26b4799dba325943f89a1d7353f30004b7230410ed118d0b4225ec66bf11cae'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2643',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=335,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=73535,
    end_offset=73539,
    text_slice='秦氏道：',
    hash='sha256:bb742af2e50a689beea716ae39ebeb49ac4adfaad6e16ea0e3208838608a01d9'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2644',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=335,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=73539,
    end_offset=73555,
    text_slice='“婶子替我请老太太、太太安罢。”',
    hash='sha256:120c5f5d177ab2b55bc7f1a9650bc5bd896b931b610a8148894a9e49cd0abbea'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2645',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=336,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=73557,
    end_offset=73577,
    text_slice='凤姐儿答应着就出来了，到了尤氏上房坐下。',
    hash='sha256:dbfe775643d244584b80445e5466aed131d349d4ccd4ba469b48513476314fcd'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2646',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=336,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=73581,
    end_offset=73594,
    text_slice='“你冷眼瞧媳妇是怎么样？”',
    hash='sha256:a5787d4c87bdd06f2b1c51a91604b7570f1c80e7db50c4836d4ea91bc393d9c4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2647',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=336,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=73594,
    end_offset=73606,
    text_slice='凤姐儿低了半日头，说道：',
    hash='sha256:6643560764c88d6640ba6e7ce6a1222cec2f9397db3120845758fa8d1b135ce5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2648',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=336,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=73606,
    end_offset=73642,
    text_slice='“这实在没法儿了。你也该将一应的后事用的东西给她料理料理，冲一冲也好。”',
    hash='sha256:1563b078bcbf43446b089a5e998b268a368816b870584393df5a0093952f33d8'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2649',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=336,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=73642,
    end_offset=73646,
    text_slice='尤氏道：',
    hash='sha256:a770cb189e69039a617afc79b3f86391dc741bed11673a456877bf606c7c1dd3'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2650',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=336,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=73646,
    end_offset=73679,
    text_slice='“我也叫人暗暗的预备了。就是那件东西不得好木头，暂且慢慢的办罢。”',
    hash='sha256:abf4d6be185f16cadd86ee6e0e41ab7a7e973dbd9a39fc27e49d6799eeac6599'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2651',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=336,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=73679,
    end_offset=73700,
    text_slice='于是，凤姐儿吃了茶，说了一会子话儿，说道：',
    hash='sha256:114684bc5849fbfc80624d0d0a3bc273a6577536b7115033212c38c4820d9704'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2652',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=336,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=73700,
    end_offset=73716,
    text_slice='“我要快回去回老太太的话去呢。”',
    hash='sha256:9a1e6ff59fdcc0b5e17f42fe9144dc44ce0f6296e11a93c4669b25025f33575d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2653',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=336,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=73716,
    end_offset=73720,
    text_slice='尤氏道：',
    hash='sha256:a770cb189e69039a617afc79b3f86391dc741bed11673a456877bf606c7c1dd3'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2654',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=336,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=73720,
    end_offset=73736,
    text_slice='“你可缓缓的说，别吓着老太太。”',
    hash='sha256:834cbed4ee8c3afd768ecd7bcf7279605cb47a1bc62b33919574ceecc3092931'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2655',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=336,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=73736,
    end_offset=73741,
    text_slice='凤姐儿道：',
    hash='sha256:93bab9ff591c039f189f615d0e6ec70c46f0b6be387ab4b78d2ab495d263a94e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2656',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=336,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=73741,
    end_offset=73747,
    text_slice='“我知道。”',
    hash='sha256:31c531f6336a86cc497da064087e453d0b1111d27c4a35be234518b1063d44ab'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2657',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=336,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=73747,
    end_offset=73757,
    text_slice='于是凤姐儿就回来了。',
    hash='sha256:134875f700d5a69c23b726bb97a7f700d4b15ae6e06c4d8e9b03a5acf6b68677'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2658',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=337,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=73759,
    end_offset=73771,
    text_slice='到了家中，见了贾母，说：',
    hash='sha256:c1950d55ddcba9567038ee7793c841d119faf4cfc253b7f922efb7d26594c699'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2659',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=337,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=73771,
    end_offset=73824,
    text_slice='“蓉哥儿媳妇请老太太安，给老太太磕头，说她好些了，求老祖宗放心罢。她再略好些，还要给老祖宗磕头请安来呢。”',
    hash='sha256:5841e5651078afd2af3dbc6324423ac5a83427c202158b070269bbce8dda424a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2660',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=337,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=73824,
    end_offset=73828,
    text_slice='贾母道：',
    hash='sha256:594e2bd952e224e191cc95f01fe230c15ec56f9f062d20f5865dde07957f71b6'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2661',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=337,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=73828,
    end_offset=73838,
    text_slice='“你看她是怎么样？”',
    hash='sha256:737ff35ef2f8906dd799b76061899a48a7b828c7cc48ccabec84f6263447fd9d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2662',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=337,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=73838,
    end_offset=73843,
    text_slice='凤姐儿说：',
    hash='sha256:6be8da6f79b674c1ae28fdbb0b1abbaac7115638af330bf5f7a84ea3f3dabf93'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2663',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=337,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=73843,
    end_offset=73856,
    text_slice='“暂且无妨，精神还好呢。”',
    hash='sha256:c086f33648e8f3b0ee9aae570b5d58a376c975f9f47710062be675f8165d9678'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2664',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=337,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=73856,
    end_offset=73874,
    text_slice='贾母听了，沉吟了半日，因向凤姐儿说：',
    hash='sha256:581f61df6227bd90a34e842bf5cb75d531c1977fa05a09ea86a0736f45689914'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2665',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=337,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=73874,
    end_offset=73887,
    text_slice='“你换换衣服，歇歇去罢。”',
    hash='sha256:5a76543f55dc0077859785d121201b3794fb626b936fff65e4678011007c4269'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2666',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=338,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=73889,
    end_offset=73927,
    text_slice='凤姐儿答应着出来，见过了王夫人，到了家中，平儿将烘的家常的衣服给凤姐儿换了。',
    hash='sha256:3c07a7cd1d855b2120a09ec90243d6ddd49359aa2489a4dd990b76fc3a3a0ffd'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2667',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=338,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=73937,
    end_offset=73948,
    text_slice='“家里没有什么事么？”',
    hash='sha256:949d4a7b642be78ff1c92a8d83e00f5ecb378d5360baaf510bc901897043972b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2668',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=338,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=73948,
    end_offset=73964,
    text_slice='平儿方端了茶来，递了过去，说道：',
    hash='sha256:0a6f2007881fa777d394b6b2eb0efd8baffc27c982a3b192d647d0a50ed5815c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2669',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=338,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=73964,
    end_offset=74020,
    text_slice='“没有什么事。就是那三百银子的利银，旺儿媳妇送进来，我收了。再有瑞大爷使人来打听奶奶在家没有，他要来请安说话。”',
    hash='sha256:e307fd93c8e27fb89410b774e32b8c31e5b4f2233484e8b0d844f2ab35bd3117'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2670',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=338,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=74020,
    end_offset=74034,
    text_slice='凤姐儿听了，哼了一声，说道：',
    hash='sha256:bd142cba459c306e2f1fb00a7d296e85852f3a20a8733f5e9218f48a102fb74d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2671',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=338,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=74034,
    end_offset=74052,
    text_slice='“这畜生合该作死，看他来了怎么样！”',
    hash='sha256:6fd4f7659224c3f3a2e497ffc232bcc85ef6ddca15884a2dcf7b398902e2221a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2672',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=338,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=74052,
    end_offset=74058,
    text_slice='平儿因问道：',
    hash='sha256:f400cb9415dce3af221a01bae35e8f05118b59e0e158340a3b7a29db61ed4554'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2673',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=338,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=74058,
    end_offset=74072,
    text_slice='“这瑞大爷是因什么只管来？”',
    hash='sha256:b9ccf64c80cd7222eadfcdc357eeb050481d10ff8ae19e3235eb48f9c2223fb1'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2674',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=338,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=74072,
    end_offset=74105,
    text_slice='凤姐儿遂将九月里在宁府园子里遇见他的光景，他说的话，都告诉了平儿。',
    hash='sha256:5cdf0cbc4a49e3e0affa3d4689bb0e520241b91f299404c75b5a3c79e3109e8b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2675',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=338,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=74110,
    end_offset=74143,
    text_slice='“癞蛤蟆想天鹅肉吃，没人伦的混帐东西，起这个念头，叫他不得好死！”',
    hash='sha256:3b864f24b1ed2cc6c2cb141fc54ae334aae8141a9f4a3889f5d352f3a9a59fe7'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2676',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=338,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=74143,
    end_offset=74148,
    text_slice='凤姐儿道：',
    hash='sha256:93bab9ff591c039f189f615d0e6ec70c46f0b6be387ab4b78d2ab495d263a94e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2677',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=338,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=74148,
    end_offset=74161,
    text_slice='“等他来了，我自有道理。”',
    hash='sha256:b127ae863e1eb380af866885d0b3cd423e583bc0c9ed5b5015cc906aba00a6f5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2678',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=338,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=74161,
    end_offset=74179,
    text_slice='不知贾瑞来时作何光景，且听下回分解。',
    hash='sha256:70616f83a5f4291f2ef4dd60df6cab8835e915c2738bff2d5de8e698c6681b35'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2679',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=339,
    segment_type='heading',
    start_offset=74181,
    end_offset=74204,
    text_slice='第十二回  王熙凤毒设相思局\u3000贾天祥正照风月鉴',
    hash='sha256:15b51dcce8902dda7251e53558e5f6642d1226d240e7dd62b537dc6b96a67299'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2680',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=340,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=74206,
    end_offset=74224,
    text_slice='话说凤姐正与平儿说话，只见有人回说：',
    hash='sha256:974f4967ad5e32b70c7317cf27b48579e6ce77d5c2e256b5a263daba8355cd27'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2681',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=340,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=74224,
    end_offset=74232,
    text_slice='“瑞大爷来了。”',
    hash='sha256:cbff55c6baf53b8c5bc789aa5d33fb93eafb446a1a2bb77e1d9ecd2f6d87563c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2682',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=340,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=74232,
    end_offset=74236,
    text_slice='凤姐急命',
    hash='sha256:4aeb837aa6b29da2eb01be5fe36f6981bab0c57025ced5e1d42896ef52a48a45'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2683',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=340,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=74236,
    end_offset=74243,
    text_slice='“快请进来。”',
    hash='sha256:bd87288386b289088e008d7186452bcecf1461b374e3fa97fbe67b2986afdd28'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2684',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=340,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=74243,
    end_offset=74277,
    text_slice='贾瑞见往里让，心中喜出望外，急忙进来，见了凤姐，满面陪笑，连连问好。',
    hash='sha256:f24a6c4c2557ccb6ed1181ce3f15b15020f68e9f8806d42fe5017ddce4a8d454'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2685',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=340,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=74277,
    end_offset=74291,
    text_slice='凤姐儿也假意殷勤，让茶让坐。',
    hash='sha256:32520a24e25e576b3a7125781fe966cd78933564b2a0007c5bf0eb638c51f18e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2686',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=341,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=74293,
    end_offset=74315,
    text_slice='贾瑞见凤姐如此打扮，亦发酥倒，因饧了眼问道：',
    hash='sha256:3654f00c7065fd8869d7a936493a2ddfaa5f019d371aff66d1ec5b4859210e41'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2687',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=341,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=74315,
    end_offset=74327,
    text_slice='“二哥哥怎么还不回来？”',
    hash='sha256:bcdc6adfeb3519453f7d32ca74df716874c2bd49589ce2a3eea0beb58213924d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2688',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=341,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=74327,
    end_offset=74331,
    text_slice='凤姐道：',
    hash='sha256:493b74ef604832e715c69f5c0a24d8d4a251e38e82e9ee38006f3f407dd315a5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2689',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=341,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=74331,
    end_offset=74340,
    text_slice='“不知什么原故。”',
    hash='sha256:a8116ef24d4e923f66f190b0cccb5553cf7009749c04a6b4bce6c3cefeaf90e9'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2690',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=341,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=74340,
    end_offset=74345,
    text_slice='贾瑞笑道：',
    hash='sha256:a1244a0ca9e21fd9600f5222f138b710dd53eb73848afd611a551513c71bf881'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2691',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=341,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=74345,
    end_offset=74369,
    text_slice='“别是在路上有人绊住了脚，舍不得回来也未可知？”',
    hash='sha256:8113a106a7809850e9db3fa7d92f3b15e24f4210d8d52b489fb2c352b5c93a5a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2692',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=341,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=74369,
    end_offset=74373,
    text_slice='凤姐道：',
    hash='sha256:493b74ef604832e715c69f5c0a24d8d4a251e38e82e9ee38006f3f407dd315a5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2693',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=341,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=74373,
    end_offset=74394,
    text_slice='“也未可知。男人家见一个爱一个也是有的。”',
    hash='sha256:b5eaa492d189531665e4bf189bd6ffc7dd20e2d1038ac0912b8e440b9ee1d861'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2694',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=341,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=74394,
    end_offset=74399,
    text_slice='贾瑞笑道：',
    hash='sha256:a1244a0ca9e21fd9600f5222f138b710dd53eb73848afd611a551513c71bf881'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2695',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=341,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=74399,
    end_offset=74415,
    text_slice='“嫂子这话说错了，我就不这样。”',
    hash='sha256:7b736f4429aeb155aa87e26b3f9320159aa9063977cb34aafbf8307cdfc18df5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2696',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=341,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=74415,
    end_offset=74420,
    text_slice='凤姐笑道：',
    hash='sha256:fa673815883516a89495f0598428fc17e5f85586cc72e1283fe4d69da7b1c484'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2697',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=341,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=74420,
    end_offset=74445,
    text_slice='“像你这样的人能有几个呢，十个里也挑不出一个来。”',
    hash='sha256:d4ed73c263de08454060623263bc1496428926302185cb76619c7efebbbe6807'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2698',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=341,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=74445,
    end_offset=74457,
    text_slice='贾瑞听了，喜得抓耳挠腮。',
    hash='sha256:586ad4d7dc748178f1c365ede610d36364730ee40b0c1163291c0c41bb1fa874'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2699',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=341,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=74460,
    end_offset=74471,
    text_slice='“嫂子天天也闷得很。”',
    hash='sha256:9a5c76122d357eb52df4da627c4e21d7c522e3abd2422f9fa39421af1bc0fe89'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2700',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=341,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=74471,
    end_offset=74475,
    text_slice='凤姐道：',
    hash='sha256:493b74ef604832e715c69f5c0a24d8d4a251e38e82e9ee38006f3f407dd315a5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2701',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=341,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=74475,
    end_offset=74494,
    text_slice='“正是呢，只盼个人来说话，解解闷儿。”',
    hash='sha256:7aa1ca55d2dc6c4c5544711ef17d0d5884f23d23e4241d2e730d97f4908ff43c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2702',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=341,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=74494,
    end_offset=74499,
    text_slice='贾瑞笑道：',
    hash='sha256:a1244a0ca9e21fd9600f5222f138b710dd53eb73848afd611a551513c71bf881'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2703',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=341,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=74499,
    end_offset=74524,
    text_slice='“我倒天天闲着，天天过来替嫂子解解闲闷可好不好？”',
    hash='sha256:985a86645ee9eb384d6629679cde247f7c7de86a3b9c35c3b00aa479697f7352'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2704',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=341,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=74524,
    end_offset=74529,
    text_slice='凤姐笑道：',
    hash='sha256:fa673815883516a89495f0598428fc17e5f85586cc72e1283fe4d69da7b1c484'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2705',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=341,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=74529,
    end_offset=74546,
    text_slice='“你哄我呢，你哪里肯往我这里来！”',
    hash='sha256:908d0369f1bf807ee9f96590237031105ae4e52f4a5964de12535471138d22d2'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2706',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=341,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=74546,
    end_offset=74550,
    text_slice='贾瑞道：',
    hash='sha256:83fe90dd541fa90fb903ac71eee5c92dcb1a75ae02bbc6092706747967eadac9'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2707',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=341,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=74550,
    end_offset=74634,
    text_slice='“我在嫂子跟前，若有一点谎话，天打雷劈。只因素日闻得人说，嫂子是个利害人，在你跟前一点也错不得，所以唬住了我。如今见嫂子最是有说有笑极疼人的，我怎么不来？死了也愿意！”',
    hash='sha256:7e02dd0029ce516a9b149b50a2478475e6838b6122eaf19a1717f320a8f3e44f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2708',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=341,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=74634,
    end_offset=74639,
    text_slice='凤姐笑道：',
    hash='sha256:fa673815883516a89495f0598428fc17e5f85586cc72e1283fe4d69da7b1c484'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2709',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=341,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=74639,
    end_offset=74696,
    text_slice='“果然你是个明白人，比贾蓉、贾蔷两个强远了。我看他那样清秀，只当他们心里明白，谁知竟是两个胡涂虫，一点不知人心。”',
    hash='sha256:ccbf651ef6e195649be7f2e458e6a51955a9e0109c7226f789ef5173b3e6aa04'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2710',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=341,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=74696,
    end_offset=74745,
    text_slice='贾瑞听了这话，越发撞在心坎儿上，由不得又往前凑了一凑，觑着眼看凤姐带的荷包，然后又问带着什么戒指。',
    hash='sha256:7f5797fa705451fbc3030ea7b9a7e8c25e32f62aafa0425db27eefeea6f47b81'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2711',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=341,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=74751,
    end_offset=74768,
    text_slice='“放尊重些！别叫丫头们看了笑话。”',
    hash='sha256:017f3cdcc17358e7756e0f6ccd77e7da9adc1e4caf7a54027fce56c968af06cc'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2712',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=341,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=74768,
    end_offset=74784,
    text_slice='贾瑞如听纶音佛语一般，忙往后退。',
    hash='sha256:5bd77eaf3d5d612b1ff625c51b863ff2bab786b64f905a74601c7e64e0f16eb6'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2713',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=341,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=74789,
    end_offset=74796,
    text_slice='“你该去了。”',
    hash='sha256:e3da7caa531eae54fa9351bf995ea017211d4354260de2c97a6e12d9e4293f17'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2714',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=341,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=74796,
    end_offset=74800,
    text_slice='贾瑞道：',
    hash='sha256:83fe90dd541fa90fb903ac71eee5c92dcb1a75ae02bbc6092706747967eadac9'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2715',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=341,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=74800,
    end_offset=74816,
    text_slice='“我再坐一会儿，好狠心的嫂子！”',
    hash='sha256:00a9c39362d8631e759bfd0b886cc9ef6480539833d2b509b3cf5fdf1612e25b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2716',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=341,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=74816,
    end_offset=74824,
    text_slice='凤姐又悄悄的道：',
    hash='sha256:dd61fb369e5d2fae7879b543fc026f555be97ae106a3269b7ad2f74f479d08e6'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2717',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=341,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=74824,
    end_offset=74873,
    text_slice='“大天白日，人来人往，你就在这里也不方便。你且去，等着晚上起了更你来，悄悄的在西边穿堂儿里等我。”',
    hash='sha256:055adb8960650b65afbb3890149f021ffd61366da2e11ca532340232085bfbf3'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2718',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=341,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=74873,
    end_offset=74887,
    text_slice='贾瑞听了，如得珍宝，忙问道：',
    hash='sha256:240039792f1d6fb7b90e95c5b6107ef176c59e4ea145206c37df81534980249d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2719',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=341,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=74887,
    end_offset=74909,
    text_slice='“你别哄我。但只那里人过的多，怎么好躲的？”',
    hash='sha256:f501977c93b83bc1a67956a356acb0b4b38c2b621090536b4b4254baea96ea1a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2720',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=341,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=74909,
    end_offset=74913,
    text_slice='凤姐道：',
    hash='sha256:493b74ef604832e715c69f5c0a24d8d4a251e38e82e9ee38006f3f407dd315a5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2721',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=341,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=74913,
    end_offset=74946,
    text_slice='“你只管放心。我把上夜的小厮们都放了假，两边门一关，再没别人了。”',
    hash='sha256:1913cde1072bf139b5fce95d772659089786b3a6268038fc25a95af3f18e388e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2722',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=341,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=74946,
    end_offset=74971,
    text_slice='贾瑞听了，喜之不禁，忙忙的告辞而去，心内以为得手。',
    hash='sha256:8b64d6958e88dfc2c1df04b7938456d3ec3d2ceef5fb3ce63a3bf47deb737f9b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2723',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=342,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=74973,
    end_offset=75006,
    text_slice='盼到晚上，果然黑地里摸入荣府，趁掩门时，钻入穿堂，果见漆黑无一人。',
    hash='sha256:f8a7a5e91d648a7a5daab10908886c60d0ebecd99c54157379250a6e5fce73ce'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2724',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=342,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=75006,
    end_offset=75028,
    text_slice='往贾母那边去的门户已倒锁，只有向东的门未关。',
    hash='sha256:bc21bc5929f9b19b9d360ca20719df6bbc4794bfb5001772da4897e48242fe88'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2725',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=342,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=75028,
    end_offset=75060,
    text_slice='贾瑞侧耳听着，半日不见人来，忽听‘咯蹬’一声，东边的门也倒关了。',
    hash='sha256:35c63fce2c87b8e27eccdd6186a3bd779cb3f94e2dc2f900790d547469ea8194'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2726',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=342,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=75060,
    end_offset=75091,
    text_slice='贾瑞急得也不敢作声，只得悄悄的出来，将门撼了撼，关得铁桶一般。',
    hash='sha256:76f00d2d453b4fa1404e217475821ee51b94766f22d3bcf7f0b56a9d3b465978'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2727',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=342,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=75091,
    end_offset=75117,
    text_slice='此时要求出去亦不能够，南北皆是大房墙，要跳亦无攀援。',
    hash='sha256:46e8b254eabcc9e036e0e659cb653441af0118d3cbe677c7a40de037c8482424'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2728',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=342,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=75117,
    end_offset=75161,
    text_slice='这屋内又是过门风，空落落的；现是腊月天气，夜又长，朔风凛凛，侵肌裂骨，一夜几乎不曾冻死。',
    hash='sha256:027443f4a5f1390b54e7c81414cbc2aa169e257b127618ac90a0855e9830234f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2729',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=342,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=75161,
    end_offset=75190,
    text_slice='好容易盼到早晨，只见一个老婆子先将东门开了，进来去叫西门。',
    hash='sha256:e37a1c954d686f122667661f36c7f3f4f19e89f7590ade1af5f9b135ebda3650'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2730',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=342,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=75190,
    end_offset=75231,
    text_slice='贾瑞瞅她背着脸，一溜烟抱着肩跑了出来，幸而天气尚早，人都未起，从后门一径跑回家去。',
    hash='sha256:71b126faeb433e7683962474292b504b4dc472d30693fdea978ed84121cda074'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2731',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=343,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=75233,
    end_offset=75252,
    text_slice='原来贾瑞父母早亡，只有他祖父代儒教养。',
    hash='sha256:7a3dce8de5a11a8660ee2ff3fdd8f4d870a89271bedbd596b9ba50885d12472b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2732',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=343,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=75252,
    end_offset=75286,
    text_slice='那代儒素日教训最严，不许贾瑞多走一步，生怕他在外吃酒赌钱，有误学业。',
    hash='sha256:ed85999dc1d5771e8b199048ce1f6b53085a747d49dcbf77f5be958ea023b6ce'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2733',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=343,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=75286,
    end_offset=75327,
    text_slice='今忽见他一夜不归，只料定他在外非饮即赌，嫖娼宿妓，哪里想到这段公案，因此气了一夜。',
    hash='sha256:94c70fb4796b1245d7bef96a6a25944d21ea0d23fdd2581bf991a0f18bc94c0f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2734',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=343,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=75347,
    end_offset=75367,
    text_slice='“往舅舅家去了，天黑了，留我住了一夜。”',
    hash='sha256:8f0e77053f8e6c7a31943483d3b0054c482572f553a8acbe70958d86a5c56039'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2735',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=343,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=75367,
    end_offset=75371,
    text_slice='代儒道：',
    hash='sha256:766b8cee0c2fea14feb8d3b1d39d3280e29bdb7496ae8473b23b9da97e0bce82'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2736',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=343,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=75371,
    end_offset=75407,
    text_slice='“自来出门，非禀我不敢擅出，如何昨日私自去了？据此亦该打，何况是撒谎！”',
    hash='sha256:071c302d0cee1ab8ba047aede28a3897c08e4128d5f0d9a5fd05b8f23da08879'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2737',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=343,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=75407,
    end_offset=75450,
    text_slice='因此，发狠到底打了三四十扳，还不许吃饭，令他跪在院内读文章，定要补出十天的功课来方罢。',
    hash='sha256:3f8c3627ffa4fb9b520a981558184c6811a18fede688d813231f698a3feeba55'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2738',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=343,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=75450,
    end_offset=75486,
    text_slice='贾瑞直冻了一夜，今又遭了苦打，且饿着肚子，跪着在风地里读文章，其苦万状。',
    hash='sha256:572b24128205aef46b8c66f26fe885be4bd2f4b87864ed3856049b2933f48652'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2739',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=344,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=75488,
    end_offset=75511,
    text_slice='此时，贾瑞前心犹是未改，再想不到是凤姐捉弄他。',
    hash='sha256:1fb7c8f7ca5c3580d1e1111941bca810cb9860214a2ba83345e84c55841a06c7'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2740',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=344,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=75511,
    end_offset=75527,
    text_slice='过后两日，得了空，便仍来找凤姐。',
    hash='sha256:ed45d2599112187c5ca3e1c4c7f6e5b6722cadfa896de09bdef459bac7898d08'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2741',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=344,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=75527,
    end_offset=75546,
    text_slice='凤姐故意抱怨他失信，贾瑞急得赌身发誓。',
    hash='sha256:19eaa3193a7b7afb00fc40773abf3ce0906c96b0fd7c07db039d70d3469a1788'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2742',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=344,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=75574,
    end_offset=75613,
    text_slice='“今日晚上，你别在那里了。你在我这房后小过道子里那间空屋里等我，可别冒撞了。”',
    hash='sha256:0b264e4c731d790efe5cf1a19e64681772551da3795f5e9264086bb86b04489f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2743',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=344,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=75613,
    end_offset=75617,
    text_slice='贾瑞道：',
    hash='sha256:83fe90dd541fa90fb903ac71eee5c92dcb1a75ae02bbc6092706747967eadac9'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2744',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=344,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=75617,
    end_offset=75622,
    text_slice='“果真？”',
    hash='sha256:0bc11398d911ad52cb7b12d07e15b41a0eb6e54cd1e5ecdbbb0ace6db2766b33'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2745',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=344,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=75622,
    end_offset=75626,
    text_slice='凤姐道：',
    hash='sha256:493b74ef604832e715c69f5c0a24d8d4a251e38e82e9ee38006f3f407dd315a5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2746',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=344,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=75626,
    end_offset=75640,
    text_slice='“谁可哄你！你不信就别来。”',
    hash='sha256:09ea37f8ebf095da5eae311a0fcd1c6daf7fdcaeebd911a7088fa81ed5ee39dd'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2747',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=344,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=75640,
    end_offset=75644,
    text_slice='贾瑞道：',
    hash='sha256:83fe90dd541fa90fb903ac71eee5c92dcb1a75ae02bbc6092706747967eadac9'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2748',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=344,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=75644,
    end_offset=75657,
    text_slice='“来，来，来，死也要来！”',
    hash='sha256:13bb3d671e129b7641074434fee4ecb3cfb19dfaec526ebf4e6c686721cfc2b4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2749',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=344,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=75657,
    end_offset=75661,
    text_slice='凤姐道：',
    hash='sha256:493b74ef604832e715c69f5c0a24d8d4a251e38e82e9ee38006f3f407dd315a5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2750',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=344,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=75661,
    end_offset=75671,
    text_slice='“这会子你先去罢。”',
    hash='sha256:5cbf171b2b6b9d6b5a69ce608ad58082ea063ae9e7621aeb523e107eba737622'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2751',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=344,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=75671,
    end_offset=75686,
    text_slice='贾瑞料定晚间必妥，此时先去了。',
    hash='sha256:7c75a537aa42699812318593d85cec2d76827d057672a8b31a927f58cb75d1fb'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2752',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=344,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=75686,
    end_offset=75702,
    text_slice='凤姐在这里便点兵派将，设下圈套。',
    hash='sha256:f067e3b19be6cc3b8d8278fa2f48e96f1f442b2cfbfe30a742a57cf0701dbba1'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2753',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=345,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=75704,
    end_offset=75742,
    text_slice='那贾瑞只盼不到晚上，偏生家里亲戚又来了，直等吃了晚饭才去，那天已有掌灯时分。',
    hash='sha256:907ae512466a5477f6c06b5b932602695991e981e5ed31f74187cfcdb6e9b629'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2754',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=345,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=75742,
    end_offset=75783,
    text_slice='又等他祖父安歇了，方溜进荣府，直往那夹道中屋子里来等着，热锅上蚂蚁一般，只是干转。',
    hash='sha256:28f7bedaea06c0ed47b39bdc41f7e62223f86a5f3d52622ec668b3266f5426cb'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2755',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=345,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=75802,
    end_offset=75819,
    text_slice='“别是又不来了，又冻我一夜不成？”',
    hash='sha256:10f116a0476d889c552f87cdc04cd8ecf2936eeff69a9c7844ae441b50c97937'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2756',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=345,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=75819,
    end_offset=75877,
    text_slice='正自胡猜，只见黑魆魆的来了一个人，贾瑞便意定是凤姐，不管皂白，饿虎一般，等那人刚至门前，便如猫捕鼠的一般，抱住叫道：',
    hash='sha256:9c6f8cb74d17d8ee15c18bc139d7f0e0c8564f07f82972e6d04e32ebb0b7f915'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2757',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=345,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=75877,
    end_offset=75890,
    text_slice='“我的亲嫂子，等死我了！”',
    hash='sha256:35cddcae6eecb6431886d38937b73010d2b91a7d2c12611b8d4594c947def3dc'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2758',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=345,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=75890,
    end_offset=75909,
    text_slice='说着，抱到屋里炕上就亲嘴扯裤子，满口里',
    hash='sha256:c3cf1496defe76f49e0e9cb6da651d24843788f3f4676272bef83a602d8dcfcc'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2759',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=345,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=75909,
    end_offset=75913,
    text_slice='“亲娘”',
    hash='sha256:937686eab758a074fb407ea61691138d97353d27ccd10633b52197c0643bf62e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2760',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=345,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=75913,
    end_offset=75917,
    text_slice='“亲爹”',
    hash='sha256:e53847e0f61dcfc4c71f7c4060ce434d09bb5e2b1b74be761451411a5be9c099'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2761',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=345,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=75917,
    end_offset=75923,
    text_slice='的乱叫起来。',
    hash='sha256:a348df816e8806ddf4d3cdc6350f26cf228306b3228e293c430f7ccafeb757f1'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2762',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=345,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=75923,
    end_offset=75930,
    text_slice='那人只不作声。',
    hash='sha256:b4495b6fbb7723f839ef21cae8b2f60417e8dea55870c738daedc84da7f0cc98'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2763',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=345,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=75930,
    end_offset=75948,
    text_slice='贾瑞扯了自己裤子，硬帮帮的就想顶入。',
    hash='sha256:a4eb9fba39050cb896883fc1c3a043cc56c238af139260fa3f0f4767f579601b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2764',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=345,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=75967,
    end_offset=75974,
    text_slice='“谁在屋里？”',
    hash='sha256:4f0a3038a4146ccf93433b4d1947a933223819896355305ea08e2fc4fa313908'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2765',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=345,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=75974,
    end_offset=75983,
    text_slice='只见炕上那人笑道：',
    hash='sha256:32c6d793643c0ac63d54c766b5e987717343d5b73ff2ae1fbe7168977de0a2df'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2766',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=345,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=75983,
    end_offset=75993,
    text_slice='“瑞大叔要肏我呢。”',
    hash='sha256:90ed841249835f93952d8c3f82bb0c6f8880323d88dc750e4ba057d00bae764d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2767',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=345,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=75993,
    end_offset=76020,
    text_slice='贾瑞一见，却是贾蓉，真臊得无地可入，不知要怎么样才好。',
    hash='sha256:3b434921ab1eb811a817b64b3d30455c2ea4df60338657d17037e0e2937cbb85'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2768',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=345,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=76035,
    end_offset=76115,
    text_slice='“别走！如今琏二婶已经告到太太跟前，说你无故调戏她。她暂用了个脱身计，哄你在这边等着。太太气死过去了，因此叫我来拿你。刚才你又拦住他，没的说，跟我去见太太吧！”',
    hash='sha256:0d44bc17b240cc7ab6c95ff0287fd90ecc63b9004dfe4faaa56c3ec47c606c86'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2769',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=346,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=76117,
    end_offset=76130,
    text_slice='贾瑞听了，魂不附体，只说：',
    hash='sha256:80150696e0378bf314716bb89f3a703c10888d11181315872a86f026057d479b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2770',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=346,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=76130,
    end_offset=76152,
    text_slice='“好侄儿，只说没有见我，明日我重重的谢你。”',
    hash='sha256:03be245f4831e82fc18aa8707295023f4c6505292f673ec1bf3fb205082029e5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2771',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=346,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=76152,
    end_offset=76156,
    text_slice='贾蔷道：',
    hash='sha256:70dc3f0eaa00b2e4e698643352ba41131d76ce28754202caf42a223472a9dbb8'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2772',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=346,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=76156,
    end_offset=76192,
    text_slice='“你若谢我，放你不值什么，只不知你谢我多少？况且口说无凭，写一文契来！”',
    hash='sha256:450c701d1b07d505017a267a4ed3279beed46c694de6bbb74507e8e20aa1b1ff'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2773',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=346,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=76192,
    end_offset=76196,
    text_slice='贾瑞道：',
    hash='sha256:83fe90dd541fa90fb903ac71eee5c92dcb1a75ae02bbc6092706747967eadac9'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2774',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=346,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=76196,
    end_offset=76205,
    text_slice='“这如何落纸呢？”',
    hash='sha256:82a47fe8d24d273995b5aafe6a05e390702e0d70b5c692317077239e4eb15bf9'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2775',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=346,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=76205,
    end_offset=76209,
    text_slice='贾蔷道：',
    hash='sha256:70dc3f0eaa00b2e4e698643352ba41131d76ce28754202caf42a223472a9dbb8'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2776',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=346,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=76209,
    end_offset=76238,
    text_slice='“这也不妨，写一个赌钱输了外人帐目，借头家银若干两便罢。”',
    hash='sha256:bbc5306f4722b7ba31124370be89fb294bbe3f94fe1846171729b120fcfc97bb'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2777',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=346,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=76238,
    end_offset=76242,
    text_slice='贾瑞道：',
    hash='sha256:83fe90dd541fa90fb903ac71eee5c92dcb1a75ae02bbc6092706747967eadac9'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2778',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=346,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=76242,
    end_offset=76257,
    text_slice='“这也容易。只是此时无纸笔。”',
    hash='sha256:7499df51dd3d11afe2a355dcc98da89dbf46467afa6802d5443243337da8e5da'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2779',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=346,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=76257,
    end_offset=76261,
    text_slice='贾蔷道：',
    hash='sha256:70dc3f0eaa00b2e4e698643352ba41131d76ce28754202caf42a223472a9dbb8'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2780',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=346,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=76261,
    end_offset=76268,
    text_slice='“这也容易。”',
    hash='sha256:31c65f8ec280b5ecd6b43551586fb050183c6e4c781de18287959b74c174f36c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2781',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=346,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=76268,
    end_offset=76288,
    text_slice='说罢，翻身出来，纸笔现成，拿来命贾瑞写。',
    hash='sha256:342ef0a053e2b3735ec191666eb0cab92e8b2d835ff4a0f1faf0bd5fb6022b63'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2782',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=346,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=76288,
    end_offset=76315,
    text_slice='他两个作好作歹，只写了五十两，然后画了押，贾蔷收起来。',
    hash='sha256:e3d30c41d8ea834aa0afc28a65cf9a01b83ee578ddfc869c8ae8a2a1d8f37f1a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2783',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=346,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=76315,
    end_offset=76322,
    text_slice='然后撕逻贾蓉。',
    hash='sha256:3446f7e0a93efaf96962da41928997ba36ab9dc5c88fe3276f02caa8429d581c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2784',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=346,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=76334,
    end_offset=76348,
    text_slice='“明日告诉族中的人评评理。”',
    hash='sha256:00a28510c9ce407ab8f79bcf9aa947040b8bab8681d4636227deef373c364a39'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2785',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=346,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=76348,
    end_offset=76357,
    text_slice='贾瑞急得至于叩头。',
    hash='sha256:a20bb01cc24ef58a5bcade015a3d5b9d3d84e4eb76fd443c4af1bd3a5942b85e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2786',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=346,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=76357,
    end_offset=76378,
    text_slice='贾蔷作好作歹的，也写了一张五十两欠契才罢。',
    hash='sha256:f57144c8e43efa797b8d8dd5c053438104d940dddc70653178d0c9bcf32b9639'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2787',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=346,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=76383,
    end_offset=76497,
    text_slice='“如今要放你，我就担着不是。老太太那边的门早已关了，老爷正在厅上看南京的东西，那一条路定难过去，如今只好走后门。若这一走，倘或遇见了人，连我也完了。等我们先去哨探哨探，再来领你。这屋里你还藏不得，少时就来堆东西。等我寻个地方。”',
    hash='sha256:8b0a2259cdbc2eaaf27842bd8763992ba8ef35bd9cb946bcbbf5872fad7537f7'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2788',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=346,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=76497,
    end_offset=76526,
    text_slice='说毕，拉着贾瑞，仍熄了灯，出至院外，摸着大台矶底下，说道：',
    hash='sha256:0cb7fc205626582c61298f444aeb338b256dc49cc0e9534b54a221bbd6c83f4a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2789',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=346,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=76526,
    end_offset=76551,
    text_slice='“这窝儿里好，你只蹲着，别哼一声，等我们来再动。”',
    hash='sha256:41356f45ddc527ef38d163ef9d4e7b4214bd64ce243eddab8559ab28f0c669ec'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2790',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=346,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=76551,
    end_offset=76559,
    text_slice='说毕，二人去了。',
    hash='sha256:d8f59339174f16c0fad51bc0dbc5441f1eb2edad850f3ae8292640c643d33e68'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2791',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=347,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=76561,
    end_offset=76577,
    text_slice='贾瑞此时身不由己，只得蹲在那里。',
    hash='sha256:18adf40ca4192797ab057f0428f66f2c49566194f0647bec9584400270f5f82d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2792',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=347,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=76577,
    end_offset=76618,
    text_slice='心下正盘算，只听头顶上一声响，哗拉拉一净桶尿粪从上面直泼下来，可巧浇了他一身一头。',
    hash='sha256:213d9b55c69455f780968f744d7dffae1fe9603ca57ca95e003bf1ea773c79b7'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2793',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=347,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=76618,
    end_offset=76658,
    text_slice='贾瑞掌不住‘嗳哟’了一声，忙又掩住口，不敢声张，满头满脸浑身皆是尿屎，冰冷打战。',
    hash='sha256:2012082b4ba600f6c788d2399d285ae7c1d3a8dac7ffbfd53761fc4988c97abd'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2794',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=347,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=76666,
    end_offset=76674,
    text_slice='“快走，快走！”',
    hash='sha256:1ecc4c1d45233f849e0a83223d7566b3c81e22eadd32d01e4e1e926cb26db091'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2795',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=347,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=76674,
    end_offset=76703,
    text_slice='贾瑞如得了命，三步两步从后门跑到家里，天已三更，只得叫门。',
    hash='sha256:b7f9babfe56c01e1bd97d73de15bfbf7e9757e69813715edb3ec8e0fd99e3b5a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2796',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=347,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=76703,
    end_offset=76718,
    text_slice='开门人见他这般景况，问是怎的。',
    hash='sha256:41193653c8cc870b6fb4174b06cb90d217aab7e7a7a98fc355af380d17c09d0c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2797',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=347,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=76725,
    end_offset=76739,
    text_slice='“黑了，失脚掉在茅厕里了。”',
    hash='sha256:8d543aaa9c120ab60f0ef70f832606795a2571825bb1e0ef757ff9ea643613dc'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2798',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=347,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=76739,
    end_offset=76764,
    text_slice='一面到了自己房中，更衣洗濯，心下方想到是凤姐玩他。',
    hash='sha256:08da03e03c09cb8919602d6bf9ba01fe63b08916d021b112db689caacc09449e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2799',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=347,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=76764,
    end_offset=76800,
    text_slice='因此发一回恨，再想想凤姐的模样儿，又恨不得一时搂在怀内，一夜竟不曾合眼。',
    hash='sha256:38d3ee52d7d8d587eadde7ce48d3bad770ff03a85a37b1d123a70fb6dd24c2f9'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2800',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=348,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=76802,
    end_offset=76819,
    text_slice='自此满心想凤姐，只不敢往荣府去了。',
    hash='sha256:49ffc918034a0a7908fb6963eed20c9267c6f17cebed6e97dd725d3e8a983b76'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2801',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=348,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=76819,
    end_offset=76856,
    text_slice='贾蓉两个又常常的来索银子，他又怕祖父知道，正是相思尚且难禁，更又添了债务。',
    hash='sha256:1527b38e315c611dcdf2cb0771d7516549f40a0be62b060961deb57944c75c46'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2802',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=348,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=76856,
    end_offset=76963,
    text_slice='日间功课又紧，他二十来岁人，尚未娶亲，迩来想着凤姐，未免有那指头告了消乏等事；更兼两回冻恼奔波，因此三五下里夹攻，不觉就得了一病：心内发膨胀，口中无滋味，脚下如绵，眼中似醋，黑夜作烧，白昼常倦，下溺连精，嗽痰带血。',
    hash='sha256:a3a0f311b0df7b5907e5a6a7a05d832a8c555c13e3a3c97aed1faeab2b079cbe'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2803',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=348,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=76963,
    end_offset=76977,
    text_slice='诸如此症，不上一年都添全了。',
    hash='sha256:943f2c373211ade36c31a088405fae987b251753a48c5b764de4bfecdb827517'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2804',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=348,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=76977,
    end_offset=77011,
    text_slice='于是不能支持，一头睡倒，合上眼还只梦魂颠倒，满口乱说胡话，惊怖异常。',
    hash='sha256:6cf510858c9df57a8b31527c44eb2a3f7923d6a6f91f33f94af7524205047de0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2805',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=348,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=77011,
    end_offset=77053,
    text_slice='百般请医疗治，诸如肉桂、附子、鳖甲、麦冬、玉竹等药，吃了有几十斤下去，也不见个动静。',
    hash='sha256:2b0c2da2ab936c0a34fa9987faf2e16d9c183c90d2d0a992b4bde0aa17b8e21a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2806',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=349,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=77055,
    end_offset=77070,
    text_slice='倏忽又腊尽春回，这病更又沉重。',
    hash='sha256:9a44ab2b1cffd6e67578fe6651f032e8b0b571212eebc0a285fbb55694fcf136'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2807',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=349,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=77070,
    end_offset=77089,
    text_slice='代儒也着了忙，各处请医疗治，皆不见效。',
    hash='sha256:505333dbaae56eb2de5fdc89e5124724a9d4146f3b404896d187ebab0e5b846d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2808',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=349,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=77093,
    end_offset=77098,
    text_slice='“独参汤”',
    hash='sha256:4b6e7e2c601bc845ae1febb1b0e05622cdf7fab660ba30c28f398edb7637d22f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2809',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=349,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=77098,
    end_offset=77116,
    text_slice='，代儒如何有这力量，只得往荣府来寻。',
    hash='sha256:d4af069f7d6439f9ec28d45dd09c67f6e40b96f662881edda4db55c49355e576'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2810',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=349,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=77133,
    end_offset=77178,
    text_slice='“前儿新近都替老太太配了药，那整的太太又说留着送杨提督的太太配药，偏生昨儿我已送了去了。”',
    hash='sha256:6d8c6a9e9e023d75c99d05f5ac749457677e0e08cb1c5cdf0621115210f057b4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2811',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=349,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=77178,
    end_offset=77183,
    text_slice='王夫人道：',
    hash='sha256:1766c1bd9af9766fe93dc7cb49104279844445c6b1a45c4facc18ec8c32aa79a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2812',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=349,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=77183,
    end_offset=77245,
    text_slice='“就是咱们这边没了，你打发个人往你婆婆那边问问，或是你珍大哥哥那府里再寻些来，凑着给人家，吃好了，救人一命，也是你的好处。”',
    hash='sha256:73fd5251dd28c62920c5c876a907542881b27a3a53f140b66b4a93f473ea4a3a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2813',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=349,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=77245,
    end_offset=77278,
    text_slice='凤姐听了，也不遣人去寻，只得将些渣末泡须凑了几钱，命人送去，只说：',
    hash='sha256:8da3c8b442cd33f38024905bdacc56ea7ab1c06e726ac8b067611a183172c8d0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2814',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=349,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=77278,
    end_offset=77291,
    text_slice='“太太送来的，再也没了。”',
    hash='sha256:a7a7f90e89ecedeaebe2da1c6080ba90ed7d16deadfa4069565df4b47b5b64c8'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2815',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=349,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=77291,
    end_offset=77301,
    text_slice='然后回王夫人，只说：',
    hash='sha256:23bf3f3b4546c183a68b6dc032c210ac028b35b2a1d7654f1081e48ab794d2a4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2816',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=349,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=77301,
    end_offset=77317,
    text_slice='“都寻了来，共凑了有二两送去。”',
    hash='sha256:c1e31ece1d9086840dc5bfd2c40c1e3fa7262e93f09134f549f3969122056e1a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2817',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=350,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=77319,
    end_offset=77345,
    text_slice='那贾瑞此时要命心甚切，无药不吃，只是白花钱，不见效。',
    hash='sha256:06fa6fe91f07698b3b35c17558260b411e315694dd905f2cf0092807d3bcc96f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2818',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=350,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=77345,
    end_offset=77368,
    text_slice='忽然这日有个跛足道人来化斋，口称专治冤业之症。',
    hash='sha256:d0f52d1d8f24d37ed66109dea9f43c7881e629b931b5c4e1fa13a7c0af3191ec'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2819',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=350,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=77386,
    end_offset=77399,
    text_slice='“快请进那位菩萨来救我！”',
    hash='sha256:e01d2f577a81988dda0c903484fae83eff734637a602c73f77de885c1003c93d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2820',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=350,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=77399,
    end_offset=77411,
    text_slice='一面叫，一面在枕上叩首。',
    hash='sha256:7bc978de43cfb1daddcc48351a08b1ddac32ce617191a5edfd8163e3a278a2d7'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2821',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=350,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=77411,
    end_offset=77423,
    text_slice='众人只得带了那道士进来。',
    hash='sha256:693a589668a55c065f9f6c77006e3b93e56782b31e983ea667f1f306a8042fad'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2822',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=350,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=77432,
    end_offset=77439,
    text_slice='“菩萨救我！”',
    hash='sha256:f94cb46ccd1dc4c76c9a440dc251a73c2a35079df96469fdddeabb568b2b55d9'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2823',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=350,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=77439,
    end_offset=77445,
    text_slice='那道士叹道：',
    hash='sha256:89d105793b6925ef8a73db549ff994a2967f63c71caf37d4356bb558b5ead1d4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2824',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=350,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=77445,
    end_offset=77475,
    text_slice='“你这病非药可医，我有个宝贝与你，你天天看时，此命可保矣。”',
    hash='sha256:e7e569417f74c39134003c513bd4014f6a408e61bd252f44c81ce6826b17b37e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2825',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=350,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=77475,
    end_offset=77504,
    text_slice='说毕，从褡裢中取出一面镜子来――两面皆可照人，镜把上面錾着',
    hash='sha256:ca7849de2c1b4d759636d1f255b80353049840a699cd0d827f707376ce3d732c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2826',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=350,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=77504,
    end_offset=77510,
    text_slice='“风月宝鉴”',
    hash='sha256:7994c18fca5ca8c2bd52c11d4c81bb482b9d19e3df1f8549b5269adb44d65184'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2827',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=350,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=77510,
    end_offset=77520,
    text_slice='四字――递与贾瑞道：',
    hash='sha256:3de7a69c83833f36389fb3efea50affdbc5e01a9fc60b583c424c01d2973cf7e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2828',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=350,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=77520,
    end_offset=77619,
    text_slice='“这物出自太虚幻境空灵殿上，警幻仙子所制，专治邪思妄动之症，有济世保生之功。所以带它到世上，单与那些聪明杰俊、风雅王孙等看照。千万不可照正面，只照它的背面，要紧，要紧！三日后吾来收取，管叫你好了。”',
    hash='sha256:1623a8673443b38286244fe7320f2237876109435928e39aba29812444fc96a3'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2829',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=350,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=77619,
    end_offset=77634,
    text_slice='说毕，佯常而去，众人苦留不住。',
    hash='sha256:bccea25682348d6abedd4a0d251bac3d3bb5be32e2f32f6b2a18323cf7760e4a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2830',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=351,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=77636,
    end_offset=77646,
    text_slice='贾瑞收了镜子，想道：',
    hash='sha256:4ff881c777a040b2cea3274547f2069088f72134db2d9d9cd5df530b30ba1c4a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2831',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=351,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=77646,
    end_offset=77665,
    text_slice='“这道士倒有意思，我何不照一照试试。”',
    hash='sha256:70b7fed4d627df66ba8c2c5f5fdc184ff16900a146cb476b01943aeed8b9951d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2832',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=351,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=77665,
    end_offset=77703,
    text_slice='想毕，拿起风月鉴来，向反面一照，只见一个骷髅立在里面，唬得贾瑞连忙掩了，骂：',
    hash='sha256:a8a8f6cf1ee150cc5bcf943a8c1696bb216f027b0163f6e91b75e3b22819548a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2833',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=351,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=77703,
    end_offset=77726,
    text_slice='“道士混帐，如何吓我！我倒再照照正面是什么。”',
    hash='sha256:c684918a8bb3d0904ef6cb0a56900050db8714269307f7104facc454a514b399'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2834',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=351,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=77726,
    end_offset=77749,
    text_slice='想着，又将正面一照，只见凤姐站在里面招手叫他。',
    hash='sha256:331cd64a5fb1d35601bd19b55ba6147e9eafb332c9b42a5057b98dae5f77e834'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2835',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=351,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=77749,
    end_offset=77783,
    text_slice='贾瑞心中一喜，荡悠悠的觉得进了镜子，与凤姐云雨一番，凤姐仍送他出来。',
    hash='sha256:4381ad62db8dad2d50424b1782c12544c108dfc95df56dc5a393030c934cf246'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2836',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=351,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=77783,
    end_offset=77820,
    text_slice='到了床上，‘嗳哟’了一声，一睁眼，镜子从手里掉过来，仍是反面立着一个骷髅。',
    hash='sha256:c9f0d4105c8fe172c4772220967601226b257191f678965182cbf6a4c7d925e9'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2837',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=351,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=77820,
    end_offset=77838,
    text_slice='贾瑞自觉汗津津的，底下已遗了一滩精。',
    hash='sha256:e01b65118cd3edbe9ed95f01269c70c6898c05f0667454c004b53d348d3443b7'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2838',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=351,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=77838,
    end_offset=77867,
    text_slice='心中到底不足，又翻过正面来，只见凤姐还招手叫他，他又进去。',
    hash='sha256:055ce5f91d67c46666f73ebaa59f47f24ba82e5326213d1bd8513777057c28e2'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2839',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=351,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=77867,
    end_offset=77873,
    text_slice='如此三四次。',
    hash='sha256:67981cb72030b92cac4f841b7ff7d668b0cec15655b7a0a3098345e2fd67e60e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2840',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=351,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=77873,
    end_offset=77906,
    text_slice='到了这次，刚要出镜子来，只见两个人走来，拿铁锁把他套住，拉了就走。',
    hash='sha256:20dd58ae1eb5d9492ef13c00802fb3d4cdfd00ff0d1c1e686dfc7f045e5f2d29'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2841',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=351,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=77911,
    end_offset=77922,
    text_slice='“让我拿了镜子再走！”',
    hash='sha256:e316bf54362f9383ed7b9003824b370476c74bfac913b296d20ed2aad5607d26'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2842',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=351,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=77922,
    end_offset=77936,
    text_slice='只说得这句，就再不能说话了。',
    hash='sha256:e327619119807b1d6f78b70f80e21862d7a5df6ee922dd6405522a9afcf37fd4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2843',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=352,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=77938,
    end_offset=77985,
    text_slice='旁边服侍贾瑞的众人，只见他先还拿着镜子照，落下来，仍睁开眼，拾在手内；末后镜子落下来便不动了。',
    hash='sha256:1a94865935a76ddd0c7ea78e483d9d31bda04798f2d359651245d8f7aa128f11'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2844',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=352,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=77985,
    end_offset=77997,
    text_slice='众人上来看时，已没了气。',
    hash='sha256:677855be4e56c1730ae56437f409ce7de3c0c6e8180233e910da19f9956fc5c4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2845',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=352,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=77997,
    end_offset=78010,
    text_slice='身子底下冰凉渍湿一大滩精。',
    hash='sha256:9ed3e633312acb47d9993688af56038229260ca28ab140845c68f8e35d4ce411'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2846',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=352,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=78010,
    end_offset=78019,
    text_slice='这才忙着穿衣抬床。',
    hash='sha256:74472f3790c69ec2bf1f136928c1e566d876f993b11a3d1298ca30b9ebb676b5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2847',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=352,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=78035,
    end_offset=78056,
    text_slice='“是何妖镜！若不早毁此物，遗害于世不小。”',
    hash='sha256:6612bd0db4cc7867a9d1bb0e282e202ad997237d912d3bc3476b5acb32ada926'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2848',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=352,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=78056,
    end_offset=78070,
    text_slice='遂命架火来烧，只听镜内哭道：',
    hash='sha256:92a9360279bf8944984c92963376e42ed871cc71b6b930437b39f2336d9de0b7'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2849',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=352,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=78070,
    end_offset=78096,
    text_slice='“谁叫你们瞧正面了﹗你们自己以假为真，何苦来烧我？”',
    hash='sha256:139d991569660b5cb1b2bec64ecca0a6a1d5712e6990c8d41a22038b0063baa2'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2850',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=352,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=78096,
    end_offset=78116,
    text_slice='正哭着，只见那跛足道人从外面跑来，喊道：',
    hash='sha256:20a73433b9c6c5c6497fb51ce3baec35d2c2f63f095477c95d5d3baf10d7e8e7'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2851',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=352,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=78116,
    end_offset=78131,
    text_slice='“谁毁‘风月鉴’？吾来救也！”',
    hash='sha256:15b1ac3f2e7482fc67876e164d01393e6766383fb3c3227153866c250c872f7c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2852',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=352,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=78131,
    end_offset=78149,
    text_slice='说着，直入中堂，抢入手内，飘然去了。',
    hash='sha256:25137a35bbc0e2a638298d97612555ef788ad2f7f2895ab3a0733c7170779f6e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2853',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=353,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=78151,
    end_offset=78167,
    text_slice='当下，代儒料理丧事，各处去报丧。',
    hash='sha256:f898026c0cd9762ec885094a3bdeae0d777e8522e978a53532e5539efb8bd106'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2854',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=353,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=78167,
    end_offset=78191,
    text_slice='三日起经，七日发引，寄灵于铁槛寺，日后带回原籍。',
    hash='sha256:132840c0855d527d507dac51841798412dea457158b1d0373dc875b771fb1d3d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2855',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=353,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=78191,
    end_offset=78254,
    text_slice='当下，贾家众人齐来吊问，荣国府贾赦赠银二十两，贾政亦是二十两，宁国府贾珍亦有二十两，别者族中贫富不一，或三两或五两，不可胜数。',
    hash='sha256:b8af758dbf1c113b7a42841868f48660f0b24445fabb4c0fa610db20e0d2fca1'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2856',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=353,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=78254,
    end_offset=78271,
    text_slice='另有各同窗家分资，也凑了二三十两。',
    hash='sha256:cc22d165e87f7737395742ae509c88abb7d7d2fa78b4adf0dcad3035c4dd9da8'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2857',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=353,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=78271,
    end_offset=78296,
    text_slice='代儒家道虽然淡薄，倒也丰富完了此事，家中很可度日。',
    hash='sha256:f4e03fc4676635aeffbb38e6821cef7037fdc9eaacbaa3a329dcfbf49f665867'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2858',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=354,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=78298,
    end_offset=78334,
    text_slice='再进这年冬底，两淮林如海的书信寄来，却为身染重疾，写书特来接林黛玉回去。',
    hash='sha256:5a9d7b1081e2c42afbc1daad43bab552f4876da360ca852e95e4fc185d705ed5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2859',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=354,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=78334,
    end_offset=78358,
    text_slice='贾母听了，未免又加忧闷，只得忙忙的打点黛玉起身。',
    hash='sha256:f15464d0ed2c8a64c96555e960184ad7c7d0a51decbd7d3a55cbad002a51cb6c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2860',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=354,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=78358,
    end_offset=78378,
    text_slice='宝玉大不自在，争奈父女之情，也不好拦劝。',
    hash='sha256:d2cdeca869bf813434acf42ebd7bf48c0b42e1f43346ef1dcd27047a9c86d04e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2861',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=354,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=78378,
    end_offset=78396,
    text_slice='于是贾母定要贾琏送她去，仍叫带回来。',
    hash='sha256:32f65a6a9860872cb354aad849d53557e010614e830206621c7773d2b1b2b5c3'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2862',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=354,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=78396,
    end_offset=78414,
    text_slice='一应土仪盘缠，不消烦说，自然要妥贴。',
    hash='sha256:506679951c51495830d15035dffabd6769b847867729bc23107ce829b258359b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2863',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=354,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=78414,
    end_offset=78447,
    text_slice='作速择了日期，贾琏与林黛玉辞别了贾母等，带领仆从，登舟往扬州去了。',
    hash='sha256:654d00c5a22806052b9f097f56e49602c0ae2fe26e6829131461831eb0262919'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2864',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=354,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=78447,
    end_offset=78459,
    text_slice='要知端的，且听下回分解。',
    hash='sha256:5abd5dab26755e7093185410c7174251c7834b09157c4de42f50724a986829ad'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2865',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=355,
    segment_type='heading',
    start_offset=78461,
    end_offset=78484,
    text_slice='第十三回  秦可卿死封龙禁尉\u3000王熙凤协理宁国府',
    hash='sha256:f3d82877b382e2efa8ecf453b6d95164131c86ec66b31bf28899d2d72e015bde'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2866',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=356,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=78486,
    end_offset=78510,
    text_slice='话说凤姐儿自贾琏送黛玉往扬州去后，心中实在无趣。',
    hash='sha256:08b666615be425a82ce6c53673eb26a33f6543ce5c278fb1718347fcae157113'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2867',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=356,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=78510,
    end_offset=78531,
    text_slice='每到晚间，不过和平儿说笑一回，就胡乱睡了。',
    hash='sha256:f16c5dbe00f6e40acaf53c6df6ad343fff0d0d9e6e5520705db54e37c7837004'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2868',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=357,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=78533,
    end_offset=78580,
    text_slice='这日夜间，正和平儿灯下拥炉倦绣，早命浓熏绣被，二人睡下，屈指算行程该到何处，不知不觉已交三鼓。',
    hash='sha256:0c22eca504ab78702d740eb2e6bc364f4ba6787fda2fae7bdf3ab69aadf37022'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2869',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=357,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=78580,
    end_offset=78587,
    text_slice='平儿已睡熟了。',
    hash='sha256:5babf1c5b58cef2a27136e9b404e0e1fab87caacd6cf074a32ab407134e88aae'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2870',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=357,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=78587,
    end_offset=78620,
    text_slice='凤姐方觉星眼微朦，恍惚只见秦氏从外走了进来，含笑说道：“婶子好睡！',
    hash='sha256:4ce9e11c24de5f6410bdc9a0098d91edc81523c82ca43a6e62c850f3e8d62a6b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2871',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=357,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=78620,
    end_offset=78634,
    text_slice='我今日回去，你也不送我一程。',
    hash='sha256:0de58070817b5a9c35e5d88d974334d4a270d9a75a89009b74facb35c5c3f7ed'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2872',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=357,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=78634,
    end_offset=78657,
    text_slice='因娘儿们素日相好，我舍不得婶婶，故来别你一别。',
    hash='sha256:f6642d3bafaca6961d1c1747bb8645af19db4fc4300d1eccae223cf283e3b8ce'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2873',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=357,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=78657,
    end_offset=78679,
    text_slice='还有一件心愿未了，非告诉婶子，别人未必中用。',
    hash='sha256:ee42515ef17a539c8eafa55b27a45cd04038b1a007e5bb5359254e97e346dca1'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2874',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=358,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=78682,
    end_offset=78692,
    text_slice='凤姐听了，恍惚问道：',
    hash='sha256:c5ec128f417a346768c56b0ab406bf40954735ff11e4b4ce923e2fa5e4ff6a82'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2875',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=358,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=78692,
    end_offset=78708,
    text_slice='“有何心愿？你只管托我就是了。”',
    hash='sha256:6277b45104cfdb3d9ca4054a66395ada246a7b7f9976eb595424d6cf49910b8a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2876',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=358,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=78708,
    end_offset=78712,
    text_slice='秦氏道：',
    hash='sha256:bb742af2e50a689beea716ae39ebeb49ac4adfaad6e16ea0e3208838608a01d9'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2877',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=358,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=78712,
    end_offset=78836,
    text_slice='“婶婶，你是个脂粉队里的英雄，连那些束带顶冠的男子也不能过你，你如何连两句俗语也不晓得：常言‘月满则亏，水满则溢’；又道是‘登高必跌重’。如今我们家赫赫扬扬，已将百载，一日倘或乐极悲生，若应了那句‘树倒猢狲散’的俗语，岂不虚称了一世的诗书旧族了！”',
    hash='sha256:fae850d961468d0095d8022e3eb0d5a777ea49e1848ef0071a00e5d3b076fad9'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2878',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=358,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=78836,
    end_offset=78853,
    text_slice='凤姐听了此话，心胸大快，十分敬畏。',
    hash='sha256:868ac5cd81aba23d9513004d2f5b3cff45c0ef2440a4f14b92a5dfb9e26ba128'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2879',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=358,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=78857,
    end_offset=78877,
    text_slice='“这话虑得极是，但有何法可以永保无虞？”',
    hash='sha256:6b48ba57f9976dcef0100c8ee0e6a5061e3d6802d5bd6d594bd693785686146e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2880',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=358,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=78877,
    end_offset=78883,
    text_slice='秦氏冷笑道：',
    hash='sha256:50ab345c9a733bfcf3b74b299e521d30b39dbbae406a574c87426759859eae59'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2881',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=358,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=78883,
    end_offset=78975,
    text_slice='“婶子好痴也！否极泰来，荣辱自古周而复始，岂人力能可保常的。但如今能于荣时筹画下将来衰时的世业，亦可谓常保永全了。即如今日诸事都妥，只有两件未妥，若把此事如此一行，则日后可保永全了。”',
    hash='sha256:d7ea0c7a43476cc12134a3c1b4d32c5371bc40fbf71cc6dbb0d2c96a544fcd7c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2882',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=359,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=78977,
    end_offset=78984,
    text_slice='凤姐便问何事。',
    hash='sha256:3cf44841e6a31f962568660a2c9b2c3d467bc488cc2560c721389f1ba47df264'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2883',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=359,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=78988,
    end_offset=79320,
    text_slice='“目今祖茔虽四时祭祀，只是无一定的钱粮；第二，家塾虽立，无一定的供给。依我想来，如今盛时固不缺祭祀、供给，但将来败落之时，此二项有何出处？莫若依我定见，趁今日富贵，将祖茔附近多置田庄、房舍、地亩，以备祭祀供给之费皆出自此处，将家塾亦设于此。合同族中长幼，大家定了则例，日后按房掌管这一年的地亩、钱粮、祭祀、供给之事。如此周流，又无争竞，亦不有典卖诸弊。便是有了罪，凡物可入官，这祭祀产业，连官也不入的。便败落下来，子孙回家读书务农，也有个退步，祭祀又可永继。若目今以为荣华不绝，不思后日，终非长策。眼见不日又有一件非常喜事，真是烈火烹油、鲜花着锦之盛。要知道，也不过是瞬间的繁华，一时的欢乐，万不可忘了那‘盛筵必散’的俗语。此时若不早为后虑，临期只恐后悔无益了。”',
    hash='sha256:fc424b9a3d8f1070a630e6a5309d2cd397d85f71aa10569ac0f0715af55a9b2c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2884',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=359,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=79320,
    end_offset=79325,
    text_slice='凤姐忙问：',
    hash='sha256:e60c8e17093053ff14ca32002a16615cb5846916dc0f943462d81b830c0d1cb4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2885',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=359,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=79325,
    end_offset=79332,
    text_slice='“有何喜事？”',
    hash='sha256:7be6cc25b727778ce4883503d5c782268bec14ea39d4864e70d84b3a108ad97e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2886',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=359,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=79332,
    end_offset=79336,
    text_slice='秦氏道：',
    hash='sha256:bb742af2e50a689beea716ae39ebeb49ac4adfaad6e16ea0e3208838608a01d9'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2887',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=359,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=79336,
    end_offset=79369,
    text_slice='“天机不可泄漏。只是我与婶子好了一场，临别赠你两句话，须要记着。”',
    hash='sha256:75f291e0d1ec6ac96fa0c949374b15645a9b5019873392d3fd410342931efc13'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2888',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=359,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=79369,
    end_offset=79389,
    text_slice='因念道：三春去后诸芳尽，各自须寻各自门。',
    hash='sha256:5ccf483a75185614d721d448fa5b317cf41b3aa89c3e56716c7b0e8d8aa6dc1f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2889',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=359,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=79389,
    end_offset=79421,
    text_slice='凤姐还欲问时，只听二门上传事云板连叩四下，正是丧音，将凤姐惊醒。',
    hash='sha256:bb4945c27b500fa8e17381fa692832417341a9918644a4afa4d75d7770ee909e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2890',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=359,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=79424,
    end_offset=79435,
    text_slice='“东府蓉大奶奶没了！”',
    hash='sha256:cbe725298e66c27f16a6f61f9e390d790995460eaeb2ceb72cbcb7341d6ebc14'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2891',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=359,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=79435,
    end_offset=79468,
    text_slice='凤姐闻听，吓了一身冷汗，出了一回神，只得忙忙的穿衣，往王夫人处来。',
    hash='sha256:b857d28cef1a040c0fc69c616f212021cb92b5706fcc16af77d1b72822dec85d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2892',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=360,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=79470,
    end_offset=79488,
    text_slice='彼时合家皆知，无不纳罕，都有些疑心。',
    hash='sha256:9000948b4456c8ccc94cbd5978aeb6a2c993a3a67c1e2787494bbec6dc26e70e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2893',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=360,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=79488,
    end_offset=79557,
    text_slice='那长一辈的想她素日孝顺，平一辈的想她素日和睦亲密，下一辈的想他她素日慈爱，以及家中仆从老小想她素日怜贫惜贱、慈老爱幼之恩，莫不悲嚎痛哭者。',
    hash='sha256:53c2f5e3bdec232df8836301bf02c1cef2927fa2b095f0c0e4ed7becd2ad4ede'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2894',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=361,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=79559,
    end_offset=79602,
    text_slice='闲言少叙，却说宝玉因近日林黛玉回去，剩得自己孤凄，也不和人顽耍，每到晚间，便索然睡了。',
    hash='sha256:3f403138a14c5dfd87fa4187823f86e477ce647aa057c8073f8f3f51a0a7ff08'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2895',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=361,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=79602,
    end_offset=79650,
    text_slice='如今从梦中听见说秦氏死了，连忙翻身爬起来，只觉心中似戳了一刀的，不忍‘哇’的一声，喷出一口血来。',
    hash='sha256:5ab257c49229925b5e56af064116d989fb122fa318b580eb1f430c67ce6e0abf'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2896',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=361,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=79650,
    end_offset=79677,
    text_slice='袭人等慌慌忙忙来搀扶，问是怎么样，又要回贾母来请大夫。',
    hash='sha256:da44c0b9d753bc1da13e60869e9517348c6fd887c9fcf64fe8ea34f1851ac42d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2897',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=361,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=79682,
    end_offset=79704,
    text_slice='“不用忙，不相干！这是急火攻心，血不归经。”',
    hash='sha256:4c7e6e28dc7f3d005dd8077261c6fb9a7f2e7fa6287a812408bb353c15694227'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2898',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=361,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=79704,
    end_offset=79728,
    text_slice='说着便爬起来，要衣服换了，来见贾母，实时要过去。',
    hash='sha256:755b11a1ed05e04c48bbf610717b006706d389a41ee1ff30ff4e24efe80ae637'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2899',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=361,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=79728,
    end_offset=79754,
    text_slice='袭人见他如此，心中虽放不下，又不敢拦，只是由他罢了。',
    hash='sha256:747ea7f97b4017f78e1182f338d358e33d951dfc1899b362a4ee287f2a0d9a94'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2900',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=361,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=79764,
    end_offset=79793,
    text_slice='“才咽气的人，那里不干净；二则夜里风大，等明早再去不迟。”',
    hash='sha256:ef2a0d574e97817912fdba0337d3f77a792e78beb11e52cf623e8253d2eb8261'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2901',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=361,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=79793,
    end_offset=79800,
    text_slice='宝玉那里肯依。',
    hash='sha256:4001e3a560f2b7ba3404dba9a797e26ecef0bb79cd5d1a06b0f837463f48c7ac'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2902',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=361,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=79800,
    end_offset=79819,
    text_slice='贾母命人备车，多派跟从人役，拥护前来。',
    hash='sha256:1dc33d31a214b86ca257d0e5a8acce7807c86f221100bb7b5160d2ba9c51ceaf'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2903',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=362,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=79821,
    end_offset=79863,
    text_slice='一直到了宁国府前，只见府门洞开，两边灯笼照如白昼，乱烘烘人来人往，里面哭声摇山振岳。',
    hash='sha256:7c247bbbbf816e1d2d4583e2191c1d44ca8f9864f655ae4654ed8b24c35e4628'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2904',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=362,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=79863,
    end_offset=79883,
    text_slice='宝玉下了车，忙忙奔至停灵之室，痛哭一番。',
    hash='sha256:152cf5c5856d3dcf8b8baf37a0ba227b50b79991c440e09ea13de36b64e7ad13'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2905',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=362,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=79883,
    end_offset=79890,
    text_slice='然后见过尤氏。',
    hash='sha256:83bb1c2d39fe90dba402f32029a91bba1ca4f963e0e9209b5a531de5a98a9d02'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2906',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=362,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=79890,
    end_offset=79907,
    text_slice='谁知尤氏正犯了胃疼旧疾，睡在床上。',
    hash='sha256:7dee32e262569b1b689705e5b991dd802c493d06cdd245a87e96d05951820f38'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2907',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=362,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=79907,
    end_offset=79916,
    text_slice='然后又出来见贾珍。',
    hash='sha256:d10fbbc7badfa90ac888cab571dd05bcfd682f5f615cfca9bbc37b6a935a4594'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2908',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=362,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=79916,
    end_offset=80014,
    text_slice='彼时贾代儒代领贾敕、贾效、贾敦、贾赦、贾政、贾琮、贾扁(原字为左玉右扁)、贾珩、贾珖、贾琛、贾琼、贾璘、贾蔷、贾菖、贾菱、贾芸、贾芹、贾蓁、贾萍、贾藻、贾蘅、贾芬、贾芳、贾兰、贾菌、贾芝等都来了。',
    hash='sha256:c54982bad2efc96f0a51ab262e49432d7d16c4986765ee9e0f1cf80a5c02317f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2909',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=362,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=80032,
    end_offset=80078,
    text_slice='“合家大小，远近亲友，谁不知我这媳妇比儿子还强十倍！如今伸腿去了，可见这长房内绝灭无人了。”',
    hash='sha256:ece0d0e540c82743b7b12c3cad209edfece9ee5eaa9e1d03aee71ffaa315812e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2910',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=362,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=80078,
    end_offset=80086,
    text_slice='说着，又哭起来。',
    hash='sha256:94b277e17a923c878f47ce9a0b094feacd2b6bb567c11c2e1a4df3ff3f923ac2'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2911',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=362,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=80092,
    end_offset=80114,
    text_slice='“人已辞世，哭也无益，且商议如何料理要紧。”',
    hash='sha256:d055fc812cdea5978ca9233bec4bd9af592c36e1d7eefb045bf23496210be120'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2912',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=362,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=80114,
    end_offset=80120,
    text_slice='贾珍拍手道：',
    hash='sha256:3710f8ffe180707e5bb88ed1b688b074217c19e8e0a8beed7076ba538d640905'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2913',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=362,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=80120,
    end_offset=80136,
    text_slice='“如何料理，不过尽我所有罢了！”',
    hash='sha256:849b7797f997dc09c42ead9ecfde413c1c73eb1d07cc5335a264bfa523d358a6'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2914',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=363,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=80138,
    end_offset=80167,
    text_slice='正说着，只见秦业、秦钟并尤氏的几个眷属、尤氏姊妹也都来了。',
    hash='sha256:caa491afe8e16f18166de776543bd4a2da10dc92a12fb806e2f8b42b3e180659'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2915',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=363,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=80167,
    end_offset=80225,
    text_slice='贾珍便命贾琼、贾琛、贾璘、贾蔷四个人去陪客，一面吩咐去请钦天监阴阳司来择日，择准停灵七七四十九日，三日后开丧送讣闻。',
    hash='sha256:7f36d0fba9a65273ad513b0da6d005df6f750df6dbf820993ae7b76d62287301'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2916',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=363,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=80225,
    end_offset=80265,
    text_slice='这四十九日，单请一百单八众禅僧在大厅上拜大悲忏，超度前亡后化诸魂，以免亡者之罪。',
    hash='sha256:e265a23efa4ad2cfd6f2572f881e73deb8bcf7563836ccd7c5a266e685d1f0ff'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2917',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=363,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=80265,
    end_offset=80296,
    text_slice='另设一坛于天香楼上，是九十九位全真道士，打四十九日解冤洗业醮。',
    hash='sha256:a31d2be02533f8215a276400531ef8bce8001fa778ee6d971e130f4b9b10eed9'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2918',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=363,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=80296,
    end_offset=80330,
    text_slice='然后停灵于会芳园中，灵前另有五十众高僧、五十众高道，对坛按七作好事。',
    hash='sha256:a0be244385e68cfa83766d5d62425b816f077af9e83f4460b205c1b27b154c3a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2919',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=363,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=80330,
    end_offset=80383,
    text_slice='那贾敬闻得长孙媳死了，因自为早晚就要飞升，如何肯又回家染了红尘，将前功尽弃呢，因此并不在意，只凭贾珍料理。',
    hash='sha256:88c251188a6215dc5522c825b89320bdd06224f841cd1ace87f7926fee9509b3'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2920',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=364,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=80385,
    end_offset=80400,
    text_slice='贾珍见父亲不管，亦发恣意奢华。',
    hash='sha256:d14311c1d850f5b083ffc1abc74b72d06b2254b012d561e9a2c0e884d6ca2b6b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2921',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=364,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=80400,
    end_offset=80414,
    text_slice='看板时，几副杉木板皆不中用。',
    hash='sha256:17855cac783488ddd5ac01dfff31b99d36ac334d91458651476b1fcdc5f755e2'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2922',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=364,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=80434,
    end_offset=80532,
    text_slice='“我们木店里有一副，叫作什么樯木，出在潢海铁网山上，作了棺材，万年不坏。这还是当年先父带来，原系义忠亲王老千岁要的，因他坏了事，就不曾拿去。现在还封在店内，也没有人出价敢买。你若要，就抬来罢了。”',
    hash='sha256:f3581f1112e7a97ca785f1fd13c6508e109406352eaf1737fe785d61d1861cb0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2923',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=364,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=80532,
    end_offset=80548,
    text_slice='贾珍听了，喜之不禁，即命人抬来。',
    hash='sha256:27424b965509d38a39fa1c9ce9ccd9505874809fb83d139c7b11d28554b826af'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2924',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=364,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=80548,
    end_offset=80583,
    text_slice='大家看时，只见帮底皆厚八寸，纹若槟榔，味若檀麝，以手扣之，玎珰如金玉。',
    hash='sha256:7e9daa050a685571501fd0eb12bf6270520f1b0306b9b0cfbac2c8664a4cd3d5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2925',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=364,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=80583,
    end_offset=80591,
    text_slice='大家都奇异称赞。',
    hash='sha256:a96f61f9ad50bd47fc04bdb0b07e7fd97d74dd19d79fd11a7fbf5e15633657a6'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2926',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=364,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=80596,
    end_offset=80603,
    text_slice='“价值几何？”',
    hash='sha256:101947ef782f50d8e8d268b7b3494e60d49816fbe1e06714cd10ef9ab804ccae'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2927',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=364,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=80603,
    end_offset=80608,
    text_slice='薛蟠笑道：',
    hash='sha256:9dbbea5ba7ba49db9e6d4cdc0a8d2bb5d4bd37781a27071711a0600aff853c80'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2928',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=364,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=80608,
    end_offset=80643,
    text_slice='“拿一千两银子来，只怕也没处买去。什么价不价，赏他们几两工钱就是了。”',
    hash='sha256:5f94b4222baa9ddd9d708ac25e2a7560767224bdea22c9592b9df44ea0b09e2d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2929',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=364,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=80643,
    end_offset=80660,
    text_slice='贾珍听说，忙谢不尽，即命解锯糊漆。',
    hash='sha256:0ee79ebb651f7baac28e828d369ee13116ffa48dcd3cceda803a4457064ea2f8'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2930',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=364,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=80666,
    end_offset=80689,
    text_slice='“此物恐非常人可享者，殓以上等杉木也就是了。”',
    hash='sha256:ea7546a058dd482105f4ff68d8efac3ffc7c1867a24a3b7ff4c60d0734243a3a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2931',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=364,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=80689,
    end_offset=80710,
    text_slice='此时，贾珍恨不能代秦氏之死，这话如何肯听。',
    hash='sha256:60dc3e3e31d80dd35e10ddfc984c04f67bde38d5e5ba47d703d645f52f9f4447'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2932',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=365,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=80712,
    end_offset=80741,
    text_slice='因忽又听得秦氏之丫鬟名唤瑞珠者，见秦氏死了，她也触柱而亡。',
    hash='sha256:82736978b12b1071d1e7c9b6e057ec00286c999d09a1a9f9f11959916d9d71f2'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2933',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=365,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=80741,
    end_offset=80755,
    text_slice='此事可罕，合族中人也都称叹。',
    hash='sha256:95679a6e71887722445d166cd6d275042a6c15972a97a48ddf59bc2be1832018'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2934',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=365,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=80755,
    end_offset=80780,
    text_slice='贾珍遂以孙女之礼敛殡，一并停灵于会芳园中之登仙阁。',
    hash='sha256:bffbbbc3ecb6a8f1c95d93f1569a193984ddea8571cb5f9a8a544c7d5d4798bd'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2935',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=365,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=80780,
    end_offset=80814,
    text_slice='小丫鬟名宝珠者，因见秦氏身无所出，乃甘心愿为义女，誓任摔丧驾灵之任。',
    hash='sha256:a6a66203e48fae287683bfb03ac7ba55853be02c04cb428e321cf87f9be79d39'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2936',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=365,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=80814,
    end_offset=80837,
    text_slice='贾珍喜之不禁，实时传下：“从此皆呼宝珠为小姐。',
    hash='sha256:69f78240c76fa041feb0ac578578929f2fab843dbee6c92324280372d7c3d9e2'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2937',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=365,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=80837,
    end_offset=80856,
    text_slice='”那宝珠按未嫁女之丧，在灵前哀哀欲绝。',
    hash='sha256:660f1be4d347afccea67d2e0a466ef4203a39e41c3015999ac079feb478196b7'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2938',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=365,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=80856,
    end_offset=80883,
    text_slice='于是，合族人丁并家下诸人，都各遵旧制行事，自不敢紊乱。',
    hash='sha256:e5d5f37d81b9fb679df08f3a612428770d12f7504c2a9617a658fef99fe7ee34'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2939',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=366,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=80885,
    end_offset=80928,
    text_slice='贾珍因想着贾蓉不过是个黉门监，灵幡经榜上写时不好看，便是执事也不多，因此心下甚不自在。',
    hash='sha256:f45b22af5ff39e19a6f575d5dae193b4bf9d655a01f3f4810252477c96857db3'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2940',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=366,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=80928,
    end_offset=80979,
    text_slice='可巧这日正是首七第四日，早有大明宫掌宫内相戴权，先备了祭礼遣人抬来，次后坐了大轿，打伞鸣锣，亲来上祭。',
    hash='sha256:30d2217d3bbe4cbb34bd4bc9d81f1d3b5066489989fe2d85cde09190abafd322'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2941',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=366,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=80979,
    end_offset=80993,
    text_slice='贾珍忙接着，让至逗蜂轩献茶。',
    hash='sha256:1ec7b4e130151420b282b383e9e12d521457f8efffad54f5a4b33a93c325a485'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2942',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=366,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=80993,
    end_offset=81021,
    text_slice='贾珍心中打算定了主意，因而趁便就说要与贾蓉蠲个前程的话。',
    hash='sha256:ff014e57f9e08aa0abf315a56dec4860f7bfffaca6af0f1c99048fd4fbb40dc4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2943',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=366,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=81030,
    end_offset=81042,
    text_slice='“想是为丧礼上风光些。”',
    hash='sha256:454bc73ed80121ad0b3a9222fae0598686612b4004e38313c10235d30875e7b8'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2944',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=366,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=81042,
    end_offset=81048,
    text_slice='贾珍忙笑道：',
    hash='sha256:b12d0ce1a107bf7a81d07f27012cacbc6b0f6af70ffdb14ec54c4ba07be4954b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2945',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=366,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=81048,
    end_offset=81058,
    text_slice='“老内相所见不差。”',
    hash='sha256:9c1bde2a71fd1e76687d1c18c0d9dcaf84d3ce05738cd0eaaf9d3dc6fecdcfe5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2946',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=366,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=81058,
    end_offset=81062,
    text_slice='戴权道：',
    hash='sha256:4a253f0cd2cf9ce59731c58fe6faadd0ff5b04810dec84e52923e8288f589bdc'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2947',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=366,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=81062,
    end_offset=81203,
    text_slice='“事倒凑巧，正有个美缺。如今三百员龙禁尉短了两员，昨儿襄阳侯的兄弟老三来求我，现拿了一千五百两银子，送到我家里。你知道，咱们都是老相与，不拘怎么样，看着他爷爷的分上，胡乱应了。还剩了一个缺，谁知永兴节度使冯胖子来求，要与他孩子蠲，我就没工夫应他。既是咱们的孩子要蠲，快写个履历来。”',
    hash='sha256:5e03a562fffeb3852b2a0457443fbe9044198a3576ca14f5d7da6cdac739a6f8'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2948',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=366,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=81203,
    end_offset=81212,
    text_slice='贾珍听说，忙吩咐：',
    hash='sha256:5dab45bdfbcb659bd82909ad4b2927f59b5a9901ae2034259ada8157ff2343fe'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2949',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=366,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=81212,
    end_offset=81231,
    text_slice='“快命书房里人恭敬写了大爷的履历来。”',
    hash='sha256:699c17456c5cef10918be789bf30e4fa95321c227dbaae9acf6101b0bd09626a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2950',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=366,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=81231,
    end_offset=81255,
    text_slice='小厮不敢怠慢，去了一刻，便拿了一张红纸来与贾珍。',
    hash='sha256:c1d3885016cc0368bb48fac7460e0debca833e951e1ccaa1d85781a46e9f000d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2951',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=366,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=81255,
    end_offset=81266,
    text_slice='贾珍看了，忙送与戴权。',
    hash='sha256:9d6856551371e2fd2511b6d75cbeff6a03077b12d64e8d190cc3abffd2dd5344'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2952',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=366,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=81266,
    end_offset=81294,
    text_slice='戴权看时，上面写道：江南江宁府江宁县监生贾蓉，年二十岁。',
    hash='sha256:e01d5c0f2eec800eb329e5171f8c1e25c6bc799d563b9d051db0335cc46375d1'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2953',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=366,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=81294,
    end_offset=81340,
    text_slice='曾祖，原任京营节度使世袭一等神威将军贾代化；祖，乙卯科进士贾敬；父，世袭三品爵威烈将军贾珍。',
    hash='sha256:b832e15df011dbf4c1de9ae263073f430ba80f18dad58ae9e3efbde78d2c704c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2954',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=366,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=81363,
    end_offset=81417,
    text_slice='“回来送与户部堂官老赵，说我拜上他，起一张五品龙禁尉的票，再给个执照，就把那履历填上，明儿我来兑银子送去。”',
    hash='sha256:6229be824fd220a2fe3711a7b8198d40999c2aac93b9a353073de6a1c115380a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2955',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=366,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=81417,
    end_offset=81431,
    text_slice='小厮答应了，戴权也就告辞了。',
    hash='sha256:69b0e2b101d2440bb7f0d65333f3813517b4b10e8840d6c07197c97ecc40a2b1'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2956',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=366,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=81431,
    end_offset=81447,
    text_slice='贾珍十分款留不住，只得送出府门。',
    hash='sha256:b7326b61636431665fa2f8f5dbe7440373481844f4013fa5d8640002dec9d7b6'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2957',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=366,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=81456,
    end_offset=81479,
    text_slice='“银子还是我到部兑，还是一并送入老内相府中？”',
    hash='sha256:62f1e511db82e2c5990b9ae86196dff524da7016a497aeb824fa8ae9b6d55ab9'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2958',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=366,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=81479,
    end_offset=81483,
    text_slice='戴权道：',
    hash='sha256:4a253f0cd2cf9ce59731c58fe6faadd0ff5b04810dec84e52923e8288f589bdc'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2959',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=366,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=81483,
    end_offset=81516,
    text_slice='“若到部里，你又吃亏了。不如平准一千二百两银子，送到我家就完了。”',
    hash='sha256:be674a7d3cc677ef1c28e3b9e42ee2f7e21e801a7ffa832d1dda58742dc0a3d4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2960',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=366,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=81516,
    end_offset=81526,
    text_slice='贾珍感谢不尽，只说：',
    hash='sha256:ed4820fb00c39d27b500088a5c90dd8b88e2122dbddf72a007f6934ffda41bf4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2961',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=366,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=81526,
    end_offset=81542,
    text_slice='“待服满后，亲带小犬到府叩谢。”',
    hash='sha256:8204aa2c22a44f11acfd2568fb47abe36699ba36bca77bc8797b6826453019fa'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2962',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=366,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=81542,
    end_offset=81547,
    text_slice='于是作别。',
    hash='sha256:96bdd49cb30d7e6c2359e988d4624a15a17a348a76fb57b7fcf5b1271a88bf5e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2963',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=367,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=81549,
    end_offset=81574,
    text_slice='接着，便又听喝道之声，原来是忠靖侯史鼎的夫人来了。',
    hash='sha256:babf45fa52fd25c34489f5e7a335d2e56001ac0a45954234f1df0670786d5b7c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2964',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=367,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=81574,
    end_offset=81613,
    text_slice='王夫人、邢夫人、凤姐等刚迎入上房，又见锦乡侯、川宁侯、寿山伯三家祭礼摆在灵前。',
    hash='sha256:12bae17269d32cb79df1561c42e09e69f20cf2484b112e077e5a1dc17a8ad2b9'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2965',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=367,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=81613,
    end_offset=81630,
    text_slice='少时，三家下轿，贾政等忙接上大厅。',
    hash='sha256:bc45e7b1355843a47540f87b5412389baba7daa97727ec583022396847c7098f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2966',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=367,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=81630,
    end_offset=81645,
    text_slice='如此亲朋你来我去，也不能胜数。',
    hash='sha256:24cf535d054ca27fcc3f5f4f37a1e38925eeba69bb86c1efd0d52bb4b0e67099'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2967',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=367,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=81645,
    end_offset=81675,
    text_slice='只这四十九日，宁国府街上一条白漫漫人来人往，花簇簇官去官来。',
    hash='sha256:3112cf44db56a582393216abdb5510eabed6919de5c4110c6f925ff56ef221ba'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2968',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=368,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=81677,
    end_offset=81694,
    text_slice='贾珍命贾蓉次日换了吉服，领凭回来。',
    hash='sha256:ccb5076125d1b3c38512a668e19bf42cc501b141ffe01389e2593178fbb223c0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2969',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=368,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=81694,
    end_offset=81710,
    text_slice='灵前供用执事等物，俱按五品职例。',
    hash='sha256:a684f045ee1c4b0dcd77dec1944c5cb4f71f675ab2e264bd013256e3f1087820'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2970',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=368,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=81710,
    end_offset=81733,
    text_slice='灵牌、疏上皆写“天朝诰授贾门秦氏恭人之灵位”。',
    hash='sha256:a2aa8878212b21b48f4a2c152f32d70a3e81bfc283249b4f525880665a1a4acd'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2971',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=368,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=81733,
    end_offset=81775,
    text_slice='会芳园的临街大门洞开，旋在两边起了鼓乐厅，两班青衣按时奏乐，一对对执事摆的刀斩斧齐。',
    hash='sha256:944e673041970317e91fb3c1458620b64ebda756d26eebe6efdac8a071d1ad32'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2972',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=369,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=81813,
    end_offset=81833,
    text_slice='对面高起着宣坛，僧道对坛榜文，榜上大书：',
    hash='sha256:2454e4419882415e7b2f1965ec86a609de9a96907d5fea0e16489830ae7d79b3'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2973',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=369,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=81833,
    end_offset=81924,
    text_slice='“世袭宁国公冢孙妇、防护内廷御前侍卫龙禁尉贾门秦氏恭人之丧。四大部州至中之地、奉天永运太平之国，总理虚无寂静教门僧录司正堂万虚、总理元始三一教门道录司正堂叶生等，敬谨修斋，朝天叩佛”',
    hash='sha256:f6c4fe1dde25625a8a4c364984cf1e51d63034371334f352df7a96380ad7736a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2974',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=369,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=81924,
    end_offset=81927,
    text_slice='，以及',
    hash='sha256:c3828f02baf2d420a6769dbeb9f10a009d58af940521140b78cdb5318be85a23'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2975',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=369,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=81927,
    end_offset=81967,
    text_slice='“恭请诸伽蓝、揭谛、功曹等神，圣恩普锡，神威远镇，四十九日消灾洗孽平安水陆道场”',
    hash='sha256:efeca7cbdc9ffce55404f198124e19b3d75165df24ef6cbb516a997b0abc37b4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2976',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=369,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=81967,
    end_offset=81980,
    text_slice='诸如等语，余者亦不消烦记。',
    hash='sha256:2c3b4ee9236d5a35c17194437c27961b6699c088b92c6eb342eb2b802996f584'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2977',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=370,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=81982,
    end_offset=82039,
    text_slice='只是贾珍虽然此时心意满足，但里面尤氏又犯了旧疾，不能料理事务，惟恐各诰命来往，亏了礼数，怕人笑话，因此心中不自在。',
    hash='sha256:699a4bbd6bd84523eb12dcd63f661e53cdc3119a589dc1854b4c376694595b28'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2978',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=370,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=82055,
    end_offset=82073,
    text_slice='“事事都算安贴了，大哥哥还愁什么？”',
    hash='sha256:70c9009ad876d87934224437e22e86376508769b162f803aaf6da82eccf6e5d9'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2979',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=370,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=82073,
    end_offset=82091,
    text_slice='贾珍见问，便将里面无人的话说了出来。',
    hash='sha256:08f20c77e3e43df386a5ffa2fb1118d33d02c79239aa7593d6265d292aa206e4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2980',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=370,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=82098,
    end_offset=82126,
    text_slice='“这有何难，我荐一个人与你权理这一个月的事，管必妥当。”',
    hash='sha256:e812d3472dc49bd82820cf92dfaaca2e99bfc1243a52a0f0ded13bf72069fbba'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2981',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=370,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=82126,
    end_offset=82131,
    text_slice='贾珍忙问：',
    hash='sha256:8dc411e53320d92975e1c240f585334cfb796d9ad086212681a8f82f86f0e716'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2982',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=370,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=82131,
    end_offset=82136,
    text_slice='“是谁？”',
    hash='sha256:82427267ca6af0bc5530458f0127b21951a3da01288fd5e7463cf1070246e245'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2983',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=370,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=82136,
    end_offset=82164,
    text_slice='宝玉见座间还有许多亲友，不便明言，走至贾珍耳边说了两句。',
    hash='sha256:881b4551f3e81e4d2cff488d9c26b285ed5bd7696ef77988f4cc1c73a8c527bb'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2984',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=370,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=82181,
    end_offset=82193,
    text_slice='“果然安贴，如今就去。”',
    hash='sha256:888eeaa1c1a40550d8af97610a93563928cb942a491fbf10f3185fd7b9e29350'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2985',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=370,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=82193,
    end_offset=82212,
    text_slice='说着拉了宝玉，辞了众人，便往上房里来。',
    hash='sha256:75e9a7cd207680d8dbb69b8263fbb7979072fc9d0416ab5857af204ae743c358'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2986',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=371,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=82214,
    end_offset=82261,
    text_slice='可巧这日非正经日期，亲友来的少，里面不过几位近亲堂客，邢夫人、王夫人、凤姐并合族中的内眷陪坐。',
    hash='sha256:25f34ab1dc85c14d7608d5e85aed29cbc78029cad8270b9b7daad44bd3b0c1a7'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2987',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=371,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=82266,
    end_offset=82274,
    text_slice='“大爷进来了。”',
    hash='sha256:4361f1fa720c993a734a38133fd0c0d8dc152aa64e002a7102e0939cfea86f54'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2988',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=371,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=82274,
    end_offset=82301,
    text_slice='吓得众婆娘的唿一声，往后藏之不迭，独凤姐款款站了起来。',
    hash='sha256:1de034b027fd77ec1dd6222c9d3047885065cc01911bb04d07006019a882aa73'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2989',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=371,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=82301,
    end_offset=82330,
    text_slice='贾珍此时也有些病症在身，二则过于悲痛了，因拄了拐踱了进来。',
    hash='sha256:0b921e3f4a6199b49c97a839a7af088dec0f84a62f09f2c71b4aeb9af4111cfe'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2990',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=371,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=82338,
    end_offset=82365,
    text_slice='“你身上不好，又连日事多，该歇歇才是，又进来做什么？”',
    hash='sha256:30a4ebc5d451df5e58c87cf4971840da93473ae38e252b5d019d084e45607297'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2991',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=371,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=82365,
    end_offset=82385,
    text_slice='贾珍一面扶拐，扎挣着要蹲身跪下请安道乏。',
    hash='sha256:519e37756fce303efcdaeff513a47c27120861943758a0eead99988bc82b33a6'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2992',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=371,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=82385,
    end_offset=82406,
    text_slice='邢夫人等忙叫宝玉搀住，命人挪椅子来与他坐。',
    hash='sha256:c76aced89cb69a073b1bf3d09963419d2ac84e1a8b628b526f1b1415c442bebb'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2993',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=371,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=82420,
    end_offset=82442,
    text_slice='“侄儿进来有一件事要恳求二位婶婶并大妹妹。”',
    hash='sha256:a9ed0cc247d847b9934c4023ce7a73d0558be43bce380c8c63881cdf56522792'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2994',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=371,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=82442,
    end_offset=82449,
    text_slice='邢夫人等忙问：',
    hash='sha256:891c084c677006f1152dc724b606dec2f314b29ecf194d37654bdfe385d2d8d9'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2995',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=371,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=82449,
    end_offset=82455,
    text_slice='“什么事？”',
    hash='sha256:1fac5ed87aea3d294cc305aaa667620bfeac9a1da17bfd76fdd65792d137a837'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2996',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=371,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=82455,
    end_offset=82461,
    text_slice='贾珍忙笑道：',
    hash='sha256:b12d0ce1a107bf7a81d07f27012cacbc6b0f6af70ffdb14ec54c4ba07be4954b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2997',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=371,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=82461,
    end_offset=82525,
    text_slice='“婶婶自然知道，如今孙子媳妇没了，侄儿媳妇偏又病倒，我看里头着实不成个体统。怎么屈尊大妹妹一个月，在这里料理料理，我就放心了。”',
    hash='sha256:0d002e0584f40ba2717680bed2b9a7f547de2984fc5722f27e92bae43ae738bd'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2998',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=371,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=82525,
    end_offset=82531,
    text_slice='邢夫人笑道：',
    hash='sha256:110b6a71cd4ed73e566bea2d4195cab209aad52c7eeeb8503b33de563c00de2a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_2999',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=371,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=82531,
    end_offset=82562,
    text_slice='“原来为这个。你大妹妹现在你二婶子家，只和你二婶子说就是了。”',
    hash='sha256:065aacad61b478bdd888c95e98e88ceea55ac19c2b14a72b61836c162baed4fe'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3000',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=371,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=82562,
    end_offset=82568,
    text_slice='王夫人忙道：',
    hash='sha256:a8e55bcd3d22cd1d2a9259aa487498ff95da82f921376292470ee91057fd126b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3001',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=371,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=82568,
    end_offset=82607,
    text_slice='“她一个小孩子家，何曾经过这样事？倘或料理不清，反叫人笑话。倒是再烦别人好。”',
    hash='sha256:83169cc517938854ea55c0366c288462756a5c7a2e42326c13f8c5450bcfd2fd'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3002',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=371,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=82607,
    end_offset=82612,
    text_slice='贾珍笑道：',
    hash='sha256:63b4c161a5484b96e4ab3ce051a57823c9c2253a8859a27eccfa65cc01a5b275'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3003',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=371,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=82612,
    end_offset=82748,
    text_slice='“婶子的意思侄儿猜着了，是怕大妹妹劳苦了。若说料理不开，我包管必料理得开，便是错一点儿，别人看着还是不错的。从小儿大妹妹玩笑着，就有杀伐决断；如今出了阁，又在那府里办事，越发历练老成了。我想了这几日，除了大妹妹，再无人了。婶婶不看侄儿、侄儿媳妇的分上，只看死了的分上罢！”',
    hash='sha256:215db9f9c52c9058f189440cf68471c88746a80d330c0eed4c494d3905f285b0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3004',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=371,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=82748,
    end_offset=82755,
    text_slice='说着滚下泪来。',
    hash='sha256:7cdef8365c27d1f075d3b1191d44486144cb3354cdb734a3dff9f4fd49270fe0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3005',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=372,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=82757,
    end_offset=82786,
    text_slice='王夫人心中怕的是凤姐儿未经过丧事，怕她料理不清，惹人笑话。',
    hash='sha256:0ef04f777a4afd57b79235f19d7d21d589928ae924e0199f7baad1d47a96fb09'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3006',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=372,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=82786,
    end_offset=82818,
    text_slice='今见贾珍苦苦的说到这步田地，心中已活了几分，却又眼看着凤姐出神。',
    hash='sha256:b76c1a8c201ace45b965665dca44a4e92968ef8da4f83bdb1302375090e23ec5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3007',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=372,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=82818,
    end_offset=82866,
    text_slice='那凤姐素日最喜揽事办，好卖弄才干，虽然当家妥当，也因未办过婚丧大事，恐人还不服，巴不得遇见这事。',
    hash='sha256:4c291316d02409d7e8fdc455ec1178493087dd33cb9fa5099b6ff89df98286ba'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3008',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=372,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=82866,
    end_offset=82884,
    text_slice='今日见贾珍如此一来；她心中早已欢喜。',
    hash='sha256:cf3f607851237f41ce1302d8bdbf1692c96986eee6395aab86a940906e648634'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3009',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=372,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=82917,
    end_offset=82936,
    text_slice='“大哥哥说得这么恳切，太太就依了罢。”',
    hash='sha256:22272e45e49e314d60a81eff92bcfa8cfb0a7e8effae3c790acd12af5882b924'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3010',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=372,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=82936,
    end_offset=82944,
    text_slice='王夫人悄悄的道：',
    hash='sha256:6c593cbde5905946ab3fd43a4b20995b8ea99d971c519d0ca31103a7cfb96a54'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3011',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=372,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=82944,
    end_offset=82951,
    text_slice='“你可能么？”',
    hash='sha256:d8c882de7003ea9b44e99960e28bfa44bdc4bc8aa31bf092af4c62c776785a95'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3012',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=372,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=82951,
    end_offset=82955,
    text_slice='凤姐道：',
    hash='sha256:493b74ef604832e715c69f5c0a24d8d4a251e38e82e9ee38006f3f407dd315a5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3013',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=372,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=82955,
    end_offset=83006,
    text_slice='“有什么不能的！外面的大事大哥哥已经料理清了，不过是里头照管照管，便是我有不知道的，问问太太就是了。”',
    hash='sha256:f29381474814f2711f0990294a2f8b6d3c2c6aedb09a1ebbf471500b0e23148a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3014',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=372,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=83006,
    end_offset=83020,
    text_slice='王夫人见说得有理，便不作声。',
    hash='sha256:a379e1f6097a2be2eaed49489bd2bffb78c38a019c9f31cd428278d2000c09db'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3015',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=372,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=83033,
    end_offset=83079,
    text_slice='“也管不得许多了，横竖要求大妹妹辛苦辛苦。我这里先与妹妹行礼，等事完了，我再到那府里去谢。”',
    hash='sha256:e8de8eac049035baef55e69ec2c5b3380642e7a08d1d216ea2bb36732fe9a41c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3016',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=372,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=83079,
    end_offset=83096,
    text_slice='说着，就作揖下去，凤姐儿还礼不迭。',
    hash='sha256:e280f26409e0480c7cd09a2ee09bc91281fad173830eda768692bf731288bf41'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3017',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=373,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=83098,
    end_offset=83123,
    text_slice='贾珍便忙向袖中取了宁国府对牌出来，命宝玉送与凤姐。',
    hash='sha256:a75778940e4ba185c742b02251696dc7eabcb6d954b20f0cbd115de342dc5383'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3018',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=373,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=83126,
    end_offset=83211,
    text_slice='“妹妹爱怎么样就怎样，要什么只管拿这个取去，也不必问我，只求别存心替我省钱，只要好看为上；二则也要同那府里一样待人才好，不要存心怕人抱怨。只这两件外，我再没不放心的了。”',
    hash='sha256:e5f59c14ddf98265f2c99498ef0b684a70744adaa4fced8cf30d6490caec6bd7'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3019',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=373,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=83211,
    end_offset=83226,
    text_slice='凤姐不敢就接牌，只看着王夫人。',
    hash='sha256:d01074c0edb61121a50db8a573322616174d346cecc5c3f7e9d6c8dbefc2af25'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3020',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=373,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=83231,
    end_offset=83275,
    text_slice='“你哥哥既这么说，你就照看照看罢了，只是别自作主意。有了事，打发人问你哥哥、嫂子要紧。”',
    hash='sha256:40ae59d16ed70c06a3e920c488896c9afd86ac2001cefe136f18d17b0a5fd354'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3021',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=373,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=83275,
    end_offset=83296,
    text_slice='宝玉早向贾珍手里接过对牌来，强递与凤姐了。',
    hash='sha256:6949196256493ecb719864fd0406565ef76d1b872be5467dddf087709ba54bb4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3022',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=373,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=83299,
    end_offset=83356,
    text_slice='“妹妹还是住在这里，还是天天来呢？若是天天来，越发辛苦了。不如我这里赶着收拾出一个院落来，妹妹住过这几日倒安稳。”',
    hash='sha256:751ff52e41adaae3750018d18d24fab367b280f0203843bc385d544867ef03e4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3023',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=373,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=83356,
    end_offset=83361,
    text_slice='凤姐笑道：',
    hash='sha256:fa673815883516a89495f0598428fc17e5f85586cc72e1283fe4d69da7b1c484'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3024',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=373,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=83361,
    end_offset=83382,
    text_slice='“不用。那边也离不得我，倒是天天来的好。”',
    hash='sha256:166e4a6551c4984ccb38f6d0473f4b5f47ac11e0b1eb86c079f1b7df4bc9a3ff'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3025',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=373,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=83382,
    end_offset=83392,
    text_slice='贾珍听说，只得罢了。',
    hash='sha256:332c6dc3e31d2641799865a38adc64915dfea741afef3f35277aeaf1983ae383'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3026',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=373,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=83392,
    end_offset=83407,
    text_slice='然后又说了一回闲话，方才出去。',
    hash='sha256:5b29b22dbc5069c18b0131a8c3896b4bf195cfd56213f0e1243e1bff8146ca73'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3027',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=374,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=83409,
    end_offset=83425,
    text_slice='一时，女眷散后，王夫人因问凤姐：',
    hash='sha256:28e9f1e64b5b8f093edff50ca732b4c64a863f2e9db86f0823e263225b6277ca'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3028',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=374,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=83425,
    end_offset=83434,
    text_slice='“你今儿怎么样？”',
    hash='sha256:94e3b748ded458186919cf4a7edcea4a63a97a45b26a2eaa205db3248e354b00'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3029',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=374,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=83434,
    end_offset=83439,
    text_slice='凤姐儿道：',
    hash='sha256:93bab9ff591c039f189f615d0e6ec70c46f0b6be387ab4b78d2ab495d263a94e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3030',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=374,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=83439,
    end_offset=83467,
    text_slice='“太太只管请回去，我须得先理出一个头绪来，才回去得呢。”',
    hash='sha256:656f6a22bc2e1590d2b94d63b285a1bdc82802dadc174cb8da61d6ccf9503c08'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3031',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=374,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=83467,
    end_offset=83488,
    text_slice='王夫人听说，便先同邢夫人等回去，不在话下。',
    hash='sha256:596221234f0dd244dc61f9095b4f12142ebbdcbaa4d19554e2cded12bc7bd8d4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3032',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=375,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=83490,
    end_offset=83508,
    text_slice='这里，凤姐儿来至三间一所抱厦内坐了。',
    hash='sha256:ee3142359a01831e82b65f22a82a639ff3be387194cc7e46364aa70ef19ef376'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3033',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=375,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=83508,
    end_offset=83592,
    text_slice='因想：头一件是人口混杂，遗失东西；第二件，事无专执，临期推委；第三件，需用过费，滥支冒领；第四件，任无大小，苦乐不均；第五件，家人豪纵，有脸者不服钤束，无脸者不能上进。',
    hash='sha256:6bc95497e0217b6c8d18fe0c95c8fe51ba676b7ec29e7f116f5d8b741eabec4e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3034',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=375,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=83592,
    end_offset=83604,
    text_slice='此五件实是宁国府中风俗。',
    hash='sha256:23cf2e72862b52ac8cebf2d080b506201e22546afde475478c9b2096dad510b5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3035',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=375,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=83604,
    end_offset=83620,
    text_slice='不知凤姐如何处治，且听下回分解。',
    hash='sha256:f230b84ed04ed79d5865c12fb3b442be3d9ce93e426c273fe4b51d8a7281bd39'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3036',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=376,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=83625,
    end_offset=83641,
    text_slice='金紫万千谁治国，裙钗一二可齐家。',
    hash='sha256:6ee5492801f241549fc6580b16648c30d03b1bc802260b740c409e7e62a7af12'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3037',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=377,
    segment_type='heading',
    start_offset=83643,
    end_offset=83666,
    text_slice='第十四回  林如海捐馆扬州城\u3000贾宝玉路谒北静王',
    hash='sha256:a2edb360e9e90f2a4b4bc73c6863119bb919ec0baf9a64b360c2bb7a3cf7403d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3038',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=378,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=83668,
    end_offset=83699,
    text_slice='话说宁国府中都总管来升闻得里面委请了凤姐，因传齐同事人等说道：',
    hash='sha256:5c370ae3404e9c08d2acb906f5c16a8d02343370bf690afb97d1b23710d98bc2'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3039',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=378,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=83699,
    end_offset=83798,
    text_slice='“如今请了西府里琏二奶奶管理内事，倘或她来支取东西，或是说话，我们须要比往日小心些。每日大家早来晚散，宁可辛苦这一个月，过后再歇着，不要把老脸丢了。那是个有名的烈货，脸酸心硬，一时恼了，不认人的。”',
    hash='sha256:dbae1ec99c1d7db0288a68ebe9617d708f6c7ed8e6a915e053114aae2d6a19fa'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3040',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=378,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=83798,
    end_offset=83803,
    text_slice='众人都道：',
    hash='sha256:45d478b58b8f745c68040b83a789074bbb7b89eed8407b4b9a621ea054fdb6ac'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3041',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=378,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=83803,
    end_offset=83808,
    text_slice='“有理。”',
    hash='sha256:836fdf0eb83778c6ee715f95cf5c92616d6b0ee74e802227555d9eef16bc0be0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3042',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=378,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=83808,
    end_offset=83815,
    text_slice='又有一个笑道：',
    hash='sha256:3800247d97afe848ed622437842bcaa4aa815a484b4d994053ba0f6f0835495b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3043',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=378,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=83815,
    end_offset=83840,
    text_slice='“论理，我们里面也须得她来整治整治，都忒不像了。”',
    hash='sha256:f7408682dd4d124d128a892e42335f81223b09241e7df9584b25b6c42fb51299'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3044',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=378,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=83840,
    end_offset=83871,
    text_slice='正说着，只见来旺媳妇拿了对牌来领取呈文京榜纸札，票上批着数目。',
    hash='sha256:3b9aa1ffa5f3ba11b165973619109688d953213cf6bc980a626bfff6663a61c8'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3045',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=378,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=83871,
    end_offset=83919,
    text_slice='众人连忙让坐倒茶，一面命人按数取纸来抱着，同来旺媳妇一路来至仪门口，方交与来旺媳妇自己抱进去了。',
    hash='sha256:bc2888226927644b8ef100e5d3fcc0d5b827646bbeda19ccb66ccbe811afcbb3'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3046',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=379,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=83921,
    end_offset=83932,
    text_slice='凤姐即命彩明钉造簿册。',
    hash='sha256:fc2bddf5ec2590206321413e6a6274399007fe45c67e68be2a1458cd4735ed46'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3047',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=379,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=83932,
    end_offset=83972,
    text_slice='实时传来升媳妇，兼要家口花名册来查看，又限于明日一早，传齐家人媳妇进来听差等语。',
    hash='sha256:3dc051abc1c23ab8a1b052402aab1abc7e92ca94ee2aa586e34b6ce3ce3042e4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3048',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=379,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=83972,
    end_offset=83999,
    text_slice='大概点了一点数目单册，问了来升媳妇几句话，便坐车回家。',
    hash='sha256:7e2c11070c44cfb82e8e8a55ec18e944ea7f57b606f93cae1314bb81e0fa63bc'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3049',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=379,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=83999,
    end_offset=84004,
    text_slice='一宿无话。',
    hash='sha256:c5443e4ddc0297a845fe17e78db992e89835f4a31422c8dd3a33aae669ed2d1d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3050',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=380,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=84006,
    end_offset=84019,
    text_slice='至次日，卯正二刻便过来了。',
    hash='sha256:efc9c07b25949c819d1c442324a1023cb35be197851e4ec8ee3dee1a3f4d1d63'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3051',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=380,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=84019,
    end_offset=84060,
    text_slice='那宁国府中婆娘媳妇闻得到齐，只见凤姐正与来升媳妇分派，众人不敢擅入，只在窗外听觑。',
    hash='sha256:85e26714128908c87c08eab71f2322009450cd1adcdf444a9b76a3d7db04443f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3052',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=380,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=84060,
    end_offset=84089,
    text_slice='只听凤姐与来升媳妇道：“既托了我，我就说不得要讨你们嫌了。',
    hash='sha256:11df5cbc702f5824db018dbc16410eb45259d864e06f1079977f00a256d6cc3b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3053',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=380,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=84089,
    end_offset=84108,
    text_slice='我可比不得你们奶奶好性儿，由着你们去。',
    hash='sha256:92d54cfbc8192c52c264ba05a7a597472ffc6373a20c15607a12b82800d5e464'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3054',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=380,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=84108,
    end_offset=84162,
    text_slice='再不要说你们这府里原是这样的话，如今可要依着我行，错我半点儿，管不得谁是有脸的，谁是没脸的，一例现清白处治。',
    hash='sha256:eb5f0f59051a3bf014be1b0d5be478ec8ba9d88990efdfe962e677b4ea3a5d6b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3055',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=380,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=84162,
    end_offset=84189,
    text_slice='”说着，便吩咐彩明念花名册，按名一个一个的唤进来看视。',
    hash='sha256:acc3b76f036d6add3a63c00f7c78fb9770e5559bff54812264f0cb3d5b0e64b5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3056',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=381,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=84191,
    end_offset=84242,
    text_slice='一时看完，便又吩咐道：“这二十个分作两班，一班十个，每日在里头单管人来客往、倒茶，别的事也不用她们管。',
    hash='sha256:7400318856967677b1a67bc7d38a903fe48058c21f79e037a4640dbcae7c8b16'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3057',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=381,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=84242,
    end_offset=84273,
    text_slice='这二十个也分作两班，每日单管本家亲戚茶饭，别的事也不用他们管。',
    hash='sha256:a46b7ae4c9053353bc943b8a718f56e3e57a5b0f68d17e27f127e0f816a96615'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3058',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=381,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=84273,
    end_offset=84319,
    text_slice='这四十个人也分作两班，单在灵前上香添油，挂幔守灵，供饭供茶，随起举哀，别的事也不与她们相干。',
    hash='sha256:61a9f8e406e528aa7573c15f4c0dd36ea23761162d4555aeae6da250f176b8f8'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3059',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=381,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=84319,
    end_offset=84348,
    text_slice='这四个人单在内茶房收管杯碟茶器，若少一件，便叫他四个描赔。',
    hash='sha256:526d466a4f927fcc715bbe9751950811c60dc5488254ffd60c99b0485ad0de25'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3060',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=381,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=84348,
    end_offset=84371,
    text_slice='这四个人单管酒饭器皿，少一件，也是她四个描赔。',
    hash='sha256:788c7983f2ff2f0ca677f39dd2165afa70d7bddd4af246002b9fe9007e6978bd'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3061',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=381,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=84371,
    end_offset=84381,
    text_slice='这八个单管监收祭礼。',
    hash='sha256:aeb93782362b6c199d574e6104d20f81407fe48780fc2fcdb876d0c3c217fc0a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3062',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=381,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=84381,
    end_offset=84424,
    text_slice='这八个单管各处灯油、蜡烛、纸札，我总支了来，交与你八个，然后按我的定数再往各处去分派。',
    hash='sha256:5469723038fb5e360d8cd712e426e8994bbe7993db4e62471e86e5117db6df32'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3063',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=381,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=84424,
    end_offset=84452,
    text_slice='这三十个每日轮流各处上夜，照管门户，监察火烛，打扫地方。',
    hash='sha256:24a4681fd0dbec7fc3f72433dad4b716b2d5bc249066d55267621db360f2f76b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3064',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=381,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=84452,
    end_offset=84510,
    text_slice='这下剩的按着房屋分开，某人守某处，某处所有桌椅、古董起，至于痰盒、掸帚，一草一苗，或丢或坏，就和守这处的人算帐描赔。',
    hash='sha256:35cf81125e1dcfd19c77d900c79f086abacfd2fc07917aa90b2e6c3deb320b3d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3065',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=381,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=84510,
    end_offset=84545,
    text_slice='来升家的每日揽总查看，或有偷懒的，赌钱吃酒的，打架拌嘴的，立刻来回我。',
    hash='sha256:c5d81054334aa87500329e848daea5a8e5e23b0dcd264d73d200785447ab0bba'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3066',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=381,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=84545,
    end_offset=84567,
    text_slice='你有徇情，经我查出，三四辈子老脸就顾不成了。',
    hash='sha256:1539e08a8599f181be8653c631a160f582400d36abd51952128f2df0b41b3159'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3067',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=381,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=84567,
    end_offset=84590,
    text_slice='如今都有定规，以后哪一行乱了，只和那一行说话。',
    hash='sha256:d5c6347fecd8fcaf7fc22e905e1c2540c37a98ff5c7a446a00d59a5888d0be9f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3068',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=381,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=84590,
    end_offset=84620,
    text_slice='素日跟我的人，随身自有钟表，不论大小事，我是皆有一定的时辰。',
    hash='sha256:ad6b8c7e4ff70f4a1ebddf2f7f6408ebb31bbd1c23d1783187db4d167d62eca8'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3069',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=381,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=84620,
    end_offset=84633,
    text_slice='横竖你们上房里也有时辰钟。',
    hash='sha256:1302b4a4abaff62820339e80477f6196c904748aca2fe6a467873a95385d7379'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3070',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=381,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=84633,
    end_offset=84663,
    text_slice='卯正二刻我来点卯，巳正吃早饭，凡有领牌、回事的，只在午初刻。',
    hash='sha256:6a1d906cb4f523707346fb334af3215e528eb9d459bc547c09a38792446fadc0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3071',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=381,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=84663,
    end_offset=84690,
    text_slice='戌初烧过黄昏纸，我亲到各处查一遍，回来上夜的交明钥匙。',
    hash='sha256:7701406fc23993bf8d95141c377023da17623788774a4aa93ca086eae7bfbddd'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3072',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=381,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=84690,
    end_offset=84702,
    text_slice='第二日还是卯正二刻过来。',
    hash='sha256:8695e2e721d66c3b26036718cd8a7d7f7e3b09bb5364b66a1cda6db422e2e59d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3073',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=381,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=84702,
    end_offset=84728,
    text_slice='说不得咱们大家辛苦这几日，事完你们家大爷自然赏你们。',
    hash='sha256:801167b64be792ba3142577c37d21ed28d64f3a78ecd2b4eb618c7a315e951e5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3074',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=382,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=84731,
    end_offset=84757,
    text_slice='说毕，又吩咐按数发与茶叶、油烛、鸡毛掸子、笤帚等物。',
    hash='sha256:87e3b6acead4d167da62f6dac246a2e69a5cdd98fb33d0438288ac16e5871d4b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3075',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=382,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=84757,
    end_offset=84785,
    text_slice='一面又搬取家伙：桌围、椅搭、坐褥、毡席、痰盒、脚踏之类。',
    hash='sha256:d4bc93d29bb749a251a0d2e2356093daa928fefca7acd7958a29d6efe25a5a8a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3076',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=382,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=84785,
    end_offset=84816,
    text_slice='一面交发，一面提笔登记，某人管某处，某人领某物，开得十分清楚。',
    hash='sha256:10b4caed61309fc1428885969176f7a04d69c9eec2ac084ecfd90db0409e5a33'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3077',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=382,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=84816,
    end_offset=84850,
    text_slice='众人领了去，也都有了投奔，不似先时只拣便宜的做，剩下的苦差没个招揽。',
    hash='sha256:6428912d24a772c8ca4551cedaa6ff51f3d424835d9f0c3cee13cde9ee7697fe'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3078',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=382,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=84850,
    end_offset=84863,
    text_slice='各房中也不能趁乱失迷东西。',
    hash='sha256:cfabd0b2c6bcf8c6bfc016494ff87746db649dc0f4400ce42f75db0393eb00dc'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3079',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=382,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=84863,
    end_offset=84899,
    text_slice='便是人来客往，也都安静了，不比先前正摆茶，又去端饭，正陪举哀，又顾接客。',
    hash='sha256:a124e13970ab30dd218bb7ffc63a85601863fc3c262ccd80860bee299fe00cdc'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3080',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=382,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=84899,
    end_offset=84928,
    text_slice='如这些无头绪、荒乱、推托、偷闲、窃取等弊，次日一概都蠲了。',
    hash='sha256:6606e7d7dd795355e1e36bdb1549762b6655829aa23688fa54bd7ed05b0dc8d5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3081',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=383,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=84930,
    end_offset=84948,
    text_slice='凤姐儿见自己威重令行，心中十分得意。',
    hash='sha256:0b1fc729033279e829c3f723481058d4373f32fcdb18b32d512ccb4f00d3e5f7'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3082',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=383,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=84948,
    end_offset=84996,
    text_slice='因见尤氏犯病，贾珍又过于悲哀，不大进饮食，自己每日从那府中煎了各色细粥，精致小菜，命人送来劝食。',
    hash='sha256:0d547e1ad507dc32b12a4f3dc62a7509dfb39c11ee2ee9313777f5e2dcd4bfd0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3083',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=383,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=84996,
    end_offset=85019,
    text_slice='贾珍也另外吩咐每日送上等菜到抱厦内，单与凤姐。',
    hash='sha256:40daf46c3dbde9f9e7998368cdd8444763dac885bc8f38b19dfe43573eec6a91'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3084',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=383,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=85019,
    end_offset=85071,
    text_slice='那凤姐不畏勤劳，天天于卯正二刻，就过来点卯理事，独在抱厦内起坐，不与众妯娌合群，便有堂客来往，也不迎会。',
    hash='sha256:f942221b33d7610bfd2433cedddb4860b80b15138e1624e8f6658ff7ba2bbb47'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3085',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=384,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=85073,
    end_offset=85186,
    text_slice='这日，乃五七正五日上，那应佛僧正开方破狱，传灯照亡，参阎君，拘都鬼，筵请地藏王，开金桥，引幢幡；那道士们正伏章申表，朝三清，叩玉帝；禅僧们行香，放焰口，拜水忏；又有十三众青年尼僧，搭绣衣，靸红鞋，在灵前默诵接引诸咒，十分热闹。',
    hash='sha256:559da46edc9661e30fa2aeaf769b69f9be8526243dac25898ddb9b5a872d2061'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3086',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=384,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=85186,
    end_offset=85219,
    text_slice='那凤姐必知今日人客不少，在家中歇宿一夜，至寅正，平儿便请起来梳洗。',
    hash='sha256:4c631e4a3c660226a6c0db2f6d953f3403aa539215a18d359112428244c93fcd'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3087',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=384,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=85219,
    end_offset=85253,
    text_slice='及收拾完备，更衣盥手，喝了两口奶子糖粳粥，漱口已毕，已是卯正二刻了。',
    hash='sha256:4b5766926b8356870d768f8b54eca9b0e293908a114793bf10373fb5f8b6929e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3088',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=384,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=85253,
    end_offset=85266,
    text_slice='来旺媳妇率领诸人伺候已久。',
    hash='sha256:99944807b8c996e004c2b92099d553c21fc8b909840c7eb64baf7687cc005934'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3089',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=384,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=85289,
    end_offset=85294,
    text_slice='“荣国府”',
    hash='sha256:c22c808f7ba6f1de4a47c90ae2a263c9e244a98e39065858202c82e2b27dd8cc'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3090',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=384,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=85294,
    end_offset=85309,
    text_slice='三个大字，款款来至宁府大门上。',
    hash='sha256:527807ad7829e821f25e524d1d8cc9c236156f76c2bec1295e4ba3ff707fa921'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3091',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=384,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=85309,
    end_offset=85339,
    text_slice='只见门灯朗挂，两边一色戳灯照如白昼，白汪汪穿孝仆从两边侍立。',
    hash='sha256:a89adbdc18df650465090c2fee11e70640d28960198c4024f2383d4b3672d615'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3092',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=384,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=85339,
    end_offset=85362,
    text_slice='请车至正门上，小厮等退去，众媳妇上来揭起车帘。',
    hash='sha256:ef121e5609e2784470c1189716302b2f83c0f58f8edbdf08675d45ab0998b52d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3093',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=384,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=85362,
    end_offset=85394,
    text_slice='凤姐下了车，一手扶着丰儿，两个媳妇执着手把灯罩，簇拥着凤姐进来。',
    hash='sha256:a9ee40f4648af60d61535b51d66e251136d48f71350e237659d3abae6647de01'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3094',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=384,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=85394,
    end_offset=85406,
    text_slice='宁府诸媳妇迎来请安接待。',
    hash='sha256:581e30ea9cf2c2c1f00ffd865580e87fe45a6a31cd78a19f6a282cb7b3b6c450'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3095',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=384,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=85406,
    end_offset=85442,
    text_slice='凤姐缓缓走入会芳园中登仙阁灵前，一见了棺材，那眼泪恰似断线珍珠滚将下来。',
    hash='sha256:26cd399a94887ecd988e480e7c6c4bd9ad55609f487add0fa028c4e3f2693fb2'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3096',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=384,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=85442,
    end_offset=85455,
    text_slice='院中许多小厮垂手伺候烧纸。',
    hash='sha256:88d73b1143b8acc11cfb47a82f5e8571c9b13b8a895560c2190202f71a25e063'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3097',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=384,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=85463,
    end_offset=85470,
    text_slice='“供茶烧纸。”',
    hash='sha256:e6a8c66a5cf0127bcbe93ae99f5b9557a5db7c22d5b4154af9f7a0174ab70053'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3098',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=384,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=85470,
    end_offset=85510,
    text_slice='只听得一棒锣鸣，诸乐齐奏，早有人端过一张大圈椅来，放在灵前，凤姐坐了，放声大哭。',
    hash='sha256:fa3d71ab6cf06c067b802d937767fd02d00c0d2315ac626002231e81367a5830'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3099',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=384,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=85510,
    end_offset=85533,
    text_slice='于是里外男女上下，见凤姐出声，都忙忙接声嚎哭。',
    hash='sha256:2467e2a3caaff16d17f60709d535ba6ee2849c26f3b9337057eaddfe5755ffd0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3100',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=385,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=85535,
    end_offset=85555,
    text_slice='一时，贾珍、尤氏遣人来劝，凤姐方才止住。',
    hash='sha256:734719421d093e2906f644616ffa75ba1065396853059a490d924089fcce63be'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3101',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=385,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=85555,
    end_offset=85585,
    text_slice='来旺媳妇献茶漱口毕，凤姐方起身，别过族中诸人，自入抱厦内来。',
    hash='sha256:4b447c7e17adf6a696366120036b619858378dd40a3c0687ab07b48136772a5c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3102',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=385,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=85585,
    end_offset=85612,
    text_slice='按名查点，各项人数都已到齐，只有迎送亲客上的一人未到。',
    hash='sha256:77ac1d5ab9cfa4496e2f7db4cd6034bc97973c6314841606a3ffe4cebadfc395'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3103',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=385,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=85612,
    end_offset=85625,
    text_slice='即命传到，那人已张惶愧惧。',
    hash='sha256:6e549b1abe0e507fee280079651d32b51a442868949f70bb444c5ac944824709'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3104',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=385,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=85631,
    end_offset=85663,
    text_slice='“我说是谁误了，原来是你！你原比她们有体面，所以才不听我的话。”',
    hash='sha256:bf9379e4918044768de628aa85be5dd48b514cec0ee66bc7094e413954b7523f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3105',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=385,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=85663,
    end_offset=85667,
    text_slice='那人道：',
    hash='sha256:acdc57c89aac845dd5803492a4664a2e3953a37f852c60b074e43038154214f3'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3106',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=385,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=85667,
    end_offset=85709,
    text_slice='“小的天天来得早，只有今日，醒了觉得早些，因又睡迷了，来迟了一步，求奶奶饶过这次。”',
    hash='sha256:ead185ecd2df1a84959c85d9ee52d15718d08466226f4f32333b402181b0b828'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3107',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=385,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=85709,
    end_offset=85732,
    text_slice='正说着，只见荣国府中的王兴媳妇来了，在外探头。',
    hash='sha256:b9937d20af5c9459356b13d0227cfe4a0ef57873745981c235b9ef964991e5e9'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3108',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=386,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=85734,
    end_offset=85747,
    text_slice='凤姐且不发放这人，却先问：',
    hash='sha256:d493fb4a2724edb46b5ebc6d4069c17fac82ab135f3f80c7804b0ecdd3be7bc7'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3109',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=386,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=85747,
    end_offset=85757,
    text_slice='“王兴媳妇作什么？”',
    hash='sha256:84062daa241a1a3da419a12df43d6fe6b1406d544620227e2dba688cdd291b5f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3110',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=386,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=85757,
    end_offset=85777,
    text_slice='王兴媳妇巴不得先问她完了事，连忙进来说：',
    hash='sha256:a52c4a748dafbb9322568fe6e545461e8d35fbe12673404b6e2a50517e75682e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3111',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=386,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=85777,
    end_offset=85790,
    text_slice='“领牌取线，打车轿网络。”',
    hash='sha256:706a7e9a766d8ea6aebc3a3e23fffbec5d085e700b7b2ea3a67042baf2bbfb20'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3112',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=386,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=85790,
    end_offset=85801,
    text_slice='说着，将个帖儿递上去。',
    hash='sha256:160474e3ac6a3f6ed9df7b82a7b533ec470174c847fc551bdde92ed8d8353679'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3113',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=386,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=85809,
    end_offset=85843,
    text_slice='“大轿两顶，小轿四顶，车四辆，共享大小络子若干根，用珠儿线若干斤。”',
    hash='sha256:5a658143dfcb44d196d41ad6846a00d0f8c4dfcd87a7b40e4571c3169565972d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3114',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=386,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=85843,
    end_offset=85869,
    text_slice='凤姐听了，数目相合，便命彩明登记，取荣国府对牌掷下。',
    hash='sha256:ab5ffe6d54cc5d0a6518c02a2c8bee0e418457cdf6cc2dd5b8f86099efd4b506'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3115',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=386,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=85869,
    end_offset=85876,
    text_slice='王兴家的去了。',
    hash='sha256:2e5a0b571e5722ad4cebca8f755b5c494c04f1d345589f4620437be0ec52c454'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3116',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=387,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=85878,
    end_offset=85911,
    text_slice='凤姐方欲说话时，只见荣国府四个执事人进来，都是要支取东西领牌来的。',
    hash='sha256:c27c8fd48447941f9184713cb5f0c235bcbbdaecf39e9b018c66a889ff49ccb1'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3117',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=387,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=85911,
    end_offset=85954,
    text_slice='凤姐命彩明要了帖儿念过，听了共四件，凤姊因指两件说道：“这两件开销错了，再算清了来取。',
    hash='sha256:5d904b2a9092dd842be8a1726162aee7f021d363802b3fd1a2b631377befaa54'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3118',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=387,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=85954,
    end_offset=85963,
    text_slice='”说着掷下帖子来。',
    hash='sha256:63e1a5d04e5f464ca40e44007200ab227048ed622a05eccb4576b1d09d1f4592'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3119',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=387,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=85963,
    end_offset=85971,
    text_slice='那二人扫兴而去。',
    hash='sha256:673fc507f05574ff3dcbf7385ceda5d98d5192bffb96fc33b3c2dab9f1b0e361'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3120',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=388,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=85973,
    end_offset=85988,
    text_slice='凤姐因见张材家的在旁，因问道：',
    hash='sha256:51870736fe3e568795aaf677c228c2cba5b58d900f4b58dcfb1d0eb726adff5d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3121',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=388,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=85988,
    end_offset=85996,
    text_slice='“你有什么事？”',
    hash='sha256:8116395e461937fcf467f31c69274b23905a04f4d4314a432a26322d0ced7263'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3122',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=388,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=85996,
    end_offset=86008,
    text_slice='张材家的忙取帖儿回说道：',
    hash='sha256:76381c8461efe7fd13ab8d16ef87c47dc0697f2f204f3cf93ef613402bd4b36a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3123',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=388,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=86008,
    end_offset=86030,
    text_slice='“就是方才车轿围作成，领取裁缝工银若干两。”',
    hash='sha256:057e7fd123c18f762a522c9eade0580db0c7a6c6d31f8890ff24447e44d8a924'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3124',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=388,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=86030,
    end_offset=86047,
    text_slice='凤姐听了，便收了帖子，命彩明登记。',
    hash='sha256:f8b2ebb4f77f9acb786bda6f5768917b0a5e0a4934cb06adbe8af5ce7d5c568e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3125',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=388,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=86047,
    end_offset=86077,
    text_slice='待王兴家的交过牌，得了买办的回押相符，然后方与张材家的去领。',
    hash='sha256:0cd2e1350c08b48eed0ae29fe6e471af58cd608e49b85c838fbefe85adf43a4e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3126',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=388,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=86077,
    end_offset=86103,
    text_slice='一面又命念那一个，是为宝玉外书房完竣，支买纸料糊裱。',
    hash='sha256:ba1f9fdfc9f9767c66978d9edc46a75b1171730ba19cc6dfb8928426a3a1e405'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3127',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=388,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=86103,
    end_offset=86132,
    text_slice='凤姐听了，即命收帖儿登记，待张材家的缴清，又发与这人去了。',
    hash='sha256:0fc031f07a13d8659e9403ca373b83108017bbc201d340d9fe51537d4ddcef6b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3128',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=389,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=86134,
    end_offset=86140,
    text_slice='凤姐便说道：',
    hash='sha256:2799f26ec063c5a9579b43af25d4f72e83f8aa111327ca90a08617541eee3b51'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3129',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=389,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=86140,
    end_offset=86196,
    text_slice='“明儿他也睡迷了，后儿我也睡迷了，将来都没有人了。本来要饶你，只是我头一次宽了，下次人就难管，不如现开发的好。”',
    hash='sha256:f81f108b5c7d15c6aadcb5a6a7fec921f137f1b527e69bbaff98b185bcbf998c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3130',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=389,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=86196,
    end_offset=86206,
    text_slice='登时放下脸来，喝命：',
    hash='sha256:e25d6d22360201062ceffa53e923058341cfa2033ce67a22d87dbef565f44881'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3131',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=389,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=86206,
    end_offset=86218,
    text_slice='“带出去，打二十板子！”',
    hash='sha256:bd239dd2f72f9c006eb984ec7bce05ed247e6c3be654ad0ce77509ddb18c52f8'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3132',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=389,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=86218,
    end_offset=86229,
    text_slice='一面又掷下宁国府对牌：',
    hash='sha256:0637b6f972bdec4c2fda3894f93f908c6aa98e10e0b42c7fdd9d744b733f4c7c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3133',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=389,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=86229,
    end_offset=86245,
    text_slice='“出去说与来升，革他一月银米！”',
    hash='sha256:9dc2c36273d9de3c722b7536e566ca9bef1152d32295dec48ee5b242fd608c3e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3134',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=389,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=86245,
    end_offset=86267,
    text_slice='众人听了，又见凤姐眉立，知是恼了，不敢怠慢。',
    hash='sha256:65aad7eadbd508e5c2b45bc73fda396118bd8be4ae5d36777881fa865f81e909'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3135',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=389,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=86267,
    end_offset=86285,
    text_slice='拖人的出去拖人，执牌传谕的忙去传谕。',
    hash='sha256:0c3bb8aa177f56c289038023075f05c050a8f17fab5c5c8c8b9c4098bc298d6a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3136',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=389,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=86285,
    end_offset=86310,
    text_slice='那人身不由己，已拖出去挨了二十大板，还要进来叩谢。',
    hash='sha256:cd87983c2eaf7ac181d9213b2e4ce69286b6863e82bc4b64f825e1100fb5da61'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3137',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=389,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=86314,
    end_offset=86342,
    text_slice='“明日再有误的打四十，后日的六十，有不怕打的，只管误！”',
    hash='sha256:f6ad3ec47c988505049dc644c521e75a49a0b52fc4ca166e489a3104ef7a8901'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3138',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=389,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=86342,
    end_offset=86348,
    text_slice='说着，吩咐：',
    hash='sha256:0e251d05fe1896833e7e8fe8e53a0cead8b9c84335ea4d54489579319b204221'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3139',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=389,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=86348,
    end_offset=86354,
    text_slice='“散了罢！”',
    hash='sha256:8d69ad2ca8d289be09deca7e41b005d081a638f79a81d1dd8812a4b2c311c3f1'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3140',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=389,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=86354,
    end_offset=86369,
    text_slice='窗外众人听说，方各自执事去了。',
    hash='sha256:5e236bcd622c327191ad25c1913dd2607a8cd92c0ed6336fbf359a2e83a12b67'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3141',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=389,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=86369,
    end_offset=86412,
    text_slice='彼时宁、荣国两处执事领牌交牌的人来人往不绝，那抱愧被打之人含羞去了，这才知道凤姐利害。',
    hash='sha256:d704ada1fa4cbb865bd5e71c9460f2240202f5a3843818d41c0ec0d8a99075f6'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3142',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=389,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=86412,
    end_offset=86437,
    text_slice='众人不敢偷闲安，自此兢兢业业，执事保全，不在话下。',
    hash='sha256:293ca18039d2be7953cc6c9d16986d91e12b899e7f33edc19f3fc59a093b7809'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3143',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=390,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=86439,
    end_offset=86477,
    text_slice='如今且说宝玉因见今日人众，恐秦钟受了委曲，因默与他商议，要同他往凤姐处来坐。',
    hash='sha256:de6b91b6841c8e6b19ae97728f10b3af3ed052015725f5b1ee74739d07689c12'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3144',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=390,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=86481,
    end_offset=86506,
    text_slice='“她的事多，况且不喜人去，咱们去了，她岂不烦腻？”',
    hash='sha256:49a966e8a59f46e2b0c8ea8a4f40d9a5ae951e4f84ec57cb15bdef20cdf88510'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3145',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=390,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=86506,
    end_offset=86510,
    text_slice='宝玉道：',
    hash='sha256:10c9e1a43f0e2e5bf2e54f50fb3dbede512eb436326aec72d14625e62153e9b0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3146',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=390,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=86510,
    end_offset=86529,
    text_slice='“她怎好腻我们，不相干，只管跟我来。”',
    hash='sha256:ad6866eca9fc9ec651db486160e74c9426c981cbf97c10c458ac78c8ed56ec53'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3147',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=390,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=86529,
    end_offset=86543,
    text_slice='说着，便拉了秦钟，直至抱厦。',
    hash='sha256:78d5133a7236d3708628350177ac1effd9d6eb01ea13d40f225cb31b312acc1e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3148',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=390,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=86559,
    end_offset=86571,
    text_slice='“好长腿子，快上来罢。”',
    hash='sha256:bc6cd2d8cfeb9d6894d6a8f30b640c331e2153c2dff860d6533b472194b6eee5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3149',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=390,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=86571,
    end_offset=86575,
    text_slice='宝玉道：',
    hash='sha256:10c9e1a43f0e2e5bf2e54f50fb3dbede512eb436326aec72d14625e62153e9b0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3150',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=390,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=86575,
    end_offset=86582,
    text_slice='“我们偏了。”',
    hash='sha256:c0c279e800333e7aeb525400a1d498d97eebd0607aa7f3b37cd7e8ea55aa4717'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3151',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=390,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=86582,
    end_offset=86586,
    text_slice='凤姐道：',
    hash='sha256:493b74ef604832e715c69f5c0a24d8d4a251e38e82e9ee38006f3f407dd315a5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3152',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=390,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=86586,
    end_offset=86603,
    text_slice='“在这边外头吃的，还是那边吃的？”',
    hash='sha256:8970bf2a92a183694a95842b199853ff42a086e011c51503324d26d9fb7f3300'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3153',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=390,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=86603,
    end_offset=86607,
    text_slice='宝玉道：',
    hash='sha256:10c9e1a43f0e2e5bf2e54f50fb3dbede512eb436326aec72d14625e62153e9b0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3154',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=390,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=86607,
    end_offset=86638,
    text_slice='“这边同那些浑人吃什么！原是那边，我们两个同老太太吃了来的。”',
    hash='sha256:8014b035a4fdd53507c7fd867484f3f59986b394abb2cd3b5d1a5618c0bc9d6d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3155',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=390,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=86638,
    end_offset=86643,
    text_slice='一面归坐。',
    hash='sha256:96b88409bcb72f7824218b4db6f174056189b2f54af9a9ff99ea31a5460550f0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3156',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=391,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=86645,
    end_offset=86672,
    text_slice='凤姐吃毕饭，就有宁国府中的一个媳妇来领牌，支取香灯事。',
    hash='sha256:62380da03a4dfa8ba7035f4f6aed60f0e20ccc375e6c59233bfe0dc757975c0a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3157',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=391,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=86677,
    end_offset=86728,
    text_slice='“我算着你们今儿该来支取，总不见来，想是忘了。这会子到底来取，要忘了，自然是你们包出来，都便宜了我。”',
    hash='sha256:3138e37420f41a86467dbadf560f5e7cdb38ebb6ddb63b3d2a15773afc257b9f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3158',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=391,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=86728,
    end_offset=86734,
    text_slice='那媳妇笑道：',
    hash='sha256:4969c3d210cc1939aa459dcba006a24db240469f8f70354d9225aa3662038d78'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3159',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=391,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=86734,
    end_offset=86760,
    text_slice='“何尝不是忘了，方才想起来，再迟一步，也领不成了。”',
    hash='sha256:ecf1b5a325914e7fe342c4d90566e5e4a75a3992adebf5720cd7ac8bd23026db'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3160',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=391,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=86760,
    end_offset=86768,
    text_slice='说罢，领牌而去。',
    hash='sha256:ba517142b4da61b78b9a43f6eeca882134e017c8f9bfbebd866f1a60044f7c85'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3161',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=392,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=86770,
    end_offset=86777,
    text_slice='一时登记交牌。',
    hash='sha256:2581a2cfcf8bf0a814c17498cdb08e335010ee4936dcccbc0b94b132ace42602'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3162',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=392,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=86783,
    end_offset=86814,
    text_slice='“你们两府里都是这牌，倘或别人私弄一个，支了银子跑了，怎样？”',
    hash='sha256:5086ef7578efc5daeb54cfaacebb4793debe919374880a29675956a427017013'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3163',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=392,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=86814,
    end_offset=86819,
    text_slice='凤姐笑道：',
    hash='sha256:fa673815883516a89495f0598428fc17e5f85586cc72e1283fe4d69da7b1c484'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3164',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=392,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=86819,
    end_offset=86831,
    text_slice='“依你说，都没王法了？”',
    hash='sha256:895fbb0d4a15f3b266f790547395c90763169caddf0ef244f4637260e1b19ffa'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3165',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=392,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=86831,
    end_offset=86836,
    text_slice='宝玉因道：',
    hash='sha256:172d49458e588864bb073fd2e8565d980ae1626030b3297a3d7800a14ef7bae1'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3166',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=392,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=86836,
    end_offset=86853,
    text_slice='“怎么咱们家没人来领牌子做东西？”',
    hash='sha256:0d36f455c63a8996cc7a366af6616da16c57b697bdcb29bce32110041ebabb2a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3167',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=392,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=86853,
    end_offset=86857,
    text_slice='凤姐道：',
    hash='sha256:493b74ef604832e715c69f5c0a24d8d4a251e38e82e9ee38006f3f407dd315a5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3168',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=392,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=86857,
    end_offset=86890,
    text_slice='“人家来领的时候，你还做梦呢！我且问你，你们这夜书多早晚才念呢？”',
    hash='sha256:aa6e321c422e5f916e3016ea738a096b68ecb630ef856c810cfcf8c6a634e56d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3169',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=392,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=86890,
    end_offset=86894,
    text_slice='宝玉道：',
    hash='sha256:10c9e1a43f0e2e5bf2e54f50fb3dbede512eb436326aec72d14625e62153e9b0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3170',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=392,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=86894,
    end_offset=86925,
    text_slice='“巴不得这如今就念才好，她们只是不快收拾出书房来，这也没法。”',
    hash='sha256:7d4ec3276a9ae7b3d9355e3be1a43326608114ea26550f03b1e8718c0143e116'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3171',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=392,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=86925,
    end_offset=86930,
    text_slice='凤姐笑道：',
    hash='sha256:fa673815883516a89495f0598428fc17e5f85586cc72e1283fe4d69da7b1c484'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3172',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=392,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=86930,
    end_offset=86944,
    text_slice='“你请我一请，包管就快了。”',
    hash='sha256:725d537a9866ede5bc749110a7a32588720c2b9cf484fe00ca275aabf73f41a1'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3173',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=392,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=86944,
    end_offset=86948,
    text_slice='宝玉道：',
    hash='sha256:10c9e1a43f0e2e5bf2e54f50fb3dbede512eb436326aec72d14625e62153e9b0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3174',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=392,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=86948,
    end_offset=86973,
    text_slice='“你要快也不中用，她们该作到那里的，自然就有了。”',
    hash='sha256:6a30ecf88ab01ec2def2896a2df614856fc01a38ba777deadcdfddb40b7b653b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3175',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=392,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=86973,
    end_offset=86978,
    text_slice='凤姐笑道：',
    hash='sha256:fa673815883516a89495f0598428fc17e5f85586cc72e1283fe4d69da7b1c484'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3176',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=392,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=86978,
    end_offset=87005,
    text_slice='“便是她们作，也得要东西去，搁不住我不给对牌是难的。”',
    hash='sha256:1c37e1c3cd11a7e20fafded547680c3b5a824ac8285398149d1149f1e2702621'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3177',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=392,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=87005,
    end_offset=87024,
    text_slice='宝玉听说，便猴向凤姐身上立刻要牌，说：',
    hash='sha256:83a24958dc8008b1423666f6ae933f17dc6fb3ce3dae4367f61b9172ce2c80a6'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3178',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=392,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=87024,
    end_offset=87044,
    text_slice='“好姐姐，给出牌子来，叫她们要东西去！”',
    hash='sha256:5d5ff75c128b825a3cecbcd09af02869fe5508f22677a07231f18ebd5de7635d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3179',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=392,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=87044,
    end_offset=87048,
    text_slice='凤姐道：',
    hash='sha256:493b74ef604832e715c69f5c0a24d8d4a251e38e82e9ee38006f3f407dd315a5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3180',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=392,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=87048,
    end_offset=87099,
    text_slice='“我乏得身子上生疼，还搁得住你搓揉。你放心罢，今儿才领了纸裱糊去了，她们该要的还等叫去呢，可不傻了！”',
    hash='sha256:59254a26f77dd15507d1b381bf1c2b854cfc70fef7f517d9c9b4c77a09b6e89c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3181',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=392,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=87099,
    end_offset=87119,
    text_slice='宝玉不信，凤姐便叫彩明查册子与宝玉看了。',
    hash='sha256:1d4309bd64773f2fbe0cdfb6463b6539f58f54396206259246de700c962a7818'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3182',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=393,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=87121,
    end_offset=87128,
    text_slice='正闹着，人回：',
    hash='sha256:7668ac01e28c550c273828feb05bdcc2c392c95d9e78e39b08ae91afb4657980'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3183',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=393,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=87128,
    end_offset=87140,
    text_slice='“苏州去的人昭儿来了。”',
    hash='sha256:6d984a75ef0cb345eb31524527600e9e8a9616ed21a6e493850e9311bd2ccd74'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3184',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=393,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=87140,
    end_offset=87148,
    text_slice='凤姐急命唤进来。',
    hash='sha256:d967626026bc9f6aadbc6bab4ab8e6b4c52208b346c2346fc6ae56a97d179389'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3185',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=393,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=87148,
    end_offset=87156,
    text_slice='昭儿打千儿请安。',
    hash='sha256:7b7c4d129719e222f7fe9cefa22f842efc684cd0bf0926e44418f313c1d38a88'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3186',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=393,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=87161,
    end_offset=87169,
    text_slice='“回来做什么？”',
    hash='sha256:ed76e8fec2c6a9780b8f713f65de23cdd44525ca82d90b6b2d82a0e8e0a3a5ca'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3187',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=393,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=87169,
    end_offset=87173,
    text_slice='昭儿道：',
    hash='sha256:70f908a2b7effc8003d025ce7a95a02be786bed160ce53a814112b3dea86b19b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3188',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=393,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=87173,
    end_offset=87267,
    text_slice='“二爷打发回来的。林姑老爷是九月初三日巳时没的。二爷带了林姑娘同送林姑老爷的灵到苏州，大约赶年底就回来了。二爷打发小的来报个信请安，讨老太太示下，还瞧瞧奶奶家里好，叫把大毛衣服带几件去。”',
    hash='sha256:47eed972ce8564ea0873f0065073173215f8b28c55881950961f63803328afb0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3189',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=393,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=87267,
    end_offset=87271,
    text_slice='凤姐道：',
    hash='sha256:493b74ef604832e715c69f5c0a24d8d4a251e38e82e9ee38006f3f407dd315a5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3190',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=393,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=87271,
    end_offset=87282,
    text_slice='“你见过别人了没有？”',
    hash='sha256:0eff479f53e451409450cc5d8ce6766beb32ad009a31f93154464abffb13f3ab'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3191',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=393,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=87282,
    end_offset=87286,
    text_slice='昭儿道：',
    hash='sha256:70f908a2b7effc8003d025ce7a95a02be786bed160ce53a814112b3dea86b19b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3192',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=393,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=87286,
    end_offset=87293,
    text_slice='“都见过了。”',
    hash='sha256:a7c3261d2975aedec013b017cf17ce24b9a33ec99c7b69594016fecbef210f17'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3193',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=393,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=87293,
    end_offset=87301,
    text_slice='说毕，连忙退去。',
    hash='sha256:9e305cfc764d61c9889fa9fb515a8f725bf97bddc08b75420eadc4a9f94a5ee4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3194',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=393,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=87309,
    end_offset=87324,
    text_slice='“你林妹妹可在咱们家住长了。”',
    hash='sha256:d44a4ebf21596459891c304d32b3d216065d365580a79a04465b2270cb7c51fb'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3195',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=393,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=87324,
    end_offset=87328,
    text_slice='宝玉道：',
    hash='sha256:10c9e1a43f0e2e5bf2e54f50fb3dbede512eb436326aec72d14625e62153e9b0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3196',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=393,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=87328,
    end_offset=87348,
    text_slice='“了不得！想来这几日她不知哭得怎样呢。”',
    hash='sha256:8ef8f9658dfc0f4cc4c2ed28a2cc0319ebfa9ac6821ae004479226bf1052cfb1'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3197',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=393,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=87348,
    end_offset=87356,
    text_slice='说着，蹙眉长叹。',
    hash='sha256:cc9e00017922819cadb7a90c84285fd4a7a9f97bc7feb876e990552c8b73f163'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3198',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=394,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=87358,
    end_offset=87413,
    text_slice='凤姐见昭儿回来，因当着人未及细问贾琏，心中自是记挂，待要回去，争奈事情繁杂，一时去了，恐有延迟失误，惹人笑话。',
    hash='sha256:2bf4217f641a03389c216c0633c0e2f06d16ed906bc223705692ac38d70b4d84'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3199',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=394,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=87413,
    end_offset=87439,
    text_slice='少不得耐到晚上回来，复令昭儿进来，细问一路平安信息。',
    hash='sha256:a6c83497171041573bfb5ba09af32775cf83b9655d7821c57bfedab5956d6bae'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3200',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=394,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=87439,
    end_offset=87477,
    text_slice='连夜打点大毛衣服，和平儿亲自检点包裹，再细细追想所需何物，一并包藏交付昭儿。',
    hash='sha256:5c482b10d0188f1dc14974ce5aea3cf8766033e8d74e05b6e34ed281ee0aa267'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3201',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=394,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=87477,
    end_offset=87504,
    text_slice='又细细吩咐昭儿：“在外好生小心服侍，不要惹你二爷生气。',
    hash='sha256:7c69a458fc1a6e52f5b4203e1e2308efda66e511b36529b1a0cc6433f3dd167b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3202',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=394,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=87504,
    end_offset=87535,
    text_slice='时时劝他少吃酒，别勾引他认得混帐女人――回来打折你的腿”等语。',
    hash='sha256:4e0141679e07a5b80f76cbb4f644f95004aef4eaf24e670b905286174009ac41'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3203',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=394,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=87535,
    end_offset=87573,
    text_slice='赶乱完了，天已四更将尽，总睡下又走了困，不觉又是天明鸡唱，忙梳洗过宁府中来。',
    hash='sha256:1292307a0aa22b166456237de27ddf22a8fd9d17288f36c0c25e1ce1c47c7621'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3204',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=395,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=87575,
    end_offset=87609,
    text_slice='那贾珍因见发引日近，亲自坐车，带了阴阳司吏，往铁槛寺来踏看寄灵所在。',
    hash='sha256:cd56cd987589485fcee8bc5c9b01da30b57c3b25914897a335b886546459e76b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3205',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=395,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=87609,
    end_offset=87640,
    text_slice='又一一嘱咐住持色空，好生预备新鲜陈设，多请名僧，以备接灵使用。',
    hash='sha256:235260dbad722ed84512609ac4af096f7353b852cc798aea3e885261631589ba'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3206',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=395,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=87640,
    end_offset=87674,
    text_slice='色空忙看晚斋，贾珍也无心茶饭，因天晚不得进城，就在净室胡乱歇了一夜。',
    hash='sha256:1fc6f2ed7785549eb70eab8205f731aa8b5cd19b43323f690998bdd22c9780b0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3207',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=395,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=87674,
    end_offset=87723,
    text_slice='次日一早，便进城来料理出殡之事，一面又派人先往铁槛寺，连夜另外修饰停灵之处，并厨、茶等项接灵人口。',
    hash='sha256:bc1f697864c04c9ef8aa81e604311abe8ce64fd1689723e290997eba76ba961c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3208',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=396,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=87725,
    end_offset=87745,
    text_slice='里面凤姐见日期在限，也预先逐细分派料理。',
    hash='sha256:252e31c068732d8337fd9b095d5a78678b043f2845b8f4cecb7ac4f3ef6d4279'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3209',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=396,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=87745,
    end_offset=87774,
    text_slice='一面又派荣府中车轿人从跟王夫人送殡，又顾自己送殡去占下处。',
    hash='sha256:ac6b1c2098877e453357f248a51511ce8b9e25cd9b51697303448b0abbba6bfe'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3210',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=396,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=87774,
    end_offset=87886,
    text_slice='目今正值缮国公诰命亡故，王、邢二夫人又去打祭送殡；西安郡王妃华诞，送寿礼；镇国公诰命生了长男，预备贺礼；又有胞兄王仁连家眷回南，一面写家信禀叩父母并带往之物；又有迎春染病，每日请医服药，看医生启帖、症源、药案等事，亦难尽述。',
    hash='sha256:b8e75aeb5d274989f963743c0c2feb71619e0a97940978b3ca1f3e2db851969b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3211',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=396,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=87886,
    end_offset=87915,
    text_slice='又兼发引在迩，因此忙得凤姐茶饭也没工夫吃得，坐卧不能清净。',
    hash='sha256:979f04b79c8ea95d7d18dbac353b6c7fb00ddfc415ea487cf49e41ee216555d6'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3212',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=396,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=87915,
    end_offset=87947,
    text_slice='刚到了宁府，荣府的人又跟到宁府；既回到荣府，宁府的人又找到荣府。',
    hash='sha256:6a554b0ae2a8e5f9ec081a20d2276399d6f360864459fdac9e18160e910dbddc'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3213',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=396,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=87947,
    end_offset=87990,
    text_slice='凤姐见如此，心中倒十分欢喜，并不偷安推托，恐落人褒贬，因此日夜不暇，筹画得十分的整肃。',
    hash='sha256:1b5ff87e948d111ddc8d5976d9227d6cd287f117dcfd7c4873887587dadfde4a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3214',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=396,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=87990,
    end_offset=88003,
    text_slice='于是合族上下无不称叹囋者。',
    hash='sha256:ca46dd91bf755fba06fba959eeb5ebf033948621238c57db17970249fed9a7bb'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3215',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=397,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=88005,
    end_offset=88060,
    text_slice='这日，伴宿之夕，里面两班小戏并耍百戏的与亲朋、堂客伴宿，尤氏犹卧于内寝，一应张罗款待，独都是凤姐一人周全承应。',
    hash='sha256:28f11d3bcfa4606ef257e7468a6ff393adae5fba7dea04e2f736f454b529ca3b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3216',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=397,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=88060,
    end_offset=88124,
    text_slice='合族中虽有许多妯娌，但或有羞口的，或有羞脚的，或有不惯见人的，或有惧贵怯官的，种种之类，俱不及凤姐举止舒徐，言语慷慨，珍贵宽大。',
    hash='sha256:26e2ef741dba73d5bd226362d1270dce093fa9dc1dde76922b725f5dfa5ebfc6'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3217',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=397,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=88124,
    end_offset=88151,
    text_slice='因此也不把众人放在眼里，挥霍指示，任其所为，目若无人。',
    hash='sha256:86f838faac01f43f4f71803b6f20f858eda1c09545274d83b9ec26e6a5403f52'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3218',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=397,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=88151,
    end_offset=88177,
    text_slice='一夜中，灯明火彩，客送官迎，那百般热闹，自不用说的。',
    hash='sha256:c43785a958442ebdff661e263cb6b88e81421ceb286e682f5b9bb85f3b8bc91d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3219',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=397,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=88177,
    end_offset=88254,
    text_slice='至天明，吉时已到，一般六十四名青衣请灵，前面铭旌上大书：“奉天洪建兆年不易之朝诰封一等宁国公冢孙妇防护内廷紫禁道御前侍卫龙禁尉享强寿贾门秦氏恭人之灵柩”。',
    hash='sha256:cdb9297b24d59d890a8a4c07178b4d817fc63bb2ebacc0a675ba5ff0b9eb1e58'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3220',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=397,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=88254,
    end_offset=88279,
    text_slice='一应执事陈设，皆系现赶着新做出来的，一色光艳夺目。',
    hash='sha256:ebc19fea29ea6da6e65d622cc32e8622581470ea16e19ca81cc6664142568ab3'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3221',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=397,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=88279,
    end_offset=88300,
    text_slice='宝珠自行未嫁女之礼外，摔丧驾灵，十分哀苦。',
    hash='sha256:4e8b496d9245948d11b52204a73a81ada181fd8f2ec9e661ecf8a6c47c50a713'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3222',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=398,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=88302,
    end_offset=88418,
    text_slice='那时，官客送殡的有：镇国公牛清之孙现袭一等伯牛继宗、理国公柳彪之孙现袭一等子柳芳、齐国公陈翼之孙世袭三品威镇将军陈瑞文、治国公马魁之孙世袭三品威远将军马尚、修国公侯晓明之孙世袭一等子侯孝康；缮国公诰命亡故，故其孙石光珠守孝不曾来得。',
    hash='sha256:c2bcd6f86694effbb29bd18ca25b0fc735216901aa215abea4bfb631b115e6c9'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3223',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=398,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=88418,
    end_offset=88440,
    text_slice='这六家与宁、荣二家，当日所称“八公”的便是。',
    hash='sha256:1694fecfe65f31e03c1ca3869139d98caa35577c4562e6c188ef09abfff87e2a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3224',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=398,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=88440,
    end_offset=88523,
    text_slice='余者更有南安郡王之孙、西宁郡王之孙、忠靖侯史鼎、平原侯之孙世袭二等男蒋子宁、定城侯之孙世袭二等男兼京营游击谢鲸、襄阳侯之孙世袭二等男戚建辉、景田侯之孙五城兵马司裘良。',
    hash='sha256:88a71c3529b51d7794c01fb2f3c818eb136cf97ab9253226d82d40abd2e303d4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3225',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=398,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=88523,
    end_offset=88562,
    text_slice='余者锦乡伯公子韩奇，神武将军公子冯紫英，陈也俊、卫若兰等诸王孙公子，不可枚数。',
    hash='sha256:aca07f391b0aa31a1c4212ad9708b661c0ba8e2a2ae7181bb55d6b559880f93a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3226',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=398,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=88562,
    end_offset=88599,
    text_slice='堂客算来，亦共有十来顶大轿，三四十顶小轿，连家下大小轿车辆，不下百十余乘。',
    hash='sha256:51f4e524b7ad4fac7d2e26879048e606755c81472e0f630c2882aeb08f3ec2cc'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3227',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=398,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=88599,
    end_offset=88626,
    text_slice='连前面各色执事、陈设、百耍，浩浩荡荡，一带摆三四里远。',
    hash='sha256:eb41ee7ddc15a29b44cc7d425619cc4a57b2c35933122f2203307085c0e2fd1e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3228',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=399,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=88628,
    end_offset=88701,
    text_slice='走不多时，路旁彩棚高搭，设席张筵，和音奏乐，俱是各家路祭：第一座是东平王府祭棚，第二座是南安郡王祭棚，第三座是西宁郡王祭棚，第四座是北静郡王祭棚。',
    hash='sha256:4370afd5b7b4f8a46045e73dd71bdfd4ab6ddd41e0d16179c7632436b3657604'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3229',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=399,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=88701,
    end_offset=88725,
    text_slice='原来这四王，当日惟北静王功高，及今子孙犹袭王爵。',
    hash='sha256:94e7efeae1c50e99a7687bbbd5d9cdae2a495ab14a544fff36c5bd9353706bd8'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3230',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=399,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=88725,
    end_offset=88749,
    text_slice='现今北静王水溶年未弱冠，生得形容秀美，情性谦和。',
    hash='sha256:73651acc86acc0f7ba8d4755707ba938ed3c9ad5cccbbfc71f2b55ff0b8542e3'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3231',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=399,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=88749,
    end_offset=88794,
    text_slice='近闻宁国公冢孙妇告殂，因想当日彼此祖父相与之情，同难同荣，未以异姓相视，因此不以王位自居。',
    hash='sha256:6751fd5892b12060643dc794f02a5283723a364547bb0cf3554b03dabcd1e13c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3232',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=399,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=88794,
    end_offset=88820,
    text_slice='上日也曾探丧上祭，如今又设路奠，命麾下各官在此伺候。',
    hash='sha256:d0285ce70548c54bef7004f46f1dc03512addbbad2ab4f702f2b34f4c0c58e4d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3233',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=399,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=88820,
    end_offset=88854,
    text_slice='自己五更入朝，公事一毕，便换了素服，坐大轿鸣锣张伞而来，至棚前落轿。',
    hash='sha256:8a4f380f649fa1b76491d795ea0e950175edfc1dfc35fddcb9683e1828cb6cde'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3234',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=399,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=88854,
    end_offset=88872,
    text_slice='手下各官两旁拥侍，军民人众不得往还。',
    hash='sha256:b6b8620bb2182babc4557cbcc42ec001c9f0cc9ae6eaa35fd40c281e0f0cd510'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3235',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=400,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=88874,
    end_offset=88899,
    text_slice='一时，只见宁府大殡浩浩荡荡、压地银山一般从北而至。',
    hash='sha256:63cf7123ccaa8233ae2350c278823fdd9fb0c496b822a2dbafdeaefff0cda0eb'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3236',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=400,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=88899,
    end_offset=88920,
    text_slice='早有宁府开路传事人看见，连忙回去报与贾珍。',
    hash='sha256:ff53eb20476c34886f7723b1830aab4c3137e39a0c0746442f5a2b3550479299'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3237',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=400,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=88920,
    end_offset=88948,
    text_slice='贾珍急命前面驻扎，同贾赦、贾政三人连忙迎来，以国礼相见。',
    hash='sha256:dff8cf8d48b1a757bb43b34cb60f7f68c32729a3d107dbd2ef4ff3351d8f70f5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3238',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=400,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=88948,
    end_offset=88976,
    text_slice='水溶在轿内欠身含笑答礼，仍以世交称呼接待，并不妄自尊大。',
    hash='sha256:a2c05273acc2dc441b8298cbb35f0b699b5448010fa4fa88c64d81ad5f8c9633'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3239',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=400,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=88980,
    end_offset=89002,
    text_slice='“犬妇之丧，累蒙郡驾下临，荫生辈何以克当！”',
    hash='sha256:e495f14e2ab2b4cfdc45f56bca674c2041024e92a9470208fd9df40d220574ef'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3240',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=400,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=89002,
    end_offset=89007,
    text_slice='水溶笑道：',
    hash='sha256:77e74773a500ccc425ac3797b884d388d86f4c209c2bfebf93ba7050ae3daa7e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3241',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=400,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=89007,
    end_offset=89019,
    text_slice='“世交之谊，何出此言。”',
    hash='sha256:daa245e6492cf443c0692aba8b2e11283ec1091570daf4b5e94f7cb91e6b63cc'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3242',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=400,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=89019,
    end_offset=89031,
    text_slice='遂回头命长府官主祭代奠。',
    hash='sha256:fd0a9c3c8760d23ec59c748916ca82316a083923670506d869f8045c69bd05dc'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3243',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=400,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=89031,
    end_offset=89047,
    text_slice='贾赦等一旁还礼毕，复身又来谢恩。',
    hash='sha256:bdabe0200cee1b16e096f625242dfa0d6090c34bf7f7ffda9ff1a9597e5bbfb7'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3244',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=401,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=89049,
    end_offset=89073,
    text_slice='水溶十分谦逊，因问贾政道：“哪一位是衔玉而诞者？',
    hash='sha256:60501232a673ce72396a622181352c73478efc4abcffca63e956f2ed42ed512a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3245',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=401,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=89073,
    end_offset=89087,
    text_slice='几次要见一见，都为杂冗所阻。',
    hash='sha256:f4fe4e061915816a498e5662b6b869a3f1502729a9804fb1dad1d350a274df29'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3246',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=401,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=89087,
    end_offset=89101,
    text_slice='想今日是来的，何不请来一会？',
    hash='sha256:3d9d3d2d68e63751151cbd0416432768f3e5de5cd8642d12e6f9d415b8177c44'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3247',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=401,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=89101,
    end_offset=89125,
    text_slice='”贾政听说，忙回去，急命宝玉脱去孝服，领他前来。',
    hash='sha256:ad6031978b4970fac105e1fa21f657e3f588b06e4c7fb053103b5d8d0c743330'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3248',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=401,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=89125,
    end_offset=89177,
    text_slice='那宝玉素日就曾听得父兄亲友人等说闲话时，常赞水溶是个贤王，且生得才貌双全，风流潇洒，每不以官俗国体所缚。',
    hash='sha256:7396f7b046afda2994493c61f336b80673f71b1ff5df197f510697ae6dd52e1b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3249',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=401,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=89177,
    end_offset=89208,
    text_slice='每思相会，只是父亲拘束严密，无由得会，今见反来叫他，自是欢喜。',
    hash='sha256:1cce5ec4024b15ab5045f95faebade930a9e9ae6e7ee226ca264a293323f59b4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3250',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=401,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=89208,
    end_offset=89232,
    text_slice='一面走，一面早瞥见那水溶坐在轿内，好个仪表人材。',
    hash='sha256:4617cbbc55e14ac3731dea7e03ac22ff30e3d0b0f91c9560302bebc1fb0a6705'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3251',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=401,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=89232,
    end_offset=89247,
    text_slice='不知近看时又是怎样，下回便制。',
    hash='sha256:bdece4a315a1989fe3fb668ce332ba2b9fd6f18f2fee614f237dc27b8a4154e7'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3252',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=402,
    segment_type='heading',
    start_offset=89249,
    end_offset=89272,
    text_slice='第十五回  王凤姐弄权铁槛寺\u3000秦鲸卿得趣馒头庵',
    hash='sha256:c4019ed23d98129f65f9d2cc5599f596e0a4df1899fd83cb8a67a3b821b15a0c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3253',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=403,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=89274,
    end_offset=89339,
    text_slice='话说宝玉举目见北静郡王水溶头上戴着洁白簪缨银翅王帽，穿著江牙海水五爪坐龙白蟒袍，系着碧玉红鞓带，面如美玉，目似明星，真好秀丽人物。',
    hash='sha256:fd6313a156382dae6a2a2361e844e13e5bd3ba6c17bb133ad186449c2eac43fb'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3254',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=403,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=89339,
    end_offset=89362,
    text_slice='宝玉忙抢上来参见，水溶连忙从轿内伸出手来挽住。',
    hash='sha256:02d9140b0bdd38f8200a8a5937f96c2ea10756e73bd839ae137e74bbd25f135e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3255',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=403,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=89362,
    end_offset=89405,
    text_slice='见宝玉戴着束发银冠，勒着双龙出海抹额，穿著白蟒箭袖，围着攒珠银带，面若春花，目如点漆。',
    hash='sha256:3ba6f95518dde1a723738c121e8dcac12775305fc2f373680c8793a93d1206cc'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3256',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=403,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=89410,
    end_offset=89428,
    text_slice='“名不虚传，果然如‘宝’似‘玉’。”',
    hash='sha256:b9dd01dd5ae21351a6c70e887c40610f99f8c7c14b57b3d8c45a8c9c36603321'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3257',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=403,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=89428,
    end_offset=89431,
    text_slice='因问：',
    hash='sha256:ccdcf4ca5b0d90eb25386587fe85c6337d5c5a7585863b57f89bca2423599a3a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3258',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=403,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=89431,
    end_offset=89442,
    text_slice='“衔的那宝贝在哪里？”',
    hash='sha256:878c172c7852258080a6ce70e41ae37e3e4da0751a2f3ae277cf3ba1270e8e21'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3259',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=403,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=89442,
    end_offset=89459,
    text_slice='宝玉见问，连忙从衣内取了递与过去。',
    hash='sha256:5f2d94d3cf73c39d684cb446abbe7c52a2d0dbf23069bdc5628a5e34b1015d19'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3260',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=403,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=89479,
    end_offset=89486,
    text_slice='“果灵验否？”',
    hash='sha256:33ac83173589c48856e38f62f445075ca2ea986ce5216b95707d3447dc34d459'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3261',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=403,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=89486,
    end_offset=89491,
    text_slice='贾政忙道：',
    hash='sha256:534a77315ce9465dd10d27efb3592e575ad5eabf0bc2cf3e5a88c7893ccf2d83'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3262',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=403,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=89491,
    end_offset=89505,
    text_slice='“虽如此说，只是未曾试过。”',
    hash='sha256:861ff024de2eea2395bd3974d2b3c7b227cec30817ae46b65e4766054bfda495'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3263',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=403,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=89505,
    end_offset=89544,
    text_slice='水溶一面极口称奇道异，一面理好彩绦，亲自与宝玉带上，又携手问宝玉几岁，读何书。',
    hash='sha256:d22b7db818b5b3d0c9241133f021b38fea4c3aa68248a20eb8b4419be744c7c1'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3264',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=403,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=89544,
    end_offset=89552,
    text_slice='宝玉一一的答应。',
    hash='sha256:836d83fe09178187ebf45cb97b672ffd41324bb8d6a1556ea89eee8abdbc5452'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3265',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=404,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=89554,
    end_offset=89577,
    text_slice='水溶见他语言清楚，谈吐有致，一面又向贾政笑道：',
    hash='sha256:7d229f10264a4249f435cfe7f5061e792c1f2fc43920ed5db1dcc79cc575d4ed'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3266',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=404,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=89577,
    end_offset=89615,
    text_slice='“令郎真乃龙驹凤雏，非小王在世翁前唐突，将来‘雏凤清于老凤声’，未可量也。”',
    hash='sha256:8f39ff8c5a6ebafbf0d14e38b82f8c32c6a394a6878aea249428b9de60a41be6'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3267',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=404,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=89615,
    end_offset=89622,
    text_slice='贾政忙陪笑道：',
    hash='sha256:c85db61a04ac67a1b59e106c4059f4d40026f094c56fe78d15e653e34d38bbfb'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3268',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=404,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=89622,
    end_offset=89652,
    text_slice='“犬子岂敢谬承金奖！赖藩郡余祯，果如是言，亦荫生辈之幸矣。”',
    hash='sha256:da2737f86944eb5745d4a7fc06d55db83a4f9e0d280fb02420aad0ccc5c52eb5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3269',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=404,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=89652,
    end_offset=89657,
    text_slice='水溶又道：',
    hash='sha256:5414accb2aa01e18222166df892af8ecee00515eba703d662f3436bccfa84e3b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3270',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=404,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=89657,
    end_offset=89799,
    text_slice='“只是一件，令郎如是资质，想老太夫人、夫人辈自然钟爱极矣；但吾辈后生，甚不宜钟溺，钟溺则未免荒失学业。昔小王曾蹈此辙，想令郎亦未必不如是也。若令郎在家难以用功，不妨常到寒第。小王虽不才，却多蒙海上众名士凡至都者，未有不另垂青目。是以寒第高人颇聚。令郎常去谈会谈会，则学问可以日进矣。”',
    hash='sha256:36c37396368ca0c84c1dab4735c62462c14b7d84d80ed7ecbbb069d528c20edf'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3271',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=404,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=89799,
    end_offset=89807,
    text_slice='贾政忙躬身答应。',
    hash='sha256:b0401d745a96e7977b798933a394b9ac568ff968f7f0904c88addba0bdacc1e2'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3272',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=405,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=89809,
    end_offset=89830,
    text_slice='水溶又将腕上一串念珠卸了下来，递与宝玉道：',
    hash='sha256:0fd4947919d2c0cf49ce49014a4d01dbb0feb6ac9055efc62ef806b594291d6a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3273',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=405,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=89830,
    end_offset=89869,
    text_slice='“今日初会，仓促竟无敬贺之物，此系前日圣上亲赐鹡鸰香念珠一串，权为贺敬之礼。”',
    hash='sha256:872445290f903dd437f6e584126ae668618b045d63683ad3cbb59a45b9b58e95'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3274',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=405,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=89869,
    end_offset=89883,
    text_slice='宝玉连忙接了，回身奉与贾政。',
    hash='sha256:ecf0e5ef8fb69e48f53f154de323f0d7c5b3a417cbfc640475e2dd8314131153'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3275',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=405,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=89883,
    end_offset=89893,
    text_slice='贾政与宝玉一齐谢过。',
    hash='sha256:f4394af816948dc854c322f16e2547d52bae2dbe9ed4452827e2ac225fb17889'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3276',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=405,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=89893,
    end_offset=89909,
    text_slice='于是贾赦、贾珍等一齐上来请回舆。',
    hash='sha256:5aaad0e383d6ab3e5e07b685867de90a9d25be5873198d9061aaa2f891ba7418'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3277',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=405,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=89913,
    end_offset=89956,
    text_slice='“逝者已登仙界，非碌碌你我尘寰中之人也。小王虽上叨天恩，虚邀郡袭，岂可越仙輀而进也！”',
    hash='sha256:8705289a224f3798a58171b4cbac35affe6dac1de36cbd842a1056ecf5e150f8'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3278',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=405,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=89956,
    end_offset=89999,
    text_slice='贾赦等见执意不从，只得告辞谢恩回来，命手下掩乐停音，滔滔然将殡过完，方让水溶回舆去了。',
    hash='sha256:bc45f78b1b0d59a068eecaaed6f9bb44c2c50453e1d9e87d677c4f2bdd994daa'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3279',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=405,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=89999,
    end_offset=90004,
    text_slice='不在话下。',
    hash='sha256:d6924045c03a7abb9192b67f99836b2b60d6a8226f1a7795692af7265875d4c7'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3280',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=406,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=90006,
    end_offset=90020,
    text_slice='且说宁府送殡，一路热闹非常。',
    hash='sha256:8b9c1fbeeb021d63e1bac26d7ce6cb94da3db59fdb3eab5501c6d8f7e525fbc8'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3281',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=406,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=90020,
    end_offset=90070,
    text_slice='刚至城门前，又有贾赦、贾政、贾珍等诸同僚属下各家祭棚接祭，一一的谢过，然后出城，竟奔铁槛寺大路行来。',
    hash='sha256:be72f5c5c91cfb364d246bf8c6880600bbb08297e6ac8341d93f1379845fa15b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3282',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=406,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=90070,
    end_offset=90115,
    text_slice='彼时贾珍带贾蓉来到诸长辈前，让坐轿上马，因而贾赦一辈的各自上了车轿，贾珍一辈的也将要上马。',
    hash='sha256:2a6dd917eb76b87d64124db44b5bee116963836332549c704fbf566603955ed7'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3283',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=406,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=90115,
    end_offset=90173,
    text_slice='凤姐因记挂着宝玉，怕他在郊外纵性逞强，不服家人的话，贾政管不着这些小事，惟恐有个失闪，难见贾母，因此便命小厮来唤他。',
    hash='sha256:71074015e10c5202efa11d8d022a899b6e3c737d53d6a59fd896f0141fac9b00'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3284',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=406,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=90173,
    end_offset=90184,
    text_slice='宝玉只得来到她的车前。',
    hash='sha256:58855126da3e6ad6b4d3cece041ea60d020e93af362f73fcccd80b914fb898f5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3285',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=406,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=90184,
    end_offset=90219,
    text_slice='凤姐笑道：“好兄弟，你是个尊贵人，女孩儿一样的人品，别学他们猴在马上。',
    hash='sha256:dce364f30f62047f897703098ed2ba703010c5a42a797f08fa4a5dfa19ee7563'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3286',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=406,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=90219,
    end_offset=90235,
    text_slice='下来，咱们姐儿两个坐车，岂不好？',
    hash='sha256:0bf4e4d1e2eb68dc2488448fe833e950868477b9df9f87d42a3a7866a50ba0da'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3287',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=406,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=90235,
    end_offset=90260,
    text_slice='”宝玉听说，忙下了马，爬入凤姐车上，二人说笑前进。',
    hash='sha256:d769da20b6d9247d464c7c308e2314c1fc794c740b79015dc28dc4c67efa309c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3288',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=407,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=90262,
    end_offset=90297,
    text_slice='不一时，只见从那边两骑马压地飞来，离凤姐车不远，一齐蹿下来，扶车回说：',
    hash='sha256:67d434864a70fdf1070487ef0ffc23b666d56106da0f7ea3d7f68b73127acea0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3289',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=407,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=90297,
    end_offset=90312,
    text_slice='“这里有下处，奶奶请歇更衣。”',
    hash='sha256:a8c2a505d56735e42936c0f948dca35a2cd4b10e71ebc719a45e9134b0667977'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3290',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=407,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=90312,
    end_offset=90334,
    text_slice='凤姐急命请邢夫人、王夫人的示下，那人回来说：',
    hash='sha256:95d597817a85d65350a435892cab7bcb907ff2767fb5976d8ec1cf20e678cd4b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3291',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=407,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=90334,
    end_offset=90352,
    text_slice='“太太们说不用歇了，叫奶奶自便罢。”',
    hash='sha256:46aae2571ad4581dfdad9d1e0a8bb08ea83b46b3beeb08ad0c6a14af940e4e61'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3292',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=407,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=90352,
    end_offset=90364,
    text_slice='凤姐听了，便命歇歇再走。',
    hash='sha256:cc967e5388d9ab00b68a9561049207152ef998da2ef670675b28baf4cfb1fd04'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3293',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=407,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=90364,
    end_offset=90385,
    text_slice='众小厮听了：一带辕马，岔出人群，往北飞走。',
    hash='sha256:a2b730572e6c7ecd303153e90e12a90576faf457abffd76fb0bb4ee0813b5035'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3294',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=407,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=90385,
    end_offset=90397,
    text_slice='宝玉在车内急命请秦相公。',
    hash='sha256:2aaf9cc8b5417a53c0643e482b7c6738794ae57a4cac3fa763e615b1c2f8b0ca'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3295',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=407,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=90397,
    end_offset=90429,
    text_slice='那时，秦钟正骑马随着他父亲的轿，忽见宝玉的小厮跑来，请他去打尖。',
    hash='sha256:908810848f4a04487565bbc54960947a83a0e1650147873d8e6458cf50b7e6fa'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3296',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=407,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=90429,
    end_offset=90486,
    text_slice='秦钟看时，只见凤姐的车往北而去，后面拉着宝玉的马，搭着鞍笼，便知宝玉同凤姐坐车，自己也便带马赶上来，同入一庄门内。',
    hash='sha256:7a09f163af6131d8259451a3c35493d48cb25d8cb92225b4522a3ac864893a11'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3297',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=407,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=90486,
    end_offset=90497,
    text_slice='早有家人将众庄汉撵尽。',
    hash='sha256:deadbf7252d4f22be6b5fbb2baf5c4f52bba4cabc865ff66139fcf82e3e9afdc'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3298',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=407,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=90497,
    end_offset=90523,
    text_slice='那庄农人家无多房舍，婆娘们无处回避，只得由她们去了。',
    hash='sha256:20939c6c92ec0659bc1ec6baa0f5f9ad6c2a256fc71682685f7bab8da53a0b35'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3299',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=407,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=90523,
    end_offset=90560,
    text_slice='那些村姑、庄妇见了凤姐、宝玉、秦钟的人品、衣服、礼数、款段，岂有不爱看的？',
    hash='sha256:e7e2824a2b3ee731cea96af8bf06186e67e2c7c0cfee1fab165f3388962939d3'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3300',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=408,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=90562,
    end_offset=90582,
    text_slice='一时凤姐进入茅堂，因命宝玉等先出去玩玩。',
    hash='sha256:0bb540e304a9dbf5f044c5a465f5fd897d703e1e1ac21b0d5c5df17b15f41d3e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3301',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=408,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=90582,
    end_offset=90605,
    text_slice='宝玉等会意，因同秦钟出来，带着小厮们各处游玩。',
    hash='sha256:9fba93e0c5b0b6697076e52bc7a744f0ec404bb4f86f7c1cb614f4f8b8f87062'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3302',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=408,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=90605,
    end_offset=90619,
    text_slice='凡庄农动用之物，皆不曾见过。',
    hash='sha256:0017453fa1b1e3b63570c4b7467d9b81f43555dc52584d13e8da149354a0737c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3303',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=408,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=90619,
    end_offset=90651,
    text_slice='宝玉一见了锹、锄、镢、犁等物，皆以为奇，不知何向所使，其名为何。',
    hash='sha256:cea374efedbaeb309842183ae87df80023912689194f14513a5c68f6d5d50295'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3304',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=408,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=90651,
    end_offset=90669,
    text_slice='小厮在旁一一的告诉了名色，说明原委。',
    hash='sha256:91576f6b32e17de75a8976cf017a07f93df9e059c95035554241ba0b273b31f9'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3305',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=408,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=90680,
    end_offset=90709,
    text_slice='“怪道古人诗上说，‘谁知盘中餐，粒粒皆辛苦’，正为此也。”',
    hash='sha256:2c5b85d7779c420eb0255d179ea9449481382cf0adf53f25fc354d740c451922'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3306',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=408,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=90709,
    end_offset=90739,
    text_slice='一面说，一面又至一间房前，只见炕上有个纺车，宝玉又问小厮们：',
    hash='sha256:9d24294ac5ff6d2041760de8924708ec7d35e93114d5a51fc03ab666adcfd889'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3307',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=408,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=90739,
    end_offset=90747,
    text_slice='“这又是什么？”',
    hash='sha256:30aab04a7d209ebfbb83b4ccaf67cc1b47409c98760c185ddcf35090158622dc'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3308',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=408,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=90747,
    end_offset=90757,
    text_slice='小厮们又告诉他原委。',
    hash='sha256:c0da99e3e62f2360977c5c1609017268e331b55593a3fb4d14e0fa4ba742468f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3309',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=408,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=90757,
    end_offset=90775,
    text_slice='宝玉听说，便上来拧转作耍，自为有趣。',
    hash='sha256:c97b2fedde2862e18938b597c1d8c65556c1322b490a0a1ef715bd411eda4f9b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3310',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=408,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=90796,
    end_offset=90803,
    text_slice='“别动坏了！”',
    hash='sha256:e4105755486e40739a601447bb9f444c06de82e7e60f0354a0ff0b7ddec8cba2'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3311',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=408,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=90803,
    end_offset=90812,
    text_slice='众小厮忙断喝拦阻。',
    hash='sha256:7d2af9014f9693df12601179ea5e5d1153bf2bfe70a0e9aadc7032672d09df2f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3312',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=408,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=90824,
    end_offset=90842,
    text_slice='“我因为没见过这个，所以试它一试。”',
    hash='sha256:493324116056d8e1b37db0988fb9908d41a0492ce2f74f65785fe7121e24b673'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3313',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=408,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=90842,
    end_offset=90847,
    text_slice='那丫头道：',
    hash='sha256:026dbe2788adb93637c42db6b5aa41634d1640ad3c915cf78337959ffef0da69'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3314',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=408,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=90847,
    end_offset=90868,
    text_slice='“你们哪里会弄这个！站开了，我纺与你瞧。”',
    hash='sha256:7fa5267bc128c89bce648d9df9fabe48fd40c2de2e92b3ced24c1d2dfe4b88eb'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3315',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=408,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=90868,
    end_offset=90877,
    text_slice='秦钟暗拉宝玉笑道：',
    hash='sha256:55dfdd24f2ca1d6e2072d897b1c8e3cf5ed2397534ea436e7ae7c05e46ec57f1'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3316',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=408,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=90877,
    end_offset=90886,
    text_slice='“此卿大有意趣。”',
    hash='sha256:af6600997d3667ba677c46a323765a4990b94568d42c804d64a46d128824641d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3317',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=408,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=90886,
    end_offset=90896,
    text_slice='宝玉一把推开，笑道：',
    hash='sha256:9f046a5887700e269ded5a8fe1a5204932ff235153716918bd35d5ece8a0e16d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3318',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=408,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=90896,
    end_offset=90911,
    text_slice='“该死的！再胡说，我就打了。”',
    hash='sha256:39eb485c9110bd478b94c31f7274b74680c2e8bea0585c8cab4cbb3a453168d1'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3319',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=408,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=90911,
    end_offset=90924,
    text_slice='说着，只见那丫头纺起线来。',
    hash='sha256:715bd26f0d217b7a95fe8d0f05add713f3bf97ad2c534768f2f3c2bd6af383e4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3320',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=408,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=90942,
    end_offset=90952,
    text_slice='“二丫头，快过来！”',
    hash='sha256:4d1bbab7b0226fd111ef661a1796420a09415b6588cab6bfe7369ede577c42a3'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3321',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=408,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=90952,
    end_offset=90968,
    text_slice='那丫头听见，丢下纺车，一径去了。',
    hash='sha256:f2a0e81e15d05f7e4ad268ba2bb33c4211cc272bb701c93b43635f8accbe60d7'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3322',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=409,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=90970,
    end_offset=90977,
    text_slice='宝玉怅然无趣。',
    hash='sha256:4a68dfb4784ebeba4b2942dd36af5a91f44fe599674c9b0988b93feecc047af8'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3323',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=409,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=90977,
    end_offset=90992,
    text_slice='只见凤姐打发人来叫他两个进去。',
    hash='sha256:e2f4f6aa923df7bfd27a7f1da1ed86a6335954007bb283168dcc016d49e465a0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3324',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=409,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=90992,
    end_offset=91013,
    text_slice='凤姐洗了手，换衣服，抖灰土，问他们换不换。',
    hash='sha256:d5a658307a8357d88b2df6bb2764538a2c7f2be96e96a95fc1c6fc6aa4dc3171'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3325',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=409,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=91013,
    end_offset=91023,
    text_slice='宝玉不换，只得罢了。',
    hash='sha256:f63c630897e2dc88d523c3e947bb98976bba52191ab17614d92145453d86c816'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3326',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=409,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=91023,
    end_offset=91073,
    text_slice='家下仆妇们将带着行路的茶壶、茶杯、十锦屉盒、各样小食端来，凤姐等吃过茶，待他们收拾完备，便起身上车。',
    hash='sha256:b07c167495c121ac4001f45d6f95e79dd04b596fe44fd2a99771d625c3469109'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3327',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=409,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=91073,
    end_offset=91097,
    text_slice='外面旺儿预备下赏封，赏了本村主人，庄妇等来叩赏。',
    hash='sha256:5d35c49997af75c06d87f5c8db3fd50ee791954a7486ad64b7d3aba5d166eaf2'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3328',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=409,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=91097,
    end_offset=91120,
    text_slice='凤姐并不在意，宝玉却留心看时，内中并无二丫头。',
    hash='sha256:906d1171d28d81f93d0ef670f35cb4cb6ae2af76f390ca2086d717d76f7797da'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3329',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=409,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=91120,
    end_offset=91162,
    text_slice='一时上了车，出来走不多远，只见迎头二丫头怀里抱着她小兄弟，同着几个小女孩子说笑而来。',
    hash='sha256:23f853cb8c13a1afe54e74477d5136eb7fbf86ef739d6141c7955eeac304667f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3330',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=409,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=91162,
    end_offset=91205,
    text_slice='宝玉恨不得下车跟了他她去，料是众人不依的，少不得以目相送，争奈车轻马快，一时展眼无踪。',
    hash='sha256:8a960beafbc9b789b44594affa6028a3391b8204a6582e953701cd1be049bc12'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3331',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=410,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=91207,
    end_offset=91219,
    text_slice='走不多时，仍又跟上大殡。',
    hash='sha256:b400de6420e862afad1b97908265880603f06ae3f9e79e3fe523723497b461c0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3332',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=410,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=91219,
    end_offset=91243,
    text_slice='早有前面法鼓金铙、幢幡宝盖，铁槛寺接灵众僧齐至。',
    hash='sha256:7fa6c8cb1cd3e4ab12a4b7f9821edc452e0f1a061d55bf77462db7622f037bd2'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3333',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=410,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=91243,
    end_offset=91261,
    text_slice='少时，到入寺中，另演佛事，重设香坛。',
    hash='sha256:aed17b51508b35d531e1376f623e2af8a61a7294aaa2011ebcb6642795998bad'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3334',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=410,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=91261,
    end_offset=91280,
    text_slice='安灵于内殿偏室之中，宝珠理里寝室相伴。',
    hash='sha256:3661eebf89a3ec2b7d485ef068d34214aff315b62d619f68543b87030d091473'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3335',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=410,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=91280,
    end_offset=91341,
    text_slice='外面贾珍款待一应亲友，也有扰饭的，也有不吃饭而辞的，一应谢过乏，从公、侯、伯、子、男，一起一起的散去，至未末时分方散尽了。',
    hash='sha256:18343be5586d2047e546773ffaacea49ce687e37bbc7b4ca678885f917281bfe'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3336',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=410,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=91341,
    end_offset=91377,
    text_slice='里面的堂客，皆是凤姐张罗接待，先从显官诰命散起，也到晌午大错时方散尽了。',
    hash='sha256:29855f078a3c6699314505bff05e529ca435806360b68402d62038d53f3b0cb4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3337',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=410,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=91377,
    end_offset=91400,
    text_slice='只有几个亲戚是至近的，等做过三日安灵道场方去。',
    hash='sha256:4fc335d8b3428fa7db57acb8bc338a0fb605c4a367ad3c116d28c038f5d2e9ca'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3338',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=410,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=91400,
    end_offset=91425,
    text_slice='那时，邢、王二夫人知凤姐必不能回家，也便就要进城。',
    hash='sha256:ba89ec49e9522962c69dcceedb94ebf04d0275a467ccf3cff9fcb92e52452bc4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3339',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=410,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=91425,
    end_offset=91455,
    text_slice='王夫人要带宝玉去，宝玉乍到郊外，哪里肯回去，只要跟凤姐住着。',
    hash='sha256:efa22421bdd3f8f2434f0d8ca502735626c5ec3bee2cde5f432060d7aaf6be48'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3340',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=410,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=91455,
    end_offset=91472,
    text_slice='王夫人无法，只得交与凤姐便回来了。',
    hash='sha256:e1020edffc942a0561d089529acd88b0a5c426d7e561554e4025bc713c88af53'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3341',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=411,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=91474,
    end_offset=91520,
    text_slice='原来这铁槛寺原是宁、荣二公当日修造，现今还是有香火地亩布施，以备京中老了人口，在此便宜寄放。',
    hash='sha256:e0d79611c4982747b0a8cc69efb735bc8cf8b8f919856fecc25b31c1d6f7e8fe'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3342',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=411,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=91520,
    end_offset=91542,
    text_slice='其中阴阳两宅俱已预备妥贴，好为送灵人口寄居。',
    hash='sha256:cd19f3fe2b188d942910a02282f787de50505df37a18920c6cea39e88874f042'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3343',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=411,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=91542,
    end_offset=91624,
    text_slice='不想如今后辈人口繁盛，其中贫富不一，或性情参商，有那家业艰难安分的，便住在这里了；有那尚排场有钱势的，只说这里不方便，一定另外或村庄或尼庵寻个下处，为事毕宴退之所。',
    hash='sha256:d8b08ccb0e44f95ee047202173fef248102528d47c93fc2b8d267d631780dba0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3344',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=411,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=91624,
    end_offset=91682,
    text_slice='即今秦氏之丧，族中诸人皆权在铁槛寺下榻，独有凤姐嫌不方便，因而早遣人来和馒头庵的姑子净虚说了，腾出两间房子来作下处。',
    hash='sha256:5a156a6c835203843a1ce1022a622374fe7a956773cb7a16d970a1f4db77f69a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3345',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=412,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=91684,
    end_offset=91721,
    text_slice='原来这馒头庵就是水月寺，因它庙里做的馒头好，就起了这个浑号，离铁槛寺不远。',
    hash='sha256:2bcb691fcf523b596d2488451d7d6d92240bf89e3ecaca51e6041752c8d0ea11'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3346',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=412,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=91721,
    end_offset=91747,
    text_slice='当下和尚功课已完，奠过晚茶，贾珍便命贾蓉请凤姐歇息。',
    hash='sha256:8a1d968596d121cca6a640b55bd46a5f84792c18850d7bdc6f924639c6b4cae6'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3347',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=412,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=91747,
    end_offset=91782,
    text_slice='凤姐见还有几个妯娌陪着女亲，自己便辞了众人，带了宝玉、秦钟往水月庵来。',
    hash='sha256:ad29669f39373af7b98298d73c364bcf49e8f121efb9fb61e3794fd70a70fa9a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3348',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=412,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=91782,
    end_offset=91807,
    text_slice='原来秦业年迈多病，不能在此，只命秦钟等待安灵罢了。',
    hash='sha256:6d3f828ad04f833b33d217db4c94f2f2908ef1e0215e3eab42f2a89f3a591638'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3349',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=412,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=91807,
    end_offset=91851,
    text_slice='那秦钟便只跟着凤姐、宝玉，一时到了水月庵，净虚带领智善、智能两个徒弟出来迎接，大家见过。',
    hash='sha256:18a991bca21fd69242a804ea826a33928a8d90ffda3322f065b828af63908308'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3350',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=412,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=91889,
    end_offset=91910,
    text_slice='“你们师徒怎么这些日子也不往我们那里去？”',
    hash='sha256:a04cb1b83ac8cd742e298eb5fbf548b618ca1eb61aba7a59ac75ac8f88ebd7e6'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3351',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=412,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=91910,
    end_offset=91914,
    text_slice='净虚道：',
    hash='sha256:4ae10eda2f67c899854a5d8f49d660d3b44a5995652080ee94f240e5ddbe0209'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3352',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=412,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=91914,
    end_offset=91981,
    text_slice='“可是。这几天都没工夫，因胡老爷府里产了公子，太太送了十两银子来这里，叫请几位师父念三日《血盆经》，忙得没个空儿，就没来请奶奶的安。”',
    hash='sha256:e053de956ac695a1839d51b951a4b6a92262217679e30997c4cf8e9ad55902c2'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3353',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=413,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=91983,
    end_offset=91992,
    text_slice='不言老尼陪着凤姐。',
    hash='sha256:7d85f3f1337188a5e929d05d5edb53b371ccdfab67214e5ff725816d8e5e4a2a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3354',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=413,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=92020,
    end_offset=92027,
    text_slice='“能儿来了。”',
    hash='sha256:54428807eff9518e3feb4f8796fb7904378f3ea0ef2273b48282d41bd699c1b6'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3355',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=413,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=92027,
    end_offset=92031,
    text_slice='秦钟道：',
    hash='sha256:7e59c5d0c87325ba39546d2dcfc86c1a4ea44c4766d6ad10ef8c65d3b5f1589e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3356',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=413,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=92031,
    end_offset=92041,
    text_slice='“理那东西作什么？”',
    hash='sha256:d347ca498c4be5ab77e85d9013ca2c5cb21224af6287119617dde4ac8235b2a5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3357',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=413,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=92041,
    end_offset=92046,
    text_slice='宝玉笑道：',
    hash='sha256:4010737831077115327a930fc031b5caa442f6aca950d1b4be97c2a32a759b5c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3358',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=413,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=92046,
    end_offset=92084,
    text_slice='“你别弄鬼，那一日在老太太屋里，一个人没有，你搂着她作什么？这会子还哄我。”',
    hash='sha256:265ca8365c6585b089f6b974238903385ed484d98f6e7f8949bfdafe5c762b07'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3359',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=413,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=92084,
    end_offset=92089,
    text_slice='秦钟笑道：',
    hash='sha256:3f51106d2128c5dc9fd201d5d6660025d9fe565a0c9f8e0b6ef85a00f4b50291'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3360',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=413,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=92089,
    end_offset=92099,
    text_slice='“这可是没有的话。”',
    hash='sha256:c401d7dee945a9b152a5dcc238e9e9d8ce86eaa0fe1dd75f4b0f611604e2a90a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3361',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=413,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=92099,
    end_offset=92104,
    text_slice='宝玉笑道：',
    hash='sha256:4010737831077115327a930fc031b5caa442f6aca950d1b4be97c2a32a759b5c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3362',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=413,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=92104,
    end_offset=92131,
    text_slice='“有没有也不管你，你只叫住她倒碗茶来我吃，就丢开手。”',
    hash='sha256:69306215a11fa8ed171d9fe6d30142599448fa017c230cab95ae05f96e577f9d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3363',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=413,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=92131,
    end_offset=92136,
    text_slice='秦钟笑道：',
    hash='sha256:3f51106d2128c5dc9fd201d5d6660025d9fe565a0c9f8e0b6ef85a00f4b50291'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3364',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=413,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=92136,
    end_offset=92162,
    text_slice='“这又奇了，你叫她倒去，还怕她不倒？何必要我说呢。”',
    hash='sha256:e356b8cd26a854a3dd70a91c7a8c0b87e3f959f9bd8a61b48581a8557bdaf735'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3365',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=413,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=92162,
    end_offset=92166,
    text_slice='宝玉道：',
    hash='sha256:10c9e1a43f0e2e5bf2e54f50fb3dbede512eb436326aec72d14625e62153e9b0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3366',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=413,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=92166,
    end_offset=92192,
    text_slice='“我叫她倒的是无情意的，不及你叫她倒的是有情意的。”',
    hash='sha256:2060f071d625107740bea40ae48d6903e1aa4e7957c0bbb81e1dd3471b9ed8d2'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3367',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=413,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=92192,
    end_offset=92199,
    text_slice='秦钟只得说道：',
    hash='sha256:e0a53b700dab9ea99efc10c08f17e7a2d717f2e5fd8bdbf308640f6427007aab'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3368',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=413,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=92199,
    end_offset=92211,
    text_slice='“能儿，倒碗茶来给我。”',
    hash='sha256:3f49d5d9f62f3e21f9025486a557d5a7c7135098afb5b709740ae9c622fc846d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3369',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=413,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=92211,
    end_offset=92239,
    text_slice='那智能儿自幼在荣府走动，无人不识，因常与宝玉、秦钟玩耍。',
    hash='sha256:956a0931f62bf76b61fafd07186c54e02916214cd80833e6d34967d29ba1287e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3370',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=413,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=92239,
    end_offset=92286,
    text_slice='她如今大了，渐知风月，便看上了秦钟人物风流，那秦钟也极爱他妍媚，二人虽未上手，却已情投意合了。',
    hash='sha256:f60dff13e89bf9bb5a605f7b6c006c50ea9ac7d333f7d71ca3e29284699141ea'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3371',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=413,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=92286,
    end_offset=92306,
    text_slice='今智能见了秦钟，心眼俱开，走去倒了茶来。',
    hash='sha256:6cc7b3bb5baa494fc80f745a4d7f4e4eaddb17c54dff9ab271e5ee174b2552af'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3372',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=413,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=92311,
    end_offset=92316,
    text_slice='“给我。”',
    hash='sha256:bca77b303150ba45fe9ff1db788eba1c397b19fa4ed7277a7dc9b0c4c5ebc0f2'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3373',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=413,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=92316,
    end_offset=92320,
    text_slice='宝玉叫：',
    hash='sha256:0997620eb02bfdcdcbd9de034c1f5f1788a557ef268c16ef2fcadfdc88dce27b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3374',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=413,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=92320,
    end_offset=92325,
    text_slice='“给我！”',
    hash='sha256:b1a6b3690938318ffdbb4b79f2661c67b80eb8543c61211535fa4b38be6164ee'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3375',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=413,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=92325,
    end_offset=92333,
    text_slice='智能儿抿嘴笑道：',
    hash='sha256:f40d65b6b192f3b7b1bab3b69306a175609e88dd77eb6b2f937128b4c893de6e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3376',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=413,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=92333,
    end_offset=92350,
    text_slice='“一碗茶也来争，我难道手里有蜜！”',
    hash='sha256:6b8c98d065b36f23c7b231a1b7d8d3161e3132b35f479e95d2a6b630661376a7'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3377',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=413,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=92350,
    end_offset=92378,
    text_slice='宝玉先抢得了吃着，方要问话，只见智善来叫智能去摆茶碟子。',
    hash='sha256:fc3eec5f87b453f42a5a79ae5266b54ee74a55ff3862fb3ec53c8464db7cc997'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3378',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=413,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=92378,
    end_offset=92392,
    text_slice='一时来请他两个去吃茶果点心。',
    hash='sha256:3b8440ba0fae0cbaff30c5a44749491613cb138f5fee8ac36225f545960d7ef5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3379',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=413,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=92392,
    end_offset=92413,
    text_slice='他两个哪里吃这些东西，坐一坐，仍出来玩笑。',
    hash='sha256:fc54cb96ebf21f7d15b60929617dfe5319d1ad49d1ad0f2dd71658dfc4a145ee'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3380',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=414,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=92415,
    end_offset=92436,
    text_slice='凤姐也略坐片时，便回至净室歇息，老尼相送。',
    hash='sha256:1a8d97ad1f04e2c0dbb53d661652091fff0322abecc5f06c14b1bbb6ff3ec98e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3381',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=414,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=92480,
    end_offset=92505,
    text_slice='“我正有一事，要到府里求太太，先请奶奶一个示下。”',
    hash='sha256:aeea66684a4855e9390f789f5a321ab7b51485124eab932a52149f95a785093d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3382',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=414,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=92505,
    end_offset=92516,
    text_slice='凤姐因问何事，老尼道：',
    hash='sha256:22562946a110e5435c308bc54ae6dbb2da49ca52378782125eb9ca4c7f1e292c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3383',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=414,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=92516,
    end_offset=92838,
    text_slice='“阿弥陀佛！只因当日我先在长安县内善才庵内出家的时节，那时有个施主姓张，是大财主。他有个女儿小名金哥，那年都往我庙里来进香，不想遇见了长安府府太爷的小舅子李衙内。那李衙内一心看上，要娶金哥，打发人来求亲，不想金哥已受了原任长安守备的公子的聘定。张家若退亲，又怕守备不依，因此说已有了人家。谁知李公子执意不依，定要娶他女儿，张家正无计策，两处为难。不想守备家听了此信，也不管青红皂白，便来作践辱骂，说一个女儿许几家，偏不许退定礼，就要打官司告状起来。那张家急了，只得着人上京来寻门路，赌气偏要退定礼。我想如今长安节度云老爷与府上最契，可以求太太与老爷说声，打发一封书去，求云老爷和那守备说一声，不怕那守备不依。若是肯行，张家连倾家孝顺也都情愿。”',
    hash='sha256:31470b4da1be79582bdff5ba7eefe5ad278b19f3947f95635f29b5585cfbbeb5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3384',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=415,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=92840,
    end_offset=92847,
    text_slice='凤姐听了笑道：',
    hash='sha256:3134f2b0f125efc05452546ca24de766549adf65d0232cf57192f3b11ffbaf95'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3385',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=415,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=92847,
    end_offset=92867,
    text_slice='“这事倒不大，只是太太再不管这样的事。”',
    hash='sha256:d513b39eb88c7de795aaae470c98c1efd48ce4ae2b904d8f5ed2165633e4e2e9'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3386',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=415,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=92867,
    end_offset=92871,
    text_slice='老尼道：',
    hash='sha256:b292006eba7db14f404872ca302443de8a42110187191f112e92d7dd768dead8'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3387',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=415,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=92871,
    end_offset=92887,
    text_slice='“太太不管，奶奶也可以主张了。”',
    hash='sha256:a876187b281e0429ad5f1d1f2fd979c8a40763e3be9538668fe5a90aedad45cc'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3388',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=415,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=92887,
    end_offset=92894,
    text_slice='凤姐听说笑道：',
    hash='sha256:c36fdc2a8f5ed7bceb2c6941b1048490e251b544258e52b279dc888f6bd6e3c3'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3389',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=415,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=92894,
    end_offset=92912,
    text_slice='“我也不等银子使，也不做这样的事。”',
    hash='sha256:b099f53a40f7a0579b0e0f4d9dc36517938ca11fe430fc0caff7116431b22d6d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3390',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=415,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=92912,
    end_offset=92927,
    text_slice='净虚听了，打去妄想，半晌叹道：',
    hash='sha256:a4b22b41abfb21cd82bd8826a9bd4a398dfbfdc50b2747b2d4ebfc4443dbb63c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3391',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=415,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=92927,
    end_offset=92990,
    text_slice='“虽如此说，只是张家已知我来求府里，如今不管这事，张家不知道没工夫管这事，不希罕他的谢礼，倒像府里连这点子手段也没有的一般。”',
    hash='sha256:9155bfd658516b46f82d21052cf5b469179949419fb9dfd623906568712883ee'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3392',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=416,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=92992,
    end_offset=93008,
    text_slice='凤姐听了这话，便发了兴头，说道：',
    hash='sha256:7bd28b873004ad472690e33d70ee876177590be0bda609ac2fd3060f2cb588cb'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3393',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=416,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=93008,
    end_offset=93067,
    text_slice='“你是素日知道我的，从来不信什么是阴司地狱报应的，凭是什么事，我说要行就行。你叫他拿三千两银子来，我就替他出这口气。”',
    hash='sha256:e2a20c227b007e46d7734929143a59b501f2d7a83548969d6de4d86c9fea70d3'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3394',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=416,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=93067,
    end_offset=93080,
    text_slice='老尼听说，喜不自尽，忙说：',
    hash='sha256:4bba61f8d392bc0591003fbd2bc9b498587058ef408802cf48783f72ae41d944'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3395',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=416,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=93080,
    end_offset=93093,
    text_slice='“有，有，有！这个不难。”',
    hash='sha256:ef59cd68811b38cf57fb90ecf18b4b9f22b15e681b504c12cc396f30b960d39a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3396',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=416,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=93093,
    end_offset=93098,
    text_slice='凤姐又道：',
    hash='sha256:05bd7a4e70509ce572ec6c37255de79e6980b31cd84678a9bb6dacc714ac452e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3397',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=416,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=93098,
    end_offset=93170,
    text_slice='“我比不得他们扯篷拉牵的图银子。这三千银子，不过是给打发说去的小厮做盘缠，使他赚几个辛苦钱，我一个钱也不要他的。便是三万两，我此刻还拿得出来。”',
    hash='sha256:deec353c4546b23e0ff5de565185c5c152582b767840ba85772b33229643fe5e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3398',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=416,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=93170,
    end_offset=93181,
    text_slice='老尼连忙答应，又说道：',
    hash='sha256:33751752d6bb4485d5b3c33a3b22416373bd4a64f7c9a89185b9b0998ea4d776'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3399',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=416,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=93181,
    end_offset=93198,
    text_slice='“既如此，奶奶明日就开恩也罢了。”',
    hash='sha256:9b9e1f991441f80743902294d7badaadb045ee7a50138cbfbf00f467727a7e8f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3400',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=416,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=93198,
    end_offset=93202,
    text_slice='凤姐道：',
    hash='sha256:493b74ef604832e715c69f5c0a24d8d4a251e38e82e9ee38006f3f407dd315a5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3401',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=416,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=93202,
    end_offset=93231,
    text_slice='“你瞧瞧我忙的，哪一处少了我？既应了你，自然快快的了结。”',
    hash='sha256:c90ff92bada0d4850858d2b85f8438f394ce6f90254d1fb8b77d06ccae3a4559'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3402',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=416,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=93231,
    end_offset=93235,
    text_slice='老尼道：',
    hash='sha256:b292006eba7db14f404872ca302443de8a42110187191f112e92d7dd768dead8'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3403',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=416,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=93235,
    end_offset=93323,
    text_slice='“这点子事，在别人跟前就忙得不知怎么样，若是奶奶跟前，再添上些也不够奶奶一发挥的。只是俗语说的，‘能者多劳’，太太因大小事见奶奶妥贴，越性都推给奶奶了，奶奶也要保重金体才是。”',
    hash='sha256:1731c58b6ddf0b328715fd13baafc6128f081def533ca6de34485acd936ac21b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3404',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=416,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=93323,
    end_offset=93349,
    text_slice='一路话奉承得凤姐越发受用了，也不顾劳乏，更攀谈起来。',
    hash='sha256:3347481f73371ca8f4da46c382f217b6297543fa059ff071fb196d1a3425caa1'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3405',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=417,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=93351,
    end_offset=93365,
    text_slice='谁想秦钟趁黑无人，来寻智能。',
    hash='sha256:8eda0870dab4f7148cc6bfbd336b16d89f27a12b6aa74dfa2bf4145b4e7c580f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3406',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=417,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=93365,
    end_offset=93394,
    text_slice='刚至后面房中，只见智能独在房中洗茶碗，秦钟跑来便搂着亲嘴。',
    hash='sha256:b8c0ca603d237f891ccd95ed219f4892fd3d4903c4f6075b5c3865a77c8959a5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3407',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=417,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=93402,
    end_offset=93420,
    text_slice='“这算什么呢！再这么，我就叫唤了。”',
    hash='sha256:7e53a7245d3b20eab1c25f703f39f26bb731f37db24392ef45291c243297e504'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3408',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=417,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=93420,
    end_offset=93425,
    text_slice='秦钟求道：',
    hash='sha256:7689402e1693d01db6fb6e2fc3c2c51cd876723bc7eaad24f6a5ac622ad7f9d8'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3409',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=417,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=93425,
    end_offset=93450,
    text_slice='“好人，我已急死了。你今儿再不依，我就死在这里。”',
    hash='sha256:f218af9631a58362b37fb33d4ff78b487e1759b792cd22b8fc1db8826b9f0924'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3410',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=417,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=93450,
    end_offset=93454,
    text_slice='智能道：',
    hash='sha256:b095ff4784df427f3e541edd8cfa16f3290bb86844ba120fd75ec68ab1f125f3'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3411',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=417,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=93454,
    end_offset=93481,
    text_slice='“你想怎样？除非等我出了这牢坑，离了这些人，才依你。”',
    hash='sha256:29bd8c6e722058009d79e34df665e54c967fc7d480ddd85de0e9a99b397d268e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3412',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=417,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=93481,
    end_offset=93485,
    text_slice='秦钟道：',
    hash='sha256:7e59c5d0c87325ba39546d2dcfc86c1a4ea44c4766d6ad10ef8c65d3b5f1589e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3413',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=417,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=93485,
    end_offset=93502,
    text_slice='“这也容易，只是远水救不得近渴。”',
    hash='sha256:699d53f039ae0417aeead6bcb9ec70e35ecd37a013d392ffd2d45e3689b0562f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3414',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=417,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=93502,
    end_offset=93529,
    text_slice='说着，一口吹了灯，满屋漆黑，将智能抱在炕上就云雨起来。',
    hash='sha256:ad19f065672f79a4177a4c8d7b6c1fa8c5e8c580df93328903be93180a96d208'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3415',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=417,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=93529,
    end_offset=93552,
    text_slice='那智能百般挣挫不起，又不好叫的，少不得依他了。',
    hash='sha256:62af9070d1e580f62a860745be6a977d6c94b77c3ef5030f6ec072ecc8594d16'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3416',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=417,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=93552,
    end_offset=93576,
    text_slice='正在得趣，只见一人进来，将他二人按住，也不则声。',
    hash='sha256:f36431d6b7e727023b68ab61213eb69d3a6f11ef8bb70f1b919b3b00e763683b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3417',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=417,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=93576,
    end_offset=93591,
    text_slice='二人不知是谁，唬得不敢动一动。',
    hash='sha256:ce9018ee46077c72ed78d81b5ad2efa4b39fc6c16d8b6559cd92f6d04b1f5fb8'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3418',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=417,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=93591,
    end_offset=93617,
    text_slice='只听那人嗤的一声，掌不住笑了，二人听声，方知是宝玉。',
    hash='sha256:1b865e8f1faa436d14213b862ccb8e63b1f087b4d34aa29119dcaca90fac6981'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3419',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=417,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=93628,
    end_offset=93635,
    text_slice='“这算什么？”',
    hash='sha256:2d885035a26db55a31c6c7730ca3d8d1e17ad2fa07aae328b075a10706e72104'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3420',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=417,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=93635,
    end_offset=93640,
    text_slice='宝玉笑道：',
    hash='sha256:4010737831077115327a930fc031b5caa442f6aca950d1b4be97c2a32a759b5c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3421',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=417,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=93640,
    end_offset=93655,
    text_slice='“你倒不依，咱们就叫喊起来。”',
    hash='sha256:f210cc6ba1dc79e6dfdfb89421d416cce48a51ecaf3c48ed5c29e0eae370673f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3422',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=417,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=93655,
    end_offset=93665,
    text_slice='羞得智能趁黑地跑了。',
    hash='sha256:3aa0738d4c484a2023763a02d2c69efcba92ef087b3a19e85d9f00db79dbff42'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3423',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=417,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=93675,
    end_offset=93684,
    text_slice='“你可还和我强？”',
    hash='sha256:ee72b72ec0e0bc0deba7f22f9bad46e69c941ad7d7e3e8e51fb4b17bd6fec3f2'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3424',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=417,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=93684,
    end_offset=93689,
    text_slice='秦钟笑道：',
    hash='sha256:3f51106d2128c5dc9fd201d5d6660025d9fe565a0c9f8e0b6ef85a00f4b50291'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3425',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=417,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=93689,
    end_offset=93713,
    text_slice='“好人，你只别嚷得众人知道，你要怎样我都依你。”',
    hash='sha256:821039f93c8000da04a3c379157f200cc7b7dca7d49540e986f5a13341c528dc'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3426',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=417,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=93713,
    end_offset=93718,
    text_slice='宝玉笑道：',
    hash='sha256:4010737831077115327a930fc031b5caa442f6aca950d1b4be97c2a32a759b5c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3427',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=417,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=93718,
    end_offset=93741,
    text_slice='“这会子也不用说，等一会睡下，再细细的算帐。”',
    hash='sha256:39e56a893f28973c1736e39b4a4b9ebfd47fe0401ee7a8bc693852778fc480cc'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3428',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=417,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=93741,
    end_offset=93782,
    text_slice='一时，宽衣安歇的时节，凤姐在里间，秦钟、宝玉在外间，满地下皆是家下婆子，打铺坐更。',
    hash='sha256:612b236d4aab488eb49b065fc1994ecaa234eee4a7a4e960ea428a08f328ac9d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3429',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=417,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=93782,
    end_offset=93810,
    text_slice='凤姐因怕通灵玉失落，便等宝玉睡下，命人拿来塞在自己枕边。',
    hash='sha256:3bb13b728ccfef3380b12c26894bc9f9b4586e21855ac0e88586cf49481b63fa'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3430',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=417,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=93810,
    end_offset=93842,
    text_slice='宝玉不知与秦钟算何帐目，未见真切，未曾记得，此系疑案，不敢纂创。',
    hash='sha256:5c08c7f68ee7c37b3d25c598b708d09b94cca807ad0eaf5f143f25573383b198'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3431',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=418,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=93844,
    end_offset=93849,
    text_slice='一宿无话。',
    hash='sha256:c5443e4ddc0297a845fe17e78db992e89835f4a31422c8dd3a33aae669ed2d1d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3432',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=418,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=93849,
    end_offset=93888,
    text_slice='至次日一早，便有贾母、王夫人打发了人来看宝玉，又命多穿两件衣服，无事宁可回去。',
    hash='sha256:606c3c7379b2518d7d7b01d97b7cb5bddbba260b9bc85898747f18c0ed20c7c7'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3433',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=418,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=93888,
    end_offset=93917,
    text_slice='宝玉那里肯回去，又有秦钟恋着智能，调唆宝玉求凤姐再住一天。',
    hash='sha256:ae412654290fb2d050a53c66f6e4c04bcfc1b89284791c20e796a3c23853f853'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3434',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=418,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=93917,
    end_offset=93996,
    text_slice='凤姐想了一想：凡丧仪大事虽妥，还有一半点小事未曾安插，可以指此再住一日，岂不又在贾珍跟前送了满情；二则又可以完净虚那事；三则顺了宝玉的心，贾母听见，岂不欢喜？',
    hash='sha256:099c5a1aaf6f6968ab2f559080de9c085f27375253b3e5a91843fd21b8cb4216'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3435',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=418,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=94008,
    end_offset=94046,
    text_slice='“我的事都完了，你要在这里逛，少不得越性辛苦一日罢了，明儿可是定要走的了。”',
    hash='sha256:d240e125eed05e34a763e905ea54ed4db128a25634dfd0bd80eb692040a1a6af'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3436',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=418,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=94046,
    end_offset=94061,
    text_slice='宝玉听说，千姐姐万姐姐的央求：',
    hash='sha256:89ac91c98098f8ed09856bdd88f4c06563a5538b34f31db93515d2fc3f04271b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3437',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=418,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=94061,
    end_offset=94075,
    text_slice='“只住一天，明日必回去的。”',
    hash='sha256:74fb09a48396b3409a08218bfebd3bc10d1b650e6d5d5f41de4f716dd47a80a2'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3438',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=418,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=94075,
    end_offset=94083,
    text_slice='于是又住了一夜。',
    hash='sha256:8b6c959b74ad383354ef43f00e08bf12d4bf186de1c987f3c46a707da1b845ca'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3439',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=419,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=94085,
    end_offset=94105,
    text_slice='凤姐便命悄悄将昨日老尼之事，说与来旺儿。',
    hash='sha256:c9b96e097689ff5bbe7ef7466fe14d06ae1af58a7476673ec4fc7f8de504d280'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3440',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=419,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=94105,
    end_offset=94163,
    text_slice='来旺儿心中俱已明白，急忙进城找着主文的相公，假托贾琏所嘱，修书一封，连夜往长安县来，不过百里路程，两日工夫俱已妥协。',
    hash='sha256:628b16b41cde7caeb93465cc0e4e6999d8d001ce77f453e784c59d2458c38961'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3441',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=419,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=94163,
    end_offset=94201,
    text_slice='那节度使名唤云光，久欠贾府之情，这一点小事，岂有不允之理，给了回书，旺儿来。',
    hash='sha256:3f4d3718447d7da0c4937e83bd6d873d6b576d2852eb7a494bf864f0d575884f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3442',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=419,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=94201,
    end_offset=94207,
    text_slice='且不在话下。',
    hash='sha256:766d5541062b049481a8a0929a06eb78ad5bef64611defe297f07880824d2169'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3443',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=420,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=94209,
    end_offset=94240,
    text_slice='却说凤姐等又过了一日，次日方别了老尼，着她三日后往府里去讨信。',
    hash='sha256:3455e3e6984418e81ff2f6d7c06e8d60daa2da0951da4843dccd998e63a517b4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3444',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=420,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=94240,
    end_offset=94276,
    text_slice='那秦钟与智能百般不忍分离，背地里多少幽期密约，俱不用细述，只得含泪而别。',
    hash='sha256:faf647bcf49e7b9a145159369a5cc4790833c82231aab7af5ac5866c68c68a48'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3445',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=420,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=94276,
    end_offset=94289,
    text_slice='凤姐又到铁槛寺中照望一番。',
    hash='sha256:b26744e9245db53c6507606add93e7bc5af5f5270c819e44abfabd72bdb24f0b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3446',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=420,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=94289,
    end_offset=94308,
    text_slice='宝珠执意不肯回家，贾珍只得派妇女相伴。',
    hash='sha256:eb8a60d1020478e54ea3df37e000b56b31170c48e36625f9c50526e9313689ab'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3447',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=420,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=94308,
    end_offset=94313,
    text_slice='后回再见。',
    hash='sha256:91a3bbffae2d074c82437158e39b6b0961804c529f5c49993e06b594b6075ac7'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3448',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=421,
    segment_type='heading',
    start_offset=94315,
    end_offset=94338,
    text_slice='第十六回  贾元春才选凤藻宫\u3000秦鲸卿夭逝黄泉路',
    hash='sha256:29621bd352297e3d6e18c52b65f237b11bb3e8861794ba60819dc58d1d92a204'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3449',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=422,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=94340,
    end_offset=94361,
    text_slice='却说宝玉见收拾了外书房，约定与秦钟读夜书。',
    hash='sha256:9f91cd2093de04a8382949e0788fd1d19887d2a52fbb9b525313e8653fe9215d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3450',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=422,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=94361,
    end_offset=94431,
    text_slice='偏那秦钟秉赋最弱，因在郊外受了些风霜，又与智能儿偷期绻缱，未免失于调养，回来时便咳嗽伤风，懒进饮食，大有不胜之态，遂不敢出门，只在家中养息。',
    hash='sha256:8a0b24cf1c65d85906198a04e88f041be67cec1b7b8233dc6a74afc7212398e3'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3451',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=422,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=94431,
    end_offset=94458,
    text_slice='宝玉便扫了兴头，只得付于无可奈何，且自静候大愈时再约。',
    hash='sha256:c3259be1763f38ee85de48ca6c1a23cca12a7e900615d335b9d83b02acfb556d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3452',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=423,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=94460,
    end_offset=94479,
    text_slice='那凤姐儿已是得了云光的回信，俱已妥协。',
    hash='sha256:ddd60729080e5665739fe8c72bbf93cda5cbd481c8fe2d379894ddfad8153c77'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3453',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=423,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=94479,
    end_offset=94503,
    text_slice='老尼达知张家，果然那守备忍气吞声的收了前聘之物。',
    hash='sha256:115ab9deac96931cea40c20a22d603dce90c68da614b73c881165041d21fe3a4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3454',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=423,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=94503,
    end_offset=94552,
    text_slice='谁知那张财主虽如此爱势贪财，却养了一个知义多情的女儿，闻得父母退了亲事，她便一条麻绳悄悄的自缢了。',
    hash='sha256:4ccc86a6f74584e2578e6585ba71a6c89201ed3b9fa8b5c6e1d46efc66db6d55'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3455',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=423,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=94552,
    end_offset=94580,
    text_slice='那守备之子闻得金哥自缢，他也是个极多情的，遂也投河而死。',
    hash='sha256:d61995d98efef580e62b2046bfe34b0d2c0ffa02c8122f0176192117eefb95f0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3456',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=423,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=94580,
    end_offset=94598,
    text_slice='只落得张、李两家没趣，真是人财两空。',
    hash='sha256:de0f27a985019871fb665886e2b5d2922cdb11b4a5d51cbae7657c114650d637'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3457',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=423,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=94598,
    end_offset=94624,
    text_slice='这里凤姐却坐享了三千两，王夫人等连一点消息也不知道。',
    hash='sha256:49d5ef74fdde644b33dcf605ed52a585acb5ca3338ccf0f48590f513c6ccba42'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3458',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=423,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=94624,
    end_offset=94658,
    text_slice='自此、凤姐胆识愈壮，以后有了这样的事，便恣意的作为起来，也不消多记。',
    hash='sha256:b9cae72f1dc77649f345c07310116ae91acab6e4e0ddcfab09539bdf844b7643'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3459',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=424,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=94660,
    end_offset=94689,
    text_slice='一日，正是贾政的生辰，宁、荣二处人丁都齐集庆贺，闹热非常。',
    hash='sha256:f19e631ce19a562b4fe286672ffe115a4e0156c32e834697693dd7fffde28a51'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3460',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=424,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=94704,
    end_offset=94719,
    text_slice='“有六宫都太监夏老爷来降旨。”',
    hash='sha256:269e1658bfc74fb7f81250f9b8a3da9f614981756cea057ab719786ee58cd5e5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3461',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=424,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=94719,
    end_offset=94759,
    text_slice='吓得贾赦、贾政等一干人不知是何消息，忙止了戏文，撤去酒席，摆了香案，启中门跪接。',
    hash='sha256:573e887373d9b13706aba377b9bf017c7b4c8abbca5fc802901a79416911ce51'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3462',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=424,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=94759,
    end_offset=94787,
    text_slice='早见六宫都太监夏守忠乘马而至，前后左右又有许多内监跟从。',
    hash='sha256:7a18455dc786c31a0a8ffd5c124ae6ceb92ca567dbd44bee76fd035acb5e9962'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3463',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=424,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=94825,
    end_offset=94845,
    text_slice='“特旨：立刻宣贾政入朝，在临敬殿陛见。”',
    hash='sha256:1889d4e2669a02301e4e4e56c751910e800f38ea823c30328113c17ceabb7643'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3464',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=424,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=94845,
    end_offset=94860,
    text_slice='说毕，也不及吃茶，便乘马去了。',
    hash='sha256:135a8dc6840c9127a622ed78aff32ccfd296ba19931d073020f526e8082b36a0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3465',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=424,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=94860,
    end_offset=94879,
    text_slice='贾赦等不知是何兆头，只得急忙更衣入朝。',
    hash='sha256:252198255147d865d53ef0a7ca4f4d5087270ec8a879859f0667214f1048431c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3466',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=425,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=94881,
    end_offset=94908,
    text_slice='贾母等合家人等心中皆惶惶不定，不住的使人飞马来往报信。',
    hash='sha256:50bc3e32c0598cae4a5737b547227ceedadbd1a4ab16fa3c6bb7bc404240c280'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3467',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=425,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=94938,
    end_offset=94959,
    text_slice='“奉老爷命，速请老太太带领太太等进朝谢恩”',
    hash='sha256:5dc724773cd49c8344fc75ff9877eb7f2a1af6e9400f2c161792af860e41abb1'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3468',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=425,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=94959,
    end_offset=94962,
    text_slice='等语。',
    hash='sha256:ff844b1dd96842e1626f4d58932f22a117191c59fa71959d33caeda92b7df9ec'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3469',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=425,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=94962,
    end_offset=94980,
    text_slice='那时贾母正心神不定，在大堂廊下伫立。',
    hash='sha256:da36de880a8cdfc5ae70333eb9c5ab17b9e103f0972e4dd1f12403f0a640922a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3470',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=425,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=94980,
    end_offset=95012,
    text_slice='邢夫人、王夫人、尤氏、李纨、凤姐、迎春姊妹以及薛姨妈等皆在一处。',
    hash='sha256:3b7fb30298feae18fb84a6bd346f4b87f401c3837508e14633f7d7d62443fddb'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3471',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=425,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=95012,
    end_offset=95031,
    text_slice='听如此信至，贾母便唤进赖大来细问端的。',
    hash='sha256:231f1ac674eb33d97e02cce6d2d433b1b2dce13cdddcb73d24809a9c19e2fdb6'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3472',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=425,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=95036,
    end_offset=95135,
    text_slice='“小的们只在临敬门外伺候，里头的信息一概不能得知。后来还是夏太监出来道喜，说咱们家大小姐晋封为凤藻宫尚书，加封贤德妃。后来老爷出来亦如此吩咐小的。如今老爷又往东宫去了，速请老太太领着太太们去谢恩。”',
    hash='sha256:cdfcac0222f9caa22c4834416a2740fdddd2c6f32576d546aeab594f4926544b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3473',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=425,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=95135,
    end_offset=95157,
    text_slice='贾母等听了方心神安定，不免又都洋洋喜气盈腮。',
    hash='sha256:130c282fea9874337825818922f7174d3bdedfdbb57d78991f500d30778040ba'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3474',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=425,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=95157,
    end_offset=95167,
    text_slice='于是都按品大妆起来。',
    hash='sha256:ba4476179a5c3813860b31befeaf32b33271850a68903be5efd829c5745fe60d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3475',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=425,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=95167,
    end_offset=95191,
    text_slice='贾母带领邢夫人、王夫人、尤氏，一共四乘大轿入朝。',
    hash='sha256:aaff8cc785459bbf5253b11e7639816fb3f1dc9ce618021666ed891aff2e101a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3476',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=425,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=95191,
    end_offset=95218,
    text_slice='贾赦、贾珍亦换了朝服，带领贾蓉、贾蔷奉侍贾母大轿前往。',
    hash='sha256:350a64e4626e48c549c33073d3bb43c2fba19d24b4991290c00df840ba38517c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3477',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=425,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=95218,
    end_offset=95255,
    text_slice='于是宁、荣两处上下里外，莫不欣然踊跃，个个面上皆有得意之状，言笑鼎沸不绝。',
    hash='sha256:ebaa89305bf240560e663390c0619c0fc5366b7554c2a5ea5a8c72a0647f8863'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3478',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=426,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=95257,
    end_offset=95324,
    text_slice='谁知近日水月庵的智能私逃进城，找至秦钟家下看视秦钟，不意被秦业知觉，将智能逐出，将秦钟打了一顿，自己气得老病发作，三五日光景呜呼死了。',
    hash='sha256:18c3aa4ac153b0623194f2e310460e6fe52db3d0583d348de99f29bba8183699'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3479',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=426,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=95324,
    end_offset=95365,
    text_slice='秦钟本自怯弱，又值带病未愈受了笞杖，今见老父气死，此时悔痛无及，更又添了许多症候。',
    hash='sha256:c511ca82f39df40729eedcbb427a8ffae6844218cecf0581700b1f82f517e8bf'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3480',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=426,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=95365,
    end_offset=95378,
    text_slice='因此宝玉心中怅然如有所失。',
    hash='sha256:8d7720a81cee071651fbc6a29978f771821a846f29e08615431232f5448804b8'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3481',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=426,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=95378,
    end_offset=95395,
    text_slice='虽闻得元春晋封之事，亦未解得愁闷。',
    hash='sha256:9e2a526ec21831a4b789b4d61bdc0a80ce26cf6dbe46e172f4deedd0f39fa1c5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3482',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=426,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=95395,
    end_offset=95451,
    text_slice='贾母等如何谢恩，如何回家，亲朋如何来庆贺，宁、荣两处近日如何热闹，众人如何得意，独他一个皆视有如无，毫不曾介意。',
    hash='sha256:ba608a88b13849a4bdccdde40d1ff5c6cb23522eb05f157d9c7dbe1b79a33a3a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3483',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=426,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=95451,
    end_offset=95462,
    text_slice='因此众人嘲他越发呆了。',
    hash='sha256:dca41a22246e277bbfbf624c18da0a1464021a6efe95a3d8e865e652cccfe6f4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3484',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=427,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=95464,
    end_offset=95500,
    text_slice='且喜贾琏与黛玉回来，先遣人来报信，明日就可到家，宝玉听了，方略有些喜意。',
    hash='sha256:50f3252557608e333e2d75b99eaa50ff67ebcfd1dc2faa3d4575e479758ece74'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3485',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=427,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=95500,
    end_offset=95560,
    text_slice='细问原由，方知贾雨村亦进京陛见，皆由王子腾累上保本，此来后补京缺，与贾琏是同宗弟兄，又与黛玉有师从之谊，故同路作伴而来。',
    hash='sha256:9c3d7aa8e035039354004b1ddc70c734503631963578973755b71fa4527c6629'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3486',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=427,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=95560,
    end_offset=95582,
    text_slice='林如海已葬入祖坟了，诸事停妥，贾琏方进京的。',
    hash='sha256:824559d7c8700d48712d97e42baf99cc2822b9889679531a893b59ce99a1cf2c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3487',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=427,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=95582,
    end_offset=95612,
    text_slice='本该出月到家，因闻得元春喜信，遂昼夜兼程而进，一路俱各平安。',
    hash='sha256:69f6bd3a622d22ce8fa353a86991f97c8707a1cf6383da322ef2f02e43637e1d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3488',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=427,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=95612,
    end_offset=95635,
    text_slice='宝玉只问得黛玉“平安”二字，余者也就不在意了。',
    hash='sha256:59adc3c8da4affb85065fb8eaef2980b291b3c2aab5145adc5491283e492c5b0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3489',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=428,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=95637,
    end_offset=95650,
    text_slice='好容易盼至明日午错，果报：',
    hash='sha256:a2722afeed6fcb821237d3bce4eaf397d5e10ae41a0e37b353f91c3ae9d78a75'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3490',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=428,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=95650,
    end_offset=95663,
    text_slice='“琏二爷和林姑娘进府了。”',
    hash='sha256:42a56c598128c03705d4b1fb46ece35713793d48b0caa1c36cd1c774f5708432'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3491',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=428,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=95663,
    end_offset=95689,
    text_slice='见面时彼此悲喜交接，未免又大哭一阵，后又致喜庆之词。',
    hash='sha256:8103b9424f5b1bf9d1c8c4094c7e16c04ff327fa36a95f2b11331dc302acaa69'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3492',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=428,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=95689,
    end_offset=95707,
    text_slice='宝玉心中品度黛玉，越发出落得超逸了。',
    hash='sha256:c46e47e124d1f6e29594ec06022d8cd649d1e3054e2a130e4ceccd5fbc339f38'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3493',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=428,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=95707,
    end_offset=95730,
    text_slice='黛玉又带了许多书籍来，忙着打扫卧室，安插器具。',
    hash='sha256:81cc6eada8d26d921c4798358d00b31cb4c425034017932de523693c90fa3e7f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3494',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=428,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=95730,
    end_offset=95750,
    text_slice='又将些纸笔等物分送宝钗、迎春、宝玉等人。',
    hash='sha256:dabe325148d45b9ca190a99b8d00cf6ba939c1fe5d47e25516fd4de8b48e48ed'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3495',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=428,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=95750,
    end_offset=95774,
    text_slice='宝玉又将北静王所赠鹡鸰香串珍重取出来，转赠黛玉。',
    hash='sha256:eb879cfee12cd30752b222591e520a756ff37ff2fc225fe87c8e27d18a56f194'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3496',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=428,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=95778,
    end_offset=95794,
    text_slice='“什么臭男人拿过的！我不要它。”',
    hash='sha256:ff03d9ce6d399e808a922cbaf274dcbe129b8b75889cdd50bb08e06705ea5ad4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3497',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=428,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=95794,
    end_offset=95800,
    text_slice='遂掷而不取。',
    hash='sha256:8c0fea8b6289a4db8c1adaf65b6581caf481b10d78fe754808423e6d240dd7d6'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3498',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=428,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=95800,
    end_offset=95812,
    text_slice='宝玉只得收回，暂且无话。',
    hash='sha256:51e7e87ae2ed7f6b34332f4d63a62c1b53567d2e8f008779633bf6bbc2a3f8bc'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3499',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=429,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=95814,
    end_offset=95832,
    text_slice='且说贾琏自回家参见过众人，回至房中。',
    hash='sha256:e55285eeb6b75a46c074f3cd3e378c984cca21b38372e0a5144c67755cdbcc38'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3500',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=429,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=95877,
    end_offset=95938,
    text_slice='“国舅老爷大喜！国舅老爷一路风尘辛苦。小的听见昨日的头起报马来报，说今日大驾归府，略预备了一杯水酒掸尘，不知赐光谬领否？”',
    hash='sha256:8dd5beb6793f566ebeea6c32678c26d65e4e1843583ec7f123920e0c09ad3e10'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3501',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=429,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=95938,
    end_offset=95943,
    text_slice='贾琏笑道：',
    hash='sha256:e27d42adcc83dc0e15430659e3fdc8aeef13fa74d3f2ea945b5ee9604973b3b4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3502',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=429,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=95943,
    end_offset=95955,
    text_slice='“岂敢岂敢，多承多承。”',
    hash='sha256:d2c555b4cf2c54cf93b5fe3406995c5b8d141b986a71b59af41bd41008807e9f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3503',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=429,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=95955,
    end_offset=95970,
    text_slice='一面平儿与众丫鬟参拜毕，献茶。',
    hash='sha256:e7482318fe6cbe42350866685963b244f2564ad57e3edfe64fa37d22f9ae482e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3504',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=429,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=95970,
    end_offset=95990,
    text_slice='贾琏遂问别后家中的事，又谢凤姐操持劳碌。',
    hash='sha256:cfe94ce20d77845f34fe5a469bce82a00bfb970a030034b73ded1d8d6efba5c9'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3505',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=429,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=95994,
    end_offset=96410,
    text_slice='“我那里照管得这些事，见识又浅，口角又笨，心肠又直率，人家给个棒槌，我就认作针。脸又软，搁不住人给两句好话，心里就慈悲了。况且又没经历过大事，胆子又小，太太略有些不自在，就吓得我连觉也睡不着了。我苦辞了几回，太太又不容辞，倒反说我图受用，不肯习学了。殊不知我是捻着一把汗儿呢。一句也不敢多说，一步也不敢多走。你是知道的，咱们家所有的这些管家奶奶们，哪一位是好缠的？错一点儿她们就笑话打趣，偏一点儿她们就指桑说槐的报怨。‘坐山观虎斗’，‘借刀杀人’，‘引风吹火’，‘站干岸儿’，‘推倒油瓶不扶’，都是全挂子的武艺。况且我年纪轻，头等不压众，怨不得不放我在眼里。更可笑那府里忽然蓉儿媳妇死了，珍大哥又再三再四的在太太跟前跪着讨情，只要请我帮他几日；我是再四推辞，太太断不依，只得从命。依旧被我闹了个马仰人翻，更不成个体统，至今珍大哥哥还抱怨后悔呢。你这一来了，明儿你见了他，好歹描补描补，就说我年纪小，原没见过世面，谁叫大爷错委她的。”',
    hash='sha256:0b17b90e74855669c00b390aaa6a970974743891f6efc4805845a2172fd64b39'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3506',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=430,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=96412,
    end_offset=96430,
    text_slice='正说着，只听外间有人说话，凤姐便问：',
    hash='sha256:7ae198ebfad0343f7904c487dab2e35930ce58635c89dc4ce6d1cb395b1c7e87'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3507',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=430,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=96430,
    end_offset=96435,
    text_slice='“是谁？”',
    hash='sha256:82427267ca6af0bc5530458f0127b21951a3da01288fd5e7463cf1070246e245'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3508',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=430,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=96435,
    end_offset=96442,
    text_slice='平儿进来回道：',
    hash='sha256:3629baae213d3038070ca0ea9d2b9ad15ed8efa7d6043871997b7a688c7f28ad'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3509',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=430,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=96442,
    end_offset=96474,
    text_slice='“姨太太打发了香菱妹子来问我一句话，我已经说了，打发她回去了。”',
    hash='sha256:740a036eaca4be1d803ddaf3dad3cf162238fe87bb0a01b9c534557726eb3a22'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3510',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=430,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=96474,
    end_offset=96479,
    text_slice='贾琏笑道：',
    hash='sha256:e27d42adcc83dc0e15430659e3fdc8aeef13fa74d3f2ea945b5ee9604973b3b4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3511',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=430,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=96479,
    end_offset=96593,
    text_slice='“正是呢，方才我见姨妈去，不防和一个年轻的小媳妇子撞了个对面，生得好齐整模样。我疑惑咱家并无此人，说话时因问姨妈，谁知就是上京来买的那小丫头，名叫香菱的，竟与薛大傻子作了房里人，开了脸，越发出挑得标致了。那薛大傻子真玷辱了她。”',
    hash='sha256:21e513ec63053454173171fb972d70eeda095b2c6871ccec647044a5d40b24f5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3512',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=430,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=96593,
    end_offset=96597,
    text_slice='凤姐道：',
    hash='sha256:493b74ef604832e715c69f5c0a24d8d4a251e38e82e9ee38006f3f407dd315a5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3513',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=430,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=96597,
    end_offset=96796,
    text_slice='“嗳！往苏杭走了一趟回来，也该见些世面了，还是这么眼馋肚饱的。你要爱她，不值什么，我去拿平儿换了她来如何？那薛老大也是‘吃着碗里看着锅里’，这一年来的光景，他为要香菱不能到手，和姨妈打了多少饥荒。也因姨妈看着香菱模样儿好还是末则，其为人行事，却又比别的女孩子不同，温柔安静，差不多的主子姑娘也跟她不上呢。故此摆酒请客的费事，明堂正道的与他作了妾。过了没半月，也看得马棚风一般了，我倒心里可惜了的。”',
    hash='sha256:a0b1d288d77ea10db399c50cc1b50a4e824a85b32f3fc32d56dd8be48ff9d487'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3514',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=430,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=96796,
    end_offset=96808,
    text_slice='语未了，二门上小厮传报︰',
    hash='sha256:1c621bef0689d5192c2c4d175a870695189eff4ad9190f2e385f3ba7fd7195f7'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3515',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=430,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=96808,
    end_offset=96821,
    text_slice='“老爷在大书房等二爷呢。”',
    hash='sha256:51512f6e12a5a31724254be90f4bfc0dbbbbdb0aae01fa7142fb94680363ecd6'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3516',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=430,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=96821,
    end_offset=96833,
    text_slice='贾琏听了，忙忙整衣出去。',
    hash='sha256:8ad667810f63904128af62818d952da89029913871548ec7f48355169104fce7'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3517',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=431,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=96835,
    end_offset=96844,
    text_slice='这里凤姐乃问平儿：',
    hash='sha256:2721641d372d0a04d7ccd55ef6dc9a5ac534dfbd1c3b6e47e1c157d9cf6de163'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3518',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=431,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=96844,
    end_offset=96865,
    text_slice='“方才姨妈有什么事，巴巴的打发了香菱来？”',
    hash='sha256:17452406599a74201a7082792ec49bc582c147b1269091a36fb2185462dfeaea'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3519',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=431,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=96865,
    end_offset=96870,
    text_slice='平儿笑道：',
    hash='sha256:7b75729cdc845862717fbb1f1114e8902d0c2fdf3ff30b56ae6fc980d96a05bd'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3520',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=431,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=96870,
    end_offset=96907,
    text_slice='“哪里来的香菱，是我借她暂撒个谎。奶奶说说，旺儿嫂子越发连个承算也没了。”',
    hash='sha256:52fc0eed6d87f43f2a5bda6a05236d8a12046557e3436fa511009af9ad1655ca'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3521',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=431,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=96907,
    end_offset=96923,
    text_slice='说着，又走至凤姐身边，悄悄说道：',
    hash='sha256:0e3236ee2fe7c311552d9767c484da0f9c8d571d3e2544248d9a4ac73e2b3d3b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3522',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=431,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=96923,
    end_offset=97095,
    text_slice='“奶奶的那利钱银子，迟不送来，早不送来，这会子二爷在家，她却送这个来了。幸亏我在堂屋里撞见，不然时走了来回奶奶，二爷倘或问奶奶是什么利钱，奶奶自然不肯瞒二爷的，少不得照实告诉二爷。我们二爷那脾气，油锅里的钱还要找出来花呢，听见奶奶有了这个梯己，他还不放心的花了呢？所以我赶着接了过来，叫我说了她两句，谁知奶奶偏听见了问我，我就撒谎说香菱来了。”',
    hash='sha256:f9efeadf644f1b16450bd9f1056e67a3993a9675cc12a947d361953368bbbed3'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3523',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=431,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=97095,
    end_offset=97102,
    text_slice='凤姐听了笑道：',
    hash='sha256:3134f2b0f125efc05452546ca24de766549adf65d0232cf57192f3b11ffbaf95'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3524',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=431,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=97102,
    end_offset=97141,
    text_slice='“我说呢，姨妈知道你二爷来了，忽喇巴的反打发个房里人来了？原来你这蹄子肏鬼。”',
    hash='sha256:cb502ab7f890c8abafa724d25258e194c47f67260b53a89a7ed3545161dcd22a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3525',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=432,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=97143,
    end_offset=97168,
    text_slice='说话时，贾琏已进来，凤姐便命摆上酒馔来，夫妻对坐。',
    hash='sha256:ac34859d4f54b137c6c7be1d399d49bbb1d20ff40a98fbac57fed912ce278863'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3526',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=432,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=97168,
    end_offset=97186,
    text_slice='凤姐虽善饮，却不敢任性，只陪着贾琏。',
    hash='sha256:1ae5829e597b8f2f1a1f94913cc750b5254c07fe23cfeaf489ceb7e2f98abe55'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3527',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=432,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=97186,
    end_offset=97199,
    text_slice='一时贾琏的乳母赵嬷嬷走来。',
    hash='sha256:59f1dcceb7b411f118409d3d53f37ced2bb210362feb8f14ef3c3d587d5a6018'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3528',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=432,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=97199,
    end_offset=97226,
    text_slice='贾琏、凤姐忙让她一同吃酒，令其上炕去，赵嬷嬷执意不肯。',
    hash='sha256:d494bdfa76948b204cddcbfe49acd1b1667a33fb66815ad31deb984bddc8d094'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3529',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=432,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=97226,
    end_offset=97257,
    text_slice='平儿等早已炕沿下设下一杌子，又有一小脚踏，赵嬷嬷在脚踏上坐了。',
    hash='sha256:df27116290c1a3a831b16ebd286de29918d712daddc61f0dfaf4d4a7f2702c19'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3530',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=432,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=97257,
    end_offset=97276,
    text_slice='贾琏向桌上拣两盘肴馔与她放在杌上自吃。',
    hash='sha256:c4a9d5912c0e0bbff8cbbce7cd0ebd7f2a0b877ee5054a181fb42fb163f43b46'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3531',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=432,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=97281,
    end_offset=97301,
    text_slice='“妈妈很嚼不动那个，倒没的矼了她的牙。”',
    hash='sha256:3240dc496640554ee243fb0d7a4f5f76f6808431d46760c43b17d3c6aec50134'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3532',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=432,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=97301,
    end_offset=97307,
    text_slice='因向平儿道：',
    hash='sha256:f7c37983645d1aa16273f480370851e6f7a3bbbaf002364bd51d9f7999b65543'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3533',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=432,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=97307,
    end_offset=97346,
    text_slice='“早起我说那一碗火腿炖肘子很烂，正好给妈妈吃，你怎么不拿了去赶着叫她们热来？”',
    hash='sha256:4e983192d57f2a1101041582fd1dbed51e2a869d3da7f961a56abc37a27dd079'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3534',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=432,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=97346,
    end_offset=97349,
    text_slice='又道：',
    hash='sha256:5491b83a3188000d53513c419a2db2a41f48c64eb411b7b7150cf57bc71ebb48'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3535',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=432,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=97349,
    end_offset=97368,
    text_slice='“妈妈，你尝一尝你儿子带来的惠泉酒。”',
    hash='sha256:1c5bda063423b008c90bf4ad600c079829568c51a099eb02071a980d468abf1d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3536',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=432,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=97368,
    end_offset=97373,
    text_slice='赵嬷嬷道：',
    hash='sha256:3dd183a7bbb52e2992281b4578a3e43abb9954d1e5de37f002d91389fb94667c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3537',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=432,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=97373,
    end_offset=97586,
    text_slice='“我喝呢，奶奶也喝一钟，怕什么？只不要过多了就是了。我这会子跑了来，倒也不为酒饭，倒有一件正经事，奶奶好歹记在心里，疼顾我些罢。我们这爷，只是嘴里说得好，到了跟前就忘了我们。幸亏我从小儿奶了你这么大。我也老了，有的是那两个儿子，你就另眼照看他们些，别人也不敢呲牙儿的。我还再四的求了你几遍，你答应得倒好，到如今还是燥屎。这如今又从天上跑出这样一件大喜事来，哪里用不着人？所以倒是来求奶奶是正经，靠着我们爷，只怕我还饿死了呢。”',
    hash='sha256:d18a12c26e8a24c1cdf7359e97e35da222502720432b9f77ae33b03c5ef6b518'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3538',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=433,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=97588,
    end_offset=97593,
    text_slice='凤姐笑道：',
    hash='sha256:fa673815883516a89495f0598428fc17e5f85586cc72e1283fe4d69da7b1c484'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3539',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=433,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=97593,
    end_offset=97724,
    text_slice='“妈妈你放心，两个奶哥哥都交给我。你从小儿奶的，你还有什么不知他那脾气的？拿着皮肉倒往那不相干的外人身上贴。可是现放着奶哥哥，哪一个不比人强？你疼顾照看他们，谁敢说个‘不’字儿？没的白便宜了外人。――我这话也说错了，我们看着是‘外人’，你却看着‘内人’一样呢。”',
    hash='sha256:61b43bd1ce4c2cdf8887846488a4e69d0930020ccdddb9be6dd43a9a22690598'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3540',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=433,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=97724,
    end_offset=97734,
    text_slice='说得满屋里人都笑了。',
    hash='sha256:792a1d0f6be8f4eb40bcefee362103202072f6a18dafa65f19c26fe5443d3220'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3541',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=433,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=97748,
    end_offset=97803,
    text_slice='“可是屋子里跑出青天来了？若说‘内人’‘外人’这些混帐事，我们爷是没有，不过是脸软心慈，搁不住人求两句罢了。”',
    hash='sha256:a243d536739e312c2006c0802cc9d01bf11ebe3259703344c2b2941a90ddc189'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3542',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=433,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=97803,
    end_offset=97808,
    text_slice='凤姐笑道：',
    hash='sha256:fa673815883516a89495f0598428fc17e5f85586cc72e1283fe4d69da7b1c484'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3543',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=433,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=97808,
    end_offset=97843,
    text_slice='“可不是呢，有‘内人’求的他才慈软呢，他在咱们娘儿们跟前才是刚硬呢！”',
    hash='sha256:aad22c773bd585d1156d532211c315a13822aa7dde033ab1846d65ac2d0687f5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3544',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=433,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=97843,
    end_offset=97849,
    text_slice='赵嬷嬷笑道：',
    hash='sha256:e94ba60ea4429b7d35d7e90a2099a67033a3a13b6bcb8aa55db3acfca699a62c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3545',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=433,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=97849,
    end_offset=97889,
    text_slice='“奶奶说得太尽情了，我也乐了，再吃一杯好酒。从此我们奶奶做了主，我就没的愁了。”',
    hash='sha256:7c1504c67060611829b41357017384ebb02b50a79c5723538cf3e173677da8a5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3546',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=434,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=97891,
    end_offset=97917,
    text_slice='贾琏此时没好意思，只是讪笑吃酒，说‘胡说’二字，――',
    hash='sha256:20d4954dfc471277949fb5c8f5f15e9a9cf6b841d4229b2f407f54fe234eaa04'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3547',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=434,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=97917,
    end_offset=97941,
    text_slice='“快盛饭来吃碗子，还要往珍大爷那边去商议事呢。”',
    hash='sha256:ae5382fd0fe6212e48803a28db215e5909f86e26edb1186b13f499ee4ab1c832'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3548',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=434,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=97941,
    end_offset=97945,
    text_slice='凤姐道：',
    hash='sha256:493b74ef604832e715c69f5c0a24d8d4a251e38e82e9ee38006f3f407dd315a5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3549',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=434,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=97945,
    end_offset=97965,
    text_slice='“可是别误了正事。才刚老爷叫你说什么？”',
    hash='sha256:f0a4c69919e0c97c88fa377568c3eca709d409416aaed41664109995e495e2ff'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3550',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=434,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=97965,
    end_offset=97969,
    text_slice='贾琏道：',
    hash='sha256:8960f0f654b8daf4978e0e8688c00eaea34ad436f208df252cba62b6df913f7e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3551',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=434,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=97969,
    end_offset=97976,
    text_slice='“就为省亲。”',
    hash='sha256:6e42bac3a20876c2072dfa279a055efacbb0cc7de8419b29bd874dffc29a7edc'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3552',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=434,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=97976,
    end_offset=97982,
    text_slice='凤姐忙问道：',
    hash='sha256:25e0b9aa1840524837500c2c882f741408f42dc365130720756e26e338b7abb4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3553',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=434,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=97982,
    end_offset=97994,
    text_slice='“省亲的事竟准了不成？”',
    hash='sha256:04ed7be3058ee172a2a7c64cda97f8ec2e9c4b8c3df83e3011c67ad166629700'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3554',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=434,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=97994,
    end_offset=97999,
    text_slice='贾琏笑道：',
    hash='sha256:e27d42adcc83dc0e15430659e3fdc8aeef13fa74d3f2ea945b5ee9604973b3b4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3555',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=434,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=97999,
    end_offset=98014,
    text_slice='“虽不十分准，也有八分准了。”',
    hash='sha256:702201cfdb9ffe7e57ac85626b0bafe5f5a5ccee67b2d11d97fc01e4ee7524f0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3556',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=434,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=98014,
    end_offset=98019,
    text_slice='凤姐笑道：',
    hash='sha256:fa673815883516a89495f0598428fc17e5f85586cc72e1283fe4d69da7b1c484'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3557',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=434,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=98019,
    end_offset=98045,
    text_slice='“可见当今的隆恩。历来听书、看戏，古时从来未有的。”',
    hash='sha256:cff7f436c142ed278ed07dbdbe7024ad21a16d2d88c329d9a12b203d834bbb6a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3558',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=434,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=98045,
    end_offset=98053,
    text_slice='赵嬷嬷又接口道：',
    hash='sha256:72b3dc9ef925c45f415c18845d8192bdc679bbd91447287c75e3ff6fbdf2e0aa'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3559',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=434,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=98053,
    end_offset=98113,
    text_slice='“可是呢，我也老糊涂了。我听见上上下下吵嚷了这些日子，什么省亲不省亲，我也不理论它去；如今又说省亲，到底是怎么个原故？”',
    hash='sha256:69d9cc367fb89f2125378661088fda70d6f4c99a374962223d66c7e845f69409'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3560',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=434,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=98113,
    end_offset=98117,
    text_slice='贾琏道：',
    hash='sha256:8960f0f654b8daf4978e0e8688c00eaea34ad436f208df252cba62b6df913f7e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3561',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=434,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=98117,
    end_offset=98531,
    text_slice='“如今当今贴体万人之心，世上至大莫如‘孝’字，想来父母儿女之性，皆是一理，不是贵贱上分别的。当今自为日夜侍奉太上皇、皇太后，尚不能略尽孝意，因见宫里嫔妃才人等皆是入宫多年，以致拋离父母音容，岂有不思想之理？在儿女思想父母，是分所应当。想父母在家，若只管思念儿女，竟不能一见，倘因此成疾致病，甚至死亡，皆由朕躬禁锢，不能使其遂天伦之愿，亦大伤天和之事。故启奏太上皇、皇太后，每月逢二六日期，准其椒房眷属入宫请候看视。于是太上皇、皇太后大喜，深赞当今至孝纯仁，体天格物。因此二位老圣人又下旨意，说椒房眷属入宫，未免有国体仪制，母女尚不能惬怀。竟大开方便之恩，特降谕诸椒房贵戚，除二六日入宫之恩外，凡有重宇别院之家，可以驻跸关防之处，不妨启请内廷鸾舆入其私第，庶可略尽骨肉私情、天伦中之至性。此旨一下，谁不踊跃感戴！现今周贵人的父亲已在家里动了工了，修盖省亲别院呢。又有吴贵妃的父亲吴天佑家，也往城外踏看地方去了。这岂不有八九分了？”',
    hash='sha256:131d09d673c12acf28d4a8e1b14e3fbe3b6bc12db8a0317b4e16c8cc2bd8d8e6'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3562',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=435,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=98533,
    end_offset=98538,
    text_slice='赵嬷嬷道：',
    hash='sha256:3dd183a7bbb52e2992281b4578a3e43abb9954d1e5de37f002d91389fb94667c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3563',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=435,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=98538,
    end_offset=98569,
    text_slice='“阿弥陀佛！原来如此。这样说，咱们家也要预备接咱们大小姐了。”',
    hash='sha256:8d5ec435774cf511ada1ef07a3635c15bcddb1993a57e019a082ad51e53aec4d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3564',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=435,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=98569,
    end_offset=98573,
    text_slice='贾琏道：',
    hash='sha256:8960f0f654b8daf4978e0e8688c00eaea34ad436f208df252cba62b6df913f7e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3565',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=435,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=98573,
    end_offset=98593,
    text_slice='“这何用说呢！不然，这会子忙的是什么？”',
    hash='sha256:bd3c313a7544faef74e803eff451ffee6e31f9222e272d6d415b0c94f4f6942a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3566',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=435,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=98593,
    end_offset=98598,
    text_slice='凤姐笑道：',
    hash='sha256:fa673815883516a89495f0598428fc17e5f85586cc72e1283fe4d69da7b1c484'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3567',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=435,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=98598,
    end_offset=98680,
    text_slice='“若果如此，我可也见个大世面了。可恨我小几岁年纪，若早生二三十年，如今这些老人家也不薄我没见世面了。说起当年太祖皇帝仿舜巡的故事，比一部书还热闹，我偏没造化赶上。”',
    hash='sha256:4c83b6b8a89a88a712b9b01ae5b046a6edabb08238b197a16678d8d7ddf14083'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3568',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=435,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=98680,
    end_offset=98685,
    text_slice='赵嬷嬷道：',
    hash='sha256:3dd183a7bbb52e2992281b4578a3e43abb9954d1e5de37f002d91389fb94667c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3569',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=435,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=98685,
    end_offset=98760,
    text_slice='“嗳哟哟，那可是千载希逢的！那时候我才记事儿，咱们贾府正在姑苏扬州一带监造海舫，修理海塘，只预备接驾一次，把银子都花的淌海水似的！说起来......”',
    hash='sha256:42677e7b16417fe8da1326e84c435c3fef314cd4c2148b15585851e3b13e5aff'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3570',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=435,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=98760,
    end_offset=98766,
    text_slice='凤姐忙接道：',
    hash='sha256:0ad68abc85baa8e99589eea4a6a0b320de32137a391871486a26703e86efaf23'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3571',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=435,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=98766,
    end_offset=98832,
    text_slice='“我们王府也预备过一次。那时我爷爷单管各国进贡朝贺的事，凡有的外国人来，都是我们家养活。粤、闽、滇、浙所有的洋船货物都是我们家的。”',
    hash='sha256:5c7abe5901e423a7f65251099fddc56de283f88f7afe53beee7bb820a29ca84e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3572',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=436,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=98834,
    end_offset=98839,
    text_slice='赵嬷嬷道：',
    hash='sha256:3dd183a7bbb52e2992281b4578a3e43abb9954d1e5de37f002d91389fb94667c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3573',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=436,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=98839,
    end_offset=98980,
    text_slice='“那是谁不知道的？如今还有个口号儿呢，说‘东海少了白玉床，龙王来请江南王’，这说的就是奶奶府上了。还有如今现在江南的甄家，嗳哟哟，好势派！独他家接驾四次，若不是我们亲眼看见，告诉谁谁也不信的。别讲银子成了土泥，凭是世上所有的，没有不是堆山塞海的，‘罪过’‘可惜’四个字竟顾不得了。”',
    hash='sha256:96e6c5ab2676d2a32b6531b4a900d75e4977ac2d6f794b3bc31174ab95c709bb'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3574',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=436,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=98980,
    end_offset=98984,
    text_slice='凤姐道：',
    hash='sha256:493b74ef604832e715c69f5c0a24d8d4a251e38e82e9ee38006f3f407dd315a5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3575',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=436,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=98984,
    end_offset=99019,
    text_slice='“常听见我们太爷们也这样说，岂有不信的。只纳罕他家怎么就这么富贵呢？”',
    hash='sha256:6264a195d2ef93b65c3f094457bb8a5f7dac715fe4029e012950513294a130f0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3576',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=436,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=99019,
    end_offset=99024,
    text_slice='赵嬷嬷道：',
    hash='sha256:3dd183a7bbb52e2992281b4578a3e43abb9954d1e5de37f002d91389fb94667c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3577',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=436,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=99024,
    end_offset=99069,
    text_slice='“告诉奶奶一句话，也不过是拿着皇帝家的银子往皇帝身上使罢了！谁家有那些钱买这个虚热闹去？”',
    hash='sha256:5b65fe4903ec3d95619a7b83f4ee60c54c1d15c4ef26fd94cfd467038c8e6748'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3578',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=437,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=99071,
    end_offset=99094,
    text_slice='正说得热闹，王夫人又打发人来瞧凤姐吃了饭不曾。',
    hash='sha256:6509ad1466d7886c13528c8fd7cde562205181ec63285b94244d8216a79eea79'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3579',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=437,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=99094,
    end_offset=99117,
    text_slice='凤姐便知有事等她，忙忙的吃了半碗饭，漱口要走。',
    hash='sha256:41a34c88d753958d8918dde39800bd76ef0717983723ecf0c8d9b3b9c312b4e0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3580',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=437,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=99127,
    end_offset=99142,
    text_slice='“东府里蓉、蔷二位哥儿来了。”',
    hash='sha256:130d492a7ded618528d136153706fa0382d5b1c8a6686ec482650a15b092d791'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3581',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=437,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=99142,
    end_offset=99167,
    text_slice='贾琏才漱了口，平儿捧着盆盥手，见他二人来了，便问：',
    hash='sha256:9db598cfb8722e9be626531ca650881128ae81d783950d43c27480405e38c828'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3582',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=437,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=99167,
    end_offset=99176,
    text_slice='“什么话？快说。”',
    hash='sha256:f2091102e1e56b3dd61a3fa32172cc531ff1c407443a044b82b7bf405dabca58'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3583',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=437,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=99176,
    end_offset=99193,
    text_slice='凤姐且止步稍候，听他二人回些什么。',
    hash='sha256:f438d1fe13cb8fd426a8eb7c97ec15ae711f05b25b7df1ecaf64120109e0d2e8'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3584',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=437,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=99199,
    end_offset=99312,
    text_slice='“我父亲打发我来回叔叔：老爷们已经议定了，从东边一带，借着东府里的花园起，转至北边，一共丈量准了，三里半大，可以盖造省亲别院了。已经传人画图样去了，明日就得。叔叔才回家，未免劳乏，不用过我们那边去，有话明日一早再请过去面议。”',
    hash='sha256:b5ef2cbcca5045f0f72362b531d49d588c72e272b0d1266c113046248adb23e0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3585',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=437,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=99312,
    end_offset=99319,
    text_slice='贾琏笑着说道：',
    hash='sha256:5ab49262f954db56eb2aa123456309a231f9f7fab8ea48b0707afb0cbdfc67c4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3586',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=437,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=99319,
    end_offset=99428,
    text_slice='“多谢大爷费心体谅，我就从命不过去了。正经是这个主意才省事，盖得也容易；若采置别处地方去，那更费事，且倒不成体统。你回去说这样很好，若老爷们再要改时，全仗大爷谏阻，万不可另寻地方。明日一早，我给大爷请安去，再议细话。”',
    hash='sha256:c3bcc4df27120116720da7e1591d3d3bc71d9f5d6194d488bfd6502939679c69'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3587',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=437,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=99428,
    end_offset=99434,
    text_slice='贾蓉忙应几个',
    hash='sha256:6ec16818bfd1ead974ab9a6df1cbf4c6a8ad1c4b82b1d6fe412615ebbb0377c1'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3588',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=437,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=99434,
    end_offset=99437,
    text_slice='“是”',
    hash='sha256:090f2ef0ebb5d24d8be084e110276dd49b63d06614f8a3a608a389ef81728909'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3589',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=437,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=99437,
    end_offset=99438,
    text_slice='。',
    hash='sha256:eb0d5884569b398e475b89e77a068c6c575a0064ff6a72fafc173102c4cfcd57'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3590',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=438,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=99440,
    end_offset=99448,
    text_slice='贾蔷又近前回说：',
    hash='sha256:e4c846254841e5473624a06710d7f6ebaeaeebc2417d2e1f9e79b7efec41d375'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3591',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=438,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=99448,
    end_offset=99522,
    text_slice='“下姑苏聘请教习，采买女孩子，置办乐器、行头等事，大爷派了侄儿，带领着来管家两个儿子，还有单聘仁、卜固修两个清客相公，一同前往，所以命我来见叔叔。”',
    hash='sha256:7fc82f83cc4020eef41ffbf16a1ed2323e71dde1332129a9c19379885aac2cc8'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3592',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=438,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=99522,
    end_offset=99539,
    text_slice='贾琏听了，将贾蔷打量了打量，笑道：',
    hash='sha256:6286dbd9ce3b07661cce8aae8866118af2c9c2860a9072af0fc52341e9f937d2'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3593',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=438,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=99539,
    end_offset=99566,
    text_slice='“你能在这一行么？这个事虽不算甚大，里头大有藏掖的。”',
    hash='sha256:02e99c7368fde0d09057200dd19ea61294ddd396620ef545f5532e96987680cc'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3594',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=438,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=99566,
    end_offset=99571,
    text_slice='贾蔷笑道：',
    hash='sha256:a647960b04bba9344fb5ab472367ff432033e26a21d963f3929d720dc0f9a3ff'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3595',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=438,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=99571,
    end_offset=99582,
    text_slice='“只好学习着办罢了。”',
    hash='sha256:b292cdab587f8e39fec29a8cf2d229c731fc2e6ff52c7483a66030e5a984ddf5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3596',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=439,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=99584,
    end_offset=99609,
    text_slice='贾蓉在身旁灯影下悄拉凤姐的衣襟，凤姐会意，因笑道：',
    hash='sha256:87d1326e9f3cc34ee6abe3ee8d5ce5d924c128d7dcc3f15ca099b4e7f92f92ac'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3597',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=439,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=99609,
    end_offset=99715,
    text_slice='“你也太操心了，难道大爷比咱们还不会用人？偏你又怕他不在行了。谁都是在行的？孩子们已长得这么大了，‘没吃过猪肉，也看见过猪跑’。大爷派他去，原不过是个坐纛旗儿，难道认真的叫他去讲价钱、会经纪去呢！依我说就很好。”',
    hash='sha256:029c56a0cbf8379c4ed58da2d1aeaa00894053241c147179ecc5d29ed14c6b0c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3598',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=439,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=99715,
    end_offset=99719,
    text_slice='贾琏道：',
    hash='sha256:8960f0f654b8daf4978e0e8688c00eaea34ad436f208df252cba62b6df913f7e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3599',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=439,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=99719,
    end_offset=99744,
    text_slice='“自然是这样。并不是我驳回，少不得替他筹算筹算。”',
    hash='sha256:4588e6de30a8e1ccc76254c298e632aab8b4fae9ef1bea57869261e2a7c6ca49'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3600',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=439,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=99744,
    end_offset=99747,
    text_slice='因问：',
    hash='sha256:ccdcf4ca5b0d90eb25386587fe85c6337d5c5a7585863b57f89bca2423599a3a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3601',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=439,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=99747,
    end_offset=99760,
    text_slice='“这一项银子动那一处的？”',
    hash='sha256:27b0486490570775c148d90abfe7b4113a15dabd458e132f93620ae29b09673f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3602',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=439,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=99760,
    end_offset=99764,
    text_slice='贾蔷道：',
    hash='sha256:70dc3f0eaa00b2e4e698643352ba41131d76ce28754202caf42a223472a9dbb8'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3603',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=439,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=99764,
    end_offset=99847,
    text_slice='“才也议到这里。赖爷爷说，竟不用从京里带下去，江南甄家还收着我们五万银子。明日写一封书信会票我们带去，先支三万，下剩二万存着，等置办花烛、彩灯并各色帘栊帐幔的使费。”',
    hash='sha256:a293524b459b6d228b6343bfc06d929c7d1722782bc5b61a2eb08771f9f74d3f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3604',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=439,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=99847,
    end_offset=99853,
    text_slice='贾琏点头道：',
    hash='sha256:ffc2e2a84896d75c4d88b847a104912965897257846b97a5e2110575d498557f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3605',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=439,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=99853,
    end_offset=99861,
    text_slice='“这个主意好。”',
    hash='sha256:adf5611e7b3c7f919109f46515b549985f0db64f111d4ba05e6ba18a7a4af4ac'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3606',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=440,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=99863,
    end_offset=99871,
    text_slice='凤姐忙向贾蔷道：',
    hash='sha256:76bb0ac59801058c21e09f153d0c5dab14e1bcab55c1f727b686583197d61127'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3607',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=440,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=99871,
    end_offset=99903,
    text_slice='“既这样，我有两个在行妥当人，你就带他们去办，这个便宜了你呢。”',
    hash='sha256:0439a5596599a358d31da7ddb3c5ef6ccc62a64f88c3b349789c650aed8fb203'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3608',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=440,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=99903,
    end_offset=99910,
    text_slice='贾蔷忙陪笑说：',
    hash='sha256:e0fcb6922e2ca028fb3a3365a1102de61f545820e39fb250c7a706079cbe0e0e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3609',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=440,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=99910,
    end_offset=99928,
    text_slice='“正要和婶婶讨两个人呢，这可巧了。”',
    hash='sha256:703a03ad2ac284d95ddeb5270d67418cc9b3f7c596d14413ae59584c46aad5a8'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3610',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=440,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=99928,
    end_offset=99933,
    text_slice='因问名字。',
    hash='sha256:277c2720471a1b55c5f55be2d180db7547e4d30935e40aac2427d7be00aac27e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3611',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=440,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=99933,
    end_offset=99941,
    text_slice='凤姐便问赵嬷嬷。',
    hash='sha256:f04caad0a6266366eb99459ff7abe7e5b27dc1837b149fba4eb8e12acb2c2ba6'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3612',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=440,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=99969,
    end_offset=99985,
    text_slice='“一个叫赵天梁，一个叫赵天栋。”',
    hash='sha256:a54b83368e92fd4e0285427c3133b1a6a269c94a65e97875532a939e1c787972'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3613',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=440,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=99985,
    end_offset=99989,
    text_slice='凤姐道：',
    hash='sha256:493b74ef604832e715c69f5c0a24d8d4a251e38e82e9ee38006f3f407dd315a5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3614',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=440,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=99989,
    end_offset=100004,
    text_slice='“可别忘了，我可干我的去了。”',
    hash='sha256:c6ced171ce4814c6f96739fa70c6ee36ac164acb588bf558d85293533f7a15d5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3615',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=440,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=100004,
    end_offset=100011,
    text_slice='说着便出去了。',
    hash='sha256:69e284f90c7254e846f5335754edb17a37dc5ee39b30c576423e947188e23f30'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3616',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=440,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=100026,
    end_offset=100059,
    text_slice='“婶子要什么东西，吩咐我开个帐给蔷兄弟带了去，叫他按帐置办了来。”',
    hash='sha256:33202ce3515338bc28f58e0ca7cda7cfb39ba4732da301387554dd2b50e07fad'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3617',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=440,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=100059,
    end_offset=100064,
    text_slice='凤姐笑道：',
    hash='sha256:fa673815883516a89495f0598428fc17e5f85586cc72e1283fe4d69da7b1c484'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3618',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=440,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=100064,
    end_offset=100093,
    text_slice='“别放你娘的屁！我的东西还没处撂呢，希罕你们鬼鬼祟祟的？”',
    hash='sha256:2c856f51a03f058a6521183f9aa47c1abd92a5b25a92c2967cc3311f73af77f9'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3619',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=440,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=100093,
    end_offset=100100,
    text_slice='说着一径去了。',
    hash='sha256:c2f0672a7b522afa6b701d45d7471b613440fed92d45c50ccbd0dfcafd747a07'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3620',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=441,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=100102,
    end_offset=100112,
    text_slice='这里贾蔷也悄问贾琏：',
    hash='sha256:1299bf9b3c7cd041c4cd074c9d6df0512d5e24a38b3f0fc93300f936c4203c50'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3621',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=441,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=100112,
    end_offset=100129,
    text_slice='“要什么东西？顺便置来孝敬叔叔。”',
    hash='sha256:63b40202df509eac820481c83a5d4694e60b53bd7517b08008b521f525666444'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3622',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=441,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=100129,
    end_offset=100134,
    text_slice='贾琏笑道：',
    hash='sha256:e27d42adcc83dc0e15430659e3fdc8aeef13fa74d3f2ea945b5ee9604973b3b4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3623',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=441,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=100134,
    end_offset=100180,
    text_slice='“你别兴头。才学着办事，倒先学会了这把戏。我短了什么，少不得写信去告诉你，且不要论到这里。”',
    hash='sha256:9a22690488cf53ca0d6182f8e5d7117433da4596f61d1757d424c3df4f5ac73d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3624',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=441,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=100180,
    end_offset=100191,
    text_slice='说毕，打发他二人去了。',
    hash='sha256:a7bc689199e50e9373f403025cfa1f1b36b37e3f2f01cdd6614c8ff9c83f9deb'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3625',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=441,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=100191,
    end_offset=100231,
    text_slice='接着回事的人来，不止三四次，贾琏害乏，便传与二门上，一应不许传报，俱等明日料理。',
    hash='sha256:4788ed753f1f8d33350622dc468c7d14bf8e05f465d3a8be0ef0853ba020223d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3626',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=441,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=100231,
    end_offset=100249,
    text_slice='凤姐至三更时分方下来安歇，一宿无话。',
    hash='sha256:d61a76043141978639264ba133d5d39585533dceaf40eb75690ca79a967e4f30'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3627',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=442,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=100251,
    end_offset=100316,
    text_slice='次早贾琏起来，见过贾赦、贾政，便往宁府中来，合同老管事人等，并几位世交门下清客相公，审察两府地方，缮画省亲殿宇，一面参度办理人丁。',
    hash='sha256:5387eb8d1b80f3adb100a701ce7c7e611b6ce698037a6b595ef4248ea0f51b7a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3628',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=442,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=100316,
    end_offset=100353,
    text_slice='自此后，各行匠役齐集，金、银、铜、锡以及土、木、砖、瓦之物，搬运移送不歇。',
    hash='sha256:739c66534cda03bfaecb84a70f8e57f3d334d9611dcdaad72b0dc9428ebf03c9'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3629',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=442,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=100353,
    end_offset=100378,
    text_slice='先令匠人拆宁府会芳园墙垣楼阁，直接入荣府东大院中。',
    hash='sha256:99894cc52dc3df298d0f79209f5bc4e36b778b989c4540f2577f36be0ee6d912'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3630',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=442,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=100378,
    end_offset=100395,
    text_slice='荣府东边所有下人一带群房尽已拆去。',
    hash='sha256:07f6e3d00f2f61dd2073b227dc819e08d702e848c3e1d16a7700244f7e673df1'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3631',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=442,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=100395,
    end_offset=100433,
    text_slice='当日宁、荣二宅，虽有一小巷界断不通，然这小巷亦系私地，并非官道，故可以连属。',
    hash='sha256:165debcc9fbd891810674e3f559d966f53b6d9ec2332590dfd185934f98ad33b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3632',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=442,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=100433,
    end_offset=100457,
    text_slice='会芳园本是从北角墙下引来一股活水，今亦无烦再引。',
    hash='sha256:25a0922257ae08d1610f5a7e24ac73892451c46f48271d0458d98e6c59085e6b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3633',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=442,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=100457,
    end_offset=100500,
    text_slice='其山石树木虽不敷用，贾赦住的乃是荣府旧园，其中竹树山石以及亭榭栏杆等物，皆可挪就前来。',
    hash='sha256:20c3b77b3f18ef8b41a1bdc0aed2521d2549ad4a5067ed1978eea40484e2c2bd'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3634',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=442,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=100500,
    end_offset=100531,
    text_slice='如此两处又甚近，凑来一处，省得许多财力，纵亦不敷，所添亦有限。',
    hash='sha256:8e85ece46a0bca47a520b80dc112f1321c32ae431730001f26d3e5c477265883'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3635',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=442,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=100531,
    end_offset=100551,
    text_slice='全亏一个老明公号山子野者，一一筹画起造。',
    hash='sha256:ac91d7c0997b46192ebffe2f3181f3924e08421f721993368c7d376b30fc68a2'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3636',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=443,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=100553,
    end_offset=100600,
    text_slice='贾政不惯于俗务，只凭贾赦、贾珍、贾琏、赖大、来升、林之孝、吴新登、詹光、程日兴等几人安插摆布。',
    hash='sha256:14fa1e6816f402d81fd6acb179467d674deb095fde3549abc297d076a2fbddce'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3637',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=443,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=100600,
    end_offset=100631,
    text_slice='凡堆山凿池，起楼竖阁，种竹栽花，一应点景之事，又有山子野制度。',
    hash='sha256:6b21095d193c46097b66bb54f2231c9825cbb66bb2757f4450edb3947741a52b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3638',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=443,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=100631,
    end_offset=100661,
    text_slice='下朝闲暇，不过各处看望看望，最要紧处和贾赦等商议商议便罢了。',
    hash='sha256:33f4c1df5cde87f460d70eb3f3f1a1526a0543729f669220aa04dd92125687ca'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3639',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=443,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=100661,
    end_offset=100707,
    text_slice='贾赦只在家高卧，有芥豆之事，贾珍等或自去回明，或写略节；或有话说，便传呼贾琏、赖大等来领命。',
    hash='sha256:8fab89fd3b0e6b81d842f9454339df45ffcc5d9aee0f53f5c1802b4a8148d2f6'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3640',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=443,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=100707,
    end_offset=100718,
    text_slice='贾蓉单管打造金银器皿。',
    hash='sha256:8aaf5a07e364327c29afe3d2ea71bcccb7a5a5d8a29d091bf7aeddef2f6713b2'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3641',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=443,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=100718,
    end_offset=100729,
    text_slice='贾蔷已起身往姑苏去了。',
    hash='sha256:e0f27a9fdc405b0dab7e11518ec0514ab213b4ab0cc83060c81b019c3f72287c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3642',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=443,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=100729,
    end_offset=100768,
    text_slice='贾珍、赖大等又点人丁，开册籍，监工等事，一笔不能写到，不过是喧阗热闹非常而已。',
    hash='sha256:7f0e74c7125c314fa583dfec595ae0cdd8ea83be762ff9f3b83d3d9f145c9564'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3643',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=443,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=100768,
    end_offset=100773,
    text_slice='暂且无话。',
    hash='sha256:8fb4b4e941a1e7a2e4a0eaf78fe8c1893b4a4f7a90b354ce95d9d559804f1c0f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3644',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=444,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=100775,
    end_offset=100829,
    text_slice='且说宝玉近因家中有这等大事，贾政不来问他的书，心中是件畅事；无奈秦钟之病一日似重一日，也着实悬心，不能乐业。',
    hash='sha256:d22ee33eee2f3af291d0c00271802ece8837e7796b47678e95e631500856a1f9'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3645',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=444,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=100829,
    end_offset=100869,
    text_slice='这日一早起来，才梳洗完毕，意欲回了贾母去望候秦钟，忽见茗烟在二门照壁前探头缩脑。',
    hash='sha256:91ebe5254f0141a4dc1111ecb9aef6c8bc7faae3006a6ae4e7843a88de1564e0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3646',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=444,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=100869,
    end_offset=100880,
    text_slice='宝玉忙出来问他作什么。',
    hash='sha256:219634927bbf5772a03f67a2a4b570096cf3c6ba247a67530718a0fd015d4fbb'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3647',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=444,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=100884,
    end_offset=100894,
    text_slice='“秦相公不中用了！”',
    hash='sha256:560423ecf77c30434b0459de3c790220b8bc08eb826deac1c03227e5e1631983'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3648',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=444,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=100894,
    end_offset=100908,
    text_slice='宝玉听说，吓了一跳，忙问道：',
    hash='sha256:f0bb93d9512fe5c4c986a58fd35ed15773b4eb2c3c3f1fe86cac87bf0a7f5db2'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3649',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=444,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=100908,
    end_offset=100935,
    text_slice='“我昨儿才瞧了他来了，还明明白白的，怎么就不中用了？”',
    hash='sha256:9a51e69afccd2c7d9a4265c7024e9d5483f9f5760409de70a08e09ac27c8a404'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3650',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=444,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=100935,
    end_offset=100939,
    text_slice='茗烟道：',
    hash='sha256:57e347c4ce8ed3f0095c65c5bfd8f29593e266d21ae9a59c7e4ca7ce51b96dbe'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3651',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=444,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=100939,
    end_offset=100963,
    text_slice='“我也不知道，才刚是他家的老头子特来告诉我的。”',
    hash='sha256:d0a3e4fc3323406df0988a1977d145f5bb747add6abe82aac973ee57f0b25db5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3652',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=444,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=100963,
    end_offset=100976,
    text_slice='宝玉听了，忙转身回明贾母。',
    hash='sha256:707112d9355831cddc952b62e4f29a9e1f5c209e0cd26540dc381c2b6c08139f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3653',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=444,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=100981,
    end_offset=101013,
    text_slice='“好生派妥当人跟去，到那里尽一尽同窗之情就回来，不许多耽搁了。”',
    hash='sha256:3623836156b32907bd73f89f1ef9da8a2538ef80a64230fc239dcfaaf98d3149'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3654',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=444,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=101013,
    end_offset=101038,
    text_slice='宝玉听了，忙忙的更衣出来，车犹未备，急得满厅乱转。',
    hash='sha256:a2fcaa03c77f8ec18ff41241ec1ef324c3730f4cdccb19fe26f7f76bc6c1f764'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3655',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=444,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=101038,
    end_offset=101060,
    text_slice='一时催促得车到，忙上了车，李贵、茗烟等跟随。',
    hash='sha256:71d37678e7139a330ce621967b74c1407c60e78f8841855fe1cf65b2b9c2d585'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3656',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=444,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=101060,
    end_offset=101101,
    text_slice='来至秦钟门首，悄无一人，遂蜂拥至内室，唬得秦钟的两个远房婶子并几个弟兄都藏之不迭。',
    hash='sha256:7b65ab9d833c68d9a87bf4d749827f2fc8181082a55e0da782b7f362334ec214'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3657',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=445,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=101103,
    end_offset=101125,
    text_slice='此时，秦钟已发过两三次昏了，移床易箦多时矣。',
    hash='sha256:4a6f7fc53f51a60a10c92ef0867852ffa540bb02a1942eaad4d01a2408f1f021'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3658',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=445,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=101125,
    end_offset=101136,
    text_slice='宝玉一见，便不禁失声。',
    hash='sha256:9e8cbf99575bd441307d0c43d056ed65f80ce5a6647ce710e2043a2cbe3b9c82'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3659',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=445,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=101142,
    end_offset=101195,
    text_slice='“不可，不可！秦相公是弱症，未免炕上挺扛的骨头不受用，所以暂且挪下来松散些。哥儿如此，岂不反添了他的病？”',
    hash='sha256:ff3770f822af212398d51c2e671e3b3efe1c020a39edf79929a2fc30d7fd19cc'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3660',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=445,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=101195,
    end_offset=101222,
    text_slice='宝玉听了，方忍住近前，见秦钟面如白蜡，合目呼吸于枕上。',
    hash='sha256:9fe8286ede7f119e31f41c785e7828137813d3486d787f631ee54be88dc4f9fc'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3661',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=445,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=101227,
    end_offset=101237,
    text_slice='“鲸兄！宝玉来了。”',
    hash='sha256:4c9a51b58dbaa2ce4e228203e44f32bc4f0d8b1fa1228b27734c7bf0b8aa99a6'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3662',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=445,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=101237,
    end_offset=101248,
    text_slice='连叫两三声，秦钟不睬。',
    hash='sha256:66e1a237dd8d160db133970af88c251aec5486b28b5f9f8088a3e00cd2651831'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3663',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=445,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=101253,
    end_offset=101260,
    text_slice='“宝玉来了！”',
    hash='sha256:e7ae6e65babe7680c967be4b30b714e896f8b2a13994dd1af406b4be3453d860'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3664',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=446,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=101262,
    end_offset=101298,
    text_slice='那秦钟早已魂魄离身，只剩得一口悠悠余气在胸，正见许多鬼判持牌提索来捉他。',
    hash='sha256:0e324de3a8216505bf9da258ea5dad44badb1fb6e31e239dffbc93bfda542d1d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3665',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=446,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=101298,
    end_offset=101361,
    text_slice='那秦钟魂魄哪里肯就去，又记念着家中无人掌管家务，又记挂着父亲还有留积下的三四千两银子，又记挂着智能尚无下落，因此百般求告鬼判。',
    hash='sha256:bce44cd8fcac0423e63305687946c682d4a2307ca2e5318159b5727522163101'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3666',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=446,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=101361,
    end_offset=101416,
    text_slice='无奈这些鬼判都不肯徇私，反叱咤秦钟道：“亏你还是读过书的人，岂不知俗语说的：‘阎王叫你三更死，谁敢留人到五更！',
    hash='sha256:3c56dc91613e719ef564be0254f11e5386977b76f3e11b308145f279d7b4738c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3667',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=446,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=101416,
    end_offset=101450,
    text_slice='’我们阴间上下都是铁面无私的，不比你们阳间瞻情顾意，有许多的关碍处。',
    hash='sha256:eadb9a8e9b000cf6f8193d6d20085be38f28ae7cb51c06abdb1f3ce8c6cc8d1f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3668',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=447,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=101453,
    end_offset=101466,
    text_slice='正闹着，那秦钟的魂魄忽听见',
    hash='sha256:a9eeaee4755aaab4b1b5caf54e4521a7e857021b905879458cbed27d081dab21'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3669',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=447,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=101466,
    end_offset=101472,
    text_slice='“宝玉来了”',
    hash='sha256:9bf6d14f1b6eb1784adcc5f9bde28bf1c4d23b03e3162aa1a33789d4e2f9c1f2'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3670',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=447,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=101472,
    end_offset=101482,
    text_slice='四字，便忙又央求道：',
    hash='sha256:5369ec032f5f1f668288e173bc485037b81d98758e813cabd654e8e42a45ed50'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3671',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=447,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=101482,
    end_offset=101514,
    text_slice='“列位神差，略发慈悲，让我回去，和这一个好朋友说一句话就来的。”',
    hash='sha256:b89bdccfc56f7e895aed1324105b9419638dc553611c2f907fa1b2cebddc0478'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3672',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=447,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=101514,
    end_offset=101518,
    text_slice='众鬼道：',
    hash='sha256:a4033b30ffead7da6a841dd571c33e74254e04b8b058c83ed31e41efd4bb97d5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3673',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=447,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=101518,
    end_offset=101528,
    text_slice='“又是什么好朋友？”',
    hash='sha256:f06d3ec8c4bc4256231537a89de926d4a410478c96cc57cd34d9fbec5d927ce2'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3674',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=447,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=101528,
    end_offset=101532,
    text_slice='秦钟道：',
    hash='sha256:7e59c5d0c87325ba39546d2dcfc86c1a4ea44c4766d6ad10ef8c65d3b5f1589e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3675',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=447,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=101532,
    end_offset=101554,
    text_slice='“不瞒列位，就是荣国公的孙子，小名宝玉的。”',
    hash='sha256:c68b2df071c462b21ec49866395b8110deee4c94727b38cb4e5c0f48da3c2698'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3676',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=447,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=101554,
    end_offset=101574,
    text_slice='都判官听了，先就唬慌起来，忙喝骂鬼使道：',
    hash='sha256:c4c6fdcdc39299afa7c89ec0fce28fffda0f4d74e7aaa929929e47cac8e2f3d7'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3677',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=447,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=101574,
    end_offset=101615,
    text_slice='“我说你们放了他去走走罢，你们断不依我的话，如今只等他请出个运旺时盛的人来才罢。”',
    hash='sha256:eb4f764e13ac5dcd53d985496c8e12bf1172f510d7eab712bf4904ef1ea5ce9e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3678',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=447,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=101615,
    end_offset=101637,
    text_slice='众鬼见都判如此，也都忙了手脚，一面又抱怨道：',
    hash='sha256:26ce4dfd0838176afe434370ab58795353427a7e4ee767688941a74a6decb5eb'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3679',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=447,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=101637,
    end_offset=101691,
    text_slice='“你老人家先是那等雷霆电雹，原来见不得‘宝玉’二字。依我们愚见，他是阳间，我们是阴间，怕他们也无益于我们。”',
    hash='sha256:4735ebbaa65ccf4c40a4232c08a632ce5659f8c68b375f41c3cd54019a7c3a71'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3680',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=447,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=101691,
    end_offset=101695,
    text_slice='都判道：',
    hash='sha256:853be98fb8fca42d62acbfe1402d64066f6350434ca521c5f94d157665e1534d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3681',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=447,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=101695,
    end_offset=101741,
    text_slice='“放屁！俗语说得好，‘天下官管天下事’，阴阳并无二理。别管他阴也罢，阳也罢，敬着没错了的。”',
    hash='sha256:3fc946959aff328c1a4569d8e538d03208969bb0a6144e76f379b0cf3991ce9d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3682',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=447,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=101741,
    end_offset=101754,
    text_slice='众鬼听说，只得将秦魂放回。',
    hash='sha256:02a88827ef4dbaf479f6b7b6eb3f8a3647cda2fdc8c3b4a2b4373f7eedc49e90'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3683',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=447,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=101776,
    end_offset=101795,
    text_slice='“怎么不肯早来？再迟一步也不能见了。”',
    hash='sha256:aaf83dad49ea016df695825aac72e571f1c8b34bbd90513be7629f058249e8cf'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3684',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=447,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=101795,
    end_offset=101804,
    text_slice='宝玉忙携手垂泪道：',
    hash='sha256:103f28457d646b13cc0ed556fcd22c481bbe646f85e2ad51b75b3e8610341c94'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3685',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=447,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=101804,
    end_offset=101816,
    text_slice='“有什么话，留下两句。”',
    hash='sha256:6bc8c38f42d65cfea69a96b8b859f2ff763731052f5824b19e8f337404bb8e1b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3686',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=447,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=101816,
    end_offset=101820,
    text_slice='秦钟道︰',
    hash='sha256:7d8aa5b13d727ce7b24943ee7877ddeb22cbf8f913ac5f968c7ff364dad7a6be'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3687',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=447,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=101820,
    end_offset=101866,
    text_slice='“并无别话，以前你我见识自为高过世人，我今日才知自误了。以后还该立志功名，以荣耀显达为是。”',
    hash='sha256:8613f9493b5cc568162ba451a1a43be7d7eb77fb9b6d5d0f005d169c639971cc'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3688',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=447,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=101866,
    end_offset=101881,
    text_slice='说毕，便长叹一声，萧然长逝了。',
    hash='sha256:855f92b0cf4a4ea5286aae7106f93e25be614052dbce0682684fefd3739b21e5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3689',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=447,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=101881,
    end_offset=101886,
    text_slice='下回分解。',
    hash='sha256:f6a36c99f925315bbbda3441dac4fb92a6536ff07635fa37b0ebeb75516538c8'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3690',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=448,
    segment_type='heading',
    start_offset=101888,
    end_offset=101911,
    text_slice='第十七回  大观园试才题对额\u3000怡红院迷路探曲折',
    hash='sha256:95c736e4a1cd6107c6c399ce81718f107344f83c08d430097e0ec9aa5f2e77a8'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3691',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=449,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=101913,
    end_offset=101928,
    text_slice='诗曰：豪华虽足羡，离别却难堪。',
    hash='sha256:1f3c9e9b14a5e9e08044756a916f90d00810681a9580ac6d516a10baaa27d71c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3692',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=449,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=101928,
    end_offset=101940,
    text_slice='博得虚名在，谁人识苦甘？',
    hash='sha256:dc687bc082b50987411ac15a23c5069d003595cde6e04ac849c5a75b7a8b3d60'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3693',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=450,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=101942,
    end_offset=101978,
    text_slice='话说秦钟既死，宝玉痛哭不已，李贵等好容易劝解半日方住，归时犹是凄恻哀痛。',
    hash='sha256:d26e14c583d4ccf7006490719d766c21c54408c3ea1de4cb455346b0c12f2da4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3694',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=450,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=101978,
    end_offset=102001,
    text_slice='贾母帮了几十两银子，外又另备奠仪，宝玉去吊纸。',
    hash='sha256:d52193f465b0c82df504982f45d73622dba94f84dfeab9838727658df692c889'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3695',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=450,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=102001,
    end_offset=102017,
    text_slice='七日后，便送殡掩埋了，别无述记。',
    hash='sha256:86d4f490de60919202a4f2f21b76443894f1d2df0ffe64d418c08d195d7835ab'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3696',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=450,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=102017,
    end_offset=102036,
    text_slice='只有宝玉日日思慕感悼，然亦无可如何了。',
    hash='sha256:fc35028573bdc7728c05c1e6092a9eceead3c99e43f32cc630fa240912dbed78'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3697',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=451,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=102038,
    end_offset=102056,
    text_slice='又不知历几何时，这日贾珍等来回贾政：',
    hash='sha256:8774b43fb31da10f7254f4ca26d633118d067c4c0a6c91e8d4b144a7ccddec07'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3698',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=451,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=102056,
    end_offset=102101,
    text_slice='“园内工程俱已告竣，大老爷已瞧过了，只等老爷瞧了，或有不妥之处，再行改造，好题匾额对联。”',
    hash='sha256:465f4b1bdf64f9268b49f8468e9648081c1d3680f701faa6b088107d7a6bea87'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3699',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=451,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=102101,
    end_offset=102114,
    text_slice='贾政听了，沉思一回，说道：',
    hash='sha256:f5bbb6100ee0985ee7b4f7d7c50fdbc085856b3fc23c5c60986c31a16ff33f45'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3700',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=451,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=102114,
    end_offset=102207,
    text_slice='“这匾额对联倒是一件难事。论理该请贵妃赐题才是，然贵妃若不亲睹其景，大约亦必不肯妄拟；若直待贵妃游幸过再请题，偌大景致，若干亭榭，无一字标题，也觉寥落无趣，任有花柳山水，也断不能生色。”',
    hash='sha256:094662c8d3f56056aadabdf6a0f21bfa9b3a39b34b2d751c034c977ec65a3416'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3701',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=451,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=102207,
    end_offset=102216,
    text_slice='众清客在旁笑答道：',
    hash='sha256:a16754eaf63218325df5be3b4007e8e1296644237a7997da3a135abbbf31fae1'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3702',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=451,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=102216,
    end_offset=102307,
    text_slice='“老世翁所见极是。如今我们有个愚见：各处匾额对联断不可少，亦断不可定名。如今且按其景致，或两字、三字、四字，虚合其意，拟了出来，暂且做灯匾联悬了。待贵妃游幸时，再请定名，岂不两全？”',
    hash='sha256:588a5c5c8ba5141d004273b1b952909f0ecfa11cdcad21eee2ef18fa4f6751cb'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3703',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=451,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=102307,
    end_offset=102315,
    text_slice='贾政听了，笑道：',
    hash='sha256:9641e80aad21d13ec6e1bc8ca68aac13fe05a45dcac34f1466976d59d971fd19'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3704',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=451,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=102315,
    end_offset=102358,
    text_slice='“所见不差。我们今日且看看去，只管题了，若妥当便用；不妥当时，将雨村请来，令他再拟。”',
    hash='sha256:64649016fe5a6ac5b621b610ee3677c140ba3287e06328dd00cf149ee6ec8830'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3705',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=451,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=102358,
    end_offset=102364,
    text_slice='众清客笑道：',
    hash='sha256:466ee3c595b5614a78982d10e8d9b5d4db014da39178141bf0fef846e4fd02f8'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3706',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=451,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=102364,
    end_offset=102382,
    text_slice='“老爷今日一拟定佳，何必又待雨村。”',
    hash='sha256:e0b76340acfcb2781ae22bd5f699a141fb057727867b01dd4769a7d283e468d5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3707',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=451,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=102382,
    end_offset=102387,
    text_slice='贾政笑道：',
    hash='sha256:c4e4801082157c7d737f1da99569399a3c2fa3dccb4bb75b4cca27092f01c1c6'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3708',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=451,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=102387,
    end_offset=102470,
    text_slice='“你们不知，我自幼于花鸟山水题咏上就平平；如今上了年纪，且案牍劳烦，于这怡情悦性文章上更生疏了。纵拟了出来，不免迂腐古板，反不能使花柳园亭生色。似不妥协，反没意思。”',
    hash='sha256:7a5040d7b8521f71d02bb4606cc09ba7b3d44b03a0b0b0e3fa628503a8f3224d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3709',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=451,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=102470,
    end_offset=102476,
    text_slice='众清客笑道：',
    hash='sha256:466ee3c595b5614a78982d10e8d9b5d4db014da39178141bf0fef846e4fd02f8'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3710',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=451,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=102476,
    end_offset=102512,
    text_slice='“这也无妨。我们大家看了公拟，各举其长，优则存之，劣则删之，未为不可。”',
    hash='sha256:530e28cc611093d30904c9ce5adc5d01a1e01b0015c1743570354b8b2aff9ba4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3711',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=451,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=102512,
    end_offset=102516,
    text_slice='贾政道：',
    hash='sha256:f33ef81bd4e7b413fce0b129e8c20ed9a8efdaf9e259c0802cebe3592ab015c1'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3712',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=451,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=102516,
    end_offset=102538,
    text_slice='“此论极是。且喜今日天气和暖，大家去逛逛。”',
    hash='sha256:4f601f490032d585960e4f9956f67024eef6a6e7e9a6e633a4eac4c01745fb3d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3713',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=451,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=102538,
    end_offset=102549,
    text_slice='说着起身，引众人前往。',
    hash='sha256:2d72b6469f7de986f1f5eea141532aa3fa8ff7a0aea0ab0a22115e04f8db7de4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3714',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=452,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=102551,
    end_offset=102562,
    text_slice='贾珍先去园中知会众人。',
    hash='sha256:887181819df946992ba3637c745ef1bb825720d2011ff573ff8aead9b2f1e62e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3715',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=452,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=102562,
    end_offset=102594,
    text_slice='可巧近日宝玉因思念秦钟，忧戚不尽，贾母常命人带他到新园中来戏耍。',
    hash='sha256:533ee9a06ffce1902461fec200356b02e260279b2822073f5014f7d3699e6016'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3716',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=452,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=102594,
    end_offset=102620,
    text_slice='此时亦才进来，忽见贾珍走来，向他笑道：“你还不出去？',
    hash='sha256:147e2aa0c0be54d64a792e3130f1298aef5c08c7cedfa31048e342b5ff5b04c6'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3717',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=452,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=102620,
    end_offset=102626,
    text_slice='老爷就来了。',
    hash='sha256:348bcd590ef3f53f3ba5e55e3723ec11478eda8d0a540455428a19fac137131e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3718',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=452,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=102626,
    end_offset=102649,
    text_slice='”宝玉听了，带着奶娘、小厮们，一溜烟就出园来。',
    hash='sha256:1bebf94c1bbbf697264cf4b5ec3ed23dbdd76c168ade4171162b4c5d4aab3395'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3719',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=452,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=102649,
    end_offset=102678,
    text_slice='方转过弯，顶头贾政引着众清客来了，躲之不及，只得一边站了。',
    hash='sha256:124281cc68aa958dee31cc60a9ffcc96626b835e4acef63c7f773a08f2f1f785'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3720',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=452,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=102678,
    end_offset=102728,
    text_slice='贾政近因闻得塾掌称赞宝玉专能对对联，虽不喜读书，偏倒有些歪才情似的，今日偶然撞见这机会，便命他跟来。',
    hash='sha256:cb6a12ffa3c4f42f08d88fe63cd9cf4960399db392fa051894fc016ac6fe56ff'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3721',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=452,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=102728,
    end_offset=102741,
    text_slice='宝玉只得随往，尚不知何意。',
    hash='sha256:37c12ef6dce0afcc34711d92f7ad2ae834dece6dcc4872ce918b143af844484f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3722',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=453,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=102743,
    end_offset=102769,
    text_slice='贾政刚至园门前，只见贾珍带领许多执事人来，一旁侍立。',
    hash='sha256:434c6aab3bed920f67b617b9d5800f3c33c3d89c1c27474a11468f1571a6e7c8'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3723',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=453,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=102773,
    end_offset=102795,
    text_slice='“你且把园门都关上，我们先瞧了外面再进去。”',
    hash='sha256:875ab1f9355f2d68a200cbb2f51a10522f24298e74e396c283c7b2fd9252261a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3724',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=453,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=102795,
    end_offset=102807,
    text_slice='贾珍听说，命人将门关了。',
    hash='sha256:c425131ffd0a0080bd2f3b227ed84f8057b2932155cd404f54eb1d595b35e931'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3725',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=453,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=102807,
    end_offset=102815,
    text_slice='贾政先秉正看门。',
    hash='sha256:89ca13a9b3a8085bc6327353e963e55d623076b8d5db3fad708d75abc2479f10'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3726',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=453,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=102815,
    end_offset=102874,
    text_slice='只见正门五间，上面桶瓦泥鳅脊，那门栏窗槅，皆是细雕新鲜花样，并无朱粉涂饰；一色水磨群墙，下面白石台矶，凿成西番草花样。',
    hash='sha256:e78d1a284742eafd3312e7a471c92ad7164640e7a4b6f39731c6662d1d475c0f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3727',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=453,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=102874,
    end_offset=102910,
    text_slice='左右一望，皆雪白粉墙，下面虎皮石，随势砌去，果然不落富丽俗套，自是喜欢。',
    hash='sha256:f6b4c7856bdd5220bf7ff4b1e3bb4f18584e28a6fd601f8764ff3cc83dd1b3b0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3728',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=453,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=102910,
    end_offset=102928,
    text_slice='遂命开门，只见迎面一带翠嶂挡在前面。',
    hash='sha256:0297ee7cbc0ad6ee76377bcbce5bd59b4e42a4f3141c3ba0597709ef06179e52'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3729',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=453,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=102934,
    end_offset=102942,
    text_slice='“好山，好山！”',
    hash='sha256:fa7e6075c53f34a8911a7b36c07b987a5785ab9671ef46d41594fd807077d848'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3730',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=453,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=102942,
    end_offset=102946,
    text_slice='贾政道：',
    hash='sha256:f33ef81bd4e7b413fce0b129e8c20ed9a8efdaf9e259c0802cebe3592ab015c1'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3731',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=453,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=102946,
    end_offset=102973,
    text_slice='“非此一山，一进来，园中所有之景悉入目中，则有何趣？”',
    hash='sha256:a2bf1969aa3aea57e5b1ab998bd2001143e6bd47c6d0eb991f7c2f7ed81ea4d2'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3732',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=453,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=102973,
    end_offset=102977,
    text_slice='众人道：',
    hash='sha256:9b7cfd35ec4e9995a55f0eb346ea28e5b8f08093983501e273ddcf11c98f91e8'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3733',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=453,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=102977,
    end_offset=102995,
    text_slice='“极是。非胸中大有邱壑，焉想及此。”',
    hash='sha256:3a6a0dcd928771f7de12e1b4386cc0c1c6d71b9b80b78043cf5896d9c3704eff'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3734',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=453,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=102995,
    end_offset=103045,
    text_slice='说着，往前一望，见白石峻嶒，或如鬼怪，或如猛兽，纵横拱立；上面苔藓成斑，藤萝掩映，其中微露羊肠小径。',
    hash='sha256:30b19f68aa666f1a45b9f9c5de8de2250cf0a7748db932928576ed801a844481'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3735',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=453,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=103049,
    end_offset=103075,
    text_slice='“我们就从此小径游去，回来由那一边出去，方可遍览。”',
    hash='sha256:70d127a255729996f87ad6cbbafb2147205deca8bf6413bc21ad6cace5c75df0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3736',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=454,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=103077,
    end_offset=103102,
    text_slice='说毕，命贾珍在前引导，自己扶了宝玉，逶迤进入山口。',
    hash='sha256:3077b5fac38f1b2ad1142c39115e9edc118d83ffef0d31ec98eb47c630d1b403'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3737',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=454,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=103102,
    end_offset=103124,
    text_slice='抬头忽见山上有镜面白石一块，正是迎面留题处。',
    hash='sha256:95968a54706a01301218faf35377ffd9a4a5e4afff5b1c4859391f3fbd4b2859'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3738',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=454,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=103131,
    end_offset=103147,
    text_slice='“诸公请看，此处题以何名方妙？”',
    hash='sha256:9634582a7ef0f3d9f4ef9544cf3999a813bf7cc08abc7d8bbe10d0a2cb208c13'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3739',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=454,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=103147,
    end_offset=103157,
    text_slice='众人听说，也有说该题',
    hash='sha256:055554d4083f2cf86c47eb3a8c203daa0b98fbbe61ba66124090dcc609478f97'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3740',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=454,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=103157,
    end_offset=103161,
    text_slice='“叠翠”',
    hash='sha256:b5dd5cc8e58446d4c7a3bb245f36dd0fc310d320c88e237ab984b14b3030a277'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3741',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=454,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=103161,
    end_offset=103169,
    text_slice='二字，也有说该提',
    hash='sha256:a56a79bf213d9cc4579e694c64c82e7a82fd640bc5cbef059105d7964989d163'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3742',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=454,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=103169,
    end_offset=103173,
    text_slice='“锦嶂”',
    hash='sha256:05450587cc4abdda319f1a133d0cf7323b6d2fda0af4c250dda0f554149ab895'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3743',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=454,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=103173,
    end_offset=103178,
    text_slice='的，又有说',
    hash='sha256:6adae6163358e11b59d62f6eaa34929dc4fdf91c7dd749838bdac8bd73067b96'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3744',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=454,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=103178,
    end_offset=103183,
    text_slice='“赛香炉”',
    hash='sha256:0e95bed3055ea63f8d285de1f4e27cd1b28419dda80017e021641e84b555584a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3745',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=454,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=103183,
    end_offset=103188,
    text_slice='的，又有说',
    hash='sha256:6adae6163358e11b59d62f6eaa34929dc4fdf91c7dd749838bdac8bd73067b96'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3746',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=454,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=103188,
    end_offset=103193,
    text_slice='“小终南”',
    hash='sha256:13527695c73106aaf264a5325df2dea9b697f30b6f3d72bc245b63cc552a81bf'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3747',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=454,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=103193,
    end_offset=103206,
    text_slice='的，种种名色，不止几十个。',
    hash='sha256:bebcb56489c4b5c837b2ce6ae8506d316ac6957c29d1694d455efdebf1fd1caf'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3748',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=454,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=103206,
    end_offset=103237,
    text_slice='原来众客心中早知贾政要试宝玉的功业进益如何，只将些俗套来敷衍。',
    hash='sha256:903dcfbf24736707597c7ec1d8df70a95f6d4cdb4e1722b5669e8f872621cdbb'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3749',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=454,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=103237,
    end_offset=103245,
    text_slice='宝玉亦料定此意。',
    hash='sha256:5df8f62c50445f4f0c8e4d91ab2e5d4c9f54d7168fb223eccdfd773f4231bf32'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3750',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=454,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=103245,
    end_offset=103259,
    text_slice='贾政听了，便回头命宝玉拟来。',
    hash='sha256:b8a19b4db9d9dd8b786ab3a95d4d19ed9cd66adc51e2ec023acc69b1532f93fa'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3751',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=454,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=103263,
    end_offset=103340,
    text_slice='“尝闻古人有云：‘编新不如述旧，刻古终胜雕今。’况此处并非主山正景，原无可题之处，不过是探景一进步耳。莫若直书‘曲径通幽处’这句旧诗在上，倒还大方气派。”',
    hash='sha256:5859b8aa6eddefc31e8aa1848e5500c583a8785be5ec2a450062005edce3491f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3752',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=454,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=103340,
    end_offset=103349,
    text_slice='众人听了，都赞道：',
    hash='sha256:08c4a64a08a407da6735f433bc423b10fd541dd932ebf8243ba6e5f92a0e9005'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3753',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=454,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=103349,
    end_offset=103375,
    text_slice='“是极！二世兄天分高，才情远，不似我们读腐了书的。”',
    hash='sha256:a0440cc4198955a72aab52e039650a9a44fd07e7396f77c1a1c52f9224a54344'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3754',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=454,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=103375,
    end_offset=103380,
    text_slice='贾政笑道：',
    hash='sha256:c4e4801082157c7d737f1da99569399a3c2fa3dccb4bb75b4cca27092f01c1c6'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3755',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=454,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=103380,
    end_offset=103410,
    text_slice='“不可谬奖。他年小，不过以一知充十用，取笑罢了。再俟选拟。”',
    hash='sha256:ce02047920f5404c4ae99dc902859b939e591b92317d09809cb80bdd69bf0782'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3756',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=455,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=103412,
    end_offset=103421,
    text_slice='说着，进入石洞来。',
    hash='sha256:079b2be7a782edbd2277f3783589bd689e8863c8ab0a90f0e6c64d4b4d5be5b1'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3757',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=455,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=103421,
    end_offset=103452,
    text_slice='只见佳木茏葱，奇花闪灼，一带清流，从花木深处曲折泻于石隙之中。',
    hash='sha256:6e708734b1ab21b0c0629bbc3e1a4238f0005427cf15391f92f2a84050caba37'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3758',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=455,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=103452,
    end_offset=103489,
    text_slice='再进数步，渐向北边，平坦宽豁，两边飞楼插空，雕甍绣槛，皆隐于山坳树杪之间。',
    hash='sha256:9fe5160a0250123a16e16183ef74b991052b6252569c3852494ff5bb9acd2938'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3759',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=455,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=103489,
    end_offset=103530,
    text_slice='俯而视之，则清溪泻雪，石磴穿云，白石为栏，环抱池沿，石桥之港，兽面衔吐，桥上有亭。',
    hash='sha256:58211202a138fa2aa0fe42f4779dc0d7642d14b6d1f97cf7e75efd8474e6214f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3760',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=455,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=103548,
    end_offset=103557,
    text_slice='“诸公以何题此？”',
    hash='sha256:789b5e9f437d28304bd30f4e66ce2aecbb30e8920d666124c3dd4566fcffc605'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3761',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=455,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=103557,
    end_offset=103562,
    text_slice='诸人都道：',
    hash='sha256:2166597531f0ec3f97e2bc72e6dfd9bf712800d445f4c3c55e38a3c1a755bdd5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3762',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=455,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=103562,
    end_offset=103592,
    text_slice='“当日欧阳公《醉翁亭记》有云：‘有亭翼然’，就名‘翼然’。”',
    hash='sha256:37685030694b2b5557d566a8426fb18f33226fda3ad6979fecdf939c98341978'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3763',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=455,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=103592,
    end_offset=103597,
    text_slice='贾政笑道：',
    hash='sha256:c4e4801082157c7d737f1da99569399a3c2fa3dccb4bb75b4cca27092f01c1c6'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3764',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=455,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=103597,
    end_offset=103653,
    text_slice='“‘翼然’虽佳，但此亭压水而成，还须偏于水题方称。依我拙裁，欧阳公之‘泻出于两峰之间’，竟用他这一个‘泻’字。”',
    hash='sha256:a43b04b822d8de421a817f1db03c16349d76dc1ae6332f0484013d2392c61aac'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3765',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=455,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=103653,
    end_offset=103658,
    text_slice='有一客道：',
    hash='sha256:a8717551fe33c180817f9cd2f8b9832a0f8ecec9ce66320f93a729cb7d3b72af'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3766',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=455,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=103658,
    end_offset=103676,
    text_slice='“是极，是极！竟是‘泻玉’二字妙。”',
    hash='sha256:0f7b31f470d892b6c21a46d78898e4716ba8a9a54f4b3fac75d7d7959f5649fa'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3767',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=455,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=103676,
    end_offset=103702,
    text_slice='贾政拈髯寻思，因抬头见宝玉侍侧，便笑命他也拟一个来。',
    hash='sha256:d858f2ceaeb848a9aa907d549b37d199f00bdad0ac0c1254b8bc21a650d5714a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3768',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=455,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=103712,
    end_offset=103814,
    text_slice='“老爷方才所议已是。但是如今追究了去，似乎当日欧阳公题酿泉用一‘泻’字则妥，今日此泉若亦用‘泻’字，则觉不甚妥。况此处虽云省亲驻跸别墅，亦当入于应制之例，用此等字眼，亦觉粗陋不雅。求再拟较此蕴籍含蓄者。”',
    hash='sha256:569fd6991ceb5d8998ad9a9ef95e134e04324708b2feb54f8c21b14792157286'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3769',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=455,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=103814,
    end_offset=103819,
    text_slice='贾政笑道：',
    hash='sha256:c4e4801082157c7d737f1da99569399a3c2fa3dccb4bb75b4cca27092f01c1c6'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3770',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=455,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=103819,
    end_offset=103868,
    text_slice='“诸公听此论若何？方才众人编新，你又说不如述古，如今我们述古，你又说粗陋不妥。你且说你的来我听。”',
    hash='sha256:91875462926aa3e7d6cf794b8d94b09187f8045a9243d0b02879fe1511a2a246'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3771',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=455,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=103868,
    end_offset=103872,
    text_slice='宝玉道：',
    hash='sha256:10c9e1a43f0e2e5bf2e54f50fb3dbede512eb436326aec72d14625e62153e9b0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3772',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=455,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=103872,
    end_offset=103898,
    text_slice='“有用‘泻玉’二字，则莫若‘沁芳’二字，岂不新雅？”',
    hash='sha256:1f665d1edd953a9bd30a2aaa43bcb1281cb5487a3d25276b9b6c4b867c77d9e0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3773',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=455,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=103898,
    end_offset=103907,
    text_slice='贾政拈髯点头不语。',
    hash='sha256:bdf9d636c83ec9db413aa5d5de10f42f270b27aae3c4a4a83cb33aae8b14056e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3774',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=455,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=103907,
    end_offset=103922,
    text_slice='众人都忙迎合，赞宝玉才情不凡。',
    hash='sha256:e9e6e6109ad9957c986c849126025c4de85f7af7f4bc8b63fe7ae64e848c248c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3775',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=455,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=103926,
    end_offset=103945,
    text_slice='“匾上二字容易。再作一副七言对联来。”',
    hash='sha256:8086a284e6f053f2635721c0f363301156f976252e88daeabd370a2b2ff04a9c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3776',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=455,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=103945,
    end_offset=103970,
    text_slice='宝玉听说，立于亭上，四顾一望，便机上心来，乃念道：',
    hash='sha256:0c8fbfeaea480c057e27f03742fc29f646a1f82c1b6ac5ef16f3eeb6fe7584e2'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3777',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=456,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=103972,
    end_offset=103988,
    text_slice='绕堤柳借三篙翠，隔岸花分一脉香。',
    hash='sha256:0187471d8ac596ed2ec341ee577a0f1bc636b383f2aa421e0782ccc610ea5844'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3778',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=457,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=103990,
    end_offset=104000,
    text_slice='贾政听了，点头微笑。',
    hash='sha256:1cb50750355f60ad6ad280483f8c1f8b3bba205fa51d6bbf82313aec21c8ade4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3779',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=457,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=104000,
    end_offset=104008,
    text_slice='众人先称赞不已。',
    hash='sha256:117581d82938c55cfe5e22d658f719f90bfcbd5a51bc5cb47736ad45f214f6cb'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3780',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=458,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=104010,
    end_offset=104034,
    text_slice='于是出亭过池，一山一石，一花一木，莫不着意观览。',
    hash='sha256:0edc291649ee02394af22e7f0e104341d47c001e7ac7a9d413b60319015d8b4d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3781',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=458,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=104034,
    end_offset=104062,
    text_slice='忽抬头看见前面一带粉垣，里面数楹修舍，有千百竿翠竹遮映。',
    hash='sha256:68370fb7663fbc5bbfb8b7de1ff3b5a31b7d49534fdaafaa8397e0eb304f8fe2'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3782',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=458,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=104062,
    end_offset=104073,
    text_slice='众人都道：“好个所在！',
    hash='sha256:a96d7a4fc5f9e0ba03c4ed9cf1444fc4393f83bc316f66c1010a29d99f40c1ea'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3783',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=458,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=104073,
    end_offset=104101,
    text_slice='”于是大家进入，只见入门便是曲折游廊，阶下石子漫成甬路。',
    hash='sha256:97caf72b4ae60765128d9114b54b68f9254130cb5dea6fd9d0c18236e1766843'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3784',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=458,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=104101,
    end_offset=104131,
    text_slice='上面小小三间房舍，一明两暗，里面都是合着地步打就的床杌椅案。',
    hash='sha256:ec1ef22d55ef1258cd0e47faafce06b9225ea560f37d21bbe95332f0f7c67d38'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3785',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=458,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=104131,
    end_offset=104159,
    text_slice='从里间房内又得一小门，出去则是后院，有大株梨花兼着芭蕉。',
    hash='sha256:abe18ea15d684e66d42ce7d864c02e7f0b384de0ebbc99e1451744a11dcc72e2'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3786',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=458,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=104159,
    end_offset=104168,
    text_slice='又有两间小小退步。',
    hash='sha256:739f81721d7db5c43d376ff8e339c4f80f262115e6efae8695d0cd395ac61017'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3787',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=458,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=104168,
    end_offset=104209,
    text_slice='后院墙下；忽开一隙，得泉一派，开沟仅尺许，灌入墙内，绕阶缘屋至前院，盘旋竹下而出。',
    hash='sha256:e0049d11f469532886b32fd0ee1b11bd4a5281bf4aff182ea444f7357a5a74fe'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3788',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=459,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=104211,
    end_offset=104216,
    text_slice='贾政笑道：',
    hash='sha256:c4e4801082157c7d737f1da99569399a3c2fa3dccb4bb75b4cca27092f01c1c6'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3789',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=459,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=104216,
    end_offset=104244,
    text_slice='“这一处倒还罢了。若能月夜坐此窗下读书，不枉虚生一世。”',
    hash='sha256:1d845d9b403f7f182c63633c830b252f80c0300bf3d74e669f311cffe6ece11a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3790',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=459,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=104244,
    end_offset=104261,
    text_slice='说毕，看着宝玉，唬得宝玉忙垂了头。',
    hash='sha256:83bfd50542ab6cf45c139c7f1947f5e0fa8bec038d67e8eef6efeb0edc9e0b39'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3791',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=459,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=104273,
    end_offset=104285,
    text_slice='“此处的匾该题四个字。”',
    hash='sha256:3c84739afaad56b53aa89873c032d669e5db90df1e850427771aa7bb0e2de268'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3792',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=459,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=104285,
    end_offset=104290,
    text_slice='贾政笑问：',
    hash='sha256:3078b77c4a5ae6a20feaedc42eb9030f927fa6fc0048f6bfa661317caa17e35a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3793',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=459,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=104290,
    end_offset=104296,
    text_slice='“哪四字？”',
    hash='sha256:f8209cd9ab5d57674160c67cac7ac57565dc6b6ce329708e3b44b93ee86510d4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3794',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=459,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=104296,
    end_offset=104300,
    text_slice='一个道是',
    hash='sha256:de3a1b2ff38b58f10c562ee1eca32db9ad7a1c20616085d3112f6c8637f42084'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3795',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=459,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=104300,
    end_offset=104306,
    text_slice='“淇水遗风”',
    hash='sha256:bf033e8322f78f98b19d624c8803b3b21348ecc6d954f02f56f6e7148d4d3edf'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3796',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=459,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=104306,
    end_offset=104311,
    text_slice='。贾政道：',
    hash='sha256:90c895029f67cfd3e7b160dcf929298c969e778af7d9192b31f66e1ea67035d3'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3797',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=459,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=104311,
    end_offset=104315,
    text_slice='“俗。”',
    hash='sha256:d7a371f68e2a2a43c3c8bb1eeb58a4bb8e9025f1c120a52f0814c4b915dabe22'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3798',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=459,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=104315,
    end_offset=104319,
    text_slice='又一个是',
    hash='sha256:b9b29b7e9cdd74718ad98493574e900446798e3d2b33eb8192494caec52fa7be'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3799',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=459,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=104319,
    end_offset=104325,
    text_slice='“睢园雅迹”',
    hash='sha256:2fed696cb38e1edcbc946b583b204343ac0f8ee68103a8959049ac582d14bc07'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3800',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=459,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=104325,
    end_offset=104330,
    text_slice='。贾政道：',
    hash='sha256:90c895029f67cfd3e7b160dcf929298c969e778af7d9192b31f66e1ea67035d3'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3801',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=459,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=104330,
    end_offset=104335,
    text_slice='“也俗。”',
    hash='sha256:19d8e22a219f449c9e2e955b949be97206aa3249e80831739793621df98ecfc2'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3802',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=459,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=104335,
    end_offset=104340,
    text_slice='贾珍笑道：',
    hash='sha256:63b4c161a5484b96e4ab3ce051a57823c9c2253a8859a27eccfa65cc01a5b275'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3803',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=459,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=104340,
    end_offset=104352,
    text_slice='“还是宝兄弟拟一个来。”',
    hash='sha256:86b9110a841cd88f27bdcc957084a5020326b5aca4a03f60b5892bb205f4fe93'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3804',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=459,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=104352,
    end_offset=104356,
    text_slice='贾政道：',
    hash='sha256:f33ef81bd4e7b413fce0b129e8c20ed9a8efdaf9e259c0802cebe3592ab015c1'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3805',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=459,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=104356,
    end_offset=104382,
    text_slice='“他未曾作，先要议论人家的好歹，可见就是个轻薄人。”',
    hash='sha256:b0c081bbd89c5529fbdccca8ab7b6d982b1d353dbc7ee124531cfce48faea6fd'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3806',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=459,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=104382,
    end_offset=104386,
    text_slice='众客道：',
    hash='sha256:91cc388fc56746f513eefd0cddb429c1bc623f93abff7f22e3f945a904232c1f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3807',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=459,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=104386,
    end_offset=104399,
    text_slice='“议论得极是，其奈他何？”',
    hash='sha256:ae654d93de0611244bceca1ad8eadbb607a1fa95ded587e60730677994cf4de0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3808',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=459,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=104399,
    end_offset=104404,
    text_slice='贾政忙道：',
    hash='sha256:534a77315ce9465dd10d27efb3592e575ad5eabf0bc2cf3e5a88c7893ccf2d83'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3809',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=459,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=104404,
    end_offset=104413,
    text_slice='“休如此纵了他。”',
    hash='sha256:a6f8eb9655e92d866afb033b76d16540b17d2c9705f7bfdbfcb45cc4a788679f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3810',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=459,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=104413,
    end_offset=104418,
    text_slice='因命他道：',
    hash='sha256:4f5043d5956ef9fdbeb362e758b084c467e01a41ee75bbf61cec6680eea1caca'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3811',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=459,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=104418,
    end_offset=104455,
    text_slice='“今日任你狂为乱道，先设议论来，然后方许你作。方才众人说的，可有使得的？”',
    hash='sha256:189223192213d123a3d9e9095c6b2a5cf510155c238c7054ebb432585324aa47'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3812',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=459,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=104455,
    end_offset=104463,
    text_slice='宝玉见问，便道：',
    hash='sha256:421100a64b9b7f0179bd14b9eb0a6fffddc9f2bc712574c075ac1cbfb1cfd6f7'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3813',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=459,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=104463,
    end_offset=104470,
    text_slice='“都似不妥。”',
    hash='sha256:991668a0ef45b89ab2fb2cd45ea9e920ab3e470f53c239362253f36c88d0baef'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3814',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=459,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=104470,
    end_offset=104476,
    text_slice='贾政冷笑道：',
    hash='sha256:fd0940088238d2487c5359eaae49e7c28b94919090afa921cab4e3e9f9b48b34'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3815',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=459,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=104476,
    end_offset=104483,
    text_slice='“怎么不妥？”',
    hash='sha256:70f7c69b036fb3d35dbc2f1d7ab6ec95e7da7cb4b2435f96e1fa299e183bfbe1'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3816',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=459,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=104483,
    end_offset=104487,
    text_slice='宝玉道：',
    hash='sha256:10c9e1a43f0e2e5bf2e54f50fb3dbede512eb436326aec72d14625e62153e9b0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3817',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=459,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=104487,
    end_offset=104526,
    text_slice='“这是第一处行幸之处，必须颂圣方可。若用四字的匾，又有古人现成的，何必再作。”',
    hash='sha256:1bf486178b8f20933dd89eeeceaf7019b607d812bd9f8e48fdff4597034dc34c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3818',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=459,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=104526,
    end_offset=104530,
    text_slice='贾政道：',
    hash='sha256:f33ef81bd4e7b413fce0b129e8c20ed9a8efdaf9e259c0802cebe3592ab015c1'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3819',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=459,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=104530,
    end_offset=104548,
    text_slice='“难道‘淇水’‘睢园’不是古人的？”',
    hash='sha256:ada093e3a8b6ae147a89a8d6e2e1e5ef2746440fbdd5969aa9bd3aa3dd55dff0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3820',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=459,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=104548,
    end_offset=104552,
    text_slice='宝玉道：',
    hash='sha256:10c9e1a43f0e2e5bf2e54f50fb3dbede512eb436326aec72d14625e62153e9b0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3821',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=459,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=104552,
    end_offset=104571,
    text_slice='“这太板腐了。莫若‘有凤来仪’四字。”',
    hash='sha256:cf560aa39591ae250ed21664d871ee56d78389ee7ca91fc474d5fc2cc8175c06'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3822',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=459,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=104571,
    end_offset=104579,
    text_slice='众人都哄然叫妙。',
    hash='sha256:b14e25594374a9ddaab5405285fcc812ecd5650fca56cc6f7178b4701d1d39b6'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3823',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=459,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=104585,
    end_offset=104603,
    text_slice='“畜生，畜生，可谓‘管窥蠡测’矣！”',
    hash='sha256:bceb4fc26de6c599a90f2abe88d59a15e5ee031b465a5ca3912c1127e8d873e4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3824',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=459,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=104603,
    end_offset=104606,
    text_slice='因命：',
    hash='sha256:c549d0a60d8d185efa2a06fcdbb7783b30824f19a91d9eecbef008be66f302dd'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3825',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=459,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=104606,
    end_offset=104614,
    text_slice='“再题一联来。”',
    hash='sha256:d13403a57cdb4b87d95872aeb39f799bc8e618b590fc31325a86514b7381e808'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3826',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=459,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=104614,
    end_offset=104620,
    text_slice='宝玉便念道：',
    hash='sha256:409cefdf6090f752e1285f9c964c3e020617ee4a0f361009349506f92a106d4d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3827',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=460,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=104622,
    end_offset=104638,
    text_slice='宝鼎茶闲烟尚绿，幽窗棋罢指犹凉。',
    hash='sha256:4da3e78cd05dbf74a4f2348a9ea7357a9d12e96dffe77dba0f83992d4b149ca2'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3828',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=461,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=104640,
    end_offset=104653,
    text_slice='贾政摇头说道：“也未见长。',
    hash='sha256:f95a1011368a7704846c63ada1410f9cb0dbb1a868650bec34b44d85b63a4a50'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3829',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=461,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=104653,
    end_offset=104663,
    text_slice='”说毕，引众人出来。',
    hash='sha256:8d1ff80941c0e9301f5315a05843c6dcb44077b5c38121ebe7267bdd0fadd279'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3830',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=462,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=104665,
    end_offset=104684,
    text_slice='方欲走时，忽又想起一事来，因问贾珍道：',
    hash='sha256:660fd7d31c85e5e9e87d5d647ad9067cb656d6e24506e68fb82789974c5623ee'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3831',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=462,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=104684,
    end_offset=104734,
    text_slice='“这些院落房宇并几案桌椅都算有了，还有那些帐幔帘子并陈设的玩器古董，可也都是一处一处合式配就的么？”',
    hash='sha256:e074907559bcafea75be065d4c40788fa8c912f56d7404ad6ce89253b1f61c4f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3832',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=462,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=104734,
    end_offset=104739,
    text_slice='贾珍回道：',
    hash='sha256:228b1756996b308779456016cf03aa9f83bc79182d3f0ed187af1817b5588dd4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3833',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=462,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=104739,
    end_offset=104821,
    text_slice='“那陈设的东西早已添了许多，临期自然合式陈设。帐幔帘子，昨日听见琏兄弟说，还不全。那原是一起工程之时就画了各处的图样，量准尺寸，就打发人办去的。想必昨日得了一半。”',
    hash='sha256:ea86908b3743f5985143ac9d48eacd945cc88e37ceb1e5b4b8bf8ae3c23bcd56'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3834',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=462,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=104821,
    end_offset=104846,
    text_slice='贾政听了，便知此事不是贾珍的首尾，便命人去唤贾琏。',
    hash='sha256:405d18795a6a0037c563437256a56af14540f7e92129a970dfd0512db9169c7d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3835',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=463,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=104848,
    end_offset=104877,
    text_slice='一时，贾琏赶来，贾政问他共有几种，现今得了几种，尚欠几种。',
    hash='sha256:6d52374e7c1968fd156b1a83f6bf507c29d187e06694f743dddc9cec0a5d8b45'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3836',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=463,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=104877,
    end_offset=104956,
    text_slice='贾琏见问，忙向靴桶取靴掖内装的一个纸折略节来，看了一看，回道：“妆蟒绣堆、刻丝弹墨，并各色绸绫、大小幔子一百二十架，湘妃竹帘二百挂昨日得了八十架，下欠四十架。',
    hash='sha256:34201196a42a94b47ec074c30d62f68591c26ccc725663bda4c1234f780e7e2f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3837',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=463,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=104956,
    end_offset=104968,
    text_slice='帘子二百挂，昨日俱得了。',
    hash='sha256:213321e0d368f49d8cd1d571baf3e8d8ddfc20fe2810bd28c04df2225f3fb180'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3838',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=463,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=104968,
    end_offset=105024,
    text_slice='外有猩猩毡帘二百挂，金丝藤红漆竹帘二百挂，墨漆竹帘二百挂，五彩线络盘花帘二百挂，每样得了一半，也不过秋天都全了。',
    hash='sha256:3c32dff3a91fcdabbba2db43c484f6955797bf4733ca5cc2d96e00d928a47151'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3839',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=463,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=105024,
    end_offset=105048,
    text_slice='椅搭、桌围、床裙、桌套，每分一千二百件，也有了。',
    hash='sha256:86af3ce0cfaa98891d07c5e48ce51bdc5c8d8010402a979f8ace8e8169024e77'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3840',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=464,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=105051,
    end_offset=105066,
    text_slice='一面说，一面走，倏尔青山斜阻。',
    hash='sha256:71c09b48ac2db19b596c9a0b92f2212a430468643e8dbeacb9fb872cef126b97'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3841',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=464,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=105066,
    end_offset=105094,
    text_slice='转过山怀中，隐隐露出一带黄泥筑就矮墙，墙头皆中稻茎掩护。',
    hash='sha256:86beccb2fda355c85afc1d79cabd77f47d75ee11c991018207cef1ba16cfcf7e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3842',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=464,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=105094,
    end_offset=105109,
    text_slice='有几百株杏花，如喷火蒸霞一般。',
    hash='sha256:fdfe7f85ed3ff5dd60fbd7f629273cb89978922c612382dfa2df5559655ace08'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3843',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=464,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=105109,
    end_offset=105116,
    text_slice='里面数楹茅屋。',
    hash='sha256:008d21f17b790b26a47d6368513238bb54dcc121159f1593d6aaa2cf92b4a3e5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3844',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=464,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=105116,
    end_offset=105147,
    text_slice='外面却是桑、榆、槿、柘，各色树稚新条，随其曲折，编就两溜青篱。',
    hash='sha256:985b9ad0761d6a03d370b793e62d454222b515e083fae93a6884632c24eb9338'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3845',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=464,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=105147,
    end_offset=105169,
    text_slice='篱外山坡之下，有一土井，旁有桔槔、辘轳之属。',
    hash='sha256:fb2dd1f07c26eca06cc816dc91ce232b836ecc42aeed349e67faba5d4b7036be'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3846',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=464,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=105169,
    end_offset=105186,
    text_slice='下面分畦列亩，佳蔬菜花，漫然无际。',
    hash='sha256:1d5f846cd9834af75b33926a180f1dcfa09141f57272142cc616cb53a29aa93f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3847',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=465,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=105188,
    end_offset=105193,
    text_slice='贾政笑道：',
    hash='sha256:c4e4801082157c7d737f1da99569399a3c2fa3dccb4bb75b4cca27092f01c1c6'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3848',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=465,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=105193,
    end_offset=105238,
    text_slice='“倒是此处有些道理。固然系人力穿凿，此时一见，未免勾引起我归农之意。我们且进去歇息歇息。”',
    hash='sha256:62d0a27adec4a677c428b964cd98054779d82c6f646bbfb711cba38eb955eb2e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3849',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=465,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=105238,
    end_offset=105264,
    text_slice='说毕，方欲进篱门去，忽见路旁有一石碣，亦为留题之备。',
    hash='sha256:604d9ace7493a4e53545483fea745cce560cb60b214de428c0b8e03bd1a582b3'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3850',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=465,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=105269,
    end_offset=105322,
    text_slice='“更妙，更妙！此处若悬匾待题，则田舍家风一洗尽矣。立此一碣，又觉生色许多，非范石湖田家之咏不足以尽其妙。”',
    hash='sha256:4fd8cccdb78b42b87d391e34266525b24e8c60db477aacb410dd832118cee804'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3851',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=465,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=105322,
    end_offset=105326,
    text_slice='贾政道：',
    hash='sha256:f33ef81bd4e7b413fce0b129e8c20ed9a8efdaf9e259c0802cebe3592ab015c1'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3852',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=465,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=105326,
    end_offset=105333,
    text_slice='“诸公请题。”',
    hash='sha256:efaacd1c2ba6e8048ec86415a3c33fd800f5ea1bad3d8729fbcde9ea3057b107'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3853',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=465,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=105333,
    end_offset=105337,
    text_slice='众人道：',
    hash='sha256:9b7cfd35ec4e9995a55f0eb346ea28e5b8f08093983501e273ddcf11c98f91e8'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3854',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=465,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=105337,
    end_offset=105376,
    text_slice='“方才世兄有云，‘编新不如述旧’，此处古人已道尽矣，莫若直书‘杏花村’妙极，”',
    hash='sha256:24c0cdeefb2264eb37a57abe271c54208438ee087c9a4499a9dcb9e249ec5bc3'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3855',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=465,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=105376,
    end_offset=105387,
    text_slice='贾政听了，笑向贾珍道：',
    hash='sha256:41d307f95523901f7c06b0db43889971dc6d2a3424aa7475c18fee4c23e6ce44'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3856',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=465,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=105387,
    end_offset=105443,
    text_slice='“正亏提醒了我。此处都妙极，只是还少一个酒幌。明日竟作一个，不必华丽，就依外面村庄的式样作来，用竹竿挑在树梢。”',
    hash='sha256:6e964f325b27282a42b282fe4fc759c86580e2feca114cc69c26f3526e2149e7'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3857',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=465,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=105443,
    end_offset=105453,
    text_slice='贾珍答应了，又回道：',
    hash='sha256:4deb8a4584035f563ce65174c154f72c571fa8aad95161237f0aa2df3c1790a9'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3858',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=465,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=105453,
    end_offset=105484,
    text_slice='“此处竟还不可养别的雀鸟，只是买些鹅、鸭、鸡类，才都相称了。”',
    hash='sha256:871e97d5c2114f3561837ba148f7fc812db7946385bd1808a1fe59fac11b4337'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3859',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=465,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=105484,
    end_offset=105492,
    text_slice='贾政与众人都道：',
    hash='sha256:6bc12ee1c4c0017d899033de6841316954943e98c9bb76915193671a1a40c2f1'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3860',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=465,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=105492,
    end_offset=105497,
    text_slice='“更妙。”',
    hash='sha256:5cb07da50e1ef20c2f412c41ac0d45462bea4de7a3e2d1fd5ead13c958a981b5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3861',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=465,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=105497,
    end_offset=105505,
    text_slice='贾政又向众人道：',
    hash='sha256:8139278249b794bf84d978d06dd9311c468cdcf1ca20f9d6ce2b6b2445b45b09'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3862',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=465,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=105505,
    end_offset=105531,
    text_slice='“‘杏花村’固佳，只是犯了正名村名，直待请名方可。”',
    hash='sha256:a80a4f7f8384cbfa2827edad607914765720fd1512843194a8aaf717c81ad809'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3863',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=465,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=105531,
    end_offset=105536,
    text_slice='众客都道：',
    hash='sha256:140a54ba44343916a1b7b3868eae83a7ff4098fe0d86aa544e5e2c91761f2120'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3864',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=465,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=105536,
    end_offset=105554,
    text_slice='“是呀！如今虚的，便是什么字样好？”',
    hash='sha256:1e010e973f7aa2f0c6c6dcb61e18da53ef86ebf551f2c992e26eb94b8d232db6'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3865',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=466,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=105556,
    end_offset=105581,
    text_slice='大家想着，宝玉却等不得了，也不等贾政的命，便说道：',
    hash='sha256:1b12d37b0fe796e3f999909b29b678525387d3c85558b644a523e47b7f8dca2c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3866',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=466,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=105581,
    end_offset=105611,
    text_slice='“旧诗有云：‘红杏梢头挂酒旗’。如今莫若‘杏帘在望’四字。”',
    hash='sha256:07b554756e3684f2d252eb3e21d3c7d11649c47b51c3ae97a712a32210bebc53'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3867',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=466,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=105611,
    end_offset=105616,
    text_slice='众人都道：',
    hash='sha256:45d478b58b8f745c68040b83a789074bbb7b89eed8407b4b9a621ea054fdb6ac'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3868',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=466,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=105616,
    end_offset=105635,
    text_slice='“好个‘在望’！又暗合‘杏花村’意。”',
    hash='sha256:f5f72f3d27dd7e24885c8c7a02cf297fb86cba18a12d66a1d4c6c28d32826214'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3869',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=466,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=105635,
    end_offset=105641,
    text_slice='宝玉冷笑道：',
    hash='sha256:530d4f338ddbdfa69cdde493020fa4a7d4509f5670b14faa54226a40d77785c1'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3870',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=466,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=105641,
    end_offset=105690,
    text_slice='“村名若用‘杏花’二字，则俗陋不堪了。又有古人诗云：‘柴门临水稻花香’，何不就用‘稻香村’的妙？”',
    hash='sha256:3c69654e0c2631e0faf5928c7fbf68aa96ddb5cca01a786adf31aa6256ab2b00'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3871',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=466,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=105690,
    end_offset=105703,
    text_slice='众人听了，亦发哄声拍手道：',
    hash='sha256:3a76539dc4ad941708532afef7be7cc9fe6574a2890429c08b270f277e911f8a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3872',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=466,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=105703,
    end_offset=105707,
    text_slice='“妙！”',
    hash='sha256:5f9cd702a76cfd9fdb1d417e1755765a0b27e3fd069d4ce6d648ca55a349bed9'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3873',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=466,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=105707,
    end_offset=105714,
    text_slice='贾政一声断喝：',
    hash='sha256:73133b4f3a03f0d629cdde85dcf21f9e872597a81bc6d0fa5243bcb461e18cfe'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3874',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=466,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=105714,
    end_offset=105778,
    text_slice='“无知的业障！你能知道几个古人，能记得几首熟诗，也敢在老先生前卖弄！你方才那些胡说的，不过是试你的清浊，取笑而已，你就认真了！”',
    hash='sha256:a636ccf5343c92dbec02405519d83e67682670d365b64ee1a7635e3fac8ec70c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3875',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=467,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=105780,
    end_offset=105806,
    text_slice='说着，引人步入茆堂，里面纸窗木榻，富贵气象一洗皆尽。',
    hash='sha256:d99532d227982a7e18abf59810ba8e3036b88f9cda217311ea752248d89c5676'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3876',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=467,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=105821,
    end_offset=105828,
    text_slice='“此处如何？”',
    hash='sha256:d9a701befdcd29966a319a9e8ca5445845aee172cd95aa91c857a972c2ef1038'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3877',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=467,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=105828,
    end_offset=105847,
    text_slice='众人见问，都忙悄悄的推宝玉，教他说好。',
    hash='sha256:92f2e008d1d8015289f5b76d19b81d9cd509ffc4b9258f1520bb95cbf9062e72'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3878',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=467,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=105859,
    end_offset=105872,
    text_slice='“不及‘有凤来仪’多矣。”',
    hash='sha256:262a43608655e9f8c5d6c2d81f34ce0e9f2ff5521125c7ab94455c19caf19394'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3879',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=467,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=105872,
    end_offset=105878,
    text_slice='贾政听了道：',
    hash='sha256:acf960fc0b72b62ffd1b9c74089b50013eba6c3e269c0deccff9ee7390d0520c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3880',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=467,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=105878,
    end_offset=105919,
    text_slice='“无知的蠢物！你只知朱楼画栋、恶赖富丽为佳，哪里知道这清幽气象。终是不读书之过！”',
    hash='sha256:02bdd86a09e425e09bbdd28b38451ac3b922656ac0d97c05761cc6f71b3637e5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3881',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=467,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=105919,
    end_offset=105925,
    text_slice='宝玉忙答道：',
    hash='sha256:1bfa352ad1ef7a27cea39de3ed6914cf7c2582c021634a0797ec5f58ed2129fe'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3882',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=467,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=105925,
    end_offset=105952,
    text_slice='“老爷教训得固是，但古人常云‘天然’二字，不知何意？”',
    hash='sha256:f9c5a23d6457b3fc2b9fed109605b0118bd8b9f89e14ee2057e3fb2ba6be941a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3883',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=468,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=105954,
    end_offset=105970,
    text_slice='众人见宝玉牛心，都怪他呆痴不改。',
    hash='sha256:1085219320bfc4b75645cd547eba99d98e9a7cfcfd20a0438fb4f863a9903507'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3884',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=468,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=105985,
    end_offset=106024,
    text_slice='“别的都明白，如何连‘天然’不知？‘天然’者，天之自然而有，非人力之所成也。”',
    hash='sha256:dab11c81db5e82d02a92b6de7400213807b7e8c107881979c8e09f09b3bd3a23'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3885',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=468,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=106024,
    end_offset=106028,
    text_slice='宝玉道：',
    hash='sha256:10c9e1a43f0e2e5bf2e54f50fb3dbede512eb436326aec72d14625e62153e9b0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3886',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=468,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=106028,
    end_offset=106174,
    text_slice='“却又来！此处置一田庄，分明见得人力穿凿扭捏而成。远无邻村，近不负郭，背山山无脉，临水水无源，高无隐寺之塔，下无通市之桥，峭然孤出，似非大观。争似先处有自然之理，得自然之气，虽种竹引泉，亦不伤于穿凿。古人云‘天然图画’四字，正畏非其地而强为地，非其山而强为山，虽百般精而终不相宜......”',
    hash='sha256:4e866648cb6a325fe1efee17c19e8e232162ea6fcd1e2d61329a5955055786f6'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3887',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=468,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=106174,
    end_offset=106186,
    text_slice='未及说完，贾政气得喝命：',
    hash='sha256:a7c172aac485c35ef8a329b275894649fbc2aa534b473e1aedea07762624f833'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3888',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=468,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=106186,
    end_offset=106192,
    text_slice='“叉出去！”',
    hash='sha256:7b8deaf7b6c8bea9af3e386d6fdeb1452f033075289309a0a0609c560571ef34'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3889',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=468,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=106192,
    end_offset=106200,
    text_slice='刚出去，又喝命：',
    hash='sha256:6f947f123aa252ac2925f740307685d9fe3f09c0ddae8a32c8a62e8fbb6bc985'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3890',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=468,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=106200,
    end_offset=106205,
    text_slice='“回来！”',
    hash='sha256:1e3d55ce0e0e082eff5f83dd2e910d79dc8e36c843abc65629940955cefec622'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3891',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=468,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=106205,
    end_offset=106211,
    text_slice='命再题一联：',
    hash='sha256:6f87a742686803827ecdcdf5dfbfffe77b63175a6d197237fbca29d8fc857058'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3892',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=468,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=106211,
    end_offset=106222,
    text_slice='“若不通，一并打嘴！”',
    hash='sha256:7a6d615d2cf2d132eac9168e4a7585a4fde0d589228bdfe58f32b40d350ad82f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3893',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=468,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=106222,
    end_offset=106229,
    text_slice='宝玉只得念道：',
    hash='sha256:5f94798198803c9b0865600575be8accd184436b65e96b6f414d9943f873e225'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3894',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=469,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=106231,
    end_offset=106247,
    text_slice='新涨绿添浣葛处，好云香护采芹人。',
    hash='sha256:1d59ea23ec69ddd2561271bb80aaaf8f6a6061c4f6cc8d5c12f28c2f097fbaad'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3895',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=470,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=106249,
    end_offset=106258,
    text_slice='贾政听了，摇头说：',
    hash='sha256:74b43a51fbe9d603704c90e6b463bf3febc31175500286b0cd697c49707a248d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3896',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=470,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=106258,
    end_offset=106264,
    text_slice='“更不好。”',
    hash='sha256:f238b2c71231a3b186ccf35d94212c9474db6dab0988319dc4cab96a0fefa455'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3897',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=470,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=106264,
    end_offset=106323,
    text_slice='一面引人出来，转过山坡，穿花度柳，抚石依泉，过了荼蘼架，再入木香棚，越牡丹亭，度芍药圃，入蔷薇院，出芭蕉坞，盘旋曲折。',
    hash='sha256:eb75336c0a489c3df0bc657b7607dbb692136cf3066e7b74d6f2121b7bc8703e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3898',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=470,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=106323,
    end_offset=106349,
    text_slice='忽闻水声潺湲，泻出石洞，上则萝薜倒垂，下则落花浮荡。',
    hash='sha256:6583003251251e438b93894e4d3e33c44559dff7f5b1ce4506c6661540defa4c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3899',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=470,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=106354,
    end_offset=106362,
    text_slice='“好景，好景！”',
    hash='sha256:20c26fb92c551239caa49c5500f7d8a346a030170f4bc023d61af978c733d38c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3900',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=470,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=106362,
    end_offset=106366,
    text_slice='贾政道：',
    hash='sha256:f33ef81bd4e7b413fce0b129e8c20ed9a8efdaf9e259c0802cebe3592ab015c1'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3901',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=470,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=106366,
    end_offset=106375,
    text_slice='“诸公题以何名？”',
    hash='sha256:945964d6a44e466526b87d220b49d840ea320d0f0d5716040e53cb3167d641c7'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3902',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=470,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=106375,
    end_offset=106379,
    text_slice='众人道：',
    hash='sha256:9b7cfd35ec4e9995a55f0eb346ea28e5b8f08093983501e273ddcf11c98f91e8'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3903',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=470,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=106379,
    end_offset=106400,
    text_slice='“再不必拟了，恰恰乎是‘武陵源’三个字。”',
    hash='sha256:bb8b4b921fc842c299f6eb306d4f1fdb34e825b85dc267802968b5bd50261782'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3904',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=470,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=106400,
    end_offset=106405,
    text_slice='贾政笑道：',
    hash='sha256:c4e4801082157c7d737f1da99569399a3c2fa3dccb4bb75b4cca27092f01c1c6'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3905',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=470,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=106405,
    end_offset=106417,
    text_slice='“又落实了，而且陈旧。”',
    hash='sha256:b55f1b8219c7302cacb76858d59ae805bc43fc1d497c5a7868302ebfeb4ed66d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3906',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=470,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=106417,
    end_offset=106422,
    text_slice='众人笑道：',
    hash='sha256:fec7ea0793d55abb41c663a1be418ec6593044408f49f0e8af795fbf821ce100'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3907',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=470,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=106422,
    end_offset=106440,
    text_slice='“不然就用‘秦人旧舍’四字也罢了。”',
    hash='sha256:47b71fa71e3de2f54987c159030fa8263826b605c792737021f0457921b1f666'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3908',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=470,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=106440,
    end_offset=106444,
    text_slice='宝玉道：',
    hash='sha256:10c9e1a43f0e2e5bf2e54f50fb3dbede512eb436326aec72d14625e62153e9b0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3909',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=470,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=106444,
    end_offset=106481,
    text_slice='“这越发过露了。‘秦人旧舍’说避乱之意，如何使得！莫若‘蓼汀花溆’四字。”',
    hash='sha256:fbab50e19b9aadd17b231ce9c19bfd8152b61830a9c66a170490e0133781cc22'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3910',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=470,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=106481,
    end_offset=106491,
    text_slice='贾政听了，更批胡说。',
    hash='sha256:fd0a32205d02df203b949ac810c4b8faa9e9544c253ec2fc6793071be68ac181'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3911',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=471,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=106493,
    end_offset=106509,
    text_slice='于是要进港洞时，又想起有船无船。',
    hash='sha256:75477696f5d707cb730fd105b1b3565e80d1d607efbc92f59bbf511e21e2b072'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3912',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=471,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=106513,
    end_offset=106534,
    text_slice='“采莲船共四只，座船一只，如今尚未造成。”',
    hash='sha256:7e3f707f27478ab503e58402a3c124fc86f1939ee02762067c0b0ead93139721'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3913',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=471,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=106534,
    end_offset=106539,
    text_slice='贾政笑道：',
    hash='sha256:c4e4801082157c7d737f1da99569399a3c2fa3dccb4bb75b4cca27092f01c1c6'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3914',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=471,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=106539,
    end_offset=106548,
    text_slice='“可惜不得入了。”',
    hash='sha256:1a02509ee9afba2627422fb9545135c43a7954b7e7014edf08967cca8b5461b2'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3915',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=471,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=106548,
    end_offset=106552,
    text_slice='贾珍道：',
    hash='sha256:f8a8aedd2ce9740ac4855922a831abf328af70a340beca97664f0fbd7e28f010'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3916',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=471,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=106552,
    end_offset=106565,
    text_slice='“从山上盘道亦可以进去。”',
    hash='sha256:6c4c0ecb4c465a5925c295b8320b717afba9ae1f1112689e88513d3b1c11454d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3917',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=471,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=106565,
    end_offset=106582,
    text_slice='说毕，在前导引，大家攀藤抚树过去。',
    hash='sha256:f0d154cdc86351d29fc20f246d984d19a8e04099a75668f6411dc622d466f516'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3918',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=471,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=106582,
    end_offset=106606,
    text_slice='只见水上落花愈多，其水愈清，溶溶荡荡，曲折萦迂。',
    hash='sha256:f541ac52d95b3bdbd5802f543716bd13ffb0fc5cb9bb4bdae259a5e8433c2f0c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3919',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=471,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=106606,
    end_offset=106630,
    text_slice='池边两行垂柳，杂着桃杏，遮天蔽日，真无一些尘土。',
    hash='sha256:177cec28b986f29ad71b535a311f8ef92737759f36835701b6fe375b99a67c14'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3920',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=471,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=106630,
    end_offset=106680,
    text_slice='忽见桃柳中又露出一个条折带朱栏板桥来，度过桥去，诸路可通，便见一所清凉瓦舍，一色水磨砖墙，清瓦花堵。',
    hash='sha256:d86403638f196c8109c9ced3942fef1b23b2ca6ddcc27a8a0fa99bce4c4c0bb2'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3921',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=471,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=106680,
    end_offset=106695,
    text_slice='那大主山所分之脉，皆穿墙而过。',
    hash='sha256:940907d2e0ac60f47857655950b5902811e150bec46a2617c8e8cc9bdf0466e1'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3922',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=472,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=106697,
    end_offset=106701,
    text_slice='贾政道：',
    hash='sha256:f33ef81bd4e7b413fce0b129e8c20ed9a8efdaf9e259c0802cebe3592ab015c1'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3923',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=472,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=106701,
    end_offset=106715,
    text_slice='“此处这所房子，无味得很。”',
    hash='sha256:c57e0974aa92ff92306f6cbe3b27e23542b4a5934acda340bc5e3816f30cf57d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3924',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=472,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=106715,
    end_offset=106768,
    text_slice='因而步入门时，忽迎面突出插天的大玲珑山石来，四面群绕各式石块，竟把里面所有房屋悉皆遮住，而且一株花木也无。',
    hash='sha256:e83a5032844201fbf3c981ebf92498cb3410ce9f7d4d7eb7c0bb5378f61c79c8'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3925',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=472,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=106768,
    end_offset=106847,
    text_slice='只见许多异草：或有牵藤的，或有引蔓的，或垂山巅，或穿石隙，甚至垂檐绕柱，萦砌盘阶，或如翠带飘飖，或如金绳盘屈，或实若丹砂，或花如金桂，味芬气馥，非花香之可比。',
    hash='sha256:f0b048a1c6a8ec9505fec578b1c7e1cdd20d576af33882d79c1edeb74b238190'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3926',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=472,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=106854,
    end_offset=106866,
    text_slice='“有趣！只是不大认识。”',
    hash='sha256:76b0b6b0ecd3d0bf6034eb5acd5afc3a50b1814f9d040028b8b27bd6639243ef'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3927',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=472,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=106866,
    end_offset=106870,
    text_slice='有的说：',
    hash='sha256:94ad6cd97042a0763e31eb0281481f6b8646cd0417baadb0f33c6e523c48e260'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3928',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=472,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=106870,
    end_offset=106878,
    text_slice='“是薜荔藤萝。”',
    hash='sha256:05715a670945072c3e8287b73ca8ad3d5016174dc60d37cd94be8bf34f9dd130'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3929',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=472,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=106878,
    end_offset=106882,
    text_slice='贾政道：',
    hash='sha256:f33ef81bd4e7b413fce0b129e8c20ed9a8efdaf9e259c0802cebe3592ab015c1'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3930',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=472,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=106882,
    end_offset=106895,
    text_slice='“薜荔藤萝不得如此异香。”',
    hash='sha256:2967f3eadbedae5ba97c0a0a50ca189ae44bf011af607f00d770f04729d45df7'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3931',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=472,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=106895,
    end_offset=106899,
    text_slice='宝玉道：',
    hash='sha256:10c9e1a43f0e2e5bf2e54f50fb3dbede512eb436326aec72d14625e62153e9b0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3932',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=472,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=106899,
    end_offset=107085,
    text_slice='“果然不是。这些之中也有藤萝薜荔；那香的是杜若蘅芜，那一种大约是茞兰，这一种大约是清葛，那一种是金簦草，这一种是玉蕗藤，红的自然是紫芸，绿的定是青芷。想来《离骚》《文选》等书上所有的那些异草，也有叫作什么藿纳姜荨的，也有叫作什么纶组紫绛的，还有石帆、水松、扶留等样，又有叫什么绿荑的，还有什么丹椒、蘼芜、风连。如今年深岁改，人不能识，故皆象形夺名，渐渐的唤差了也是有的。”',
    hash='sha256:9b5e6951a2816bb96b413e1bfeb8ca54da6596afb1593eac968b98696ca0c68d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3933',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=472,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=107085,
    end_offset=107095,
    text_slice='未及说完，贾政喝道：',
    hash='sha256:7aae9b93ded51e1be428327d415dcf9244e0476e15c35cf6d6c7909fe47ba820'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3934',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=472,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=107095,
    end_offset=107102,
    text_slice='“谁问你来！”',
    hash='sha256:4fc05fdb747bc2b6990b57477f09e2892cd56631fda660421c14c3448b476f6a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3935',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=472,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=107102,
    end_offset=107114,
    text_slice='唬得宝玉倒退，不敢再说。',
    hash='sha256:96008e01210089cd31d95f4d3112299fa08d9418d98429d5ecf996ad94ad01a2'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3936',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=473,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=107116,
    end_offset=107137,
    text_slice='贾政因见两边俱是超手游廊，便顺着游廊步入。',
    hash='sha256:1e434f4982bd641afef5225762734232980fa7ad7c80ffa0abee6a5738da3d5b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3937',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=473,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=107137,
    end_offset=107170,
    text_slice='只见上面五间清厦连着卷棚，四面出廊，绿窗油壁，更比前几处清雅不同。',
    hash='sha256:d4c77db05d05f00168111ef6eb9f77271c2a3c6386f03cfdc9482ef308252958'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3938',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=473,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=107175,
    end_offset=107219,
    text_slice='“此轩中煮茶操琴，亦不必再焚名香矣！此造已出意外，诸公必有佳作新题以颜其额，方不负此。”',
    hash='sha256:e15e8d6a8d31817030e0e32472e7822a74d59cc25b98403ffc780d0bfda430df'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3939',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=473,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=107219,
    end_offset=107224,
    text_slice='众人笑道：',
    hash='sha256:fec7ea0793d55abb41c663a1be418ec6593044408f49f0e8af795fbf821ce100'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3940',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=473,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=107224,
    end_offset=107239,
    text_slice='“再莫若‘兰风蕙露’贴切了。”',
    hash='sha256:eba2fe34327c9244eaed4a723703d3d9273f006c80a6739d9783ee2416df5eef'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3941',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=473,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=107239,
    end_offset=107243,
    text_slice='贾政道：',
    hash='sha256:f33ef81bd4e7b413fce0b129e8c20ed9a8efdaf9e259c0802cebe3592ab015c1'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3942',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=473,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=107243,
    end_offset=107258,
    text_slice='“也只好用这四字。其联若何？”',
    hash='sha256:6f4756a9ac83d93e13af305a3f3a76af3d26a291cac364c5c19f5e44d4effd3a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3943',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=473,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=107258,
    end_offset=107262,
    text_slice='一人道：',
    hash='sha256:af8949dfd4f2dd3a16546cd8bb8799498e41b3894ee8996d9dc120de14bfffd2'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3944',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=473,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=107262,
    end_offset=107278,
    text_slice='“我倒想了一对，大家批削改正。”',
    hash='sha256:1798086466b6bfd1052f0531f6dff2f0a57bcc22b239c8231d93c08ce9ee6819'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3945',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=473,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=107278,
    end_offset=107282,
    text_slice='念道是：',
    hash='sha256:d610829eb6570c0a0c330d5779b01e6f9cba0bba03424da888cce16c15373967'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3946',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=474,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=107284,
    end_offset=107300,
    text_slice='麝兰芳霭斜阳院，杜若香飘明月洲。',
    hash='sha256:205cb1aab9cc9db0f3c98b58051da63192d39c87ec00a00cd39b8c25571db3b7'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3947',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=475,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=107302,
    end_offset=107306,
    text_slice='众人道：',
    hash='sha256:9b7cfd35ec4e9995a55f0eb346ea28e5b8f08093983501e273ddcf11c98f91e8'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3948',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=475,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=107306,
    end_offset=107324,
    text_slice='“妙则妙矣，只是‘斜阳’二字不妥。”',
    hash='sha256:21db46e4f895a4f1ad9b2dbd25bbe8a4987540698c85a08889187822171b4e30'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3949',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=475,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=107324,
    end_offset=107328,
    text_slice='那人道：',
    hash='sha256:acdc57c89aac845dd5803492a4664a2e3953a37f852c60b074e43038154214f3'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3950',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=475,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=107328,
    end_offset=107344,
    text_slice='“古人诗云‘蘼芜满院泣斜晖’。”',
    hash='sha256:28b10352fce9d279e12f7e04d0b0373a1a5e5f2ae0c9c7dae5d0ee4b21615bf9'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3951',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=475,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=107344,
    end_offset=107348,
    text_slice='众人道：',
    hash='sha256:9b7cfd35ec4e9995a55f0eb346ea28e5b8f08093983501e273ddcf11c98f91e8'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3952',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=475,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=107348,
    end_offset=107356,
    text_slice='“颓丧，颓丧！”',
    hash='sha256:f6b9975ff7be457115267759d95e33afbf04fb8763e2e9c2ec073377a3c95afb'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3953',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=475,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=107356,
    end_offset=107361,
    text_slice='又一人道：',
    hash='sha256:650a1ddd4ea4870d526bf5be9665786f1f71fced7c701b4805b8a4a7d393368b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3954',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=475,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=107361,
    end_offset=107376,
    text_slice='“我也有一联，诸公评阅评阅。”',
    hash='sha256:d0a3351f1d10fd262dd131713f0f7004824661c04e818859d49fec441b7d401c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3955',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=475,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=107376,
    end_offset=107380,
    text_slice='因念道：',
    hash='sha256:060f2a7dff64b4d4b8b1eb67c5db898c2d7b3ae41b2f5346b3665cb4a59f1a2f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3956',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=476,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=107382,
    end_offset=107398,
    text_slice='三径香风飘玉蕙，一庭明月照金兰。',
    hash='sha256:96c600bfe3bbeeee947b338a054896c7cca450866cbd5d8e08f09b143572855a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3957',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=477,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=107400,
    end_offset=107414,
    text_slice='贾政拈髯沉音，意欲也题一联。',
    hash='sha256:8942446b640c779e19df06808db00adef5f8518c8b9e446f59d347825633eaa7'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3958',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=477,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=107431,
    end_offset=107455,
    text_slice='“怎么你应说话时又不说了？还要等人请教你不成！”',
    hash='sha256:fbfd57823f4311b33d51d3f15cd3f17f3f0076ffe3bcc36cf9a42179f6b26b11'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3959',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=477,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=107455,
    end_offset=107464,
    text_slice='宝玉听说，便回道：',
    hash='sha256:9b2b143762dd3c8a02d8042113e4f5608b8f4ce22ee0aedbb3f428385ecb0aa4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3960',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=477,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=107464,
    end_offset=107510,
    text_slice='“此处并没有什么‘兰麝’，‘明月’，‘洲渚’之类，若要这样着迹说起来，就题二百联也不能完。”',
    hash='sha256:791fd1e748b219be53e71c7520c2c3f50755d5ea5bc42e7e50c7bc0fce36a49d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3961',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=477,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=107510,
    end_offset=107514,
    text_slice='贾政道：',
    hash='sha256:f33ef81bd4e7b413fce0b129e8c20ed9a8efdaf9e259c0802cebe3592ab015c1'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3962',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=477,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=107514,
    end_offset=107534,
    text_slice='“谁按着你的头，叫你必定说这些字样呢？”',
    hash='sha256:17d2e3ef5d51c3f03140af2176aaba42bcd1e23fc69027383aa4ecf2a5d4fcd4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3963',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=477,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=107534,
    end_offset=107557,
    text_slice='宝玉道：“如此说，匾上则莫若‘蘅芷清芬’四字。',
    hash='sha256:90e202bbb6b2d96c3c388834b527fc7e13e858b59f8967629e5f339ba70a464d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3964',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=478,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=107564,
    end_offset=107580,
    text_slice='吟成荳蔻才犹艳，睡足酴醾梦也香。',
    hash='sha256:61597d9533fa3f6a2cf43e61c0824f287e0d6412882bca4d6bc1f666a1481625'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3965',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=479,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=107582,
    end_offset=107587,
    text_slice='贾政笑道：',
    hash='sha256:c4e4801082157c7d737f1da99569399a3c2fa3dccb4bb75b4cca27092f01c1c6'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3966',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=479,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=107587,
    end_offset=107608,
    text_slice='“这是套的‘书成蕉叶文犹绿’，不足为奇。”',
    hash='sha256:19e480ac92a365d64ea7857d95cf7a5a84ff7b58b66a9e205f08b56a2750e19b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3967',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=479,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=107608,
    end_offset=107612,
    text_slice='众客道：',
    hash='sha256:91cc388fc56746f513eefd0cddb429c1bc623f93abff7f22e3f945a904232c1f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3968',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=479,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=107612,
    end_offset=107682,
    text_slice='“李太白‘凤凰台’之作，全套‘黄鹤楼’，只要套得妙。如今细评起来，方才这一联，竟比‘书成蕉叶’犹觉幽娴活泼。视‘书成’之句，竟似套此而来。”',
    hash='sha256:bbef8eda4b350e6d0102fd370b4c41ad35dfe352be6a526901977f3028e8e669'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3969',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=479,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=107682,
    end_offset=107687,
    text_slice='贾政笑说：',
    hash='sha256:a19d0e136616850aa82aa211b266c395da097869e484efb408216d7f54942687'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3970',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=479,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=107687,
    end_offset=107694,
    text_slice='“岂有此理！”',
    hash='sha256:eb4b4821c273f7024405185ae31c8ced9a13cca45b5b41f34a7c3469113c92ad'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3971',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=480,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=107696,
    end_offset=107704,
    text_slice='说着，大家出来。',
    hash='sha256:58554fa683d73ff54f11ee6e251a5bcf18cf970b25b9cff8543aaefe5d094ab7'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3972',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=480,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=107704,
    end_offset=107755,
    text_slice='行不多远，则见崇阁巍峨，层楼高起，面面琳宫合抱，迢迢复道萦纡；青松拂檐，玉栏绕砌，金辉兽面，彩焕螭头。',
    hash='sha256:8f55bd781da8ca0307a9e916000177f2738aac80393707cf5955708dcdb51654'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3973',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=480,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=107759,
    end_offset=107775,
    text_slice='“这是正殿了，只是太富丽了些。”',
    hash='sha256:38b5e3c4f47c12d9b7f393c2aebe50ecb138098275a5e453eae2acb3bb8ba631'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3974',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=480,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=107775,
    end_offset=107780,
    text_slice='众人都道：',
    hash='sha256:45d478b58b8f745c68040b83a789074bbb7b89eed8407b4b9a621ea054fdb6ac'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3975',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=480,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=107780,
    end_offset=107820,
    text_slice='“要如此方是。虽然贵妃崇节尚俭，天性恶繁悦朴，然今日之尊，礼仪如此，不为过也。”',
    hash='sha256:b06685c2d4068d5a23034176857c386281c77d3ae9b6812ca745d842b485b75d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3976',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=480,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=107820,
    end_offset=107854,
    text_slice='一面说，一面走，只见正面现出一座玉石牌坊来，上面龙蟠螭护，玲珑凿就。',
    hash='sha256:649c850e80ad4507c0cf998eec7ca11e58dfa83e35f09d6e0c8d3e059f0de810'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3977',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=480,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=107858,
    end_offset=107867,
    text_slice='“此处书以何文？”',
    hash='sha256:4ae94d708b6759165900fed7adeccb3d55b7a56de11506df68be63dfead9e77b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3978',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=480,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=107867,
    end_offset=107871,
    text_slice='众人道：',
    hash='sha256:9b7cfd35ec4e9995a55f0eb346ea28e5b8f08093983501e273ddcf11c98f91e8'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3979',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=480,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=107871,
    end_offset=107884,
    text_slice='“必是‘蓬莱仙境’方妙。”',
    hash='sha256:551326dc1be991a6e4c270910d56e83cf6beba651c5aa1dbdbc3922cec356f21'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3980',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=480,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=107884,
    end_offset=107891,
    text_slice='贾政摇头不语。',
    hash='sha256:5c0b8b262d4f166159d07aff997f203784af92a7f92694267b8c0a0109e0d47e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3981',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=480,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=107891,
    end_offset=107937,
    text_slice='宝玉见了这个所在，心中忽有所动，寻思起来，倒像那里曾见过的一般，却一时想不起那年月日的事了。',
    hash='sha256:3ab3edb158245eb12606454441bbf7ea0a87e4588642ca14432416589748f773'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3982',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=480,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=107937,
    end_offset=107961,
    text_slice='贾政又命他作题，宝玉只顾细思前景，全无心于此了。',
    hash='sha256:6ea36d43c33dbb3092a47ccf6668b143bc26aff094f9acf4bedd14be4ac15e26'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3983',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=480,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=107961,
    end_offset=108012,
    text_slice='众人不知其意，只当他受了这半日的折磨，精神耗散，才尽词穷了；再要考难逼迫，着了急，或生出事来，倒不便。',
    hash='sha256:063caef972f4516d3f3fa944a11b7071fc39ff0c87d8335fb959229797cdfc4b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3984',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=480,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=108019,
    end_offset=108032,
    text_slice='“罢，罢，明日再题罢了。”',
    hash='sha256:e6f97829eaabc0d90a7cc4a736fac45d392d3618261584b8010cac36f9a248b9'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3985',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=480,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=108032,
    end_offset=108049,
    text_slice='贾政心中也怕贾母不放心，遂冷笑道：',
    hash='sha256:83fbd29fecd9294bedb8d64c9576545521c3f5ebaab94c7979ea6620bb18804e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3986',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=480,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=108049,
    end_offset=108099,
    text_slice='“你这畜生，也竟有不能之时了。也罢，限你一日，明日若再不能，我定不饶。这是要紧一处，更要好生作来！”',
    hash='sha256:6f4d506cfef08e4e15337fbc047694d2156f7a2423af11b88f843a35ebb38b18'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3987',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=481,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=108101,
    end_offset=108134,
    text_slice='说着，引人出来，再一观望，原来自进门起，所行至此，才游了十之五六。',
    hash='sha256:18e2b8e7af544d82a6e96f25bd603b470a26cd9655e4de6effa428a15c2b63a2'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3988',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=481,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=108134,
    end_offset=108150,
    text_slice='又值人来回，有雨村处遣人来回话。',
    hash='sha256:21db54625c7eca5dad619b8a4895fd396c844024b86dba3f107aa6b5c9dd912b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3989',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=481,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=108155,
    end_offset=108189,
    text_slice='“此数处不能游了。虽如此，到底从那一边出去，纵不能细观，也可稍览。”',
    hash='sha256:8f410331908d4f55c8b92fd9f98f700f7b187d7f294ed6ac40db3b069e95cc57'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3990',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=481,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=108189,
    end_offset=108213,
    text_slice='说着，引客行来，至一大桥前，见水如晶帘一般奔入。',
    hash='sha256:2c930eb56dac4634bde3779d5e730ff42088bff51688348c7b24af077c572894'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3991',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=481,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=108213,
    end_offset=108231,
    text_slice='原来这桥便是通外河之闸，引泉而入者。',
    hash='sha256:27f1af715bb934ff46557884cf3e2c514e745fdb5b5e5183c87bf5c6527d264f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3992',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=481,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=108236,
    end_offset=108243,
    text_slice='“此闸何名？”',
    hash='sha256:31972aa6057151205dd49e208c2226c869b63b5e0ad57836b63054cbd17d1ec1'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3993',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=481,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=108243,
    end_offset=108247,
    text_slice='宝玉道：',
    hash='sha256:10c9e1a43f0e2e5bf2e54f50fb3dbede512eb436326aec72d14625e62153e9b0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3994',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=481,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=108247,
    end_offset=108266,
    text_slice='“此乃沁芳泉之正源，就名‘沁芳闸’。”',
    hash='sha256:6a2a7898a492c7c6a42acdd0e22bbbbca65f83ab3be6fb37bcc92de6cf861c69'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3995',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=481,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=108266,
    end_offset=108270,
    text_slice='贾政道：',
    hash='sha256:f33ef81bd4e7b413fce0b129e8c20ed9a8efdaf9e259c0802cebe3592ab015c1'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3996',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=481,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=108270,
    end_offset=108285,
    text_slice='“胡说！偏不用‘沁芳’二字。”',
    hash='sha256:e65ca5c787153eab7e88b6b5dd8d36802a5800cd5e144da7a4ab660db38ab581'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3997',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=482,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=108287,
    end_offset=108352,
    text_slice='于是一路行来，或清堂，或茅舍；或堆石为垣，或编花为牖；或山下得幽尼佛寺，或林中藏女道丹房；或长廊曲洞，或方厦圆亭，贾政皆不及进去。',
    hash='sha256:e10312045a49f69916d613a4e6805c6cd14c9f5406e1098555c342ce768a5c49'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3998',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=482,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=108352,
    end_offset=108364,
    text_slice='因说半日腿酸，未尝歇息。',
    hash='sha256:3377949c1def49ee00beed53576d7940779074dcee4f37dd5a7050fdd960cdf6'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_3999',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=482,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=108383,
    end_offset=108397,
    text_slice='“到此可要进去歇息歇息了。”',
    hash='sha256:5c584f84a16dea9571121d8f80805d22c8d2b4052b1297131195d34992dd72bd'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4000',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=482,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=108397,
    end_offset=108437,
    text_slice='说着，一径引人绕着碧桃花，穿过一层竹篱花障编就的月洞门，俄见粉墙环护，绿柳周垂。',
    hash='sha256:3457aa0812af3e97986cfcc8986b0e046de3990f8c7b97d79c11208f2424bb1a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4001',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=482,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=108437,
    end_offset=108458,
    text_slice='贾政与众人进去，一入门，两边俱是游廊相接。',
    hash='sha256:fd97e611a8627f8a36b8c69c61ffdb4f06e6f10285d45185dba9d4112417d810'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4002',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=482,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=108458,
    end_offset=108503,
    text_slice='院中点衬几块山石，一边种着数本芭蕉，那一边乃是一棵西府海棠，其势若伞，丝垂翠缕，葩吐丹砂。',
    hash='sha256:80428177a4450eceac09d0e51d5dcba1e33737e43076acc2d4792da3efc8ee04'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4003',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=482,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=108508,
    end_offset=108534,
    text_slice='“好花，好花！从来也见过许多海棠，哪里有这样妙的。”',
    hash='sha256:09b7c435d160a8b8b01a4a53e6803b1f2e5e2a8241db2361be9389f7737b2318'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4004',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=482,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=108534,
    end_offset=108538,
    text_slice='贾政道：',
    hash='sha256:f33ef81bd4e7b413fce0b129e8c20ed9a8efdaf9e259c0802cebe3592ab015c1'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4005',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=482,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=108538,
    end_offset=108585,
    text_slice='“这叫作‘女儿棠’，乃是外国之种。俗传系出‘女儿国’中，云彼国此种最盛，亦荒唐不经之说罢了。”',
    hash='sha256:03a6d4d01c86aba1616f2a46983cc11a6f087e5734252ecbcab21446c49c56f3'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4006',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=482,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=108585,
    end_offset=108590,
    text_slice='众人笑道：',
    hash='sha256:fec7ea0793d55abb41c663a1be418ec6593044408f49f0e8af795fbf821ce100'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4007',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=482,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=108590,
    end_offset=108605,
    text_slice='“然虽不经，如何此名传久了？”',
    hash='sha256:4f45149c4ff8a07d1e105fa4c778301003bb076637c52451d37e4518e1270003'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4008',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=482,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=108605,
    end_offset=108609,
    text_slice='宝玉道：',
    hash='sha256:10c9e1a43f0e2e5bf2e54f50fb3dbede512eb436326aec72d14625e62153e9b0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4009',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=482,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=108609,
    end_offset=108688,
    text_slice='“大约骚人咏士，以此花之色红晕若施脂，轻弱似扶病，大近乎闺阁风度，所以以‘女儿’命名。想因被世间俗恶听了，他便以野史纂入为证，以俗传俗，以讹传讹，都认真了。”',
    hash='sha256:199d25f7c3cf0bb36a68bd08ef4ffeab44fa43c47bd6f3ecffa2ee181cc53e7a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4010',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=482,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=108688,
    end_offset=108696,
    text_slice='众人都摇身赞妙。',
    hash='sha256:b885d7e35028545afd3754dc18aaef15529813d539feb1ba4da1c6ea1c5289c4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4011',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=483,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=108698,
    end_offset=108720,
    text_slice='一面说话，一面都在廊外抱厦下打就的榻上坐了。',
    hash='sha256:5f7a0456daf85a49a8db6b4dab7f5713f987619882834729d1f6d6aa51bbc397'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4012',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=483,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=108725,
    end_offset=108739,
    text_slice='“想几个什么新鲜字来题此？”',
    hash='sha256:1409299a3ec4ccd059db32d78b20e517db7693b4c05a411c4f7f93470c4267f4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4013',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=483,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=108739,
    end_offset=108752,
    text_slice='一客道：‘蕉鹤’二字最妙。',
    hash='sha256:6819546add6da51fc80e5b34f93281a9d04cef574d25750e91f46e1ed9ca0d90'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4014',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=483,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=108752,
    end_offset=108759,
    text_slice='“又一个道：”',
    hash='sha256:e82a857f844e1c272f688ea2398a90ff4a57d59cd669ea9e95eb24236703bc95'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4015',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=483,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=108759,
    end_offset=108768,
    text_slice='‘崇光泛彩’方妙。',
    hash='sha256:f54f0600845142fcc0bc4f15562b649c66a18423eeb7a06be1c1deb726af3eb9'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4016',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=483,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=108768,
    end_offset=108778,
    text_slice='“贾政与众人都道：”',
    hash='sha256:3afb2c31e9f15e78b47d6bd112a21a8206bead4932bc87a5d966e53e11553b0e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4017',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=483,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=108778,
    end_offset=108787,
    text_slice='好个‘崇光泛彩’！',
    hash='sha256:9ad9cebbe928aac6dcaf8e476a2d203053971617d32dcffc2127a83c470be005'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4018',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=483,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=108787,
    end_offset=108794,
    text_slice='“宝玉也道：”',
    hash='sha256:7f8f8688cafb232f11eecc6d7a4816600c04289fa9f679fde55ecd1418fe0077'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4019',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=483,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=108794,
    end_offset=108797,
    text_slice='妙极！',
    hash='sha256:fe93938eebd7ea7876b21d6f7024a2d0d8b6ca0e9356e6757e59afeed3325883'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4020',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=483,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=108797,
    end_offset=108802,
    text_slice='“又叹：”',
    hash='sha256:a2227e68976954a49f282fed1f5fbd5fe82a10764c17552c1781543f394a7442'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4021',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=483,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=108802,
    end_offset=108808,
    text_slice='只是可惜了。',
    hash='sha256:74f3cb93e3e81df8515fe59afa53fd27134f3936513d7c728c9c8d1acc9385a9'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4022',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=483,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=108808,
    end_offset=108814,
    text_slice='“众人问：”',
    hash='sha256:89c65e26b2366367d9fea0d377e8d5facc68784620f01e0590cdf6cee0cb23b5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4023',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=483,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=108814,
    end_offset=108819,
    text_slice='如何可惜？',
    hash='sha256:e9b0fc5b8470bd86a1912347e6e40aef4bef77b1613e6d48232ad20f5d964b6d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4024',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=483,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=108819,
    end_offset=108825,
    text_slice='“宝玉道：”',
    hash='sha256:11d7a2c1003a9d64df3bd80b552d8151e90093898a82ad8bd2a2868303d22563'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4025',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=483,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=108825,
    end_offset=108849,
    text_slice='‘处蕉、棠两植，其意暗蓄’红‘、’绿‘二字在内。',
    hash='sha256:c6cbcc52865808e3b3b0f3edf82b41fc75ba8126d3ad95ea80f0c8b5a1301fae'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4026',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=483,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=108849,
    end_offset=108871,
    text_slice='若只说蕉，则棠无着落；若只说棠，蕉亦无着落。',
    hash='sha256:fb543b15bd5c72c63134999e2be124aced65997d3a4dc86c613e9d4db57e9e95'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4027',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=483,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=108871,
    end_offset=108887,
    text_slice='固有蕉无棠不可，有棠无蕉更不可。',
    hash='sha256:4ea7099663f5831ac2a72fd87c3e0a3ae156595455791381679173b7a7b105d9'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4028',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=483,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=108887,
    end_offset=108893,
    text_slice='“贾政道：”',
    hash='sha256:f150980c1fb844744765c5ba813237a4b4c96175ac933603e7f9529b76c58a39'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4029',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=483,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=108893,
    end_offset=108898,
    text_slice='依你如何？',
    hash='sha256:fb8c05a9d3702f85cb3604709678802b4f0430c8c7c91d80541c126d9a8fba84'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4030',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=483,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=108898,
    end_offset=108904,
    text_slice='“宝玉道：”',
    hash='sha256:11d7a2c1003a9d64df3bd80b552d8151e90093898a82ad8bd2a2868303d22563'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4031',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=483,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=108904,
    end_offset=108923,
    text_slice='依我，题’红香绿玉‘四字，方两全其妙。',
    hash='sha256:fc5a3b8aa7e30d61f85209d584927a3d9582438ee324b1d56f337f5421204793'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4032',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=483,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=108923,
    end_offset=108931,
    text_slice='“贾政摇头道：”',
    hash='sha256:2028c1fbe482f49d4314c2d841395139a0d29986dde2017fa05ba0a88f34d255'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4033',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=483,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=108931,
    end_offset=108937,
    text_slice='不好，不好！',
    hash='sha256:6ffe00d1d7c2368cbffc71fd024bcb916273512fb12e405f37847254dceecb34'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4034',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=484,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=108940,
    end_offset=108950,
    text_slice='说着，引人进入房内。',
    hash='sha256:c765c3a033064f004836e314364c99785c209cca4f423fb24314e67656e09dbc'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4035',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=484,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=108950,
    end_offset=108975,
    text_slice='只见这几间房内收拾得与别处不同，竟分不出间隔来的。',
    hash='sha256:ee9c2b28b40778fe8390f6fff8175b9e6e401e2a50ff18d4716f9ddaf400c871'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4036',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=484,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=108989,
    end_offset=108995,
    text_slice='“流云百蝠”',
    hash='sha256:b7e2c7673c5c5412cc2525e979f4be01ee13561948eabd6ae3c08860e4e1de59'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4037',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=484,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=108995,
    end_offset=108997,
    text_slice='，或',
    hash='sha256:b6317a47633cf46cf9ef571adee423c08b7673e054463ccf796df86e011aeaff'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4038',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=484,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=108997,
    end_offset=109003,
    text_slice='“岁寒三友”',
    hash='sha256:1b54f65d07595a8a670bf88289897387abe2c949c7b746e02a3bf85abbe3473e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4039',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=484,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=109003,
    end_offset=109050,
    text_slice='，或山水人物，或翎毛花卉，或集锦，或博古，或卍福卍寿，各种花样，皆是名手雕镂，五彩销金嵌宝的。',
    hash='sha256:9364e595b9cee0175ea711a879aae4927145f5b93bf9fa3fa9617dcc9653463e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4040',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=484,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=109050,
    end_offset=109086,
    text_slice='一槅一槅，或有贮书处，或有设鼎处，或安置笔砚处，或供花设瓶、安放盆景处。',
    hash='sha256:09d06b860e504401af92257a2404665c5cd39d884cb56861a3cc743c47f4b10a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4041',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=484,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=109086,
    end_offset=109111,
    text_slice='其槅各式各样，或天圆地方，或葵花蕉叶，或连环半璧。',
    hash='sha256:91aed73e0ad96631396756d04598a9ca1c4477f08c03d1f9f72b0dabcb5d0f79'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4042',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=484,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=109111,
    end_offset=109123,
    text_slice='真是花团锦簇，剔透玲珑。',
    hash='sha256:a707e5c2f3fb5fd0c01a59e909daaf31d5168dd76ff04522b6da6113726d3feb'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4043',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=484,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=109123,
    end_offset=109148,
    text_slice='倏尔五色纱糊就，竟系小窗；倏尔彩凌轻覆，竟系幽户。',
    hash='sha256:eac6507fa16406a5efb09285a6db53551cb2455948b54e32c75d47ac84a9b825'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4044',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=484,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=109148,
    end_offset=109170,
    text_slice='且满墙满壁，皆系随依古董玩器之形抠成的槽子。',
    hash='sha256:7864455edc9dd90cd2d4b418f393bf9873e53a1d61872e8dcab6922c1bad9ff8'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4045',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=484,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=109170,
    end_offset=109198,
    text_slice='诸如琴、剑、悬瓶、桌屏之类，虽悬于壁，却都是与壁相平的。',
    hash='sha256:43ca994430b51d20280effc3c6f9f3a797934342e4ac11a7086da241cf508e2d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4046',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=484,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=109203,
    end_offset=109218,
    text_slice='“好精致想头！难为怎么想来！”',
    hash='sha256:87c47335eb22e1bc5963e3e5fe1c643dc6bbd872c9d6e23af33092e97ad748a4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4047',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=485,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=109220,
    end_offset=109272,
    text_slice='原来贾政等走了进来，未进两层，便都迷了旧路，左瞧也有门可通，右瞧又有窗暂隔，及到了跟前，又被一架书挡住。',
    hash='sha256:280b24bec43737eba552444340e189b6549d89bc81e252fae1c26cc9ce2be49d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4048',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=485,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=109272,
    end_offset=109326,
    text_slice='回头再走，又有窗纱明透，门径可行；及至门前，忽见迎面也进来了一群人，都与自己形相一样，却是一架玻璃大镜相照。',
    hash='sha256:a08a5e5af76c7a579106bd58d1d892d03b13bafbff6c2dc8643d50746f0c64b5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4049',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=485,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=109326,
    end_offset=109340,
    text_slice='及转过镜去，越发见门子多了。',
    hash='sha256:4cbc3026a6773ac7c1b37e53f5625a8d34ce964690d269fd2cd51fb8b10bb3a1'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4050',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=485,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=109345,
    end_offset=109376,
    text_slice='“老爷随我来。从这门出去，便是后院；从后院出去，倒比先近了。”',
    hash='sha256:ae0fe567e0f0e8e8437bae64128f7fbeb7f4c89667cdf9b29f684b2aa6250d98'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4051',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=485,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=109376,
    end_offset=109406,
    text_slice='说着，又转了两层纱橱锦槅，果得一门出去，院中满架蔷薇、宝相。',
    hash='sha256:7165eaa132860aaabd638933931ec448d730d208ac27ec5e9761710617a02ae3'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4052',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=485,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=109406,
    end_offset=109418,
    text_slice='转过花障，则见青溪前阻。',
    hash='sha256:766213ffa4fe00c14445b90a0e99a570ef353a20a481d53290adc15d5b77f376'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4053',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=485,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=109423,
    end_offset=109435,
    text_slice='“这股水又是从何而来？”',
    hash='sha256:f3e03a945de6d995f46c01c32958fcbe9373806bf0cc810dcca5d87cdc967b01'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4054',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=485,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=109435,
    end_offset=109441,
    text_slice='贾珍遥指道：',
    hash='sha256:0272c41fad3cca95dce8a83c06c2e1830bf49526c0b4774a429fff2529e73449'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4055',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=485,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=109441,
    end_offset=109501,
    text_slice='“原从那闸起流至那洞口，从东北山坳里引到那村庄里，又开一道岔口，引到西南上，共总流到这里，仍旧合在一处，从那墙下出去。”',
    hash='sha256:2c8a9873b5537c57341e389b7043a99315cb8a0218c520c628b9e27bb0e6e9be'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4056',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=485,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=109501,
    end_offset=109509,
    text_slice='众人听了，都道：',
    hash='sha256:6951871f42521dc4b81ecc000bc31d412898f5c75060cda671709e63576688c4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4057',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=485,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=109509,
    end_offset=109516,
    text_slice='“神妙之极！”',
    hash='sha256:28dc96a5c01e6c0047bacf82d5c4b4ac1e34ead8c6709fa35267a77983ec0329'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4058',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=485,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=109516,
    end_offset=109526,
    text_slice='说着，忽见大山阻路。',
    hash='sha256:82fb52761a15c87c485f23d7edceee11b8aa1bb29c0cb9f2df4f51306ff8c298'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4059',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=485,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=109530,
    end_offset=109537,
    text_slice='“迷了路了。”',
    hash='sha256:8ae8001a2f731023aabf35d2bd3b80a72fe3ebff3233f4608e0bbe2b6ba5cb36'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4060',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=485,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=109537,
    end_offset=109542,
    text_slice='贾珍笑道：',
    hash='sha256:63b4c161a5484b96e4ab3ce051a57823c9c2253a8859a27eccfa65cc01a5b275'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4061',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=485,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=109542,
    end_offset=109548,
    text_slice='“随我来。”',
    hash='sha256:ae83307938aad3c18894ce1ced3b7279b3e477ba965924d7ceb3913392f752ad'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4062',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=485,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=109548,
    end_offset=109583,
    text_slice='仍在前导引，众人随他直由山脚边忽一转，便是平坦宽阔大路，豁然大门前现。',
    hash='sha256:981ea1cc87d5553670317a9ee12f057f412b1ff286cf1e32bff31082e106b059'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4063',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=485,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=109588,
    end_offset=109604,
    text_slice='“有趣，有趣，真搜神夺巧之至！”',
    hash='sha256:259fb5d7e078948966bbb5524bea7d623f61102b37f47bf7a5a86bdea5efcdb0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4064',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=485,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=109604,
    end_offset=109611,
    text_slice='于是大家出来。',
    hash='sha256:8c6990a67c612af89ebdbcd10b2521591416891c666759225c3042e7a8eb0a79'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4065',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=486,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=109613,
    end_offset=109641,
    text_slice='那宝玉一心只记挂着里边，又不见贾政吩咐，少不得跟到书房。',
    hash='sha256:30f5e509ecb01b1097c4d2765137a8cf2c207a18140f4ccd9ea3cd79ad212934'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4066',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=486,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=109641,
    end_offset=109659,
    text_slice='贾政忽想起他来，方喝道：“你还不去？',
    hash='sha256:c7308d13cef12a842bf873f53005268d964fecce482051c369b7edfc7c3aa9e2'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4067',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=486,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=109659,
    end_offset=109666,
    text_slice='难道还逛不足！',
    hash='sha256:a1d16996dcbb156da2c1044cf54aefc0939c2bad69965ac65deaa99afbf21de8'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4068',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=486,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=109666,
    end_offset=109683,
    text_slice='也不想逛了这半日，老太太必悬挂着。',
    hash='sha256:5b5243778ff7fe69ad7382e69278686e0cf96f490d4ff54d1b63f242bc192c5d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4069',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=486,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=109683,
    end_offset=109694,
    text_slice='快进去，疼你也白疼了！',
    hash='sha256:a8a822292191d64dcb24932ded068d4cbf0cfb8681617278706e9c4519d1bb24'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4070',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=486,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=109694,
    end_offset=109706,
    text_slice='”宝玉听说，方退了出来。',
    hash='sha256:0237b64ca7919a4c813b0db000d05e25493636bbc8d1671039e917a480c16317'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4071',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=486,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=109706,
    end_offset=109713,
    text_slice='再听下回分解。',
    hash='sha256:125594a842711969d03adeffcd352d63b2979fc94a485001ec5c638f3d9fd1bf'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4072',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=487,
    segment_type='heading',
    start_offset=109715,
    end_offset=109738,
    text_slice='第十八回  林黛玉误剪香袋囊\u3000贾元春归省庆元宵',
    hash='sha256:be49465aa4f42e23fb64a26ed38224c33a6ed9468d061be35571851c32cd0830'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4073',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=488,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=109740,
    end_offset=109769,
    text_slice='却说宝玉来至院外，就有跟贾政的几个小厮上来拦腰抱住，都说：',
    hash='sha256:2231be03ed59c383c33fdd61af21ddfdb1c8b1b3d5a64ad5f2f5b864caf18e96'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4074',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=488,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=109769,
    end_offset=109856,
    text_slice='“今儿亏了我们，老爷才喜欢，老太太打发人出来问了几遍，都亏我们回说喜欢，若不然，老太太叫你进去，就不得展才了。人人都说，你那些诗比众人都强。今儿得了这样的彩头。该赏我们了。”',
    hash='sha256:e0687da1bf7391aa26617de9b23f749a4782e41ead2a00cd87ff02126bf9fdd3'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4075',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=488,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=109856,
    end_offset=109861,
    text_slice='宝玉笑道：',
    hash='sha256:4010737831077115327a930fc031b5caa442f6aca950d1b4be97c2a32a759b5c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4076',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=488,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=109861,
    end_offset=109869,
    text_slice='“每人一吊钱。”',
    hash='sha256:d1a6b7cca1b3664e97f17c5d1801c58b6b1185be6c63cc878e69d1da304b8e6b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4077',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=488,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=109869,
    end_offset=109873,
    text_slice='众人道：',
    hash='sha256:9b7cfd35ec4e9995a55f0eb346ea28e5b8f08093983501e273ddcf11c98f91e8'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4078',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=488,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=109873,
    end_offset=109891,
    text_slice='“谁没见那一吊钱！把这荷包赏了罢。”',
    hash='sha256:4bb646bd1e6feba1342e1ed8bae559e841e5343b71e4f82be1b8df4844829d6d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4079',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=488,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=109891,
    end_offset=109927,
    text_slice='说着，一个上来解荷包，那一个就解扇囊，不容分说，将宝玉所佩之物尽行解去。',
    hash='sha256:bb77c3a58407f23abd5ada41e372afa9b06b91a542e6136c11cb08d723ca6980'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4080',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=488,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=109930,
    end_offset=109939,
    text_slice='“好生送上去罢。”',
    hash='sha256:b40d396ae88f49166130a850adf4b86e9b47e500c43fc65b4d342af04edc03b4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4081',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=488,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=109939,
    end_offset=109959,
    text_slice='一个抱了起来，几个围绕，送至贾母二门前。',
    hash='sha256:f27022c380720ad0ef9dd9afc0e66cc3263b502867567f30ad0fb154880f2fe6'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4082',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=488,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=109959,
    end_offset=110002,
    text_slice='那时，贾母已命人看了几次，众奶娘、丫鬟跟上来，见过贾母，知不曾难为着他，心中自是喜欢。',
    hash='sha256:e10557b55e8d650e4c4e2446f4aa40a12e74ffe895846b6013d09a672168a6ce'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4083',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=489,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=110004,
    end_offset=110028,
    text_slice='少时，袭人倒了茶来，见身边佩物一件无存，因笑道：',
    hash='sha256:e8e5584503ff234546dba72f74df0399497ceeacdc87beacafb300431a44c8e3'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4084',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=489,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=110028,
    end_offset=110048,
    text_slice='“戴的东西又是那起没脸的东西解了去了？”',
    hash='sha256:ac7e7828f62a93e9a77514ea749bb561c1f2238df2637d7d63c206d293e1e931'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4085',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=489,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=110048,
    end_offset=110072,
    text_slice='林黛玉听说，走来瞧瞧，果然一件无存，因向宝玉道：',
    hash='sha256:a39b36be638f3dfe4fbb7d5d75be82d43ad78762283dfb82b45f767b8c7a079c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4086',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=489,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=110072,
    end_offset=110103,
    text_slice='“我给的那个荷包也给他们了？你明儿再想我的东西，可不能够了！”',
    hash='sha256:0b571b32875d79b7f4dd6ecccf0b9f944ae554ef46c6ff1bbe8d2fb34bb30dd6'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4087',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=489,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=110103,
    end_offset=110143,
    text_slice='说毕，赌气回房，将前日宝玉所烦她做的那个香袋儿――才做了一半――赌气拿过来就铰。',
    hash='sha256:d8a30ae6335b471b401ca72c334a81ef2925112db8b4f1e90725738b94887a4b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4088',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=489,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=110143,
    end_offset=110165,
    text_slice='宝玉见她生气，便知不妥，忙赶过来，早剪破了。',
    hash='sha256:c796a9cecafb3b000c339dc5da1c2610aa60f2b72f2f602f9ef7f408a421af96'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4089',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=489,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=110165,
    end_offset=110192,
    text_slice='宝玉已见过这香囊，虽尚未完，却十分精巧，费了许多工夫。',
    hash='sha256:1234853d4fca670c541207f3bd8c6a64748fc77a770b9c95184093fe992bc096'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4090',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=489,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=110192,
    end_offset=110204,
    text_slice='今见无故剪了，却也可气。',
    hash='sha256:ef11b4902067e0885841c8b5a98724fcd6e806b7ca8d2463c5d22101dbbf4c82'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4091',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=489,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=110240,
    end_offset=110264,
    text_slice='“你瞧瞧，这是什么！我那一回把你的东西给人了？”',
    hash='sha256:12506dc32ab30a9930230986165bc252bbf1809446a92f8e18ffbe0a290e53fb'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4092',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=489,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=110264,
    end_offset=110307,
    text_slice='黛玉见他如此珍重，带在里面，可知是怕人拿去之意，因此又自悔莽撞，未见皂白，就剪了香袋。',
    hash='sha256:a8f6e26c07d77a788649e5ecf3ad52731102140a165d6a146d29251f3d694655'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4093',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=489,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=110307,
    end_offset=110321,
    text_slice='因此又愧又气，低头一言不发。',
    hash='sha256:cd50fe8b02e73957eee89baaf53276ea87efb25356fa4b4a59abb1df4059a527'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4094',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=489,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=110325,
    end_offset=110356,
    text_slice='“你也不用剪，我知道你是懒待给我东西。我连这荷包奉还，何如？”',
    hash='sha256:07e6e391dd63476e2cd9c0196fd491fb073cf0a0a9b29258a5d34ab6b43f131a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4095',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=489,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=110356,
    end_offset=110367,
    text_slice='说着，掷向她怀中便走。',
    hash='sha256:2d8f2d08f85010d971fa7a3a66237b787352b3df63c0568728707e4a93dfe728'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4096',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=489,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=110367,
    end_offset=110401,
    text_slice='黛玉见如此，越发气起来，声咽气堵，又汪汪的滚下泪来，拿起荷包来又剪。',
    hash='sha256:6a8c64638253766dd48b2bfde13a89d9e6e0d9919ba661d18be7f9bb0c48f27f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4097',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=489,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=110417,
    end_offset=110428,
    text_slice='“好妹妹，饶了它罢！”',
    hash='sha256:2d4333f9b37ca6ed7675187fc7b6f5a272bceec274d0373ad547af51b025246f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4098',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=489,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=110428,
    end_offset=110441,
    text_slice='黛玉将剪子一摔，拭泪说道：',
    hash='sha256:2ee10e6885b41349e648284293e81dae5c0ceccf84f83215e04f448b592e898d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4099',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=489,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=110441,
    end_offset=110470,
    text_slice='“你不用同我好一阵歹一阵的，要恼，就撂开手。这当了什么！”',
    hash='sha256:3f0b980513d7c54723b595da1f2f6b29ad20d28b39ac71191bc3c14714b5f074'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4100',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=489,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=110470,
    end_offset=110486,
    text_slice='说着，赌气上床，面向里倒下拭泪。',
    hash='sha256:0c35e0edb85d13acc83ae78f02c38ce24b7a24234c3cde4a6874ed81f40ec98d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4101',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=489,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=110493,
    end_offset=110497,
    text_slice='“妹妹”',
    hash='sha256:2134de5f15b677092aec42cb82c9aeb0f20c40808a99f31f477e8369680712a9'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4102',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=489,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=110497,
    end_offset=110498,
    text_slice='长',
    hash='sha256:597ae23d84d4eac2ff048cf385cea0f35cae68896a8524107eb15a154b978af3'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4103',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=489,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=110498,
    end_offset=110502,
    text_slice='“妹妹”',
    hash='sha256:2134de5f15b677092aec42cb82c9aeb0f20c40808a99f31f477e8369680712a9'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4104',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=489,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=110502,
    end_offset=110507,
    text_slice='短赔不是。',
    hash='sha256:4632849c2d073b253c13936291dc224a349cbc3a45bd2262f3a867a13e55d675'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4105',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=490,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=110509,
    end_offset=110520,
    text_slice='前面贾母一片声找宝玉。',
    hash='sha256:cf2d6d1e6db9a4e2731f2f5e107326c07ea0349d5d2a99e52c9a301eabc5b59c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4106',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=490,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=110531,
    end_offset=110541,
    text_slice='“在林姑娘房里呢。”',
    hash='sha256:258e0f723704415cc7d5cd428e6eabd18a8172d5da371802562d3f28998954f2'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4107',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=490,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=110541,
    end_offset=110547,
    text_slice='贾母听说道：',
    hash='sha256:ead33f238e0bce9f0094551e1a8ffb7f065b4cff5acf5405e7187b10409738f9'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4108',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=490,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=110547,
    end_offset=110600,
    text_slice='“好，好，好！让他姊妹们一处玩玩罢。才他老子拘了他这半天，让他开心一会子罢，只别叫他们拌嘴，不许扭了他。”',
    hash='sha256:7425fa08290f2d17f3df47572c5e67a39c643370650f61a4fa65e457c22d5764'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4109',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=490,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=110600,
    end_offset=110606,
    text_slice='众人答应着。',
    hash='sha256:a9073804b1ab904dc55de133337da09210c3823d0a5ddaf280a6e2cf88932f51'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4110',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=490,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=110621,
    end_offset=110639,
    text_slice='“你的意思不叫我安生，我就离了你。”',
    hash='sha256:b4f297795b9040b1beef3d98a32d3567228f16c37e856c51372b5a81d456768b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4111',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=490,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=110639,
    end_offset=110646,
    text_slice='说着往外就走。',
    hash='sha256:21426e535dd79609e703a41937d680e1e7a41166ffc21085964115cf28848dd8'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4112',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=490,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=110651,
    end_offset=110664,
    text_slice='“你到哪里，我跟到那里。”',
    hash='sha256:74a5d2ae0f88660e4a880ec0fac8a62a89fde07030b3c0c9c4bf36fff893284d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4113',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=490,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=110664,
    end_offset=110675,
    text_slice='一面仍拿起荷包来带上。',
    hash='sha256:d2726d32e62e4e07b32a19bce14ec3ef1177a667ae4913401a262ba50c633b59'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4114',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=490,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=110682,
    end_offset=110705,
    text_slice='“你说不要了，这会子又带上，我也替你怪臊的！”',
    hash='sha256:e239cc4d773f958004d219432239ecbc2c238c0b017a814c234f883f2d898d12'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4115',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=490,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=110705,
    end_offset=110708,
    text_slice='说着，',
    hash='sha256:b903d311dcee4ba5ae5b15b6771a711701c2892b85282d461ba935d71230332c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4116',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=490,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=110708,
    end_offset=110711,
    text_slice='“嗤”',
    hash='sha256:89f6d910cb3cbba47b77e9e14c6355891b7fa311f3b1ba08fa128a9a2366cb61'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4117',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=490,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=110711,
    end_offset=110718,
    text_slice='的一声又笑了。',
    hash='sha256:310893e0645c1e385a89e5aed439bfc9271f3b08c012771831f726660d4879ac'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4118',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=490,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=110722,
    end_offset=110740,
    text_slice='“好妹妹，明儿另替我作个香袋儿罢！”',
    hash='sha256:29d69e1afad5c7b2c9208a9931c78083413206b97785f325fb2e881f27ec1323'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4119',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=490,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=110740,
    end_offset=110744,
    text_slice='黛玉道：',
    hash='sha256:e1608e3669e13bd2ad429b5caf8a6374d9c98e7e77047fb494ca22f634cf5d6f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4120',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=490,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=110744,
    end_offset=110756,
    text_slice='“那也只瞧我高兴罢了。”',
    hash='sha256:bad90e113319f761b9c1acc99178292f34875db1832a40146b990ad52579293c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4121',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=490,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=110756,
    end_offset=110777,
    text_slice='一面说，一面二人出房，到王夫人上房中去了。',
    hash='sha256:01cca6e3f58638952323d9401a567117ec2a16ce56828b6c861453f86d827140'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4122',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=490,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=110777,
    end_offset=110786,
    text_slice='可巧宝钗亦在那里。',
    hash='sha256:8c5d38a94f39181756eefeac800c6cd081f5722d05e10800c7763746715cc540'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4123',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=491,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=110788,
    end_offset=110801,
    text_slice='此时，王夫人那边热闹非常。',
    hash='sha256:b9411382bd891df7922cde4f220bef31baccc0c1ee45f024583904186fd4c3ef'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4124',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=491,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=110801,
    end_offset=110836,
    text_slice='原来贾蔷已从姑苏采买了十二个女孩子――并聘了教习――以及行头等物来了。',
    hash='sha256:055edc5bcb79bd1745fa666289e71b61543f68d4bb7a866efc9c57532fa50c28'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4125',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=491,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=110836,
    end_offset=110885,
    text_slice='那时，薛姨妈另迁于东北上一所幽静房舍居住，将梨香院早已腾挪出来，另行修理了，就令教习在此教演女戏。',
    hash='sha256:c4c59cd07c427a9fa115001e4c224842f7578b73cc3b6d6be7db76c1c948204c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4126',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=491,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=110885,
    end_offset=110922,
    text_slice='又另派家中旧有曾演学过歌唱的女人们――如今皆已皤然老妪了，着她们带领管理。',
    hash='sha256:6d38194ad74ae17965e316fde6b438376d590e7ac3d11a6869a7d37f6b01f8f1'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4127',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=491,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=110922,
    end_offset=110953,
    text_slice='就令贾蔷总理其日用出入银钱等事，以及诸凡大小所需之物料、帐目。',
    hash='sha256:3128dd2babb22e2c23d9b414ed1775e9e94ff60789695fff668fdbc7d4b6c9db'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4128',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=491,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=110963,
    end_offset=111243,
    text_slice='“采访聘买得十个小尼姑、小道姑都有了，连新做的二十分道袍也有了。外有一个带发修行的，本是苏州人氏，祖上也是读书仕宦之家。因生了这位姑娘自小多病，买了许多替身儿皆不中用，到底这位姑娘亲自入了空门，方才好了。所以带发修行，今年才十八岁，法名妙玉。如今父母俱已亡故，身边只有两个老嬷嬷、一个小丫头服侍。文墨也极通，经文也不用学了，摸样儿又极好。因听见‘长安’都中有观音遗迹并贝叶遗文，去岁随了师父上来，现在西门外牟尼院住着。她师父极精演先天神数，于去冬圆寂了。妙玉本欲扶灵回乡的，她师父临寂遗言，说她衣食起居不宜回乡，在此静居，后来自然有你的结果。所以她竟未回乡。”',
    hash='sha256:fa4aae924ea5dfa764a494caf1c5ab5bf9cd6d5044643071d02445c468a89639'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4129',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=491,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=111243,
    end_offset=111254,
    text_slice='王夫人不等回完，便说：',
    hash='sha256:09baf19afde59e4858e684f72b20cad1692ef078cb12e76f70fbd8bd774456db'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4130',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=491,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=111254,
    end_offset=111269,
    text_slice='“既这样，我们何不接了她来？”',
    hash='sha256:829e321106193c49215d03ec07e20400403633e8e16c9d63677626092461efb3'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4131',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=491,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=111269,
    end_offset=111277,
    text_slice='林之孝家的回道：',
    hash='sha256:052732f626fecb70c4b74a89010088c2750aadd9a19815b8bcb7732eb804562a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4132',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=491,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=111277,
    end_offset=111304,
    text_slice='“请她，她说‘侯门公府，必以贵势压人，我再不去的。’”',
    hash='sha256:47e1eec38ec659d70770c66459a7f3173a727db905330bd6f34624c2af0b428a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4133',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=491,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=111304,
    end_offset=111310,
    text_slice='王夫人笑道：',
    hash='sha256:d2a34a029ec825755997b3326e5527a8361a1129b0512caaba4ee6efc09c5462'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4134',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=491,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=111310,
    end_offset=111336,
    text_slice='“她既是官宦小姐，自然骄傲些，就下个帖子请她何妨。”',
    hash='sha256:40d3974a2c5fb8829329f96d88e6102bfb2e3fdab84ef976e9cff00ad8ace3be'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4135',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=491,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=111336,
    end_offset=111360,
    text_slice='林之孝家的答应了出去，命书启相公写请帖去请妙玉。',
    hash='sha256:a71e7332c3cee3559d42cb0f306f34ff1d88d0faad0737630395ab2688c30355'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4136',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=491,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=111360,
    end_offset=111385,
    text_slice='次日遣人备车轿去接等后话，暂且搁过，此时不能表白。',
    hash='sha256:16e7ffe261afb2c97dba4fad713382e89ea23aa6fdfa95f691bbf2a69ff5d6da'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4137',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=492,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=111387,
    end_offset=111433,
    text_slice='当下又有人回，工程上等着糊东西的纱绫，请凤姐去开楼拣纱绫；又有人来回，请凤姐开库收金银器皿。',
    hash='sha256:a305cf1cdbde11346de5b3bdf93f4d40385ec12d04e57a24d36d5909ad5cf0b3'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4138',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=492,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=111433,
    end_offset=111453,
    text_slice='连王夫人并上房丫鬟等众，皆一时不得闲的。',
    hash='sha256:9c624bffbfbc7fe66316ddf1c70ff90b5d2c30c09d3e828da742bb6a4da47b9f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4139',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=492,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=111453,
    end_offset=111476,
    text_slice='宝钗便说：“咱们别在这里碍手碍脚，找探丫头去。',
    hash='sha256:485090901e51421b59bcc26eed7dc852d8bb34aac4766bc0ce7aada73abf2e10'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4140',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=492,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=111476,
    end_offset=111499,
    text_slice='”说着，同宝玉、黛玉往迎春等房中来闲玩，无话。',
    hash='sha256:6e4c656ff5aad00829a157a118fc6e9f2ce41ef78f367e3c15d7a7195203fd3e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4141',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=493,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=111501,
    end_offset=111617,
    text_slice='王夫人等日日忙乱，直到十月将尽，幸皆全备：各处监管都交清帐目；各处古董文玩，皆已陈设齐备；采办鸟雀的，自仙鹤、孔雀以及鹿、兔、鸡、鹅等类，悉已买全，交于园中各处像景饲养；贾蔷那边也演出二十出杂戏来；小尼姑、道姑也都学会了念几卷经咒。',
    hash='sha256:1737c57fa0ab1c62fc78e6b7f75ed16c48b13ece2fd4116052a89f097c14a7e8'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4142',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=493,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=111617,
    end_offset=111656,
    text_slice='贾政方略心意宽畅，又请贾母等进园，色色斟酌，点缀妥当，再无一些遗漏不当之处了。',
    hash='sha256:7b76c57eb3e65406f051131590bde85f4bc866ef7f2f045162b3e42a6c0c3886'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4143',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=493,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=111656,
    end_offset=111666,
    text_slice='于是贾政方择日题本。',
    hash='sha256:a0e0f59c04ab4877c4fe045e876f61152bd98da7ac133e0e64f61217be26dc9a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4144',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=493,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=111666,
    end_offset=111695,
    text_slice='本上之日，奉朱批准奏：次年正月十五上元之日，恩准贾妃省亲。',
    hash='sha256:f28d24e0ddd38bcccdaa0ffa7cfd07f45d528ef61282c68f12e9dd6baf21714d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4145',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=493,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=111695,
    end_offset=111719,
    text_slice='贾府领了此恩旨，益发昼夜不闲，年也不曾好生过得。',
    hash='sha256:7784f9187cf1c8cf60242772b1a3fbb17d312f86fb7d83acd075bc62ec25b07f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4146',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=494,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=111721,
    end_offset=111771,
    text_slice='展眼元宵在迩，自正月初八日，就有太监出来先看方向：何处更衣，何处燕坐，何处受礼，何处开宴，何处退息。',
    hash='sha256:4e0e631d10060b8d6a7e28b91d791383cfdd5cd61ac8ef1c004fa852833c5c1f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4147',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=494,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=111771,
    end_offset=111835,
    text_slice='又有巡察地方总理关防太监等，带了许多小太监出来，各处关防，挡围幙；指示贾宅人员何处退，何处跪，何处进膳，何处启事，种种仪注不一。',
    hash='sha256:a97dc122f24c028ffb713d4d5cf0de40c991c2407f3b97b7ccd732aa309fa8c2'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4148',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=494,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=111835,
    end_offset=111859,
    text_slice='外面又有工部官员并五城兵备道打扫街道，撵逐闲人。',
    hash='sha256:1fd7e62713f3e9f4f237df24b95a796f34c9e358a64904234c17b1ef21c26572'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4149',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=494,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=111859,
    end_offset=111885,
    text_slice='贾赦等督率匠人扎花灯、烟火之类，至十四日，俱已停妥。',
    hash='sha256:c941c84e284ed84118063cf85ef7577d310f8fb3da3b6857b49cb1f8e29e9971'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4150',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=494,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=111885,
    end_offset=111896,
    text_slice='这一夜，上下通不曾睡。',
    hash='sha256:2c6982130d1a3b163109a27911c20e64690dfe01e7c02270ce4dc1db2fb0dbe8'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4151',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=495,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=111898,
    end_offset=111920,
    text_slice='至十五日五鼓，自贾母等有爵者，皆按品服大妆。',
    hash='sha256:a1a56c3205755fc6775d3440225f4ab2cda73d4ccaed1e8a9c15ba2bf75d4d7d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4152',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=495,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=111920,
    end_offset=111966,
    text_slice='园内各处，帐舞蟠龙，帘飞彩凤；金银焕彩，珠宝争辉；鼎焚百合之香，瓶插长春之蕊；静悄无人咳嗽。',
    hash='sha256:bb5a4cda7b70fbe1f06704e92ba6cd8983f7c873062e69c94bd885ae80e160c5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4153',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=495,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=111966,
    end_offset=111985,
    text_slice='贾赦等在西街门外，贾母等在荣府大门外。',
    hash='sha256:a5c0ad4e34731e033c5544726fe667ec615053754416d520af71beb44d6e09f6'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4154',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=495,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=111985,
    end_offset=111997,
    text_slice='街头巷口，俱系围幕挡严。',
    hash='sha256:4b8fde5c0a146bd9e76f0841caebdd51f279e52c888857e486f4afdf3e46ed3d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4155',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=495,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=111997,
    end_offset=112025,
    text_slice='正等得不耐烦，忽一太监骑大马而来，贾母忙接入，问其消息。',
    hash='sha256:d252708e655848b40e4709b7d0ac105d6b9db8b855308ddbfacaf1254b0b5c53'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4156',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=495,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=112029,
    end_offset=112080,
    text_slice='“早多着呢！未初刻用过晚膳，未正二刻还到宝灵宫拜佛，酉初刻进大明宫领宴看灯方请旨，只怕戌初才起身呢。”',
    hash='sha256:3940744d1d56d4b16ba290833a7764c3b873ff0f77d86a9d1f35c2a88cd60b2f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4157',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=495,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=112080,
    end_offset=112086,
    text_slice='凤姐听了道：',
    hash='sha256:134f9531c40f06f174cb16c58b1b0c0f6472914f0a39a74e7dfc13c0923c4ed0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4158',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=495,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=112086,
    end_offset=112114,
    text_slice='“既这么着，老太太、太太且请回房，等是时候再来也不迟。”',
    hash='sha256:f04ff818579dea95e8d87671ac381b6e11485c0b8c9d2c9325899ab19c343b4b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4159',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=495,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=112114,
    end_offset=112133,
    text_slice='于是贾母等暂且自便，园中悉赖凤姐照理。',
    hash='sha256:2c90b2d44b4df7cd60e1b87caf154c1b9ee78e30121dff776ee3b42a1739df24'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4160',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=495,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=112133,
    end_offset=112148,
    text_slice='又命执事人带领太监们去吃酒饭。',
    hash='sha256:c88a10ebbd5cd7f52136167b15dd938daa19daf9cdfb6dcae977500d862790bb'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4161',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=496,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=112150,
    end_offset=112170,
    text_slice='一时传人一担一担的挑进蜡烛来，各处点灯。',
    hash='sha256:fada840dd674d68e4d3d4e29d5e7ad67f2e046fd0e207d318834ea1972fc989d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4162',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=496,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=112170,
    end_offset=112184,
    text_slice='方点完时，忽听外边马跑之声。',
    hash='sha256:86d0fdcb758e77a97a8153f8159999876f67100f1c035616fe4242d15b9ff51b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4163',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=496,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=112184,
    end_offset=112203,
    text_slice='一时，又十来个太监都喘吁吁跑来拍手儿。',
    hash='sha256:16f7ffe9a676b301e91155ae5fb92b27c33c6b48e2883df1065017cda98f424e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4164',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=496,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=112214,
    end_offset=112220,
    text_slice='“来了来了”',
    hash='sha256:409b630a7538d050872f5cffdc8040d12522ac8d2cc3dca1b8e882f6c8363e65'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4165',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=496,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=112220,
    end_offset=112228,
    text_slice='，各按方向站住。',
    hash='sha256:15d6debaafac95aea101742bf1cc163f98be2e0c5fe045bd59e09dd81ff590a3'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4166',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=496,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=112228,
    end_offset=112255,
    text_slice='贾赦领合族子侄在西街门外，贾母领合族女眷在大门外迎接。',
    hash='sha256:d0a0f1473fcd6af237e423c379d20bd4202d80c382092ded69a722811b879e4c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4167',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=496,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=112255,
    end_offset=112262,
    text_slice='半日静悄悄的。',
    hash='sha256:5dc828920e4cd6a63942c3c4de18383f1264d8a132fd95109e48c11e0a6c87d5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4168',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=496,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=112262,
    end_offset=112303,
    text_slice='忽见一对红衣太监骑马缓缓的走来，至西街门下了马，将马赶出围幕之外，便垂手面西站住。',
    hash='sha256:f6c8c492afb3777d462c76e7ea992a22225aa9437bcfdeb4ac4974cc83be8989'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4169',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=496,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=112303,
    end_offset=112315,
    text_slice='半日又是一对，亦是如此。',
    hash='sha256:45dc417a01eb1671d71863d0582d6d6dbb02e089dd98c37d79c759b5abe50b51'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4170',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=496,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=112315,
    end_offset=112334,
    text_slice='少时便来了十来对，方闻得隐隐细乐之声。',
    hash='sha256:b5fc784e159bc66a2a917e135c56f3e9404856a9240bdd37de7f071a779be976'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4171',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=496,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=112334,
    end_offset=112358,
    text_slice='一对对龙旌凤翣，雉羽夔头，又有销金提炉焚着御香。',
    hash='sha256:3a2bdfade7cb5dd6eb1236841216a190a21b707432767f0747025a330a9e1a18'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4172',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=496,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=112358,
    end_offset=112379,
    text_slice='然后一把曲柄七凤黄金伞过来，便是冠袍带履。',
    hash='sha256:baa21ae4292e044c0dca6099310bd08e71c8110a8a6f7e0e9c2dd6a5caa5395d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4173',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=496,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=112379,
    end_offset=112401,
    text_slice='又有值事太监捧着香珠、绣帕、漱盂、拂尘等类。',
    hash='sha256:17d2d99651b4011d0f32dd4c9f10ed67609db13bb53e18464fa234bfd066d6fb'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4174',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=496,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=112401,
    end_offset=112433,
    text_slice='一队队过完，后面方是八个太监抬着一顶金顶金黄绣凤版舆，缓缓行来。',
    hash='sha256:b834767165c3417c96f1a87e4ea6e42d5cad8bf12a521251cf0e1a7528ed5031'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4175',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=496,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=112433,
    end_offset=112443,
    text_slice='贾母等连忙路旁跪下。',
    hash='sha256:a585ec5f4008cdab622cdd838c2d8fc4d80ee83b4961bb19a6f8f4840121993b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4176',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=496,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=112443,
    end_offset=112467,
    text_slice='早飞跑过几个太监来，扶起贾母、邢夫人、王夫人来。',
    hash='sha256:a756a6bd9eed44cf6f35e5d5b0144fc933e99ee202ed2bd9a9f9325e5de3c682'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4177',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=496,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=112467,
    end_offset=112502,
    text_slice='那版舆抬进大门，入仪门往东去，到一所院落门前，有执拂太监跪请下舆更衣。',
    hash='sha256:b13d22540990c38bd7e2baef32f33a68a11c837bc9ffd62d373639f0cab41e00'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4178',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=496,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=112502,
    end_offset=112530,
    text_slice='于是抬舆入门，太监等散去，只有昭容、彩嫔等引领元春下舆。',
    hash='sha256:1211d923046fa88b807646092f6c3a5e345e941916967e243d4ab8542f8f6367'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4179',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=496,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=112530,
    end_offset=112553,
    text_slice='只见院内各色花灯烂灼，皆系纱绫扎成，精致非常。',
    hash='sha256:f6b3ce417ab4f2595f7710d7c89b5f20a114d328a74431c63dc42baca8ada29f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4180',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=496,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=112562,
    end_offset=112568,
    text_slice='“体仁沐德”',
    hash='sha256:7622a2a21a14ae57d58878307b6b254ef3672fff6d9e90f4934c967a4fbf656d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4181',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=496,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=112568,
    end_offset=112571,
    text_slice='四字。',
    hash='sha256:3d8cfbb9123e426fb84d007033aa3f320e258a30464afa447b40bdf09af5ea16'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4182',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=496,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=112571,
    end_offset=112588,
    text_slice='元春入室，更衣毕，复出，上舆进园。',
    hash='sha256:4f8ed8220e71edee47db5dc8256a0141c73be0c199621c255d3702429b315987'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4183',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=496,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=112588,
    end_offset=112630,
    text_slice='只见园中香烟缭绕，花彩缤纷，处处灯光相映，时时细乐声喧；说不尽这太平气象，富贵风流。',
    hash='sha256:bc7e89b878028d7b62766491ad55e9e0a6ed76b5c605b64f7afe54fbc77c7655'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4184',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=496,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=112630,
    end_offset=112683,
    text_slice='――此时自己回想当初在大荒山中、青埂峰下，那等凄凉寂寞；若不亏癞憎、跛道二人携来到此，又安能得见这般世面。',
    hash='sha256:da3db61b7fbc3eaa267583cb98b66841e4aa1a180c68e73b6b076c90ce98e23b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4185',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=496,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=112683,
    end_offset=112718,
    text_slice='本欲作一篇《灯月赋》、《省亲颂》，以志今日之事，但又恐入了别书的俗套。',
    hash='sha256:c76a443f48b83f6de8e0bf1b2e14c7630d06c24a76de4f23a9d0c10a7a8d01e6'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4186',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=496,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=112718,
    end_offset=112764,
    text_slice='按此时之景，即作一赋一赞，也不能形容得尽其妙；即不作赋赞，其豪华富丽，观者诸公亦可想而知矣。',
    hash='sha256:f3e16e7b3c34f2510b982164b217babc1d47e0f04e234e5739489f888a39d98c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4187',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=496,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=112764,
    end_offset=112784,
    text_slice='所以倒是省了这工夫纸墨，且说正经的为是。',
    hash='sha256:83bd169fe24093384a92652e3820b5e96223c547add0c146f07ec53a7e3dc84e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4188',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=497,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=112786,
    end_offset=112813,
    text_slice='且说贾妃在轿内看此园内外如此豪华，因默默叹息奢华过费。',
    hash='sha256:f9107950ddb07d99f6a2b2582d960c1dfc8ee414ddbd834dac4d11ffbb616792'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4189',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=497,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=112813,
    end_offset=112831,
    text_slice='忽又见执拂太监跪请登舟，贾妃乃下舆。',
    hash='sha256:d9f2fcb980b7be14171352f891e82e6feb6fd748539cd8c1c743daf30541ecac'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4190',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=497,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=112831,
    end_offset=112941,
    text_slice='只见清流一带，势如游龙；两边石栏上，皆系水晶玻璃各色风灯，点得如银花雪浪；上面柳、杏诸树虽无花叶，然皆用通草、绸、绫、纸、绢依势作成，粘于枝上的，每一株悬灯数盏；更兼池中荷、荇、凫、鹭之属，亦皆系螺、蚌、羽毛之类作就的。',
    hash='sha256:8e88291b68fc9531e776bb798f4051ab7478de46329f232dd534f5b5fe444a0d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4191',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=497,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=112941,
    end_offset=112960,
    text_slice='诸灯上下争辉，真系玻璃世界、珠宝乾坤。',
    hash='sha256:78d1a2d696d7d0992180f412204455b502b504bfbbc323c515e8493a364e71fb'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4192',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=497,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=112960,
    end_offset=112988,
    text_slice='船上亦系各种精致盆景诸灯，珠帘绣幙，桂楫兰桡，自不必说。',
    hash='sha256:ac3fb6e2fd9f7d1dd597f173241013a81a22396e34fe9f4420c119c9c97bd513'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4193',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=497,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=113006,
    end_offset=113012,
    text_slice='“蓼汀花溆”',
    hash='sha256:0c1a0ca28eccfa9deda6568f685e75b8610723b54da87de945de09d2b5362738'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4194',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=497,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=113012,
    end_offset=113015,
    text_slice='四字。',
    hash='sha256:3d8cfbb9123e426fb84d007033aa3f320e258a30464afa447b40bdf09af5ea16'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4195',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=497,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=113023,
    end_offset=113029,
    text_slice='“有凤来仪”',
    hash='sha256:d48e3c9de541a2b1a2cc2c9c90d3492fbf6ef2a9f8389d3409696abb36884c32'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4196',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=497,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=113029,
    end_offset=113061,
    text_slice='等处，皆系上回贾政偶然一试宝玉之课艺才情耳，何今日认真用此匾联？',
    hash='sha256:79979ec41685d10df2406b4edc1587005d77891123874d352d3b9d880c9d14e4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4197',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=497,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=113061,
    end_offset=113107,
    text_slice='况贾政世代诗书，来往诸客屏侍座陪者，悉皆才技之流，岂无一名手题撰，竟用小儿一戏之辞苟且搪塞？',
    hash='sha256:5265cc750602f41445b737ee5508f72f7d34cb87c71d7350f5b8c285f9d889d8'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4198',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=497,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=113132,
    end_offset=113149,
    text_slice='“前门绿柳垂金锁，后户青山列锦屏”',
    hash='sha256:892f4ae433c3f1f4c2650aecd46287d5ed693d0f64d0b3fe80c8af6a836d1ba8'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4199',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=497,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=113149,
    end_offset=113181,
    text_slice='之类，则以为大雅可观，岂《石头记》中通部所表之宁、荣贾府所为哉！',
    hash='sha256:20eba1669f6ba8fc28087ea047ed0337d9f789dec9a2230bf6c706c55c2d0295'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4200',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=497,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=113181,
    end_offset=113193,
    text_slice='据此论之，竟大相矛盾了。',
    hash='sha256:9253265876629c8e13f601a39f9e7ac7d6915997e80b716062d82ecfff36011e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4201',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=497,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=113193,
    end_offset=113212,
    text_slice='诸公不知，待蠢物将原委说明，大家方知。',
    hash='sha256:ec9e547d8b60baaab1c0e901bb0859095b67a4e1444089d96a8c718ba0afd58c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4202',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=498,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=113214,
    end_offset=113234,
    text_slice='当日，这贾妃未入宫时，自幼亦系贾母教养。',
    hash='sha256:482fe62cb19733904a1d5f75f15c85472a69cc286f366173f13e124885f73ac2'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4203',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=498,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=113234,
    end_offset=113282,
    text_slice='后来添了宝玉，贾妃乃长姊，宝玉为弱弟，贾妃之心上念母年将迈，始得此弟，是以怜爱宝玉，与诸弟不同。',
    hash='sha256:916d9df9f204883e4165fdeb564a3cafb6be7fb6af72e8f66523d7f1425d1376'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4204',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=498,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=113282,
    end_offset=113293,
    text_slice='且同随祖母，刻未暂离。',
    hash='sha256:f8b0bb1ad865a7f81d5a73aebe7c4cd0fa3f5eca1836f5300452cf9bd0f21437'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4205',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=498,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=113293,
    end_offset=113332,
    text_slice='那宝玉未入学堂之先，三四岁时，已得贾妃手引口传，教授了几本书、数千字在腹内了。',
    hash='sha256:681c3e72d10f4e4b7fa796ab52ad61ce85e36977cef192a3791f235c8e2c0b9d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4206',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=498,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=113332,
    end_offset=113348,
    text_slice='其名分虽系姊弟，其情状有如母子。',
    hash='sha256:e19b2c473281e99abb3c9198ce8f03115c5c1aad5d9248d5ae35f9027e27c79f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4207',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=498,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=113348,
    end_offset=113393,
    text_slice='自入宫后，时时带信出来与父母说：“千万好生扶养，不严不能成器，过严恐生不虞，且致父母之忧。',
    hash='sha256:6f10c7c13f6dc9a07b1c62f88516d6241e1ab3a8c98b233a3424f51b6662c7d2'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4208',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=498,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=113393,
    end_offset=113406,
    text_slice='”眷念切爱之心，刻未能忘。',
    hash='sha256:ae552e771f89f57877ff077aafa42e40ad189d3da6a022fd6316d12308e9d75c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4209',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=498,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=113406,
    end_offset=113452,
    text_slice='前日，贾政闻塾师背后赞宝玉偏才尽有，贾政未信，适巧遇园已落成，令其题撰，聊一试其情思之清浊。',
    hash='sha256:5a103e55bd0136d159468535113805a81d6a8b3eb438a51bb64c3125cfd2c60e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4210',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=498,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=113452,
    end_offset=113474,
    text_slice='其所拟之匾联虽非妙句，在幼童为之，亦或可取。',
    hash='sha256:30c54a681c33eb571ee2103e8d533ae4b4337555d88208b772c4088ed84278bb'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4211',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=498,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=113474,
    end_offset=113503,
    text_slice='即另使名公大笔为之，固不费难，然想来倒不如这本家风味有趣。',
    hash='sha256:4de6331788dfdceec6b88d7d1ba4f9a7e01cecd476deedcd0a5b3595729e5da0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4212',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=498,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=113503,
    end_offset=113530,
    text_slice='更使贾妃见之，知系其爱弟所为，亦或不负其素日切望之意。',
    hash='sha256:af65b2df8e9bc7585f0d5abcc1d5830b8ea3387397594a6593b6eb5a97aa3af9'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4213',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=498,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=113530,
    end_offset=113550,
    text_slice='因有这段原委，故此竟用了宝玉所题之联额。',
    hash='sha256:f6b932a1bd535c223523b85163bda3a39e31dfb3e6fcd4ba9fb8ffdd3fa31781'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4214',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=498,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=113550,
    end_offset=113565,
    text_slice='那日虽未曾题完，后来亦曾补拟。',
    hash='sha256:ae55077db730c87d4c4b6f18fa24441c250e30e3024e1fedc59ab3a9bd46c9eb'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4215',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=499,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=113567,
    end_offset=113584,
    text_slice='闲文少述，且说贾妃看了四字，笑道：',
    hash='sha256:34ec29d439276c1f37a6a2c64afe39ed1b56b8fdc36fb021432ad5505be5e0a3'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4216',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=499,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=113584,
    end_offset=113603,
    text_slice='“‘花溆’二字便妥，何必，‘蓼汀’？”',
    hash='sha256:56d082d99e5fa928176548ef14eafac95388a10fbe240e8bb0dbad481ef8be66'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4217',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=499,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=113603,
    end_offset=113623,
    text_slice='侍座太监听了，忙下小舟登岸，飞传与贾政。',
    hash='sha256:e9adbb9e4c3d9e73d7a1321f9f5f96ee6d711d9440608bbec7bccc65a7015609'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4218',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=499,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=113623,
    end_offset=113633,
    text_slice='贾政听了，即忙移换。',
    hash='sha256:12a0f01da905259a1bfa18b803a4ae80bd4eb4da5f02c9a9fad43bef3f9a5951'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4219',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=499,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=113633,
    end_offset=113659,
    text_slice='一时，舟临内岸，复弃舟上舆，便见琳宫绰约，桂殿巍峨。',
    hash='sha256:101c754f980f410e7e15f62df87bfea158444a61de9534742c2d8467821b4cfa'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4220',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=499,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=113665,
    end_offset=113671,
    text_slice='“天仙宝境”',
    hash='sha256:699feadc7de974da8aeb06631f1b77a66ef8ad433eb369712211539a433df239'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4221',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=499,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=113671,
    end_offset=113680,
    text_slice='四大字，贾妃忙命换',
    hash='sha256:1ac5d5e3a2225404c791e2b2adf414297635b6b33b7e978b5efa654c46289584'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4222',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=499,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=113680,
    end_offset=113686,
    text_slice='“省亲别墅”',
    hash='sha256:c1ebf152db25274b3e550013b23510b7ca06a935f6b524b55282c99538566d74'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4223',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=499,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=113686,
    end_offset=113689,
    text_slice='四字。',
    hash='sha256:3d8cfbb9123e426fb84d007033aa3f320e258a30464afa447b40bdf09af5ea16'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4224',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=499,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=113689,
    end_offset=113696,
    text_slice='于是进入行宫。',
    hash='sha256:9b58bf74e278272b2c4dca132eae1c6c7266ee45a85cd595e8bc2870b8cfd8e1'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4225',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=499,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=113696,
    end_offset=113718,
    text_slice='但见庭燎烧空，香屑布地，火树琪花，金窗玉槛。',
    hash='sha256:8b2b7696a36994f7c5825f6dfb928b9612247d6d4d3f0c61dbbd3853b057452d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4226',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=499,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=113718,
    end_offset=113745,
    text_slice='说不尽帘卷虾须，毯铺鱼獭，鼎飘麝脑之香，屏列雉尾之扇。',
    hash='sha256:f42fe1f589da154df7fd8596476500a52f04436fa4e1345dba744920993cf071'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4227',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=500,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=113750,
    end_offset=113766,
    text_slice='金门玉户神仙府，桂殿兰宫妃子家。',
    hash='sha256:d866a45ac2c54ee2432fa155bd2f6ae828bc9aa9300955c5be3575e45a4d7047'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4228',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=501,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=113768,
    end_offset=113773,
    text_slice='贾妃乃问：',
    hash='sha256:33c2412ffa92f2a3c5647d40086a68be4bb0d7c39e9b3f0a499a725db2c0ffe1'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4229',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=501,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=113773,
    end_offset=113782,
    text_slice='“此殿何无匾额？”',
    hash='sha256:d970706e5cd389ecf3a93c78380523b019e27e86dc9f07c01580892d3c407ef9'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4230',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=501,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=113782,
    end_offset=113790,
    text_slice='随侍太监跪启曰：',
    hash='sha256:280f26dead6fa8106b2dae21b17647ed75f0cb1722b391a2f19780a490c8d682'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4231',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=501,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=113790,
    end_offset=113804,
    text_slice='“此系正殿，外臣未敢擅拟。”',
    hash='sha256:b70496359c3211de6e0904e8e4268ed3f6a3e3e9389964829ca69c5a673bd6d2'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4232',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=501,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=113804,
    end_offset=113811,
    text_slice='贾妃点头不语。',
    hash='sha256:50d074c28181fe8f12d1a31721d93f8673847b4d1bd70a6b0b08820abc8ec895'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4233',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=501,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=113811,
    end_offset=113827,
    text_slice='礼仪太监跪请升座受礼，两陛乐起。',
    hash='sha256:442041d5714e279887a6d05d1014df3c3b53ff37590c6bff1defe209ba25b91f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4234',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=501,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=113855,
    end_offset=113859,
    text_slice='“免。”',
    hash='sha256:5dc813321d388275c60d9d060536b72495828acc24f4d6fd43df23134cae68cb'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4235',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=501,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=113859,
    end_offset=113868,
    text_slice='太监引贾赦等退出。',
    hash='sha256:eaee6876a351b5728d0ab9a679e8f9e3bccb5d5892f7f0c877648f5337f936ff'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4236',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=501,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=113897,
    end_offset=113901,
    text_slice='“免。”',
    hash='sha256:5dc813321d388275c60d9d060536b72495828acc24f4d6fd43df23134cae68cb'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4237',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=501,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=113901,
    end_offset=113906,
    text_slice='于是引退。',
    hash='sha256:6cfff9bdacbe6b8b91d46e62464c83a50c83895df83861fef2d72a9eb3f4e7f0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4238',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=502,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=113908,
    end_offset=113921,
    text_slice='茶已三献，贾妃降座，乐止。',
    hash='sha256:a6543ac2bf68bc4b46e2c754d655415d1e8bd5ff3a864c450071c6a837727ce0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4239',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=502,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=113921,
    end_offset=113937,
    text_slice='退入侧殿更衣，方备省亲车驾出园。',
    hash='sha256:dff791a1d5bdb25686fd1141e3bd7bae0cb69099bca090002fffa6aba357cb14'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4240',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=502,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=113937,
    end_offset=113957,
    text_slice='至贾母正室，欲行家礼，贾母等俱跪止不迭。',
    hash='sha256:3f64d7a3f5b4bede87c8da20f19e56bb8a3793499fd78de4fa22b98bd19b46f7'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4241',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=502,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=113957,
    end_offset=113972,
    text_slice='贾妃满眼垂泪，方彼此上前厮见。',
    hash='sha256:72f0951563e65b448c9b457b1a7956ad4985cc7992ec9a4f9562fa8c3ec4b934'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4242',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=502,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=113972,
    end_offset=114011,
    text_slice='一手搀贾母，一手搀王夫人，三个人满心里皆有许多话，只是俱说不出，只管呜咽对泣。',
    hash='sha256:a60d2ea0423f827c68205507258c0f2e5d247a4ea6aab6938840738ca4e1b247'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4243',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=502,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=114011,
    end_offset=114043,
    text_slice='邢夫人、李纨、王熙凤、迎、探、惜三姊妹等，俱在旁围绕，垂泪无言。',
    hash='sha256:37154dc9e926d96e4e799fc87795c7fa203a1607f95ea4714db8db861163d6c9'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4244',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=502,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=114064,
    end_offset=114122,
    text_slice='“当日既送我到那不得见人的去处，好容易今日回家娘儿们一会，不说说笑笑，反倒哭起来。一会子我去了，又不知多早晚才来！”',
    hash='sha256:87ef76e24778ad94f19bcd2ad227615785893bf8c0fb2d5f0bad486c44c560bc'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4245',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=502,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=114122,
    end_offset=114135,
    text_slice='说到这句，不禁又哽咽起来。',
    hash='sha256:c7a4d933f514049a04499bf27fdf93316cff2aa74b065d31ebc763222741b33c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4246',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=502,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=114135,
    end_offset=114145,
    text_slice='邢夫人等忙上来解劝。',
    hash='sha256:23c3b025eaf173c9dc80cea8e1f8c4a932536c088d010cc2e6e12abc6d61843c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4247',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=502,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=114145,
    end_offset=114170,
    text_slice='贾母等让贾妃归座，又逐次一一见过，又不免哭泣一番。',
    hash='sha256:823c3b864fc3565ccda33b8799d073abdf5ccc622f7044816024e1a891270843'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4248',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=502,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=114170,
    end_offset=114205,
    text_slice='然后东西两府掌家执事人丁在厅外行礼，及两府掌家执事媳妇领丫鬟等行礼毕。',
    hash='sha256:83ea007f4614c9f136036e7b5641262e524b3f9589cc6896fe400b1b6cb10a62'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4249',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=502,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=114210,
    end_offset=114226,
    text_slice='“薛姨妈、宝钗、黛玉因何不见？”',
    hash='sha256:963d2a754f81d1e14b23a0831e852bb665c75af33ece561e42cf5efea24df3d0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4250',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=502,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=114226,
    end_offset=114232,
    text_slice='王夫人启曰：',
    hash='sha256:385197ab0fdd0d50d4d6257544893dd4b6852fd209c8c8b6ea72825b9a0a504c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4251',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=502,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=114232,
    end_offset=114244,
    text_slice='“外眷无职，未敢擅入。”',
    hash='sha256:1f8a47487b6ae9b05ebac4db49d4ea3d5c6ab9f8d1c7165360d870f40afc8f64'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4252',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=502,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=114244,
    end_offset=114254,
    text_slice='贾妃听了，忙命快请。',
    hash='sha256:4167f894215857200d6fdc5822bbeebc4672e66323bd650995937b722734329f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4253',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=502,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=114254,
    end_offset=114283,
    text_slice='一时，薛姨妈等进来，欲行国礼，亦命免过，上前各叙阔别寒温。',
    hash='sha256:6f97265ad08a4e3ef8c47c287c706c5415e6c94d3906a7db6ce0d5dd95f9f2fc'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4254',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=502,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=114283,
    end_offset=114318,
    text_slice='又有贾妃原带进宫去的丫鬟抱琴等上来叩见，贾母等连忙扶起，命人别室款待。',
    hash='sha256:7a4237b2ddd3c1088c0205b4c38f5a2782cd3adc26f89537dadcdc6c06adfc85'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4255',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=502,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=114318,
    end_offset=114361,
    text_slice='执事太监及彩嫔、昭容各侍从人等，宁国府及贾赦那宅两处自有人款待，只留三四个小太监答应。',
    hash='sha256:937231e9e2475e3ea809e6c3bcea5d554e019477d733a092efe2664cafc29c6c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4256',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=502,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=114361,
    end_offset=114379,
    text_slice='母女姊妹深叙些离别情景，及家务私情。',
    hash='sha256:7e3fc5714a60c6b511790c767e8599f85c240c6b39f7f587cce69e48c6f638db'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4257',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=503,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=114381,
    end_offset=114400,
    text_slice='又有贾政至帘外问安，贾妃垂帘行参等事。',
    hash='sha256:0f79629afb34eb1270c3e70eeec649ce1b2bdb1aa8f2ef14f58fc0cb2ade4e79'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4258',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=503,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=114400,
    end_offset=114449,
    text_slice='又隔帘含泪，谓其父曰：“田舍之家，虽齑盐布帛，终能聚天伦之乐；今虽富贵已极，骨肉各方，然终无意趣！',
    hash='sha256:c26d112695236dee70fd1a4925f9f3b3fc1973ba3d0816f6a35907960479c39e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4259',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=504,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=114460,
    end_offset=114484,
    text_slice='“臣，草莽寒门，鸠群鸦属之中，岂意得征凤鸾之瑞。',
    hash='sha256:757fd9339998e14b7a40a87d46ac83f9dacdd546d27106220aa83631c0d5c268'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4260',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=504,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=114484,
    end_offset=114523,
    text_slice='今贵人上锡天恩，下昭祖德，此皆山川日月之精奇、祖宗之远德钟于一人，幸及政夫妇。',
    hash='sha256:54f3ee576c520ad1f0b3ec371a598ff2e1deb12f301f4741037abc65e1548d8d'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4261',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=504,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=114523,
    end_offset=114560,
    text_slice='且今上启天地生物之大德，垂古今未有之旷恩，虽肝脑涂地，臣子岂能得报于万一！',
    hash='sha256:9b77b23172e408c9d0c64d0f3d5a08b25b318254ce549f6426319cdf1c45efa1'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4262',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=504,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=114560,
    end_offset=114590,
    text_slice='惟朝干夕惕，忠于厥职外，愿我君万寿千秋，乃天下苍生之同幸也。',
    hash='sha256:01c8d86d1669c07701d0997d057e8547397ac17df832f4a97a34f78530601998'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4263',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=504,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=114590,
    end_offset=114615,
    text_slice='贵妃切勿以政夫妇残年为念，懑愤金怀，更祈自加珍爱。',
    hash='sha256:ba0350c8720d2f6d275755f29fa5eba373d185768800d5eaf019b6c0252152a6'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4264',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=504,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=114615,
    end_offset=114644,
    text_slice='惟业业兢兢，勤慎恭肃以侍上，庶不负上体贴眷爱如此之隆恩也。',
    hash='sha256:db5cfce71946cf9c813f8ea9558db0a20b957e4e7ceabd320658fcd36fad9299'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4265',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=505,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=114647,
    end_offset=114651,
    text_slice='贾妃亦嘱',
    hash='sha256:accb8ad1b4e045ecb598eda3c79f6fce171ccc26bb54bf41a7b57011bf411ec0'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4266',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=505,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=114651,
    end_offset=114669,
    text_slice='“只以国事为重，暇时保养，切勿记念”',
    hash='sha256:c874d8740c64bbe5606e32d54d17c21c4f1e13b7605fb7c031aa32fab818cd1e'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4267',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=505,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=114669,
    end_offset=114672,
    text_slice='等语。',
    hash='sha256:ff844b1dd96842e1626f4d58932f22a117191c59fa71959d33caeda92b7df9ec'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4268',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=505,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=114677,
    end_offset=114713,
    text_slice='“园中所有亭台轩馆，皆系宝玉所题；如果有一二稍可寓目者，请别赐名为幸。”',
    hash='sha256:31984da4f9e744c299f525b5b520ad89ded5672a4e89e06be00a872a705dc068'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4269',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=505,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=114713,
    end_offset=114727,
    text_slice='元妃听了宝玉能题，便含笑说：',
    hash='sha256:77823029e7cd1e9dd1096c7dd6f2f4ece654f89a6bd28af20ae15aa590e6994a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4270',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=505,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=114727,
    end_offset=114734,
    text_slice='“果进益了。”',
    hash='sha256:c1577e0f6f6fa4188b5d3191962d9bd88fc847879612fa263f21e9e418b7ef8b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4271',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=505,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=114734,
    end_offset=114739,
    text_slice='贾政退出。',
    hash='sha256:f7a0d6465e17331fe6e7caedda11d0e2ab60141f46f03ea476c325fc64dea12b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4272',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=506,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=114741,
    end_offset=114767,
    text_slice='贾妃见宝、林二人亦发比别姊妹不同，真是姣花软玉一般。',
    hash='sha256:16d579ea761c3c3945129be797310f6f662e1221a5e802950a7852a9d0c90640'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4273',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=506,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=114770,
    end_offset=114780,
    text_slice='“宝玉为何不进见？”',
    hash='sha256:89dafe5afdce32b93317e817e1386c8686498413091f99435a8e230f8e9750b3'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4274',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=506,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=114780,
    end_offset=114785,
    text_slice='贾母乃启：',
    hash='sha256:86a82d74ab667a980b1eb31b463042d44fee8d948958772bc4ec2afd5d4bdd75'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4275',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=506,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=114785,
    end_offset=114797,
    text_slice='“无谕，外男不敢擅入。”',
    hash='sha256:733cbd12fdc8c0433173632f56e0a7fffc26cd50e22efea5bb6e499034e2ad74'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4276',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=506,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=114797,
    end_offset=114805,
    text_slice='元妃命快引进来。',
    hash='sha256:e3b44fa9faf55a75149655ea0607022ef1890f4a6191cfe4d5428c84ff460f20'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4277',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=506,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=114844,
    end_offset=114859,
    text_slice='“比先竟长了好些......”',
    hash='sha256:e4a32b3d919c3679e50862ba0f70c1be34a53ae61045bbaa0a980e6560b64a25'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4278',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=506,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=114859,
    end_offset=114869,
    text_slice='一语未终，泪如雨下。',
    hash='sha256:027764fdec9247e922a04c77485db65fa5ff279ad918f545c080f31b40e8c132'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4279',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=507,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=114871,
    end_offset=114882,
    text_slice='尤氏、凤姐等上来启道：',
    hash='sha256:4fb721abaef59db8cdaec216bde2076ec745a9168c65713270fddd7f473efb3b'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4280',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=507,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=114882,
    end_offset=114895,
    text_slice='“筵宴齐备，请贵妃游幸。”',
    hash='sha256:bf14bde53096de965ccc5aa0a7b75a1502bf7f0599e87da4cd128e9c252910f5'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4281',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=507,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=114895,
    end_offset=114917,
    text_slice='元妃等起身，命宝玉导引，遂同诸人步至园门前。',
    hash='sha256:57e30409cef8c7de38d7566b732e0c3807e4e9aef58d26b37047beb1c815d119'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4282',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=507,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=114917,
    end_offset=114933,
    text_slice='早见灯光火树之中，诸般罗列非常。',
    hash='sha256:28445e3bd221e1948250cd93ecd3124731197f5c1729ba80f9c8f773c4448586'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4283',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=507,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=114938,
    end_offset=114944,
    text_slice='“有凤来仪”',
    hash='sha256:d48e3c9de541a2b1a2cc2c9c90d3492fbf6ef2a9f8389d3409696abb36884c32'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4284',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=507,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=114944,
    end_offset=114945,
    text_slice='、',
    hash='sha256:c4a40ea8fe35627476f7f8cb9e1fc7f8898f428c6d1ff18b0bc5479d5db39c5f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4285',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=507,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=114945,
    end_offset=114951,
    text_slice='“红香绿玉”',
    hash='sha256:ad4c2e054e3ba91818c4d8a05e798db315fa3a795974f2cf6f68a3c154b05ac2'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4286',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=507,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=114951,
    end_offset=114952,
    text_slice='、',
    hash='sha256:c4a40ea8fe35627476f7f8cb9e1fc7f8898f428c6d1ff18b0bc5479d5db39c5f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4287',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=507,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=114952,
    end_offset=114958,
    text_slice='“杏帘在望”',
    hash='sha256:fc69221f7e072eaf067df66729515430386483dbe41dcd368c555a592b9938a3'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4288',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=507,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=114958,
    end_offset=114959,
    text_slice='、',
    hash='sha256:c4a40ea8fe35627476f7f8cb9e1fc7f8898f428c6d1ff18b0bc5479d5db39c5f'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4289',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=507,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=114959,
    end_offset=114965,
    text_slice='“蘅芷清芬”',
    hash='sha256:d5605c7d521c2d64fc838aed6b5610222be3dac1e43b84cbeb9eb7064cb08a95'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4290',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=507,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=114965,
    end_offset=114985,
    text_slice='等处，登楼步阁，涉水缘山，百般眺览徘徊。',
    hash='sha256:0593fecb60f79eabd9d2ec41f9568c62cc0cbb127a7526d2e0f66faeadc27c20'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4291',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=507,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=114985,
    end_offset=115001,
    text_slice='一处处铺陈不一，一桩桩点缀新奇。',
    hash='sha256:3825d1343b3d8ab135318056ead501fbeac5dc6d4d3a68ccd6e298a2862d2560'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4292',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=507,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=115011,
    end_offset=115027,
    text_slice='“以后不可太奢，此皆过分之极。”',
    hash='sha256:1fd05a0fe4149ad0b9fb9a5ebf53547487e98be0c7d416f094a3cf909f45ee4c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4293',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=507,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=115027,
    end_offset=115045,
    text_slice='已而，至正殿，谕免礼归座，大开筵宴。',
    hash='sha256:d1808cf95b919045efb010abe677ad311062a616ec18c6bfd26c768615512b1c'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4294',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=507,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=115045,
    end_offset=115068,
    text_slice='贾母等在下相陪，尤氏、李纨、凤姐等亲捧羹把盏。',
    hash='sha256:837775af03cf0f317d08ecf9a6f1c5c3ac88eee670dd93149e7586c02e1a7fdc'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4295',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=508,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=115070,
    end_offset=115095,
    text_slice='元妃乃命传笔砚伺候，亲搦湘管，择其几处最喜者赐名。',
    hash='sha256:0db2f1c1be35e295830c887577f33b0f9df109d5bc18fc30ba41c51c1fd69884'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4296',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=509,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=115102,
    end_offset=115108,
    text_slice='“顾恩思义”',
    hash='sha256:7c64a1c6fc8c9a5c56e518f7a8bd46b9b237cc0442e6c6c88e4a57910d06820a'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4297',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=509,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=115108,
    end_offset=115140,
    text_slice='（匾额）天地启宏慈，赤子苍头同感戴；古今垂旷典，九州万国被恩荣。',
    hash='sha256:e3e346c3ccabd53c1d6abdefb318b3c05ef2552a1debf092631367e2d070de75'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4298',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=509,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=115151,
    end_offset=115156,
    text_slice='“大观园”',
    hash='sha256:d36bd3002b71cc751763397b20327a9b19615c6f32dae4c6d55110fe3f580ee4'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4299',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=509,
    segment_type='sentence',
    start_offset=115156,
    end_offset=115159,
    text_slice='园之名',
    hash='sha256:c90a95a9c04db7d96d2a6020285fcb9ca5f0ffb36ee97f0c033f1ffaf5552926'
)

Segment(
    id='hongloumeng_seg_4300',
    doc_id='hongloumeng',
    block_index=509,
    segment_type='dialogue',
    start_offset=115159,
    end_offset=115165,
    text_slice='“有凤来仪”',
    hash='sha256:d48e3c9de541a2b1a2cc2c9c90d3492fbf6ef2a9f8389d3409696abb36884c32'
)

